    <node id="HOSPITAL UNIVERSITARIO PR&#205;NCIPE DE ASTURIAS">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The Hospital Universitario Pr&#237;ncipe de Asturias (HUPA) is a prominent medical facility located in Alcal&#225; de Henares, Madrid. It specializes in various medical fields, particularly endocrinology and nutrition, with Julia &#193;lvarez Hern&#225;ndez serving as the Head of the Endocrinology and Nutrition Section. In addition to its focus on endocrinology, HUPA is recognized for its comprehensive management of oropharyngeal dysphagia, having established the Unidad Funcional de Disfagia Orofar&#237;ngea (UFDOF) to address the needs of patients suffering from this condition.

The hospital employs a multidisciplinary approach to provide acute care and optimize the quality of care for patients with oropharyngeal dysphagia. This includes the development of 36 specialized recipes aimed at managing the dietary needs of these patients. HUPA is committed to integrating various medical services to ensure comprehensive patient care, making it a pioneering institution in the treatment of dysphagia. Overall, the Hospital Universitario Pr&#237;ncipe de Asturias plays a vital role in both endocrinology and the management of dysphagia, contributing significantly to the healthcare landscape in Madrid.</data>
      <data key="d2">06484c3fe8af6e4c44bbfc3ac2fa2590,1955c09ee453969c7603ae8206c088f8,4a84ad8115beacfc311b44b973743dde,6533cbcb76873caf6fd68eb95d313d24,669a55d41ff26c3ea749aaa095688593,734812860aa1e2e5c5ae35a39eb5a865,7c37a605ce9323c724b713aa64b7fae5,80793c857399f9e6e22c76392e96ac8b,929b14ae2554caeaab2a010ad94222eb,a3fd9c0d942a044ac2490f16d4ecc520,a519216aaee7bf8a1317f5d6b522c4b6,c56e48073639b88eaeeaf183cbcdeb20,dce680808e039e852dc0f2639835db32,dfc3b0905ab9fc1fca9fc64473ebed80,ea0b88195d04b227bedf7fa3cb3b6513</data>
