    <node id="AEHH">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">AEHH, or Asociaci&#243;n Espa&#241;ola de Hosteler&#237;a, is a Spanish association focused on the hospitality sector. It is also known as the Asociaci&#243;n Espa&#241;ola de Hosteler&#237;a Hospitalaria, which is a scientific society that supports research and knowledge dissemination related to oropharyngeal dysphagia. This dual identity highlights AEHH's commitment to both the hospitality industry and the medical field, particularly in addressing issues related to swallowing disorders.</data>
