    <node id="ADENYD">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">ADENYD, or the Asociaci&#243;n de Enfermeras de Nutrici&#243;n y Diet&#233;tica, is a scientific society based in Spain that focuses on the fields of nutrition and dietetics. The organization is dedicated to supporting various initiatives, including the production of a book on oropharyngeal dysphagia. It serves as a professional association for nurses who specialize in nutrition and dietetics, promoting best practices and advancements in these areas.</data>
