    <node id="JULIA &#193;LVAREZ HERN&#193;NDEZ">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Julia &#193;lvarez Hern&#225;ndez is a prominent medical professional specializing in endocrinology and nutrition, serving as the Head of the Endocrinology and Nutrition Section at the Hospital Universitario Pr&#237;ncipe de Asturias in Alcal&#225; de Henares, Madrid. In her role, she is actively involved in the management and treatment of patients with oropharyngeal dysphagia, working within the Unidad Funcional de Disfagia Orofar&#237;ngea. Julia is also a co-author and coordinator of a book discussing oropharyngeal dysphagia, contributing her expertise to the section that addresses this condition. Her work encompasses a broad range of topics related to nutrition and dysphagia, highlighting her commitment to advancing knowledge and treatment in these fields.</data>
