    <node id="UNIDAD FUNCIONAL DE DISFAGIA OROFAR&#205;NGEA">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The Unidad Funcional de Disfagia Orofar&#237;ngea (UFDOF) is a specialized, multidisciplinary unit established in 2013 within the Hospital Universitario Pr&#237;ncipe de Asturias (HUPA). Its primary focus is on the assessment, diagnosis, and treatment of patients suffering from oropharyngeal dysphagia, a condition that affects swallowing. The unit aims to provide comprehensive care through collaborative efforts among various healthcare professionals, ensuring that patients receive tailored and effective management for their swallowing disorders. UFDOF emphasizes quality care and integrates multiple disciplines to enhance the treatment and rehabilitation processes for individuals with dysphagia, thereby improving their adapted nutrition and overall well-being.</data>
      <data key="d2">02c3924fac2660b8531f61207f3b04bb,06484c3fe8af6e4c44bbfc3ac2fa2590,1955c09ee453969c7603ae8206c088f8,5dd39815651d2d44f18c16e69696c0cf,669a55d41ff26c3ea749aaa095688593,929b14ae2554caeaab2a010ad94222eb,a3fd9c0d942a044ac2490f16d4ecc520,dfc3b0905ab9fc1fca9fc64473ebed80,ea0b88195d04b227bedf7fa3cb3b6513,fcc886f826047ced8783c4abfe3bf4a3</data>
