    <node id="DISFAGIA OROFAR&#205;NGEA: SOLUCIONES MULTIDISCIPLINARES">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">The book titled *Disfagia orofar&#237;ngea: soluciones multidisciplinares* addresses the treatment of oropharyngeal dysphagia and aims to be a reference in the field.</data>
      <data key="d2">669a55d41ff26c3ea749aaa095688593</data>
