    <node id="PACIENTES">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">PACIENTES refers to a diverse group of individuals facing various medical conditions that necessitate specialized nutritional support and dietary management. This group includes individuals suffering from chronic respiratory diseases such as EPOC (Chronic Obstructive Pulmonary Disease), cystic fibrosis (FQ), and bronchiectasis (BQ), who often encounter nutritional challenges. Additionally, patients with celiac disease must adhere to a strict gluten-free diet and receive education about their condition and associated risks.

Certain patients are at risk of refeeding syndrome, particularly those with a history of malnutrition, anorexia nervosa, or prolonged fasting, requiring careful monitoring and nutritional support. Others may need artificial nutrition at home due to an inability to meet their nutritional needs through regular food intake. This includes patients undergoing surgical procedures related to the digestive system, such as gastrostomy or jejunostomy, who require tailored nutritional support post-surgery.

PACIENTES also encompasses individuals with food allergies or intolerances, who need appropriate information and treatment. Those suffering from conditions like dysphagia, particularly oropharyngeal dysphagia, face challenges in swallowing and require specialized care and management. This group includes patients receiving treatment in specialized units, such as the Unidad Funcional de Disfagia Orofar&#237;ngea, where their treatment and satisfaction are prioritized.

Furthermore, patients with gastrointestinal disorders, such as Crohn's disease or ulcerative colitis, may require nutritional support to manage their conditions effectively. Individuals suffering from acute pancreatitis also undergo various treatments and nutritional assessments. 

In the context of eating disorders, PACIENTES includes individuals with anorexia nervosa and bulimia nervosa, who face both psychological and nutritional challenges and require comprehensive dietary education and support. Additionally, patients with urea cycle disorders, who experience symptoms like hyperammonemia, necessitate dietary management and treatment.

Overall, PACIENTES represents a broad spectrum of individuals requiring medical treatment and specialized nutritional care due to various health conditions, emphasizing the importance of individualized dietary plans and support systems tailored to their unique needs.</data>
      <data key="d2">01d01bb87220a5cf6d7b37d95834e15f,0487e1a4525547575a1d284297280f9a,05a2506becec805cd1374d73de9a9fec,08d8220e35364eb95bacafae7dd2953b,0d5d152382113aa1b8faab4e554c88cd,0ebd0c517a3d578a6823dc39797e4da1,0f0303399f29734dede9db544e1dda9e,0f7dbd2afca6dc5582d55fb39b0f55b7,0f965e7f43fe2ea0144b4b16715a04ba,123ef22fb42b6ade4fa2dda096df8490,17fc469cf1ddbb8fa68bad4446bd65e6,1f2b31f5a0bba00ecee5e3a8fb2c83ea,1fad843d053b1ec4805a4e7c6be9ceb3,222519e556047fafecd61c2964aaaeed,23c483bf9bf70d04577ef3735a1ca2e8,2b8c323c265f8f7f3d15bf988bf1f9ee,2d07762e6db07c2587caceac3427a1c7,3898563966943dbfc8a0f6e84bc627b1,39f9c76ac9952fa528996c6dc7b33ed8,3a7dac32347984360ee9e87767129272,3bc554a0031c436483a977c2b9e57b48,40fbc53467b8460d1d2d6bcd0d6dbf2a,43883071d6db17a632d928bc976776fd,44b25f00a145b92a9875173aafbc27c8,46912552a886d029c4aa16e3ea9a0e27,4ec3e8cb1f21808e70bbc71cb26d7396,538970e30e9d0e758546ca1a3cf5a205,5664277128c865feb0e93f9fd56a3d05,5dd39815651d2d44f18c16e69696c0cf,60a2803170af3c20448ef70091bdfadd,60e73f6536e23a61362ac00a9a9149d7,6289e9e0b5871fb9a2f2f691429bb4f8,639ebafae8a95bb03a09e111172b9a4e,669a55d41ff26c3ea749aaa095688593,70a9e916b8c55784c53828958c76eb09,754053396bd343e6bea58cadc2842462,76be4651996e2afabd433daa9f5fd3ac,7c0d1f274b31d130e4feb8e46fbeb764,7d29ccd4b2eeb48ab5572fd3c6c2802d,80220ae2bbcfeda884776e0ed9103390,84aebe8ee79b67a8fe16d40b6c07331d,8eef8cced3d7433de267e8e624813566,929b14ae2554caeaab2a010ad94222eb,94481f05649e1ec83f8cc2e4a70b660b,948f7e888e5bb06b347a80a3fbf87ae7,94df5002f2221058a9bb77f456a50e61,95b0d21cd06eb29e984e0882f8fac544,95ec74fd93c18ac23c08eb70137bc8db,98f9ca00cf50b7e359aa41f1d58d0735,9ee81e7e8558eff462947643e3a64588,a089d87928ddde83e1945eece488d3f5,a3d1ea55509c69a04f3268ea20a33ba4,a3fd9c0d942a044ac2490f16d4ecc520,acba2f4838c3e73b321d9dcc6ba6fe55,ad6c1f4ea2a6b80d32100cf5c2808cdc,b0ffa7260c4fc20462ad4c9bedcbfae7,b58b0258891d9207b27237bab6a03946,b7034350b98abd27ed6af7560149691d,b7fb13d01f792b754e667a3a5bcdba93,bd3be91ff178508497a810f873861eca