    <node id="REHABILITACI&#211;N">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Rehabilitaci&#243;n refers to the comprehensive process of rehabilitation that is often associated with enteral nutrition, aimed at helping patients regain their ability to eat orally. This process is particularly important for individuals suffering from oropharyngeal dysphagia, a condition that affects swallowing. Rehabilitation for oropharyngeal dysphagia involves the implementation of specific techniques and strategies designed to enhance swallowing safety and efficiency. The Rehabilitaci&#243;n (Rehabilitation) service is dedicated to the recovery and treatment of patients with various conditions, including those experiencing dysphagia. The Rehabilitation department provides targeted therapeutic interventions to improve the swallowing function of these patients, ensuring a holistic approach to their care and recovery.</data>
      <data key="d2">02d838eb7d60f4fe558e304b6b6933e8,1fad843d053b1ec4805a4e7c6be9ceb3,28e2e3a92ef4dd76af0898ae3e3df522,669a55d41ff26c3ea749aaa095688593,a3fd9c0d942a044ac2490f16d4ecc520</data>
      <data key="d3">1131</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">4</data>
      <data key="d6">19</data>
      <data key="d7">ea2f3a91381e42b5bfa4ef9c0f262490</data>
    </node>
    <node id="OTORRINOLARINGOLOG&#205;A">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Otorrrinolaringolog&#237;a, also known as otolaryngology, is a medical specialty dedicated to the evaluation and treatment of disorders related to the ear, nose, and throat. This specialty encompasses a range of conditions, including those affecting swallowing and the glosopalatine function of patients. The department plays a crucial role in diagnosing and managing dysphagia-related conditions, particularly oropharyngeal dysphagia, ensuring comprehensive care for individuals experiencing difficulties in these areas.</data>
      <data key="d2">669a55d41ff26c3ea749aaa095688593,9c43759c41fe226a2702de300b9e580a,a3fd9c0d942a044ac2490f16d4ecc520</data>
      <data key="d3">1080</data>
