    <node id="LUISA MAR&#205;A ANDR&#201;S ESTEBAN">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Luisa Mar&#237;a Andr&#233;s Esteban is a professional involved in the field of oropharyngeal dysphagia. She is a co-author of a manual that focuses on this condition, contributing to the development of multidisciplinary solutions aimed at addressing the challenges associated with dysphagia. In addition to her academic contributions, she works as a cook in the Hospital's Kitchen Service, specifically within the Functional Unit of Orofar&#237;ngea Dysphagia, where she applies her expertise to support patients with this condition through appropriate dietary management.</data>
