    <node id="ROSA ANA ASHBAUGH ENGUIDANOS">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Rosa Ana Ashbaugh Enguidanos is a dedicated professional specializing in nursing care for patients with oropharyngeal dysphagia. She works as a nurse in the Clinical Nutrition and Dietetics Unit at the Hospital Universitario Pr&#237;ncipe de Asturias, where her primary focus is on the treatment of dysphagia. In addition to her clinical work, Rosa Ana is also an author who contributes to the field of nutrition, particularly emphasizing the use of thickening agents in the management of dysphagia. Her expertise and contributions are significant in enhancing the care and nutritional support for patients facing these challenges.</data>
