    <node id="ELENA ATIENZA S&#193;NCHEZ">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Elena Atienza S&#225;nchez is a Resident Intern Physician in the Endocrinology and Nutrition Section at the Hospital Universitario Pr&#237;ncipe de Asturias. She is actively involved in research, particularly focusing on the role of digital technology in health and dysphagia. Additionally, she has contributed as a co-author to a section discussing oropharyngeal dysphagia in a relevant document. Furthermore, Elena is an author engaged in the study and documentation of nutritional practices specifically tailored for dysphagia patients.</data>
