    <node id="M&#211;NICA BENITO FERN&#193;NDEZ">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">M&#243;nica Benito Fern&#225;ndez is a dedicated professional in the field of nursing and nutrition, specifically focusing on the nutritional treatment of oropharyngeal dysphagia. She is a nurse who graduated in Clinical Nutrition and Dietetics and currently works in the Clinical Nutrition and Dietetics Unit at the Hospital Universitario Pr&#237;ncipe de Asturias. In her role, she provides nursing care for patients suffering from oropharyngeal dysphagia, ensuring they receive appropriate nutritional support. Additionally, M&#243;nica is a co-author of a document highlighting the importance of oral hygiene, further emphasizing her commitment to patient care and health education. Her research contributions are significant in enhancing the understanding and management of oropharyngeal dysphagia, showcasing her expertise and dedication to improving patient outcomes in this area.</data>
