    <node id="DYSFAGIA OROFAR&#205;NGEA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Dysfagia Orofaringea, or oropharyngeal dysphagia, is a condition that impacts the swallowing process, particularly affecting the throat. This specific type of dysphagia is a significant focus of clinical study and treatment at the Hospital Universitario Pr&#237;ncipe de Asturias. Various screening methods are employed to assess oropharyngeal dysphagia, highlighting its importance in clinical settings.</data>
      <data key="d2">7a685dfeed939ab716eb2f6e86a6cc04,80793c857399f9e6e22c76392e96ac8b</data>
