    <node id="SARCOPENIA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Sarcopenia is a condition characterized by the progressive loss of muscle mass and strength, primarily affecting older adults. This condition is significantly associated with aging and is linked to various health complications, including frailty, increased vulnerability to infections, and a higher risk of disability and mortality. Sarcopenia can also exacerbate health issues in patients with chronic diseases, such as cancer and liver cirrhosis, where it is often related to malnutrition and can impact overall prognosis.

The condition is particularly concerning in the elderly, as it contributes to functional decline and can lead to increased dependence and fragility. It is also associated with dysphagia, which affects swallowing ability, further complicating the health of older individuals. Nutritional interventions, including increased protein intake and exercise, have been shown to mitigate the effects of sarcopenia, highlighting the importance of proper nutrition and physical activity in managing this condition.

Sarcopenia was first proposed by Irwin Rosenberg in 1989 and has since been the focus of numerous studies aimed at understanding its implications and developing effective interventions. It is recognized as a syndrome that not only impacts physical health but can also influence cognitive health and overall quality of life in the elderly population.</data>
      <data key="d2">00a918807f0c6568ea1d9f0c41f1ad49,025274b58725397020078dea52ea012b,02b61e2d4f840772c76a05502aa4f171,0597a142067272f25431b8b42cb5288f,066ca85c476fdb709bb2b588cb86a55a,0bff3417518c19ae80d20de8150be58b,125bf798b37a7f42c661002099924973,1911ce26c118381473eccb438875b29c,1bad878c6efa9d3f5719546bb51bccb6,2b9c137acf3599eaa41c3514aba67a8a,2f194bef97e28167f81acc7a66ac56ab,3437d6cdf014282ec447fc7f4de92cab,368804d3e1f8a58c4e6c3a8210f08a35,3f21321c62f3e5ee31c822e90ca6b89e,4b3664b368fad59fd55189a65e19b000,5341a1454aa3fed0eab02f9ce7fea5d1,56da8c0bffe9c7811cc9790d767f4972,5898660be8944e9248ba187ffd7553b1,5d87d36fec170e242e5e50305a1bec49,639ebafae8a95bb03a09e111172b9a4e,78d3252445aa1a02df4627450218fb59,8205166235be6abd77947eb2f7c5ab27,87e62f930efe0b81911357297ccd271c,97a29de0d5161aebffb702f69c6dd870,a25b0f84bc321cad942a2e33f681a5e4,a527688a9f74d33efc23a2a94d33163b,a6a4604a5fc2c91b714b6ba568bb0090,a830f202c73ba48c11fb8863e0e4a642,b4b789f8b1484fea88d0b5c58dfde854,b5f705e0ba650f5ad1f558446be0191e,b7465350e74a3bada96615deb0d7b031,bdb8258b310cb9ed8a0e4354fac5a33c,d59761afc53676cf5d1fe62616f0d7d7,d93c7f9ea61d85e6be22df63c4b67d4d,df284534230932ffa363470a1a101b29,e155d9b2d1858daab734fd68a45d0c0a,e34366e525fb1dbc8468a7f4e6d91cb7,ea432f742f5cd2b4840a984ae35a9d09,eadd983c9f28c11a1c279e4b923351cd,f7871bbaa57d50bb5f5675cd580cb0af</data>
