    <node id="DINAPENIA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">DINAPENIA refers to a condition characterized by the loss of muscle strength, particularly in elderly patients. This condition can significantly contribute to dysphagia, which is the difficulty in swallowing. The impact of dinapenia on muscle strength not only affects overall physical capabilities but also poses challenges in the swallowing process for the elderly population.</data>
      <data key="d2">0bff3417518c19ae80d20de8150be58b,e34366e525fb1dbc8468a7f4e6d91cb7</data>
