    <node id="F&#193;RMACOS">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">F&#225;rmacos, or drugs and medications, are substances utilized in the treatment of various medical conditions. They play a crucial role in clinical practice, particularly in their interactions with diet and nutrients, which can significantly affect their efficacy and absorption. F&#225;rmacos may need to be administered to patients receiving enteral nutrition, necessitating specific guidelines to ensure proper delivery and effectiveness.

Certain medications, such as antibiotics and laxatives, are commonly associated with gastrointestinal side effects, including diarrhea and constipation. Additionally, f&#225;rmacos like somatostatin analogs are specifically used to manage dumping syndrome and its related symptoms. The gastrointestinal side effects of f&#225;rmacos can vary widely, with some causing chronic diarrhea depending on their nature and usage.

F&#225;rmacos are also essential in the control of metabolic processes, particularly in patients with burns, where they assist in managing nutrimetabolic needs. Furthermore, these medications can interact with nutrients during nutritional therapy, potentially impacting treatment outcomes. They may also affect thermoregulation and hydration in athletes, highlighting the importance of understanding their interactions with dietary components.

Moreover, certain medications can interfere with swallowing functionality, especially in the elderly, and can disrupt the absorption and metabolism of thyroid hormones, which may compromise treatment efficacy. Overall, f&#225;rmacos encompass a wide range of medications that require careful consideration of their interactions with diet and nutrients to optimize patient care.</data>
      <data key="d2">1ff94f3fcc6eff16c2fdae5eb9b3aefa,2ec23f85b858abc42196ef48260e8cb0,364aa13581a973c2e55c25191bad27cc,449c8567a3aa59b49fbe65b7a3a26d46,44f263c31f91c1bc594cbb28bd397c89,52a0434694f8face489cdb4c8d206a9e,65e3dfcb7a0c5a2a09a98342c597c020,7f0ee0bea2b1dfd09e75026d4c027291,95b0d21cd06eb29e984e0882f8fac544,ac274a54f27601e9d60118e72fc2ba94,be2de576112f22070e8ef8a5cb9e1017,e34366e525fb1dbc8468a7f4e6d91cb7,fa5c0208b983c59b247a65e6bb166f2a,fc664efd4e1c463dc21857e596b68b46</data>
      <data key="d3">1144</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
