      <data key="d6">144</data>
      <data key="d7">f4c90c4226ef4f2281f3a3514f1efba6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="DOF">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">DOF, or Dysphagia Orofar&#237;ngea, refers to a clinical condition characterized by difficulty in swallowing, which can significantly impact patients' health and quality of life. This condition is often associated with various medical issues and is particularly prevalent among the elderly. DOF requires a comprehensive and multidisciplinary management approach due to its implications for nutrition and hydration, as it can lead to malnutrition and dehydration.

The condition is recognized as a significant health concern, complicating the management of patients, especially those with comorbidities. It necessitates dietary modifications and the use of specific nutritional products to ensure safe consumption of food and liquids. Rehabilitation techniques and exercises may also be employed to improve swallowing function.

Furthermore, DOF is linked to increased patient mortality, longer hospital stays, and higher healthcare costs, highlighting the need for specialized consultation services that address swallowing disorders. Despite its importance, there is a noted lack of such services across the country, indicating a gap in the healthcare system that needs to be addressed to better support affected individuals.</data>
      <data key="d2">02c3924fac2660b8531f61207f3b04bb,06484c3fe8af6e4c44bbfc3ac2fa2590,085d1e3702bc42fa47418095d541867f,0bff3417518c19ae80d20de8150be58b,1835e55766e759ce3b8acec75f4b6875,186a95fdfe908123ad6f42d43b52ee1d,4ae09eb472a346b355bc66df2fea519f,4befdcd21a98898cec30bbac7b402d4b,5dd39815651d2d44f18c16e69696c0cf,67f60ae11335cf41da4f96400b69e67b,a3fd9c0d942a044ac2490f16d4ecc520,a76f6268d6065b1baabb9e13ef7f098c,be410757354948d16ee86e49a852101c,c257fcbbfdc5ac2678d371cee5c12edf,c30b47b534824f4d1b74f3c0bb00ffd9,d8fa59c6af96b4ebb96f2c6b4ddb5473,da965f79110bd8915deff461d0d91187,e34366e525fb1dbc8468a7f4e6d91cb7,eb2f276d3dc4e4a9e53923d9d80fec1a,f093c7e72a5015556281394111990625,fcc886f826047ced8783c4abfe3bf4a3</data>
