    <node id="ENVEJECIMIENTO">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">"ENVEJECIMIENTO" refers to the process of aging, a universal biological phenomenon that impacts individuals in diverse ways. This process leads to various physiological changes, including increased frailty and sarcopenia, which is characterized by a decline in muscle mass and strength. Aging significantly affects both cognitive function and nutritional needs, making it a critical factor in the overall health status of older adults. Additionally, it influences all aspects of health, including physical capabilities and the risk of conditions such as dysphagia. As the population of older adults continues to grow, understanding the implications of aging becomes increasingly important, as it is closely related to the deterioration of bodily systems and the overall well-being of the elderly.</data>
      <data key="d2">12281055b260e7dc55fcaeeab7eefde6,24e49b0b93b2307e2c4e7ac34f4d7f4b,5f15452403a4c9b4b3c7a48bac634a04,7427cd5c0088cf9c6ea0134ccf5f7e4f,a527688a9f74d33efc23a2a94d33163b,b36323a01af9698c9ac089dd8d37213d,b5f705e0ba650f5ad1f558446be0191e,b7465350e74a3bada96615deb0d7b031,bdb8258b310cb9ed8a0e4354fac5a33c,caab2e12a2bce3c947d663cf8b71cb67,e34366e525fb1dbc8468a7f4e6d91cb7</data>
      <data key="d3">1768</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">9</data>
      <data key="d6">146</data>
      <data key="d7">07a8da3e2f7d420dbef6b6db8a94558d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="MASA MUSCULAR">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Masa Muscular se refiere a la cantidad de tejido muscular presente en el cuerpo, un componente esencial para el rendimiento f&#237;sico y la salud de un deportista. Esta masa muscular puede ser evaluada mediante el &#205;ndice Creatinina-Altura, que proporciona una medida de la cantidad de m&#250;sculo en relaci&#243;n con la altura de una persona. Adem&#225;s, es importante destacar que la masa muscular tiende a disminuir con el envejecimiento, lo que puede tener implicaciones en la salud, incluyendo condiciones como la disfagia. En resumen, la masa muscular es un indicador clave de la salud f&#237;sica y el bienestar general, especialmente en el contexto del deporte y el envejecimiento.</data>
      <data key="d2">ab9a942f3aa9ca3eb88bcd26fcd60ddb,c69834419bc4c69bcafd7a81ed8535d4,e34366e525fb1dbc8468a7f4e6d91cb7</data>
