    <node id="CANCER DE CABEZA Y CUELLO">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">CANCER DE CABEZA Y CUELLO, or head and neck cancer, is a type of cancer that can significantly impact various functions, including swallowing. This condition is particularly relevant in the context of dysphagia studies, as it can lead to difficulties in swallowing due to the anatomical and functional changes caused by the disease.</data>
      <data key="d2">0bff3417518c19ae80d20de8150be58b,188b9989e78550b42ac06b2d89822bfb,c257fcbbfdc5ac2678d371cee5c12edf</data>
