    </node>
    <node id="DIFICULTADES PARA TRAGAR">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">"DIFICULTADES PARA TRAGAR" refers to difficulties swallowing, a common symptom that affects a significant portion of the population at some point in their lives. These swallowing difficulties can lead to the necessity of modifying one's diet, which may subsequently impact nutritional status.</data>
      <data key="d2">e12655d89e99e57ce1f6d87563adf674,e28f0577e97765bca9099d5dc4a4fcc5</data>
      <data key="d3">953</data>
