      <data key="d6">168</data>
      <data key="d7">2f080b6e644c4db7936432f64df1589a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="PATOLOG&#205;A">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">PATOLOG&#205;A refers to the study of diseases and their effects on the organism, which is particularly relevant to clinical nutrition. It encompasses various health conditions, including those that can coexist with dysphagia, thereby increasing its prevalence among affected individuals.</data>
      <data key="d2">5bda98c244ed300cfc07192e54c7eb88,e28f0577e97765bca9099d5dc4a4fcc5</data>
      <data key="d3">953</data>
