    <node id="AUSTRALIA">
      <data key="d0">GEO</data>
      <data key="d1">Australia is a country that plays a significant role in various health-related studies, particularly focusing on malnutrition and dehydration in elderly patients, with 53 hospitals participating in this research. Additionally, Australia has been involved in studying trends in hospital admissions due to anaphylaxis. However, it faces challenges in data collection for epidemiological studies, being one of eight countries noted for such limitations. Furthermore, Australia has conducted studies on the prevalence of malnutrition, contributing valuable comparative data to the field.</data>
      <data key="d2">17444b83ec19bdcc65ff0722869e7b4b,e119877a92b580500f5e5b0307401732,eab1daf48c7ca09f43fc115a3379cc10,f093c7e72a5015556281394111990625</data>
