    <node id="CAREGIVERS">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">CAREGIVERS are individuals who provide essential care and support to patients, playing a crucial role in the management of various health conditions, including dementia, disorders of function (DOF), and malnutrition. They face significant challenges due to the complexities of the patients' conditions, requiring them to adapt their caregiving strategies to meet the diverse needs of those they care for.</data>
