    <node id="UNITED STATES">
      <data key="d0">GEO</data>
      <data key="d1">The United States is a country located in North America, recognized for its significant influence on global politics and economics. It has a high prevalence of obesity, with approximately 34% of its population affected. Additionally, the United States is the site where studies on the prevalence of dysphagia and its impact on hospital stays and associated costs were conducted.</data>
