    <node id="DENMARK">
      <data key="d0">GEO</data>
      <data key="d1">Denmark is one of the five northern European countries that contributed to the establishment of the ERAS group. Additionally, it is the country where a study was conducted to evaluate the costs associated with dysphagia in geriatric patients.</data>
      <data key="d2">1835e55766e759ce3b8acec75f4b6875,980d6217f6ec073bf1673f14542ebbf0</data>
