    <node id="HOSPITALIZACI&#211;N">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Hospitalizaci&#243;n refers to the process of being admitted to a hospital for medical care, which may be necessary for various conditions, including head and neck cancers, acute pancreatitis, severe diarrhea, and complications related to liver disease. During hospitalization, patients often face challenges such as dysphagia, which can lead to longer hospital stays compared to those without such issues. Nutritional support is critical during this period, especially for patients at risk of malnutrition, including frail elderly individuals who may experience hospitalization due to stress factors and their frailty. 

In cases of severe malnutrition, hospitalization involves close monitoring and treatment to address related complications. Additionally, hospitalization can be a stressful event, particularly for elderly patients, potentially exacerbating their fragility. It is also relevant in the context of patients undergoing specific treatment protocols, such as the ketogenic diet, where medical supervision is essential. Furthermore, hospitalization may be necessary for psychiatric treatment, especially in cases involving eating disorders. Overall, the hospitalization process is a crucial aspect of medical care that addresses both physical and nutritional needs of patients across various health conditions.</data>
      <data key="d2">0ebd0c517a3d578a6823dc39797e4da1,1290ddd67bed33472ff31398d8699503,1835e55766e759ce3b8acec75f4b6875,195affa22ecd2f7b1cdce3d72fc1cba4,28f6d6818b8f0ce3d2b8f483fe0dac6c,3159307e5633698722f72fde1e82702f,3bd6f34f55dc7500746b997ebeecf327,449d46789f604265753884e2d371ec8c,4bf9e20e18b101e95ebd6a9ca591fc54,5aa4da1a8d1e0b60ec7e801c7db1701c,5f15452403a4c9b4b3c7a48bac634a04,6656dd3bdc79720504c3e4245f935d32,88dcf64f61e33adc3702b1ec401e2d4e,905bf2bbef1716cece7bd2f1f62c204e,b7a2c1e4dd77f47605fdb33f4a2c2bdf,bdb8258b310cb9ed8a0e4354fac5a33c,e34642244b0c7f309ab1c1be1e81da31,e5103e718912067f1a2766544cf1b4db,ec4fd77add427ab49ea4b8687b94b263</data>
