    <node id="PACIENTES HOSPITALIZADOS">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">"PACIENTES HOSPITALIZADOS" refers to individuals who are receiving treatment in a hospital setting. This group is particularly vulnerable to various health complications, including a notable percentage diagnosed with dysphagia, which is a condition that affects swallowing. Additionally, hospitalized patients are at a high risk of malnutrition, a prevalent issue that can further complicate their overall health status.</data>
      <data key="d2">02b61e2d4f840772c76a05502aa4f171,1835e55766e759ce3b8acec75f4b6875,cc6ee3d7bc9bfaf4a06f3f02c4907eb0</data>
