    <node id="MULTIDISCIPLINARY APPROACH">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">The "MULTIDISCIPLINARY APPROACH" refers to a collaborative strategy in healthcare that involves various professionals working together to deliver comprehensive care. This approach is particularly important in the treatment of conditions such as oropharyngeal dysphagia and in the field of ELA (English Language Arts) treatment. By integrating the expertise of different healthcare providers, a multidisciplinary approach ensures effective diagnosis and treatment, ultimately enhancing patient outcomes.</data>
      <data key="d2">02c3924fac2660b8531f61207f3b04bb,cea5f90ebf49c4157cab16ee26b9d97c</data>
      <data key="d3">932</data>
