    <node id="J NEUROL NEUROSURG PSYCHIATRY">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The entity "J NEUROL NEUROSURG PSYCHIATRY," also known as The Journal of Neurology, Neurosurgery, and Psychiatry, is a scholarly journal that focuses on publishing research related to the fields of neurology and psychiatry. Notably, in 2003, the journal published an article addressing the neurology of swallowing and oral feeding disorders. Additionally, it features studies that explore the relationship between diet and cognitive health, contributing to the broader understanding of how neurological and psychiatric conditions can be influenced by dietary factors.</data>
