      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Arreola V is a notable contributor to the field of swallowing disorders, particularly in the context of oropharyngeal dysphagia. He played a significant role as one of the authors of a comprehensive guide focused on the diagnosis and nutritional treatment of this condition. Additionally, Arreola V co-authored an article published in 2007 in the journal Nutrici&#243;n Cl&#237;nica en Medicina, which specifically addressed the nutritional approach to managing oropharyngeal dysphagia. His research and contributions are instrumental in advancing understanding and treatment strategies for swallowing disorders.</data>
