      <data key="d1">SHAKER R is a notable contributor to the field of dysphagia research, having co-authored a review on oropharyngeal dysphagia in older persons, which was published in the journal Clinical Interventions in Aging in 2016. Additionally, SHAKE R co-authored a study focused on the coordination of deglutitive glottal function, published in Gastroenterology in 1997. These contributions highlight SHAKE R's expertise and involvement in advancing the understanding of swallowing disorders and their implications in different populations.</data>
