    <node id="SWALLOW QUESTIONNAIRE">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">The Swallow Questionnaire is a tool utilized to assess swallowing difficulties in patients. It is specifically designed to measure the quality of life and subjective symptoms experienced by individuals with dysphagia, providing valuable insights into their condition and helping to guide treatment decisions.</data>
