    <node id="EATING ASSESSMENT TOOL-10">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">The Eating Assessment Tool-10 is a screening tool specifically designed to assess dysphagia in patients. It functions as a self-evaluation scale that enables individuals to evaluate their own clinical symptoms related to dysphagia. This tool is instrumental in identifying difficulties in swallowing, thereby facilitating appropriate clinical interventions.</data>
      <data key="d2">7a685dfeed939ab716eb2f6e86a6cc04,db12fd42641d2de0cee5f33601bfb6dc</data>
