    <node id="PREDYCES STUDY">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">The PREDyCES Study is a comprehensive research initiative that investigates the prevalence and costs associated with malnutrition in hospitalized patients, specifically focusing on those with diabetes mellitus and dysphagia. This study aims to analyze the extent of hospital malnutrition among these patient groups, highlighting the significant health and economic implications of this condition in a hospital setting. Through its multifaceted approach, the PREDyCES Study seeks to provide valuable insights into the challenges posed by malnutrition in healthcare, ultimately contributing to improved patient care and resource allocation.</data>
      <data key="d2">242fceb82929615af653d9f8574b0ef5,36c1edffe986e2f70996b6e440e11213,477da86aa038212a1e2b555b5a854cba,7a685dfeed939ab716eb2f6e86a6cc04,b422a0b87e2f7205a53dc0a5f1c0ab39</data>
