    <node id="GUGGING SWALLOWING SCREEN">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The Gugging Swallowing Screen (GUSS) is a clinical tool specifically designed to assess swallowing ability and the severity of dysphagia. It was developed in collaboration with the University of Danube Krems in Austria, highlighting its academic foundation and clinical relevance.</data>
      <data key="d2">4e83f9d1f09d1d6b2eb82c16a15f1928,7ff388a8f346ea7b1ceece48ed64b1a2</data>
      <data key="d3">1222</data>
