    </node>
    <node id="AQUA BI">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Aqua bi is a liquid solution utilized in clinical assessments to evaluate swallowing ability, particularly in the context of dysphagia management. It is specifically employed in the direct swallowing test of the Gugging Swallowing Screen (GUSS), where it is used in conjunction with food thickeners to assess an individual's swallowing capabilities.</data>
      <data key="d2">4e83f9d1f09d1d6b2eb82c16a15f1928,7ff388a8f346ea7b1ceece48ed64b1a2</data>
      <data key="d3">1222</data>
