      <data key="d7">667ab26271b6443f8f854eb12dde104d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="PATIENT">
      <data key="d0" />
      <data key="d1">The term "PATIENT" encompasses a diverse group of individuals receiving medical care, each with unique health conditions and treatment needs. Among them is a 29-year-old woman diagnosed with MELAS, who experiences multiple neurological and gastrointestinal symptoms and requires chronic treatment. Additionally, there is a 76-year-old male patient suffering from type 2 diabetes and moderate to severe malnutrition, necessitating specialized nutritional support and monitoring.

Patients, in general, may include those undergoing nutritional assessments and treatments, particularly individuals at risk of malnutrition or those managing various health conditions such as diabetes. This includes individuals who may require dietary management, lifestyle changes, and specific nutritional plans tailored to their health needs. For instance, patients with diabetes often need individualized nutrition strategies to effectively manage their condition.

Furthermore, the patient population also includes individuals undergoing evaluations for swallowing disorders, obesity, and related health issues, as well as those requiring nutritional support due to oncological conditions, such as a neuroendocrine tumor of the pancreas. Some patients may be preparing for or recovering from bariatric surgery, which involves adhering to specific dietary recommendations.

Overall, the term "PATIENT" refers to individuals receiving medical care across a spectrum of health challenges, highlighting the importance of tailored nutritional assessment and support in their treatment plans.</data>
      <data key="d2">02db15b9ad7bc5655e1907ad3fa4e8ad,03b047c49cda5e7bb642efcc9109ccc6,071141fe8f0a45f56522de2f52ddcb46,1f2b31f5a0bba00ecee5e3a8fb2c83ea,20863ac06779722abc2cbc2dd023777e,28cd3f60e1ccd9129a7d4d386e241a93,2b5b30d7b9371f8fe9e686c89dde3cb7,5236affa95aaf73b0f2d08e839e4db54,67ac4ae2f7a1b9b3455a1d1da9c20161,687a74f539aea483b8c6611f3b062931,6edff59a3b151e946e7664f13bcb0931,7295ffd1826d8ea12cf9f832ba6f80b3,7a6970183393c5ef1adc99851ef3eada,7ff388a8f346ea7b1ceece48ed64b1a2,81491129b1fbfcc2e010109419cde1f0,814d394c907e59b29a5f0d9e82aed423,8413d4414414c5cb139198857cce327a,84e91b50850bfa0ad0122cdebf477a1d,8ad412c188e4086d686c217c6c5c5324,8d04735d72211a4d6f619b72cbce48b6,a76f6268d6065b1baabb9e13ef7f098c,aeb399b3f90c6a50eed8adfa8a140451,b1ce0d940909277d321ee55bffcc69b3,c639615d7681ffeb945a996d231bb7aa,e2304aa7e992d9e26558aab3c807b51d,e279d3a0da085b47528c08f486afe0a5,ec94449c6ffff75664588262301de0a6,eeb6e04f12698ee82912bdf775d79381,f44811ae5b3e9dab0f295efe8842767a,fb0c6cd346ca91e15f8ff1cc07570d9d</data>
