      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Neurological pathologies refer to a range of disorders affecting the nervous system, which can lead to complications such as dysphagia and malnutrition.</data>
      <data key="d2">59a97e6bf8748a66eb335bec2852ce38</data>
