    </node>
    <node id="CRIBADO DE LA DISFAGIA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Swallowing screening is a process used to identify patients at risk of dysphagia, particularly in those with neurological conditions.</data>
      <data key="d2">59a97e6bf8748a66eb335bec2852ce38</data>
      <data key="d3">1275</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">344</data>
      <data key="d7">13e1838455854805bb9f21160556fbbd</data>
    </node>
    <node id="RECOMENDACIONES">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">The entity "RECOMENDACIONES" encompasses a set of guidelines designed to enhance clinical practices in various aspects of nutrition and health management. These recommendations are based on evidence and aim to improve dietary intake and nutritional needs across different age groups. Additionally, they provide specific guidance for the assessment and management of dysphagia, particularly in patients with neurological disorders. Overall, "RECOMENDACIONES" serves as a comprehensive framework for promoting optimal nutrition and health practices.</data>
      <data key="d2">59a97e6bf8748a66eb335bec2852ce38,767d564db2dbf0182707caaf1b0a52d2,90fe1d34782402a1896d33ad5bb47614</data>
      <data key="d3">1275</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">6</data>
      <data key="d6">345</data>
      <data key="d7">4890ef0d993642b490339baa082c1938</data>
    </node>
    <node id="NUTRICI&#211;N CL&#205;NICA">
      <data key="d0" />
      <data key="d1">NUTRICI&#211;N CL&#205;NICA is a dynamic and evolving discipline that focuses on the nutritional care and dietary management of patients, particularly in clinical settings. This field encompasses the assessment and management of dietary needs, nutritional therapy, and interventions aimed at improving health outcomes for individuals with various health conditions, including chronic illnesses, metabolic disorders, and those requiring specialized nutrition products.

Clinical nutrition involves the study and application of nutrition principles in the context of health and disease management, emphasizing the importance of dietary interventions in the prevention and treatment of diseases. It includes practices such as the use of parenteral nutrition for patients with specific needs, dietary modifications for individuals with swallowing difficulties, and nutritional support for patients with conditions like cancer, burns, and severe trauma.

NUTRICI&#211;N CL&#205;NICA also highlights the design and development of clinical nutrition products, which is a comprehensive process that involves generating ideas, conducting formulation trials, and ensuring that these products meet specific health and dietary requirements. This aspect of clinical nutrition is crucial for providing essential nutrients to patients and improving their overall health.

Furthermore, NUTRICI&#211;N CL&#205;NICA is integrated into evidence-based medicine, focusing on the nutritional needs of patients and the application of nutritional knowledge in clinical decision-making processes. It plays a vital role in the management of patients' dietary needs, particularly in hospital settings, and is increasingly supported by research aimed at enhancing patient outcomes through effective dietary management and interventions.</data>
      <data key="d2">0148b1abded087a7c25eda89c8014f38,0379ef9e3f56ccd30c572884eb5bd723,03b7a89c9bb1dfd115acef377b491808,07a16ed299a7f8bafcaa44a54495a9c3,07e45dae0f017eba9ef9f48439de5c59,0977493109f1215441cf1927961d21ee,0bf272be187cbf9ec33184c8052e19c6,0e4628d74bee9cdd38f544f119527748,0ed0218136adceb16e9f246f3072e6dd,0fd4d7a9544dd7c2999b9ce1708919bc,1870ba6878c109f3023c9d15d0fa784b,1e6677459719ee2aa18d6d2ffbe46330,26765fd0d663c8708d7bd6a545de3e2c,2f5d9123a78d23b1bc3d9f06d7a53d78,3159307e5633698722f72fde1e82702f,36c284376160918fa78cabc41d6b6285,3775bd9e3567a81cf7b7acf1e2741f6f,3b21a011b73cb6fe2bb548f624a8c45c,3d73ef14929e7391e915f739189e4dfa,4196233cbb95a9ab194177cc11875e7a,41dee7570059d609c99074f155d4f927,4734ce2075bc72c352950c018bab7185,57a5157c4312ac09073e72ad7789ad7c,59a97e6bf8748a66eb335bec2852ce38,5c69bb68f0d23a5aa15fa31301aa13c2,5e934738b2a8cb03468f4ebf4eec0cd2,62f527b38024e8807d3e63a0cf488046,6906ee13020e48a5d50fc97dc22928fa,7852af9e2886d0d889fbc056d0a75f21,7c37a605ce9323c724b713aa64b7fae5,820640c45c3a696fca3c8c45b680b19b,89ca65c4bdc30027c9c9ed1e1b442939,8ff1cad741bacfef19d53bb8941b5ca9,90fe1d34782402a1896d33ad5bb47614,91131751d701592a597bae807e00c1dc,9df39dbac545af182eade788e4c5db5d,a4b56b993221a7065a59bca622c02953,a5ee3f91f8571820c338a8db4d3db09d,aaef63df030ff97e66b358358491e6a5,b6c8d5ff1536806d6512fb9d1af1e6db,c1fce1d059978d0a9ee9e63f75c8ca98,c1fcea6b2c2290b4c90ae1a511ca05d4,c879347903aabeef630597c99cff2275,d9e4179f945ec9152199511522d70159,da9a9fd67ac55e9180d1609d1df2a255,dabdb883b39fe459da7aab4a4e7242cb,dc38a37c30b175667931b84a9c9103bb,dce680808e039e852dc0f2639835db32,e5ec5005272f7691eba86e2cc7240f5a,ec69668515f0a014f1a602bcdc46c47f,f7d56bac9cc29e47690669e812094c99,f999ed498214f69427e629a05ea8ce4a,fbbb8c2530f7ac5635ecf5110ea186b2</data>
