    <node id="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL is a vital method of delivering nutrition directly to the gastrointestinal tract, primarily designed for patients who are unable to consume food orally. This approach is often favored over parenteral nutrition due to its physiological benefits, safety, and efficacy. It involves administering nutrients either orally or through a feeding tube directly into the stomach or intestines, making it suitable for a variety of patient populations, including those with swallowing difficulties, chronic illnesses, or post-surgical needs.

This method is particularly beneficial for critically ill patients, individuals with severe dysphagia, and those with conditions that impair nutrient absorption, such as cystic fibrosis or pancreatitis. It is also extensively utilized in pediatric care, especially for premature infants, to ensure adequate growth and development. NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL helps maintain the integrity of the intestinal barrier, reduces the risk of infections, and improves overall nutritional status.

In clinical settings, enteral nutrition is typically initiated when oral intake is insufficient, often starting 5-7 days before surgery and continuing postoperatively. It is tailored to meet individual caloric and nutritional needs, utilizing specially formulated diets. However, it may present complications, such as digestive symptoms or increased infection risk, necessitating careful management to avoid interactions with medications.

NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL serves as a critical intervention for patients who cannot meet their nutritional requirements through traditional means, ensuring they receive the necessary nutrients to support their health and recovery. It is particularly indicated for patients with conditions like neoplasia, fistulas, and Crohn's disease, and is essential for maintaining digestive tract integrity and minimizing inflammatory responses. Overall, this nutritional support method has developed significantly in recent years and is preferred when the digestive tract is functional, making it a cornerstone of modern nutritional therapy.</data>
      <data key="d2">00467cf9f31ccb0046bfd36ff48c4448,01704aec4089b2f0f24dd0f0841b5ecf,029b25f481d41458f45f1711f98c970f,02d838eb7d60f4fe558e304b6b6933e8,03b047c49cda5e7bb642efcc9109ccc6,058edb7500a486cc3196de4ca335b375,05d8d8e5292374b82ba2b4afdd3d700a,07e45dae0f017eba9ef9f48439de5c59,08d8220e35364eb95bacafae7dd2953b,0977493109f1215441cf1927961d21ee,09e9623b3facc5045e80541b1cd2cada,0a844e2dc679c0578ba4bdeda742c2eb,0b02ff4978fb09a0b2a360ae8c661337,0b6ad83080610bbf1789d7db4c8d40ba,0bdc356a46149def2545e7939372c20d,0dab18980ece5562db9bbd4a3bb9f9ac,0df5ab4ef9db16004ddebefc8290f5f2,0e014859b304da60c29590e36c9cbc85,0e756c1673317aaf495b90b8bcb02515,0f965e7f43fe2ea0144b4b16715a04ba,111edb0e21c873322871e35619a1ebf5,123ef22fb42b6ade4fa2dda096df8490,125acd19edb76fa23986de56fc2517e8,13c6297da17b9be4a67cf439f62cd289,140611dbb8a68fc40712c946de92b73f,186a95fdfe908123ad6f42d43b52ee1d,1870ba6878c109f3023c9d15d0fa784b,195affa22ecd2f7b1cdce3d72fc1cba4,1ba0aa1d1330351a62eb6319ffdd30db,20491afa9a4770e93e6cff9034f8b0f0,21e6d7085f520d8a2f415746dc7eab71,2206bb4d5efe2dcf644ee48468ea112c,234b514a40a64bc02f1346cb62cf3f97,2754a719b063eed550046e5b405be3d5,27b65be3bda292c9c26dfd7a87e74752,27c75984e62c5adcac1ac33cbdc520dc,285343ba92b89a1761b72d9d789ba8f6,28633689bf0b9bc990e61fb26722ce16,29b85b34282f79a12349b7e1d967b1a7,29c2dd6ce196c0166033a861582e9721,2ad1c3591301bd2ea6f99c3782714d69,2b8c323c265f8f7f3d15bf988bf1f9ee,2b9c137acf3599eaa41c3514aba67a8a,2c7998e65812140cbdda2e4d9c972315,2def4be9506db96f8bdfe9e3ba6f9b6f,2ebe12524f7750215eee73b328b601ee,2f96bbc5eafd39b659620da7282a2079,30d5c2ac31f39f8177bec50f6b5e631b,3159307e5633698722f72fde1e82702f,395385fad73fd5b7ed9eda114b482624,397cb82cce268866351c44a5b38ccb8b,3a5d7e4dc412f1d4701672c3af3cb4ed,3c6db755168f2fea94b2535a81ce6f58,3d03390859575cc2ead8aa5f917d0066,3dfc700a2eaec232c05b0a53f2089229,3ee948dc4ddfdc75daa8fe7db9bb471e,3f295222427803a7fc92b83386e5ec56,4015c8a1a16c5c93f3b853d9cac57bf4,417548e99612a123d61f9fd10807ce34,41dee7570059d609c99074f155d4f927