    <node id="GASTROSTOM&#205;A PERCUT&#193;NEA ENDOSC&#211;PICA">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">La gastrostom&#237;a percut&#225;nea endosc&#243;pica es un procedimiento para administrar nutrici&#243;n enteral en pacientes con dificultades para alimentarse.</data>
      <data key="d2">4ae09eb472a346b355bc66df2fea519f</data>
      <data key="d3">1178</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">348</data>
      <data key="d7">a6f6fe293383496fa2c0cc5f62845b1e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="CRIBADO">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">CRIBADO refers to a screening process that involves evaluating individuals to detect various health conditions. This process is particularly important for identifying issues such as dysphagia in patients suffering from multiple sclerosis and stroke. Additionally, screening is utilized to test for diseases in individuals who do not yet exhibit symptoms. Furthermore, the CRIBADO process serves as a method to assess patients for nutritional risk prior to undergoing surgical interventions. Overall, CRIBADO encompasses a comprehensive approach to early detection and risk assessment in healthcare.</data>
      <data key="d2">4ae09eb472a346b355bc66df2fea519f,af95ffa2f3eaddc28a86d59cd2d89415,ebfa3e3e6e6101b4d607871e17276705</data>
      <data key="d3">914</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">3</data>
      <data key="d6">349</data>
      <data key="d7">77f8305da6694344b5514d9e15b786b3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="RECOMENDACI&#211;N">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Las recomendaciones son gu&#237;as establecidas para el manejo de la nutrici&#243;n y la disfagia en pacientes con esclerosis m&#250;ltiple e ictus.</data>
      <data key="d2">4ae09eb472a346b355bc66df2fea519f</data>
      <data key="d3">914</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">350</data>
      <data key="d7">39e2d4a959b544bdb7fed6ceeac3c3a1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="VIDEOFLOROSCOPIA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">VIDEOFLOROSCOPIA is an instrumental technique utilized to assess swallowing function in patients with dysphagia, particularly beneficial for those exhibiting early signs of swallowing difficulties. This diagnostic procedure involves the observation of the passage of food or liquid through the oropharynx using fluoroscopy, allowing for a detailed evaluation of swallowing mechanics. It is typically performed in specialized settings, ensuring that patients receive accurate assessments and appropriate interventions for their swallowing issues.</data>
      <data key="d2">76be4651996e2afabd433daa9f5fd3ac,b44e720874efa74c538dd573ee936378,fcc886f826047ced8783c4abfe3bf4a3</data>
      <data key="d3">953</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">3</data>
      <data key="d6">351</data>
      <data key="d7">74de9619e5d446b59574ffcb57eadc26</data>
    </node>
    <node id="M&#201;TODO DE EXPLORACI&#211;N CL&#205;NICA VOLUMEN-VISCOSIDAD (MECV-V)">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">El MECV-V es una herramienta que ayuda a detectar alteraciones en la degluci&#243;n y determina la viscosidad y volumen adecuados para pacientes con disfagia.</data>
      <data key="d2">dd15aaae6791a32f0adb78cc25cb70c3</data>
      <data key="d3">906</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">352</data>
      <data key="d7">6af21f97790f4c7cb7889576f84999dc</data>
    </node>
    <node id="VELASCO M">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Velasco M es uno de los autores que contribuy&#243; a la gu&#237;a de diagn&#243;stico y tratamiento nutricional y rehabilitador de la disfagia orofar&#237;ngea.</data>
      <data key="d2">dd15aaae6791a32f0adb78cc25cb70c3</data>
