    <node id="BURGOS R">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Burgos R is a researcher who has made significant contributions to the field of malnutrition, particularly focusing on diabetic patients. In addition to their research work, Burgos R is also an author known for translating and validating the EAT-10 scale, which is utilized for dysphagia screening. This dual role highlights Burgos R's commitment to improving health outcomes through both research and practical assessment tools in the medical community.</data>
