    <node id="TRATADO DE NUTRICI&#211;N">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">The "TRATADO DE NUTRICI&#211;N" is a comprehensive work on nutrition that was published in 2017 by Editorial M&#233;dica Panamericana. Edited by Gil Hern&#225;ndez, this publication covers various aspects of dietary science, providing an in-depth exploration of nutritional principles and practices.</data>
      <data key="d2">8778654a17a48b8ea7b1cec378d52346,dae3d2cddf63b2af4067a27d8b9d7ab5</data>
      <data key="d3">1479</data>
