    </node>
    <node id="VIDEOENDOSCOPIA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Videoendoscopia is a diagnostic procedure that employs videoendoscopy, an instrumental technique, to visualize the swallowing process and assess dysphagia. This method is specifically designed to evaluate swallowing function in patients experiencing difficulties, providing valuable insights into their condition.</data>
      <data key="d2">d8fa59c6af96b4ebb96f2c6b4ddb5473,dae3d2cddf63b2af4067a27d8b9d7ab5</data>
