    <node id="BIOPSIAS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Biopsias, also known as biopsies, are medical procedures that involve the removal of tissue samples for examination. These procedures are crucial diagnostic techniques used to identify diseases, including conditions such as FQ. By sampling tissue, biopsias allow healthcare professionals to analyze the cellular structure and determine the presence of any abnormalities or diseases.</data>
