    <node id="P&#201;RDIDA DE PESO">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">"P&#201;RDIDA DE PESO" refers to the significant reduction in body weight experienced by patients, which is a critical indicator of malnutrition and is often evaluated to determine nutritional status. This condition can manifest as a weight loss of 5 kg or more over a period of six months, with percentages of weight loss ranging from 13% to 17%. It is particularly concerning in patients with specific health conditions, such as gastroesophageal reflux disease, where it may indicate potential complications, and in cancer patients, where it is commonly associated with malnutrition and caquexia.

In geriatric patients, weight loss can also signify malnutrition and is a common symptom that necessitates further investigation. The assessment of weight loss is crucial in various medical contexts, including the management of patients with chronic obstructive pulmonary disease (EPOC), where it may relate to malnutrition and increased energy expenditure. Additionally, weight loss is a monitored outcome in neonates, especially regarding fluid management and overall health assessment.

Overall, "P&#201;RDIDA DE PESO" is a significant health concern that is systematically measured and classified according to its severity, serving as a vital parameter in diagnosing malnutrition and assessing the overall health status of patients across different medical conditions.</data>
      <data key="d2">0bc48d0666e895b990c211acf7cbcf23,15ffbfba2decfecb69a26bcb1e4bd898,2ad1c3591301bd2ea6f99c3782714d69,3356667d6f35de6a8587ece00f8c6580,3f379d10d8c57694a1c646c072f7ed84,4681f41ebd69a732f7a8be6c2ed0f51a,514518b96e32b025815b45cc2a504f0d,5277ea34ef65b7d029950f2c905c6732,5664277128c865feb0e93f9fd56a3d05,58af2bdd20eeb5647ecc8088732833d8,67f60ae11335cf41da4f96400b69e67b,6c8b41c09b1ada129f0908d6e5d18185,6d116bdd48d75e9e6c33844db5816915,7906ee47aaf0c271f072790eaea05866,83b82871866963bb43f901dd9ca09fcb,b26b998479da515c234ce46b1bfa73db,bf0cc16dc61df5b90a5a1e961322391a,ddd48beea3c882bf1a651cb25283ba91,e12655d89e99e57ce1f6d87563adf674,e474ebdcd3e5392e4b2bed8434293849,ea7d8ba0550547d4cff0b5d18c3f6ae5</data>
