    <node id="NUTRICIONAL VALORATION">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Nutritional valorization is the process of assessing the nutritional status of patients, particularly those with dysphagia, to tailor dietary and nutritional support.</data>
      <data key="d2">73fd366244763cef4b13c058330147b1</data>
      <data key="d3">906</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">2</data>
      <data key="d6">544</data>
      <data key="d7">e69e194f8e7940418fd7e3b93ce9144f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="NUTRITIONAL REQUIREMENTS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Nutritional requirements encompass the specific energy and protein needs of individuals, particularly focusing on patients with swallowing difficulties, such as those with dysphagia. These requirements are not uniform; they vary based on several factors including health status, age, activity level, and specific medical conditions. Evaluations during assessments help determine these individualized needs, which are crucial for maintaining health and supporting growth, especially in vulnerable populations like children, the elderly, and individuals with chronic diseases. Additionally, nutritional requirements provide guidelines and calculations for energy and nutrient intake, particularly for hospitalized patients, to prevent malnutrition and dehydration. Overall, understanding and addressing nutritional requirements is essential for promoting optimal health and well-being across different demographics.</data>
      <data key="d2">67f60ae11335cf41da4f96400b69e67b,73fd366244763cef4b13c058330147b1,91b470ee527a45d8e81a821eeb9ce259,abd9a4b801dbdaca1708f0e22331a829,bfe875ea294b9a390193b5de532ff71b,c639615d7681ffeb945a996d231bb7aa,d0061877457bb078516d0e43dd6d8131</data>
      <data key="d3">752</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">13</data>
      <data key="d6">545</data>
      <data key="d7">ef2a7767b208416894c6efd474b8d6cf</data>
    </node>
    <node id="NUTRITIONAL SCREENING">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Nutritional screening is a process utilized to identify patients at risk of malnutrition. This screening is particularly important for individuals with specific health concerns, such as those with TCA (Tricyclic Antidepressant) use and those suspected of having dysphagia, a condition that affects swallowing. The primary goal of nutritional screening is to evaluate patients for potential nutritional deficiencies, ensuring that individuals at risk are identified and can receive appropriate interventions to address their nutritional needs.</data>
      <data key="d2">14039baea6555ffc156768e503ff0b90,58ae94a34f90df368b032f1618c7bcec,73fd366244763cef4b13c058330147b1,c67141db7734dcc583e60c351c2e0772,f5660be03d70d5dd506c197283dd79ae</data>
      <data key="d3">1174</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">9</data>
      <data key="d6">546</data>
      <data key="d7">427b80eaf9684e95989ef96d4dbe285d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="NUTRITIONAL SUPPORT">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Nutritional support refers to a comprehensive set of medical interventions and dietary strategies aimed at maintaining or improving the nutritional status of patients, particularly those who are unable to consume food normally due to various medical conditions. This practice is especially critical in medical settings, where patients may be undergoing treatments such as chemotherapy, hematopoietic stem cell transplants, or surgeries, including those for esophageal and pancreatic cancer.

The interventions associated with nutritional support include the provision of oral nutritional supplements, enteral nutrition, and parenteral nutrition, which are essential for patients with swallowing difficulties, chronic diseases, or those at nutritional risk. Nutritional support is vital for patients with conditions such as cancer, diabetes, liver disease, cystic fibrosis, and pancreatitis, as it helps manage their energy and protein needs, prevents malnutrition, and improves overall health outcomes.

In critical care settings, nutritional support plays a crucial role in aiding recovery for patients who are critically ill, burned, or have suffered trauma. It involves dietary modifications and supplementation tailored to individual needs, ensuring that patients receive adequate nutrients to support healing and recovery. Additionally, nutritional support is integral to protocols like Enhanced Recovery After Surgery (ERAS), which emphasizes preoperative screening for malnutrition and postoperative dietary management.

Overall, nutritional support encompasses a wide range of strategies and interventions designed to enhance the dietary intake and health status of patients, particularly those facing challenges in meeting their nutritional needs due to illness or medical procedures.</data>
      <data key="d2">005b22fc9dae5f9b135f0c8ba729819f,10bde114bd1285b3aeeec94dd4292d9e,11cbdce47eee11a80ab609f3b786bcc1,178140d0d29364593546d7d21393f2c6,193f43446f6311107c8a73b6111fa25a,22769156746e1c11980b01e7fffbcac7,242881af1a0439ab16c10b788cff01fd,24cc40d6e3b225945cd4d8c2484632e4,32642463df83d3626d7a9c5acf121825,3534154ea7562c7d4abe51bf29546109,36cffc3e7c3a6fe82e50787e939f7537,384e13475cc83e77e160fd6be9a88e73,396dda5c9597828f0749f963f42142b4,408288a47065e62d79bbc9b19df87c61,4ada21f24df8df18dbc05f5619c0a368,4eb41f33f9aba3b8ecd3906de91a1345,5705dc62240c8f823dd1bc15770d5ab2,58ae94a34f90df368b032f1618c7bcec,58db9fa69ca87ec24d7117fea6f2fe88,5aaadc19de8fb96a4951c0ba38192991,6517add809ee588bede013f59f20b0ef,69bfdb98603d3d8c4733cb795f4c82f3,6edff59a3b151e946e7664f13bcb0931,7295ffd1826d8ea12cf9f832ba6f80b3,73d47e377c2910da3393d7bb65f80e8e,73fd366244763cef4b13c058330147b1,758bc764453f49b9097073c5175470cc,762a80a4c9f24d778b79fdd596f343e3,814d394c907e59b29a5f0d9e82aed423,8413d4414414c5cb139198857cce327a,8c1c8ef18f5c90fe936a3ca920768ee2,8d9c5b85d058d0d3cde4479b5589a7d1,91b470ee527a45d8e81a821eeb9ce259,97a728c18b63007d07b6a4a5fc22d5e4,9ea9816b490492ba0030e6ba4bc3bb9f,9ec3bf4d23f9f4fca8984c81d95aac41,9ef354c0ee5ac877ce8fba79fcc7e2b3,a496bf37d4cc9b6246f5eb6b66b03d8a,a66b01654a2f495559fd1a24efc0e64e,abd9a4b801dbdaca1708f0e22331a829,b0b96ec7b9f57581fe18f0ac902af707,b3760fcb9c0421b66d37c20b1dc68577,b3ddc7e512f6a789fa4cef18e7b18fab,bb209dcfffac9c89dae0ad4ed2908d85,c45c1688135653a80812cdaf426ec9a3,c7577b8eccf83ced48f5ecf36717b4e1,c940d6c62fa57d30867f7a8533492471,cae7bf8d7b8c9d1f34a87ef41ff39a17,ce2e5f8df5ad472bb255174d496cc1d7,d23c564df025cf16e37f2ef2be83ec34,df284534230932ffa363470a1a101b29,eadd983c9f28c11a1c279e4b923351cd,ec94449c6ffff75664588262301de0a6,ee3700469e1c419d283b34f38100fa29,f6135205f57ce2216ab62038ac34a2bb,f7b4cba3bbdeec64513c036fd4166835,f902ee3930fcc849fa131b58d6e4933d,fab4b91ddb77bd16a93a3808a9c12b4c,fb24bf4c9fcf60bbc1dd56cd60ba0a47,fb7b0d121f195e2a472f3d47e28ccff9,fea8c7e37cd76ac988e0b242cb84fe6f</data>
      <data key="d3">1214</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
