    <node id="CRIBADO NUTRICIONAL">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">CRIBADO NUTRICIONAL refers to the nutritional screening process, which is essential for identifying patients at risk of malnutrition. This process is particularly relevant for individuals with oropharyngeal dysphagia and those undergoing hematopoietic cell transplantation. Nutritional screening is a standardized procedure that evaluates the nutritional status of patients, making it a mandatory practice in hospital settings. The primary goal of this screening is to identify individuals who may benefit from nutritional support, ensuring that at-risk patients receive the necessary care to prevent malnutrition.</data>
      <data key="d2">27c75984e62c5adcac1ac33cbdc520dc,39f9c76ac9952fa528996c6dc7b33ed8,6458fe5a14762d5f8c1561f80acb844a,969bdfc6cc15b9089e96000addd87561,a3444da30e339275da1056c3e13bcae5,a9b588c70518bc2aa91325853898b7c0,f764c1a74fbbce262e79b50639acb7bd</data>
