    <node id="BAPEN">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The British Association for Parenteral and Enteral Nutrition (BAPEN) is an organization dedicated to providing guidance and support for nutritional care in the UK. BAPEN focuses on nutrition support and has developed guidelines specifically for malnutrition screening. Additionally, the organization oversees practices and guidelines related to artificial nutrition, ensuring that standards are maintained in the field of nutritional care.</data>
