    <node id="RIESGO NUTRICIONAL">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">RIESGO NUTRICIONAL refers to the potential for malnutrition or adverse health outcomes resulting from inadequate nutritional intake or status. This concern is particularly significant for patients undergoing bariatric surgery, as they may experience malabsorption, which can exacerbate nutritional deficiencies. Additionally, nutritional risk encompasses the possibility that patients, especially those with conditions such as cancer, may not receive sufficient nutrients. Various screening tools are utilized to assess this risk, ensuring that patients are monitored for potential malnutrition and its associated health implications.</data>
