    <node id="ATENCI&#211;N PRIMARIA">
      <data key="d0">GEO</data>
      <data key="d1">Atenci&#243;n Primaria refers to primary healthcare services that provide initial care and management for patients, including those with diabetes. These services are essential in coordinating with the UFDOF in the Community of Madrid, ensuring comprehensive care for patients. Additionally, Atenci&#243;n Primaria is involved in the management and follow-up of patients receiving home artificial nutrition, playing a key role in the ongoing assessment and management of patients' nutritional status.</data>
