    <node id="TRATAMIENTO NUTRICIONAL">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">The "TRATAMIENTO NUTRICIONAL" encompasses a variety of therapeutic approaches aimed at improving the nutritional status and overall health of patients across different medical conditions. It plays a crucial role in the management of eating disorders, facilitating weight recovery and promoting healthy eating habits. In the context of cancer care, nutritional treatment provides dietary advice and may include artificial nutrition to support patients' health and recovery, particularly for those with gastrointestinal malignancies.

For patients with renal lithiasis, the treatment focuses on increasing fluid intake and modifying dietary habits to prevent recurrence of kidney stones. Additionally, nutritional treatment is tailored to meet the specific needs of individuals with diabetes and other metabolic disorders, emphasizing dietary control to avert complications. 

Furthermore, it addresses the needs of patients at risk of malnutrition by designing plans that enhance dietary intake and overall health. In cases of oropharyngeal dysphagia, nutritional strategies involve adapting food texture and viscosity to ensure safe swallowing. Lastly, for patients with Glycogen Storage Disease I, dietary management is crucial for maintaining normal blood glucose levels. Overall, "TRATAMIENTO NUTRICIONAL" is a comprehensive approach that integrates various dietary strategies to support recovery and health across a spectrum of medical conditions.</data>
      <data key="d2">397cb82cce268866351c44a5b38ccb8b,3bd6f34f55dc7500746b997ebeecf327,639ebafae8a95bb03a09e111172b9a4e,76287e9b94faab94755c56fead3541d7,948f7e888e5bb06b347a80a3fbf87ae7,a5ee3f91f8571820c338a8db4d3db09d,b703f173982cf68d36653cc0d9cc1fcb,c7cd7add413c00d9d6eb40d934ba10af,f764c1a74fbbce262e79b50639acb7bd</data>
