      <data key="d7">89aacedf9caf4acd8d39c672ce9a52e2</data>
    </node>
    <node id="ENFERMEDAD AGUDA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">"ENFERMEDAD AGUDA" refers to any acute illness or psychological stress experienced by a patient within the last three months. This condition can significantly impact the patient's nutritional status and overall health. Acute illnesses often lead to increased nutritional needs, which are crucial for recovery and maintaining health. The effects of "enfermedad aguda" are evaluated through tools such as the Mini Nutritional Assessment, which helps in assessing the nutritional implications of recent acute illnesses or psychological stress on the patient.</data>
      <data key="d2">0bc48d0666e895b990c211acf7cbcf23,67ac4ae2f7a1b9b3455a1d1da9c20161,8e8aac45bfe71fa006f622690dfdbbb8</data>
