      <data key="d6">584</data>
      <data key="d7">104bf0ba8dff4504a1e06ab3fd356910</data>
    </node>
    <node id="NUTRIENTS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Nutrients is an open-access scientific journal dedicated to the study of nutrition and its significant impact on health. It encompasses a wide range of topics, including research on aging populations, dietary management for metabolic disorders, and the effects of nutrition on various health conditions such as diabetes and eating disorders. The journal publishes systematic reviews, clinical studies, and meta-analyses, contributing to the understanding of how nutrients&#8212;essential substances like proteins, vitamins, minerals, sodium, potassium, and fiber&#8212;are crucial for maintaining life, supporting growth, and aiding recovery after surgery.

Nutrients are vital for proper bodily function and play a critical role in nutritional assessments and dietary guidelines. The journal also explores the relationship between nutrition and cognitive function, as well as the implications of dietary components on health risks, such as the association between dietary nitrates, nitrites, and nitrosamines with gastric cancer risk, and the impact of monounsaturated fatty acids on cardiovascular disease. Overall, Nutrients serves as a comprehensive resource for researchers and practitioners interested in the multifaceted role of nutrition in health and disease.</data>
      <data key="d2">0692eb750371d46b9fff71ec305df6ce,27f06efb5e9ac8bbc3f8bd31ee5a2777,28cd3f60e1ccd9129a7d4d386e241a93,2f1fed346bb25032751634adf513337a,3af2658fd59065a71bfee00d2bd27b1b,4198768cfbdf9c226ffba9074adf628f,4c4d1882f0ac14b7c55941ec1c17b650,63593ac5546e44eaddb37a2f257bfa80,6517add809ee588bede013f59f20b0ef,69bfdb98603d3d8c4733cb795f4c82f3,7180911fea4c085adf139e1c4cd43151,abd9a4b801dbdaca1708f0e22331a829,b5db5210dfb726bf3f6d3fae82598596,c3182f51249513a920db6b935632fead,c4f12f866dc714cdbb2323a920f524c2,ccd3c800d2985d4ad5e2c8d6e88b1b68,e155d9b2d1858daab734fd68a45d0c0a,ea8be3e3b3d7195ddc85512be460b6f8,ee3700469e1c419d283b34f38100fa29</data>
