    <node id="HOSPITAL MALNUTRITION">
      <data key="d0" />
      <data key="d1">Hospital malnutrition refers to the state of malnutrition that can occur in patients during hospitalization, particularly in those with conditions such as DOF (Disease of the Organ Function). This condition necessitates a multidisciplinary approach to effectively address the nutritional needs of patients during their hospital stay.</data>
      <data key="d2">28cd3f60e1ccd9129a7d4d386e241a93,67f60ae11335cf41da4f96400b69e67b,bd8df34b86026d71089bcf062570b70f,d80f1e55925e0ce0cd958e35ad2e49ff</data>
