    <node id="DETSKY">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Detsky is a researcher known for his significant contributions to the field of nutritional evaluation, particularly through the development of the Global Subjective Assessment method. This method, which was designed in the 1980s at the Hospital General de Toronto, has become a key tool in assessing nutritional status.</data>
      <data key="d2">2ae5ac5b335a00d15c090777da386817,f7b74dc42fea9d33e4675a41e15975ab</data>
