    <node id="N&#193;USEAS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">N&#193;USEAS refers to a symptom characterized by the sensation of needing to vomit, which can be associated with various medical conditions. This sensation of discomfort can interfere with food intake and negatively impact nutritional status. Nausea is particularly common among patients undergoing chemotherapy, often requiring dietary adjustments and the use of antiemetic medications to manage the condition effectively.</data>
      <data key="d2">2ae5ac5b335a00d15c090777da386817,2bbe847617971cacfe15b2c970de2d21,e12655d89e99e57ce1f6d87563adf674</data>
