    <node id="COMPOSICI&#211;N CORPORAL">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">"COMPOSICI&#211;N CORPORAL" refers to the proportion of fat and muscle in the body, which is crucial for evaluating the health of cancer patients. It encompasses the analysis of various body components, including fat, muscle, and bone mass, and is often assessed during health evaluations. This comprehensive understanding of body composition is essential for monitoring health and making informed medical decisions.</data>
