    <node id="VALORACI&#211;N NUTRICIONAL">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">"VALORACI&#211;N NUTRICIONAL" refers to a comprehensive process aimed at evaluating the nutritional status of individuals, particularly those at risk of malnutrition due to various medical conditions. This assessment is crucial for detecting early signs of malnutrition, especially in patients with oropharyngeal dysphagia, inflammatory bowel disease, liver diseases, and those undergoing treatments such as cancer therapies or hematopoietic cell transplants.

The process involves a variety of measurements and markers, including clinical and anthropometric evaluations, to understand a patient's dietary habits and nutritional needs. It is a dynamic and ongoing procedure that not only identifies the risk of malnutrition but also establishes the necessity for nutritional interventions. The nutritional assessment is essential for guiding dietary and health interventions, ensuring that patients receive appropriate support tailored to their specific conditions.

In particular, the nutritional assessment is integral to protocols for managing dysphagia and is conducted by specialized teams, such as the UNCyD team, to ensure comprehensive care. This systematic approach to evaluating dietary intake and nutritional status is vital for the effective management of patients, especially those in critical conditions or with complex health needs.</data>
      <data key="d2">0bc48d0666e895b990c211acf7cbcf23,1033f1626ca6ac2b3bab298805a17aec,111edb0e21c873322871e35619a1ebf5,17f48ff2bbbb22ecd24983f41739c88b,2ae5ac5b335a00d15c090777da386817,2ebe12524f7750215eee73b328b601ee,3fa37a80a7ecb21c1bdd4838ed9abf2e,4015c8a1a16c5c93f3b853d9cac57bf4,428ea9c156fe3f0571b20d5d81648868,5549895a3a7f54651e6c54f5a5d7d833,55aabc274c460459322072406f17d52c,5c69bb68f0d23a5aa15fa31301aa13c2,806140d9fadd08a1e72238d53c829eb2,a2c6ccdc966e72b4675d71b4c072e1dc,a3444da30e339275da1056c3e13bcae5,a519216aaee7bf8a1317f5d6b522c4b6,a96b8f4fe52b5b963b28242c3352aa7c,a9b588c70518bc2aa91325853898b7c0,af40d7a664dbfc9c14307a26f52b9bff,c69834419bc4c69bcafd7a81ed8535d4,cc6ee3d7bc9bfaf4a06f3f02c4907eb0,dbfd111867924ed831f05d8fff01888b,ea7d8ba0550547d4cff0b5d18c3f6ae5,ecc0b96af9066f424f1c114102063682,f7d56bac9cc29e47690669e812094c99,fcc886f826047ced8783c4abfe3bf4a3</data>
