    <node id="REQUERIMIENTOS NUTRICIONALES">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">REQUERIMIENTOS NUTRICIONALES refers to the specific dietary needs that individuals, particularly patients, must meet to maintain their health and well-being. These nutritional requirements are tailored based on various factors, including the patient's medical conditions, metabolic stress, health status, and activity level. It is essential to assess and customize these requirements for each hospitalized patient to ensure proper care and facilitate recovery. This is especially critical for patients undergoing procedures such as hematopoietic cell transplantation, where precise nutritional support is vital for their health outcomes. Overall, REQUERIMIENTOS NUTRICIONALES encompasses the comprehensive dietary needs necessary for optimal health and recovery in patients.</data>
      <data key="d2">2ae5ac5b335a00d15c090777da386817,3159307e5633698722f72fde1e82702f,43883071d6db17a632d928bc976776fd,476274b4d401aba4307379ed0f5387ac,5c69bb68f0d23a5aa15fa31301aa13c2,8178ba40e7ef08e569845c1f3f1621cc,93ddfb3a9423ac76f9303638f6465d25,c2a8dd9d28d1992a73de2834131b69c9</data>
