    </node>
    <node id="VALORACI&#211;N GLOBAL SUBJETIVA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">The "VALORACI&#211;N GLOBAL SUBJETIVA" is a clinical tool designed for assessing nutritional status through a combination of clinical judgment, patient history, and physical examination. This method has been developed for various populations and serves as an effective means to evaluate a patient's nutritional condition. By integrating both subjective and objective data, the "Valoraci&#243;n Global Subjetiva" provides a comprehensive assessment of an individual's nutritional health.</data>
      <data key="d2">0b6ad83080610bbf1789d7db4c8d40ba,2ae5ac5b335a00d15c090777da386817,bf0cc16dc61df5b90a5a1e961322391a,e12655d89e99e57ce1f6d87563adf674</data>
