    <node id="VALORACI&#211;N SUBJETIVA GLOBAL">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">"VALORACI&#211;N SUBJETIVA GLOBAL" is a comprehensive subjective global assessment tool designed to evaluate the nutritional status of patients, particularly those with serious illnesses. This method relies on clinical judgment to identify malnutrition and categorize patients based on their nutritional needs. It serves as an effective means of assessing a patient's overall nutritional condition, facilitating appropriate interventions and care. The tool is widely recognized for its utility in clinical settings, where understanding a patient's nutritional status is crucial for effective treatment and management.</data>
      <data key="d2">67f60ae11335cf41da4f96400b69e67b,83d00bec042a3fe8b69d68316d8569ff,9ce201472321f20b339146bb6b452f60,a9b588c70518bc2aa91325853898b7c0,af40d7a664dbfc9c14307a26f52b9bff,dad52b0e2f29edbe1c7e7e1fdee1d7cc</data>
