    <node id="PIR&#193;MIDE DE ALIMENTACI&#211;N SALUDABLE">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">The "PIR&#193;MIDE DE ALIMENTACI&#211;N SALUDABLE" is a visual representation of healthy eating guidelines that serves as a tool for planning diets for individuals, including those with dysphagia. This pyramid was adapted by the Spanish Nutrition Society (SENC) in 2015, reflecting contemporary dietary recommendations. It provides a structured approach to healthy eating, emphasizing the importance of balanced nutrition.</data>
