    <node id="LEGUMBRES">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">LEGUMBRES, or legumes, are a diverse group of plant-based foods that include beans, lentils, peas, chickpeas, and soybeans. They are recognized for their significant health benefits, particularly in reducing cholesterol levels and lowering the risk of cardiovascular diseases. Legumbres are an important source of protein and fiber, making them a staple in healthy diets, including the Mediterranean diet. They are often recommended to be consumed 1-2 times a week, preferably in homemade preparations rather than canned versions.

In addition to their nutritional value, legumbres are typically served in pur&#233; form in soft diets, providing essential nutrients while being easy to digest. They are also gluten-free, making them suitable for individuals with gluten sensitivities. Legumbres can be sold by weight or in bulk, and it is important to provide allergen information when selling them.

While legumbres are generally low to moderate in purine levels, they can influence uric acid levels, and it is advised to remove them from the diet prior to certain medical tests to avoid interference with imaging results. Dietary guidelines suggest incorporating legumbres for their health benefits, particularly in relation to heart health and potential anticancer effects. Overall, legumbres are a valuable addition to a balanced diet, contributing to overall nutrition and well-being.</data>
      <data key="d2">08edfb59071449728499ca59eb51ac84,108b158c33fead285203903273758748,1387d49a5eae8a32dd81f2f9991a4821,393fd6c0f1d43f0413a5b82d1dc0c2fc,398be32cb0a16895225a8b29c9d118df,3dd309c324107af87b7988bd0284892e,4d74cee5793710b781c0b83db2f27209,4e6568999eba5abd852eedecc5fc580f,57d928013f61475d356dcec181cc0c6c,61b84039de5ac2d9e25890c3b8f4f87a,633a3a90a82e02d05096b361ddba3ad7,73896da11a9ec209fb3e5b61f19f81df,743649231e27012822c870ff5878263c,8f4f0fffa52482a1b5a520849d10c692,cb892163c42e6e5ec9dede2d66693978,ccac97d61bc412a8574fd71aa26dad79,e9d9dbd1ccc60737441dcf7bfeef638e,ed7bd985e5e4a3d5642e4b401b8e3e17,eff56271e184ab2f11877bfab7f715c4</data>
