    <node id="ALIMENTOS A EVITAR">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">"ALIMENTOS A EVITAR" refers to a section in a manual that provides guidance on foods to avoid for individuals with specific dietary restrictions. This includes foods that are problematic for individuals with oropharyngeal dysphagia, where the section lists examples and offers solutions for each type of food. Additionally, "ALIMENTOS A EVITAR" also encompasses food items that may contain gluten, which should be avoided by individuals with celiac disease. Thus, the term highlights the importance of avoiding certain foods to ensure the health and safety of individuals with these conditions.</data>
