    <node id="AGUA GELIFICADA">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">AGUA GELIFICADA is a gelled water product specifically designed for individuals with dysphagia, a condition that affects swallowing. This product is created using thickeners, making it suitable for the hydration of patients who require modifications to their liquid intake to ensure safe swallowing. AGUA GELIFICADA serves as an important dietary option for those with swallowing difficulties, promoting safety and hydration.</data>
