    <node id="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL, or parenteral nutrition (PN), is a specialized medical treatment that delivers nutritional support intravenously to patients who are unable to receive adequate nutrition through the gastrointestinal tract. This method is essential for individuals who cannot tolerate enteral nutrition due to various conditions, including severe pancreatitis, chronic intestinal failure, post-operative complications, short bowel syndrome, high-output fistulas, and severe malnutrition requiring surgical intervention.

The treatment involves the direct administration of a complex mixture of macro and micronutrients into the bloodstream, bypassing the usual processes of eating and digestion. It is particularly vital for pediatric patients, those undergoing chemotherapy or radiotherapy, and individuals with significant nutritional deficiencies, such as those suffering from quilot&#243;rax and ascitis quilosa. NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL is indicated when enteral feeding is not possible, insufficient, or contraindicated, and is often utilized in critical care settings to stabilize nutritional status and reduce morbidity and mortality.

Parenteral nutrition can be administered through central or peripheral intravenous routes, depending on the patient's condition, and requires careful monitoring to avoid complications such as hyperglycemia and hepatobiliary issues. It is a crucial alternative to enteral nutrition, ensuring that patients who cannot eat or absorb food normally receive the necessary nutrients for recovery and overall health. This method is also used until enteral nutrition can be utilized or when the digestive system is not functional.

In summary, NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL serves as a critical intervention for patients with gastrointestinal dysfunction or those unable to consume food orally, providing essential nutrients directly into the bloodstream to support their health and recovery.</data>
      <data key="d2">00de48c582cca92f1a59df5fceb07bfb,01704aec4089b2f0f24dd0f0841b5ecf,036e8182deab774d39f06cd811738c9b,03b047c49cda5e7bb642efcc9109ccc6,08d8220e35364eb95bacafae7dd2953b,09e9623b3facc5045e80541b1cd2cada,0b6ad83080610bbf1789d7db4c8d40ba,0cdbb308e3359fd3ddbb1d828d12dc04,0dab18980ece5562db9bbd4a3bb9f9ac,0e756c1673317aaf495b90b8bcb02515,103ae80b955f35401aca706444999b29,111edb0e21c873322871e35619a1ebf5,125acd19edb76fa23986de56fc2517e8,12b6478763cfb60ad144be6b81778e03,140611dbb8a68fc40712c946de92b73f,186a95fdfe908123ad6f42d43b52ee1d,1870ba6878c109f3023c9d15d0fa784b,195affa22ecd2f7b1cdce3d72fc1cba4,1adf391b13598f3ffe28ae596ff49438,1f2182c320403c424563ba1a084c00d5,202e4fa915a698c9d9164c3fcc61534e,20491afa9a4770e93e6cff9034f8b0f0,20b676e149e50ddc54c40e2e1577e9ac,21e6d7085f520d8a2f415746dc7eab71,2206bb4d5efe2dcf644ee48468ea112c,222519e556047fafecd61c2964aaaeed,241d358b60724c07a75223b79c9e5f41,27b65be3bda292c9c26dfd7a87e74752,27c75984e62c5adcac1ac33cbdc520dc,2b8c323c265f8f7f3d15bf988bf1f9ee,2b9c137acf3599eaa41c3514aba67a8a,2bd5549759c6a0d8393bb93fdccb747b,2c7998e65812140cbdda2e4d9c972315,2d14f6773b107ec9a872245c32ae0a94,2ebe12524f7750215eee73b328b601ee,30d5c2ac31f39f8177bec50f6b5e631b,3159307e5633698722f72fde1e82702f,36cffc3e7c3a6fe82e50787e939f7537,37ca60bdc28109c9bec995e3c433c801,395385fad73fd5b7ed9eda114b482624,397cb82cce268866351c44a5b38ccb8b,3dfc700a2eaec232c05b0a53f2089229,3ee948dc4ddfdc75daa8fe7db9bb471e,3f3896c039ea7ef78de8bf5fb6e09a48,4015c8a1a16c5c93f3b853d9cac57bf4,417548e99612a123d61f9fd10807ce34,41dee7570059d609c99074f155d4f927,422dbd193843eb5098307e57ba002ced,44346a4b1b9a6d3ae2bc161314ff9efd,445e6aeaae0e8edb3faf2d36be2073ce,45628dcc866de3617e83105d66f901ad,476274b4d401aba4307379ed0f5387ac,488affd4bfc1b1b4b9f5b6a054c97d80,4a65e02e4e364419b836920c093055fe,4a88c4a9d485f88fca1d0f03e2e277a5,4b19145e0977ee48b7132c9915d8c284,4b4f297dec86d7f65e362ad688bbb28f,4b5441741b392c27b7f7c29cc79e13a5,4ce6342fdfe4419826c1ab2f84c56247,4cf0c8d0f4e711be85d16ee71317aa4e