    </node>
    <node id="&#913;-AMILASA SALIVAL">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">&#945;-Amilasa salival is an enzyme that breaks down starches in the saliva, affecting the viscosity of thickened liquids and foods.</data>
      <data key="d2">4aeca0ee5f2663f449cfd017d3e3bbfb</data>
