    <node id="VOLUMEN">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">VOLUMEN refers to the quantity of liquid present in the body, which can influence blood pressure and cardiac function. Additionally, it pertains to the amount of food or liquid administered to patients with dysphagia, a condition that necessitates careful management for safe swallowing. Furthermore, VOLUMEN also denotes the volume of liquid measured in milliliters for various parenteral nutrition products, highlighting its importance in nutritional support and medical care.</data>
      <data key="d2">45628dcc866de3617e83105d66f901ad,884a8370915a18a005fb2fa913e4b95c,da965f79110bd8915deff461d0d91187</data>
