    </node>
    <node id="AGENTES ESPESANTES">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Thickening agents such as modified starch and carrageenan used to achieve desired viscosity in dysphagia products.</data>
      <data key="d2">da965f79110bd8915deff461d0d91187</data>
      <data key="d3">914</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">805</data>
      <data key="d7">7a2896dfd93648a7a144f2058f4e59a4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="SUPLEMENTOS NUTRICIONALES">
      <data key="d0" />
      <data key="d1">"SUPLEMENTOS NUTRICIONALES" refers to a variety of products designed to enhance dietary intake and support nutritional health. These nutritional supplements are specifically formulated to assist individuals in maintaining good nutritional status, particularly in patients with specific health conditions such as nephropathy and cystic fibrosis. They are comprehensive mixtures of nutrients that aim to complement food intake in individuals experiencing nutritional deficiencies.

These products can include vitamins, minerals, and other dietary ingredients, and are often utilized to improve nutrition in vulnerable populations, such as the elderly or those with chronic health issues like EPOC (chronic obstructive pulmonary disease). While some nutritional supplements are marketed with claims of health benefits, including promoting longevity, their effectiveness can sometimes be questioned.

Overall, nutritional supplements serve a crucial role in enhancing dietary intake, supporting health, and ensuring adequate nutrient consumption, especially when conventional diets may not suffice. They are also popular among athletes seeking to improve performance and overall health.</data>
      <data key="d2">058edb7500a486cc3196de4ca335b375,2ab0f03a87bdf418c83a614b2183332f,5f15452403a4c9b4b3c7a48bac634a04,62afbb83c3f69bd45bf24467ac5b47b8,a96b8f4fe52b5b963b28242c3352aa7c,c926a8237fba5d5bc497ac2165bbb039,cbadd445efd24c3f7ab682a373e416cf,d667e6abc204bbfa6aba210705db6d56,da965f79110bd8915deff461d0d91187,e321db63d9b561eb98a4f01853b141ad</data>
