    </node>
    <node id="QUESO">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">QUESO, or cheese, is a versatile dairy product that can be molded and is suitable for individuals with dysphagia when prepared correctly. It is recognized for its nutritional benefits, providing calcium and contributing to dietary recommendations. As a dairy product, queso must adhere to labeling regulations, which include information about ingredients and allergens. Nutritionally, queso contains 2.2 mg of iron per 100 grams, and its lactose content can vary depending on the type of cheese and the processing method used.</data>
      <data key="d2">6ff2742793c37a38db1c11c14d2a6629,8255943be503f6709a8e63d7d33b79d1,ae2bf939fd143e4d8d998722ad86ba66,c30b47b534824f4d1b74f3c0bb00ffd9,e742c891694171ad455b038f416b7728</data>
      <data key="d3">523</data>
      <data key="d4">1</data>
      <data key="d5">4</data>
      <data key="d6">811</data>
      <data key="d7">12e8f6f11ec24ef3b291b03183f44b1f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="DIETA TRITURADA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">DIETA TRITURADA is a specialized diet consisting of pureed foods that are soft and homogeneous, specifically designed for individuals with severe swallowing difficulties, known as dysphagia. This diet is intended for patients who have difficulty chewing or swallowing solid foods and includes a variety of food groups that can be pureed or blended. The primary goal of DIETA TRITURADA is to facilitate easier swallowing, ensuring that individuals with these challenges can consume a nutritious and safe diet.</data>
      <data key="d2">1130db2843c569042990b711cf15d8ee,bd22bf95ac5fc6dc95539efb99c5b11a,c30b47b534824f4d1b74f3c0bb00ffd9</data>
      <data key="d3">1080</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">3</data>
      <data key="d6">812</data>
      <data key="d7">a565f479770342c393f51215dd3a6093</data>
    </node>
    <node id="DIETA MANIPULADA MEC&#193;NICAMENTE">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">A mechanically altered diet consisting of soft and homogeneous purees, suitable for individuals with swallowing difficulties.</data>
      <data key="d2">c30b47b534824f4d1b74f3c0bb00ffd9</data>
      <data key="d5">0</data>
      <data key="d6">813</data>
      <data key="d7">ddd2e3606d8e44dfa16ec1e633c8f0ac</data>
    </node>
    <node id="DIETA SUAVE Y DE F&#193;CIL MASTICACI&#211;N">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">A soft diet that requires gentle chewing, designed for individuals transitioning to a normal diet with mild swallowing difficulties.</data>
      <data key="d2">c30b47b534824f4d1b74f3c0bb00ffd9</data>
      <data key="d5">0</data>
      <data key="d6">814</data>
      <data key="d7">f157e15969944119afb20f999ccec79c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="INTERNATIONAL DYSPHAGIA DIET STANDARDIZATION INITIATIVE">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The International Dysphagia Diet Standardization Initiative (IDDSI) is an organization dedicated to establishing a framework for the standardization of diets tailored for individuals with dysphagia. The initiative emphasizes the development of standardized descriptors that clearly define various dysphagia diets, ensuring consistency and clarity in dietary recommendations for those affected by swallowing difficulties.</data>
      <data key="d2">694f957b0b008ab3339e5bf1fd57b81a,905bf2bbef1716cece7bd2f1f62c204e</data>
      <data key="d3">85</data>
