    <node id="JOURNAL OF THE ACADEMY OF NUTRITION AND DIETETICS">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The Journal of the Academy of Nutrition and Dietetics is a publication dedicated to disseminating research articles and studies pertinent to the fields of nutrition and dietetics. It covers a wide range of topics, including specialized areas such as dysphagia. The journal serves as a platform for both research and reviews, contributing to the advancement of knowledge and practice in nutrition and dietetics.</data>
      <data key="d2">694f957b0b008ab3339e5bf1fd57b81a,c3182f51249513a920db6b935632fead</data>
