      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">"Critical Reviews in Food Science and Nutrition" is a journal dedicated to publishing critical reviews on a wide range of topics within the fields of food science and nutrition. This includes specialized subjects such as dysphagia, highlighting the journal's commitment to addressing diverse and significant issues in these areas. The journal serves as a platform for comprehensive analyses and discussions, contributing valuable insights to the scientific community.</data>
