    <node id="HOSPITAL CATERERS">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Hospital Caterers is an organization dedicated to providing guidelines and resources for food services in hospitals. It focuses on ensuring that dietary adaptations are made for patients with specific needs, including those with dysphagia. The organization plays a crucial role in supporting hospitals to meet the diverse dietary requirements of their patients, thereby enhancing the quality of care and nutrition provided in healthcare settings.</data>
      <data key="d2">90aa696a6e48637e06acfcd7213699da</data>
