      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">CALIDAD ORGANOL&#201;PTICA refers to the sensory quality attributes of food, which encompass taste, smell, appearance, and texture. These attributes are crucial for patient meals, as they significantly influence patient satisfaction in hospitals. Ensuring high calidad organol&#233;ptica in food served to patients is essential for enhancing their overall dining experience and well-being.</data>
