    <node id="C&#193;MARAS DE REFRIGERACI&#211;N">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">C&#225;maras de Refrigeraci&#243;n are refrigeration chambers used to store food at controlled temperatures to maintain safety and quality.</data>
      <data key="d2">3baf860995ab719c63b8b226f6c7b3c1</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">858</data>
      <data key="d7">49105f758cf545599b2a66385f99e9a9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="HORNOS">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Hornos are ovens specifically designed for regenerating food, ensuring that it reaches the necessary temperature for safe consumption. Additionally, they are utilized for cooking various dishes as outlined in the accompanying manual.</data>
      <data key="d2">3baf860995ab719c63b8b226f6c7b3c1,569c8eafa9f82b2becef8d37416316a8</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">859</data>
      <data key="d7">cb549a73d04946f4935bdf4ade2ec9cc</data>
    </node>
    <node id="PROCEDIMIENTO EXHAUSTIVO">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Procedimiento Exhaustivo refers to the detailed procedures that must be followed in food preparation to ensure safety and quality.</data>
      <data key="d2">3baf860995ab719c63b8b226f6c7b3c1</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">860</data>
      <data key="d7">33f8b68ea2f64644826a13e027b9f5b3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="PRODUCCI&#211;N DE ALIMENTOS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Producci&#243;n de Alimentos encompasses the entire process of food production, from preparation to distribution.</data>
      <data key="d2">3baf860995ab719c63b8b226f6c7b3c1</data>
      <data key="d5">5</data>
      <data key="d6">861</data>
      <data key="d7">39bd013f79454988aac8c4ed7761089b</data>
    </node>
