    <node id="MOLUSCOS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">MOLUSCOS, commonly known as mollusks, represent a diverse group of invertebrates that are frequently utilized in culinary dishes. These organisms are not only valued for their culinary applications but also recognized as significant allergens in food safety protocols. As such, products containing mollusks must be carefully labeled to inform consumers of potential allergenic risks.</data>
