      <data key="d1">C&#211;DIGO DE DIETAS is a comprehensive document that records all available diets in a hospital, specifically designed to meet the dietary needs of patients. It serves as a systematic framework that categorizes these diets, ensuring proper dietary planning and management. The Diet Code outlines the standards and guidelines necessary for effective dietary management within the hospital setting, facilitating the provision of appropriate nutrition to patients.</data>
