    <node id="COSTUMBRES GASTRON&#211;MICAS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">COSTUMBRES GASTRON&#211;MICAS refers to the culinary customs and traditions of a region that play a significant role in shaping dietary preferences and acceptance among individuals, particularly in the context of hospitalized patients. When planning diets for these patients, it is essential to consider these culinary customs to ensure that the meals are not only nutritionally adequate but also culturally appropriate, thereby promoting acceptance and compliance with dietary recommendations.</data>
      <data key="d2">058edb7500a486cc3196de4ca335b375,93ddfb3a9423ac76f9303638f6465d25</data>
