    <node id="FICHAS T&#201;CNICAS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">FICHAS T&#201;CNICAS refers to technical sheets that provide detailed information about the composition, preparation, and nutritional value of dishes served in the hospital. These sheets serve as a comprehensive resource for understanding the ingredients and nutritional content of the meals offered, ensuring that dietary needs and health standards are met.</data>
      <data key="d2">058edb7500a486cc3196de4ca335b375,80220ae2bbcfeda884776e0ed9103390</data>
