    <node id="DIETA BASAL">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">The Basal Diet, known as "DIETA BASAL," is the most requested diet in hospitals, specifically designed to meet the general nutritional needs of patients. It serves as the basic hospital menu and is intended for patients who do not require any special modifications to their diet. This diet ensures that patients receive essential nutrients while maintaining a standard dietary framework suitable for a wide range of individuals in a hospital setting.</data>
      <data key="d2">31f8f2c83d12928b56228d8b3f9d081c,80220ae2bbcfeda884776e0ed9103390</data>
      <data key="d3">1151</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
