      <data key="d7">4248306492a44a9ebfc171e472611f99</data>
    </node>
    <node id="DIETAS TERAP&#201;UTICAS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">"DIETAS TERAP&#201;UTICAS" refers to specialized diets that are specifically designed to meet the energy and nutrient requirements of hospitalized patients. These therapeutic diets are derived from a basal diet and are tailored to address the unique nutritional needs of individual patients, ensuring that they receive the appropriate nutrients necessary for their recovery and overall health.</data>
      <data key="d2">4e7560a799f319bdc8ae25737acc4d05,80220ae2bbcfeda884776e0ed9103390</data>
