    <node id="DIETA DE F&#193;CIL DEGLUCI&#211;N">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">The "DIETA DE F&#193;CIL DEGLUCI&#211;N" is a transitional diet specifically designed for patients suffering from oropharyngeal dysphagia. This diet incorporates modified texture foods that facilitate easier swallowing, making it suitable for individuals who have difficulty with traditional food textures. The primary goal of the diet is to aid patients in swallowing by providing easy-to-swallow options that meet their dietary needs.</data>
      <data key="d2">929b14ae2554caeaab2a010ad94222eb,a9b588c70518bc2aa91325853898b7c0</data>
