    <node id="FIGURA 4">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">FIGURA 4 encompasses a variety of illustrations that serve different purposes. One illustration features a whisk, highlighting it as a fundamental piece of kitchen equipment essential for preparing recipes. Another depiction focuses on the effects of ionic strength on protein solubility, particularly in the context of clinical nutrition, showcasing its relevance in scientific discussions. Additionally, FIGURA 4 illustrates a semi-reclined position of a patient in bed, demonstrating the assistance provided by a caregiver during feeding. Collectively, these illustrations reflect the diverse applications and contexts in which FIGURA 4 is utilized, ranging from culinary tools to clinical and caregiving scenarios.</data>
      <data key="d2">7c842769e1890739769789ed10a08005,dad5cb424b9586e4e672ed57db1f4fd6,dc38a37c30b175667931b84a9c9103bb</data>
