    <node id="FIGURA 5">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">FIGURA 5 encompasses a variety of illustrations and representations related to clinical nutrition and food preparation. It includes an illustration of a chinois or food mill, which is utilized for food preparation in various recipes. Additionally, FIGURA 5 depicts the variation of protein solubility as a function of pH in clinical nutrition products, providing insights into the biochemical aspects of nutrition. Furthermore, it illustrates a strategy for diagnosing malnutrition, detailing the essential steps involved in nutritional risk screening and assessment. Lastly, FIGURA 5 presents a specially designed cup intended for patients with swallowing difficulties, which aims to enhance safety during hydration. Overall, FIGURA 5 serves as a comprehensive resource that integrates food preparation tools, nutritional science, and patient care strategies.</data>
      <data key="d2">7c842769e1890739769789ed10a08005,ba214f6f228224af19c5ca2dcc9c6772,dad5cb424b9586e4e672ed57db1f4fd6,dc38a37c30b175667931b84a9c9103bb</data>
