    <node id="FIGURA 6">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">FIGURA 6 is a multifaceted illustration that serves several important purposes. It features a blender, which is essential for achieving the desired food texture, highlighting its role in food preparation. Additionally, FIGURA 6 demonstrates the correct body position for safety while feeding, a crucial aspect in preventing choking incidents. Furthermore, the illustration outlines the various organizations involved in the fight against malnutrition in Spain, showcasing the collaborative efforts aimed at addressing this significant issue.</data>
