    <node id="FIGURA 8">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">FIGURA 8 is a multifaceted entity that encompasses both culinary and scientific aspects. It features an illustration that showcases vegetables cooked to an al dente texture, which serves as a demonstration of the proper cooking technique for dysphagia diets, ensuring that individuals with swallowing difficulties can enjoy nutritious meals safely. Additionally, FIGURA 8 includes the World Health Organization's equations for estimating energy expenditure, providing a scientific framework for understanding energy needs. This combination of culinary guidance and health-related equations highlights FIGURA 8's role in promoting both dietary health and nutritional awareness.</data>
