    <node id="FIGURA 9">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">FIGURA 9 is an illustration that serves a dual purpose. Firstly, it depicts vegetables cooked to a normal texture, which is indicative of the cooking process for meals designed to be friendly for individuals with dysphagia, a condition that affects swallowing. Secondly, FIGURA 9 illustrates the classic pattern of weight loss associated with low-carbohydrate diets compared to low-fat diets. This multifaceted illustration effectively communicates important dietary information relevant to both meal preparation for those with swallowing difficulties and the comparative effects of different dietary approaches on weight management.</data>
      <data key="d2">89b0bde0358432506a0e03d4691dd2ab,dad5cb424b9586e4e672ed57db1f4fd6</data>
