    <node id="FIGURA 13">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">FIGURA 13 is an illustration that serves a dual purpose. It depicts a person opening their mouth with their hand, which is used to demonstrate a specific exercise aimed at improving oral motor skills. Additionally, the illustration features food with a p&#226;t&#233;-like texture, which is particularly suitable for patients experiencing swallowing difficulties. This combination of visual elements highlights both the exercise for enhancing swallowing function and the type of food that can aid individuals with such challenges.</data>
      <data key="d2">60f20082b58784c6b2a2ff01d0e29e85,dad5cb424b9586e4e672ed57db1f4fd6</data>
