    <node id="FIGURA 14">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">FIGURA 14 is a composite illustration that includes two distinct yet related depictions. The first part of the illustration features a person with their mouth open, while a hand holds a tongue depressor. This image is intended to demonstrate a technique for stimulating the soft palate, which is relevant in the context of swallowing and speech therapy. The second part of FIGURA 14 showcases a food processor, emphasizing its utility as a kitchen device for preparing meals that are friendly for individuals with dysphagia, a condition that affects swallowing. Together, these illustrations provide valuable insights into both the clinical and practical aspects of managing dysphagia.</data>
      <data key="d2">60f20082b58784c6b2a2ff01d0e29e85,dad5cb424b9586e4e672ed57db1f4fd6</data>
