    <node id="FIGURA 15">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">FIGURA 15 is an illustration that features two distinct activities. The first part of the illustration showcases a hand blender set, highlighting it as an essential tool for food preparation. The second part depicts a person inflating a balloon using their mouth, which serves as a demonstration of an exercise aimed at improving muscle tone and mobility of the soft palate. Together, these elements illustrate both culinary and physical activities, emphasizing the importance of tools in food preparation and exercises for enhancing oral muscle function.</data>
      <data key="d2">60f20082b58784c6b2a2ff01d0e29e85,dad5cb424b9586e4e672ed57db1f4fd6</data>
