    <node id="HOSPITALARIA">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">HOSPITALARIA refers to the context of hospital settings where specific recipes and guidelines for managing dysphagia, a condition that affects swallowing, are applied. Additionally, it encompasses a medical event that took place over a period of three days, focusing on preoperative nutrition. This event highlights the importance of nutritional management in hospital care, particularly in relation to patients who may have difficulties with swallowing.</data>
      <data key="d2">7184072817ac284bebfea449e3eaac8b,dad5cb424b9586e4e672ed57db1f4fd6</data>
