    <node id="UNIVERSIDAD COMPLUTENSE">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The Universidad Complutense is a public university located in Madrid, Spain, recognized for its research and educational programs across a wide range of disciplines, including medicine. It is notable for its academic contributions and has a diverse faculty, including Pilar Mat&#237;a Mart&#237;n, who serves as an associate professor at the institution.</data>
