    </node>
    <node id="EJERCICIOS DE SHAKER">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">A specific set of exercises designed to strengthen the suprahyoid muscles and improve swallowing function, particularly in patients with dysphagia.</data>
