    <node id="EJERCICIOS DE POTENCIACI&#211;N DE LA LENGUA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">"EJERCICIOS DE POTENCIACI&#211;N DE LA LENGUA" refers to a series of exercises specifically designed to improve the strength and mobility of the tongue. These exercises are essential for effective swallowing and overall oral function. One of the methods employed in these exercises involves the use of the Iowa Oral Performance Instrument (IOPI), a device that measures the pressure exerted by the tongue against the palate, thereby facilitating targeted training to enhance tongue strength.</data>
      <data key="d2">0d5d152382113aa1b8faab4e554c88cd,2bd5c03d0aa542ef4a7b0380e30e84c3</data>
