      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">VitalStim&#174; is a device approved by the FDA for neuromuscular electrical stimulation to treat dysphagia, particularly effective in patients with swallowing difficulties.</data>
      <data key="d2">3109714174ef86262626929d5a436f11</data>
