    <node id="J AM GERIATR SOC">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The Journal of the American Geriatrics Society (J AM GERIATR SOC) is a prominent publication that focuses on research related to aging and health issues affecting older adults. It publishes a variety of studies, including those examining the relationship between testosterone levels and frailty in older men, as well as research on dysphagia, a condition that affects swallowing. Through its diverse range of articles, the journal aims to advance the understanding of geriatric health and improve the quality of care for the aging population.</data>
      <data key="d2">1d3c30089c42a02917c7625774aa29f2,3be9d646c354d76527755d79a77c916b</data>
      <data key="d3">1225</data>
