    <node id="LIU J">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Liu J is a prominent researcher and author who has made significant contributions to the field of medical research. Liu J co-authored a study published in the International Journal of Surgery, which examined the effect of early oral feeding on the short-term outcomes of patients undergoing laparoscopic distal gastrectomy. In addition to this work, Liu J has focused on dysphagia treatments, contributing valuable insights into this area of study. Furthermore, Liu J conducted a meta-analysis investigating the relationship between fruit and vegetable intake and esophageal squamous cell carcinoma, as well as studying the impact of fruit and vegetable consumption on lung cancer. Through these diverse research efforts, Liu J has demonstrated a commitment to advancing knowledge in oncology and surgical outcomes.</data>
      <data key="d2">1d3c30089c42a02917c7625774aa29f2,581527a14dedf97c7a839eff5c40cbc2,c3c8c4edabc77ed1f0a834676de2939c</data>
