    <node id="UFDOF">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The Functional Unit of Oropharyngeal Dysphagia (UFDOF), also known as Unidad Funcional de Disfagia Orofar&#237;ngea, is a specialized unit located within HUPA (Hospital Universitario Pr&#237;ncipe de Asturias) in the Community of Madrid. This unit is dedicated to the evaluation, diagnosis, and treatment of patients suffering from oropharyngeal dysphagia, a condition that affects swallowing. In addition to providing direct patient care, UFDOF is committed to training healthcare professionals to enhance the quality of care for individuals with dysphagia. Through its focused approach, UFDOF aims to improve the management of swallowing disorders and ensure comprehensive support for affected patients.</data>
      <data key="d2">1955c09ee453969c7603ae8206c088f8,1fad843d053b1ec4805a4e7c6be9ceb3,a9b588c70518bc2aa91325853898b7c0,d52a789e548d621109d06f6333c5746c,d8fa59c6af96b4ebb96f2c6b4ddb5473,eb2f276d3dc4e4a9e53923d9d80fec1a,f0c6cfeca2bb2f42209798eccceb4ac5</data>
