    <node id="LOGOPEDIA">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Logopedia refers to the field of speech therapy that encompasses services aimed at the treatment of dysphagia, a condition that affects an individual's ability to swallow. It plays a crucial role in the rehabilitation of patients suffering from this disorder, providing essential support and therapeutic interventions to improve their swallowing capabilities and overall communication skills.</data>
      <data key="d2">d3fe4efde8231eb48c021e46ca13e219,dfc3b0905ab9fc1fca9fc64473ebed80</data>
