    <node id="TERAPIA OCUPACIONAL">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Terapia Ocupacional (Occupational Therapy) is a discipline that plays a significant role in the rehabilitation of patients with dysphagia. The Terapia Ocupacional service specifically focuses on assisting these patients in their recovery process, utilizing various therapeutic techniques to improve their swallowing abilities and overall quality of life.</data>
      <data key="d2">1fad843d053b1ec4805a4e7c6be9ceb3,dfc3b0905ab9fc1fca9fc64473ebed80</data>
