    <node id="EQUIPO MULTIDISCIPLINAR">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">The "EQUIPO MULTIDISCIPLINAR" is a multidisciplinary team composed of various healthcare professionals, including a psychiatrist, psychologist, endocrinologist, diabetes educator, dietitian/nutritionist, and social worker. This team collaborates to manage treatment priorities for patients with diabetes and eating disorders, ensuring comprehensive care tailored to individual needs. Additionally, the team includes professionals from different specialties who work together to provide care for patients with dysphagia and those requiring home parenteral nutrition. Furthermore, the team is involved in designing appropriate diets for patients in the context of renal insufficiency, highlighting their commitment to addressing diverse health challenges through a collaborative approach.</data>
      <data key="d2">0dab18980ece5562db9bbd4a3bb9f9ac,48f1fe343d54cd0f353be34b736a352c,c00d7a0a842e45f78f71c27adecde3f9,dfc3b0905ab9fc1fca9fc64473ebed80,e321db63d9b561eb98a4f01853b141ad,ed9e6da7ef23d47467822d2a1e461195</data>
