    <node id="NEUROLOG&#205;A">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The entity "NEUROLOG&#205;A" refers to a specialized unit within a hospital dedicated to the diagnosis and treatment of disorders related to the nervous system. This department plays a crucial role in addressing various neurological conditions, including those that may lead to complications such as dysphagia, which is difficulty in swallowing. Through its comprehensive approach, the Neurology department aims to manage and treat the underlying causes of these disorders effectively.</data>
