    <node id="MEDICINA INTERNA">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The "MEDICINA INTERNA" refers to the Internal Medicine department, which is a medical specialty focused on the diagnosis, treatment, and prevention of diseases in adults. This specialty encompasses a wide range of conditions affecting multiple systems of the body. The department is particularly noted for its role in managing patients with dysphagia, ensuring coordinated care for these individuals. Additionally, the Internal Medicine department emphasizes dietary considerations as part of its comprehensive care approach for adult patients. Overall, "MEDICINA INTERNA" plays a crucial role in providing thorough medical attention and support for various adult health issues.</data>
      <data key="d2">98f9ca00cf50b7e359aa41f1d58d0735,9df63e54761edd6ad6c4ad6fb83ae123,a3fd9c0d942a044ac2490f16d4ecc520,b6336e61e2a290a5c471fd72297d6093,cba5d81f1acff7cbf84e85ef35420521</data>
