    <node id="ENDOCRINOLOG&#205;A Y NUTRICI&#211;N">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">"ENDOCRINOLOG&#205;A Y NUTRICI&#211;N" is a specialized field of medicine that focuses on hormonal and nutritional health. It encompasses both clinical practice and research, as evidenced by the existence of a scientific journal dedicated to this discipline. The journal, also named "Endocrinolog&#237;a y Nutrici&#243;n," serves as a platform for disseminating research findings related to endocrinology and nutrition. 

In clinical settings, the Endocrinology and Nutrition department plays a crucial role in patient care, particularly for individuals with diabetes and those requiring nutritional support, such as dysphagia patients. This department is where patients are referred for evaluation after experiencing significant weight loss, highlighting its importance in managing various health concerns related to nutrition and hormonal balance.

Mart&#237;n L&#243;pez de la Torre Casares is noted for his specialization in this field, contributing to both the clinical and editorial aspects of endocrinology and nutrition. As an associate editor of the journal, he is involved in advancing knowledge and research in this vital area of healthcare.</data>
      <data key="d2">0ec21b45b9a154289761f46105b364f2,319591d16b552cff77a5cd56e69c1ca2,60d24674009cc67523f1ecdc63975fdc,920badd1fd76f2c279282a4a20295a55,a3fd9c0d942a044ac2490f16d4ecc520,c3182f51249513a920db6b935632fead,cba5d81f1acff7cbf84e85ef35420521</data>
      <data key="d3">559</data>
      <data key="d4">1</data>
      <data key="d5">8</data>
      <data key="d6">1157</data>
      <data key="d7">cb24d0f8f7a84b9cbb7a2c8610f82ccf</data>
    </node>
    <node id="LOGOPEDAS">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Logopedas are professionals who specialize in the evaluation and treatment of swallowing disorders, particularly in patients with dysphagia. They play a crucial role in assessing deglutition and the risk of aspiration in individuals receiving enteral nutrition. In both the United States and Europe, logopedas are primarily responsible for the care of patients with dysphagia, ensuring that these individuals receive appropriate interventions to manage their swallowing difficulties effectively.</data>
      <data key="d2">06484c3fe8af6e4c44bbfc3ac2fa2590,13c6297da17b9be4a67cf439f62cd289,a3fd9c0d942a044ac2490f16d4ecc520</data>
      <data key="d3">931</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">4</data>
      <data key="d6">1158</data>
      <data key="d7">737cb84080674df88dccfc2753ea8bf9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="UNCYD">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The Unidad de Nutrici&#243;n Cl&#237;nica y Diet&#233;tica (UNCyD) is a clinical nutrition unit dedicated to conducting nutritional assessments and screenings, particularly for patients over the age of 65. It operates within a team-oriented framework, offering nutritional support tailored to individuals with special needs. UNCyD focuses on the management of clinical nutrition and dietary practices to enhance patient care and well-being.</data>
      <data key="d2">2f91f92c99da813a8d1be2f6ac0fa552,7469cc60475806b519e91abe2796aead,76c4ef07f382585bf943bfaf57372c86,a3fd9c0d942a044ac2490f16d4ecc520,ea7d8ba0550547d4cff0b5d18c3f6ae5</data>
      <data key="d3">931</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">9</data>
      <data key="d6">1159</data>
      <data key="d7">e266044bd3344b3589727f8ae31723ce</data>
    </node>
    <node id="COMUNIDAD DE MADRID">
      <data key="d0">GEO</data>
      <data key="d1">The Community of Madrid is an autonomous community in Spain that serves as a significant healthcare hub. It is home to the Hospital Universitario Pr&#237;ncipe de Asturias (HUPA), which acts as a reference center for the treatment of patients suffering from oropharyngeal dysphagia. Additionally, the region is notable for its specific measurement and reporting of congenital hypothyroidism incidence, highlighting its commitment to monitoring and addressing health issues within the population. Overall, the Community of Madrid plays a crucial role in providing specialized medical services and healthcare resources to its residents.</data>
      <data key="d2">06484c3fe8af6e4c44bbfc3ac2fa2590,8ddb42b0859e58bd2f937125505ed9d5,a9b588c70518bc2aa91325853898b7c0,d8fa59c6af96b4ebb96f2c6b4ddb5473</data>
