    <node id="HUPA">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">HUPA is a healthcare center dedicated to the eradication of dysphagia and malnutrition, with a strong commitment to enhancing patient care through multidisciplinary approaches. Located in the Community of Madrid, HUPA oversees the Functional Unit of Orofar&#237;ngea Dysphagia, offering specialized care for patients suffering from oropharyngeal dysphagia. The institution emphasizes comprehensive and quality treatment, ensuring that patients receive thorough evaluation and management of their swallowing disorders. In addition to its focus on dysphagia, HUPA provides a range of medical services aimed at improving overall patient health and well-being.</data>
      <data key="d2">a9b588c70518bc2aa91325853898b7c0,d52a789e548d621109d06f6333c5746c,d8fa59c6af96b4ebb96f2c6b4ddb5473,eb2f276d3dc4e4a9e53923d9d80fec1a,f0c6cfeca2bb2f42209798eccceb4ac5</data>
