    <node id="CALIDAD ASISTENCIAL">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Calidad asistencial refers to the quality of care provided to patients, encompassing various dimensions such as accessibility, equity, and effectiveness. It is particularly relevant in the context of managing specific conditions, such as dysphagia. Additionally, calidad asistencial represents the standard of care that the UFDOF aims to provide to its patients, ensuring that all aspects of patient care meet high-quality benchmarks.</data>
      <data key="d2">03b047c49cda5e7bb642efcc9109ccc6,905bf2bbef1716cece7bd2f1f62c204e,d52a789e548d621109d06f6333c5746c</data>
