    </node>
    <node id="INVESTIGACI&#211;N">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Investigaci&#243;n refers to the research efforts that the UFDOF is committed to in order to improve dysphagia treatment. Additionally, it encompasses the study of artificial home nutrition, which is necessary to determine its impact on quality of life and the early detection of mood disorders. This comprehensive approach highlights the importance of research in both enhancing treatment methods and understanding the broader implications of nutritional interventions on health and well-being.</data>
      <data key="d2">123ef22fb42b6ade4fa2dda096df8490,d52a789e548d621109d06f6333c5746c</data>
      <data key="d3">1924</data>
