    <node id="REHABILITATION">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Rehabilitation refers to the process of restoring health and functional ability in patients with chronic diseases through various therapeutic interventions, including nutritional support. The Rehabilitation service at HUPA specifically focuses on the recovery and rehabilitation of patients, including those who experience dysphagia, ensuring a comprehensive approach to patient care and recovery.</data>
      <data key="d2">f0c6cfeca2bb2f42209798eccceb4ac5,fea8c7e37cd76ac988e0b242cb84fe6f</data>
