    <node id="SERVICIO DE ORL">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The Servicio de ORL (Otorhinolaryngology Service) at HUPA is dedicated to the diagnosis and treatment of conditions affecting the ear, nose, and throat. This includes a focus on swallowing disorders, specifically dysphagia. The service provides specialized care and assessments for patients with these conditions and collaborates with the Unidad Funcional de Disfagia Orofar&#237;ngea to enhance patient outcomes. Through its comprehensive approach, the Servicio de ORL ensures that patients receive targeted and effective treatment for their otorhinolaryngological needs.</data>
      <data key="d2">1fad843d053b1ec4805a4e7c6be9ceb3,eb2f276d3dc4e4a9e53923d9d80fec1a,fcc886f826047ced8783c4abfe3bf4a3</data>
