    </node>
    <node id="SERVICIO DE COCINA HOSPITALARIA">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The Servicio de Cocina Hospitalaria at HUPA is dedicated to preparing and providing meals that are specifically tailored to meet the dietary needs of patients. This includes accommodating individuals undergoing swallowing assessments and ensuring that all meals align with the individualized diets prescribed by the UNCyD team. The service focuses on delivering nutrition that supports the health and recovery of patients, taking into account their unique nutritional requirements.</data>
      <data key="d2">eb2f276d3dc4e4a9e53923d9d80fec1a,fcc886f826047ced8783c4abfe3bf4a3</data>
      <data key="d3">932</data>
