    <node id="NAVARRA">
      <data key="d0" />
      <data key="d1">Navarra is an autonomous community in Spain known for its distinct characteristics and health statistics. It is notable for having one of the lowest mortality rates for Chronic Obstructive Pulmonary Disease (COPD) among women, indicating a relatively favorable health outcome in this demographic. Additionally, in Navarra, patients are required to submit a justification report to continue receiving treatment for their nutritional needs, reflecting the region's structured approach to healthcare management and patient support.</data>
      <data key="d2">298e79737894aa157da136b1996578bf,6dd2bf3e3132697b855c16e624c56ed0,eb2f276d3dc4e4a9e53923d9d80fec1a</data>
