    <node id="EVALUACI&#211;N NUTRICIONAL">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">EVALUACI&#211;N NUTRICIONAL refers to the process of determining an individual's nutritional status through various measurements and analyses. This comprehensive evaluation is crucial for identifying dietary needs and nutritional support requirements, particularly for patients. It involves assessing a patient's dietary intake and overall nutritional status to ensure appropriate care is provided. This process is especially significant for individuals diagnosed with gastrointestinal cancers, as their nutritional needs may be more complex and require tailored interventions.</data>
      <data key="d2">639ebafae8a95bb03a09e111172b9a4e,7469cc60475806b519e91abe2796aead,a9b588c70518bc2aa91325853898b7c0,c69834419bc4c69bcafd7a81ed8535d4</data>
