    <node id="TOXINA BOTUL&#205;NICA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Botulinum toxin, commonly known as "TOXINA BOTUL&#205;NICA," is utilized in specific medical applications to address various health issues. It is employed in the treatment of bowel function disorders, helping to manage conditions that affect gastrointestinal motility. Additionally, botulinum toxin is used in targeted therapies for oropharyngeal dysphagia, a condition that impairs swallowing function, thereby improving the ability to swallow in affected individuals.</data>
      <data key="d2">a9b588c70518bc2aa91325853898b7c0,beef8f83c872431c6e371987b717e43b</data>
