    <node id="HISTORIA CL&#205;NICA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">HISTORIA CL&#205;NICA refers to the comprehensive medical history of a patient, which is essential for assessing and treating various health conditions, including dysphagia and diarrhea. It encompasses a detailed record of the patient's medical background, including dietary history and other relevant health information. The historia cl&#237;nica serves as a crucial document that not only tracks all follow-ups and treatments but also records the patient's health history and their responses to treatments. This medical record is fundamental for nutritional assessment and plays a vital role in guiding healthcare decisions related to the patient's treatment.</data>
