    <node id="SUPLEMENTOS ORALES">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">"SUPLEMENTOS ORALES" refers to oral nutritional supplements that are specifically designed to provide additional energy and protein to patients with particular dietary needs. These products are prescribed for individuals who are unable to achieve their nutritional goals through a traditional diet, including those who may have swallowing difficulties or are experiencing significant weight loss. 

Oral supplements are particularly relevant in the context of nutrition for frail elderly individuals and are indicated for patients with conditions such as diabetes, where regular food intake may not suffice to meet their energy and nutrient requirements. They are characterized by their high caloric content and are intended for patients with normal gastrointestinal function, ensuring that they can effectively enhance dietary intake. Overall, oral supplements serve as a vital tool in addressing nutritional deficiencies and supporting the health of patients with specific dietary challenges.</data>
      <data key="d2">20491afa9a4770e93e6cff9034f8b0f0,2ad1c3591301bd2ea6f99c3782714d69,395385fad73fd5b7ed9eda114b482624,40dcfaa6144c6424068ba46fdf288dd2,7e1b90e2c8714b39e283be229f6d5de3,a9b588c70518bc2aa91325853898b7c0,cba5d81f1acff7cbf84e85ef35420521,d3dab2869ed103bbf74ecb1a4a822567,e510500bd5a5f16a0bf0353cfdb79c13,e55003dbf85cc1fb81cac90716ce0e87</data>
