    <node id="GASTROSTOM&#205;A">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Gastrostom&#237;a is a surgical procedure that involves creating an opening in the stomach to facilitate nutritional support through a feeding tube. This procedure is often employed when oral intake is not possible, particularly in patients with severe swallowing difficulties, esophageal obstruction, or other conditions that necessitate long-term nutritional support. It is commonly used in various clinical scenarios, including for patients with chronic conditions, those requiring prolonged feeding, and even in premature newborns.

The gastrostomy procedure typically involves placing a tube through the abdominal wall directly into the stomach, allowing for enteral feeding. This method ensures that patients receive adequate nutrition when they cannot eat by mouth, making it a critical intervention in managing nutritional needs. The procedure may be part of a broader treatment plan for individuals with severe dysphagia or low weight, as it provides a reliable means of nutritional intake.

In summary, gastrostom&#237;a is a vital surgical intervention designed to support patients who require enteral nutrition, ensuring they receive the necessary sustenance for their health and well-being.</data>
      <data key="d2">0b3eea4ed6da979f796aeba1ff2ee8d9,0f7dbd2afca6dc5582d55fb39b0f55b7,1adf391b13598f3ffe28ae596ff49438,395385fad73fd5b7ed9eda114b482624,40dcfaa6144c6424068ba46fdf288dd2,417548e99612a123d61f9fd10807ce34,4dffad2ae717727b21f2294ac520f2be,70e48774a3f732e015a59d38ba2fa5d5,724f16660e0077267b0836a0e1fb02c3,7469cc60475806b519e91abe2796aead,76bdd5f53571ff68dd1e439219572347,7c0d1f274b31d130e4feb8e46fbeb764,7c43869fff0960219e47d176597b35b8,84e91b50850bfa0ad0122cdebf477a1d,95ef1473677a26ea6ad77c7db0c55e5e,99900c6d95f85a5b4b88fcfed6775cec,bd3be91ff178508497a810f873861eca,bfdbf41efa08067d5ae1b1a67830affd,c3975fe03d2af26b95b09795c7769e8b,d8fa59c6af96b4ebb96f2c6b4ddb5473,e4019011dbf10f2c4b73d33215d7631d,e569eda9506ef1e77080a8120e388963,e7df0ed14559db764d393fb9411fec33</data>
