    <node id="MUST">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">The Malnutrition Universal Screening Tool (MUST) is a comprehensive screening tool designed to identify adults at risk of malnutrition. It is recommended by the European Society for Clinical Nutrition and Metabolism (ESPEN) for use in community settings and various healthcare environments. MUST serves as a valuable resource for assessing nutritional risk in the general population, helping healthcare professionals to identify individuals who may be malnourished or at risk of malnutrition. This tool is particularly effective in screening patients and community members, facilitating early intervention and management of malnutrition. Overall, MUST is recognized as an essential instrument for evaluating nutritional status and addressing malnutrition risk among adults.</data>
      <data key="d2">005b22fc9dae5f9b135f0c8ba729819f,14039baea6555ffc156768e503ff0b90,1fad843d053b1ec4805a4e7c6be9ceb3,4734ce2075bc72c352950c018bab7185,7906ee47aaf0c271f072790eaea05866,7d1eed82db6d0ad62418f3f965316c39,8e8a6418528a5c33a9ddf7eb94066a04,bd8df34b86026d71089bcf062570b70f,bf0cc16dc61df5b90a5a1e961322391a,cc6ee3d7bc9bfaf4a06f3f02c4907eb0,fab4b91ddb77bd16a93a3808a9c12b4c,fbbb8c2530f7ac5635ecf5110ea186b2</data>
