    </node>
    <node id="EHEALTH">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">eHealth refers to the use of digital technology and information and communication technologies to improve health services and patient care. It integrates various health information systems to enhance the efficiency and effectiveness of healthcare delivery, ultimately aiming to provide better health outcomes for patients.</data>
      <data key="d2">3d64634b55389cb5d01f78b185bada8d,5a0cbd0175ff61eee9b252f8ba7040ed</data>
      <data key="d3">1018</data>
