      <data key="d5">5</data>
      <data key="d6">1244</data>
      <data key="d7">c1922312792b40aaa70c04bf517b23ad</data>
    </node>
    <node id="MHEALTH">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">MHEALTH, or Mobile Health, refers to the utilization of mobile devices and applications to enhance health services and information, particularly in the realms of patient care and health monitoring. It is a subset of eHealth, focusing on the integration of mobile technology to support health services. MHEALTH plays a significant role in improving patient engagement and is particularly effective in managing chronic diseases, thereby facilitating better health outcomes through continuous monitoring and support.</data>
      <data key="d2">3d64634b55389cb5d01f78b185bada8d,5a0cbd0175ff61eee9b252f8ba7040ed,6d174de24d62997808908333da591120</data>
      <data key="d3">1018</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">5</data>
      <data key="d6">1245</data>
      <data key="d7">b9178aa4dfd54545a879fc42a9c7ac9d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="TRHLAB">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">TRHLab is a tele-rehabilitation project developed at Hospital San Pau in Barcelona, specifically designed to address the needs of patients with oropharyngeal dysphagia. Led by Dr. Helena Bascu&#241;ana, TRHLab utilizes digital tools to enhance education and training for both patients and healthcare providers. This initiative represents a significant opportunity for the advancement of digital technology in the field of dysphagia within Spain, aiming to improve patient outcomes through innovative management strategies.</data>
      <data key="d2">1fd926c88c75ff7b965baddbfb8bc0a6,3d64634b55389cb5d01f78b185bada8d,98b5a4ce29a4f18c4069276963d8cc19,ac81cd68683925828178b289759d58a9</data>
      <data key="d3">956</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">7</data>
      <data key="d6">1246</data>
      <data key="d7">c610000d77f64a5097d7055d7db12029</data>
    </node>
    <node id="TELECOMUNICACIONES">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Telecommunications encompasses the technologies and services that enable communication over distances, playing a vital role in the accessibility of digital health solutions.</data>
      <data key="d2">3d64634b55389cb5d01f78b185bada8d</data>
      <data key="d3">1017</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
