    <node id="SALUD">
      <data key="d0" />
      <data key="d1">SALUD refers to the overall condition of a person's body or mind, encompassing the presence or absence of illness or injury. This concept is significantly influenced by digital technology, which impacts various aspects of health, including patient care, research, and health promotion. Additionally, general health can be affected by conditions such as kidney stones and their complications, as well as associated conditions like diabetes and hypertension.</data>
      <data key="d2">3d64634b55389cb5d01f78b185bada8d,5a0cbd0175ff61eee9b252f8ba7040ed,806361fc4a48aa9718a93e11a04170d2,b703f173982cf68d36653cc0d9cc1fcb</data>
