    <node id="AETSA">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The Agency for Health Technology Assessment of Andalusia (AETSA) is a prominent organization dedicated to the evaluation of health technologies. It is recognized as a pioneer within the Spanish Network of Agencies for Health Technology Assessment, establishing itself as a leader in the field. AETSA plays a crucial role in assessing health technologies, contributing to informed decision-making in healthcare within the region of Andalusia.</data>
      <data key="d2">3a7dac32347984360ee9e87767129272,5a0cbd0175ff61eee9b252f8ba7040ed</data>
