    <node id="BIG DATA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Big Data refers to the large volumes of data that can be collected, stored, managed, analyzed, and visualized in real-time. It plays a crucial role in improving health interventions and patient care by enabling the analysis of extensive datasets. In the context of health data, Big Data facilitates the extraction of valuable insights that can enhance decision-making and optimize healthcare outcomes.</data>
      <data key="d2">b7034350b98abd27ed6af7560149691d,da2707b26ddb548995a6d0e2a3eeddb0</data>
