      <data key="d6">1263</data>
      <data key="d7">b83737b5ec1d48c79dbafeb0ef773924</data>
    </node>
    <node id="SAVANA">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Savana is a pioneering project developed in Spain that focuses on the application of artificial intelligence in healthcare. Currently operational in numerous care centers, Savana aims to enhance the usability of clinical data. The program, created by Ignacio Hern&#225;ndez Medrano, utilizes artificial intelligence to transform unstructured clinical data into valuable information, thereby improving healthcare delivery and decision-making processes.</data>
      <data key="d2">806361fc4a48aa9718a93e11a04170d2,b7034350b98abd27ed6af7560149691d,f12947896819ee4ab30d1fa3f3c9995d</data>
