    </node>
    <node id="TELEMEDICINA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Telemedicine is the practice of providing healthcare services remotely using telecommunications technology, facilitating diagnosis, treatment, and patient management from a distance.</data>
      <data key="d2">ac81cd68683925828178b289759d58a9</data>
      <data key="d3">778</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">2</data>
      <data key="d6">1267</data>
      <data key="d7">8f9f39a2f72045649bd8b41288d2d81f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="HOSPITAL SAN PAU">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Hospital San Pau in Barcelona is a prominent healthcare institution that has been actively involved in telemedicine since 2010. It has developed a specialized initiative known as TRHLab, which focuses on the rehabilitation of oropharyngeal dysphagia. In addition to this initiative, Hospital San Pau provides valuable resources for both patients and healthcare professionals concerning dysphagia, further emphasizing its commitment to improving patient care and rehabilitation through innovative medical practices.</data>
      <data key="d2">5aef6ccb162a04d926beeb343ceea252,ac81cd68683925828178b289759d58a9</data>
      <data key="d3">778</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
