    <node id="HOSPITAL UNIVERSITARIO MIGUEL SERVET">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Hospital Universitario Miguel Servet is a prominent healthcare institution located in Zaragoza, Spain. It specializes in clinical nutrition and dietetics, with a particular focus on providing services for diabetic patients. The hospital is led by Dr. Alejandro Sanz Par&#237;s, who heads the Clinical Nutrition and Dietetics Unit. Additionally, the institution offers resources for dysphagia management through the Disfapp app. Another notable professional associated with the hospital is Diego &#193;lvarez Ballano. Overall, Hospital Universitario Miguel Servet is recognized for its comprehensive approach to nutrition and endocrinology, making it a key player in the healthcare landscape of Zaragoza.</data>
      <data key="d2">0977493109f1215441cf1927961d21ee,34fd1f99a5ed706146b0a6a4db494afc,4216916ebab948061d2dca4afe7e1e84,4e8b65ec9939ccf2152e68fa7f8b12c4,5aef6ccb162a04d926beeb343ceea252,66bc37c9c52956b468bccf2ef89662de,a549bdc3929c5dd7a613c6900a0fe90e,e00575eedbd6807f0778df41cf8b10b8</data>
