    <node id="FRESENIUS KABI">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Fresenius Kabi is a global healthcare company that specializes in lifesaving medicines and technologies. The company focuses on a range of products, including nutritional solutions and medical devices. Fresenius Kabi is particularly known for its nutritional products, such as Fresubin, Supportan Drink, Diben est&#225;ndar, Diben Drink, and Fresubin HP Energy, which cater to various dietary needs, including enteral nutrition and parenteral nutrition. The company also produces solutions and additives for medical use, specifically designed for managing dysphagia and supporting patients requiring specialized nutritional care. Through its commitment to innovation and collaboration with healthcare institutions, Fresenius Kabi plays a vital role in enhancing patient care and outcomes in the healthcare sector.</data>
      <data key="d2">010eeb888fc145c82babc1e391659d17,0ce5d03d68754406ae67953693447691,14c19a260cd596700d9063264706c3f5,242f6cf03a4c50245e71fee58de41d18,5aef6ccb162a04d926beeb343ceea252,66a75395e918aa1473ad8cf32c9d33f5,751947d2192006b89bb703587d56df99,77c2b5963fab84c30e6eb596b49336bf,7d929a0137a287c5c96416fa5fc36239,c15050bcda4ba43dac2389a2c73459c7,cd2b394eb36bf2bba5fba6e1145cdda2,ceea9bf255384db1726c76c13ce560c8,d6abfd0fdff414c8f98db6dc3c239723,eae483df53fc129a2da04f2925b91d57,ede4d21db7723c6b72e8493236b217ad,f1a5aedade8a18645812e3d39b313afa,f5e31a6599b8198e736e732c44f8eaa4</data>
