    <node id="NESTL&#201;">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Nestl&#233; is a global multinational food and beverage company renowned for its extensive range of nutritional products and solutions. The company provides resources for managing dysphagia through its health management website and is recognized for its specialized nutritional offerings, including enteral formulas and products tailored for children and patients with specific dietary needs. Among its notable products are Novasource, Resource Diabet, Resource Peptide, Resource Diabet Plus, and various nutritional drinks such as Renutryl and Resource 2.0.

Nestl&#233; also produces a variety of nutritional supplements, including Isosource Protein, Isosource Mix, Resource Support Plus, and Impact Enteral, catering to diverse dietary requirements. The company is committed to supporting health management through dietary software like Dietsource&#174; and has a strong focus on infant nutrition and milk fortifiers. Additionally, Nestl&#233; has been involved in the development of the Mini Nutritional Assessment (MNA), first published in 1994 and revised in 2006, further emphasizing its dedication to nutritional health. Overall, Nestl&#233; stands out as a leader in the food and beverage industry, particularly in the realm of nutritional products.</data>
      <data key="d2">010eeb888fc145c82babc1e391659d17,0ce5d03d68754406ae67953693447691,12b6478763cfb60ad144be6b81778e03,14c19a260cd596700d9063264706c3f5,16e694ae79763a00ceb974feca8e733d,3f0bfab71cc06082c8260831cbfc6348,4752b173a12652aa3728cbfaf3d6cb37,480f782b060bfee2602cabab8f0a8430,5aef6ccb162a04d926beeb343ceea252,5c8bb96f818f658375def01d5ad51dd2,751947d2192006b89bb703587d56df99,7d1eed82db6d0ad62418f3f965316c39,7d929a0137a287c5c96416fa5fc36239,919ff63f7f48a238e717f60361d8dbd1,c15050bcda4ba43dac2389a2c73459c7,c3399f261a9e270031cf3b7e31cd43ad,c883bcb78593d21f8f0467eae1a2c8fa,ca2801bd227abdbbb8e1d4f3bb4e16c7,ceea9bf255384db1726c76c13ce560c8,d7995c4e4e8e09e71d30c87b5f02b18a,e19124eedd22ae875792520ac81cd761,eae483df53fc129a2da04f2925b91d57,ede4d21db7723c6b72e8493236b217ad,f1a5aedade8a18645812e3d39b313afa</data>
