    <node id="VEGENAT">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">VEGENAT is a company dedicated to the nutrition and feeding of elderly individuals, actively sponsoring the series "Envejecimiento y Nutrici&#243;n." In 2014, VEGENAT produced documents focused on ideal diets for the elderly and nutritional interventions for fragile elderly individuals. The brand is associated with health and nutrition, as indicated by its logo and collaborative efforts. VEGENAT specializes in plant-based nutritional products, offering dietary supplements tailored to specific health needs, including solutions for dysphagia. The company manufactures a variety of dietary products, such as TDiET HP, TDiET HP sin fibra, T-Diet PLUS for diabetic patients, Diaba HP, TDiET 2, T-DIET Energy, At&#233;mpero Enteral, Dienat G, and Suppresi. Overall, VEGENAT is committed to providing high-calorie and plant-based nutritional solutions, collaborating with healthcare institutions to enhance the well-being of its consumers.</data>
      <data key="d2">010eeb888fc145c82babc1e391659d17,0903b40c7774225e89c5e798f9feef9b,237aabddb06fa04afb7e741dc1dfcd97,242f6cf03a4c50245e71fee58de41d18,480f782b060bfee2602cabab8f0a8430,5aef6ccb162a04d926beeb343ceea252,65e1359e381a0ac66f53b3a6eeba408b,66a75395e918aa1473ad8cf32c9d33f5,751947d2192006b89bb703587d56df99,7d929a0137a287c5c96416fa5fc36239,7f1e7297290e6bec78ef6dca66af0d1b,bd228b54354e751399b62683662e2b56,c3399f261a9e270031cf3b7e31cd43ad,c883bcb78593d21f8f0467eae1a2c8fa,ca2801bd227abdbbb8e1d4f3bb4e16c7,ceea9bf255384db1726c76c13ce560c8,d7995c4e4e8e09e71d30c87b5f02b18a,e19124eedd22ae875792520ac81cd761</data>
