    <node id="NUTRICIA">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Nutricia is a specialized nutrition company that is part of the Danone Group, focusing on medical nutrition and dietary products. The brand is known for producing a wide range of nutritional products, including arginine supplements, enteral formulas, and specialized nutritional formulas for infants and children. Nutricia's product offerings include Nutrison Protein Plus, Nutrison Protein Plus Energy, Nutrison Multifibre, and Nutrison Advanced Cubison, among others. 

The company develops products aimed at providing nutritional support for various medical needs, including energy supplementation for patients requiring additional caloric intake, as exemplified by their Infatrini&#174; formula. Nutricia also addresses specific dietary requirements for individuals with metabolic disorders, such as phenylketonuria, and offers resources for patients with dysphagia. 

In addition to their focus on pediatric nutrition, Nutricia provides dietary management solutions for adults, including products like Fortimel Complete, Fortimel Extra, and Forticare. Their commitment to specialized nutrition is evident in their extensive range of medical nutrition products designed to meet the unique needs of patients across different health conditions. Overall, Nutricia is dedicated to advancing medical nutrition and providing tailored dietary solutions for individuals with specific nutritional requirements.</data>
