    <node id="REDES SOCIALES">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">REDES SOCIALES, or social networks, are platforms that facilitate social interaction and information sharing among users. They play a significant role in health communication, providing a space for users to connect and exchange information. However, despite their potential, social networks currently exhibit minimal engagement with content related to dysphagia, indicating a gap in the dissemination and discussion of this specific health topic within these platforms.</data>
