    <node id="TIC">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">TIC, or Information and Communication Technologies, refers to a range of digital tools and resources designed to enhance communication and information sharing, especially within the healthcare sector. These technologies play a crucial role in improving the efficiency and effectiveness of healthcare delivery by enabling better access to information and facilitating interactions among healthcare providers and patients.</data>
