      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Facebook is a global social media platform that enables users to create groups for sharing information, making it particularly popular among patients. Within this platform, various profiles related to dysphagia can be found, encompassing both professional services and personal accounts. This diverse range of content allows users to connect, share experiences, and access resources related to dysphagia, highlighting Facebook's role as a significant tool for community engagement and information dissemination in health-related contexts.</data>
