    <node id="LINKEDIN">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">LinkedIn is a professional networking site and social media platform that facilitates connections and content sharing among professionals across various sectors. Within this platform, groups related to dysphagia have been identified, primarily consisting of individual profiles. This highlights LinkedIn's role not only as a networking tool but also as a space for specialized discussions and connections within specific fields.</data>
