    <node id="YOUTUBE">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">YouTube is a video-sharing platform that serves as a valuable tool for information dissemination and professional training across various fields, including health. It hosts numerous publications on dysphagia, featuring content from professionals that provides essential insights and knowledge on the subject.</data>
