    <node id="FUNDACI&#211;N ISYS">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The FUNDACI&#211;N ISYS is a foundation dedicated to the evaluation of internet content and health technologies, with a particular focus on dysphagia. In addition to its work in this area, the iSYS Foundation also assesses health mobile applications, utilizing objective variables to inform users about the popularity, trustworthiness, and utility of these applications. Through its comprehensive evaluations, FUNDACI&#211;N ISYS aims to enhance the quality and reliability of health-related digital resources.</data>
