    </node>
    <node id="SEVILLA">
      <data key="d0">GEO</data>
      <data key="d1">Sevilla is a city in Spain, serving as the capital of Andaluc&#237;a. It is renowned for its historical significance and is recognized as a center for health technology evaluation. Within this vibrant city, Fernando Garc&#237;a P&#233;rez-Sevillano practices, contributing to the local health landscape.</data>
      <data key="d2">cca60bfbb1e73ceda513fbcaf0866a8f,f12947896819ee4ab30d1fa3f3c9995d</data>
