      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The Universidad Aut&#243;noma de Barcelona is a public university located in Spain, known for its commitment to research and education across various fields, including medicine. It is an esteemed educational institution where Ana M.&#170; Urioste Fondo completed her Master's in Research Methodology. Additionally, it is the alma mater of Miguel A. Rubio Herrera, who obtained his medical degree from the university in 1982.</data>
      <data key="d2">11fcae49d6b540a5ad5cdfe74ed269a9,9df39dbac545af182eade788e4c5db5d,f12947896819ee4ab30d1fa3f3c9995d</data>
