    <node id="ENFERMEDADES RARAS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">ENFERMEDADES RARAS refers to rare diseases, which are conditions that affect a small percentage of the population and often necessitate specialized medical attention and support. In Spain, the CIBERer is a dedicated research center focused on these rare diseases, aiming to advance understanding and treatment options for affected individuals.</data>
      <data key="d2">ce0de74f95e1a41a930b2df09da1f887,f12947896819ee4ab30d1fa3f3c9995d</data>
