    <node id="CUIDADO DE LA SALUD">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">CUIDADO DE LA SALUD refers to the essential aspect of healthcare, particularly in the context of providing medical services to individuals, including those who are incarcerated and may be on hunger strikes. It encompasses the organized provision of medical services aimed at maintaining or improving health. This highlights the critical importance of health care in ensuring the well-being of vulnerable populations, emphasizing the need for attentive and responsive health services in various circumstances.</data>
      <data key="d2">3a39d5a157094736650455097e986fdd,f12947896819ee4ab30d1fa3f3c9995d</data>
