    <node id="BMC PUBLIC HEALTH">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">BMC Public Health is a peer-reviewed journal dedicated to publishing research on a wide range of public health issues. The journal features studies that encompass various topics, including nutritional interventions for the elderly, general nutrition, and disease prevention. Additionally, BMC Public Health includes participatory action research projects, highlighting its commitment to diverse methodologies in addressing public health challenges. Through its comprehensive approach, the journal aims to contribute valuable insights and findings to the field of public health.</data>
      <data key="d2">04fc50226ccbf87e5833a09d52275757,594e6f43e0098791036927da2623b2f5,cf833689453c8ce13d3650766a8b47a7,e155d9b2d1858daab734fd68a45d0c0a</data>
