    </node>
    <node id="FIGURA 2">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">FIGURA 2 serves as a comprehensive illustration that encompasses multiple aspects of clinical nutrition. It depicts the action of a homogenizer in the preparation of clinical nutrition products, emphasizing the importance of this equipment in ensuring the consistency and quality of nutritional formulations. Additionally, FIGURA 2 highlights the position of the caregiver while feeding a patient, underscoring the caregiver's critical role in implementing proper feeding techniques to enhance patient care. Furthermore, the figure illustrates the process of detecting and managing elevated gastric residuals in patients receiving enteral nutrition, which is essential for monitoring patient safety and nutritional efficacy. Overall, FIGURA 2 integrates these elements to provide a holistic view of the practices involved in clinical nutrition management.</data>
      <data key="d2">13c6297da17b9be4a67cf439f62cd289,7c842769e1890739769789ed10a08005,dc38a37c30b175667931b84a9c9103bb</data>
