    <node id="BIBLIOGRAF&#205;A">
      <data key="d0" />
      <data key="d1">BIBLIOGRAF&#205;A refers to a comprehensive collection of references and studies that support various guidelines and recommendations in the field of nutrition and clinical practice. It encompasses a wide range of topics, including methodologies and findings in nutritional assessment, as well as specific areas such as the use of parenteral and enteral nutrition in both adult and pediatric patients. The bibliography includes references related to the diagnosis and treatment of conditions like Adrenoleukodystrophy, inflammatory bowel disease, and hyponatremia. Additionally, it features studies that address the interactions between medications and nutrients, highlighting their relevance to clinical practice. The section serves as a vital resource, providing a list of sources that underpin the information presented in the document, thereby emphasizing the importance of nutrition in various health contexts, including neurological diseases and renal conditions.</data>
      <data key="d2">0482404f71667592ce2b0f771153ece8,54a47e2936e787ab5943e2d75afc03f1,7f0ee0bea2b1dfd09e75026d4c027291,a519216aaee7bf8a1317f5d6b522c4b6,a76f25b0b56092f8125f49ec456f78df,aaef63df030ff97e66b358358491e6a5,b4580c82418cd4df97f400e183702858,c3d9237f72732f1f51141fa79be271c9,c4abdcd9f1628aa02ca6ed662b795fd6,caf1d075a295b93dcd3c6f5cf72b028d,ce8f5f24dbbf8624e49a6f85c2ad0d04,e321db63d9b561eb98a4f01853b141ad,e98937544f56006f5d327136c593c969,fa0165b0420f4c761829a08a3ab08508</data>
