    <node id="CANCER">
      <data key="d0" />
      <data key="d1">Cancer is a complex group of diseases characterized by the uncontrolled growth of abnormal cells in the body. This uncontrolled cell proliferation can lead to a variety of health complications, including cachexia, sarcopenia, malnutrition, diabetes, and hypercalcemia, particularly in older patients. Cancer significantly impacts the health and functional status of individuals, contributing to frailty and reducing overall resilience.

The disease can manifest in various parts of the body, including the head, neck, and thyroid gland, with specific types such as differentiated thyroid cancer being addressed in clinical guidelines. Cancer treatment often necessitates specialized nutritional support due to the effects of both the disease and its treatment on patients' ability to eat and maintain adequate nutrition. 

Dietary and lifestyle factors play a crucial role in cancer risk, with studies indicating that habits such as the consumption of fruits and vegetables can influence susceptibility. Additionally, certain nutritional supplements, like arginine and glutamine, have been the focus of research regarding their potential benefits for cancer patients.

Overall, cancer is a chronic condition that poses significant health challenges and requires complex treatment strategies, as well as tailored dietary guidelines to support affected individuals.</data>
      <data key="d2">02db15b9ad7bc5655e1907ad3fa4e8ad,066ca85c476fdb709bb2b588cb86a55a,11cbdce47eee11a80ab609f3b786bcc1,1566fcfef74295869c46405aaca05b32,1776df2694e83680f59e035be5ffb00b,36cffc3e7c3a6fe82e50787e939f7537,3b361c0a9b5d08df1a67476a3ae3b968,5f4610a3d5efde69d7f34ec14c4bed0b,67d484d5c0c84fff32782bd773c0fd7a,6c509f5e704c690cfa39b3f7b19eb766,70e4538100be270d06e7a3cdc254ba28,73d47e377c2910da3393d7bb65f80e8e,74c9662af46dca03f3941e133df2e783,758bc764453f49b9097073c5175470cc,76da5650c43a6cbc7270a05d3aa3fa1d,97a29de0d5161aebffb702f69c6dd870,a6ccbda174f6599eeeb2e4cdb00db5f2,b110392fc91bc3d7875124ec3fa07c46,b3f35283251afbd3276cf40d7be382c0,ba0a1fee09e488cf2628102b72a52435,bb209dcfffac9c89dae0ad4ed2908d85,bbe700b5b290ea119e511c94a6f0c67f,bd3162e408d0d1ddd770ea833aad5ff3,c9a02c0d93ca431827b63d51ae564670,cb0b01ccd7736b620c0755a756a42e5b,ce2e5f8df5ad472bb255174d496cc1d7,ce6821fbd8f78047e06917383f25f037,dfc1e2e58310777aea7dc00c58cd384d,ea79efb65695c260a301f5c42237e2cb,eadd983c9f28c11a1c279e4b923351cd,fb7b0d121f195e2a472f3d47e28ccff9</data>
