    <node id="NUTRITION">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Nutrition is a comprehensive field of study and practice that focuses on the dietary needs and health impacts of food consumption. It encompasses the intake of food and nutrients, which are essential for maintaining health, growth, and disease management. Nutrition plays a critical role in various health contexts, including the prevention and management of diseases such as cancer, cardiovascular conditions, diabetes, and cognitive disorders like Alzheimer's and dementia.

The field addresses the dietary requirements of different populations, including infants, children, and patients with specific health conditions. For instance, nutrition is vital in managing inflammatory bowel disease, sarcopenia, frailty, and conditions like nephrolithiasis and gout. It is also crucial in the recovery process for patients undergoing preoperative and postoperative care, as well as in the management of eating disorders and during treatments like bone marrow transplantation and parenteral nutrition.

Research in nutrition includes studies on dietary practices, food allergies, and the effects of specific food groups, such as dairy products, on health. Journals dedicated to nutrition publish findings on nutritional assessment techniques, the role of nutrition in liver disease management, and the overall impact of dietary choices on health outcomes.

Overall, nutrition is a vital aspect of health that influences not only physical well-being but also cognitive function and quality of life, highlighting the importance of proper dietary management across various medical contexts.</data>
      <data key="d2">0692eb750371d46b9fff71ec305df6ce,0a742cf103e30cf0fadaf6ffabbbde2d,1f06578cbfda22ce8c7d322ba35a93a1,22f9164844b9778cfef429e45de95060,242fceb82929615af653d9f8574b0ef5,2cd8f3cd1703aeede881bef67e072607,2de75b0403c279c1781dfec3cdd2a3e2,33900ea313cbdf466c2bebc1f587e2bf,384e13475cc83e77e160fd6be9a88e73,3b361c0a9b5d08df1a67476a3ae3b968,49e6a5571bf2f206ac38ac536d70f710,4c07b8e0a5058216ff9f2f748bde2ada,53e49c7e4c8bca9063d743acb9997132,5aaadc19de8fb96a4951c0ba38192991,67d484d5c0c84fff32782bd773c0fd7a,680ff2c9e67ec29c5952df66bd83c984,6d6fc66abf6c858e5c5e9e47eb1ff6d2,70e4538100be270d06e7a3cdc254ba28,73d47e377c2910da3393d7bb65f80e8e,8205166235be6abd77947eb2f7c5ab27,91b470ee527a45d8e81a821eeb9ce259,980d6217f6ec073bf1673f14542ebbf0,9ef354c0ee5ac877ce8fba79fcc7e2b3,a0162312192878417ef2c4ef8f9cffba,a35fdf8cbbb5fe4783572ea6e86f7776,a4b144210b0a4b654a260ebc394de0af,b3ddc7e512f6a789fa4cef18e7b18fab,c84372864fd2ee7b7ed425b2d597efdb,ce2e5f8df5ad472bb255174d496cc1d7,d0b74d75847bdd3e0d4962e7cc2ca5fe,d6a596828c4ca22ce0a49c5ba26b33e8,deb3afabda4adf3c61e4b9e1545103cc,e119877a92b580500f5e5b0307401732,e757275b1935a42dabd03a0b528649a3,f73cc4b49b42b9c9d60bc906430ffe90,faa6d27a781e64a98fe101236a44dc16</data>
