    <node id="ACEITE DE OLIVA">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Aceite de Oliva, or olive oil, is a versatile cooking oil widely used in various recipes, including those designed for dysphagia management. It is recognized for its health benefits, particularly its high content of oleic acid, a monounsaturated fatty acid associated with cardiovascular health. This oil is a staple in Mediterranean diets and is commonly used for frying, dressing dishes, and enhancing flavors in recipes such as Crema Fr&#237;a de Mel&#243;n con Jam&#243;n, Salmorejo, and Magdalena de espinacas.

In Spain, Aceite de Oliva can be classified under Denominaci&#243;n de Origen Protegida (DOP), with over 30 designated regions producing this high-quality oil. It serves as a source of healthy fats and is recommended for balancing omega-3 and omega-6 fatty acids in dietary mixes. Additionally, olive oil is noted for its role in parenteral nutrition and is suggested for use in low-sodium cooking.

Overall, Aceite de Oliva is not only a flavorful ingredient but also a key component of a healthy diet, contributing to lower blood pressure levels and promoting overall well-being, making it suitable for all age groups, including children.</data>
      <data key="d2">0af5605f96545f73fc229a30e2aa34bd,1d959525e9a5fe22094271d67d0b9108,29b354fe9b007cadb55ce27555391d5a,53ab21b47d6304cc0eba5a45de3e8b53,569c8eafa9f82b2becef8d37416316a8,61b84039de5ac2d9e25890c3b8f4f87a,6ce19f63a040cd71afad92f822b079da,7ce7a74ee3898be3e3f6d500d73afefd,86450d0e00138163bc3427ff406aa842,8eaa5c33797ca6e96f578139f2831f47,a687eee1e8bfd2d98ce40a14628dd855,a8a688d676adb0ffde17c9f1d729aea3,b8fd422921866f53cdaa6c24db528ee5,c1ec1ae8298c71442c08a75a2e629469,c7af1c950a6caab8be5d180a2889a25a,ca18ae77517f7075f919107aa348a2f5,d01787532282add470408550197035c8,df410977169e29218f41ff919bd4e44b,e04e16f606e0bc5eeb59e2d5388ab061,ed225adac152d1c29c228d1a09c2ce54,ed7bd985e5e4a3d5642e4b401b8e3e17,ee5838dfb7aae573c969c1510fbf2d09,eff56271e184ab2f11877bfab7f715c4,fa95290726c6f8f7c5947019c98a3e1d,ffb492629e13ca96c1fcee1496522f12</data>
