      <data key="d1">Salmorejo con perlitas de huevo is a cold Spanish tomato soup that is specifically designed to cater to dysphagia diets. This dish features a blend of ingredients including tomato, bread, and egg, and is typically served with egg pearls. It is often prepared in a hospital culinary context, highlighting its suitability for patients with dietary restrictions while still offering a flavorful and nutritious option.</data>
