    <node id="PIMIENTA">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Pimienta, commonly known as pepper, is a versatile spice used to enhance the flavor of various dishes. It serves as a seasoning in multiple recipes, including cold salmon cake and vegetable pie, allowing for flavor adjustment and improvement. As a key ingredient, pimienta contributes to the overall taste profile of these dishes, making it an essential component in culinary preparations.</data>
