    <node id="PAN">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">PAN refers to bread and baked goods, which are included in various meals throughout the diet plan. It is an essential ingredient in Salmorejo, contributing to the soup's texture. While bread is permitted in modified diets, it may pose risks if it is hard or crusty. Additionally, individuals with phenylketonuria should consume bread with caution, as it may contain phenylalanine. Overall, PAN encompasses a variety of bread types that can be part of a diet, but careful consideration is necessary regarding their texture and potential dietary restrictions.</data>
      <data key="d2">347e3d175ef7f30e3dcad731f84fb375,4b19145e0977ee48b7132c9915d8c284,5700f71dc6a101296f5bfec99b1e796f,5f1b707b42d6235a666179f880d1d98a,6ce19f63a040cd71afad92f822b079da,7d2050a2481adc105bdebbcf2af1a173,bd22bf95ac5fc6dc95539efb99c5b11a</data>
