    <node id="HUEVO">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Huevo, or egg, is a versatile ingredient widely used in various culinary recipes. It plays a crucial role in binding mixtures together, as seen in dishes like cold salmon cake and vegetable pie. Additionally, eggs are essential in cooking for binding ingredients in recipes such as croquetas. They are a common component in numerous dishes, including Ralladura de huevo con tomate, Salmorejo, and Magdalena de espinacas, contributing not only to the texture but also providing a valuable source of protein. Overall, huevo is an integral part of many recipes, enhancing both flavor and nutritional value.</data>
      <data key="d2">6ce19f63a040cd71afad92f822b079da,a8a688d676adb0ffde17c9f1d729aea3,cddf59ae158cab9962605b9e7d903544,d01787532282add470408550197035c8,ffb492629e13ca96c1fcee1496522f12</data>
