      <data key="d1">AT&#218;N, or tuna, is a type of fish that serves as a primary ingredient in various dishes, including Chupito de calabac&#237;n y at&#250;n, where it contributes both protein and flavor. Additionally, AT&#218;N is noted for its significant purine content, which can influence uric acid levels in the body.</data>
