    <node id="TOMATE">
      <data key="d0" />
      <data key="d1">Tomate, also known as tomato, is a fruit that is widely utilized in cooking and is recognized for its juicy texture. It is commonly featured in salads, sauces, and a variety of dishes, making it a versatile ingredient in culinary practices. Tomate is not only a key component in specific recipes such as Ralladura de huevo con tomate and Delicias de at&#250;n con tomate, but it is also recommended as part of a balanced diet, particularly for children. Additionally, tomatoes are a source of dietary fiber and are frequently used as a base ingredient in numerous recipes, highlighting their importance in both nutrition and gastronomy.</data>
