    <node id="JUD&#205;AS VERDES">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Jud&#237;as Verdes, commonly known as green beans, are a type of vegetable that serves as a key ingredient in various recipes, including vegetable pie. These green beans are recognized for their dietary fiber content, making them a nutritious addition to meals. Additionally, jud&#237;as verdes are noted for their inclusion in a strict low-sodium diet, highlighting their versatility and health benefits in various culinary contexts.</data>
