    </node>
    <node id="SALSA DE TOMATE">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Salsa de Tomate, commonly known as tomato sauce, serves multiple culinary purposes across various dishes. It is a key ingredient in Br&#243;coli con Salsa Aurora, where it enhances both the flavor and color of the dish. Additionally, Salsa de Tomate is utilized in a cold salmon cake recipe, contributing flavor and moisture to the dish. It is also beneficial for individuals with swallowing difficulties, as it can be used to moisten foods, making them easier to consume. Furthermore, Salsa de Tomate is incorporated into a vegetable pie recipe, showcasing its versatility in enhancing a variety of meals.</data>
