    <node id="T&#201;CNICA CULINARIA">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">T&#201;CNICA CULINARIA encompasses a variety of culinary techniques essential for preparing dishes, particularly those suitable for individuals with dysphagia. The manual outlines specific methods such as triturado (blending), boiling, mashing, baking, and refrigerating, which are crucial for ensuring the dishes are safe and palatable for those with swallowing difficulties. These techniques are integral to the recipes provided, highlighting the importance of proper food preparation methods to accommodate dietary needs. Overall, T&#201;CNICA CULINARIA refers to the diverse cooking methods employed in the creation of these specialized dishes, ensuring they meet both nutritional and safety standards.</data>
