    <node id="C&#218;RCUMA">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">C&#250;rcuma, commonly known as turmeric, is a spice renowned for its vibrant color and numerous health benefits. It is frequently utilized in various culinary applications, including sauces and dishes, where it enhances both flavor and visual appeal. In particular, turmeric is featured in recipes such as hake medallions, contributing to the dish's color and taste. Additionally, it is important to note that turmeric may contain oxalate, which could potentially influence the risk of developing kidney stones. Overall, C&#250;rcuma is celebrated not only for its culinary uses but also for its health-promoting properties.</data>
