      <data key="d1">Champi&#241;&#243;n is a type of mushroom known for its culinary versatility and its ability to enhance dishes with a rich umami flavor. It contains a low amount of galactose, specifically less than 5 mg per 100 grams, making it a suitable option for those who are mindful of their galactose intake.</data>
