    <node id="PIMIENTO">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Pimiento refers to bell peppers, which are vegetables known for their vibrant colors and versatility in cooking. They contain oxalate, a compound that can increase the risk of kidney stones if consumed in large quantities. Among the various types of peppers, piquillo peppers are particularly notable for their culinary use, often featured in sauces and various dishes.</data>
      <data key="d2">e67ea94c6cdb27cf6bb6715598cfe224,fa95290726c6f8f7c5947019c98a3e1d</data>
