    <node id="CALDO">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">CALDO is a type of broth that serves as a fundamental base in numerous recipes, enhancing flavor and moisture in various dishes. It is particularly beneficial for dysphagia patients, as it is suitable for their dietary needs. Additionally, CALDO is recognized as a liquid food that is included in liquid and semi-liquid diets, providing essential nutrients in a form that is easy to consume. Overall, CALDO plays a significant role in cooking by enriching dishes while catering to specific dietary requirements.</data>
      <data key="d2">0af5605f96545f73fc229a30e2aa34bd,4d74cee5793710b781c0b83db2f27209,fa95290726c6f8f7c5947019c98a3e1d</data>
