    <node id="AZ&#218;CAR">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Az&#250;car, commonly known as sugar, is a widely used sweetener that plays a significant role in various culinary applications. It is an essential ingredient in many dessert recipes, such as Flan de caf&#233; and Crema de queso con pur&#233; de membrillo, where it enhances the flavor and sweetness of the dishes. In addition to desserts, Az&#250;car is utilized in a variety of foods and beverages, contributing to both their taste and energy content.

In dietary contexts, Az&#250;car is mentioned in strict low-sodium diets, indicating its relevance in nutritional planning. It is included in dietary plans and is permitted in modified diets, particularly within the sweets and desserts category. Furthermore, Az&#250;car is also used in cooking to sweeten various dishes, showcasing its versatility as a common ingredient in both sweet and savory recipes.</data>
