    <node id="BACALAO AL CAVA CON PUR&#201; DE ESPINACAS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">BACALAO AL CAVA CON PUR&#201; DE ESPINACAS is a dish that features cod cooked in cava, a sparkling wine, and is served with a spinach puree. This dish is specifically tailored for individuals with dysphagia, ensuring it is suitable for those who have difficulty swallowing. Additionally, it is described as a white fish covered in a light-colored sauce, further enhancing its culinary appeal. The combination of the delicate flavors of the cod and the creamy spinach puree makes it a refined option in a culinary context.</data>
