    <node id="SALM&#211;N">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Salm&#243;n, or salmon, is a versatile fish that serves as a key ingredient in various culinary dishes. It is notably featured in the cold salmon cake recipe, where it provides both flavor and nutrition. Additionally, salmon is used in the preparation of the dish 'Sufl&#233; de Salm&#243;n en Salsa de Naranja', showcasing its adaptability in different recipes. While salmon was previously discouraged for its high phosphorus content, it has a phosphorus ratio of 13.58 mg/g, which makes it acceptable for consumption in moderation. Furthermore, salmon has moderate purine levels, which can influence uric acid levels in the body, indicating that it should be consumed with consideration for those who are sensitive to purines. Overall, salmon is a nutritious fish that can be enjoyed in a variety of dishes while being mindful of its nutritional properties.</data>
      <data key="d2">26e7a15d14f527bbd2b99f7a7bc55d81,393fd6c0f1d43f0413a5b82d1dc0c2fc,569c8eafa9f82b2becef8d37416316a8,cddf59ae158cab9962605b9e7d903544</data>
