      <data key="d1">VINO refers to wine, which is not only a popular beverage but also an integral component of the Mediterranean diet. Moderate consumption of wine has been linked to positive effects on cardiovascular health. Additionally, wine is frequently utilized in cooking, enhancing the flavors of various dishes, such as rabo de toro and various sauces.</data>
