    <node id="CALDO DE CARNE">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Caldo de carne is a flavorful meat broth that serves as a foundational ingredient for soups and sauces, enhancing the overall depth of flavor in various dishes. Additionally, it is suitable for inclusion in the diets of patients who experience swallowing difficulties, making it a versatile option in both culinary and dietary contexts.</data>
