    <node id="PI&#209;A">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Pi&#241;a is a fruit that is notable for its use in the Semifr&#237;o de Pi&#241;a recipe, where it contributes both flavor and texture. Additionally, Pi&#241;a is characterized by its higher galactose content, which ranges between 10-20 mg per 100 grams. This combination of culinary application and nutritional profile highlights the significance of Pi&#241;a in both gastronomy and dietary considerations.</data>
      <data key="d2">160d4259ba08a1bfcdc877b63a4c799d,ec9e9b1519699c4c01b955945ea892d5</data>
