    <node id="HUEVO PASTEURIZADO">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Huevo pasteurizado is a processed egg product that is utilized in various recipes for its safety and convenience. It is particularly noted for its application in the Flan de Huevo Casero recipe, where pasteurized eggs are used to ensure a safe and delicious outcome.</data>
