    <node id="CARAMELO">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Caramelo is a sweet substance created by caramelizing sugar, which serves as a key ingredient in various desserts. It is notably used in the Flan de Huevo Casero recipe, where it provides both flavor and texture. Additionally, Caramelo is utilized as a topping or base in other desserts, such as Flan de caf&#233;, enhancing their sweetness and overall appeal.</data>
      <data key="d2">173bd6d0dd53c58c39f748b3c60c08bd,ec9e9b1519699c4c01b955945ea892d5</data>
