    <node id="CANELA">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Canela, commonly known as cinnamon, is a spice utilized in a variety of recipes, particularly in desserts, to enhance flavor. It plays a significant role in traditional dishes such as Flan de Huevo Casero and Cremoso de Manzana, where it is specifically used for flavoring, contributing to the overall taste and aroma of these culinary creations.</data>
      <data key="d2">173bd6d0dd53c58c39f748b3c60c08bd,ec9e9b1519699c4c01b955945ea892d5</data>
