    <node id="MELOCOTON">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Melocot&#243;n is a fruit known for its juicy and sweet taste, containing a fructose content of 1.5 g per 100 g. In addition to being enjoyed fresh, Melocot&#243;n can also be utilized in various culinary recipes, similar to other fruits such as pears and apples.</data>
