    <node id="PERA">
      <data key="d0" />
      <data key="d1">Pera, commonly known as pear, is a fruit recognized for its sweetness and nutritional value. It contains a moderate amount of galactose, ranging from 5-10 mg per 100 grams. Additionally, Pera has a fructose content of 6.2-8.9 g per 100 grams, contributing to its sweet flavor. This fruit is also high in dietary fiber, making it a healthy choice for those seeking to improve their nutrition.</data>
      <data key="d2">160d4259ba08a1bfcdc877b63a4c799d,23c483bf9bf70d04577ef3735a1ca2e8,9d56eb0b82a3266e422a6a8ac5e63944,b2bdb1e00976001800583298f8dddc7a</data>
