    <node id="ALERGENOS">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">ALERGENOS refers to allergens that must be disclosed in food products, such as Galleta Maria, to ensure consumer safety. These allergens are substances that can trigger allergic reactions, with the most common being peanuts, nuts, and shellfish. The control of allergens is particularly important in food production, especially for patients with dysphagia, as it helps prevent adverse reactions. Additionally, allergens must be clearly highlighted on food labeling to inform consumers and promote safe consumption.</data>
      <data key="d2">0a0bea4b9792f715e9d625450c4cd25c,0f0303399f29734dede9db544e1dda9e,3a7dac32347984360ee9e87767129272,a3444da30e339275da1056c3e13bcae5,e0a2b5f5d5b3682c870f787f54f6b5ef</data>
