    <node id="HOSPITAL LA FE">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Hospital La Fe, also known as Hospital Universitari i Polit&#232;cnic La Fe, is a prominent medical facility located in Valencia, Spain. This university and polyclinic hospital offers a wide range of medical services, with a particular emphasis on nutritional support and dietetics. It provides enteral nutrition formulas specifically designed for diabetes patients, as well as various treatments for individuals undergoing surgical procedures or those suffering from nutritional deficiencies. The institution is dedicated to delivering specialized care to patients with diverse medical conditions, ensuring comprehensive healthcare and support.</data>
      <data key="d2">762a80a4c9f24d778b79fdd596f343e3,ee3a1b87e74846f0f84c404a07717ebc,f0a97cbd966f5a930d9355f589d05613,f7ca532ae3a834fd6643ad694d3e850c</data>
