    </node>
    <node id="J.F. MERINO TORRES">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">J.F. Merino Torres is a prominent figure in the field of nutritional management, particularly in relation to diabetes in cystic fibrosis patients. He is a co-author of a chapter that specifically addresses the nutritional management of this condition. Additionally, he has contributed to various chapters that discuss nutritional requirements and assessments within a medical context, as well as the topic of artificial nutrition. Beyond his authorship, J.F. Merino Torres serves as the coordinator of the Comisi&#243;n de Nutrici&#243;n Artificial, Diet&#233;tica y Dietoterapia at Hospital La Fe, where he is responsible for overseeing nutritional care, further highlighting his expertise and commitment to the field of nutrition.</data>
      <data key="d2">00de48c582cca92f1a59df5fceb07bfb,3fa37a80a7ecb21c1bdd4838ed9abf2e,61ece3be5a1146d0a386ccd0a379c88b,bfe875ea294b9a390193b5de532ff71b,ee3a1b87e74846f0f84c404a07717ebc</data>
