    <node id="DEPARTAMENTO DE SALUD VALENCIA LA FE">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The Department of Health Valencia La Fe is a healthcare organization dedicated to enhancing clinical practices and patient care in Valencia. It serves as the governing body responsible for overseeing health services at Hospital La Fe, which includes the management of nutrition services. Through its initiatives, the Department aims to improve the overall quality of healthcare delivery in the region.</data>
      <data key="d2">c6e20d0537c538462ab6743aa9405954,ee3a1b87e74846f0f84c404a07717ebc</data>
