    <node id="UNIDAD DE NUTRICI&#211;N">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The "UNIDAD DE NUTRICI&#211;N" is a specialized medical unit within Hospital La Fe that plays a crucial role in the nutritional care of patients. This unit supervises patients on specialized diets to ensure they receive adequate nutrient intake and maintain health safety. It evaluates patients' dietary needs and creates personalized diet plans tailored to individual health conditions and preferences, particularly for those with complex medical issues such as cancer.

In addition to assessing and adjusting nutrition, the Unidad de Nutrici&#243;n is responsible for planning and managing dietary codes within the hospital. This includes the calibration of diet menus to ensure nutritional quality and the training of nursing staff on dietary codes and nutrition-related topics. The unit integrates closely with the Service of Endocrinology, highlighting its comprehensive approach to patient care and nutrition management.</data>
      <data key="d2">1cdda2c6d946ce6e48baae4230be531d,31f8f2c83d12928b56228d8b3f9d081c,4681d149c863ed06c99b19443f841abd,b624abf4d303854800e88f2364d190f0,e474ebdcd3e5392e4b2bed8434293849,ee3a1b87e74846f0f84c404a07717ebc</data>
