    </node>
    <node id="SERVICIO DE ENDOCRINOLOG&#205;A Y NUTRICI&#211;N">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The Servicio de Endocrinolog&#237;a y Nutrici&#243;n encompasses medical departments dedicated to the treatment and management of various endocrine and nutritional issues. At the Complejo Hospitalario de Navarra, the service focuses on addressing nutritional problems, ensuring comprehensive care for patients with dietary needs. Additionally, the service is involved in the diagnosis and nutritional follow-up of patients suffering from dysphagia, highlighting its commitment to specialized care in this area. Furthermore, at Hospital La Fe, the Servicio de Endocrinolog&#237;a y Nutrici&#243;n is responsible for managing a wide range of endocrine and nutritional health services, reinforcing its role in promoting overall health and well-being.</data>
      <data key="d2">8ff1cad741bacfef19d53bb8941b5ca9,aaef63df030ff97e66b358358491e6a5,d96ab48565912e67fdb51ccdf5a100ac,ee3a1b87e74846f0f84c404a07717ebc</data>
