    <node id="MANUAL DE NUTRICI&#211;N ARTIFICIAL">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">The "Manual de Nutrici&#243;n Artificial" is a clinical guide designed to enhance nutritional practices within healthcare settings. It serves as a resource for healthcare professionals to improve the quality of nutritional care provided to patients.</data>
