    <node id="EUROPEAN SOCIETY OF PARENTERAL AND ENTERAL NUTRITION">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The European Society of Parenteral and Enteral Nutrition (ESPEN) is an organization dedicated to advancing research and education in the field of parenteral and enteral nutrition throughout Europe. Its primary focus is on enhancing the quality of nutritional care for patients who require these forms of nutrition. ESPEN plays a crucial role in improving clinical practices by providing guidelines and recommendations that inform healthcare professionals on best practices in nutritional care. Through its efforts, ESPEN aims to support the overall improvement of nutritional practices and outcomes for patients across the continent.</data>
      <data key="d2">0b6ad83080610bbf1789d7db4c8d40ba,628cd3e2664561301cbe6679f48c4bd3,b90c0df8a9e4219d941b633154695dde,f0a97cbd966f5a930d9355f589d05613</data>
