      <data key="d5">3</data>
      <data key="d6">1634</data>
      <data key="d7">af8c2710805f438abae124d61653b7e3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="NUTRICI&#211;N ARTIFICIAL">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">"NUTRICI&#211;N ARTIFICIAL" refers to a medical intervention that provides nutritional support to patients who are unable to consume food orally. This method is crucial for individuals with severe dietary restrictions, swallowing difficulties, or specific medical conditions such as liver diseases, celiac disease, and various forms of cancer. Nutritional support can be delivered through enteral or parenteral means, depending on the patient's condition and needs.

The practice of artificial nutrition is particularly relevant in critical care settings and for patients suffering from malnutrition, metabolic disorders, or those requiring mechanical ventilation due to severe burns. It is also indicated for patients with inflammatory bowel diseases and those experiencing complications like hyponatremia or diabetes, especially in cases such as MELAS syndrome.

Artificial nutrition aims to prevent malnutrition and restore nutritional status, utilizing specialized formulas to correct deficiencies. It is a therapeutic approach that may be palliative and is not considered basic care, as its application depends on the individual circumstances of each patient. Overall, "NUTRICI&#211;N ARTIFICIAL" encompasses a range of nutritional support methods designed to meet the needs of patients who cannot achieve adequate nutrition through normal eating.</data>
      <data key="d2">05a2506becec805cd1374d73de9a9fec,0977493109f1215441cf1927961d21ee,0b02ff4978fb09a0b2a360ae8c661337,0b3eea4ed6da979f796aeba1ff2ee8d9,306519cca8810e0ff1c973128a75200a,3733abb85045220c8e373e316f858791,397cb82cce268866351c44a5b38ccb8b,428ea9c156fe3f0571b20d5d81648868,4b19145e0977ee48b7132c9915d8c284,61ece3be5a1146d0a386ccd0a379c88b,6c8b41c09b1ada129f0908d6e5d18185,6dfb109dac53e054fd015f6d8adf48ac,7c37a605ce9323c724b713aa64b7fae5,82adde9844cf0b1ccd052f91b304fb6e,85cfae7019d0efa6f0c87f5cd5b9ce8e,8a7b2d5e0440750e36603c8d3f93a68a,8d1eb00b23450a2f2cb1243ea32aa36f,8ff1cad741bacfef19d53bb8941b5ca9,916d4d35de887923f4ea5b05928f13e3,94df5002f2221058a9bb77f456a50e61,95ec74fd93c18ac23c08eb70137bc8db,99900c6d95f85a5b4b88fcfed6775cec,a56fad7f6dac4a75bd4748b247aa9215,a6ccbda174f6599eeeb2e4cdb00db5f2,addd6db95fafa3464a6f085f8d0041ce,b4580c82418cd4df97f400e183702858,beaa66c30582232126ce2c762a9c6bdb,c73e5e558cab6ae4736ce1619142c0a4,c7577b8eccf83ced48f5ecf36717b4e1,d2f4a90f3a3df7c568cd82d019bb5edd,d8ad55d79ba614f2c8906babacf0e9f6,dc8d12d9f32208671f6067b0bb64a645,e3370b71146ad5063d6b1e9c3d8a3bd2,e4b62c2ae5857a5dd11f609286271bb4,eae8ddef005974a2ffe71cf7c61b0634,efc0b55f4e91f02e4708b7cc43c64608,f0a97cbd966f5a930d9355f589d05613,f7871bbaa57d50bb5f5675cd580cb0af,fee4d9611c98c81859bccdb4ded03622</data>
