    <node id="PACIENTE QUIR&#218;RGICO">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">The "PACIENTE QUIR&#218;RGICO" refers to an individual who is undergoing a surgical procedure. This type of patient may benefit from specific nutritional formulas designed to enhance their recovery process. Specialized nutritional support is often necessary for these patients to ensure optimal healing and overall health following surgery.</data>
      <data key="d2">169eceabd2bd24183f24faccb2c00088,f0a97cbd966f5a930d9355f589d05613</data>
