      <data key="d7">64de1539090a44cab667ae3c8023bba9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="POLITRAUMATISMOS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Politraumatismos refer to multiple traumatic injuries occurring simultaneously, which often necessitate complex medical management. These injuries can lead to significant challenges in patient care, including the potential need for enteral nutrition due to the inability to ingest food normally. Consequently, patients with politraumatismos may require nutritional support as part of their recovery process, highlighting the importance of comprehensive treatment strategies in managing such complex cases.</data>
      <data key="d2">bd297992bd38c0b110dd5f0cae141f83,e5b3805730df59cb36030c92aa33c194,f0a97cbd966f5a930d9355f589d05613</data>
