      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">1637</data>
      <data key="d7">e683a203251e44f3a8fa9bf8919b2461</data>
    </node>
    <node id="SEPSIS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Sepsis is a life-threatening condition that arises from the body's extreme response to infection, leading to significant injury to its own tissues and organs. It is particularly prevalent among critically ill patients and can complicate the treatment of those requiring parenteral nutrition. The condition is characterized by systemic inflammation, which can result in elevated liver enzymes and increased energy expenditure, especially in pediatric patients. 

Sepsis can develop in various clinical contexts, including patients with short bowel syndrome, those receiving nutritional support, and individuals suffering from acute pancreatitis. It is often associated with catheter-related infections, which can significantly increase morbidity. The condition can also influence nutritional needs, potentially leading to insufficient nutrient intake and necessitating enteral nutrition. 

In managing sepsis, specific nutritional interventions, including amino acid supplementation, may be beneficial to support recovery and address the heightened metabolic stress experienced by affected patients. Overall, sepsis represents a serious medical challenge that requires urgent treatment and specialized nutritional care to improve patient outcomes.</data>
      <data key="d2">036e8182deab774d39f06cd811738c9b,056067ecde43f31b356fc39e056221ee,0f965e7f43fe2ea0144b4b16715a04ba,10bde114bd1285b3aeeec94dd4292d9e,21bd0c4198fa2be0aa931387bd631728,379909adba66c6e316f560669cd30472,417548e99612a123d61f9fd10807ce34,43883071d6db17a632d928bc976776fd,4a251705839547c8dcd0e9ddc5bb4066,88dcf64f61e33adc3702b1ec401e2d4e,8d7280a9f9085fe677f5993b12910ea2,8d9c5b85d058d0d3cde4479b5589a7d1,9562f39f9e78644164daeff3177a2f84,9fda43c414d32c5a8a3bb7354bfb1704,ace4abd79441a61d6688d67db2dc0747,b3bff0edc314389f2ac432a753fec9f7,bd297992bd38c0b110dd5f0cae141f83,be901905a9eef428a784ea179931028a,c69834419bc4c69bcafd7a81ed8535d4,cf34fdea5374cdee9a8be8f93c63e830,e5b3805730df59cb36030c92aa33c194,e945adb09eb8d9984302b72f9a2a68cb,ec69668515f0a014f1a602bcdc46c47f,ec94449c6ffff75664588262301de0a6,ee3700469e1c419d283b34f38100fa29,f0a97cbd966f5a930d9355f589d05613,f79f02438413f5accef9ac5fbd96f6df</data>
