    <node id="INSUFICIENCIA RESPIRATORIA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Insuficiencia respiratoria, or respiratory failure, is a medical condition characterized by the inability to maintain adequate gas exchange, leading to insufficient oxygen supply and/or carbon dioxide removal from the body. This condition often necessitates specialized nutritional support for affected patients, as they may experience poor fluid management and require specific nutritional formulations to aid in their recovery. Insuficiencia respiratoria can occur in patients with progressive muscle weakness, such as those suffering from Kennedy's syndrome, which further complicates their ability to breathe effectively.</data>
      <data key="d2">2cc103269ed63bac1a1b5cb76eab1916,4accb4afaddfdc671690221252ff1b99,f0a97cbd966f5a930d9355f589d05613</data>
      <data key="d3">1154</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">3</data>
      <data key="d6">1639</data>
      <data key="d7">de22543233914dc4a1a30a6b519fec01</data>
    </node>
    <node id="INSUFICIENCIA RENAL">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">"Insuficiencia renal," or renal insufficiency, is a medical condition characterized by the kidneys' inability to effectively filter waste products from the blood. This condition can lead to significant health complications, including malnutrition and the need for specialized dietary adjustments. Patients with insuficiencia renal often require tailored nutritional support to manage their health, as the condition can affect protein levels, fluid and electrolyte needs, and overall nutritional status.

The condition may necessitate the use of specific nutritional products, such as Nepro HP, designed to support individuals with kidney failure. Additionally, it can complicate the administration of certain medications and dietary restrictions, such as a low-sodium diet. In pediatric patients, renal insufficiency can impact their nutritional requirements and necessitate adjustments in parenteral nutrition formulations.

Insuficiencia renal can also be associated with other health issues, such as hyperuricemia and high triglyceride levels, which may further complicate treatment options. Overall, this serious condition requires careful medical intervention and monitoring to ensure that patients receive the appropriate nutritional support and manage their health effectively.</data>
      <data key="d2">0597a142067272f25431b8b42cb5288f,12ceae17f5df9d7a1a40ebc43156a35e,140611dbb8a68fc40712c946de92b73f,1ad59ffc3e39719e331a017fe64cd07d,2cc103269ed63bac1a1b5cb76eab1916,37ca60bdc28109c9bec995e3c433c801,541c13a95526e4d68903f0901042f292,6edff59a3b151e946e7664f13bcb0931,75a4b2d504de480eaef247aa682bfd05,79dc467f42c611bc9f285c95a6c6ff62,7eea8ed505de441028811dbb848d0fa0,9de04e5aa72249acf96899ca74c17e0b,9fda43c414d32c5a8a3bb7354bfb1704,a1b16c80a55fd88d0b1efb78addf3853,a87e8e113488b153c5b4b2d2fca712c0,aea37ea74c52c952285b3ae7db228572,bcbca87f5ebf2c5d260810cf83a70257,c6406ac5c0c7b03d4ee61ca311fd783f,ceea9bf255384db1726c76c13ce560c8,d66eff5b0a0e16993c167d3a6ffef395,e321db63d9b561eb98a4f01853b141ad,e5b3805730df59cb36030c92aa33c194,f0a97cbd966f5a930d9355f589d05613,f7871bbaa57d50bb5f5675cd580cb0af</data>
