    </node>
    <node id="ENFERMEDAD INFLAMATORIA INTESTINAL">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">"ENFERMEDAD INFLAMATORIA INTESTINAL" (Inflammatory Bowel Disease, IBD) refers to a group of chronic inflammatory disorders that affect the gastrointestinal tract, including conditions such as Crohn's disease and ulcerative colitis. These disorders are characterized by persistent inflammation, which can lead to a variety of complications, including malabsorption of nutrients, anemia, and nutritional deficiencies. The condition often necessitates specialized nutritional management to prevent malnutrition and support overall health.

Patients with ENFERMEDAD INFLAMATORIA INTESTINAL may experience significant impacts on their quality of life due to symptoms and complications associated with the disease. Nutritional intervention is frequently required, and in severe cases, enteral nutrition or parenteral nutrition may be necessary when normal dietary intake is insufficient. Additionally, clinical studies suggest that probiotic treatments may offer benefits for managing the condition.

The disease can also contribute to the formation of intestinal fistulas and may be considered in the differential diagnosis of mitochondrial diseases. Overall, ENFERMEDAD INFLAMATORIA INTESTINAL encompasses a range of inflammatory conditions that require careful dietary management and may lead to various clinical manifestations and complications, including immunosuppression and growth delays in affected patients.</data>
      <data key="d2">0977493109f1215441cf1927961d21ee,0b6ad83080610bbf1789d7db4c8d40ba,298e79737894aa157da136b1996578bf,29c2dd6ce196c0166033a861582e9721,379909adba66c6e316f560669cd30472,417548e99612a123d61f9fd10807ce34,44b25f00a145b92a9875173aafbc27c8,45ae0837b0632b026fac1053b7d9d4e8,4dff41ef8e80b9381bc674195671c430,5a1ea1a4dfb1b591756a8dc60f504da2,609140cabbcd0c7297a7029f5365d186,6321383c8b1370699d20007624cd87c8,6595cec039fe5a2c290eea9ab7e3b2fc,88647cc4d1748c5bb058d4aab1817d63,8efd8d610de6aced043032198b436f3f,a519216aaee7bf8a1317f5d6b522c4b6,b1464c57df2eaa651a10c1522ab7db68,b8db8cc3349b8ac0cce45497da6244fc,bd297992bd38c0b110dd5f0cae141f83,bf234f719a608fc6858d9a1749463539,c9790e5e47712b100fb4870d35a3edfa,d66daca6ec5ffce0fc73bce55a3c0ff0,e5542485c64706310c70513397de07f9,eaa2ba81b06f325e284b5dbdc45b5c9f,f0a97cbd966f5a930d9355f589d05613,f7d56bac9cc29e47690669e812094c99</data>
