    <node id="C&#193;NCER">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">C&#193;NCER is a complex group of diseases characterized by the uncontrolled growth of abnormal cells in the body. This condition can lead to significant health complications, including malnutrition and weight loss, as it often affects the metabolism and nutrient intake of patients. The disease is associated with various treatment modalities such as surgery, chemotherapy, radiotherapy, and immunotherapy, all of which can further complicate nutritional status and require specialized nutritional support.

Patients with cancer frequently experience increased metabolic needs and may suffer from anorexia, necessitating enteral nutrition to maintain health and manage treatment side effects. The nutritional challenges faced by cancer patients can lead to deficits and metabolic alterations that impact their quality of life. Therefore, careful dietary management is essential, and certain dietary factors, including the consumption of fruits, vegetables, and omega-3 fatty acids, have been studied for their potential influence on cancer risk and progression.

Research indicates that dietary habits and lifestyle choices play a significant role in cancer risk, with associations found between cancer and the consumption of red and processed meats, as well as salt and dairy products. Conversely, adherence to a Mediterranean diet has shown promise in reducing the risk of several types of cancer, including colorectal and breast cancer.

C&#193;NCER is a major global health issue, contributing to high morbidity and mortality rates. It is crucial for healthcare providers to address the nutritional needs of cancer patients, as proper dietary support can enhance treatment outcomes and overall well-being. The disease is also a focus of extensive research, with various thematic networks dedicated to advancing understanding and treatment of cancer through cooperative projects.</data>
      <data key="d2">16887bf1589e9515213d2e392bbc8c69,240ded3c69bd7ae82bed4089517ffb6b,24e49b0b93b2307e2c4e7ac34f4d7f4b,2ab0f03a87bdf418c83a614b2183332f,36cffc3e7c3a6fe82e50787e939f7537,3926ed628d3d5919b8a65e44fffbc3b9,44b25f00a145b92a9875173aafbc27c8,4dff41ef8e80b9381bc674195671c430,4e6568999eba5abd852eedecc5fc580f,5075c65bfc020ec93f9bf14d3fe764c3,5173ac9bd92d5f238acade41f8c65ebf,5277ea34ef65b7d029950f2c905c6732,5549895a3a7f54651e6c54f5a5d7d833,5e934738b2a8cb03468f4ebf4eec0cd2,62afbb83c3f69bd45bf24467ac5b47b8,6c8b41c09b1ada129f0908d6e5d18185,7ba4c7b49d445c147394ac626d055ef3,95ec74fd93c18ac23c08eb70137bc8db,9c3716c3860855ce045a1e5d9d30b9d1,9ce201472321f20b339146bb6b452f60,a0ef28095dacaada520d8e6fbaf518f1,a96b8f4fe52b5b963b28242c3352aa7c,b003f8a156374bb4430475f4ffe8e074,b26b998479da515c234ce46b1bfa73db,bfe7b32b596449644b274ed7486a507a,ca3fd82e042bcc480e80a1ae56b34507,ce62d279f86b3364fed4e121ad2d5e1f,ea5b0e748b16db9640ab70c394ca1a4c,f0a97cbd966f5a930d9355f589d05613,f7871bbaa57d50bb5f5675cd580cb0af,fa42f07df0762860c72a58c869627aec</data>
