    <node id="QUEMADOS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">QUEMADOS refers to individuals who have suffered severe burn injuries and are in need of specialized care, particularly in pediatric settings. These burn victims experience increased energy expenditure due to their condition, necessitating tailored dietary management to support their recovery. Specialized nutritional support is crucial for these patients to facilitate healing and improve their overall health outcomes.</data>
