      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">La Fe Hospital Universitari i Polit&#232;cnic is a comprehensive healthcare facility that operates within a university hospital system, emphasizing both medical care and education. This institution specializes in enteral and parenteral nutrition, providing essential nutritional support to patients, particularly those in surgical contexts and those requiring artificial nutrition. Additionally, La Fe Hospital is involved in the management and treatment of thrombotic conditions and related infections, offering specialized care for patients with thrombotic obstructions.

The hospital also addresses pediatric nutritional needs and conducts research across various medical fields, highlighting its commitment to advancing healthcare practices. La Fe Hospital Universitari i Polit&#232;cnic places a strong emphasis on nutritional screening for patients upon admission, ensuring that all health-related needs are met effectively. Overall, it serves as a vital resource for both healthcare services and medical education, likely located in a Spanish-speaking country.</data>
