    <node id="SONDA NASOYEYUNAL">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">SONDA NASOYEYUNAL refers to a medical device known as a nasojejunal tube, which is specifically designed for enteral feeding. This tube is inserted through the nose and extends into the jejunum, a part of the small intestine. It is utilized for nutritional support in patients who are unable to eat normally due to specific gastrointestinal conditions or when the stomach is not functioning properly. The primary purpose of the Sonda Nasoyeyunal is to provide enteral nutrition to individuals who require assistance with feeding, ensuring they receive the necessary nutrients when oral intake is not feasible.</data>
      <data key="d2">0b6ad83080610bbf1789d7db4c8d40ba,178140d0d29364593546d7d21393f2c6,20491afa9a4770e93e6cff9034f8b0f0,4dffad2ae717727b21f2294ac520f2be,70e48774a3f732e015a59d38ba2fa5d5,7295ffd1826d8ea12cf9f832ba6f80b3,f7ca532ae3a834fd6643ad694d3e850c</data>
