    <node id="K. GARC&#205;A MALPARTIDA">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">K. Garc&#237;a Malpartida is a notable author who has made significant contributions to various chapters in a comprehensive document focused on nutrition. Specifically, K. Garc&#237;a Malpartida is associated with the chapter on enteral nutrition, where they discuss its concepts and applications. Additionally, they are involved in the chapter on parenteral nutrition, addressing complications related to this form of nutrition. K. Garc&#237;a Malpartida also contributes to the chapter on nutrition and diabetes within the context of cystic fibrosis, as well as the chapter detailing nutritional requirements in a medical context. Furthermore, they play a role in the educational material concerning nutritional screening in hospitals and are involved in the chapter on nutritional assessment. Overall, K. Garc&#237;a Malpartida's work encompasses a wide range of topics related to nutrition, highlighting their expertise and commitment to the field.</data>
      <data key="d2">00de48c582cca92f1a59df5fceb07bfb,3c6db755168f2fea94b2535a81ce6f58,3fa37a80a7ecb21c1bdd4838ed9abf2e,61ece3be5a1146d0a386ccd0a379c88b,6feef8e192d7b29998dea0f23077a021,820640c45c3a696fca3c8c45b680b19b,a700a2e14ec1a75902455bcb005e1434,bd297992bd38c0b110dd5f0cae141f83,bfe875ea294b9a390193b5de532ff71b,c67141db7734dcc583e60c351c2e0772</data>
