    <node id="HOSPITAL UNIVERSITARIO Y POLIT&#201;CNICO LA FE">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The Hospital Universitario y Polit&#233;cnico La Fe is located in Valencia and is notable for its comprehensive healthcare services. Dr. Juan Francisco Merino Torres serves as the head of the Endocrinology and Nutrition Service at this hospital, where he is responsible for overseeing the department's operations. The hospital is dedicated to improving the nutritional status of both inpatients and outpatients, ensuring that patients receive the necessary support for their dietary needs. Additionally, the Hospital Universitario y Polit&#233;cnico La Fe features a human milk bank, which provides essential resources for premature infants who require specialized nutritional support.</data>
      <data key="d2">0977493109f1215441cf1927961d21ee,201f8e6a0d6c49396cf9c81f5da4520f,234b514a40a64bc02f1346cb62cf3f97,4734ce2075bc72c352950c018bab7185,a00805212febe78884955ddd3476f6ca</data>
