    <node id="MARASMO">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Marasmo is a type of severe malnutrition characterized by insufficient caloric intake, which results in a specific clinical presentation. It is primarily caused by a deficiency of both calories and protein, leading to significant weight loss and muscle wasting. This condition reflects a critical state of undernutrition, where the body does not receive the necessary nutrients to maintain normal physiological functions.</data>
      <data key="d2">42f51d76ff4164f7e731f1af04780490,4734ce2075bc72c352950c018bab7185</data>
      <data key="d3">1436</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">2</data>
      <data key="d6">1691</data>
      <data key="d7">7593044d6e7c4b55a5100357731ae10e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="KWASHIORKOR">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Kwashiorkor is a severe form of malnutrition primarily resulting from a protein-deficient diet. It is often characterized by symptoms such as edema and growth failure, particularly in children. In addition to its primary association with protein deficiency, Kwashiorkor can also be linked to severe nutritional deficiencies, including low copper levels. Furthermore, this condition can impact lactase activity in infants and young children, potentially affecting their ability to digest lactose. Overall, Kwashiorkor represents a critical health issue related to inadequate protein intake and its associated complications.</data>
      <data key="d2">232591ff32b33e56e95717d4582a5903,2a387a0f62fd64b31ecf55b1538932c2,42f51d76ff4164f7e731f1af04780490,4734ce2075bc72c352950c018bab7185,c43f12d9be878da7ceb2074808ca7922</data>
      <data key="d3">1436</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">4</data>
      <data key="d6">1692</data>
      <data key="d7">4b2c1db2302a4d388b153763c1191b18</data>
    </node>
    <node id="MIXTA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">A type of malnutrition that involves both caloric and protein deficiencies.</data>
      <data key="d2">4734ce2075bc72c352950c018bab7185</data>
