    </node>
    <node id="MALNUTRICI&#211;N">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Malnutrici&#243;n, or malnutrition, is a significant health condition characterized by an inadequate or unbalanced intake of nutrients, which can lead to various complications and negatively impact the quality of life. It is particularly prevalent among cancer patients, where it manifests as weight loss, decreased muscle mass, and diminished strength, complicating treatment and recovery. This condition can arise from several factors, including chronic diseases such as cancer, renal insufficiency, liver disease, and conditions like dysphagia, which hinder proper nutrient intake.

In cancer patients, malnutrition is a common diagnosis, affecting approximately 80% of those with advanced gastric cancer and leading to poor health outcomes and increased mortality rates. It can also complicate recovery in patients undergoing surgical procedures and those receiving treatments like hematopoietic cell transplantation. Nutritional deficiencies in these patients can result in a weakened immune response, prolonged hospital stays, and a greater risk of complications.

Malnutrition is not limited to cancer patients; it is also a critical issue among the elderly, particularly those in palliative care, where it can lead to functional and social incapacity. In geriatric patients, malnutrition may necessitate nutritional support interventions to improve health outcomes. Additionally, malnutrition can occur in patients with chronic kidney disease, liver disease, and other conditions, often requiring specialized dietary considerations and interventions, such as parenteral nutrition.

Overall, malnutrition encompasses both undernutrition and overnutrition, affecting health and well-being across various populations. It is essential to recognize and address malnutrition through appropriate nutritional assessments and interventions to enhance recovery and quality of life for affected individuals.</data>
      <data key="d2">0597a142067272f25431b8b42cb5288f,0bc48d0666e895b990c211acf7cbcf23,0d083c309fb6f4d0d16c0e2b23ea5c8b,1130db2843c569042990b711cf15d8ee,1ba0aa1d1330351a62eb6319ffdd30db,1f9d0f4850dde2dbd335969b016fc359,21634801ee74e0828836551dbeb8b1ed,24e49b0b93b2307e2c4e7ac34f4d7f4b,2754a719b063eed550046e5b405be3d5,27c75984e62c5adcac1ac33cbdc520dc,2b8c323c265f8f7f3d15bf988bf1f9ee,2b9c137acf3599eaa41c3514aba67a8a,2c60ced31055ac58d76da9c1e90c8e9d,30d5c2ac31f39f8177bec50f6b5e631b,395385fad73fd5b7ed9eda114b482624,3ee948dc4ddfdc75daa8fe7db9bb471e,417548e99612a123d61f9fd10807ce34,4335489f570bb14684484e76cd6c196f,4b5441741b392c27b7f7c29cc79e13a5,541c13a95526e4d68903f0901042f292,54f3b76c0240696aa63ae60ad52b82b6,5549895a3a7f54651e6c54f5a5d7d833,5664277128c865feb0e93f9fd56a3d05,58af2bdd20eeb5647ecc8088732833d8,5bda98c244ed300cfc07192e54c7eb88,5e934738b2a8cb03468f4ebf4eec0cd2,61564a330848cb173088bd08e1a9a181,639ebafae8a95bb03a09e111172b9a4e,6c8b41c09b1ada129f0908d6e5d18185,71dd228326087dc7aaa0d310d49b6f42,7949b821c1ca2e4adc524e7775626396,7c0d1f274b31d130e4feb8e46fbeb764,8169062e4a75aaf466ffa4affa509241,933d6526b2d313c95c9f4aaa950a62a3,9426220ccd162a5796b1bb2cb373e29f,98f9ca00cf50b7e359aa41f1d58d0735,9c3716c3860855ce045a1e5d9d30b9d1,9da930839072b524410f2345ab1df8b1,a25b0f84bc321cad942a2e33f681a5e4,a6ed8551aad722adcaf8fced4ac8685b,a7baff5fb024c516ea6ae8c236dc945d,a87e8e113488b153c5b4b2d2fca712c0,a96b8f4fe52b5b963b28242c3352aa7c,b4b789f8b1484fea88d0b5c58dfde854,b6180d67d6fdf45ff73aa2a63a8e3f74,bd3162e408d0d1ddd770ea833aad5ff3,bf234f719a608fc6858d9a1749463539,bf76380d2417653bab17a6a9b91d85bc,c69834419bc4c69bcafd7a81ed8535d4,ce62d279f86b3364fed4e121ad2d5e1f,d3f53b7b7352e8ba2fd9dc8be977648c,d66daca6ec5ffce0fc73bce55a3c0ff0,e329b5d4c64709889680df357bd1cc09,e7a9d9aa3031b4c032d724047f80ebe9,ed9dfe1b1e334597565187840983df05,f087e20586f6b263059597e194a04993,f75d1340b39e345875bf878dba07ab8c,fe69a5b07baa1ca7328e65ff39f7719a</data>
