    <node id="&#205;NDICE DE MASA CORPORAL (IMC)">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">The &#205;ndice de Masa Corporal (IMC), known in English as Body Mass Index (BMI), is a metric utilized to evaluate body weight in relation to height. It serves as a tool in nutritional assessments and is instrumental in classifying individuals into various weight categories based on their weight relative to their height. This classification helps in understanding an individual's body composition and potential health risks associated with different weight statuses.</data>
      <data key="d2">0bc48d0666e895b990c211acf7cbcf23,30d5c2ac31f39f8177bec50f6b5e631b</data>
      <data key="d3">1368</data>
