    <node id="CIRCUNFERENCIA BRAQUIAL">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">The "CIRCUNFERENCIA BRAQUIAL," or brachial circumference, is a measurement of the upper arm that serves as an important tool for assessing muscle mass and nutritional status. It is particularly relevant in evaluating body composition among patients with chronic diseases. This measurement is utilized to estimate lean body mass and is a key component in the nutritional assessment of individuals, helping healthcare professionals gauge overall health and nutritional needs.</data>
      <data key="d2">3356667d6f35de6a8587ece00f8c6580,8e8aac45bfe71fa006f622690dfdbbb8,9704c66c0d725d94e3dbd8f09440ed27,c69834419bc4c69bcafd7a81ed8535d4,ea7d8ba0550547d4cff0b5d18c3f6ae5</data>
