    </node>
    <node id="NITR&#211;GENO">
      <data key="d0" />
      <data key="d1">NITR&#211;GENO is a crucial element in the field of nutrition, particularly in the formulation of amino acid solutions used for parenteral nutrition. It plays a vital role as a key component in amino acids and proteins, which are essential for maintaining health. The balance of nitrogen is especially important for overall well-being, with particular significance for older adults who may require careful management of their nutritional intake.</data>
      <data key="d2">30d5c2ac31f39f8177bec50f6b5e631b,45628dcc866de3617e83105d66f901ad,60577bdc0f4979d10ba7385bf483c344</data>
