    <node id="PLIEGUES TRICIPITAL">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Pliegues tricipital refers to a specific measurement related to body fat distribution, commonly utilized in health assessments. It specifically denotes the tricep skinfold measurement, which is employed to evaluate body fat levels in individuals. This measurement is an important tool in understanding an individual's body composition and overall health.</data>
