    <node id="HOMBRES">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Hombres refers to male individuals, specifically categorized into different age groups for the purpose of dietary and nutritional studies. This group includes male adolescents aged 9-18 years, for whom specific dietary needs and recommendations are outlined in nutritional guidelines. Additionally, the term encompasses men aged 60-69 and older, who also have particular dietary recommendations, especially concerning Vitamin B&#8321;&#8322; and other essential nutrients. Overall, Hombres represents a diverse demographic with tailored nutritional requirements based on age.</data>
