    <node id="PESO">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">PESO refers to the weight of the patient, which is a crucial metric evaluated to determine weight loss during the cribage process. Monitoring weight is essential for assessing the nutritional needs and calculating energy expenditure for hospitalized patients. The measurement of a patient's body weight over time is closely tracked throughout their treatment to ensure appropriate care and support.</data>
