    <node id="FACTOR DE ESTR&#201;S">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Factor de Estr&#233;s refers to various medical conditions that can affect a patient's metabolic needs, including major surgery, moderate infection, polytrauma, sepsis, and burns.</data>
