    <node id="POLITRAUMATISMO">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Politraumatismo refers to a medical condition characterized by multiple traumatic injuries occurring simultaneously in a patient. This condition often necessitates complex medical intervention due to the severity and variety of the injuries sustained. Additionally, patients experiencing politraumatismo may require specialized nutritional support to aid in their recovery and overall management of their injuries.</data>
      <data key="d2">056067ecde43f31b356fc39e056221ee,51ccbecf506101052f08de7cbbaa6b62</data>
