    </node>
    <node id="QUEMADURAS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">QUEMADURAS refer to injuries that affect the skin and other tissues, resulting from exposure to heat, chemicals, electricity, or radiation. These injuries can be treated with immunomodulatory formulas, particularly in patients who have suffered burns.</data>
      <data key="d2">056067ecde43f31b356fc39e056221ee,d77e49d1dba3a67fbc9cf58911dc2478</data>
