    <node id="TALLA">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">TALLA refers to a measurement used to classify nutritional status, particularly in relation to child growth and health. It specifically denotes the height of an individual, which plays a crucial role in determining ideal body weight and assessing nutritional needs.</data>
      <data key="d2">056067ecde43f31b356fc39e056221ee,21634801ee74e0828836551dbeb8b1ed</data>
