    <node id="PESO IDEAL">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">"PESO IDEAL" refers to a calculated weight that is deemed optimal for health, taking into account factors such as height and body mass index (BMI). For a specific patient, the ideal weight has been determined to be 53.5 kg, based on their height and BMI. This concept emphasizes the importance of maintaining a weight that supports overall health and well-being.</data>
      <data key="d2">056067ecde43f31b356fc39e056221ee,c3975fe03d2af26b95b09795c7769e8b</data>
