      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">"DESNUTRICI&#211;N HOSPITALARIA" refers to the condition of hospital malnutrition, which affects patients during their stay in healthcare facilities. This condition is characterized by inadequate nutritional status and undernourishment, often necessitating specific nutritional interventions to address the issue. Hospital malnutrition is a significant concern within the healthcare setting, highlighting the importance of proper nutritional care for patients while they are receiving treatment.</data>
