    <node id="ELIA M">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Elia M is a prominent researcher in the field of nutrition, particularly known for her contributions to nutritional screening and interventions. She is a co-author of the Malnutrition Universal Screening Tool (MUST) and has played a significant role in developing the ESPEN guidelines for nutrition screening. Her research primarily focuses on the impact of nutritional interventions on health outcomes in older adults. Additionally, Elia M has authored a systematic review on enteral nutritional support in cancer patients and has studied the effects of oral glutamine supplementation in patients undergoing bone marrow transplants. Furthermore, she has contributed to a systematic review and meta-analysis of fibre-containing enteral formulae, highlighting her extensive involvement in advancing nutritional research and practice.</data>
      <data key="d2">005b22fc9dae5f9b135f0c8ba729819f,3ec3efbe130c20d623681e00e3d784f7,42b1be887a83da3e796a9cec7a082b11,a700a2e14ec1a75902455bcb005e1434,ceb66a898fed371e013171c43a87e1d1</data>
