    <node id="VELLAS B">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Vellas B is a prominent researcher specializing in the fields of frailty and aging. He has made significant contributions to the development and review of the Mini Nutritional Assessment, which is widely used in clinical settings to evaluate nutritional status. Additionally, Vellas B is an author of the ESPEN guidelines for nutrition screening, further underscoring his expertise and influence in the area of nutritional assessment and its applications in healthcare.</data>
      <data key="d2">3be9d646c354d76527755d79a77c916b,83d00bec042a3fe8b69d68316d8569ff,a700a2e14ec1a75902455bcb005e1434</data>
