    <node id="PLAUTH M">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Plauth M is a prominent author and researcher in the field of nutrition, particularly in relation to liver disease. He has made significant contributions to the ESPEN (European Society for Clinical Nutrition and Metabolism) guidelines, specifically focusing on parenteral nutrition in hepatology and enteral nutrition in liver disease. Additionally, Plauth M has conducted research on cachexia in liver cirrhosis, further highlighting his expertise and commitment to improving nutritional care for patients with liver conditions. His work in developing guidelines for nutrition screening also underscores his role in advancing clinical practices in this area.</data>
