      <data key="d1">Mueller C is a researcher who has made significant contributions to the field of nutrition, particularly in the development of clinical guidelines. They are notably recognized as an author of the ASPEN clinical guidelines for nutrition screening and assessment, which serve as a vital resource for healthcare professionals in evaluating and addressing nutritional needs.</data>
