    <node id="SALAS-SALVAD&#211; J">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Salas-Salvad&#243; J is a prominent researcher known for his investigations into the Mediterranean diet and its role in the prevention of diabetes. In addition to his research contributions, he is also recognized as an author referenced in the bibliography concerning the SEEDO consensus, which focuses on the evaluation of overweight and obesity. His work bridges the fields of nutrition and public health, highlighting the importance of dietary patterns in managing health outcomes.</data>
