    <node id="SONDA">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">SONDA refers to a medical device utilized for administering enteral nutrition to patients who are unable to feed themselves orally. This device is positioned supradiaphragmatically to facilitate access to the stomach, allowing for the direct delivery of nutrients to the stomach or intestines. The sonda serves as a crucial tool in providing necessary nutrition to individuals requiring medical support for their dietary needs.</data>
      <data key="d2">029b25f481d41458f45f1711f98c970f,3c6db755168f2fea94b2535a81ce6f58,6a5102072d17111dafe768ab7d38f41a,820640c45c3a696fca3c8c45b680b19b,c78e1786c296e2b8a7ad428c0fb10c36</data>
