    </node>
    <node id="E. L&#211;PEZ BRIZ">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">E. L&#243;pez Briz is a medical professional who specializes in enteral medication administration and is actively involved in providing recommendations for this practice. Additionally, E. L&#243;pez Briz is one of the authors contributing to the chapter on Parenteral Nutrition, showcasing expertise in nutritional support. Furthermore, E. L&#243;pez Briz discusses complications related to long-term central venous catheters in pediatrics, indicating a focus on the challenges and considerations in pediatric care. Overall, E. L&#243;pez Briz's work encompasses both enteral and parenteral nutrition, as well as the management of complications associated with intravenous access in children.</data>
      <data key="d2">58e7286e0ab9d6d52b4c70dadb8b001f,7c60735b2451e2d314fe6c5377b7a79d,820640c45c3a696fca3c8c45b680b19b,bb6ff0a9ac5248b96f246a39919aa779</data>
