    <node id="A. V&#193;ZQUEZ POLO">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">A. V&#225;zquez Polo is a medical professional with expertise in the recommendations for medication administration, specifically focusing on enteral feeding methods. In addition to this role, A. V&#225;zquez Polo is also an author who has contributed to significant medical literature, including a chapter on hematopoietic stem cell transplantation and another on parenteral nutrition. This diverse involvement highlights A. V&#225;zquez Polo's commitment to advancing knowledge and practices in the field of medical nutrition and patient care.</data>
      <data key="d2">58e7286e0ab9d6d52b4c70dadb8b001f,61890d3cb54fb752b95a4dfad8db8bb6,820640c45c3a696fca3c8c45b680b19b,bb6ff0a9ac5248b96f246a39919aa779</data>
