    </node>
    <node id="P. MARRERO &#193;LVAREZ">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">P. Marrero &#193;lvarez is a medical professional who specializes in providing recommendations for the administration of medications through enteral feeding. This involves guiding the proper methods and practices for delivering enteral medications to patients, ensuring their safety and efficacy in treatment.</data>
      <data key="d2">58e7286e0ab9d6d52b4c70dadb8b001f,bb6ff0a9ac5248b96f246a39919aa779</data>
