    <node id="K. GARC&#205;A">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">K. Garc&#237;a is a notable figure in the field of nutrition and endocrinology, recognized for their contributions to the management of diarrhea in enteral nutrition. As a co-author of the algorithm designed for this purpose, K. Garc&#237;a plays a significant role in developing effective strategies for patients requiring enteral feeding. Additionally, K. Garc&#237;a is a member of the Endocrinology and Nutrition Service, where they contribute to the management of dysphagia, further highlighting their expertise in nutritional care. Their involvement in creating recommendations for managing diarrhea in enteral nutrition underscores their commitment to improving patient outcomes in this area.</data>
      <data key="d2">0f426d03e5adabc2a16b5c9a9df1c32c,52a0434694f8face489cdb4c8d206a9e,d96ab48565912e67fdb51ccdf5a100ac</data>
      <data key="d3">903</data>
