      <data key="d5">3</data>
      <data key="d6">1920</data>
      <data key="d7">9ab1c553c91f41779a0711b5a7dfcb78</data>
    </node>
    <node id="M. ARGENTE">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">M. Argente is a prominent figure in the field of nutrition and endocrinology, actively contributing to various protocols and recommendations. They are a co-author of an algorithm designed for managing diarrhea in enteral nutrition, highlighting their expertise in this area. Additionally, M. Argente is a member of the Endocrinology and Nutrition Service, where they play a significant role in the development of dysphagia protocols. Furthermore, M. Argente has also contributed to discussions regarding complications associated with parenteral nutrition, showcasing a comprehensive involvement in addressing critical issues related to nutritional management.</data>
      <data key="d2">0f426d03e5adabc2a16b5c9a9df1c32c,52a0434694f8face489cdb4c8d206a9e,6feef8e192d7b29998dea0f23077a021,d96ab48565912e67fdb51ccdf5a100ac</data>
      <data key="d3">902</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
