    </node>
    <node id="SERVICIO DE FARMACIA">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The Servicio de Farmacia is a pharmacy service that plays a crucial role in hospitals by assisting with medication administration queries. It is responsible for managing medications and nutritional products, ensuring their proper administration, and overseeing the handling of unused supplies. This comprehensive approach ensures that patients receive the correct medications while maintaining safety and efficiency in pharmaceutical care.</data>
      <data key="d2">52a0434694f8face489cdb4c8d206a9e,b7fb13d01f792b754e667a3a5bcdba93</data>
      <data key="d3">588</data>
