    </node>
    <node id="SONDA ENTERAL">
      <data key="d0" />
      <data key="d1">SONDA ENTERAL refers to a medical device known as an enteral feeding tube, which is utilized to deliver nutrition directly to the stomach or intestines. This device is particularly important for patients who are unable to consume food orally. The enteral feeding tube serves as a critical means of providing necessary nutrients to individuals who may be experiencing difficulties with traditional feeding methods. In summary, the SONDA ENTERAL is essential for administering nutrition directly to the gastrointestinal tract in patients who cannot eat by mouth.</data>
      <data key="d2">0b3eea4ed6da979f796aeba1ff2ee8d9,0e014859b304da60c29590e36c9cbc85,52a0434694f8face489cdb4c8d206a9e,5d4476c2c40af44f9d54628af0ac463d</data>
      <data key="d3">1186</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">10</data>
      <data key="d6">1925</data>
      <data key="d7">40317c3f93d642a1a7718c2e3319d67b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="GENERALITAT HOSPITAL UNIVERSITARI">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Generalitat Hospital Universitari is a modern hospital that provides various medical services, including nutritional support.</data>
      <data key="d2">820640c45c3a696fca3c8c45b680b19b</data>
      <data key="d3">588</data>
