    <node id="OBESITY">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Obesity is a complex medical condition characterized by excessive body fat accumulation, which can lead to a variety of health issues, including diabetes, cardiovascular diseases, metabolic syndrome, and an increased risk of certain cancers. It often arises from an imbalance between calorie intake and expenditure, and is influenced by factors such as poor nutrition, lifestyle choices, hormonal treatments, and even the intestinal microbiota. 

This condition is particularly concerning in specific populations, such as children and women with Polycystic Ovary Syndrome, and is also associated with comorbidities like Klinefelter syndrome. In patients who have undergone liver transplantation, obesity may develop due to nutritional imbalances. 

Obesity is classified into different stages based on body mass index (BMI) and is often addressed through dietary modifications, including very low-calorie diets (VLCD) and low-fat diets. Pharmacological treatments, such as drugs like BN and liraglutide, are also being utilized to manage obesity. In some cases, bariatric surgery is considered as a treatment option, although it can lead to various health complications.

Overall, obesity is a prevalent metabolic disorder that significantly deteriorates quality of life and necessitates individualized nutritional goals and dietary evaluations to effectively manage and mitigate its associated health risks.</data>
      <data key="d2">018644ab78da6f804c57546f08ff6a65,032fc2148da74e586c8fd91e073c2be6,0381a11415dca4cfeda74f1de745d6ae,1388342730ee9177144f78f9e9d7816e,20863ac06779722abc2cbc2dd023777e,2582e3a8c599c599624ee99e7754a7e0,2689c33de87eab465f004fff5f0530b8,341d121c4c1cc1e4fb942e4b23f6931b,428616513e9e654c21ede19bd544ffbc,52d93d6adba464a2397ddec01d152840,5509bb6959e4faa5989289c1ddbcc96b,55aabc274c460459322072406f17d52c,5c8bb96f818f658375def01d5ad51dd2,64821313d6eb9af473ab515aff2ba3c7,6517add809ee588bede013f59f20b0ef,70bc9625e649f5e478fdef15e27dda58,70e4538100be270d06e7a3cdc254ba28,89ca65c4bdc30027c9c9ed1e1b442939,8ad412c188e4086d686c217c6c5c5324,959173b0e9d9c5ea2edabff579240462,a3e3a651e24883d279405241439b58bc,b0a60df651e774a77b1969babdf3b21a,b110392fc91bc3d7875124ec3fa07c46,b2549791b62afc5e1244c2c610af55e6,b602544ec2048878e40226cd2c0b29d4,c3182f51249513a920db6b935632fead,cf34fdea5374cdee9a8be8f93c63e830,dda58e50ce4bb9fa40e3c61e40e1b9c7,df284534230932ffa363470a1a101b29,e5b6965b2fc3b73112c8bd3bdb58738f,e7a633f303c813ee9f0b7f55e7a0968a,ea79efb65695c260a301f5c42237e2cb,ecd0e2cc6ed4a480591f4ac32cd7f691,f44811ae5b3e9dab0f295efe8842767a,f9aab8a2d805b64afaa1c261f3947869</data>
