    <node id="DIALYSIS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Dialysis is a medical treatment for renal failure, primarily utilized for patients suffering from chronic kidney disease. This treatment significantly impacts the protein and amino acid requirements of these patients, necessitating specific dietary recommendations to ensure their nutritional needs are met.</data>
      <data key="d2">cf34fdea5374cdee9a8be8f93c63e830,da58daf0bc31441182ccfd5807a91127</data>
