    <node id="MAGNESIO">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">MAGNESIO, or magnesium, is an essential mineral that plays a crucial role in numerous biological functions and biochemical reactions within the body. It is vital for muscle and nerve function, the regulation of blood pressure, and is involved in over 300 enzymatic reactions, including those related to energy production and calcium metabolism. Magnesium is primarily absorbed in the distal small intestine and is found in various food sources, particularly in plant-based options such as vegetables, legumes, nuts, and dairy products.

In clinical settings, magnesium is monitored and adjusted in parenteral nutrition to meet patient requirements, especially for those with specific health conditions. Deficiency in magnesium can negatively impact health, contributing to complications in diseases such as cardiovascular issues, diabetes, osteoporosis, and malabsorption syndromes. It is particularly important for patients with chronic liver disease, inflammatory bowel disease, and those undergoing treatments that may lead to deficiencies, such as long-term aminoglycoside therapy or hematopoietic cell transplants.

Magnesium is also recognized for its laxative properties, aiding in the relief of constipation, and is considered a protective factor against urinary crystallization, helping to prevent kidney stones. Its deficiency, while rare, can occur in patients experiencing significant diarrhea or other health complications. Recommended daily intake levels of magnesium vary by age and gender, and it is included in nutritional recommendations for children and older adults.

Overall, magnesium is an essential nutrient that must be adequately supplied through diet or supplementation, particularly in specific populations or clinical situations, to support overall health and prevent serious health issues.</data>
      <data key="d2">04f886244ff7d736eb270f175d6b120e,0dab18980ece5562db9bbd4a3bb9f9ac,1d2e960cc2c2980890a657d98fab39b6,29b354fe9b007cadb55ce27555391d5a,2cff1005fe34ac994249b78b4ca112c7,2f548ddee569586dbe82ca124f2695e9,3bd46addca98ca875c66aab3827bbf5f,3bfd2ce2b4408f718fd35e43c03965c7,4296623c2da263830137344ead99ba92,44bcef3c5453091f304bd39882ae1a07,44f263c31f91c1bc594cbb28bd397c89,4a88c4a9d485f88fca1d0f03e2e277a5,565aef05382a327b4bdefb2ab3d3b4be,57d928013f61475d356dcec181cc0c6c,5cab61b11d03ef705141159d100ae7c5,5fb0e4d2f6efd6c6abcd9f7b7583ed7f,609140cabbcd0c7297a7029f5365d186,64d85b2cd48849f9143370c8c04ab04c,74a9c62d0f932e27419151241f7db445,764b89f13f6ebf12ba0d0ec4a73d2c68,808759fcf017fe581d5c893c7a29c5be,846a0cb8b0428de4dd313cf55913d6bd,863198ceabd6e1c11a0d0944c676737c,86a4647fb1fa580f7b72aa4833965ecb,8bcd338de10fbee8f3c808cc30b69b25,91f7ece6ed9226a98b3f59f46000ebf6,9200477669cf2a6e6f67f912c729ddc6,9f0536c07d1aae0e5d1a66d06697f416,a45daf363c832c36bc8ece57f5887f53,a4886f74d848ccd61cefcaab3103f233,b1d4c144806ac7875725e152251868f3,b789dfd7a5aa36fac33c5c881a1a4981,bd26f1257d0d7f3e1de6624b3b4a3cc2,c00d7a0a842e45f78f71c27adecde3f9,c6db4a9613e32e9237476d5dcda073b3,cb892163c42e6e5ec9dede2d66693978,cd2b394eb36bf2bba5fba6e1145cdda2,d1d2d307f9b3ceb8f8a21846f314b260,d6abfd0fdff414c8f98db6dc3c239723,d936cb199b788cfcddbfb6e51b1e6e48,eaa2ba81b06f325e284b5dbdc45b5c9f,eff56271e184ab2f11877bfab7f715c4,f1635e39e27702010af8222ea31360d6,f718747b68f5c2d9d67148f05fd2d4ef,fa356397bc52582bdbbd1868639feec9</data>
