    <node id="VITAMINA D">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">VITAMINA D, also known as Vitamin D, is an essential fat-soluble nutrient crucial for maintaining bone health and regulating calcium and phosphate levels in the body. It plays a significant role in calcium absorption, which is vital for preventing conditions such as osteoporosis, rickets, and osteomalacia. Deficiencies in Vitamin D are common, particularly among older adults, individuals with limited sun exposure, and those with certain health conditions, including chronic kidney disease, cirrhosis, and inflammatory bowel disease. 

The recommended daily intake of Vitamin D varies, with suggestions typically ranging from 400 to 1000 IU, depending on age and health status. For instance, infants, especially those who are exclusively breastfed, are advised to receive a daily supplement of 400 IU to prevent deficiency. In older adults, adequate levels of Vitamin D are essential for maintaining muscle strength and reducing the risk of falls and fractures.

Vitamin D can be synthesized in the skin upon exposure to sunlight, but it is also found in dietary sources such as fatty fish, eggs, and fortified dairy products. In certain populations, such as those with obesity or undergoing bariatric surgery, supplementation may be necessary to achieve optimal levels. Additionally, Vitamin D is often monitored in patients receiving parenteral nutrition and those with elevated parathyroid hormone (PTH) levels.

Beyond its role in bone health, Vitamin D has been associated with various other health benefits, including potential protective effects against certain cancers, cardiovascular diseases, and cognitive decline. It is also important for immune function and may influence insulin secretion and glucose metabolism.

In summary, VITAMINA D is a vital nutrient that supports overall health, particularly bone and muscle function, and is often supplemented in various populations to prevent deficiencies and promote well-being.</data>
      <data key="d2">01d01bb87220a5cf6d7b37d95834e15f,036e8182deab774d39f06cd811738c9b,05ad4e8782ea0fc2d2347d73a0b5c704,06f547bc6311ffa370bc1a65dc7184d2,0c6c9eb4aba5c4642a75d76bd7ea08ba,0dab18980ece5562db9bbd4a3bb9f9ac,1052683f23a0c9825af9c5c1d39ceb2c,16887bf1589e9515213d2e392bbc8c69,16e694ae79763a00ceb974feca8e733d,17b7995dcf275c50629c7e3d4723882e,18f04b0302d49a339210d54d9cc55cd3,1d2e960cc2c2980890a657d98fab39b6,28633689bf0b9bc990e61fb26722ce16,2a1b909c98067bf7fc270d6f30199f96,2f548ddee569586dbe82ca124f2695e9,30676865841b1573426895ff17c40ab4,3202b451a4ece0fc376bd2899a412bef,368804d3e1f8a58c4e6c3a8210f08a35,4296623c2da263830137344ead99ba92,4335489f570bb14684484e76cd6c196f,49e05b04f80c53d5f20f7d97f970f5dd,51729d1c2f83f752895eaca1969e2c0d,62afbb83c3f69bd45bf24467ac5b47b8,6aa8928e063b4107007dc14cc1b301bd,6ff2742793c37a38db1c11c14d2a6629,71dd228326087dc7aaa0d310d49b6f42,7427cd5c0088cf9c6ea0134ccf5f7e4f,743649231e27012822c870ff5878263c,74a9c62d0f932e27419151241f7db445,764b89f13f6ebf12ba0d0ec4a73d2c68,7925a5f252f3bfc107f8199401edf824,7ba4a7e7b4c409f6d4c6979a7de6c832,88647cc4d1748c5bb058d4aab1817d63,8bcd338de10fbee8f3c808cc30b69b25,8f51c67fbf44368dcfc2d7c767e2cef6,91f7ece6ed9226a98b3f59f46000ebf6,94afd4bf40b661992e66cf7963ef236c,9f38649a548112c415a1c33a8aa72d68,9f77fc213da2123b013166c181a60323,a25b0f84bc321cad942a2e33f681a5e4,a45daf363c832c36bc8ece57f5887f53,a4886f74d848ccd61cefcaab3103f233,a6a4604a5fc2c91b714b6ba568bb0090,aa44a32ccc29ae80ddbbc4a77b33a297,ae2bf939fd143e4d8d998722ad86ba66,b2bdb1e00976001800583298f8dddc7a,b36323a01af9698c9ac089dd8d37213d,b68dc7398a80c0b67d28b1d9f73ff885,b86f20e3d8bb0128635881d88ba6bdfa,bf234f719a608fc6858d9a1749463539,c00d7a0a842e45f78f71c27adecde3f9,c6562eb1ee41febabe53bb8f2152f119,c947e3441a061fe1807f7aaf29becdce,caab2e12a2bce3c947d663cf8b71cb67,ce9cd0d993ab8b3995c1a78e9306bcad,d0f40e5a802daab3992f9e1746a82467,d600b483c44c0647e40e4775e0936044,da58ef987e74d508eb95395230f21cdc,dd8d59465dd2648ee8f73d8d2c95fe56,e4002acd67016cc1f7428e0a3ab42977,e55543c6579d036d25f25eb2ff63fcf2,e945adb09eb8d9984302b72f9a2a68cb,eaa2ba81b06f325e284b5dbdc45b5c9f,ed9dfe1b1e334597565187840983df05,ed9fbb82a9162d601f8370ef97810e54,f1635e39e27702010af8222ea31360d6,f3d21fef234a5c6fed6ef3fb2c8da1f4,f718747b68f5c2d9d67148f05fd2d4ef,fe2e0137e7ca501d13c9a8fa4d800377</data>
