      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">7</data>
      <data key="d6">2002</data>
      <data key="d7">a57f7048106b43d79fb7778db8273635</data>
    </node>
    <node id="VITAMINA B12">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">VITAMINA B12, also known as Cobalamin, is a crucial water-soluble vitamin that plays an essential role in various bodily functions, particularly in the formation of red blood cells and the maintenance of the nervous system. It is vital for nerve function and the production of DNA, and its deficiency can lead to significant health issues, including anemia and neurological problems.

Deficiency in VITAMINA B12 is commonly observed in individuals with unbalanced diets, particularly among vegans, the elderly, and patients with certain medical conditions such as celiac disease, inflammatory bowel disease, and those who have undergone gastric bypass surgery. These groups may require supplementation to prevent deficiencies. Additionally, patients undergoing dialysis may also need VITAMINA B12 supplementation due to losses during treatment.

VITAMINA B12 is typically monitored in patients with cystic fibrosis and those receiving parenteral nutrition, as absorption issues can arise in these populations. It is included in various multivitamin formulations, such as Infuvite Pedi&#225;trico, to support overall health. The vitamin is found naturally in foods such as liver, eggs, milk, and fish, and specific intake recommendations exist to ensure adequate levels.

Despite its importance, upper limits for VITAMINA B12 intake have not been established due to a lack of data on adverse effects. The recommended daily intake is approximately 5 micrograms. VITAMINA B12 works in conjunction with folate to help prevent elevated homocysteine levels, which are associated with various health risks. 

In summary, VITAMINA B12 is an essential nutrient that requires careful monitoring and supplementation in certain populations to maintain optimal health and prevent deficiencies.</data>
      <data key="d2">17b7995dcf275c50629c7e3d4723882e,2a1b909c98067bf7fc270d6f30199f96,3202b451a4ece0fc376bd2899a412bef,3bd46addca98ca875c66aab3827bbf5f,3f295222427803a7fc92b83386e5ec56,4335489f570bb14684484e76cd6c196f,45ae0837b0632b026fac1053b7d9d4e8,49d3f1ca700a7974db89e684f3744a40,49e05b04f80c53d5f20f7d97f970f5dd,4d3437a0370e3fe7789ba3908d445576,609140cabbcd0c7297a7029f5365d186,62afbb83c3f69bd45bf24467ac5b47b8,70b2393fa61e51fc3e772479a9792c98,74a9c62d0f932e27419151241f7db445,808759fcf017fe581d5c893c7a29c5be,88647cc4d1748c5bb058d4aab1817d63,91f7ece6ed9226a98b3f59f46000ebf6,9200477669cf2a6e6f67f912c729ddc6,97270fe12224dcc1dc019b0d1026a7fd,9f77fc213da2123b013166c181a60323,b68dc7398a80c0b67d28b1d9f73ff885,bf234f719a608fc6858d9a1749463539,c00d7a0a842e45f78f71c27adecde3f9,e5838e52fbc5d3d18fc0533b71148201,f1635e39e27702010af8222ea31360d6,f718747b68f5c2d9d67148f05fd2d4ef,f757d4ff813fdf7b43b3382e7e1bd69c,fe2e0137e7ca501d13c9a8fa4d800377</data>
