    <node id="BIOTINA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Biotina, also known as Vitamin H, is a water-soluble vitamin that plays a crucial role in fatty acid synthesis and energy metabolism. It is included in the multivitamin composition for parenteral nutrition, specifically in products like Infuvite Pedi&#225;trico. Biotin supports metabolic functions and is beneficial for the health of hair, skin, and nails. Notably, there are no established upper limits for biotin intake due to a lack of data on adverse effects. According to daily vitamin recommendations, biotin should be administered in quantities of 60 micrograms.</data>
      <data key="d2">49e05b04f80c53d5f20f7d97f970f5dd,4d3437a0370e3fe7789ba3908d445576,97270fe12224dcc1dc019b0d1026a7fd,f1635e39e27702010af8222ea31360d6,f757d4ff813fdf7b43b3382e7e1bd69c</data>
