    <node id="ANOREXIA NERVIOSA">
      <data key="d0" />
      <data key="d1">Anorexia Nervosa (AN) is a serious eating disorder characterized by an intense fear of gaining weight and a distorted body image. This condition leads to self-imposed starvation, excessive weight loss, and restricted energy intake, resulting in significantly low body weight. Individuals with anorexia nervosa often engage in behaviors that interfere with weight gain, even when they are severely underweight. The disorder can cause severe health complications, including malnutrition, osteoporosis, hormonal imbalances, and primary amenorrhea in prepubertal patients. 

Anorexia nervosa raises complex medical and ethical issues, particularly regarding treatment and patient autonomy, especially in detention settings. It can lead to severe health risks, necessitating nutritional rehabilitation and, in some cases, enteral nutrition support. The disorder is also associated with physiological conditions such as hypercortisolism, although it rarely presents with clinical features of Cushing's syndrome. Overall, anorexia nervosa is a multifaceted mental health disorder that poses significant challenges for both patients and healthcare providers.</data>
      <data key="d2">04221ccceb5e95933ff349645c328457,0f51b0c02b1e8200f9a98b830621c55c,1f8ce52208981fd781dcf23f690f6c3c,1f9d0f4850dde2dbd335969b016fc359,31ce1e681d5daab6e4f4071ed09a0266,3bc554a0031c436483a977c2b9e57b48,44b25f00a145b92a9875173aafbc27c8,46912552a886d029c4aa16e3ea9a0e27,5099515cbc35bc6330fb794c4f1d715d,574c4f0c1e9d196b5007cf183174ecaa,7cc3d3c5826ce81977ed8ad725e1ddbe,8029c950c540c731bb9334bd90348239,9934fdd98a0d66fb3ff7ac1b56b18460,9c65bcd67b717641c8d9d94ef9cfb210,9f38649a548112c415a1c33a8aa72d68,b7fb13d01f792b754e667a3a5bcdba93,bbb0b98043e40738bce354afe3de265c,bf941c97b0ce9caab6cfbab0a4832c27,e165a1c74230c4f9f29f883df45e4c8c,e5103e718912067f1a2766544cf1b4db,e7a9d9aa3031b4c032d724047f80ebe9,eaa675a346becd53a4fcfacbb99def88,ecf27310ce7cbfc335117dafa5d4eefb</data>
      <data key="d3">1596</data>
