    <node id="DENSITOMETR&#205;A &#211;SEA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">DENSITOMETR&#205;A &#211;SEA refers to bone densitometry, a specialized test that measures bone density. This assessment is crucial for evaluating the risk of osteoporosis, particularly in individuals undergoing hormone therapy. Additionally, bone densitometry is utilized to assess the risk of fractures and overall bone health, which can be adversely affected in patients with eating disorders. The procedure is also significant in the context of parenteral nutrition, as it helps evaluate the patient's bone health in relation to their nutritional status. Overall, DENSITOMETR&#205;A &#211;SEA plays a vital role in monitoring and managing bone health across various patient populations.</data>
      <data key="d2">0cf04c95a8e6bbdf9201bf3fff9103f6,12c5004508264971bc2e63c88d19f480,5cf1703fd601b27dd0ebda9f20cb3259,7cc3d3c5826ce81977ed8ad725e1ddbe</data>
      <data key="d3">1080</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">2</data>
      <data key="d6">2029</data>
      <data key="d7">8e4176e5c7734bc79702365f368a5de1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="CONTROL ANAL&#205;TICO">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">El control anal&#237;tico es un proceso de evaluaci&#243;n del estado metab&#243;lico y nutricional del paciente durante el tratamiento de nutrici&#243;n parenteral.</data>
      <data key="d2">5cf1703fd601b27dd0ebda9f20cb3259</data>
      <data key="d3">1080</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">2030</data>
      <data key="d7">d7a46432cb70483081159af6afc5950b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="SEGUIMIENTO">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">SEGUIMIENTO refers to the continuous process of monitoring and evaluating a patient's health status, particularly in the context of assessing the effectiveness of parenteral nutrition and preventing complications. This ongoing medical supervision involves regular assessments to ensure that the patient's treatment is effective and to identify any necessary adjustments. Additionally, SEGUIMIENTO encompasses the monitoring of production processes to ensure that products meet quality standards. Overall, SEGUIMIENTO is a comprehensive approach that integrates patient health monitoring with quality assurance in medical treatments.</data>
      <data key="d2">4196233cbb95a9ab194177cc11875e7a,5cf1703fd601b27dd0ebda9f20cb3259,acd36e6dbcd98757c4cf33ff090764ee,b00c312f46e790b32fe99743480f9e47</data>
