    <node id="BIBLIOGRAFIA">
      <data key="d0" />
      <data key="d1">BIBLIOGRAFIA refers to the list of sources and references cited in a document. It serves to provide evidence and support for the information presented, as well as the guidelines discussed. This compilation of references is essential for validating the content and ensuring the credibility of the work.</data>
      <data key="d2">00467cf9f31ccb0046bfd36ff48c4448,3f3896c039ea7ef78de8bf5fb6e09a48,f79f02438413f5accef9ac5fbd96f6df</data>
