    <node id="STAPHYLOCOCCUS">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Staphylococcus is a genus of bacteria, with S.epidermidis and S.aureus being the most common types associated with catheter infections.</data>
      <data key="d2">c58712e2ee5757b5175054fcc54f4dd6</data>
