    <node id="INSULINA">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Insulina is a crucial hormone produced by the pancreas that plays a significant role in regulating blood glucose levels and is essential in the management of diabetes, particularly Type 1 diabetes. It is administered to patients in various regimens to control hyperglycemia and prevent complications such as ketoacidosis. Insulin therapy is a vital component of diabetes management, especially for critically ill patients, as it helps maintain blood glucose levels near normal and influences overall metabolic processes.

In the context of diabetes treatment, insulin is often used when other medications are insufficient. It is particularly important for managing blood sugar levels during acute conditions, such as diabetic ketoacidosis and in patients with hyperglycemia due to acute pancreatitis. Insulin administration can also affect nutritional status and health in patients with conditions like pancreatic cancer and cirrhosis.

Patients may require adjustments to their insulin dosages based on their individual needs, and monitoring is essential to ensure effective management of their blood glucose levels. Insulin can also be included in parenteral nutrition protocols when necessary. However, some patients may struggle with adherence to their insulin regimen, leading to omitted doses, which can complicate their diabetes management.

Overall, insulin is a fundamental medication in the treatment of diabetes, helping to regulate glucose metabolism and maintain health in individuals with this chronic condition.</data>
      <data key="d2">05ad4e8782ea0fc2d2347d73a0b5c704,095d265c06452e52ccbfbc871a19a899,111edb0e21c873322871e35619a1ebf5,1290ddd67bed33472ff31398d8699503,20b676e149e50ddc54c40e2e1577e9ac,21339c051dc2f47471026673b3ac6436,2ec23f85b858abc42196ef48260e8cb0,3a1d1c4eb34995d440bd72c4b64e3c8d,3ed179f6e734d9fe4921fb0be0b018e4,3f46d79bcfab2143f045659e11be171b,410fab643c125e0f8944ebae5dba5ec0,48f1fe343d54cd0f353be34b736a352c,507eeea555c496a467930836fc4c1a39,57ec3d3d82d22e19c09ea2b735ef7779,5bb504bf68288cc0ba6a8f0dd9e4c245,6083387b51909347a13ed5aa1c92bb26,630ac8fefe27e4b893831674a67dcc82,7c10030e29c1434df3b10b1533710486,83b82871866963bb43f901dd9ca09fcb,88dcf64f61e33adc3702b1ec401e2d4e,933d6526b2d313c95c9f4aaa950a62a3,9889a9000d5a82ffba9e0f6c92da918a,9baa05f21f51764ac1d0537294bdc7db,abf638322cfb1c522bfbee1852e28a19,ac2955cad85e541f3b61de2f4df0a3a9,ac89fcaa7dcce835c0d5b9ed9ce94cea,afe0f4f37815c175f0faff06eb24a256,b00c312f46e790b32fe99743480f9e47,b7a2c1e4dd77f47605fdb33f4a2c2bdf,bd3162e408d0d1ddd770ea833aad5ff3,c58712e2ee5757b5175054fcc54f4dd6,ce4c057e0a625bc9e64301a0cca1e206,d42b833940d845abc98aa8e8ea05d6ae,dc7539b4d637d6dd09963c2564f4f084,e55f521d442f8ba50012b67d7051d39f,f1bd89f4a1fcc385a19f5c5323ee2f89</data>
