    <node id="HIPOGLUCEMIA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Hipo glucemia, also known as hypoglycemia, is a medical condition characterized by abnormally low levels of glucose in the blood. This condition is commonly observed in patients with various underlying health issues, including Glycogen Storage Disease type III (GSDIII), diabetes, insulinomas, and urea cycle disorders. 

In individuals with diabetes, particularly those undergoing insulin therapy or certain medications, the risk of hypoglycemia is heightened. It can also occur in patients receiving enteral nutrition, often linked to inadequate nutritional intake or excessive diabetic treatment. Additionally, hypoglycemia may manifest in hospitalized patients, especially those on insulin, and can be a concern in the dietary management of patients with specific metabolic disorders.

Hypoglycemia can lead to serious health issues if not treated promptly, with symptoms that may include confusion and weakness. It is also noted that this condition can arise from prolonged fasting, as seen in patients with fructose-1,6-bisphosphate deficiency, and may be associated with the treatment of hyperglycemia. In newborns, particularly those with restricted nutritional supply, hypoglycemia can occur due to insufficient glucose availability.

Furthermore, hypoglycemia is recognized as a potential side effect of growth hormone treatment and can stimulate the secretion of growth hormone itself. In some cases, it may also be linked to acute hyponatremia, which is a medical emergency that can lead to severe complications such as cerebral edema.

Overall, hypoglycemia is a multifaceted condition that requires careful management to prevent adverse health outcomes.</data>
      <data key="d2">0487e1a4525547575a1d284297280f9a,0b901814a09392d24880be465dcbce6f,1f2182c320403c424563ba1a084c00d5,214cb2b8ddec52ff69849d87feb8e141,449046c83c1432d2b8cc6cacb5eadf51,473502714ce73073f93b598ca0edcc21,6289e9e0b5871fb9a2f2f691429bb4f8,68be432b2dd3e64676989cd544f23d8c,70e6c476cce381861896b5a6be2f39ad,75a4b2d504de480eaef247aa682bfd05,8bcf09481326ab5017cc3b45317538a3,8f51c67fbf44368dcfc2d7c767e2cef6,9480cb55d00db88cfe1decdf011cb41f,a3fd8bf0a5229c36813682803cd15e35,ac2955cad85e541f3b61de2f4df0a3a9,afe0f4f37815c175f0faff06eb24a256,b11e575be155e186717a992a9d641577,b5e899a3def3da339630eb0d2bfe4af8,bd3162e408d0d1ddd770ea833aad5ff3,c58712e2ee5757b5175054fcc54f4dd6,c73e5e558cab6ae4736ce1619142c0a4,cff2f16dff598dbf0bff544091c77837,e41a9b2827462263a11ef60ce74c160b</data>
