      <data key="d1">ALTERACIONES HIDROELECTROL&#205;TICAS refer to disturbances in the levels of electrolytes in the body, which can lead to serious health issues, particularly in malnourished patients. These imbalances often necessitate careful monitoring and management to prevent complications and ensure the well-being of affected individuals.</data>
