      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Hospital Universitari i Polit&#232;cnic La Fe is a comprehensive medical facility that offers a wide range of healthcare services. It specializes in providing nutritional support for patients, especially in surgical contexts, ensuring that their dietary needs are met during recovery. Additionally, the hospital is actively involved in the treatment and management of patients suffering from acute pancreatitis, highlighting its commitment to addressing complex medical conditions.</data>
