      <data key="d1">F. Mingol Navarro is a medical professional and co-author who focuses on the nutritional needs of surgical patients. He is actively involved in both the study and practice of nutritional support, emphasizing the importance of addressing these needs to improve patient outcomes in surgical settings.</data>
