      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">M. Saur&#237; Ortiz is a medical professional and co-author who focuses on the nutritional needs of surgical patients. He collaborates on research and practices that emphasize the importance of nutritional support in this patient population, contributing valuable insights to the field.</data>
