      <data key="d7">06b84211436c4faf81e90f5eb0b1bba5</data>
    </node>
    <node id="POLITRAUMATIZADO">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">El politraumatizado es un paciente que presenta m&#250;ltiples lesiones y puede requerir soporte nutricional debido a sus necesidades energ&#233;ticas aumentadas.</data>
      <data key="d2">140611dbb8a68fc40712c946de92b73f</data>
      <data key="d3">1132</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">2090</data>
      <data key="d7">d492a48be58c49c58c165ffd5b3e56c7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="NEOPLASIA DE ES&#211;FAGO">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">La neoplasia de es&#243;fago es una condici&#243;n m&#233;dica que afecta la capacidad de un paciente para ingerir alimentos, lo que puede requerir atenci&#243;n nutricional especial. Esta condici&#243;n puede restringir anat&#243;micamente el aparato digestivo, lo que indica la necesidad de nutrici&#243;n enteral para asegurar que el paciente reciba los nutrientes necesarios.</data>
      <data key="d2">140611dbb8a68fc40712c946de92b73f,44346a4b1b9a6d3ae2bc161314ff9efd</data>
      <data key="d3">748</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">2</data>
      <data key="d6">2091</data>
      <data key="d7">8d5aaef187e64993b08d4b57618d080f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="DIFICULTAD PARA LA INGESTA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">La dificultad para la ingesta es una condici&#243;n que puede llevar a la necesidad de nutrici&#243;n enteral cuando un paciente no puede consumir alimentos por v&#237;a oral.</data>
      <data key="d2">140611dbb8a68fc40712c946de92b73f</data>
      <data key="d3">1080</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">2092</data>
      <data key="d7">ac5d3d2408c94167bb9acfa87b9cf767</data>
    </node>
    <node id="CIRUG&#205;A">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">CIRUG&#205;A refers to surgical procedures that encompass a range of medical interventions, particularly significant in the context of patient care and recovery. These procedures often necessitate nutritional support, as they can lead to alterations in the nutritional status of patients, especially those with cancer, resulting in weight loss and potential complications. The surgical department is responsible for the comprehensive care and treatment of patients, which includes the administration of parenteral nutrition and the placement of enteral feeding tubes to ensure adequate nutritional intake.

Moreover, surgery can impact critical health markers such as albumin levels and overall nutritional status, particularly in critically ill patients. It is also noted that surgical procedures may induce insulin resistance and hyperglycemia, which can further complicate recovery and affect patient outcomes. In specific cases, such as surgeries involving head and neck cancer patients, immunomodulatory formulas may be utilized to support recovery. Therefore, careful nutritional considerations are essential both before and after surgical interventions to optimize patient health and recovery outcomes.</data>
      <data key="d2">140611dbb8a68fc40712c946de92b73f,2b8c323c265f8f7f3d15bf988bf1f9ee,4b4f297dec86d7f65e362ad688bbb28f,781bee94bdbc4f6a3cf4186d6ae0daff,9562f39f9e78644164daeff3177a2f84,b26b998479da515c234ce46b1bfa73db,d42b833940d845abc98aa8e8ea05d6ae,d77e49d1dba3a67fbc9cf58911dc2478,e98937544f56006f5d327136c593c969</data>
      <data key="d3">1139</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">11</data>
      <data key="d6">2093</data>
      <data key="d7">dc514ab62e83426eac772c62718acdd4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="MALNUTRICI&#211;N SEVERA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">MALNUTRICI&#211;N SEVERA es una condici&#243;n m&#233;dica que puede se&#241;alar la necesidad de iniciar nutrici&#243;n enteral o parenteral con el fin de restaurar el estado nutricional del paciente.</data>
      <data key="d2">140611dbb8a68fc40712c946de92b73f,4ec3e8cb1f21808e70bbc71cb26d7396</data>
      <data key="d3">1131</data>
