    <node id="F&#211;RMULAS INMUNOMODULADORAS">
      <data key="d0" />
      <data key="d1">F&#211;RMULAS INMUNOMODULADORAS are specialized enteral nutrition formulas designed to provide nutritional support for patients in various critical conditions, such as those undergoing cancer surgery or experiencing trauma. These immunomodulatory formulas contain specific nutrients aimed at influencing disease processes and enhancing the nutritional status of the patient. While they may offer benefits to certain critical patients, their use is not routine in clinical practice.</data>
      <data key="d2">169eceabd2bd24183f24faccb2c00088,44346a4b1b9a6d3ae2bc161314ff9efd,4ce0bfcd129ba597d70d90d2120c1996,d77e49d1dba3a67fbc9cf58911dc2478</data>
