    </node>
    <node id="NEOPLASIA G&#193;STRICA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Neoplasia g&#225;strica refers to gastric neoplasia, a condition that may require nutritional support and specific dietary management pre- and post-surgery.</data>
