      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">F&#237;stulas intestinales are intestinal fistulas that can lead to severe malnutrition and require careful nutritional management and treatment.</data>
      <data key="d2">f7ca532ae3a834fd6643ad694d3e850c</data>
