    <node id="DIETA POLIM&#201;RICA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">DIETA POLIM&#201;RICA refers to a polymeric diet, which is a form of enteral nutrition designed for patients who can digest food normally. This diet contains whole proteins and offers a balanced mix of nutrients, making it suitable for individuals with specific dietary needs. It is commonly utilized in clinical settings to support the nutritional requirements of patients.</data>
      <data key="d2">aeb399b3f90c6a50eed8adfa8a140451,f7ca532ae3a834fd6643ad694d3e850c</data>
      <data key="d3">1104</data>
