    <node id="P. JUSTO PAVIA">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">P. Justo Pavia is a medical professional and author who has made significant contributions to the field of medicine, particularly in the areas of polytraumatism, traumatic brain injury, and the care of burn patients. In the referenced text, P. Justo Pavia is noted for contributing to a chapter focused on polytraumatism and traumatic brain injury, as well as another chapter that addresses the management of burn patients and the role of artificial nutrition in their treatment.</data>
      <data key="d2">36cffc3e7c3a6fe82e50787e939f7537,d2110ea1623a52d24b22d1a18f66010c</data>
