    <node id="TCE">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">TCE, or traumatic brain injury, is a significant medical condition that affects millions of individuals globally each year, leading to considerable rates of death and disability. Recovery from TCE necessitates specific nutritional interventions tailored to support the unique metabolic needs of patients. These nutritional strategies are essential for promoting healing and optimizing recovery outcomes in those affected by this serious condition.</data>
      <data key="d2">01704aec4089b2f0f24dd0f0841b5ecf,51ccbecf506101052f08de7cbbaa6b62,723cbca2d5cfbf8cf05a923c52569641</data>
