      <data key="d7">d7211beb0be145d89aa2b8c15cbd90d1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="ACIDO LINOLEICO">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Acido linoleico, also known as linoleic acid, is an essential fatty acid that is crucial for human health. It is recommended for administration in parenteral nutrition to prevent deficiencies in essential fatty acids. As an essential fatty acid, linoleic acid must be included in the diet to ensure adequate nutrition and to avoid potential health issues associated with its deficiency.</data>
      <data key="d2">33815f13a51d2a716356eaca97176390,bb7584256e051f1c3d8cb13502ade155</data>
      <data key="d3">1647</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">2</data>
      <data key="d6">2133</data>
      <data key="d7">20d217cf504645a5951d6a95608c6f24</data>
    </node>
    <node id="ACIDO ALFA-LINOLENICO">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Alpha-linolenic acid is an essential omega-3 fatty acid important for health.</data>
      <data key="d2">33815f13a51d2a716356eaca97176390</data>
      <data key="d3">1389</data>
