    <node id="GENERALITAT VALENCIANA">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The Generalitat Valenciana is the regional government of Valencia, Spain, tasked with overseeing health and nutrition policies as well as public health policies. This governmental body plays a crucial role in managing and implementing health-related initiatives within the region, ensuring the well-being of its citizens through effective governance and policy-making.</data>
      <data key="d2">3bfd2ce2b4408f718fd35e43c03965c7,7a389f3625ba13c74ce52213197b01ae</data>
