    <node id="FOSFORO">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Fosforo, also known as phosphorus, is an essential mineral that plays a critical role in various bodily functions, particularly in bone health and energy production. The recommended daily intake of fosforo ranges from 700 to 3,000 mg, depending on individual needs. It is crucial for daily nutrition, and specific intake levels are particularly important for patients, especially those with conditions such as respiratory failure, where phosphorus levels are closely monitored. Overall, fosforo is vital for maintaining overall health and supporting metabolic processes.</data>
      <data key="d2">3bfd2ce2b4408f718fd35e43c03965c7,5cab61b11d03ef705141159d100ae7c5,74a9c62d0f932e27419151241f7db445,ae1766e8ae855b3c79ad6d5fdefab1b0,d1d2d307f9b3ceb8f8a21846f314b260</data>
