    <node id="ENFERMOS">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">ENFERMOS refers to pediatric patients who are critically ill and require enteral nutrition. The primary objective of their treatment is to ensure their well-being, which involves providing specialized nutritional support tailored to their specific health needs during their recovery process.</data>
