    <node id="NUTRICION">
      <data key="d0" />
      <data key="d1">NUTRICION encompasses a vital aspect of health, particularly in the context of medical treatments such as hematopoietic cell transplantation. It plays a crucial role in the preparation and recovery of patients, helping to prevent malnutrition and enhance their quality of life. Additionally, Nutrison Advanced Cubison, a nutritional product developed by Nutricia, is specifically designed to provide dietary support. The field of nutrition also includes the establishment of intervention guidelines aimed at addressing malnutrition risks among frail elderly patients. Furthermore, nutritional studies are conducted to examine dietary intake and its effects on health, utilizing various survey methods to gather data. Overall, NUTRICION is integral to improving health outcomes across different populations, particularly those at risk of malnutrition.</data>
