    <node id="CHEST">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">CHEST is a prominent medical journal dedicated to the publication of research and reviews concerning chest diseases. It encompasses a wide range of topics, including critical care and nutrition in the intensive care unit (ICU), as well as the study and treatment of respiratory diseases. The journal addresses specific conditions such as chylothorax and chylous ascites, contributing to the understanding and management of these complex medical issues. Through its comprehensive coverage, CHEST serves as a vital resource for healthcare professionals involved in the care of patients with respiratory and critical care needs.</data>
