    <node id="CRIT CARE MED">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Crit Care Med is a journal dedicated to the field of critical care medicine, emphasizing both research and clinical practices. It publishes a variety of studies, including those examining energy expenditure in patients with pancreatitis and analyses comparing clinical outcomes and costs associated with early postoperative enteral immunonutrition in surgical patients. The journal serves as a vital resource for advancements and insights in critical care, contributing to the understanding and improvement of patient care in this specialized area of medicine.</data>
