    <node id="CATABOLISMO PROTEICO">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">CATABOLISMO PROTEICO refers to the metabolic process in which proteins are broken down into amino acids. This process is particularly significant in the context of critically ill patients, as it can be increased under such conditions, thereby impacting their nutritional needs. Understanding catabolismo proteico is essential for managing the dietary requirements of patients, especially those who are critically ill, as their protein breakdown rates may necessitate adjustments in their nutritional intake.</data>
      <data key="d2">4ce6342fdfe4419826c1ab2f84c56247,cd16cc82ca1357af8c9c1ab73ea55c5a</data>
