    </node>
    <node id="ALTERACIONES ELECTROL&#205;TICAS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Alteraciones Electrol&#237;ticas refer to disturbances in electrolyte balance that can occur in patients receiving nutritional support, significantly impacting their overall health. These imbalances are particularly common in critically ill patients, making careful nutritional management essential to restore and maintain electrolyte balance. Dietary plans are designed to prevent potential health issues associated with these electrolyte imbalances, highlighting the importance of monitoring and addressing this aspect of patient care.</data>
      <data key="d2">8d7a18d8258ab74a0e56129f937a8a84,cd16cc82ca1357af8c9c1ab73ea55c5a,cff2f16dff598dbf0bff544091c77837</data>
