    <node id="BROWN RO">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Brown RO is a researcher and author with a focus on nutrition in clinical settings. He is involved in studies that compare specialized and standard enteral formulas specifically for trauma patients. Additionally, Brown RO has contributed to research on parenteral nutrition solutions, enhancing the understanding of nutritional support in various medical contexts. He is also an author of clinical guidelines that address nutrition support for patients with renal failure, further demonstrating his expertise and commitment to improving patient care through nutritional strategies.</data>
