    <node id="M. HIG&#211;N BALLESTER">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">M. Hig&#243;n Ballester is a medical doctor recognized for his contributions to the field of nutrition in critical medical conditions. He has co-authored chapters on artificial nutrition, specifically focusing on its application in both acute pancreatitis and liver diseases. His expertise in these areas highlights his significant role in advancing medical knowledge related to nutritional support in severe health issues.</data>
