    <node id="SCREENING NUTRICIONAL">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Screening nutricional is the process of assessing a patient's nutritional status to determine the need for nutritional support in the context of acute pancreatitis.</data>
      <data key="d2">6a12bee5b54e4c1706548bca972516e3</data>
      <data key="d5">0</data>
      <data key="d6">2210</data>
      <data key="d7">61ff370cc91f4200ac30e243691845da</data>
    </node>
    <node id="DIETA L&#205;QUIDA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">DIETA L&#205;QUIDA refers to a dietary phase that is primarily indicated for patients who are recovering from surgery or fasting. This phase consists of easily digestible liquids, allowing individuals to gradually initiate oral tolerance. Additionally, DIETA L&#205;QUIDA is also applicable for patients who have experienced an episode of acute pancreatitis, as it permits the consumption of clear liquids while they begin to tolerate oral intake. Overall, DIETA L&#205;QUIDA serves as a crucial step in the recovery process, facilitating a safe transition back to regular dietary habits.</data>
      <data key="d2">4b19145e0977ee48b7132c9915d8c284,4d74cee5793710b781c0b83db2f27209,6a12bee5b54e4c1706548bca972516e3</data>
