      <data key="d6">2220</data>
      <data key="d7">16c63959c70b4b5ab062e4a93930591d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="ENFERMEDAD HEP&#193;TICA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Enfermedad hep&#225;tica refers to liver disease, a medical condition that encompasses a range of disorders affecting liver function, including cirrhosis and hepatitis. This condition can significantly impact amino acid metabolism and nutritional status, influencing the energy expenditure and nutritional requirements of affected individuals. Careful nutritional management is essential for those with liver disease, as parenteral nutrition can exacerbate the condition and further affect liver function and health.</data>
      <data key="d2">036e8182deab774d39f06cd811738c9b,3437d6cdf014282ec447fc7f4de92cab,79dc467f42c611bc9f285c95a6c6ff62,9fda43c414d32c5a8a3bb7354bfb1704,e55543c6579d036d25f25eb2ff63fcf2,ecc0b96af9066f424f1c114102063682</data>
