      <data key="d7">74dba8240f494d09a43a41cbe7474333</data>
    </node>
    <node id="VARICES ESOF&#193;GICAS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Esophageal varices are enlarged and swollen veins located in the esophagus. These varices can pose serious health risks, as they have the potential to bleed, which can result in significant blood loss and anemia. Additionally, the presence of esophageal varices can complicate medical procedures, such as the placement of feeding tubes.</data>
      <data key="d2">20491afa9a4770e93e6cff9034f8b0f0,6595cec039fe5a2c290eea9ab7e3b2fc</data>
