    <node id="PLAQUETOPENIA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Plaquetopenia, also known as thrombocytopenia, is a condition characterized by a low platelet count in the blood. It is a frequent side effect of the oil of Lorenzo, occurring in approximately 40% of patients who use this treatment. This condition can complicate medical procedures due to the reduced ability of the blood to clot effectively.</data>
      <data key="d2">20491afa9a4770e93e6cff9034f8b0f0,9aa00ebb9b33b958c9956b7859eb11d8</data>
