    <node id="FORMULAS HIPERPROTEICAS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">FORMULAS HIPERPROTEICAS are specialized dietary preparations that are high in protein, specifically designed to meet the increased protein requirements of patients with various medical conditions, such as fibrosis qu&#237;stica. These hyperproteic formulas serve as nutritional solutions tailored for specific medical situations, ensuring that individuals receive the necessary protein intake to support their health and recovery.</data>
      <data key="d2">20491afa9a4770e93e6cff9034f8b0f0,95ef1473677a26ea6ad77c7db0c55e5e</data>
