    </node>
    <node id="AACR">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">AACR refers to branched-chain amino acids, which are proposed as a therapeutic option for patients suffering from hepatic encephalopathy. These amino acids are specific nutrients that play a significant role in enteral nutrition for individuals with liver disease.</data>
      <data key="d2">20491afa9a4770e93e6cff9034f8b0f0,ea1d430dfc773b669eec18759441b31a</data>
      <data key="d3">1786</data>
