      <data key="d7">7a3c4195867549b9a3f4cae7e694fbd9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="VALENCIA">
      <data key="d0">GEO</data>
      <data key="d1">Valencia is a city in Spain that serves as the location for several important institutions and entities. It is home to the Generalitat Valenciana, the regional government of Valencia, and is where the referenced manual was published. Additionally, Valencia hosts significant healthcare facilities, including the Hospital Universitario Doctor Peset and the Hospital Universitario y Polit&#233;cnico de La Fe. The city is also the site of the Menta publishing house, which published the referenced works.</data>
      <data key="d2">3a1d1c4eb34995d440bd72c4b64e3c8d,6dfb109dac53e054fd015f6d8adf48ac,7a389f3625ba13c74ce52213197b01ae,84e91b50850bfa0ad0122cdebf477a1d,b6c8d5ff1536806d6512fb9d1af1e6db</data>
