      <data key="d7">8935f8f17f2e4146b1cb1100f8e243ae</data>
    </node>
    <node id="CLIN NUTR">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">CLIN NUTR, also known as Clinical Nutrition, is a journal dedicated to publishing research related to clinical nutrition. It encompasses a wide range of studies, including those focused on enteral and parenteral nutrition, nutritional support following surgery, and the nutritional aspects of health and disease. The journal addresses various topics, such as muscle contractile and metabolic dysfunction in aging, and has published significant guidelines, including the ESPEN Guidelines on Enteral Nutrition, which cover areas related to liver disease and surgical care. Additionally, CLIN NUTR has published research on clinical nutrition practices and the concurrent validity of the Malnutrition Universal Screening Tool (MUST). Overall, the journal serves as a vital resource for advancing knowledge in nutritional science and its implications in clinical settings.</data>
      <data key="d2">005b22fc9dae5f9b135f0c8ba729819f,242fceb82929615af653d9f8574b0ef5,3be9d646c354d76527755d79a77c916b,3f1d1c7c7c62b83f62f6fa31c25f65b2,4eb41f33f9aba3b8ecd3906de91a1345,60d24674009cc67523f1ecdc63975fdc,6dfb109dac53e054fd015f6d8adf48ac,9ec3bf4d23f9f4fca8984c81d95aac41,9ef354c0ee5ac877ce8fba79fcc7e2b3,bd8df34b86026d71089bcf062570b70f,f8c0a9f795e94be1048ffba0007831de</data>
