    <node id="M.D. HIG&#211;N BALLESTER">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">M.D. Hig&#243;n Ballester is a medical doctor recognized for his contributions to the field of nutrition, particularly in relation to inflammatory bowel disease and cystic fibrosis. He has played a significant role in advancing knowledge and practices surrounding nutritional care for patients with these conditions, demonstrating a commitment to improving health outcomes through specialized dietary interventions.</data>
      <data key="d2">9200477669cf2a6e6f67f912c729ddc6,ce8f5f24dbbf8624e49a6f85c2ad0d04</data>
