    <node id="LOCHS H">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Lochs H is a prominent researcher and co-author of the ESPEN Guidelines on enteral nutrition, which offer expert recommendations in the field of clinical nutrition. He has made significant contributions to the understanding of nutritional support, particularly for patients suffering from liver cirrhosis. Additionally, Lochs H is recognized for his involvement in discussions surrounding the ESPEN guidelines as they pertain to gastroenterology, further emphasizing his expertise and influence in the area of enteral nutrition.</data>
      <data key="d2">49e6a5571bf2f206ac38ac536d70f710,bf234f719a608fc6858d9a1749463539,ceb66a898fed371e013171c43a87e1d1</data>
