    </node>
    <node id="MAMA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">MAMA refers to breast cancer, a condition that can lead to weight loss in some patients. Additionally, MAMA encompasses breast tissue, and it is important to note that obesity is associated with an increased risk of developing postmenopausal breast cancer. This highlights the complex relationship between body weight and breast cancer, emphasizing both the potential effects of the disease on weight and the influence of obesity on cancer risk.</data>
      <data key="d2">b26b998479da515c234ce46b1bfa73db,ea79efb65695c260a301f5c42237e2cb</data>
      <data key="d3">996</data>
