      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">RESOURCE SUPPORT PLUS is a nutritional product developed by Nestl&#233;, specifically designed for patients who require high-energy and high-protein diets. It is available in a variety of flavors, catering to different taste preferences while providing essential dietary support.</data>
      <data key="d2">7d929a0137a287c5c96416fa5fc36239,dc8d12d9f32208671f6067b0bb64a645</data>
