    <node id="PROSURE">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">PROSURE is a nutritional drink developed by Abbott, specifically formulated to meet the dietary needs of patients requiring additional nutritional support. This supplement provides essential nutrients and is available in multiple flavors and presentations, catering to the diverse preferences of its users.</data>
      <data key="d2">7d929a0137a287c5c96416fa5fc36239,dc8d12d9f32208671f6067b0bb64a645,e0be9f17e2314a41061f01d4e1d43262</data>
