    <node id="SUPPORTAN DRINK">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Supportan Drink is a nutritional beverage produced by Fresenius Kabi, specifically designed to provide energy and protein for patients in need of nutritional support. This product is available in a variety of flavors, catering to different taste preferences while fulfilling its purpose of aiding in the nutritional needs of individuals.</data>
      <data key="d2">7d929a0137a287c5c96416fa5fc36239,dc8d12d9f32208671f6067b0bb64a645</data>
