    <node id="FORTICARE">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">FORTICARE is a nutritional product developed by Nutricia, specifically designed to meet the dietary needs of patients requiring increased nutritional support. It provides a high-calorie and protein-rich formulation, making it suitable for individuals with heightened energy requirements. Available in various flavors, FORTICARE aims to deliver essential nutrients effectively, ensuring that patients receive the dietary assistance they need for optimal health and recovery.</data>
      <data key="d2">7d929a0137a287c5c96416fa5fc36239,dc8d12d9f32208671f6067b0bb64a645,e0be9f17e2314a41061f01d4e1d43262</data>
