    </node>
    <node id="ONDANSETR&#211;N">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Ondansetron, also known as Ondansetr&#243;n, is an antiemetic medication that serves to prevent nausea and vomiting, particularly those induced by cancer treatments. It functions as a 5HT3 antagonist, effectively reducing the incidence of nausea and vomiting associated with such therapies.</data>
      <data key="d2">79a751fb45e4b69c946d088100f43654,dc8d12d9f32208671f6067b0bb64a645</data>
      <data key="d3">1112</data>
