    <node id="DIABETES UK">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Diabetes UK is a charity organization dedicated to the prevention and management of diabetes in the United Kingdom. It provides evidence-based nutrition guidelines aimed at helping individuals manage their condition effectively and reduce the risk of developing diabetes. Through its initiatives, Diabetes UK plays a crucial role in supporting those affected by diabetes and promoting healthier lifestyles.</data>
      <data key="d2">4f6c697d19c8a4459b3accd91f111bfd,762a80a4c9f24d778b79fdd596f343e3</data>
