    <node id="DIABETES CARE">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">"Diabetes Care" is a journal published by the American Diabetes Association that focuses on various aspects of diabetes management, including clinical research, education, and practice. The journal is dedicated to publishing a wide range of content related to diabetes care, including position statements, clinical studies, and guidelines that address the management and treatment of diabetes and its complications, such as diabetic retinopathy. 

In addition to clinical care, "Diabetes Care" emphasizes the importance of nutrition and its impact on diabetes outcomes, publishing research that explores nutritional aspects and their relationship to diabetes management. The journal also covers related conditions, including studies on obesity, hyperglycemia, and parenteral nutrition. Overall, "Diabetes Care" serves as a comprehensive resource for healthcare professionals involved in diabetes management, providing valuable insights into research, guidelines, and best practices in the field.</data>
      <data key="d2">1388342730ee9177144f78f9e9d7816e,152aeb8f10c2f4548114403c05af6b55,19e153f7c5e2fcd13d3bf7a99298834e,1cc73922b5279318629905f2bdc66906,265fcc321b2c0bbf0bf8200d0489e1a1,4c4d1882f0ac14b7c55941ec1c17b650,64378df2be6b08b39bd652c0a2d3789c,762a80a4c9f24d778b79fdd596f343e3,784f8d7f49cdce2d0611be585eda7e2c,a265c943c66b9cb5d09f89d40ddb995f,a3e3a651e24883d279405241439b58bc,bb2e69a0ff4c25a21149882162922c8d,ddd686507e25374444e2e7525a5aacf4,eb275fa50517d86a71589fd318784a5b</data>
