    <node id="FRESENIUS-KABI">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Fresenius-Kabi is a global healthcare company that specializes in lifesaving medicines and technologies. The company is particularly known for its nutritional products, which include formulas designed for children and products aimed at diabetes management. Additionally, Fresenius-Kabi focuses on enteral nutrition, offering specialized products such as Diben. Through its diverse range of offerings, Fresenius-Kabi plays a crucial role in providing essential healthcare solutions.</data>
