    <node id="ABBOTT">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Abbott is a global healthcare company that develops and manufactures a diverse array of healthcare products, encompassing medical devices, diagnostics, and nutritional supplements. The company is particularly known for its extensive range of nutritional products, which includes specialized formulas designed for various health needs. Among its offerings are products such as Jevity Plus HP, Osmolite HN Plus, Vital P&#233;ptido 1.5, Ensure Plus Advance, and Glucerna, which cater to individuals with specific dietary requirements, including those with diabetes. Abbott also produces energy drinks and various enteral formulas for medical use, demonstrating its commitment to addressing a wide spectrum of nutritional needs. Overall, Abbott stands out as a comprehensive provider of healthcare solutions, with a strong emphasis on nutritional products.</data>
      <data key="d2">010eeb888fc145c82babc1e391659d17,0ce5d03d68754406ae67953693447691,12b6478763cfb60ad144be6b81778e03,14c19a260cd596700d9063264706c3f5,480f782b060bfee2602cabab8f0a8430,751947d2192006b89bb703587d56df99,762a80a4c9f24d778b79fdd596f343e3,77c2b5963fab84c30e6eb596b49336bf,7d929a0137a287c5c96416fa5fc36239,7f1e7297290e6bec78ef6dca66af0d1b,ca2801bd227abdbbb8e1d4f3bb4e16c7,e19124eedd22ae875792520ac81cd761,eae483df53fc129a2da04f2925b91d57,ede4d21db7723c6b72e8493236b217ad,ef1f9c5ab11653bcf9af53c70890b43e,f1a5aedade8a18645812e3d39b313afa,f5e31a6599b8198e736e732c44f8eaa4</data>
