    <node id="GRIFOLS">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Grifols is a global healthcare company recognized for its expertise in the production of plasma-derived medicines and a diverse range of nutritional products. The company develops and manufactures various nutritional offerings, including Dietgrif MCT, Dietgrif hiperproteico, Dietgrif Pudding Completo, and Dietgrif Activ Protein Fibra. Grifols also provides specialized nutritional products aimed at patients, including those with diabetes, and produces enteral formulas to support various healthcare needs. Overall, Grifols is committed to advancing healthcare through its innovative therapies and nutritional solutions.</data>
      <data key="d2">12b6478763cfb60ad144be6b81778e03,16e694ae79763a00ceb974feca8e733d,751947d2192006b89bb703587d56df99,762a80a4c9f24d778b79fdd596f343e3,7f1e7297290e6bec78ef6dca66af0d1b,c883bcb78593d21f8f0467eae1a2c8fa,eae483df53fc129a2da04f2925b91d57,ede4d21db7723c6b72e8493236b217ad</data>
