    <node id="PERSAN FARMA">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">PERSAN FARMA is a pharmaceutical company based in Spain that is actively involved in the production and sponsorship of various initiatives related to clinical nutrition, particularly for patients with diabetes mellitus and associated chronic conditions. The company has sponsored round table events and scientific forums focused on nutritional diagnosis and treatment, as well as clinical case conferences that emphasize the importance of nutrition in managing diabetes.

PERSAN FARMA is recognized for its commitment to enhancing the training of healthcare professionals through scientific projects and publications. The company produces a range of nutritional products designed to meet the needs of diabetic patients, including NutAvant HP Fibra, NutAvant Plus, NutAvant HC (a high-calorie nutritional beverage), NutAvant Diab&#233;tica, and NutAvant Plus Diab&#233;tica. Additionally, PERSAN FARMA manufactures NutAvant Fibra and NutAvant Est&#225;ndar, further diversifying its product offerings in the nutritional sector.

The company is represented by a logo featuring an orange four-leaf clover or flower-like symbol, which reflects its identity within the pharmaceutical industry. Through its various initiatives and products, PERSAN FARMA aims to contribute significantly to the field of clinical nutrition and improve the quality of care for patients with diabetes.</data>
      <data key="d2">010eeb888fc145c82babc1e391659d17,14c19a260cd596700d9063264706c3f5,234b514a40a64bc02f1346cb62cf3f97,2eff7eb5e1b3c24a5650d80b185fbd96,7949b821c1ca2e4adc524e7775626396,a5ee3f91f8571820c338a8db4d3db09d,a86e44ac34c096cea172895339d5f733,c15050bcda4ba43dac2389a2c73459c7,c3399f261a9e270031cf3b7e31cd43ad,daed781ebc502b854582efdef23e9dde,e19124eedd22ae875792520ac81cd761,f2a95e3c367ee9dd679b57bf1820e6e6,f5e31a6599b8198e736e732c44f8eaa4</data>
