    </node>
    <node id="ALTERACIONES DE LA MASTICACI&#211;N">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Las alteraciones de la masticaci&#243;n en pacientes ancianos pueden requerir modificaciones en la textura de los alimentos para facilitar la degluci&#243;n.</data>
      <data key="d2">2f548ddee569586dbe82ca124f2695e9</data>
      <data key="d3">586</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">2415</data>
      <data key="d7">ac84d27fb5dc46a3b2b818af2e69e3fa</data>
    </node>
    <node id="ACTIVIDAD F&#205;SICA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">"ACTIVIDAD F&#205;SICA" refers to physical activity, which plays a crucial role in preventing and managing various health conditions, particularly diabetes and chronic diseases in elderly patients. It is essential for maintaining muscle mass and functionality, especially in cancer patients, where it helps preserve physical strength and overall well-being. Additionally, physical activity is a key component in the treatment of frailty syndrome, enhancing functionality and reducing the likelihood of hospital readmissions. It is also integral to nutritional treatment, contributing to improved quality of life for patients. Activities classified as physical activity include any bodily movement that burns calories, such as walking and strength training, which are particularly beneficial for elderly individuals. Overall, physical activity is recognized as one of the four pillars of comprehensive treatment for frailty in the elderly, highlighting its importance in promoting a healthy lifestyle and managing health conditions effectively.</data>
      <data key="d2">1052683f23a0c9825af9c5c1d39ceb2c,2f548ddee569586dbe82ca124f2695e9,4913cc391a44397e2e1ea12979e1fd58,6656dd3bdc79720504c3e4245f935d32,a7baff5fb024c516ea6ae8c236dc945d,a96b8f4fe52b5b963b28242c3352aa7c,ac2955cad85e541f3b61de2f4df0a3a9,bdb8258b310cb9ed8a0e4354fac5a33c,ca3fd82e042bcc480e80a1ae56b34507,da2707b26ddb548995a6d0e2a3eeddb0,f7871bbaa57d50bb5f5675cd580cb0af</data>
      <data key="d3">1783</data>
