    <node id="G&#211;MEZ CANDELA C">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">G&#243;mez Candela C is a prominent researcher associated with the NADYA group, where they focus on studies related to home parenteral nutrition and home enteral nutrition in Spain. In addition to their research contributions, G&#243;mez Candela C has authored significant works, including a chapter on nutrition in eating disorders for a medical textbook and guidelines on home artificial nutrition specifically for oncological patients. They have also emphasized the importance of maintaining a balanced omega 6/omega 3 ratio for overall health. Furthermore, G&#243;mez Candela C serves as an editor for the "Manual de recomendaciones nutricionales en pacientes geri&#225;tricos," where they contribute to the development of nutritional recommendations for geriatric patients.</data>
      <data key="d2">4cf0c8d0f4e711be85d16ee71317aa4e,54f3b76c0240696aa63ae60ad52b82b6,8bcd338de10fbee8f3c808cc30b69b25,ed9b8701ef76cf4813eccfc58d6be998,fa36086a4b64a662e6e1752ee6e589aa,fff76d1cd0e64233a5727a707d80e2b9</data>
