    <node id="ASTENIA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Astenia is a condition characterized by a state of physical weakness or lack of energy. It is commonly recognized as a symptom associated with advanced cancer, where it is highly prevalent among non-oncological palliative patients. Additionally, astenia can also manifest as a symptom in individuals with celiac disease, further highlighting its association with various health conditions.</data>
      <data key="d2">3ec4c9fa90e7083cd895d95efed02f84,d3f53b7b7352e8ba2fd9dc8be977648c</data>
      <data key="d3">1082</data>
