    <node id="ASPEN BOARD OF DIRECTORS">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The ASPEN Board of Directors is a governing body responsible for establishing and overseeing guidelines and standards related to parenteral and enteral nutrition practices in medical settings. This board plays a crucial role in ensuring that nutrition support therapy is effectively implemented for both adult and pediatric patients. The ASPEN Board of Directors is dedicated to providing comprehensive guidelines that facilitate the appropriate use of nutrition practices, thereby enhancing patient care and outcomes in various clinical environments.</data>
      <data key="d2">2f5d9123a78d23b1bc3d9f06d7a53d78,9ef354c0ee5ac877ce8fba79fcc7e2b3,c3d9237f72732f1f51141fa79be271c9,ceb66a898fed371e013171c43a87e1d1,df3e8fd56a2df522425984adc77392ab,f902ee3930fcc849fa131b58d6e4933d</data>
