    <node id="LAS PALMAS DE GRAN CANARIA">
      <data key="d0">GEO</data>
      <data key="d1">Las Palmas de Gran Canaria is a city located in the Canary Islands, Spain. It is notable for being a hub of medical publications related to palliative care and nutrition. Additionally, the city is home to the Hospital Universitario Insular de Gran Canaria, a significant healthcare facility that contributes to the region's medical services and research.</data>
      <data key="d2">4c4d1882f0ac14b7c55941ec1c17b650,9f0dc667db1447b9e51420cc6ba091c9,ce62d279f86b3364fed4e121ad2d5e1f,d2f4a90f3a3df7c568cd82d019bb5edd</data>
