    </node>
    <node id="RN PRET&#201;RMINO">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">RN PRET&#201;RMINO refers to fortified breast milk or formulas specifically designed for preterm infants. This nutritional support is provided until the infants reach a certain weight or gestational age, ensuring they receive the necessary nutrients for healthy growth and development.</data>
      <data key="d2">c3d9237f72732f1f51141fa79be271c9,e41a9b2827462263a11ef60ce74c160b</data>
      <data key="d3">664</data>
