    </node>
    <node id="ESPGHAN COMMITTEE ON NUTRITION">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The ESPGHAN Committee on Nutrition is responsible for developing guidelines and recommendations focused on nutrition for infants and children. This committee also offers practical approaches to pediatric enteral nutrition, ensuring that healthcare professionals have the necessary resources to support the nutritional needs of young patients effectively.</data>
      <data key="d2">561247e03fd2c7b8ca61c7f8ee874d38,c3d9237f72732f1f51141fa79be271c9</data>
