    <node id="DESCOLOCACI&#211;N INADVERTIDA DE LA SONDA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Inadvertent dislocation of the tube can lead to obstruction of the gastric outlet tract or displacement into the gastrocutaneous fistula tract.</data>
