      <data key="d5">3</data>
      <data key="d6">2508</data>
      <data key="d7">c2c22059104241a3be6f7ced3299d797</data>
    </node>
    <node id="PEDR&#211;N GINER C">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Pedr&#243;n Giner C is a prominent figure in the field of pediatric nutrition, recognized for his significant contributions to both enteral and parenteral nutrition literature. He is a co-author of a consensus document on pediatric parenteral nutrition published in the journal Nutr Hosp. Additionally, he has played a vital role in developing guidelines and literature related to pediatric enteral nutrition, demonstrating his expertise and commitment to improving nutritional practices for children. His extensive writing on these topics underscores his influence and dedication to advancing knowledge in pediatric nutrition.</data>
      <data key="d2">5a69e2f952998ea5b7109ad2d51a7849,7ea112a550fd775a80c3eda15663fba5,b410dfc796e4ac9178ac19ac368e2036,fbeb9736ced2a2a020bdb39bdd10de0d</data>
