    </node>
    <node id="MORO VILLARES JM">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Moreno Villares JM is a co-author engaged in pediatric nutrition research and standardization. In addition to this role, he also addresses the ethical aspects of nutrition and hydration in children, contributing to a comprehensive understanding of these critical issues in pediatric care.</data>
      <data key="d2">193f43446f6311107c8a73b6111fa25a,5a69e2f952998ea5b7109ad2d51a7849</data>
