    <node id="TABLAS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">The entity "TABLAS" refers to tables included in a document that serve multiple purposes related to nutrition. These tables provide diagnostic parameters for assessing the severity of malnutrition, offering essential criteria for evaluation. Additionally, they outline the main indications for enteral nutrition in pediatrics, detailing various medical conditions and their corresponding nutritional requirements. Together, these tables serve as a comprehensive resource for understanding and addressing nutritional needs in both malnutrition assessment and enteral nutrition guidance for pediatric patients.</data>
      <data key="d2">5a69e2f952998ea5b7109ad2d51a7849,bf0cc16dc61df5b90a5a1e961322391a</data>
      <data key="d5">0</data>
      <data key="d6">2512</data>
      <data key="d7">4d423c0708ad446d8e46243ca2d0ed8a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="DIFICULTADES PARA LA INGESTI&#211;N">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">A category of conditions that impede the ability to ingest food, necessitating enteral nutrition in pediatric patients.</data>
      <data key="d2">5a69e2f952998ea5b7109ad2d51a7849</data>
      <data key="d5">0</data>
      <data key="d6">2513</data>
