    <node id="ENFERMEDAD ONCOL&#211;GICA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">The entity "ENFERMEDAD ONCOL&#211;GICA" refers to a type of cancer that can significantly impact the nutritional status of patients, particularly pediatric patients undergoing treatment. This condition may necessitate specialized nutritional support, including enteral nutrition, to address the nutritional needs of these young patients. Additionally, "ENFERMEDAD ONCOL&#211;GICA" is associated with an increased prevalence of malnutrition, especially in advanced stages of the disease. This highlights the critical importance of nutritional management in the care of individuals affected by cancer.</data>
      <data key="d2">02b61e2d4f840772c76a05502aa4f171,5a69e2f952998ea5b7109ad2d51a7849</data>
      <data key="d3">1099</data>
