      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Mart&#237;nez Costa C is a notable figure in the field of pediatric nutrition, recognized for their contributions to various aspects of this specialty. They are a co-author of a consensus document on pediatric parenteral nutrition, which was published in the journal Nutr Hosp. Additionally, Mart&#237;nez Costa C has collaborated on research concerning enteral nutrition in pediatrics, further demonstrating their expertise in this area. Their work also encompasses a range of topics related to nutritional assessment and pediatric nutrition, highlighting their commitment to advancing knowledge and practices in the field.</data>
