    <node id="M. GORMAZ MORENO">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">M. Gormaz Moreno is an author who has made significant contributions to the field of neonatal nutrition. They are involved in writing a chapter on enteral nutrition for newborns in a medical text, as well as contributing to a chapter on neonatal parenteral nutrition. Through these contributions, M. Gormaz Moreno plays a vital role in advancing knowledge and practices related to the nutritional care of newborns.</data>
