    <node id="J. DALMAU SERRA">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">J. Dalmau Serra is an accomplished author who has made significant contributions to the field of pediatric nutrition. He is notably involved in writing chapters on enteral nutrition for newborns and neonatal parenteral nutrition in a medical text, showcasing his expertise in these critical areas of infant care. Additionally, J. Dalmau Serra addresses complications associated with long-term central venous catheters in pediatrics, further highlighting his commitment to improving health outcomes for children. Through these contributions, he plays a vital role in advancing knowledge and practices in pediatric nutrition and care.</data>
