    <node id="ASOCIACI&#211;N ESPA&#209;OLA DE PEDIATR&#205;A">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The Asociaci&#243;n Espa&#241;ola de Pediatr&#237;a (AEP) is a professional organization dedicated to promoting the health and welfare of children in Spain. It focuses on various aspects of pediatric health, including nutrition, and provides dietary recommendations for children. Among its initiatives, the AEP emphasizes the importance of vitamin D intake guidelines to ensure the well-being of children. Through its efforts, the AEP plays a crucial role in advocating for and supporting the health needs of the pediatric population in Spain.</data>
