    </node>
    <node id="HUMAN MILK">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Human milk is discussed in the context of its composition and nutritional value for preterm infants, as well as guidelines for its use.</data>
      <data key="d2">ea5e972294754a47333efb4c580cf15c</data>
      <data key="d3">537</data>
      <data key="d4">1</data>
      <data key="d5">6</data>
      <data key="d6">2594</data>
      <data key="d7">cebaa736bbd24a22b440b132aea59f30</data>
    </node>
    <node id="TSANG R.">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Tsang R. is the editor of the book "Nutrition of the Preterm Infant," which includes a chapter on human milk.</data>
      <data key="d2">ea5e972294754a47333efb4c580cf15c</data>
      <data key="d3">537</data>
