    <node id="INFATRINI">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Infatrini is a high-calorie, semi-elemental nutritional formula produced by Nutricia, specifically designed for infants up to 12 months of age who have increased energy needs. This polymeric formula provides 1 kcal/ml, making it suitable for infants requiring nutritional support to promote their growth and development. Infatrini aims to meet the unique dietary requirements of young children, ensuring they receive the necessary nutrients for healthy growth.</data>
      <data key="d2">3f0bfab71cc06082c8260831cbfc6348,4a251705839547c8dcd0e9ddc5bb4066,8366a6776a090c4e13b4746a1b23e96f</data>
