    </node>
    <node id="DISPLASIA BRONCOPULMONAR">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Bronchopulmonary dysplasia, also known as displasia broncopulmonar, is a serious chronic lung condition that primarily affects premature infants. This condition necessitates specialized care and management due to its complexity. Additionally, it requires careful dietary considerations to support the health and development of affected infants.</data>
      <data key="d2">8366a6776a090c4e13b4746a1b23e96f,e5b3805730df59cb36030c92aa33c194</data>
