    <node id="VITAMIN B2">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Vitamin B2, also known as riboflavin, is a vital B vitamin that plays a crucial role in energy production and cellular function. It is commonly included in dietary supplements, such as Hidropolivit, highlighting its importance in maintaining overall health and supporting metabolic processes.</data>
      <data key="d2">8366a6776a090c4e13b4746a1b23e96f,acfde2ff93b969353912836034d74242</data>
      <data key="d3">1629</data>
