    <node id="VITAMIN A">
      <data key="d0" />
      <data key="d1">Vitamin A is a fat-soluble vitamin that is essential for various bodily functions, including vision, immune function, and skin health. It is particularly important for patients with specific health conditions, as there are recommended dosages tailored for their needs. Additionally, Vitamin A contributes to the growth and development of the skeleton by influencing protein synthesis and the differentiation of bone cells.</data>
      <data key="d2">65ba063e1a9e43a87dbfe9cf627674b1,8366a6776a090c4e13b4746a1b23e96f,acfde2ff93b969353912836034d74242,d76cb2d50e736da37be7fe2a415a7281</data>
