    <node id="INFUVITE PEDI&#193;TRICO">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">INFUVITE PEDI&#193;TRICO is a specialized vitamin preparation designed for infants, particularly aimed at meeting the nutritional needs of preterm infants. The product consists of two vials that provide essential nutritional supplementation, ensuring that infants receive the necessary vitamins for their growth and development.</data>
      <data key="d2">49e05b04f80c53d5f20f7d97f970f5dd,fa356397bc52582bdbbd1868639feec9</data>
