    </node>
    <node id="NEONATES">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Neonates are newborn infants who are particularly characterized by their need for specialized nutritional support, including parenteral nutrition and specific lipid solutions. These infants may exhibit unique intestinal adaptation capabilities that differentiate them from older children and adults, highlighting their distinct nutritional and developmental needs.</data>
      <data key="d2">4ada21f24df8df18dbc05f5619c0a368,bb7584256e051f1c3d8cb13502ade155,fa356397bc52582bdbbd1868639feec9</data>
