    <node id="ACIDO PANTOT&#201;NICO">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Pantothenic acid, or Vitamin B5, is a water-soluble vitamin important for the synthesis of coenzyme A, included in Infuvite Pedi&#225;trico.</data>
