    <node id="ACIDO F&#211;LICO">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">ACIDO F&#211;LICO, also known as Vitamin B9, is a vital micronutrient essential for various physiological functions, particularly in older adults, where it helps prevent deficiencies and related health issues. It plays a crucial role in DNA synthesis and repair, making it an important component in parenteral nutrition formulations to support cell division. Additionally, Folic acid is included in products like Infuvite Pedi&#225;trico, highlighting its significance in both adult and pediatric health.</data>
      <data key="d2">49e05b04f80c53d5f20f7d97f970f5dd,aa44a32ccc29ae80ddbbc4a77b33a297,f757d4ff813fdf7b43b3382e7e1bd69c</data>
