      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Farmacia is the pharmacy department dedicated to providing medications and nutritional support to patients. It plays a crucial role in preparing parenteral nutrition under sterile conditions, ensuring both safety and efficacy in the delivery of these essential health services.</data>
