    <node id="VITAMINA K1">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Vitamin K1, also known as Phylloquinone, is a vital nutrient found in plants that plays a crucial role in supporting blood clotting and maintaining bone health. It is often included in parenteral nutrition to ensure adequate levels of this essential vitamin, which is necessary for the proper functioning of the coagulation process in the body.</data>
