    <node id="J PEDIATR GASTROENTEROL NUTR">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">The "J PEDIATR GASTROENTEROL NUTR," also known as the Journal of Pediatric Gastroenterology and Nutrition, is a scientific journal dedicated to publishing research and guidelines pertinent to the fields of pediatric gastroenterology and nutrition. The journal features a variety of studies, including those focused on pediatric gastrointestinal health and specific conditions such as cystic fibrosis. It serves as a vital resource for professionals in the field, contributing to the advancement of knowledge and practices related to the nutritional and gastrointestinal well-being of children.</data>
      <data key="d2">39a32082aa23f1e71dc12d92750ca657,52d93d6adba464a2397ddec01d152840,deb3afabda4adf3c61e4b9e1545103cc,fbeb9736ced2a2a020bdb39bdd10de0d</data>
