    <node id="DE CURTIS M">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">De Curtis M is a prominent researcher in the field of neonatal nutrition, particularly focusing on the nutritional needs of preterm infants. They have co-authored a commentary on enteral nutrient supply for preterm infants, which was published in the Journal of Pediatric Gastroenterology and Nutrition. Additionally, De Curtis M contributed to a document addressing the nutrition of preterm infants, published in Early Human Development. Their research also encompasses the study of parenteral nutrition in premature infants, highlighting their commitment to improving nutritional strategies for this vulnerable population.</data>
