    <node id="GOMIS MU&#209;OZ P">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Gomis Mu&#241;oz P is a notable figure in the field of pediatric nutrition and healthcare. He is a co-author of a consensus document on pediatric parenteral nutrition, which was published in the journal Nutr Hosp. Additionally, he has contributed to a study focused on intravenous lipid emulsions in pediatric parenteral nutrition, published in Acta Pediatr Esp. Furthermore, Gomis Mu&#241;oz P has also engaged in research concerning sealing methods in pediatric patients, showcasing his diverse contributions to improving pediatric care and nutrition.</data>
