    <node id="MORENO VILLARES JM">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Moreno Villares JM is a notable figure in the field of pediatric nutrition, particularly in the area of parenteral nutrition. He is a co-author of a consensus document on pediatric parenteral nutrition, which was published in the journal Nutr Hosp. Additionally, he contributed as a co-author to a study focusing on intravenous lipid emulsions in pediatric parenteral nutrition, published in Acta Pediatr Esp. Furthermore, Moreno Villares JM has been involved in research concerning sealing methods for pediatric patients who require home parenteral nutrition. His work reflects a commitment to advancing knowledge and practices in pediatric nutritional care.</data>
