      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">C. Ribes Koninckx is one of the authors discussing complications related to long-term central venous catheters in pediatrics.</data>
      <data key="d2">7c60735b2451e2d314fe6c5377b7a79d</data>
