    </node>
    <node id="TROMBOLISIS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Trombolysis is a medical procedure designed to dissolve blood clots that obstruct blood vessels. It is indicated for use in patients under specific circumstances to ensure effective treatment. This procedure plays a crucial role in managing conditions where blood flow is compromised due to clot formation.</data>
      <data key="d2">5ad53a3f16964261ae37b64f7c3cb688,6b73aed941007771a7f23462cdb4470b</data>
      <data key="d3">764</data>
