    <node id="S. AUREUS">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">S. Aureus, also known as Staphylococcus aureus, is a type of bacteria that can lead to various infections. It is commonly associated with skin and respiratory flora and poses a particular risk to individuals with compromised health. This bacterium is known for its ability to cause a range of infections, highlighting its significance in both clinical and community settings.</data>
      <data key="d2">5ad53a3f16964261ae37b64f7c3cb688,f79f02438413f5accef9ac5fbd96f6df</data>
      <data key="d3">767</data>
