    </node>
    <node id="ENDOCARDITIS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Endocarditis is an infection of the inner lining of the heart, often considered a serious complication that can arise from catheter-related infections. It is particularly associated with patients who have central venous catheters (CVC). This condition poses significant health risks and requires careful management to prevent severe outcomes.</data>
      <data key="d2">5ad53a3f16964261ae37b64f7c3cb688,f79f02438413f5accef9ac5fbd96f6df</data>
      <data key="d3">766</data>
