    <node id="CL&#205;NICA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Cl&#237;nica refers to healthcare facilities where professionals apply nutritional assessment methods to enhance patient care. Additionally, it encompasses the clinical presentation of infections associated with catheters, detailing symptoms and diagnostic criteria for sepsis and other related complications. This dual focus highlights the importance of both nutritional support and infection management within clinical settings.</data>
      <data key="d2">caf1d075a295b93dcd3c6f5cf72b028d,f79f02438413f5accef9ac5fbd96f6df</data>
