    <node id="PROTOCOLO DE DIAGN&#211;STICO Y SEGUIMIENTO NUTRICIONAL DE LA DISFAGIA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">The "PROTOCOLO DE DIAGN&#211;STICO Y SEGUIMIENTO NUTRICIONAL DE LA DISFAGIA" is a comprehensive protocol designed for the diagnosis and monitoring of dysphagia. It details specific procedures and assessments aimed at ensuring safe swallowing for patients experiencing this condition. The protocol not only focuses on the diagnostic aspects but also emphasizes the importance of nutritional follow-up for individuals with dysphagia. It provides guidelines for safe eating practices, ensuring that patients receive appropriate recommendations to manage their condition effectively. Overall, this protocol serves as a crucial resource for healthcare professionals in the assessment and ongoing care of dysphagia patients.</data>
      <data key="d2">0f426d03e5adabc2a16b5c9a9df1c32c,2d50b3b46d83d6e824edc64e142cbf8a,806140d9fadd08a1e72238d53c829eb2</data>
