      <data key="d1">Crowther M is an author known for conducting systematic reviews in the medical field. Notably, Crowther M authored a systematic review on post-thrombotic syndrome in children, contributing valuable insights into this condition. Additionally, Crowther M also conducted a systematic review focused on glutamine supplementation in stem cell transplantation, further showcasing expertise in the area of clinical research and its implications for patient care.</data>
