    <node id="ACV">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">ACV, or Accidente Vascular Cerebral, is a medical event commonly known as a stroke. It is particularly significant in the elderly population, as it can lead to various complications, including swallowing difficulties. Additionally, ACV is associated with central nervous system disorders and can be a contributing factor to conditions such as Syndrome of Inappropriate Antidiuretic Hormone secretion (SIADH).</data>
      <data key="d2">98f9ca00cf50b7e359aa41f1d58d0735,addd6db95fafa3464a6f085f8d0041ce</data>
      <data key="d3">953</data>
