    </node>
    <node id="UMCE">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">UMCE refers to a specific medical unit that focuses on patients at risk of dysphagia. Within this unit, hospital wards have implemented a protocol for dysphagia screening to ensure that patients receive appropriate care and assessment related to their swallowing difficulties.</data>
      <data key="d2">42cc35e2edb450d48bb31f7c51b7a02f,98f9ca00cf50b7e359aa41f1d58d0735,d590f931bbeb2d87392c751f2746e4da</data>
      <data key="d3">959</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">2</data>
      <data key="d6">2894</data>
