    <node id="UMLE">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">UMLE is an organization involved in the protocolized treatment of patients with dysphagia, a condition that affects swallowing. It operates within hospital wards where dysphagia screening is systematically implemented for patients. Additionally, UMLE may refer to another medical unit that specializes in the assessment and treatment of dysphagia, further emphasizing its role in ensuring comprehensive care for individuals with this condition.</data>
      <data key="d2">42cc35e2edb450d48bb31f7c51b7a02f,98f9ca00cf50b7e359aa41f1d58d0735,d590f931bbeb2d87392c751f2746e4da</data>
