    <node id="NUTRITIONAL PROTOCOL FOR DYSPHAGIA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">A protocol for diagnosing and monitoring nutritional needs in patients with dysphagia, including dietary recommendations and assessments.</data>
      <data key="d2">d590f931bbeb2d87392c751f2746e4da</data>
      <data key="d3">274</data>
      <data key="d4">1</data>
      <data key="d5">9</data>
      <data key="d6">2899</data>
      <data key="d7">4bc653a756fb458fa7db35e1b11a71fa</data>
    </node>
    <node id="NUTILIS">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Nutilis is a thickening agent utilized in both hospital settings and nutritional products. It is specifically designed to assist patients with dysphagia, a condition that affects swallowing, by modifying the consistency of liquids to ensure they are safe and easier to consume. Nutilis plays a crucial role in helping these patients achieve the appropriate food consistency, thereby enhancing their ability to eat and drink safely.</data>
      <data key="d2">9b853d8ac0d48f1111932f52fb0749db,d590f931bbeb2d87392c751f2746e4da</data>
      <data key="d3">274</data>
