    <node id="HOSPITAL GENERAL UNIVERSITARIO DE ALICANTE">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The Hospital General Universitario de Alicante is a prominent healthcare institution that specializes in various medical services. It is home to Dr. &#193;ngel Luis Abad Gonz&#225;lez, who serves as a specialist in endocrinology and nutrition. Additionally, Dr. &#211;scar Moreno P&#233;rez plays a significant role at the hospital, coordinating the Diabetes Unit within the Endocrinology and Nutrition Service. The hospital is also recognized for its commitment to patient care, providing nutritional protocols specifically designed for patients with dysphagia. Overall, the Hospital General Universitario de Alicante is dedicated to delivering comprehensive medical care and specialized services to its patients.</data>
