      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">F&#211;RMULA PEPT&#205;DICA is a specialized enteral nutrition formula that contains peptides, specifically designed for patients with cystic fibrosis who experience difficulties tolerating other nutritional formulas. This peptide-based formula is tailored to meet the dietary needs of individuals with specific digestive challenges, as it includes hydrolyzed proteins that facilitate easier digestion and absorption. Overall, F&#211;RMULA PEPT&#205;DICA serves as an essential nutritional support option for those requiring specialized dietary interventions.</data>
