    <node id="BAXTER">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Baxter is a global healthcare company recognized for its extensive range of medical products and services. The company has conducted studies focusing on patients receiving Nutritional Parenteral Delivery (NPD), emphasizing various psychosocial aspects and quality of life. As a manufacturer, Baxter is known for producing nutritional solutions, including nitrogenous and lipid solutions specifically designed for parenteral nutrition. Additionally, Baxter has engaged in research that reviews the quality of life of adult patients who are treated with long-term parenteral nutrition, further highlighting its commitment to improving patient outcomes in the healthcare sector.</data>
