    <node id="SOCIEDAD ESPA&#209;OLA DE GERIATR&#205;A Y GERONTOLOG&#205;A">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The "Sociedad Espa&#241;ola de Geriatr&#237;a y Gerontolog&#237;a" is a professional society in Spain dedicated to the fields of geriatrics and gerontology. This organization is actively involved in research and education aimed at enhancing the health and well-being of older adults. It focuses on various aspects related to aging, including the promotion of elderly care, addressing issues of frailty, and improving the nutritional needs of the elderly population. Through its initiatives, the Sociedad Espa&#241;ola de Geriatr&#237;a y Gerontolog&#237;a aims to advance the understanding and management of health care for elderly patients in Spain.</data>
      <data key="d2">65e1359e381a0ac66f53b3a6eeba408b,7131ab51390b43ca6b91c75d8057bea2,ba214f6f228224af19c5ca2dcc9c6772,c3fea62b02f75fe3cf6e469e624ac7f9,d6c8f8036af0c4f0b6f7938c4bab491f</data>
