      <data key="d1">Dr. Manuel Ant&#243;n Jim&#233;nez is a geriatrician at Hospital Ntra. Sra. de la Monta&#241;a in C&#225;ceres. He plays a significant role in the dietary guidelines for older adults, ensuring that their nutritional needs are met. Additionally, he is actively involved in the study and treatment of elderly patients, focusing on their overall health and well-being. Through his work, Dr. Jim&#233;nez contributes to improving the quality of care for the aging population.</data>
