    <node id="ENVEJECIMIENTO Y NUTRICI&#211;N">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">"ENVEJECIMIENTO Y NUTRICI&#211;N" refers to a comprehensive series and discussion focused on the relationship between aging and nutrition, particularly emphasizing the dietary needs and nutritional requirements of older adults. This initiative includes a conference or publication that provides nutritional intervention guidelines specifically designed for frail elderly individuals. It aims to promote healthy aging through proper nutrition, offering insights and recommendations for the nutritional management of the elderly population. The series addresses the impact of nutrition on aging and related health issues, highlighting the importance of dietary considerations in the treatment of conditions such as frailty. Additionally, it emphasizes the role of physical activity and adequate caloric and protein intake in maintaining the health and well-being of older adults. Overall, "ENVEJECIMIENTO Y NUTRICI&#211;N" serves as a vital resource for understanding and addressing the nutritional needs of the aging population.</data>
      <data key="d2">1052683f23a0c9825af9c5c1d39ceb2c,2cff1005fe34ac994249b78b4ca112c7,368804d3e1f8a58c4e6c3a8210f08a35,4913cc391a44397e2e1ea12979e1fd58,65e1359e381a0ac66f53b3a6eeba408b,6656dd3bdc79720504c3e4245f935d32,72bafac70ee8322d8f303cf94612b461,c3fea62b02f75fe3cf6e469e624ac7f9,c7af1c950a6caab8be5d180a2889a25a,d6c8f8036af0c4f0b6f7938c4bab491f</data>
