    </node>
    <node id="SHARE-FI">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">SHARE-FI, or the Frailty Instrument for Primary Care of the Survey of Health, Ageing, and Retirement in Europe, is a model designed for the assessment of frailty in elderly individuals. It serves as a valuable tool for detecting frailty, which is a critical aspect of health evaluation in older adults.</data>
      <data key="d2">00a918807f0c6568ea1d9f0c41f1ad49,17f48ff2bbbb22ecd24983f41739c88b</data>
      <data key="d3">708</data>
