    <node id="ABIZANDA SOLER P">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Abizanda Soler P is a researcher and author recognized for his contributions to the study of frailty and aging in the elderly. His work has significantly advanced the understanding of nutritional interventions and the role of cytokines in the health of older adults. Additionally, he has focused on clarifying the appropriate usage of the term "fragility" in the context of elderly populations, further enhancing the discourse surrounding this important aspect of gerontology.</data>
      <data key="d2">72bafac70ee8322d8f303cf94612b461,caab2e12a2bce3c947d663cf8b71cb67</data>
