    <node id="MORLEY JE">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Morley JE is a prominent researcher known for his extensive contributions to the fields of frailty and aging. He has published numerous works that focus on these critical areas, including significant studies related to sarcopenia and limited mobility in older adults. Morley JE has played a vital role in the development of the frailty consensus, advocating for improved understanding and management of frailty in elderly care. His efforts emphasize the importance of addressing frailty as a key component of aging, and he has called for action to enhance care strategies for the elderly population.</data>
      <data key="d2">3be9d646c354d76527755d79a77c916b,72bafac70ee8322d8f303cf94612b461,933cfaece6287ed7626c5216a1e5c54d,ea432f742f5cd2b4840a984ae35a9d09</data>
