    </node>
    <node id="ROCKWOOD K">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Rockwood K is a prominent researcher in the field of geriatric medicine, particularly recognized for his significant contributions to the study of frailty in elderly individuals. He is known for developing a global clinical measure of fitness and frailty, which has been instrumental in advancing the understanding and assessment of these critical aspects of health in older populations. Through his work, Rockwood K has made substantial contributions to the field, enhancing the care and management of frailty among the elderly.</data>
      <data key="d2">3be9d646c354d76527755d79a77c916b,72bafac70ee8322d8f303cf94612b461,ea432f742f5cd2b4840a984ae35a9d09</data>
