    <node id="BMC GERIATRICS">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">BMC GERIATRICS is a journal dedicated to publishing research focused on geriatric medicine and the aging process. It specifically addresses important topics such as co-morbidities and the development of pressure ulcers among older adults, contributing valuable insights into the health challenges faced by this demographic. Through its publications, BMC GERIATRICS aims to enhance the understanding and management of health issues related to aging.</data>
      <data key="d2">36c1edffe986e2f70996b6e440e11213,ea432f742f5cd2b4840a984ae35a9d09</data>
      <data key="d3">268</data>
