    </node>
    <node id="LANCET">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The Lancet is a prestigious and leading medical journal that publishes a wide array of research and reviews across various fields of medicine. It covers numerous health topics, including frailty in elderly individuals, obesity and nutrition, mortality and disease burden, cardiovascular disease, and clinical trials related to pancreatitis. The journal is recognized for its contributions to the medical community, including the publication of significant studies such as the findings of the Zutphen Elderly Study. Additionally, The Lancet features research articles that explore dietary interventions and their health outcomes, solidifying its role as a vital source of information in the medical field.</data>
      <data key="d2">35a49a079daea350a5552c8fd96d7967,428616513e9e654c21ede19bd544ffbc,63593ac5546e44eaddb37a2f257bfa80,6533cbcb76873caf6fd68eb95d313d24,a3d355dd6da93691c892691f873338aa,bb2e69a0ff4c25a21149882162922c8d,e271766bdc88e84209e5cdac4adc0724,e757275b1935a42dabd03a0b528649a3,ea432f742f5cd2b4840a984ae35a9d09</data>
