    <node id="FRAILTY INDEX">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">The Frailty Index is a tool designed to evaluate frailty in older adults by utilizing a range of health indicators. It serves as an important assessment method to identify individuals who may be at increased risk of adverse health outcomes due to frailty.</data>
