    </node>
    <node id="AGEING">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Ageing is a natural process that impacts both hormone levels and physiological functions, resulting in a range of health considerations. It affects physical and cognitive health, often leading to conditions such as frailty and dementia. As individuals age, they may experience changes that necessitate attention to their overall well-being and health management.</data>
      <data key="d2">b5f705e0ba650f5ad1f558446be0191e,f979a07da5d7c814ccf957629ab91cc5</data>
      <data key="d3">398</data>
