    </node>
    <node id="CRIBADO DE DESNUTRICI&#211;N">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">"CRIBADO DE DESNUTRICI&#211;N" refers to a screening process designed to identify individuals at risk of malnutrition. This nutritional screening is particularly important in clinical settings, where it is recommended to be conducted in hospitals, especially for elderly patients. The primary goal of this process is to detect malnutrition early, allowing for timely intervention and support to improve the nutritional status of at-risk individuals.</data>
      <data key="d2">54633fef79a422c0fada846ff2b861ba,83d00bec042a3fe8b69d68316d8569ff,dbfd111867924ed831f05d8fff01888b</data>
