    </node>
    <node id="HOSPITALIZED PATIENTS">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Hospitalized patients are individuals receiving medical care in a hospital setting. They often require nutritional assessment and support to aid in their recovery. This group includes patients admitted for various treatments, particularly those suffering from liver cirrhosis and its related complications.</data>
      <data key="d2">49e6a5571bf2f206ac38ac536d70f710,d26aec24f3f8c930c1c4b1d464bacd6b,ef8194ca70c613876b927087bf7554f5</data>
