    <node id="ALTA HOSPITALARIA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">ALTA HOSPITALARIA refers to the discharge of a patient from the hospital after they have received treatment. This process, known as hospital discharge, involves releasing the patient from the hospital's care. A critical aspect of this transition is ensuring that the patient receives appropriate nutritional care, which is essential for their recovery following hospitalization.</data>
      <data key="d2">1bad878c6efa9d3f5719546bb51bccb6,4681f41ebd69a732f7a8be6c2ed0f51a</data>
      <data key="d3">1080</data>
