      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">&#193;lvarez-Hern&#225;ndez J is a researcher who focuses on malnutrition and its management within hospital settings. He has conducted studies examining the prevalence and costs associated with malnutrition in hospitalized patients, contributing valuable insights to the field. His work emphasizes the importance of addressing malnutrition to improve patient outcomes in healthcare environments.</data>
      <data key="d2">2f5d9123a78d23b1bc3d9f06d7a53d78,d80f1e55925e0ce0cd958e35ad2e49ff</data>
