    <node id="CRUZ-JENTOFT AJ">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Cruz-Jentoft AJ is a prominent researcher associated with the European Working Group on Sarcopenia in Older People. He has made significant contributions to the consensus on sarcopenia, a condition characterized by the loss of muscle mass and strength in older adults. His research focuses on the implications of sarcopenia for this demographic, highlighting the importance of understanding and addressing this condition to improve the health and quality of life for older individuals.</data>
      <data key="d2">066ca85c476fdb709bb2b588cb86a55a,3be9d646c354d76527755d79a77c916b,d80f1e55925e0ce0cd958e35ad2e49ff</data>
