    <node id="WALSTON J">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Walston J is a researcher actively engaged in the Cardiovascular Health Study, where he focuses on frailty and its relationship with comorbidities in older adults. His research encompasses the study of frailty, including its activation and the associations it has with inflammation in this demographic. Through his work, Walston J contributes valuable insights into the complexities of frailty and its impact on cardiovascular health among older individuals.</data>
      <data key="d2">0903b40c7774225e89c5e798f9feef9b,3be9d646c354d76527755d79a77c916b,3ec3efbe130c20d623681e00e3d784f7</data>
