    </node>
    <node id="MCBURNIE MA">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">McBurnie MA is a researcher actively engaged in the Cardiovascular Health Study, which focuses on aging and frailty. In addition to this primary research area, McBurnie MA has also contributed to studies examining the relationship between frailty and inflammation systems. Through these efforts, McBurnie MA plays a significant role in advancing the understanding of cardiovascular health in the context of aging and related health challenges.</data>
      <data key="d2">0903b40c7774225e89c5e798f9feef9b,3be9d646c354d76527755d79a77c916b,3ec3efbe130c20d623681e00e3d784f7</data>
