    <node id="NEWMAN A">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Newman A is a researcher known for significant contributions to the fields of frailty and aging. Their work has particularly focused on the health outcomes of older adults, emphasizing the relationship between frailty and overall health. Additionally, Newman A participated in the Cardiovascular Health Study, furthering their involvement in research that addresses critical health issues affecting the elderly population.</data>
      <data key="d2">0903b40c7774225e89c5e798f9feef9b,3be9d646c354d76527755d79a77c916b,3ec3efbe130c20d623681e00e3d784f7</data>
