    <node id="WEINHEIMER EM">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Weinheimer EM is a researcher known for conducting systematic reviews that explore the effects of diet and exercise on various populations. Notably, Weinheimer EM has focused on the impact of energy restriction and exercise on fat-free mass, as well as the effects of these factors specifically on older adults. Through this research, Weinheimer EM contributes valuable insights into the relationship between nutrition, physical activity, and body composition across different age groups.</data>
      <data key="d2">0903b40c7774225e89c5e798f9feef9b,3ec3efbe130c20d623681e00e3d784f7</data>
