    <node id="SANDS LP">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Sands LP is a researcher dedicated to studying nutrition and its effects on health, particularly in older populations. Additionally, Sands LP is involved in conducting systematic reviews that examine the relationship between energy restriction and exercise. Through this work, Sands LP contributes valuable insights into the impact of dietary and physical activity interventions on the well-being of older adults.</data>
      <data key="d2">0903b40c7774225e89c5e798f9feef9b,3ec3efbe130c20d623681e00e3d784f7</data>
