    <node id="CAMPBELL WW">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Campbell WW is a researcher known for his contributions to the field of nutrition and aging. He has played a significant role in conducting a systematic review on fat-free mass in older adults, highlighting the importance of maintaining muscle mass as individuals age. Additionally, Campbell WW has studied the effects of dietary interventions specifically tailored for older adults, further emphasizing his commitment to understanding and improving the health and well-being of this demographic through nutrition.</data>
      <data key="d2">0903b40c7774225e89c5e798f9feef9b,3ec3efbe130c20d623681e00e3d784f7</data>
