    <node id="NUTRITION REVIEWS">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Nutrition Reviews is a journal dedicated to providing comprehensive and critical reviews of the literature in nutrition science and dietetics. It focuses on the implications of nutrition for health and publishes systematic reviews on various nutrition-related topics. Key areas of interest include the effects of energy restriction and exercise on health, making it a valuable resource for researchers and practitioners in the field of nutrition.</data>
      <data key="d2">0903b40c7774225e89c5e798f9feef9b,428616513e9e654c21ede19bd544ffbc,c3182f51249513a920db6b935632fead</data>
