    <node id="VITAMIN D DEFICIENCY">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Vitamin D deficiency is a health condition characterized by insufficient levels of vitamin D in the body, which is crucial for maintaining bone health. This deficiency can lead to a range of health issues, particularly frailty in older adults. Additionally, it is prevalent among patients with chronic liver disease, where it can significantly affect their overall health. Research has also indicated that vitamin D deficiency may influence various health factors, including an increased risk of cardiovascular problems. Overall, vitamin D deficiency poses a serious concern for multiple aspects of health, necessitating attention and management.</data>
      <data key="d2">0903b40c7774225e89c5e798f9feef9b,9303a85464d02f1cc012aaca21edf9bb,c45c1688135653a80812cdaf426ec9a3,d93c7f9ea61d85e6be22df63c4b67d4d</data>
      <data key="d3">478</data>
      <data key="d4">1</data>
