    <node id="TABLA 6">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Table 6 provides a comprehensive overview of various aspects related to parenteral nutrition. It outlines the calculations necessary for determining the requirements for the composition of parenteral nutrition, ensuring that patients receive adequate nutritional support. Additionally, Table 6 presents the results of complementary tests conducted six months after the initiation of artificial nutritional support, highlighting various health parameters of the patient. Furthermore, it summarizes the energy and macronutrient requirements specifically for older adults, offering dietary recommendations tailored to this demographic. Overall, Table 6 serves as a crucial resource for understanding the nutritional needs and health outcomes associated with parenteral nutrition.</data>
      <data key="d2">59fd1772b0c4b6c23c975977be6a60fe,60577bdc0f4979d10ba7385bf483c344,d936cb199b788cfcddbfb6e51b1e6e48</data>
