    </node>
    <node id="VITAMINA B&#8321;&#8322;">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">VITAMINA B&#8321;&#8322;, also known as cobalamina, is an essential nutrient that plays a vital role in the formation of red blood cells. It is primarily found in animal-based products. This vitamin is particularly important for older adults, as it is necessary for preventing anemia and maintaining cardiovascular health.</data>
      <data key="d2">26629a423810543625be19deea4cc35f,2cff1005fe34ac994249b78b4ca112c7</data>
      <data key="d3">1402</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">4</data>
      <data key="d6">3512</data>
      <data key="d7">5dba8571da5746bda7dd82b561a0c1ff</data>
    </node>
    <node id="LEGUMINOSAS">
      <data key="d0">GEO</data>
      <data key="d1">Las leguminosas son una fuente de nutrientes que incluyen varias vitaminas B, especialmente B&#8325; y B&#8326;.</data>
      <data key="d2">26629a423810543625be19deea4cc35f</data>
      <data key="d3">1890</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">3513</data>
      <data key="d7">88ea3433b6a84e7086d54289b56e65cd</data>
    </node>
    <node id="LEVADURAS">
      <data key="d0">GEO</data>
      <data key="d1">Las levaduras son utilizadas en la producci&#243;n de alimentos y son ricas en vitaminas del grupo B, incluyendo B&#8323; y B&#8326;.</data>
      <data key="d2">26629a423810543625be19deea4cc35f</data>
      <data key="d3">1888</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">3514</data>
      <data key="d7">a1ce7fefbea04d90b99a3fe19f164f93</data>
    </node>
    <node id="HARINAS">
      <data key="d0">GEO</data>
      <data key="d1">Las harinas, especialmente las integrales, contienen vitaminas del grupo B, incluyendo B&#8323; y B&#8326;.</data>
      <data key="d2">26629a423810543625be19deea4cc35f</data>
      <data key="d3">1888</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">3515</data>
      <data key="d7">baf51b5d27724c9ba74b7dad9ba55fb1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="PAN INTEGRAL">
      <data key="d0">GEO</data>
      <data key="d1">PAN INTEGRAL, or whole grain bread, is recognized for its nutritional benefits, making it a healthier choice compared to white bread. It serves as a source of various B vitamins, including B&#8323; and B&#8326;, and is notably higher in fiber content. Additionally, PAN INTEGRAL provides 2.5 mg of iron per 100 grams, contributing to its overall nutritional profile. It is also included in dietary recommendations for meals, emphasizing its role in a balanced diet.</data>
      <data key="d2">26629a423810543625be19deea4cc35f,8d7a18d8258ab74a0e56129f937a8a84,b2bdb1e00976001800583298f8dddc7a,e742c891694171ad455b038f416b7728</data>
