    <node id="CANCER DE COLON">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Colon cancer, also known as cancer de colon, is a medical condition that can be detected through specific dietary modifications and tests. This disease has been associated with various nutritional factors, including a notable link to selenium deficiency.</data>
      <data key="d2">029a82f84eb8dfda723f9feabe2384d7,f43e3958f11ed24b0a02f60a2993309a</data>
