    <node id="SAL YODADA">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">SAL YODADA refers to iodized salt, which serves as a common dietary source of iodine, an essential trace element necessary for maintaining proper health. It is widely utilized to meet the iodine requirements in the diet, ensuring that individuals receive adequate intake of this vital nutrient.</data>
      <data key="d2">efbbfb33c127e16f4f9013683aff2c5f,f43e3958f11ed24b0a02f60a2993309a</data>
