    <node id="BORO">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Boro refers to boron, a mineral that is recognized for its various roles in biological systems. While it is not classified as an essential trace element for humans, it is acknowledged in dietary guidelines with recommended daily intake levels. Boro is particularly important for animals and plants, contributing to cellular membrane stability and calcium metabolism.</data>
      <data key="d2">565aef05382a327b4bdefb2ab3d3b4be,5cab61b11d03ef705141159d100ae7c5</data>
      <data key="d3">583</data>
