    <node id="INTERMOUNTAIN HEART COLLABORATIVE">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The Intermountain Heart Collaborative (IHC) is a research group dedicated to studying cardiovascular health, with a particular emphasis on the effects of vitamin D deficiency on cardiovascular risk factors and disease status. This collaborative effort investigates various cardiovascular risk factors and the overall disease status within healthcare populations, aiming to enhance understanding and improve outcomes related to cardiovascular health.</data>
      <data key="d2">5cab61b11d03ef705141159d100ae7c5,d93c7f9ea61d85e6be22df63c4b67d4d</data>
      <data key="d5">5</data>
