    <node id="COCHRANE DATABASE OF SYSTEMATIC REVIEWS">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The Cochrane Database of Systematic Reviews is a comprehensive collection of high-quality systematic reviews that play a crucial role in informing healthcare decision-making. This database includes various studies, such as those focused on vitamin D supplementation, providing valuable insights and evidence to guide healthcare professionals and policymakers.</data>
      <data key="d2">60d24674009cc67523f1ecdc63975fdc,d93c7f9ea61d85e6be22df63c4b67d4d,e032cf926bee7048e207a0e28604f60e</data>
