    <node id="BRITISH MEDICAL JOURNAL">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The British Medical Journal (BMJ) is a leading peer-reviewed medical journal that publishes a wide range of research articles, reviews, and clinical guidelines in the field of medicine. It covers various medical topics, including but not limited to calcium and vitamin D supplementation, contributing to the advancement of medical knowledge and practice.</data>
      <data key="d2">428616513e9e654c21ede19bd544ffbc,d93c7f9ea61d85e6be22df63c4b67d4d</data>
