    <node id="FELDMAN EB">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Feldman EB is an author recognized for his contributions to the field of nutrition, particularly focusing on older adults. He has written extensively on this topic, including a significant contribution to the Handbook of Nutrition and Food, where he addresses the nutritional needs and considerations for individuals in later years.</data>
