    <node id="NUTRITIONAL RECOMMENDATIONS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">NUTRITIONAL RECOMMENDATIONS are comprehensive guidelines designed to enhance overall health and well-being through informed dietary choices. These recommendations focus on improving cardiovascular health by advising individuals to limit added sugars and sodium intake. They are particularly aimed at older adults, helping to improve their dietary habits and nutritional intake. Additionally, these guidelines are based on evidence and are intended to prevent and treat obesity and overweight conditions. Developed by various organizations, NUTRITIONAL RECOMMENDATIONS promote health and aim to prevent diseases through a balanced and mindful approach to diet.</data>
      <data key="d2">0381a11415dca4cfeda74f1de745d6ae,4b79601d85087d62f0d4890761776c04,88d6f98c356e5a49db38ab5aa960bb95,fa36086a4b64a662e6e1752ee6e589aa</data>
