    <node id="AM J CLIN NUTR">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">The American Journal of Clinical Nutrition (Am J Clin Nutr) is a peer-reviewed journal dedicated to the field of clinical nutrition and its significant impact on health. It publishes a wide range of research articles that explore various aspects of nutrition, including its relationship with cancer risk, dietary practices, and overall health outcomes. Notably, the journal has featured systematic reviews and meta-analyses on topics such as the effects of fruit and vegetable intake on weight loss, as well as studies on dietary omega-3 fatty acid supplementation and its influence on muscle protein synthesis. Through its comprehensive coverage of clinical nutrition and dietetics, Am J Clin Nutr serves as a vital resource for researchers and practitioners interested in the implications of nutrition on health.</data>
      <data key="d2">1f465485ab8858e532f511401e7558f9,2f5d9123a78d23b1bc3d9f06d7a53d78,3534154ea7562c7d4abe51bf29546109,35a49a079daea350a5552c8fd96d7967,3af2658fd59065a71bfee00d2bd27b1b,581527a14dedf97c7a839eff5c40cbc2,8cdedff25a6a366c17615073d05a5aa2,987613571ae90d73ce7a875f3ddc41bf,9ef354c0ee5ac877ce8fba79fcc7e2b3,d0b74d75847bdd3e0d4962e7cc2ca5fe,dea403b707c5339329451aa7494d9ca5,f7d56bac9cc29e47690669e812094c99</data>
