    <node id="SAEDYN">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">SAEDYN, or the Sociedad Andaluza de Endocrinolog&#237;a, Diabetes y Nutrici&#243;n, is a scientific society dedicated to the fields of endocrinology, diabetes, and nutrition in Andalusia. The organization plays a significant role in promoting these disciplines within the region and is involved in the accreditation of continuous training activities related to endocrinology and nutrition. Through its efforts, SAEDYN aims to enhance the knowledge and skills of professionals in these vital areas of health.</data>
      <data key="d2">1485a96a60386bca4d8facc2ccedbb22,3cb4ce49ec9f9c770ff8b27359c0049d,fc81f645a5600b374c960fd8739a0503</data>
