    </node>
    <node id="HIP&#211;FISIS">
      <data key="d0" />
      <data key="d1">The "HIP&#211;FISIS," also known as the pituitary gland, is a small but crucial endocrine gland located at the base of the brain. It plays a vital role in regulating various hormonal functions in the human body, including the production of hormones such as growth hormone (GH), prolactin, adrenocorticotropic hormone (ACTH), and thyroid-stimulating hormone (TSH). The gland is often referred to as the "master gland" due to its significant influence on other endocrine glands and its involvement in processes such as growth, metabolism, and fluid balance through the secretion of antidiuretic hormone (ADH).

The pituitary gland is divided into two main parts: the adenohypophysis (anterior pituitary) and the neurohypophysis (posterior pituitary). It can be affected by various conditions, including hyperplasia during pregnancy and hypothyroidism, as well as by tumors such as pituitary adenomas and metastases from other cancers, like breast and lung tumors. Additionally, there are instances where the pituitary gland may be involved in autoimmune conditions, such as suspected autoimmune hypophysitis in patients with a history of autoimmune diseases.

The development of the pituitary gland's hormonal secretion control system begins during gestation, highlighting its importance in endocrine functions from early life. Furthermore, the gland may also be impacted by conditions like iron overload in hemochromatosis, which can affect its normal functioning. Overall, the HIP&#211;FISIS is essential for maintaining hormonal balance and regulating numerous physiological processes in the body.</data>
      <data key="d2">08a470f7ca590eb337a66093ccb5c198,2b6e6d589cd4e83086e44c77205b3740,2e73034a100b1adb0a00561c08416bda,2f30de565a9a9acf7ac0930483276bbb,309cfad754049a78b0459a3e71f496ef,39838811d935b8d580e419ac87ef32ab,45921035725d6b94d451399b0dac4079,490c43a262bf2f4ac77134fdcf14e891,67fc85f14d95a9a24054c2a3ec125e37,6d1d33d516f4ff2c0edf5bf266205c1f,742d2991389effe376f335dad6fbafa1,755475a08c9b594dacee6386b782065f,78b093da6669fb9ed3258ed62a73260e,88a8ebb15abeea8eaded56ef3d2df73f,94acece2df038421a302ca1fa53d5275,9b9d487a35d8197bfe9d1aa0fce19c32,9d100ca2bc5b797561fe3b3a4bb61586,af95ffa2f3eaddc28a86d59cd2d89415,b157600f59e67793829a144ddaff24df,b530539793a70d1223f3307aa47777fe,c5ebf416dfb2be58a226e15fb9771c86,fc81f645a5600b374c960fd8739a0503</data>
