    <node id="M&#211;DULO 4">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">M&#243;dulo 4 is dedicated to the topic of Nutrition and encompasses a comprehensive exploration of various aspects related to this field. It includes a series of questions and answers that address nutritional assessment and requirements, as well as enteral and parenteral nutrition. Additionally, M&#243;dulo 4 covers special situations, eating disorders, and clinical cases, providing a well-rounded understanding of nutrition in different contexts.</data>
      <data key="d2">476274b4d401aba4307379ed0f5387ac,545db57c3c81825310618d52b413a5a5</data>
