    <node id="M&#211;DULO 5">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">M&#243;dulo 5 is a comprehensive educational module that covers a range of topics related to the adrenal glands. It includes detailed discussions on adrenal insufficiency, Cushing's syndrome, hyperaldosteronism, pheochromocytoma, incidentaloma, and adrenal carcinoma. Additionally, M&#243;dulo 5 features a series of questions and answers that further explore the subject of adrenal health, providing a thorough understanding of the various conditions and functions associated with the adrenal glands.</data>
      <data key="d2">476274b4d401aba4307379ed0f5387ac,545db57c3c81825310618d52b413a5a5</data>
