    <node id="VIRGINIA BELLIDO CASTA&#209;EDA">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Dr. Virginia Bellido Casta&#241;eda is a distinguished medical professional specializing in endocrinology and nutrition. She serves as the Head of Section at the Endocrinology and Nutrition Service of Hospital Universitario Cruces, located in Barakaldo, Vizcaya. In addition to her clinical responsibilities, Dr. Bellido Casta&#241;eda focuses on nutritional labeling, contributing her expertise to the field of nutrition. Her affiliation with Hospital Universitario Cruces underscores her commitment to advancing healthcare in endocrinology and nutrition.</data>
      <data key="d2">3cb4ce49ec9f9c770ff8b27359c0049d,70e4538100be270d06e7a3cdc254ba28,7852af9e2886d0d889fbc056d0a75f21</data>
