      <data key="d7">75010c8ecfc44bc4942f2faa11cd1585</data>
    </node>
    <node id="DIEGO BELLIDO GUERRERO">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Diego Bellido Guerrero is a Doctor in Medicine and a specialist in Endocrinology and Nutrition. He serves as the Head of Service at the Complex University Hospital of El Ferrol, also known as Complejo Hospitalario Universitario de Ferrol, located in A Coru&#241;a, Spain. In his role, he is involved in diet therapy and nutrition, contributing to various topics related to healthy eating. He is affiliated with the University of A Coru&#241;a and is recognized as a professional in the Endocrinology and Nutrition Service at the hospital.</data>
      <data key="d2">0379ef9e3f56ccd30c572884eb5bd723,3cb4ce49ec9f9c770ff8b27359c0049d,70e4538100be270d06e7a3cdc254ba28,7852af9e2886d0d889fbc056d0a75f21,edc9ccbe5d98671343d0119a309cddaf</data>
      <data key="d3">1449</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">9</data>
      <data key="d6">3645</data>
      <data key="d7">0bce9e1e371a47419e83beedc2e0591f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="HOSPITAL UNIVERSITARIO CRUCES">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Hospital Universitario Cruces is a medical facility located in Barakaldo, Vizcaya, near Bilbao. It specializes in endocrinology and nutrition. The hospital is notable for its leadership in the Endocrinology and Nutrition section, with Dr. Fco. Javier Santamar&#237;a Sandi serving as the Head of this section since 2007. Additionally, Virginia Bellido Casta&#241;eda is also mentioned as working in the same department, holding the position of Head of Section in Endocrinology and Nutrition.</data>
      <data key="d2">3cb4ce49ec9f9c770ff8b27359c0049d,490c43a262bf2f4ac77134fdcf14e891,70e4538100be270d06e7a3cdc254ba28,8ddb42b0859e58bd2f937125505ed9d5</data>
      <data key="d3">1450</data>
