    </node>
    <node id="SOCIEDAD ANDALUZA DE ENDOCRINOLOG&#205;A, DIABETES Y NUTRICI&#211;N">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The Sociedad Andaluza de Endocrinolog&#237;a, Diabetes y Nutrici&#243;n (SAEDYN) is a scientific and professional society dedicated to the fields of endocrinology, diabetes, and nutrition. It plays a significant role in the accreditation of continuous training activities related to these specialties, ensuring that healthcare professionals remain updated with the latest knowledge and practices. The society is currently presided over by Mart&#237;n L&#243;pez de la Torre Casares, who leads its initiatives and activities aimed at advancing the understanding and treatment of endocrine disorders and nutritional issues in the Andalusian region.</data>
      <data key="d2">0ec21b45b9a154289761f46105b364f2,3cb4ce49ec9f9c770ff8b27359c0049d</data>
      <data key="d3">1452</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">3</data>
      <data key="d6">3648</data>
