    <node id="HOSPITAL CL&#205;NICO SAN CARLOS">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Hospital Cl&#237;nico San Carlos is a prominent medical facility located in Madrid, Spain. It offers a wide range of healthcare services, with a particular emphasis on endocrinology, nutrition, and geriatrics. The hospital is staffed by several physicians, including Dr. Miguel A. Rubio Herrera, who serves as the Head of the Endocrinology and Nutrition Section. Dr. Rubio Herrera specializes in clinical nutrition and obesity, contributing to the hospital's focus on these critical areas of healthcare. Additionally, Mart&#237;n Cuesta Hern&#225;ndez is another endocrinologist working at the hospital, further enhancing its expertise in endocrinology. Overall, Hospital Cl&#237;nico San Carlos is recognized for its comprehensive medical services and specialized care in various fields.</data>
      <data key="d2">11fcae49d6b540a5ad5cdfe74ed269a9,490c43a262bf2f4ac77134fdcf14e891,75a4b2d504de480eaef247aa682bfd05,9ec3bf4d23f9f4fca8984c81d95aac41,afdd80af18df0213292a5858afeae9cc,b7465350e74a3bada96615deb0d7b031,f999ed498214f69427e629a05ea8ce4a</data>
