    <node id="LARSEN PR">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Larsen PR is a prominent author and editor in the field of endocrinology, particularly recognized for his contributions to thyroid physiology. He is known for his work in the endocrinology textbook referenced, and he serves as an editor of the "Williams Textbook of Endocrinology." This comprehensive textbook covers various topics, including hormonal regulation, disorders, and specific conditions such as pheochromocytoma. Through his editorial role, Larsen PR has significantly influenced the understanding and dissemination of knowledge in endocrinology.</data>
      <data key="d2">05edb31ec01c621a00d71bd5868784e0,68be432b2dd3e64676989cd544f23d8c,973f9100fbfeb9ef31038f51312620a9,adab3c750c469ba13dd6c020d2b53aaa,f701d832b0dc8b95c2cb09997d543897</data>
