    <node id="TRH">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">TRH (Thyrotropin-Releasing Hormone) is a hypothalamic factor and a hormone that plays a crucial role in the endocrine system by stimulating the secretion of Thyroid-Stimulating Hormone (TSH) from the pituitary gland.</data>
      <data key="d2">68be432b2dd3e64676989cd544f23d8c,d4fb31e0ff471ed415f98bc11ca26d1d</data>
      <data key="d3">1299</data>
