    <node id="HORMONAS DEL EJE HIPOT&#193;LAMO-HIP&#211;FISO-TIROIDEO">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Hormones of the hypothalamic-pituitary-thyroid axis are involved in the regulation of thyroid function.</data>
      <data key="d2">68be432b2dd3e64676989cd544f23d8c</data>
