    <node id="WALTHAM">
      <data key="d0">GEO</data>
      <data key="d1">Waltham is a city located in Massachusetts, USA, and serves as the headquarters for UpToDate Inc. This organization is a valuable resource for medical professionals, providing updated medical information and guidelines on a variety of health conditions, including hyperaldosteronism, osteoporosis treatment, and insulinoma. UpToDate Inc. is recognized for its comprehensive medical information, making it an essential tool for healthcare providers seeking current and reliable data.</data>
      <data key="d2">15cc53e1fcf2a1afd24bf25a2b059f98,2a73a65aa862d055c1e417cc50a42166,41b6e4025d59564d7881f459e230639d,46466da830644a88f74108645c668fd5,6aa8928e063b4107007dc14cc1b301bd,74c9662af46dca03f3941e133df2e783,85df619f6d535bbe5c0485f540242903,85ee651c191c3b0c5fe786fe2e0718a4,89b0bde0358432506a0e03d4691dd2ab,8f5500c9a9e74d855b17365c80375df3,97afc23d7c06c09383611da00b084017,9944c8e8d3d7769c5297f8dfb9b6f664,a2bc3ecb4c946bf6d4905a8d4fe7d013,adab3c750c469ba13dd6c020d2b53aaa,bb2f48277736ce24d1ff0310a682376d</data>
