    <node id="UPTODATE INC.">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">UpToDate Inc. is a clinical decision support resource and medical information provider based in Waltham, MA. It is renowned for offering evidence-based information tailored for healthcare professionals across a wide range of medical topics. The organization provides comprehensive literature reviews and clinical guidelines that cover various conditions, including adrenal incidentalomas, congenital adrenal hyperplasia, Cushing's syndrome, insulinoma, hypoglycemia, vitamin D deficiency, osteoporosis treatment, and pheochromocytoma. UpToDate Inc. is dedicated to ensuring that healthcare professionals have access to the most current and relevant medical information to aid in the diagnosis and treatment of patients.</data>
      <data key="d2">095d265c06452e52ccbfbc871a19a899,1400aceda067bb7180ca90f0a5335bfe,15cc53e1fcf2a1afd24bf25a2b059f98,172da539e648a8f72cc1576d16e35f46,2261671ccad439da1ed9ea5a27857dc8,2a73a65aa862d055c1e417cc50a42166,313611d83ceda2a812387fbcffbedad6,41b6e4025d59564d7881f459e230639d,46466da830644a88f74108645c668fd5,592d424edaa447a54ab4489d82495db6,74c9662af46dca03f3941e133df2e783,7f3df1437755b60344fdffd2ef3b8a9e,8fe4d0101ea7a6ddaefd71c963d9ecc7,973f9100fbfeb9ef31038f51312620a9,9944c8e8d3d7769c5297f8dfb9b6f664,9ff14a3c49bd56b2fb12b3fd8ed246de,a2bc3ecb4c946bf6d4905a8d4fe7d013,adab3c750c469ba13dd6c020d2b53aaa,b7b162b783ea688c5fe9b7f531b46aaf</data>
