    </node>
    <node id="HYP&#211;FISIS">
      <data key="d0">GEO</data>
      <data key="d1">The hypophysis, or pituitary gland, is a crucial gland in the endocrine system that regulates various hormones, including growth hormone.</data>
      <data key="d2">adab3c750c469ba13dd6c020d2b53aaa</data>
