    <node id="BERNABEU I">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Bernabeu I is an author engaged in research on pituitary tumors and their pathology. Additionally, Bernabeu I has co-authored works that explore hypopituitarism, emphasizing its clinical implications and management strategies. Through these contributions, Bernabeu I has made significant strides in understanding and addressing conditions related to the pituitary gland.</data>
      <data key="d2">4faa9b46acd7540904fc5b0772bb7c51,fa557ef3cae0faa594a71dc7e2d84cdc</data>
