    <node id="CASANUEVA FF">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Casanueva FF is an author known for their contributions to the field of endocrinology, particularly in the study of prolactin disorders. They have authored a publication that discusses various aspects of these disorders, with a specific focus on the epidemiology and causes, while excluding prolactin-secreting pituitary tumors. In addition to their work on prolactin disorders, Casanueva FF has also researched hypopituitarism, exploring its treatment options. Furthermore, they have written extensively about pituitary tumors and their management, showcasing a comprehensive understanding of these related conditions within the endocrine system.</data>
      <data key="d2">4faa9b46acd7540904fc5b0772bb7c51,55a9e6e8ff365dac34555c938dd3c244,b344a34a623d4ade6b3ed6e1adae0016,fa557ef3cae0faa594a71dc7e2d84cdc</data>
