      <data key="d1">Cooper DS is an editor associated with the medical resource UpToDate, which provides comprehensive information on various medical conditions, including hyperprolactinemia and hypopituitarism. As an editor, Cooper DS has contributed to the publication, ensuring that it includes relevant and up-to-date information on these topics, thereby serving as a valuable resource in the field of medical literature.</data>
