    <node id="MARTIN KA">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Martin KA is an editor who has made significant contributions to the medical resource UpToDate. His work includes providing information on hyperprolactinemia, a condition characterized by elevated levels of prolactin in the blood, as well as contributing to the understanding of hypopituitarism, a disorder resulting from insufficient hormone production by the pituitary gland. Martin KA is referenced in the context of medical literature related to both of these conditions, highlighting his role in enhancing the knowledge and resources available in the field of medicine.</data>
