      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Springer Nature Switzerland AG is a publishing company that specializes in the publication of scientific works. Among its notable contributions is the book titled "Prolactin disorders," which addresses various topics related to prolactin disorders. The company is recognized for its commitment to disseminating scholarly information in the field of science.</data>
