    <node id="PROLACTIN DISORDERS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Prolactin disorders is a medical condition discussed in the book, focusing on the epidemiology, causes, and management of prolactin-related issues.</data>
      <data key="d2">55a9e6e8ff365dac34555c938dd3c244</data>
