    </node>
    <node id="DIABETES INSIPIDA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Diabetes insipida is a medical condition characterized by excessive thirst and urination, which is often associated with issues related to the pituitary gland. This condition can lead to severe dehydration and hypernatremia, particularly affecting vulnerable populations such as infants and elderly patients with cognitive impairment.</data>
      <data key="d2">4faa9b46acd7540904fc5b0772bb7c51,a1b16c80a55fd88d0b1efb78addf3853</data>
      <data key="d3">628</data>
