      <data key="d6">3795</data>
      <data key="d7">62993d940d5f4000988db6679c27ff4c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="CDKN1B">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">CDKN1B is a gene that encodes a cyclin-dependent kinase inhibitor, which has been associated with the development of pituitary adenomas. Additionally, CDKN1B may be studied in the context of Multiple Endocrine Neoplasia type 1 (MEN1) syndrome, especially in cases where mutations in the MEN1 gene are not identified.</data>
      <data key="d2">2415ccd829f700cbe1975f4bca87245f,309cfad754049a78b0459a3e71f496ef</data>
      <data key="d3">1323</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">3796</data>
      <data key="d7">5b75ecd1870f405196e90ba737946dda</data>
    </node>
    <node id="CCNB2">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">CCNB2 es una ciclina que se ha implicado en la proliferaci&#243;n celular y en adenomas hipofisarios.</data>
      <data key="d2">309cfad754049a78b0459a3e71f496ef</data>
      <data key="d3">1323</data>
