    <node id="EUROPEAN JOURNAL OF ENDOCRINOLOGY">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The European Journal of Endocrinology is a scientific journal dedicated to publishing research in the field of endocrinology. It covers a wide range of topics, including studies on thyroid carcinoma and various hormonal disorders. Notably, this journal is also the platform where significant research, such as the study on ipilimumab-induced hypophysitis, has been published, highlighting its role in disseminating important findings in endocrinological research.</data>
      <data key="d2">592f69a8890825d710e132d8e60f6d24,a2303199b7587142ad661841870790ec</data>
