    <node id="UPTODATE INC">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">UpToDate Inc. is a comprehensive medical resource that offers evidence-based information and clinical decision support for healthcare professionals. The organization provides detailed literature reviews and treatment guidelines on a wide range of medical conditions, including hypercalcemia, pheochromocytoma, hyperprolactinemia, Cushing's syndrome, osteoporosis management, and adrenocortical carcinoma. UpToDate Inc. is recognized as a reliable source of updated medical information, serving as a reference for various health topics and conditions, including hypogonadism. The resource is designed to assist healthcare professionals in making informed clinical decisions by providing access to current medical literature and guidelines.</data>
      <data key="d2">05edb31ec01c621a00d71bd5868784e0,08bc93c6dcf6df5ebf660f30b1f1ef2d,209bcca22090a109f52e26657bf3c999,2ad120e12741c91b54f0eee4e16a3022,43b6763c37598cae7a26ed8a26b45f54,5509bb6959e4faa5989289c1ddbcc96b,6aa8928e063b4107007dc14cc1b301bd,6d1d33d516f4ff2c0edf5bf266205c1f,85df619f6d535bbe5c0485f540242903,85ee651c191c3b0c5fe786fe2e0718a4,94acece2df038421a302ca1fa53d5275,97afc23d7c06c09383611da00b084017,b344a34a623d4ade6b3ed6e1adae0016,dbe034ccd694ae06cf72d347d7dbdacb</data>
      <data key="d3">1304</data>
