    </node>
    <node id="VENLAFAXINA">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Venlafaxina is a medication that is primarily used as an antidepressant to treat depressive disorders. It functions as a serotonin and norepinephrine reuptake inhibitor, which means it helps to increase the levels of these neurotransmitters in the brain, thereby improving mood and alleviating symptoms of depression. In some patients, venlafaxina may be associated with hyperprolactinemia, a condition characterized by elevated levels of prolactin. This medication was prescribed to the patient for managing her psychiatric condition, highlighting its role in the treatment of mental health issues.</data>
      <data key="d2">2f91f92c99da813a8d1be2f6ac0fa552,3f685a05a9682db6dcde958d1918cc77,94acece2df038421a302ca1fa53d5275,b344a34a623d4ade6b3ed6e1adae0016</data>
      <data key="d3">1080</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">4</data>
      <data key="d6">3903</data>
      <data key="d7">eda4909c37f54c9bbaa793c62c0e467e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="RISPERIDONA">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Risperidona, conocida en ingl&#233;s como risperidone, es un antipsic&#243;tico de segunda generaci&#243;n que se utiliza en el tratamiento de diversas condiciones psiqui&#225;tricas. Este medicamento se asocia frecuentemente con la hiperprolactinemia, lo que implica que puede provocar aumentos significativos en los niveles de prolactina en el organismo.</data>
      <data key="d2">94acece2df038421a302ca1fa53d5275,b344a34a623d4ade6b3ed6e1adae0016</data>
      <data key="d3">1319</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">2</data>
      <data key="d6">3904</data>
      <data key="d7">07085bad103646249d64f7810df289f7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="MACROPROLACTINA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">La macroprolactina es una forma de prolactina que se forma por la uni&#243;n de la mol&#233;cula nativa de prolactina a la inmunoglobulina G, causando hiperprolactinemia anal&#237;tica.</data>
      <data key="d2">94acece2df038421a302ca1fa53d5275</data>
      <data key="d3">1319</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">3905</data>
      <data key="d7">c7dac716549445beb3cd7e990bce0398</data>
    </node>
