    <node id="MELMED S.">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Melmed S. is a prominent researcher and author recognized for his significant contributions to the understanding of acromegaly, including its causes and clinical manifestations. He is notably an author and editor of the Williams Textbook of Endocrinology, which serves as a key reference in the field of endocrinology. Through his work, Melmed S. has made substantial contributions to academic literature, enhancing the knowledge and understanding of endocrine disorders.</data>
      <data key="d2">02b8a693303f9f8603c740fefc53d526,2261671ccad439da1ed9ea5a27857dc8,41b6e4025d59564d7881f459e230639d</data>
