      <data key="d1">Hipoglucemia insul&#237;nica is a test used to stimulate growth hormone release by inducing low blood sugar levels.</data>
      <data key="d2">593ae586183f02d2611966f8a1603e5d</data>
      <data key="d3">1080</data>
