      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Rebeca Reyes Garc&#237;a is a specialist in Endocrinology and Nutrition, a doctor in Medicine and Surgery from the University of Granada, and a member of the Diabetes Working Group of the Spanish Society of Endocrinology and Nutrition.</data>
      <data key="d2">404f3831a7bac02ee23cb4d4f4f2b0e9</data>
