    </node>
    <node id="S&#205;NDROME DE WOLFRAM">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Wolfram syndrome, also known as DIDMOAD, is a rare neurodegenerative disorder characterized by diabetes mellitus type 1, diabetes insipidus, and optic atrophy, caused by mutations in specific genes.</data>
      <data key="d2">4885c129837f58f091d24d2cbc8aae66</data>
      <data key="d3">1522</data>
