    <node id="TOMOGRAF&#205;A DE COHERENCIA &#211;PTICA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Tomograf&#237;a de coherencia &#243;ptica (OCT) is a non-invasive imaging technology used to capture high-resolution images of the retina, often used in diagnosing diabetic eye diseases.</data>
      <data key="d2">aa9279dacd764b478618ae36af93ad83</data>
      <data key="d3">400</data>
