    <node id="AACE">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The American Association of Clinical Endocrinologists (AACE) is a professional organization dedicated to providing comprehensive medical guidelines for various endocrine disorders. Among its contributions, AACE offers specific guidelines for the management of thyroid nodules, including recommendations for the performance of fine-needle aspiration biopsy (PAAF). Additionally, the organization is recognized for its extensive guidelines on the treatment and management of diabetes, further emphasizing its role in advancing clinical practices in endocrinology.</data>
