    <node id="METFORMIN">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Metformin is a medication commonly prescribed for managing type 2 diabetes. Mar&#237;a takes Metformin in a dosage of 850 mg three times a day. This medication works by reducing glucose production in the liver and improving insulin sensitivity, which helps to control blood sugar levels. Additionally, Metformin is often used in combination with liraglutide to enhance glycemic control in patients with type 2 diabetes.</data>
      <data key="d2">265fcc321b2c0bbf0bf8200d0489e1a1,3eddab8e3e55bbd7e6cbcd3776fecb29,6a2d5ced0ad16871fec539845797e0ac</data>
