    </node>
    <node id="ERC">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">ERC, or Enfermedad Renal Cr&#243;nica, refers to chronic kidney disease (CKD), a condition that significantly impacts the management of diabetes medications. Individuals with ERC require careful dietary management, particularly concerning their intake of phosphorus and protein, to maintain their health and mitigate the progression of the disease.</data>
      <data key="d2">630ac8fefe27e4b893831674a67dcc82,ae1766e8ae855b3c79ad6d5fdefab1b0</data>
