    <node id="T&#218;BULO PROXIMAL">
      <data key="d0">GEO</data>
      <data key="d1">The proximal tubule is a part of the nephron in the kidney where GLP-1 influences natriuresis and glucose handling.</data>
      <data key="d2">50fafa000d5f2830cbf66f3201657396</data>
