    <node id="INSULINA GLULISINA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Insulina glulisina is a rapid-acting insulin analog that is utilized to control blood sugar levels, particularly during meals. It promotes the formation of monomers following subcutaneous administration, which enhances its effectiveness in managing diabetes. This type of insulin is specifically administered to patients to help regulate their blood glucose levels.</data>
      <data key="d2">3f685a05a9682db6dcde958d1918cc77,e1f3aed8f37691759547d488b926a79f,e83d288a4f420cdc975112d3a63bd522</data>
