    <node id="COMORBILIDADES">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Comorbilidades refer to the presence of one or more additional conditions that occur alongside a primary condition, which can complicate the management and prognosis of the primary illness. For instance, in patients with diabetes, cardiovascular disease may be a common comorbidity. Similarly, in individuals with chronic obstructive pulmonary disease (EPOC), the existence of additional comorbidities can further complicate treatment and affect overall health outcomes.</data>
      <data key="d2">bede549235c80e5de32a793f3c456a22,e83d288a4f420cdc975112d3a63bd522</data>
