    <node id="INSULINA LISPRO">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Insulina lispro is a rapid-acting insulin that is utilized by patients as needed for the management of blood sugar levels. It is designed to mimic the quick insulin secretion response observed in non-diabetic individuals. This insulin is particularly effective in controlling blood sugar levels around meal times and during exercise, making it an essential component for individuals managing diabetes. Insulina lispro helps to ensure that blood sugar levels remain stable during periods of increased glucose intake, such as meals.</data>
      <data key="d2">21339c051dc2f47471026673b3ac6436,bfdbf41efa08067d5ae1b1a67830affd,c3975fe03d2af26b95b09795c7769e8b,e1f3aed8f37691759547d488b926a79f</data>
