    <node id="MAR&#205;A">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Mar&#237;a is a patient who has faced several health challenges. She has experienced altered basal glucose levels and is currently undergoing treatment for prediabetes, which later progressed to a diagnosis of gestational diabetes. Additionally, Mar&#237;a presented with a superficial ulcer on her left foot, which is infected; however, the infection does not involve deeper structures.</data>
      <data key="d2">6a2d5ced0ad16871fec539845797e0ac,d77ee7b5259ebdf92e8375c5f2d322e6</data>
