    </node>
    <node id="PALMER BF">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">PALMER BF is a medical professional and researcher recognized for his contributions to the understanding of electrolyte and acid-base disturbances in patients with diabetes mellitus. He co-authored a significant paper on this topic, highlighting his expertise and commitment to advancing knowledge in this area of medicine.</data>
      <data key="d2">9889a9000d5a82ffba9e0f6c92da918a,ed9e6da7ef23d47467822d2a1e461195</data>
      <data key="d3">900</data>
