    <node id="LIRAGLUTIDA">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Liraglutida is a GLP-1 analog and receptor agonist primarily used for the treatment of type 2 diabetes and obesity. It is recognized for its prolonged action, which enhances insulin release and helps manage blood sugar levels effectively. In addition to its primary role in diabetes management, Liraglutida has demonstrated cardiovascular benefits and is known to significantly reduce HbA1c levels. Furthermore, it promotes weight loss, making it an effective option for individuals seeking to manage both diabetes and obesity. Overall, Liraglutida is a multifaceted medication that addresses critical health concerns related to type 2 diabetes and weight management while also positively impacting cardiovascular risk markers.</data>
      <data key="d2">419657aaa9492bbff3d218e00d2b0fd4,5c11ed246e1a48261910b9b71b65014c,90c684dca4542bbe1177afd26e78581e,f44811ae5b3e9dab0f295efe8842767a</data>
