      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Fco. Javier Santamar&#237;a Sandi is a specialist in Endocrinology and Nutrition, currently working at the Hospital Universitario Cruces and an associate professor at the University of the Basque Country.</data>
