    <node id="UNIVERSIDAD DEL PA&#205;S VASCO">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The Universidad del Pa&#237;s Vasco, also known as the University of the Basque Country, is a prominent educational institution in Spain. It is notable for being the alma mater of Francisco Javier Escalada San Mart&#237;n, who graduated in Medicine in 1986. Additionally, the university employs Fco. Javier Santamar&#237;a Sandi as an associate professor in the Department of Medicine, contributing to its academic reputation in the field of medical education.</data>
      <data key="d2">70b2393fa61e51fc3e772479a9792c98,8ddb42b0859e58bd2f937125505ed9d5</data>
