    <node id="VAN VLIET G">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Van Vliet G is an author recognized for contributions to the field of paediatric endocrinology, particularly in relation to congenital hypothyroidism. They are one of the authors of the European Society for Paediatric Endocrinology Consensus Guidelines on congenital hypothyroidism, which provides important recommendations and standards for the diagnosis and management of this condition. Additionally, Van Vliet G has co-authored a study examining the incidence of congenital hypothyroidism in Quebec, further contributing to the understanding and research surrounding this endocrine disorder.</data>
      <data key="d2">0171dc124a749b9b7abb823f09b1aba7,838d1ef59dfea4cab2a724bc85b02632</data>
