    <node id="DEFECTOS EN LA S&#205;NTESIS DE HORMONAS TIROIDEAS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Defects in the synthesis of thyroid hormones are the second most common cause of congenital hypothyroidism, explaining 10% to 15% of cases.</data>
