      <data key="d6">4453</data>
      <data key="d7">20f9d4157b8d4e5ca52e87b53b40ea60</data>
    </node>
    <node id="DAVIES TF">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Davies TF is an author recognized for his contributions to the literature on the physiology and diagnosis of thyroid disorders. He has also played a significant role in the field of endocrinology, specifically discussing hyperthyroid disorders in a textbook on the subject. His work encompasses both theoretical and practical aspects of thyroid function, making him a notable figure in the study of endocrine health.</data>
      <data key="d2">84ebd4f784ceacfe0744f6bb9cd9a5a3,f701d832b0dc8b95c2cb09997d543897</data>
