    <node id="TIROIDES 3">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">TIROIDES 3 is a topic associated with hypothyroidism and its diagnosis, often referenced in the context of inquiries regarding this condition. Additionally, TIROIDES 3 pertains to a section or table that classifies responses in differentiated thyroid cancer, offering detailed descriptions of various response categories. This dual focus highlights TIROIDES 3's relevance in both the diagnosis of hypothyroidism and the evaluation of responses in thyroid cancer cases.</data>
