    </node>
    <node id="HIPERTIROIDISMO">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">HIPERTIROIDISMO, or hyperthyroidism, is a medical condition characterized by the excessive production of thyroid hormones by the thyroid gland. This overproduction can lead to various metabolic disturbances and a range of symptoms, including gastrointestinal issues such as chronic diarrhea. Additionally, hyperthyroidism can influence levels of ferritin and increase sex hormone-binding globulin (SHBG) levels, which may affect testosterone availability.

The condition can be treated with radioiodine therapy, and it is important to note that hyperthyroidism is a contraindication for the use of certain medications, including fentermina and topiramato. Furthermore, hyperthyroidism may also arise as a potential adverse effect of immune checkpoint inhibitors, especially when these therapies are used in combination. Overall, hyperthyroidism is a significant health concern that requires careful management and treatment.</data>
      <data key="d2">072912695b1cff9f390d4ead3b9ad742,40253f8b49d61452dbc56454cd1a07e0,449c8567a3aa59b49fbe65b7a3a26d46,4beab004731d7baff10fd2796a523b55,4c18507e3d98242cdbcddd1a1997b92f,68c1e1d1d60cf84e8ba37450cd6dc7d3,af631316aa8584710d755d8c59e851b6,c4f0f024f16be34d17dbbbae57042b2b,cca243547034544596d9409f2643eac0</data>
      <data key="d3">1352</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">13</data>
      <data key="d6">4503</data>
      <data key="d7">99f5a2689c264efd879cb2f30a4d6f60</data>
    </node>
    <node id="EUROPEAN GROUP ON GRAVES' ORBITOPATHY">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The European Group on Graves' Orbitopathy (EUGOGO) is a dedicated organization that focuses on the management and research of Graves' orbitopathy, a condition associated with thyroid disease. EUGOGO aims to establish consensus guidelines for the treatment and management of this condition, facilitating improved care and understanding among healthcare professionals across Europe.</data>
      <data key="d2">3c8b29df4105e84d4766d8d632de8535,4c18507e3d98242cdbcddd1a1997b92f</data>
      <data key="d3">1349</data>
