    <node id="MANDEL SJ">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Mandel SJ is an author recognized for his contributions to the field of endocrinology, particularly in the areas of thyroiditis and hyperthyroidism, as evidenced by his writings in medical texts. He is notably one of the authors of the American Thyroid Association Management Guidelines for Adult Patients with Thyroid Nodules and Differentiated Thyroid Cancer, which serves as a significant resource for healthcare professionals managing these conditions.</data>
      <data key="d2">17db9c3996d806c3332ba2796ab7736f,4c18507e3d98242cdbcddd1a1997b92f,a4e97817eb89c3941a890d94f5359369</data>
