    </node>
    <node id="RECEPTORES DE TSH">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Receptores de TSH are thyroid-stimulating hormone receptors that play a role in the regulation of thyroid function and are implicated in autoimmune conditions like Graves' disease.</data>
