      <data key="d1">Hegedus L is a researcher known for his work on the relationship between cigarette smoking and Graves' ophthalmopathy. Additionally, he is one of the authors of the American Association of Clinical Endocrinologists Medical Guidelines for Clinical Practice, which focuses on the diagnosis and management of thyroid nodules.</data>
