    <node id="BECK-PECCOZ P">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Beck-Peccoz P is a prominent researcher in the field of endocrinology, particularly known for their contributions to the European Thyroid Association Guidelines for the Diagnosis and Treatment of Thyrotropin-Secreting Pituitary Tumors. This researcher has played a significant role in developing these guidelines, which are essential for diagnosing and treating TSH-secreting pituitary tumors. Additionally, Beck-Peccoz P has contributed to the broader understanding of thyroid hormone action and its associated disorders, further establishing their expertise and influence in the field.</data>
