    <node id="THYROID HORMONE RESISTANCE">
      <data key="d0" />
      <data key="d1">Thyroid hormone resistance is a condition characterized by the body's tissues exhibiting resistance to the effects of thyroid hormones. This resistance results in a range of clinical challenges, impacting the overall functioning of the endocrine system and potentially leading to various health issues.</data>
      <data key="d2">10cd1db13dc50a14adab6e4c215bb3b0,4937d8f482fff897409bb1d7a094151a</data>
