    <node id="PROPILTHIOURACIL">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Propylthiouracil (PTU) is a medication used to treat hyperthyroidism, particularly during pregnancy, as recommended by the American Thyroid Association.</data>
