      <data key="d1">Chen H is a prominent researcher known for significant contributions to medical guidelines in the field of endocrinology. Notably, Chen H played a key role in developing the consensus guideline for the diagnosis and management of neuroendocrine tumors. Additionally, Chen H is recognized as one of the authors of the 2017 Guidelines of the American Thyroid Association, which focus on the diagnosis and management of thyroid disease during pregnancy and the postpartum period. Through these contributions, Chen H has made a substantial impact on the standards of care in these areas of medicine.</data>
