    </node>
    <node id="ANN INTERN MED">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Ann Intern Med, also known as the Annals of Internal Medicine, is a peer-reviewed medical journal that focuses on publishing research and reviews in the field of internal medicine. The journal covers a wide range of topics, including the effects of various health interventions, such as dietary impacts on diabetes and the effects of amiodarone on thyroid function. Through its publications, Ann Intern Med contributes to the advancement of medical knowledge and practice by disseminating important findings related to internal medicine and health interventions.</data>
      <data key="d2">1388342730ee9177144f78f9e9d7816e,45213238a7d4c834b6db62ef71dcda43,8cdedff25a6a366c17615073d05a5aa2,e376d9f50b7608f5b6d1f88877fde59e</data>
