      <data key="d7">c483b9aa790d4974b4ce3b000c247562</data>
    </node>
    <node id="ARCH INTERN MED">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">ARCH INTERN MED, also known as Archives of Internal Medicine, is a prominent medical journal dedicated to publishing research and systematic reviews in the field of internal medicine. The journal covers a wide range of topics, including studies on frailty, nutrition in older adults, cardiovascular disease, and specific medical conditions such as amiodarone-induced hypothyroidism. Additionally, it explores the relationship between frailty and various physiological systems, including inflammation and coagulation. Through its diverse array of published research, ARCH INTERN MED contributes significantly to the understanding and advancement of internal medicine.</data>
      <data key="d2">35a49a079daea350a5552c8fd96d7967,3be9d646c354d76527755d79a77c916b,45213238a7d4c834b6db62ef71dcda43,e155d9b2d1858daab734fd68a45d0c0a,e271766bdc88e84209e5cdac4adc0724</data>
