    </node>
    <node id="EUR J ENDOCRINOL">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Eur J Endocrinol, also known as the European Journal of Endocrinology, is a medical journal dedicated to publishing research in the field of endocrinology. It features studies on various topics, including the effects of amiodarone in rats, highlighting its focus on both clinical and experimental research within endocrinology. The journal serves as a platform for disseminating significant findings and advancements in the understanding of endocrine disorders and treatments.</data>
      <data key="d2">45213238a7d4c834b6db62ef71dcda43,4937d8f482fff897409bb1d7a094151a</data>
