    <node id="AM J MED">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">AM J MED, also known as the American Journal of Medicine, is a peer-reviewed medical journal that publishes a diverse array of articles covering a wide range of medical topics. The journal is known for its contributions to the field, including studies on specific medical conditions such as amiodarone-induced thyrotoxicosis and hypothyroidism. It serves as a platform for research articles, reviews, and meta-analyses, making it a significant resource for medical professionals and researchers.</data>
      <data key="d2">45213238a7d4c834b6db62ef71dcda43,91c73a1de38742d1b6c4e803ec1717a3,cf833689453c8ce13d3650766a8b47a7</data>
