    <node id="TSI">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">TSI (thyroid-stimulating immunoglobulins) are antibodies that can cross the placenta and cause transient hyperthyroidism in the fetus.</data>
      <data key="d2">45213238a7d4c834b6db62ef71dcda43</data>
      <data key="d3">172</data>
      <data key="d4">1</data>
