    <node id="LIVER TRANSPLANTATION">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Liver transplantation is a surgical procedure that involves replacing a diseased liver with a healthy liver from a donor. This procedure is often necessary for patients suffering from end-stage liver disease, which can result from various conditions, including drug-induced liver injury. The process aims to restore normal liver function and improve the patient's quality of life.</data>
      <data key="d2">025274b58725397020078dea52ea012b,125bf798b37a7f42c661002099924973,1dc3bddf85e4bb26e46f373169e43b14,49e6a5571bf2f206ac38ac536d70f710,5aaadc19de8fb96a4951c0ba38192991,e2f9ec03a9b71e608bdd14455b0595a6</data>
