      <data key="d6">4605</data>
      <data key="d7">8363889f8de04a5f982681513ed44088</data>
    </node>
    <node id="RHT">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">RHT, which stands for Resistance to Hormones Thyroid (or resistencia a hormonas tiroideas in Spanish), is a medical condition characterized by the body's tissues failing to respond appropriately to thyroid hormones. This condition can be distinguished from TSHomas, a type of tumor that affects thyroid-stimulating hormone (TSH) levels, through specific tests and evaluations.</data>
      <data key="d2">39cdf983b8de558536d2d829978daba1,d6bea02011329ebf0fa64f4d6792d101</data>
      <data key="d3">1668</data>
