    <node id="MAYO CLINIC">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The Mayo Clinic is a renowned medical center that has conducted extensive research and treatment for various thyroid conditions, including Riedel's thyroiditis.</data>
