    <node id="TSH-SECRETING PITUITARY ADENOMAS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">TSH-secreting pituitary adenomas are tumors that produce excess thyroid-stimulating hormone, which can lead to hyperthyroidism.</data>
