    <node id="CIBAS ES">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Cibas ES is an author who has significantly contributed to the development of the Bethesda system for the classification and reporting of thyroid cytology. Their work has been instrumental in enhancing the standards and practices related to thyroid cytopathology, providing a structured approach for the evaluation and communication of cytological findings.</data>
      <data key="d2">171bf5a205ba13cbab91aab05e088040,3491690ff2b417d00598f7df8e68f4d6</data>
      <data key="d3">1673</data>
