    </node>
    <node id="CAMPANELLA ET AL.">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Campanella et al. conducted a comprehensive meta-analysis examining the cancer risk linked to both clinical and ultrasonographic features of thyroid nodules. Their research focused on identifying factors associated with malignancy in these nodules, utilizing a thorough evaluation of the ultrasonographic characteristics. This study contributes valuable insights into the assessment of thyroid nodules and their potential cancer risk.</data>
      <data key="d2">17db9c3996d806c3332ba2796ab7736f,3491690ff2b417d00598f7df8e68f4d6</data>
      <data key="d3">1212</data>
