    <node id="HAUGEN BR">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Haugen BR is a prominent author who has significantly contributed to the field of thyroid health, particularly in the development of management guidelines for thyroid conditions. He is recognized as one of the authors of the American Thyroid Association Management Guidelines for Adult Patients with Thyroid Nodules and Differentiated Thyroid Cancer, specifically the 2015 edition. His work focuses on providing comprehensive guidance for the management of thyroid nodules and differentiated thyroid cancer, reflecting his expertise and commitment to improving patient care in this area.</data>
      <data key="d2">02db15b9ad7bc5655e1907ad3fa4e8ad,171bf5a205ba13cbab91aab05e088040,17db9c3996d806c3332ba2796ab7736f,a4e97817eb89c3941a890d94f5359369,bbe700b5b290ea119e511c94a6f0c67f,e775708e66a97968834f7476479a21b2</data>
