    </node>
    <node id="PUNCION ASPIRATIVA CON AGUJA FINA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Fine-needle aspiration (FNA) is a procedure used to obtain a sample from a thyroid nodule for cytological evaluation to determine the risk of malignancy.</data>
      <data key="d2">cb3b93a50040c892ecf439582ebb6ac0</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">4653</data>
