    <node id="CANCER DIFERENCIADO DE TIROIDES">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">C&#225;ncer diferenciado de tiroides refers to a group of thyroid cancers that are typically well-differentiated, primarily including papillary and follicular thyroid cancers. This type of cancer arises from follicular cells and is generally managed according to established guidelines, such as those provided by the American Thyroid Association.</data>
      <data key="d2">2c745fa0855caf0a3316554b5a46752c,cb3b93a50040c892ecf439582ebb6ac0</data>
      <data key="d3">181</data>
