      <data key="d7">def7e45edf13466fb4b7d4aa6e1c7572</data>
    </node>
    <node id="GU&#205;A ATA 2015">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The "Gu&#237;a ATA 2015" refers to the 2015 American Thyroid Association guidelines, which offer comprehensive recommendations for the management of thyroid nodules and differentiated thyroid cancer. These guidelines are designed to assist healthcare professionals in making informed decisions regarding the diagnosis, treatment, and follow-up of patients with these thyroid conditions.</data>
      <data key="d2">14299e85574ef5c76c7164e2c4d20a53,cb3b93a50040c892ecf439582ebb6ac0</data>
      <data key="d3">424</data>
