      <data key="d7">d29b18c367414007a416911b88288438</data>
    </node>
    <node id="NATIONAL COMPREHENSIVE CANCER NETWORK">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The National Comprehensive Cancer Network (NCCN) is an organization dedicated to developing clinical practice guidelines in the field of oncology. Among its various contributions, the NCCN provides specific guidelines for the treatment and management of thyroid carcinoma. These guidelines are designed to assist healthcare professionals in delivering high-quality care to patients with cancer.</data>
      <data key="d2">a4e97817eb89c3941a890d94f5359369,e2091cc12f3e5cfae8cc2c1358cddc65</data>
      <data key="d3">432</data>
