      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The Korean Society of Thyroid Radiology provides consensus statements and recommendations for the ultrasonography diagnosis and management of thyroid nodules.</data>
      <data key="d2">e2091cc12f3e5cfae8cc2c1358cddc65</data>
