    <node id="BOCIO DIFUSO NO T&#211;XICO">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">BOCIO DIFUSO NO T&#211;XICO, or diffuse non-toxic goiter, is a condition characterized by an enlarged thyroid gland that occurs without the presence of toxic symptoms. This condition is often associated with iodine deficiency or other factors that impede the synthesis of thyroid hormones. It represents an adaptive process of the thyroid in response to these challenges, reflecting the gland's efforts to maintain hormonal balance despite the difficulties in hormone production.</data>
      <data key="d2">14299e85574ef5c76c7164e2c4d20a53,e2091cc12f3e5cfae8cc2c1358cddc65</data>
