    <node id="LLOYD RV">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Lloyd RV is a prominent researcher who plays a significant role in the development of the NANETS guidelines for neuroendocrine tumors. In addition to this, Lloyd RV serves as an editor for the WHO Classification of Tumours of Endocrine Organs, a comprehensive resource that encompasses various types of endocrine tumors, including those of the thyroid. Through these contributions, Lloyd RV is actively involved in advancing the understanding and classification of endocrine-related neoplasms.</data>
