    <node id="JAMA ONCOL">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">JAMA Oncology is a peer-reviewed medical journal that focuses on publishing research and reviews related to oncology and cancer treatment. The journal covers a wide range of topics within the field, including specific studies on various types of cancer, such as head and neck cancer.</data>
