    </node>
    <node id="ANNALS OF SURGERY">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The "ANNALS OF SURGERY" is a peer-reviewed medical journal that focuses on publishing research related to surgical practices and outcomes. It features a variety of articles, including meta-analyses concerning immunonutrition in surgery and studies that estimate mortality risk in preoperative patients. Additionally, the journal includes research on specific surgical conditions, such as medullary thyroid cancer. Through its comprehensive coverage of surgical topics, the "ANNALS OF SURGERY" serves as a significant resource for medical professionals in the field of surgery.</data>
      <data key="d2">3d5af63a33abe5094b25a96394f69969,6216a2d06144ebde48b78330f488c603,ce6821fbd8f78047e06917383f25f037,e775708e66a97968834f7476479a21b2</data>
      <data key="d3">1237</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">3</data>
      <data key="d6">4729</data>
      <data key="d7">34bd72d5bf8e441d9199d9e627ea8e7a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="JOURNAL OF CLINICAL ENDOCRINOLOGY AND METABOLISM">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The Journal of Clinical Endocrinology and Metabolism is a prominent medical journal dedicated to publishing research on various aspects of endocrinology and metabolism. It covers a wide range of topics, including the impacts of diet on health, endocrine disorders such as medullary thyroid carcinoma, and hormonal and metabolic disorders. The journal features studies on vitamin D deficiency in cystic fibrosis patients, as well as research related to anorexia nervosa and its treatments. Through its diverse array of publications, the Journal of Clinical Endocrinology and Metabolism contributes significantly to the understanding and advancement of knowledge in the fields of endocrinology and metabolism.</data>
      <data key="d2">203ff7a2671a44d48a1a326f469c5543,2de75b0403c279c1781dfec3cdd2a3e2,c3e74ddf9529482684f4b62e713df49b,e775708e66a97968834f7476479a21b2</data>
      <data key="d3">1591</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">4</data>
      <data key="d6">4730</data>
      <data key="d7">2f580f68945541bf9939440bf9de4471</data>
    </node>
    <node id="CLINICAL ONCOLOGY">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Clinical Oncology is a journal that publishes research and reviews on cancer treatment and management, including studies on medullary thyroid carcinoma.</data>
      <data key="d2">e775708e66a97968834f7476479a21b2</data>
      <data key="d3">427</data>
