    <node id="WELLS SA">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">WELLS SA is a prominent researcher and author in the field of thyroid cancer, specifically focusing on medullary thyroid carcinoma. They have been actively involved in developing guidelines and conducting studies related to this type of cancer. WELLS SA's contributions include significant input into the management guidelines for medullary thyroid carcinoma, highlighting their expertise and commitment to advancing knowledge in this area.</data>
      <data key="d2">2c745fa0855caf0a3316554b5a46752c,a2303199b7587142ad661841870790ec,de6e1d8ac9f422acb17fd26b77b485da</data>
