    <node id="CARCINOMA MEDULAR">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Carcinoma medular is a type of thyroid cancer that is associated with mutations in the RET proto-oncogene. It is often diagnosed in patients with Multiple Endocrine Neoplasia types 2A (MEN2A) and 2B (MEN2B). This form of cancer can secrete hormones, leading to symptoms such as diarrhea and flushing.</data>
      <data key="d2">2c745fa0855caf0a3316554b5a46752c,8ef1954ebfc3ede96038ff1db145e140</data>
      <data key="d3">969</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
