    <node id="DRALLE H">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Dralle H is a prominent contributor to the European Society of Endocrinology guidelines, specifically focusing on the management of adrenal incidentalomas. With a specialization in endocrine surgery, Dralle H plays a significant role in shaping the guidelines that govern the clinical approach to these conditions. Additionally, Dralle H is actively involved in research related to medullary thyroid carcinoma, contributing to the development of management guidelines and engaging in studies that explore biomarker-based risk stratification for this type of cancer. Through these efforts, Dralle H has established a comprehensive expertise in both adrenal incidentalomas and medullary thyroid carcinoma, making valuable contributions to the field of endocrinology.</data>
      <data key="d2">02db15b9ad7bc5655e1907ad3fa4e8ad,28bca03cd2152cf2562d7aa16d7ced1d,8fe4d0101ea7a6ddaefd71c963d9ecc7,b7b162b783ea688c5fe9b7f531b46aaf,de6e1d8ac9f422acb17fd26b77b485da</data>
      <data key="d3">1334</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">3</data>
      <data key="d6">4757</data>
      <data key="d7">0179e0e8ea224595b006ecca23104f6c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="TIROIDECTOM&#205;A TOTAL">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Tiroidectom&#237;a total, or total thyroidectomy, is a surgical procedure indicated for patients with specific RET mutations to prevent the development of medullary thyroid carcinoma. Additionally, it is recommended for patients diagnosed with thyroid cancer, as outlined in medical guidelines. This procedure involves the complete removal of the thyroid gland and is a critical intervention for managing certain thyroid-related conditions.</data>
      <data key="d2">02db15b9ad7bc5655e1907ad3fa4e8ad,931560e7015f30adee5741819cdd0fab</data>
      <data key="d3">970</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">2</data>
      <data key="d6">4758</data>
      <data key="d7">361f3c3587ac4ab6bf3365b361adaddc</data>
    </node>
    <node id="VACIAMIENTO DE COMPARTIMENTO VI">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Compartment VI dissection is a surgical procedure that may be indicated in the management of thyroid cancer, particularly when lymph nodes are involved.</data>
      <data key="d2">02db15b9ad7bc5655e1907ad3fa4e8ad</data>
      <data key="d3">1257</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">4759</data>
      <data key="d7">c01aeabe2fa140a2abbd3be3f3c588e7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="VACIAMIENTO GANGLIONAR">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Lymphadenectomy is a surgical procedure to remove lymph nodes that may be affected by cancer, as indicated in the management of thyroid cancer.</data>
      <data key="d2">02db15b9ad7bc5655e1907ad3fa4e8ad</data>
      <data key="d3">1257</data>
