    <node id="GALICIA">
      <data key="d0">GEO</data>
      <data key="d1">Galicia is an autonomous community in Spain known for its unique cultural identity and geographical features. In recent years, it has become a focal point for studies on nutritional risk assessments in hospitalized patients, highlighting the region's commitment to healthcare and patient well-being. Additionally, Galicia has established its own catalog of enteral formulas, which restricts the number of formulas approved for funding, ensuring that only certain products are available for patients in need of nutritional support. To continue treatment for nutritional needs, patients in Galicia are required to submit a justification report to the General Subdirectorate of Pharmacy and Health Products, reflecting the region's structured approach to healthcare management. Furthermore, Galicia faces significant challenges with obesity prevalence rates, underscoring the importance of ongoing research and intervention in nutritional health within the community.</data>
      <data key="d2">0597a142067272f25431b8b42cb5288f,0df5ab4ef9db16004ddebefc8290f5f2,298e79737894aa157da136b1996578bf,62cb70a5fd28a7c444f52a64ce2a7f75,7ba6c80b1b1919de63502e93c6b9f6fa</data>
      <data key="d3">1373</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">5</data>
      <data key="d6">4804</data>
      <data key="d7">7b120faccc124de4abdeebab399a9ddc</data>
    </node>
    <node id="EDEMATOSO">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Edematous states refer to conditions where excess fluid accumulates in the body's tissues, which can affect nutritional status and body composition.</data>
      <data key="d2">0597a142067272f25431b8b42cb5288f</data>
      <data key="d3">1155</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">4805</data>
      <data key="d7">6d8830f6c1674c33865a30f668693cbd</data>
    </node>
    <node id="MASA LIBRE DE GRASA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Lean body mass refers to the weight of everything in the body except fat, an important measure in assessing body composition.</data>
