    <node id="GONZALO MAR&#205;N M">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Gonzalo Mar&#237;n M is an author who has contributed to research in clinical nutrition and metabolism. He has also collaborated on works related to nutritional requirements and diet therapy. His contributions reflect a focus on understanding the complexities of nutrition and its application in clinical settings.</data>
