    <node id="DIETOTERAPIA, NUTRICI&#211;N CL&#205;NICA Y METABOLISMO">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">"DIETOTERAPIA, NUTRICI&#211;N CL&#205;NICA Y METABOLISMO" is a comprehensive medical text that explores the intricate relationship between diet therapy, clinical nutrition, and metabolism. This publication delves into various aspects of nutritional practices, including parenteral nutrition, and emphasizes the importance of dietary controls and their implications for health. It provides valuable insights into nutritional guidelines and practices, as well as the interactions between drugs and diet. Edited by multiple authors, including Olveira Fuster G., this work serves as an essential resource for healthcare professionals seeking to understand the role of nutrition in patient care and the impact of dietary interventions on health outcomes.</data>
      <data key="d2">16d282094937dc2b58bfd40e13934fd2,285343ba92b89a1761b72d9d789ba8f6,4e86ca77481672995a03989d321652bc,5fb0e4d2f6efd6c6abcd9f7b7583ed7f,66bc37c9c52956b468bccf2ef89662de,cd56385abb6f8c594bf532666bdf1860,fa5c0208b983c59b247a65e6bb166f2a</data>
