    <node id="RECOMENDACIONES DIET&#201;TICAS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">The entity "RECOMENDACIONES DIET&#201;TICAS" refers to dietary recommendations, which are guidelines established to ensure that individuals receive the appropriate amount of nutrients and energy in their diet. These recommendations are particularly important for children, as they help to guide nutrient intake during critical growth periods. Additionally, dietary recommendations are essential for patients with chronic kidney disease, as they provide specific guidelines to maintain nutritional status and overall health. Overall, these dietary guidelines serve to promote well-being and prevent nutritional deficiencies across different populations.</data>
      <data key="d2">285343ba92b89a1761b72d9d789ba8f6,b2bdb1e00976001800583298f8dddc7a,e321db63d9b561eb98a4f01853b141ad</data>
