      <data key="d7">0133adb8190142be91386dce5ef54442</data>
    </node>
    <node id="IRETON-JONES">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Ireton-Jones is a researcher focused on nutritional support for cancer patients. In addition to their research, Ireton-Jones is known for developing the Ireton-Jones equation, which is utilized to estimate energy expenditure in patients, particularly those with specific medical conditions. This equation serves as a valuable tool for calculating the energy needs of critically ill patients, highlighting its importance in clinical settings.</data>
      <data key="d2">285343ba92b89a1761b72d9d789ba8f6,3e40e9a9e041bbf1e7ca6eaa14080666,bef1f848ac9b922f7361b740210a8314</data>
