    <node id="OLVEIRA FUSTER G">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Olveira Fuster G is a notable author and editor recognized for significant contributions to the field of nutrition and diet therapy. He has authored an update on probiotics, prebiotics, and symbiotics in clinical nutrition, showcasing his expertise in these areas. Additionally, he has contributed to a manual that addresses nutritional needs across different life stages, further emphasizing his commitment to advancing knowledge in nutrition. Olveira Fuster G also serves as an editor and contributor to the book titled "Dietoterapia, nutrici&#243;n cl&#237;nica y metabolismo," which reflects his comprehensive understanding of clinical nutrition and metabolism. Through these works, Olveira Fuster G has established himself as a key figure in the literature surrounding nutritional requirements and diet therapy.</data>
      <data key="d2">03b7a89c9bb1dfd115acef377b491808,1e60716fb6d7eb11fdf78dc47bd9a5d9,582f520c5400d8dfa8ec81c8afdc31a8,91131751d701592a597bae807e00c1dc</data>
