    </node>
    <node id="DIETA EQUILIBRADA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">"DIETA EQUILIBRADA" refers to a balanced diet that is crucial for maintaining overall health and preventing chronic diseases. It encompasses a variety of foods consumed in appropriate proportions, which is essential not only for general well-being but also for specific health management, such as preventing kidney stones. A balanced diet provides all the necessary nutrients required for optimal health and serves as a foundational aspect of nutritional education, highlighting its importance in disease prevention and health maintenance.</data>
      <data key="d2">91131751d701592a597bae807e00c1dc,9ea70909c43b9b7923a0fa217c0e7290,e0102bb655b6476ce3296726e3aceb4a</data>
