    <node id="FEDERACI&#211;N ESPA&#209;OLA DE SOCIEDADES DE ALIMENTACI&#211;N, NUTRICI&#211;N Y DIET&#201;TICA">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The Federaci&#243;n Espa&#241;ola de Sociedades de Alimentaci&#243;n, Nutrici&#243;n y Diet&#233;tica (FESNAD) is an organization that provides consensus on dietary fats and oils for the adult Spanish population.</data>
