    <node id="METABOLISMO">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Metabolismo encompasses all biochemical processes that occur within living organisms to maintain life, including essential functions such as digestion, nutrient absorption, and the conversion of food into energy. It is closely related to nutrition and exercise, playing a crucial role in understanding the nutritional needs of individuals, particularly during specific conditions such as pregnancy, obesity, and recovery from burns or severe trauma. The metabolic processes are vital for sustaining life and can be influenced by various medical conditions, affecting how the body utilizes energy derived from food. Overall, metabolismo is integral to the health and well-being of living organisms, highlighting the importance of proper nutrition and metabolic function.</data>
      <data key="d2">03b7a89c9bb1dfd115acef377b491808,0bf272be187cbf9ec33184c8052e19c6,6906ee13020e48a5d50fc97dc22928fa,89e0e7fac6984f367ae1649e9eaab7d7,a4b56b993221a7065a59bca622c02953,bd22bf95ac5fc6dc95539efb99c5b11a,cca60bfbb1e73ceda513fbcaf0866a8f,dce680808e039e852dc0f2639835db32,e5ec5005272f7691eba86e2cc7240f5a,f999ed498214f69427e629a05ea8ce4a</data>
      <data key="d3">1434</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">5</data>
      <data key="d6">4835</data>
      <data key="d7">17f5d63d4faa448a84026bd3a8091ef0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="DIETOTERAPIA">
      <data key="d0" />
      <data key="d1">Dietoterapia is a comprehensive therapeutic approach that focuses on diet management and clinical nutrition to treat various health conditions. It is particularly significant for patients recovering from digestive surgeries, as it emphasizes tailored dietary recommendations to optimize recovery. The practice encompasses clinical nutrition and metabolism, aiming to manage dietary needs through specific food choices and meal planning.

Dietoterapia plays a crucial role in the early stages of conditions such as amyotrophic lateral sclerosis (ALS), where dietary modifications are essential to enhance intake and reduce dysphagia. It also addresses the nutritional requirements of patients with chronic diseases, including cystic fibrosis and metabolic disorders, by implementing controlled diets that cater to specific health issues like diabetes and obesity.

The organization behind Dietoterapia is involved in the publication of relevant literature and the development of nutrition products, highlighting its commitment to advancing clinical nutrition practices. This approach includes dietary therapy for managing inflammatory bowel disease, pancreatic diseases, and other health conditions, with a focus on improving overall health and nutritional status.

Dietoterapia also encompasses the use of diet in the treatment of diseases, including cancer prevention and management, and considers the impact of dietary factors such as sugar intake on weight and dental health. It is a vital aspect of nutrition and health, particularly in clinical settings where patients may require specialized dietary interventions, including parenteral nutrition in certain scenarios.

Overall, Dietoterapia represents a holistic approach to dietary therapy, emphasizing the importance of nutrition in managing health conditions and improving patient outcomes.</data>
      <data key="d2">0148b1abded087a7c25eda89c8014f38,018644ab78da6f804c57546f08ff6a65,0379ef9e3f56ccd30c572884eb5bd723,03b7a89c9bb1dfd115acef377b491808,0bf272be187cbf9ec33184c8052e19c6,1870ba6878c109f3023c9d15d0fa784b,1adf391b13598f3ffe28ae596ff49438,1e60716fb6d7eb11fdf78dc47bd9a5d9,2206bb4d5efe2dcf644ee48468ea112c,2b5b30d7b9371f8fe9e686c89dde3cb7,2f5d9123a78d23b1bc3d9f06d7a53d78,3dbf07634cee8d4d443f59ed50f98b54,41dee7570059d609c99074f155d4f927,4681d149c863ed06c99b19443f841abd,5700f71dc6a101296f5bfec99b1e796f,5c69bb68f0d23a5aa15fa31301aa13c2,67d484d5c0c84fff32782bd773c0fd7a,6906ee13020e48a5d50fc97dc22928fa,701eb4c24e94839def8d18882a2dda63,76bdd5f53571ff68dd1e439219572347,7852af9e2886d0d889fbc056d0a75f21,87cb06eed8a8c92c589d25ea2d5cfaec,89e0e7fac6984f367ae1649e9eaab7d7,8ff1cad741bacfef19d53bb8941b5ca9,9c65bcd67b717641c8d9d94ef9cfb210,9df63e54761edd6ad6c4ad6fb83ae123,a2675f78609440ca1162c24997360929,a4b56b993221a7065a59bca622c02953,a4d8922d5e65304a84f8a61999f77933,a519216aaee7bf8a1317f5d6b522c4b6,aaef63df030ff97e66b358358491e6a5,b6c8d5ff1536806d6512fb9d1af1e6db,bd22bf95ac5fc6dc95539efb99c5b11a,c83e630c61a82784e0597259d89b96ea,cca60bfbb1e73ceda513fbcaf0866a8f,da9a9fd67ac55e9180d1609d1df2a255,dce680808e039e852dc0f2639835db32,e4edae03f8089b7bc1c46e697e658e3c,e5ec5005272f7691eba86e2cc7240f5a,f14ec70726a24a574ae5d437903fddb8,f7d56bac9cc29e47690669e812094c99</data>
