    <node id="INGESTAS DIET&#201;TICAS DE REFERENCIA">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Ingestas Diet&#233;ticas de Referencia (IDR) are dietary reference intakes specifically developed for Spain and published in 2010. These guidelines serve as a framework for dietary recommendations aimed at the Spanish population, providing essential information on the intake of various nutrients. Among the nutrients addressed in the IDR are vitamin D and calcium, highlighting the importance of these elements in the diet. Overall, the IDR represents a comprehensive approach to ensuring adequate nutrition and health for individuals in Spain.</data>
