      <data key="d1">De Luis Rom&#225;n DA is an author recognized for his contributions to the field of nutrition, specifically in the areas of enteral and parenteral nutrition. He has been referenced in discussions regarding the administration methods of enteral nutrition, highlighting his expertise in this area. Additionally, De Luis Rom&#225;n DA has addressed the complications associated with parenteral nutrition, further demonstrating his comprehensive understanding of nutritional practices. His work has significantly contributed to the literature on enteral nutrition, establishing him as a notable figure in this domain.</data>
