      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Weimann A is a researcher and author who is associated with the ESPEN guidelines on clinical nutrition in surgery. He has contributed to the development of these guidelines, which are essential for providing evidence-based recommendations in the field of clinical nutrition for surgical patients.</data>
