    <node id="BRAGA M">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Braga M is a prominent researcher and author known for significant contributions to the field of surgical nutrition. He has focused on enhanced recovery after surgery and the impact of immunonutrition on surgical outcomes. As an expert in this area, Braga M is associated with the ESPEN guidelines, specifically those pertaining to clinical nutrition in surgery and parenteral nutrition related to surgical practices. Additionally, he has played a vital role in formulating consensus recommendations from the North American Surgical Nutrition Summit, further establishing his influence and expertise in the field of surgical nutrition.</data>
