    <node id="CARLI F">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Carli F is a prominent researcher and author recognized for her contributions to the field of clinical nutrition, particularly in the context of surgery. She is associated with the ESPEN guidelines on clinical nutrition, which provide essential recommendations for managing nutritional care in surgical patients. Additionally, Carli F is actively involved in researching perioperative care specifically for patients undergoing pancreaticoduodenectomy, a complex surgical procedure. Furthermore, she has contributed to the recommendations stemming from the North American Surgical Nutrition Summit, highlighting her commitment to advancing nutritional practices in surgical settings.</data>
