    <node id="KLEK S">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">KLEK S is a prominent researcher focused on the field of immunonutrition and its implications for surgical patients. He has contributed significantly to the understanding of how immunonutrition affects malnourished individuals undergoing surgery. In addition to his research, KLEK S is one of the authors of the ESPEN guidelines, which provide comprehensive recommendations for the management of acute intestinal failure. His work is recognized within the clinical nutrition community, particularly in the context of surgery, where he has played a key role in shaping best practices through his involvement with the ESPEN guidelines on clinical nutrition.</data>
