    <node id="V&#211;MITOS INCOERCIBLES">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">"V&#211;MITOS INCOERCIBLES" refers to episodes of vomiting that are uncontrollable and cannot be managed effectively. These episodes can lead to significant health issues, including dehydration and complications that may arise from the inability to maintain proper nutrition. Specifically, v&#243;mitos incoercibles can hinder the safe administration of enteral nutrition, making it challenging to provide adequate dietary support to affected individuals.</data>
      <data key="d2">8c1c8ef18f5c90fe936a3ca920768ee2,b1464c57df2eaa651a10c1522ab7db68</data>
