      <data key="d0">GEO</data>
      <data key="d1">Toledo is a city in Spain known for its rich history and cultural significance. It is home to the Aula M&#233;dica, a medical publishing house that published a notable book on clinical nutrition. This book, which focuses on clinical nutrition and metabolism, has been referenced in various contexts, highlighting Toledo's role as a center for medical literature in this field.</data>
