    </node>
    <node id="HERNIAS HIATALES">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Hiatal hernias are conditions that can complicate the placement of gastrostomy tubes.</data>
      <data key="d2">76bdd5f53571ff68dd1e439219572347</data>
      <data key="d3">1147</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">4866</data>
      <data key="d7">ba5a462db8d343018acd72b4f5ed1540</data>
    </node>
    <node id="V&#211;LVULO G&#193;STRICO">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">V&#211;LVULO G&#193;STRICO is a medical condition characterized by the twisting of the stomach on itself, which can result in obstruction. This condition necessitates careful consideration during medical procedures due to the potential complications it may cause. Additionally, gastric volvulus can contraindicate the placement of gastrostomy tubes, highlighting the importance of thorough evaluation and management in affected patients.</data>
      <data key="d2">0b3eea4ed6da979f796aeba1ff2ee8d9,76bdd5f53571ff68dd1e439219572347</data>
      <data key="d3">1147</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">4867</data>
      <data key="d7">74f4c3d668f341bd975e618c9b11a064</data>
    </node>
    <node id="HIPERTENSI&#211;N PORTAL">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">HIPERTENSI&#211;N PORTAL refers to a medical condition characterized by increased blood pressure in the portal venous system, which is often a complication associated with chronic liver diseases, particularly cirrhosis. This condition contributes to the retention of fluids in patients suffering from liver cirrhosis and can complicate medical procedures such as the placement of gastrostomy tubes due to the heightened risk of bleeding. Overall, portal hypertension is a significant concern in the management of liver-related health issues, especially in the context of cirrhosis.</data>
      <data key="d2">1911ce26c118381473eccb438875b29c,76bdd5f53571ff68dd1e439219572347,84b542fb745825398f17e4f8f4756cb4,9426220ccd162a5796b1bb2cb373e29f,ad6c1f4ea2a6b80d32100cf5c2808cdc</data>
      <data key="d3">1820</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">4</data>
      <data key="d6">4868</data>
      <data key="d7">72b57f921feb41368b906447b94e9b5d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="SYSTEM NATIONAL DE SALUD">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The Sistema Nacional de Salud is the national health system in Spain that regulates healthcare services, including nutritional support for patients.</data>
      <data key="d2">f7b4cba3bbdeec64513c036fd4166835</data>
      <data key="d3">750</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">4869</data>
      <data key="d7">936975cde0174e9e862c4e20c711476d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="MINISTERIO DE SANIDAD">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The Ministerio de Sanidad, also known as the Spanish Ministry of Health, is a governmental body responsible for public health policies in Spain. It oversees health services and financing within the healthcare system, ensuring the implementation of health guidelines. Among its various responsibilities, the Ministerio de Sanidad provides guidelines for enteral nutrition and home parenteral nutrition, reflecting its commitment to managing nutritional health as part of its broader public health mandate.</data>
      <data key="d2">26765fd0d663c8708d7bd6a545de3e2c,e945adb09eb8d9984302b72f9a2a68cb,f7b4cba3bbdeec64513c036fd4166835</data>
      <data key="d3">750</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">3</data>
      <data key="d6">4870</data>
      <data key="d7">668663e54f8c48aab856fc428a45cb7c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="SONDA DE GASTROSTOM&#205;A">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">The "SONDA DE GASTROSTOM&#205;A" is a medical device designed to provide long-term nutritional support for patients who are unable to eat orally. It is inserted into the stomach through the abdominal wall, facilitating enteral nutrition. This device is particularly useful in procedures such as endoscopic gastrostomy, where it allows for direct feeding into the stomach. The gastrostomy tube can be replaced by a button once a gastrocutaneous fistula has formed, offering a more comfortable option for ongoing nutritional support. Overall, the gastrostomy tube is essential for patients who cannot maintain adequate nutritional status through oral intake.</data>
      <data key="d2">4041e05fe2f79ca70bbf0522cc31be8f,5549895a3a7f54651e6c54f5a5d7d833,82d36ebbaaa026c713df2b7a47253efa,ce4c057e0a625bc9e64301a0cca1e206,e569eda9506ef1e77080a8120e388963,f7b4cba3bbdeec64513c036fd4166835</data>
      <data key="d3">1081</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">8</data>
      <data key="d6">4871</data>
      <data key="d7">98743531e69f46e5a2b8de19a971384a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="TUMORES DE CABEZA Y CUELLO">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">TUMORES DE CABEZA Y CUELLO, or head and neck tumors, are cancers located in the head and neck region that can significantly impact a patient's ability to swallow and maintain proper nutritional status. These tumors may necessitate surgical intervention, and post-surgery, patients often require specialized nutritional support to aid in their recovery. Due to the potential difficulties in swallowing, alternative feeding methods, such as gastrostomy, may be necessary. Therefore, careful nutritional assessment and support are essential for individuals affected by these medical conditions.</data>
      <data key="d2">38c7f97d650c77986c2dc9132aa20fdb,58af2bdd20eeb5647ecc8088732833d8,99900c6d95f85a5b4b88fcfed6775cec,eae8ddef005974a2ffe71cf7c61b0634,f7b4cba3bbdeec64513c036fd4166835</data>
      <data key="d3">953</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">9</data>
      <data key="d6">4872</data>
      <data key="d7">c70d18f923184bc2a80bd35bb352276e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="FORMULAS ENTERALES">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">FORMULAS ENTERALES are specialized nutritional products specifically designed for enteral feeding, providing complete nutrition to patients who require this form of dietary support. These enteral formulas are particularly beneficial for surgical patients, as they help meet their nutritional needs during recovery.</data>
      <data key="d2">0b02ff4978fb09a0b2a360ae8c661337,f7b4cba3bbdeec64513c036fd4166835</data>
      <data key="d3">1178</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">4873</data>
      <data key="d7">fa07d9eacc0440d6a0bf74ba1ceb826b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="F&#211;RMULAS MONOM&#201;RICAS">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Las f&#243;rmulas monom&#233;ricas son soluciones que contienen amino&#225;cidos libres y son utilizadas en la nutrici&#243;n enteral.</data>
      <data key="d2">0a844e2dc679c0578ba4bdeda742c2eb</data>
      <data key="d3">1183</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">3</data>
      <data key="d6">4874</data>
      <data key="d7">74247b8aad6e436baf7f5a9d464ddb5f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="F&#211;RMULAS PEPT&#205;DICAS">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Las f&#243;rmulas pept&#237;dicas son soluciones que predominan en p&#233;ptidos y son utilizadas en la nutrici&#243;n enteral.</data>
      <data key="d2">0a844e2dc679c0578ba4bdeda742c2eb</data>
      <data key="d3">1183</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">3</data>
      <data key="d6">4875</data>
      <data key="d7">dffc871ef8514cb49443be346e740c4c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="F&#211;RMULAS ESPEC&#205;FICAS">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">F&#243;rmulas espec&#237;ficas are specialized nutritional formulas tailored for patients with specific health conditions, including diabetes and various metabolic or digestive diseases. These formulas serve as nutritional solutions that are adapted to meet the unique needs of individuals suffering from these conditions. They are designed not only to provide essential nutrients but also to influence the evolution and prognosis of certain diseases, thereby supporting the overall health and well-being of patients.</data>
      <data key="d2">0a844e2dc679c0578ba4bdeda742c2eb,178140d0d29364593546d7d21393f2c6,d028f23d86d7ed32eebe35c5d90765f2</data>
      <data key="d3">1178</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">4</data>
      <data key="d6">4876</data>
      <data key="d7">3b0323e825964a30a000152776b8f66f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="OSMOLALIDAD">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">La osmolalidad es una medida de la concentraci&#243;n de part&#237;culas osm&#243;ticamente activas en una soluci&#243;n, importante en la clasificaci&#243;n de f&#243;rmulas de nutrici&#243;n enteral.</data>
      <data key="d2">0a844e2dc679c0578ba4bdeda742c2eb</data>
      <data key="d3">1183</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">3</data>
      <data key="d6">4877</data>
      <data key="d7">6ed07b459c994038b8c7df94ddc62de0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="F&#211;RMULAS EST&#193;NDAR">
      <data key="d0" />
      <data key="d1">F&#211;RMULAS EST&#193;NDAR se refiere a preparaciones nutricionales com&#250;nmente utilizadas que, en ciertos casos, no presentan diferencias significativas en comparaci&#243;n con f&#243;rmulas espec&#237;ficas. Estas f&#243;rmulas son dise&#241;adas para proporcionar una nutrici&#243;n adecuada y son ampliamente empleadas en diversas aplicaciones.</data>
      <data key="d2">056e169253fe046c2922537bb79ba187,0a844e2dc679c0578ba4bdeda742c2eb,169eceabd2bd24183f24faccb2c00088</data>
      <data key="d3">610</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">4</data>
      <data key="d6">4878</data>
      <data key="d7">e3dcb2fdef5a4f328acea6a9a1d7ed97</data>
    </node>
    <node id="F&#211;RMULAS OLIGOMONOM&#201;RICAS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Las f&#243;rmulas oligomonom&#233;ricas son productos de nutrici&#243;n enteral en las que las prote&#237;nas se encuentran hidrolizadas en peque&#241;os p&#233;ptidos a amino&#225;cidos libres, clasificadas seg&#250;n su composici&#243;n y caracter&#237;sticas nutricionales.</data>
      <data key="d2">2def4be9506db96f8bdfe9e3ba6f9b6f</data>
      <data key="d3">1183</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">6</data>
      <data key="d6">4879</data>
      <data key="d7">ff8aff5024f544bf9289e8d345163535</data>
    </node>
    <node id="DEL OLMO GARC&#205;A D.">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Del Olmo Garc&#237;a D. es un autor que ha escrito sobre productos diet&#233;ticos para usos nutricionales espec&#237;ficos.</data>
      <data key="d2">2def4be9506db96f8bdfe9e3ba6f9b6f</data>
      <data key="d3">1479</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">2</data>
      <data key="d6">4880</data>
      <data key="d7">de3dd67a7f914c5c90fbb52367ecb7e4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="DIETAS OLIGOMONOM&#201;RICAS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Las dietas oligomonom&#233;ricas son f&#243;rmulas que tienen una osmolalidad moderadamente hipert&#243;nica, entre 350-550 mOsm/kg, y son utilizadas en nutrici&#243;n enteral.</data>
      <data key="d2">2def4be9506db96f8bdfe9e3ba6f9b6f</data>
      <data key="d3">1178</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">4881</data>
      <data key="d7">c5fadf77edff49b19359b75f8251d4b4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="DIETAS MONOM&#201;RICAS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Las dietas monom&#233;ricas son f&#243;rmulas con osmolalidad hipert&#243;nica, superior a 550 mOsm/kg, utilizadas en nutrici&#243;n enteral.</data>
      <data key="d2">2def4be9506db96f8bdfe9e3ba6f9b6f</data>
      <data key="d3">1178</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">4882</data>
      <data key="d7">f294299c729d4d1ebe717786d329f77b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="CASE&#205;NA">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Case&#237;na is a protein found in milk that has garnered attention for its various health benefits, including potential anticancer properties. It is recognized as a slow-digesting dairy protein, making it a popular choice in nutritional supplements aimed at muscle recovery and sustained energy. Additionally, case&#237;na is utilized in nutritional products for promoting satiety, which can aid in weight management. It serves as the primary source of protein in polymeric and oligomeric formulas, available in both intact and hydrolyzed forms. Overall, case&#237;na is valued for its nutritional applications and its role in supporting muscle health and recovery.</data>
      <data key="d2">16e694ae79763a00ceb974feca8e733d,2def4be9506db96f8bdfe9e3ba6f9b6f,751947d2192006b89bb703587d56df99,a0ef28095dacaada520d8e6fbaf518f1,d7995c4e4e8e09e71d30c87b5f02b18a</data>
      <data key="d3">1183</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">5</data>
      <data key="d6">4883</data>
      <data key="d7">2ae8dbb7e3c74af8b10f7d85239a52ee</data>
    </node>
    <node id="LACTOALB&#218;MINA">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Lactoalb&#250;mina is a protein derived from whey, recognized for its high biological value. It serves as a significant source of protein and is commonly utilized in various dietary supplements. Additionally, lactoalb&#250;mina is incorporated into certain enteral nutrition formulas, highlighting its importance in nutritional support and supplementation.</data>
      <data key="d2">2def4be9506db96f8bdfe9e3ba6f9b6f,d7995c4e4e8e09e71d30c87b5f02b18a</data>
      <data key="d3">1183</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">4884</data>
      <data key="d7">b24ff1e1768f4377bb674c8587e58dbb</data>
    </node>
    <node id="PROTE&#205;NA DE SOJA">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">La prote&#237;na de soja es un al&#233;rgeno que puede provocar reacciones adversas en lactantes y ni&#241;os mayores, de manera similar a la prote&#237;na de la leche de vaca. Adem&#225;s, se utiliza como una de las fuentes de prote&#237;nas en f&#243;rmulas de nutrici&#243;n enteral, lo que resalta su importancia en la alimentaci&#243;n y nutrici&#243;n de ciertos grupos de poblaci&#243;n.</data>
      <data key="d2">2def4be9506db96f8bdfe9e3ba6f9b6f,693b5721c7fc52c8165c48b580777840</data>
      <data key="d3">1531</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">3</data>
      <data key="d6">4885</data>
      <data key="d7">bfd7f052adba452b9f1fb96e04508c85</data>
    </node>
    <node id="PROTE&#205;NA DEL GUISANTE">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">La prote&#237;na del guisante es otra fuente de prote&#237;na utilizada en f&#243;rmulas de nutrici&#243;n enteral.</data>
      <data key="d2">2def4be9506db96f8bdfe9e3ba6f9b6f</data>
      <data key="d3">1183</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">4886</data>
      <data key="d7">73c12d6dd8224f38b22afef5aa99d8e5</data>
    </node>
    <node id="PROTE&#205;NAS DE LACTOSUERO">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Las prote&#237;nas de lactosuero son utilizadas en algunas f&#243;rmulas de nutrici&#243;n enteral como fuente de prote&#237;na.</data>
      <data key="d2">2def4be9506db96f8bdfe9e3ba6f9b6f</data>
