    <node id="GOMIS P">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Gomis P is an author who specializes in the formulation and preparation of parenteral nutrition. Additionally, Gomis P is involved in the study of oral glutamine supplements specifically for hematopoietic transplant patients. This dual focus highlights Gomis P's contributions to both nutritional support and the management of patients undergoing significant medical treatments.</data>
