    <node id="G&#211;MEZ HOYOS E">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">G&#243;mez Hoyos E is an author recognized for contributions to the field of parenteral nutrition and its associated complications. This author has specifically studied the effects of correcting serum sodium levels in patients undergoing parenteral nutrition, with findings presented at the 17th European Congress of Endocrinology.</data>
