    <node id="AULA M&#201;DICA">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Aula M&#233;dica is a medical publishing house that specializes in producing literature related to clinical nutrition and medical guidelines. The organization is known for publishing textbooks that cover topics in clinical nutrition and metabolism, contributing to the field of medical education. Additionally, Aula M&#233;dica is recognized as the publisher of a referenced book specifically focused on clinical nutrition and metabolism, further solidifying its role in disseminating important medical knowledge.</data>
