    <node id="A.S.P.E.N.">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">A.S.P.E.N. (American Society for Parenteral and Enteral Nutrition) is an organization dedicated to providing guidelines and recommendations for nutrition support in clinical settings. It focuses on the nutritional needs of patients, particularly those with hyperglycemia, and issues clinical guidelines to ensure effective nutrition support. Additionally, A.S.P.E.N. publishes position papers on various nutritional practices, further contributing to the advancement of knowledge and standards in the field of nutrition support.</data>
      <data key="d2">a265c943c66b9cb5d09f89d40ddb995f,d936cb199b788cfcddbfb6e51b1e6e48,e36c9b09870e14d19aa6eb7c82514499</data>
