      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The Grupo de Metabolismo Mineral is a group within the Sociedad Espa&#241;ola de Endocrinolog&#237;a y Nutrici&#243;n focused on mineral metabolism and its clinical implications.</data>
