    </node>
    <node id="MINI-NUTRITIONAL ASSESSMENT">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">The Mini-Nutritional Assessment (MNA) is a screening tool used to identify patients at risk of malnutrition.</data>
      <data key="d2">8ccd7ff955c5b8a333f23f41e34c563a</data>
      <data key="d3">1922</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">5021</data>
      <data key="d7">3b7163ffd699435da717db330d5cdf48</data>
    </node>
    <node id="DUODENOPANCREATECTOM&#205;A">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Duodenopancreatectomy is a surgical procedure that involves the removal of the duodenum and a portion of the pancreas. This operation is often performed in cases of pancreatic cancer or gastric cancer, making it a critical intervention for patients suffering from these conditions. The procedure can lead to complications such as diabetes and malabsorption, which are important considerations in the management of patients post-surgery. Overall, duodenopancreatectomy is utilized primarily in the treatment of pancreatic diseases, highlighting its significance in surgical oncology.</data>
      <data key="d2">3ee948dc4ddfdc75daa8fe7db9bb471e,8b074745f27ee51afc8337a49fafacfa,95ec74fd93c18ac23c08eb70137bc8db</data>
      <data key="d3">225</data>
      <data key="d4">1</data>
      <data key="d5">8</data>
      <data key="d6">5022</data>
      <data key="d7">5ddfeaa7ce5d4734af88f198c370afcd</data>
    </node>
    <node id="ERAS SOCIETY">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The ERAS Society is an organization dedicated to enhancing perioperative care, with a particular emphasis on improved recovery following surgery. It provides comprehensive guidelines aimed at optimizing surgical recovery processes. Among its recommendations, the ERAS Society specifically addresses the needs of patients undergoing pancreaticoduodenectomy, ensuring that best practices are implemented to facilitate better outcomes in surgical recovery.</data>
      <data key="d2">3ee948dc4ddfdc75daa8fe7db9bb471e,a496bf37d4cc9b6246f5eb6b66b03d8a</data>
      <data key="d3">225</data>
      <data key="d4">1</data>
      <data key="d5">3</data>
      <data key="d6">5023</data>
      <data key="d7">b96611571a4b47188ab5e37e377e55d0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="K. LASSEN">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">K. Lassen es uno de los autores de las gu&#237;as para el cuidado perioperatorio en la cirug&#237;a pancre&#225;tica, contribuyendo a la investigaci&#243;n en nutrici&#243;n cl&#237;nica.</data>
      <data key="d2">3ee948dc4ddfdc75daa8fe7db9bb471e</data>
      <data key="d3">225</data>
