    <node id="COSTE-EFECTIVIDAD">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">COSTE-EFECTIVIDAD refers to a comprehensive analysis used to evaluate the economic viability of various interventions aimed at achieving specific health outcomes. This analysis measures effectiveness in clinical terms, such as the cost per case of infections or the cost of life years gained. It plays a crucial role in the economic evaluation of enteral nutrition formulas, particularly highlighting their benefits for surgical patients. Additionally, coste-efectividad is essential for assessing the economic feasibility of home artificial nutrition within healthcare systems. It is also a significant factor when choosing between parenteral and enteral nutrition, as the costs associated with devices and care are generally higher for parenteral nutrition.</data>
      <data key="d2">0b02ff4978fb09a0b2a360ae8c661337,123ef22fb42b6ade4fa2dda096df8490,7b13bde26d33b4316c3183dd027ed909,c1fce1d059978d0a9ee9e63f75c8ca98</data>
      <data key="d3">1440</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">3</data>
      <data key="d6">5033</data>
      <data key="d7">16fed34874824316be54eded42084946</data>
    </node>
    <node id="COMPLICACIONES INFECCIOSAS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">"COMPLICACIONES INFECCIOSAS" refers to infectious complications that can arise in surgical patients, particularly in those with cancer. These complications are significant adverse effects that may occur post-surgery and are often addressed in the context of nutritional support. One specific risk associated with these complications is lipoid pneumonia due to aspiration, which can be linked to the ketogenic diet. To mitigate the health issues that may arise after surgery, the use of immunomodulatory formulas is recommended. Overall, "COMPLICACIONES INFECCIOSAS" encompasses a range of infectious risks that necessitate careful management and nutritional strategies to improve patient outcomes.</data>
      <data key="d2">0b02ff4978fb09a0b2a360ae8c661337,7184072817ac284bebfea449e3eaac8b,95ec74fd93c18ac23c08eb70137bc8db,bf7fc15e1aac41553dc6586efe68b8cb</data>
      <data key="d3">579</data>
      <data key="d4">1</data>
      <data key="d5">3</data>
      <data key="d6">5034</data>
      <data key="d7">16b961fa8e4d42c1ac8fde1c677a5ce1</data>
    </node>
