    <node id="PARANEOPLASTIC SYNDROME">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Paraneoplastic syndrome refers to a set of symptoms that occur in patients with cancer, which in this case is likely related to the tumor causing Cushing's syndrome.</data>
      <data key="d2">85eef7ed9c9b92d86939a6687ea2acfd</data>
