    </node>
    <node id="METOPIRONA">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Metopirona, also known as Metopirone, is a medication that primarily functions as an inhibitor of 11-&#946;-hydroxylase. This action results in a rapid decrease in cortisol levels, making it particularly useful in the treatment of Cushing's syndrome.</data>
      <data key="d2">b2ca509109e853875e707e29a98391e0,dbe034ccd694ae06cf72d347d7dbdacb</data>
