    <node id="HARRISON PRINCIPLES OF INTERNAL MEDICINE">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The "Harrison Principles of Internal Medicine" is a comprehensive medical textbook that provides extensive information on a wide range of medical conditions. Notably, it covers adrenal disorders, including Cushing's syndrome, and includes detailed discussions on various conditions related to the adrenal cortex. This textbook serves as a vital resource for understanding complex medical issues and is widely recognized in the field of internal medicine.</data>
      <data key="d2">4c034422eb6302c32e0d5fdce5b3046d,7082a5d31b18dd81d4c4a0e8ed02623b,9ff14a3c49bd56b2fb12b3fd8ed246de,b2ca509109e853875e707e29a98391e0</data>
