    <node id="HYPERCORTISOLISM">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">HYPERCORTISOLISM is a condition characterized by excessive levels of cortisol in the body. This condition is often associated with Cushing's syndrome, which presents a range of symptoms linked to the elevated cortisol levels. Hypercortisolism is recognized as a hallmark of Cushing's syndrome, highlighting its significance in the diagnosis and understanding of this endocrine disorder.</data>
      <data key="d2">4c034422eb6302c32e0d5fdce5b3046d,8fe4d0101ea7a6ddaefd71c963d9ecc7,9ff14a3c49bd56b2fb12b3fd8ed246de</data>
