    </node>
    <node id="GADOLINIUM">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Gadolinium is a contrast agent used in MRI scans to enhance the visibility of structures, which is important in diagnosing conditions like Cushing's syndrome.</data>
