    <node id="HAUSER SL">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Hauser SL is a prominent author and editor in the field of internal medicine, recognized for his contributions to the medical textbook "Harrison's Principles of Internal Medicine." He has collaborated on topics related to adrenal cortex disorders, including congenital adrenal hyperplasia and Cushing's syndrome, providing valuable insights into these medical conditions. Additionally, Hauser SL has played a significant role in enhancing the understanding of pheochromocytoma through his editorial work. His expertise and contributions have made him a notable figure in the literature surrounding internal medicine.</data>
      <data key="d2">1400aceda067bb7180ca90f0a5335bfe,7082a5d31b18dd81d4c4a0e8ed02623b,8fe4d0101ea7a6ddaefd71c963d9ecc7,973f9100fbfeb9ef31038f51312620a9,b7b162b783ea688c5fe9b7f531b46aaf,dbe034ccd694ae06cf72d347d7dbdacb</data>
