    <node id="YOUNG WF">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Young WF is an author associated with UpToDate, where he provides literature reviews on adrenal incidentalomas. In addition to this, he has written extensively on the diagnosis of primary aldosteronism and endocrine hypertension. His contributions to the field highlight his expertise in endocrinology, particularly in the areas related to adrenal disorders and hypertension.</data>
      <data key="d2">28bca03cd2152cf2562d7aa16d7ced1d,b9bf0b94c01d3dfa9ef4cbce09dd7ec3</data>
