    </node>
    <node id="NEWELL-PRICE J">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Newell-Price J is a prominent contributor to the European Society of Endocrinology guidelines concerning adrenal incidentalomas. This individual is recognized for their significant research in adrenal disorders and has played a key role in developing management guidelines for these conditions. As an author of the European Society of Endocrinology guidelines on the management of adrenal incidentalomas, Newell-Price J has contributed valuable insights and expertise to the field.</data>
      <data key="d2">28bca03cd2152cf2562d7aa16d7ced1d,8fe4d0101ea7a6ddaefd71c963d9ecc7,b7b162b783ea688c5fe9b7f531b46aaf</data>
