    </node>
    <node id="SAHDEV A">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Sahdev A is a notable contributor to the European Society of Endocrinology guidelines concerning adrenal incidentalomas. He has played a significant role in the development of management guidelines for these conditions, demonstrating his involvement in the field of clinical endocrinology. As an author of the European Society of Endocrinology guidelines on the management of adrenal incidentalomas, Sahdev A's expertise and contributions are integral to the understanding and treatment of this area in endocrinology.</data>
      <data key="d2">28bca03cd2152cf2562d7aa16d7ced1d,8fe4d0101ea7a6ddaefd71c963d9ecc7,b7b162b783ea688c5fe9b7f531b46aaf</data>
