      <data key="d7">fe5069a833e743eb929147c7dab1dd95</data>
    </node>
    <node id="ENDOCRINOLOGY CONSULTATION">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">An endocrinology consultation was conducted for a 34-year-old patient referred for evaluation of bilateral gynecomastia.</data>
      <data key="d2">592d424edaa447a54ab4489d82495db6</data>
      <data key="d3">1298</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">3</data>
      <data key="d6">5474</data>
      <data key="d7">d6efa70d99aa4cba89c3e662564a463f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="MUSCLE FATIGUE">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Muscle fatigue is a significant symptom reported by the patient, indicating increasing difficulty in physical activities.</data>
      <data key="d2">592d424edaa447a54ab4489d82495db6</data>
      <data key="d3">1298</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">2</data>
      <data key="d6">5475</data>
      <data key="d7">27a73e6598e24c85b0b1e14fa754f43c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="HORMONAL STUDY">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">A hormonal study was requested to evaluate the patient's hormone levels, including FSH, LH, and testosterone.</data>
      <data key="d2">592d424edaa447a54ab4489d82495db6</data>
      <data key="d3">1298</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">5</data>
      <data key="d6">5476</data>
      <data key="d7">ef4cf4dd66504c8f99c937f4c1ab2bf1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="NEUROLOGY REFERRAL">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">The patient was referred to neurology for further study based on the findings from the endocrinology consultation.</data>
      <data key="d2">592d424edaa447a54ab4489d82495db6</data>
      <data key="d3">1298</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">5477</data>
      <data key="d7">03a9dd479e4d41e4b972606c59109da4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="TUMORES TESTICULARES">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Tumores testiculares son una categor&#237;a de c&#225;ncer que afecta a los test&#237;culos, incluyendo seminomas y no seminomas, y son responsables de la mayor&#237;a de los casos de c&#225;ncer testicular.</data>
      <data key="d2">4accb4afaddfdc671690221252ff1b99</data>
      <data key="d3">1296</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">5478</data>
      <data key="d7">ff1b3efb01624af9a33bac2c00997382</data>
    </node>
    <node id="S&#205;NDROME DE KENNEDY">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">El s&#237;ndrome de Kennedy es una enfermedad rara que afecta a varones, caracterizada por debilidad muscular progresiva y atrofia, causada por una mutaci&#243;n gen&#233;tica en el receptor androg&#233;nico.</data>
      <data key="d2">4accb4afaddfdc671690221252ff1b99</data>
      <data key="d3">1296</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">2</data>
      <data key="d6">5479</data>
      <data key="d7">de5511f9b4304e13b751526ff7d82f99</data>
    </node>
    <node id="C&#201;LULAS DE SERTOLI">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Las c&#233;lulas de Sertoli son c&#233;lulas en los test&#237;culos que apoyan la producci&#243;n de esperma, estimuladas por la FSH.</data>
      <data key="d2">4accb4afaddfdc671690221252ff1b99</data>
      <data key="d3">1296</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">3</data>
      <data key="d6">5480</data>
      <data key="d7">b509a701f3544e3b8b106b517708c356</data>
    </node>
    <node id="CAG">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">La tripleta CAG es una secuencia gen&#233;tica que se expande en el s&#237;ndrome de Kennedy, causando la enfermedad a trav&#233;s de la mutaci&#243;n en el receptor androg&#233;nico.</data>
      <data key="d2">4accb4afaddfdc671690221252ff1b99</data>
      <data key="d3">1296</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">5481</data>
      <data key="d7">7abc900ff30342d3bb81a4cd75c66237</data>
    </node>
    <node id="VIH">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">VIH (HIV) is a virus that can lead to various health complications in infected individuals, including endocrine and metabolic disorders. Additionally, VIH (HIV) is an infection that may result in the development of Syndrome of Inappropriate Antidiuretic Hormone secretion (SIADH) and can influence the response to treatment.</data>
      <data key="d2">4beab004731d7baff10fd2796a523b55,69844236241841a2f03d6419e0916966</data>
      <data key="d3">1356</data>
