    <node id="NURIA VALDES GALLEGO">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Nuria Valdes Gallego is a specialist in Endocrinology and Nutrition, with a degree in Biochemistry and a doctorate in Medicine. She is the head of the Endocrinology and Nutrition Section at the University Hospital of Cabue&#241;es in Gij&#243;n and an associate professor at the University of Oviedo.</data>
      <data key="d2">cc9543ac7abe58ae289e1fbd5353e219</data>
