      <data key="d7">1105aa3b67ce43988e9d7aea5d22eb51</data>
    </node>
    <node id="SILVERBERG">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Silverberg is a distinguished medical expert and researcher recognized for his contributions to the field of endocrinology, particularly in the management of primary hyperparathyroidism and its associated complications. He has published significant works that enhance the understanding of this condition. Additionally, Silverberg is known for his research on hypercalcemia of malignancy, focusing on its mechanisms and implications. His expertise in these areas underscores his important role in advancing medical knowledge and treatment strategies related to calcium metabolism disorders.</data>
      <data key="d2">74c9662af46dca03f3941e133df2e783,ba0a1fee09e488cf2628102b72a52435</data>
      <data key="d3">1284</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
