    </node>
    <node id="RATIO DE HAZARD">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Hazard ratio is a measure used in epidemiological studies to compare the risk of a certain event occurring in two groups, often used to assess the impact of obesity on health outcomes.</data>
