    <node id="MANTZOROS CS">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Mantzoros CS is an author known for his research on the health implications of obesity. He has conducted studies that discuss the relationship between obesity and cancer risk, as well as exploring the connection between obesity and non-alcoholic fatty liver disease. Through his work, Mantzoros CS contributes to the understanding of how obesity can influence various health conditions.</data>
