      <data key="d0" />
      <data key="d1">GASTROENTEROL HEPATOL is a journal that focuses on the fields of Gastroenterology and Hepatology. It publishes research related to digestive health and liver diseases, contributing to the advancement of knowledge and understanding in these medical specialties.</data>
      <data key="d2">7e4178b0d21cc5424b4c54bc5de42471,dea403b707c5339329451aa7494d9ca5</data>
