    </node>
    <node id="PACKER M">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Packer M is an author and researcher who has investigated the relationship between obesity and atrial fibrillation. His work has contributed to studies examining the impact of obesity and inflammation on the myocardium, highlighting the significant connections between these health issues and their effects on heart rhythm disorders.</data>
      <data key="d2">884a8370915a18a005fb2fa913e4b95c,ea79efb65695c260a301f5c42237e2cb</data>
      <data key="d3">1397</data>
