    <node id="WORLD CANCER RESEARCH FUND">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The World Cancer Research Fund (WCRF) is an organization dedicated to cancer prevention, emphasizing the importance of diet and lifestyle factors, including obesity. It conducts research to understand how these elements influence cancer risk and promotes awareness of the role that diet and physical activity play in reducing the likelihood of developing cancer. Through its efforts, the WCRF aims to provide valuable insights and guidance for healthier living to help prevent cancer.</data>
