    <node id="CANCER PREVENTION-II">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Cancer Prevention-II is a study that investigates the relationship between obesity and cancer mortality rates. It aims to examine how obesity may influence the likelihood of cancer-related deaths, providing valuable insights into the potential impact of weight management on cancer outcomes.</data>
