    <node id="ENDOMETRIUM">
      <data key="d0">GEO</data>
      <data key="d1">The endometrium is the inner lining of the uterus, playing a crucial role in the reproductive system. It is important to note that obesity is a significant risk factor for endometrial cancer, highlighting the health implications associated with the condition of the endometrium.</data>
      <data key="d2">b110392fc91bc3d7875124ec3fa07c46,ea79efb65695c260a301f5c42237e2cb</data>
