      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Bupropion-naltrexone is a combination pharmacotherapy used for weight loss, particularly effective in patients with appetite control issues.</data>
      <data key="d2">7eea8ed505de441028811dbb848d0fa0</data>
