      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Proopiomelanocortina (POMC) is a precursor protein that is involved in the production of several hormones that regulate appetite.</data>
      <data key="d2">7eea8ed505de441028811dbb848d0fa0</data>
