    <node id="NALTREXONE">
      <data key="d0" />
      <data key="d1">Naltrexone is a medication that functions by blocking opioid receptors in the body. It is primarily used in combination with bupropion, a medication that is also associated with weight loss. Research has focused on the effects of this combination on weight loss and its potential benefits in addressing obesity-related risk factors.</data>
      <data key="d2">3eddab8e3e55bbd7e6cbcd3776fecb29,488970234520652b063db88e8346031c,7eea8ed505de441028811dbb848d0fa0</data>
