    <node id="NIFEDIPINO">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Nifedipino is a calcium antagonist primarily used to treat high blood pressure and angina. It is also utilized in cases of late dumping syndrome, although its effectiveness can vary among individuals.</data>
