    </node>
    <node id="LOW-CARBOHYDRATE DIET">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">A low-carbohydrate diet is a dietary plan that limits carbohydrate intake, aimed at weight loss and managing blood sugar levels.</data>
      <data key="d2">7855ffa74481ba85f44e9700279250e7</data>
      <data key="d3">738</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">5960</data>
      <data key="d7">346866b59faf4b0bbb1bbc8d97fbb0b2</data>
    </node>
    <node id="BARIATRIC SURGERY">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Bariatric surgery is a medical procedure designed for weight loss through various surgical techniques that modify the digestive system. This includes methods such as gastrectomy and bypass surgery. It is primarily recommended for individuals suffering from obesity and related health issues, including Type 2 diabetes, as it aims to achieve significant weight loss and improve metabolic health. 

The procedure is recognized as the most effective treatment for patients with morbid obesity, leading to various physiological changes, including hormonal alterations and modifications in intestinal microbiota that contribute to weight loss. However, bariatric surgery also necessitates specific dietary adjustments post-operation and is associated with potential complications and nutritional issues. 

Furthermore, bariatric surgery is linked to various health outcomes, including impacts on cardiovascular disease and mortality rates among patients with obesity. It is often discussed in the context of Enhanced Recovery After Surgery (ERAS) protocols, which are designed to enhance recovery and minimize complications following the procedure. Overall, bariatric surgery encompasses a range of surgical interventions aimed at facilitating weight loss and improving overall health in individuals with obesity.</data>
      <data key="d2">5236affa95aaf73b0f2d08e839e4db54,58db9fa69ca87ec24d7117fea6f2fe88,6517add809ee588bede013f59f20b0ef,7855ffa74481ba85f44e9700279250e7,79afec9f55a4cb9aa31a7e4566dae279,8ad412c188e4086d686c217c6c5c5324,959173b0e9d9c5ea2edabff579240462,980d6217f6ec073bf1673f14542ebbf0,a3e3a651e24883d279405241439b58bc,ae99604da4e0a7da3a6e99e197205ab5,b0a60df651e774a77b1969babdf3b21a,db39b776f49b9fad2deb1dec7a0d3288,e566fac3f3e2e113b66424e3e0412ab3,e5b6965b2fc3b73112c8bd3bdb58738f,fab4b91ddb77bd16a93a3808a9c12b4c</data>
