    <node id="DAVIES MJ">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Davies MJ is a prominent researcher and co-author involved in multiple studies related to type 2 diabetes. They have contributed to the evaluation of semaglutide, a medication used for managing this condition. Additionally, Davies MJ played a significant role in the SCALE Diabetes randomized clinical trial, which focused on assessing the efficacy of liraglutide for weight loss in patients with type 2 diabetes. Furthermore, Davies MJ has conducted a systematic review and meta-analysis examining the relationship between fruit and vegetable intake and type 2 diabetes, highlighting their commitment to advancing research in this field.</data>
      <data key="d2">3af2658fd59065a71bfee00d2bd27b1b,3eddab8e3e55bbd7e6cbcd3776fecb29,8d2d57471630a504ffa4a39c259d9b18</data>
