    <node id="PRATLEY RE">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Pratley RE is a researcher who has made significant contributions to the field of diabetes treatment, particularly focusing on type 2 diabetes mellitus in older adults. Additionally, Pratley RE is one of the authors involved in the SUSTAIN trials, which compare the efficacy of semaglutide and dulaglutide, two medications used in the management of this condition. Through these efforts, Pratley RE has played a vital role in advancing the understanding and treatment options for diabetes in the aging population.</data>
      <data key="d2">8d2d57471630a504ffa4a39c259d9b18,cd2217af0cd2e70226661f038043911b</data>
