    <node id="COLDITZ GA">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Colditz GA is a prominent researcher recognized for his contributions to the fields of bariatric surgery, nutritional factors, and dietary patterns. He is a co-author of an updated systematic review that evaluates the effectiveness and risks associated with bariatric surgery. Additionally, Colditz GA has conducted studies focusing on the relationship between nutritional factors and hypertension, as well as exploring various dietary patterns and their implications for health. His work encompasses a broad range of topics related to nutrition and its impact on health outcomes.</data>
      <data key="d2">63593ac5546e44eaddb37a2f257bfa80,8d2d57471630a504ffa4a39c259d9b18,b49f181ca7099fc110f35ccc27e7fafc</data>
      <data key="d5">0</data>
