    <node id="OBESITY SURGERY">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Obesity Surgery is a medical journal that focuses on the publication of multiple studies related to bariatric surgery techniques and their outcomes. The term "obesity surgery" encompasses a range of surgical procedures designed for weight loss, including various techniques such as gastric bypass. This field of medicine aims to provide effective solutions for individuals struggling with obesity through surgical interventions.</data>
