      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The Hospital Cl&#237;nico Universitario Lozano Blesa is a clinical hospital located in Zaragoza, Spain, known for providing a range of medical services and engaging in research activities. Dr. Julia Oc&#243;n Bret&#243;n serves as the head of the Clinical Nutrition and Dietetics Unit at this institution. Additionally, Francisco Javier Escalada San Mart&#237;n was associated with the hospital, working there from 2005 to 2007.</data>
