    </node>
    <node id="CARDONA F">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Cardona F is recognized as one of the authors of the "Manual de Endocrinolog&#237;a y Nutrici&#243;n," a significant contribution to the fields of endocrinology and nutrition. This manual was published by the Sociedad Espa&#241;ola de Endocrinolog&#237;a y Nutrici&#243;n, highlighting Cardona F's involvement in advancing knowledge in these areas. Additionally, Cardona F is referenced in the manual, further establishing their role and expertise in the subject matter.</data>
      <data key="d2">2729f43dc666433fb3fabad498b99f91,c3a9acd26c8b8bbe2144d4fe53046439,e0db2f1e2ec0f05e24ec079563d8952a</data>
