    </node>
    <node id="ALCAIDE J">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Alcaide J is a co-author of the "Manual de Endocrinolog&#237;a y Nutrici&#243;n," which is published by the Sociedad Espa&#241;ola de Endocrinolog&#237;a y Nutrici&#243;n. This manual serves as a significant resource in the fields of endocrinology and nutrition, and Alcaide J is actively involved in research and the development of guidelines within these disciplines. Additionally, Alcaide J is recognized as one of the authors referenced in this important manual, highlighting their contribution to the literature on endocrinology and nutrition.</data>
      <data key="d2">2729f43dc666433fb3fabad498b99f91,c3a9acd26c8b8bbe2144d4fe53046439,e0db2f1e2ec0f05e24ec079563d8952a</data>
