    </node>
    <node id="FERN&#193;NDEZ GARC&#205;A JC">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Fern&#225;ndez Garc&#237;a JC is a notable contributor to the field of endocrinology and nutrition, recognized as one of the authors of the "Manual de Endocrinolog&#237;a y Nutrici&#243;n." This manual, published by the Sociedad Espa&#241;ola de Endocrinolog&#237;a y Nutrici&#243;n, showcases the expertise of Fern&#225;ndez Garc&#237;a JC alongside other contributors. His work is referenced within the manual, highlighting his significant role in advancing knowledge in this specialized area of medicine.</data>
      <data key="d2">2729f43dc666433fb3fabad498b99f91,c3a9acd26c8b8bbe2144d4fe53046439,e0db2f1e2ec0f05e24ec079563d8952a</data>
