    <node id="PEREA CASTILLA V">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Perea Castilla V is an author of the "Manual de Endocrinolog&#237;a y Nutrici&#243;n," a comprehensive guide that addresses various aspects of endocrinology and nutrition. This manual specifically includes discussions on the treatment of dyslipidemias, highlighting Perea Castilla V's contributions to the field.</data>
