    <node id="AMOR FERN&#193;NDEZ">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Amor Fern&#225;ndez is an author known for the "Manual de Endocrinolog&#237;a y Nutrici&#243;n," a significant work that addresses treatments for dyslipidemia and contributes to the broader field of endocrinology and nutrition. Through this manual, Fern&#225;ndez provides valuable insights and guidance on managing dyslipidemias, highlighting the importance of nutrition in endocrine health.</data>
      <data key="d2">746fad557197bebe72763efd23a9e0e2,916ad020bd9c528e55001071b4d9530b,9312fdfba5d3f79b95c5e6af38ced009</data>
      <data key="d3">1458</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">3</data>
      <data key="d6">6087</data>
      <data key="d7">b9a3c03823dd4659831a298713913f13</data>
    </node>
    <node id="VINAGRE TORRES">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Vinagre Torres is an author of the "Manual de Endocrinolog&#237;a y Nutrici&#243;n," where he has made significant contributions to the field of endocrinology and nutrition. Specifically, he has contributed to the chapter on dyslipidemias, which plays a crucial role in the treatment of dyslipidemia. Through his work, Vinagre Torres has enhanced the understanding and management of this important health issue.</data>
      <data key="d2">746fad557197bebe72763efd23a9e0e2,916ad020bd9c528e55001071b4d9530b,9312fdfba5d3f79b95c5e6af38ced009</data>
      <data key="d3">1458</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">3</data>
      <data key="d6">6088</data>
      <data key="d7">16c2015191564ea9877cae30fae8a719</data>
    </node>
    <node id="PEREA CASTILLA">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Perea Castilla is an accomplished author of the "Manual de Endocrinolog&#237;a y Nutrici&#243;n," which emphasizes the importance of endocrinology and nutrition in medical practice. Specifically, Perea Castilla focuses on the treatment of dyslipidemias, contributing valuable insights and knowledge to this area of study. Through this manual, Perea Castilla aims to enhance understanding and management of dyslipidemia, thereby advancing the field of endocrinology and nutrition.</data>
      <data key="d2">746fad557197bebe72763efd23a9e0e2,916ad020bd9c528e55001071b4d9530b,9312fdfba5d3f79b95c5e6af38ced009</data>
      <data key="d3">1456</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">3</data>
      <data key="d6">6089</data>
      <data key="d7">4137e170412e4615b0db7b32c1b7ae8d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="INFARTO DE MIOCARDIO">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Infarto de miocardio, or myocardial infarction, is a serious cardiovascular event that can occur due to high cholesterol levels.</data>
      <data key="d2">916ad020bd9c528e55001071b4d9530b</data>
      <data key="d3">493</data>
      <data key="d4">1</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">6090</data>
      <data key="d7">bfda4e3342cb4f0ebb2bd3b002615e90</data>
    </node>
    <node id="HOMBRE DE 34 A&#209;OS">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">A 34-year-old man referred for consultation due to persistently high LDL cholesterol levels.</data>
      <data key="d2">916ad020bd9c528e55001071b4d9530b</data>
      <data key="d3">493</data>
      <data key="d4">1</data>
      <data key="d5">4</data>
      <data key="d6">6091</data>
      <data key="d7">67c6bcea508d468ca6cf9bb353066a06</data>
    </node>
