    <node id="MART&#205;N CUESTA HERN&#193;NDEZ">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Mart&#237;n Cuesta Hern&#225;ndez is a licensed physician and endocrinologist with a specialization in diabetes and new technologies. He has a robust background in both research and clinical practice, having worked in Madrid and Dublin. Currently, he serves as an attending physician in the Endocrinology and Nutrition Service at Hospital Cl&#237;nico San Carlos in Madrid.</data>
      <data key="d2">75a4b2d504de480eaef247aa682bfd05,b7465350e74a3bada96615deb0d7b031</data>
