    </node>
    <node id="GSK3&#914;">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Glycogen synthase kinase 3 beta (GSK3&#946;) is an enzyme involved in cellular signaling pathways that can be inhibited by lithium, affecting aquaporin-2 function.</data>
      <data key="d2">1fb4c8ba1bc908ea3a3c7717a073fa4f</data>
