    <node id="WONG ET">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Wong ET is a researcher and author who conducted a study on the prevalence of hypomagnesemia and hypermagnesemia in hospitalized patients. In their research, Wong ET reported a high prevalence of both conditions among this patient population, highlighting the significance of monitoring magnesium levels in clinical settings.</data>
      <data key="d2">5bb504bf68288cc0ba6a8f0dd9e4c245,b9342cecd69cdc0e9936df041657f5f5</data>
