    <node id="ACUTE PANCREATITIS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Acute pancreatitis is a sudden inflammatory condition of the pancreas characterized by severe abdominal pain, necessitating immediate medical attention. This condition can also result in complications such as low intracellular magnesium levels and hypocalcemia, highlighting the potential systemic effects of the inflammation.</data>
      <data key="d2">a3d355dd6da93691c892691f873338aa,b9342cecd69cdc0e9936df041657f5f5</data>
