    <node id="ESTEVE">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">ESTEVE is a pharmaceutical company that appears to be involved in the educational program related to endocrinology and nutrition.</data>
      <data key="d2">1485a96a60386bca4d8facc2ccedbb22</data>
      <data key="d3">1486</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">3</data>
      <data key="d6">6314</data>
      <data key="d7">03dcd5c972cf40fe8b7516d73e516bde</data>
    </node>
    <node id="JANUARY 2020">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">January 2020 is the date associated with the publication or content related to the educational program by ESTEVE.</data>
      <data key="d2">1485a96a60386bca4d8facc2ccedbb22</data>
      <data key="d5">0</data>
      <data key="d6">6315</data>
      <data key="d7">bf0408e5987d40a892566ccb3faed8ce</data>
    </node>
    <node id="THYROID GLAND">
      <data key="d0">GEO</data>
      <data key="d1">The thyroid gland is an endocrine gland that is illustrated in the graphic design element, representing its significance in endocrinology.</data>
      <data key="d2">1485a96a60386bca4d8facc2ccedbb22</data>
      <data key="d3">1486</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">2</data>
      <data key="d6">6316</data>
      <data key="d7">a7395eade4994d9e8a992efce272ef26</data>
    </node>
    <node id="RED SPHERES">
      <data key="d0">GEO</data>
      <data key="d1">The red spheres in the graphic design may symbolize molecular structures, relevant to the field of endocrinology.</data>
      <data key="d2">1485a96a60386bca4d8facc2ccedbb22</data>
      <data key="d5">0</data>
      <data key="d6">6317</data>
      <data key="d7">63b8db2e4c96408686a3cee82e0e9ec1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="GRAPHIC DESIGN ELEMENT">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">The graphic design element features red spheres and molecular structures, possibly representing concepts in endocrinology and nutrition.</data>
      <data key="d2">1485a96a60386bca4d8facc2ccedbb22</data>
      <data key="d3">1486</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">6318</data>
      <data key="d7">eb833d07c2c44e95bdcf25932b286057</data>
    </node>
    <node id="M&#193;LAGA">
      <data key="d0">GEO</data>
      <data key="d1">M&#225;laga is a city and province in Spain. The city is notable for being the location where the document titled '3-minivademecum-nutricional' was created in 2020 by Dr. Almeida. Additionally, the province of M&#225;laga encompasses various municipalities, including Pizarra.</data>
      <data key="d2">bd228b54354e751399b62683662e2b56,dbfd111867924ed831f05d8fff01888b,f9951c9666473dd8daea6c3f2bcf9a8e</data>
      <data key="d3">1684</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">4</data>
      <data key="d6">6319</data>
      <data key="d7">a20476cdab954d6ca3837212949ca527</data>
    </node>
    <node id="DR ALMEIDA">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Dr. Almeida is the author of the document '3-minivademecum-nutricional' created in M&#225;laga in 2020.</data>
      <data key="d2">bd228b54354e751399b62683662e2b56</data>
      <data key="d3">1684</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">3</data>
      <data key="d6">6320</data>
      <data key="d7">16319433b2be4d158f78fcba2f4b562c</data>
    </node>
