      <data key="d1">Dr. Miguel Le&#243;n Sanz is a distinguished medical professional specializing in oncology nutrition and endocrinology. He serves as the head of the endocrinology and nutrition service at Hospital Universitario 12 de Octubre in Madrid. In addition to his clinical responsibilities, Dr. Le&#243;n Sanz is also an author and contributor to the medical field, actively engaging in research and advancements related to nutrition in oncology. His expertise encompasses both the nutritional aspects of cancer care and the broader field of endocrinology.</data>
