      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The Sociedad Espa&#241;ola de Nutrici&#243;n Cl&#237;nica y Metabolismo (SENPE) is an organization focused on improving clinical nutrition and metabolism practices in Spain.</data>
