      <data key="d6">6405</data>
      <data key="d7">145f27b989bb4a85bc7e2ca8a99370dc</data>
    </node>
    <node id="IDF">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The International Diabetes Federation (IDF) is an organization dedicated to providing data and advocacy related to diabetes on a global scale. It plays a crucial role in raising awareness and promoting education about diabetes through its various initiatives. One of its key contributions is the publication of the Atlas of Diabetes, which offers comprehensive global epidemiological data on the prevalence and impact of diabetes worldwide. Through these efforts, the IDF aims to improve the understanding of diabetes and support efforts to combat this growing health issue.</data>
      <data key="d2">d2e2009d967ecd49af312dba4e2ed4fd,dec6b3fc008edd47758cfc00106d077b</data>
      <data key="d3">1372</data>
