    <node id="POBLACI&#211;N">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Poblaci&#243;n refers to a group of individuals that are the subject of study in research, particularly in cross-sectional studies. In the context of Castilla y Le&#243;n, the term specifically pertains to the general public, with a focus on those affected by diabetes and its related health issues. This dual perspective highlights the importance of understanding both the broader demographic and the specific health challenges faced by certain segments of the population.</data>
      <data key="d2">cf8a6f1b6d59546ed7bd297d032f6b30,fc8df7c3d7a0d2286c55493077ed3937</data>
