    <node id="ALEJANDRO SANZ PAR&#205;S">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Alejandro Sanz Par&#237;s is a distinguished medical professional serving as the Head of the Endocrinology and Nutrition Section at Hospital Universitario Miguel Servet in Zaragoza. He specializes in nutrition and dietetics, with a particular focus on diabetes care. In addition to his role as head of the Endocrinology and Nutrition Section, Dr. Sanz Par&#237;s also holds the position of technical director and leads the Clinical Nutrition and Dietetics Unit at the same hospital. His expertise and leadership contribute significantly to the management and treatment of nutritional and dietary needs in patients.</data>
      <data key="d2">4216916ebab948061d2dca4afe7e1e84,a549bdc3929c5dd7a613c6900a0fe90e,e00575eedbd6807f0778df41cf8b10b8</data>
