    <node id="OLVEIRA ET AL.">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Olveira et al. conducted a study in Spain that focused on two main aspects related to hospitalized patients, particularly those with diabetes. The first aspect of their research observed the prevalence of enteral nutrition among these patients, highlighting its significance in their care. Additionally, the study examined the costs associated with diabetes care in hospitalized patients, providing insights into the financial implications of managing diabetes in a hospital setting. Through their comprehensive analysis, Olveira et al. contributed valuable information to the understanding of nutritional and economic factors affecting diabetes care in Spain.</data>
      <data key="d2">1ba0aa1d1330351a62eb6319ffdd30db,a549bdc3929c5dd7a613c6900a0fe90e</data>
      <data key="d3">1686</data>
