    <node id="DIABETES RESEARCH AND CLINICAL PRACTICE">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Diabetes Research and Clinical Practice is a journal dedicated to publishing research and studies focused on diabetes management and treatment. It serves as a platform for disseminating findings related to various aspects of diabetes, including innovative management strategies and clinical research.</data>
      <data key="d2">cd2217af0cd2e70226661f038043911b,d52ef4e5955918a8a47b697fcdb4096f</data>
