    <node id="NUTRITION HOSPITAL">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">NUTRITION HOSPITAL is a journal dedicated to the field of nutrition, emphasizing its critical role in health and disease management. The journal covers a wide range of topics within clinical nutrition and dietetics, offering recommendations and research studies that pertain to nutritional support. It particularly focuses on nutritional practices and interventions in clinical settings, with a special emphasis on patients with eating disorders. Additionally, NUTRITION HOSPITAL publishes research on the dietary impacts on health, including studies related to parenteral nutrition and the nutritional aspects of diabetes management in hospitalized patients. Overall, the journal serves as a vital resource for understanding the implications of nutrition in various clinical contexts.</data>
      <data key="d2">0692eb750371d46b9fff71ec305df6ce,42b1be887a83da3e796a9cec7a082b11,64378df2be6b08b39bd652c0a2d3789c,d52ef4e5955918a8a47b697fcdb4096f,dbdb3cd3b9065e8846fd2eb15b9d5879,f2b8b21255397ebbaf2b5d66ff6bde88</data>
