    <node id="CIBERDEM">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">CIBERDEM, officially known as the Centro de Investigaci&#243;n Biom&#233;dica en Red de Diabetes y Enfermedades Metab&#243;licas Asociadas, is a prominent biomedical research center dedicated to the study of diabetes and associated metabolic diseases. This center has conducted significant research, including a study on the incidence of diabetes in Spain, highlighting its commitment to understanding and addressing the challenges posed by these health issues. CIBERDEM plays a crucial role in advancing knowledge and developing solutions related to diabetes and its related conditions.</data>
