    <node id="VOMITOS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">VOMITOS refers to episodes of vomiting that can manifest in various medical contexts. In children, v&#243;mitos can be a symptom associated with classic celiac disease. Additionally, in patients with hyponatremia, v&#243;mitos are categorized as moderate neurological symptoms, indicating a potential underlying issue that may require medical attention. Furthermore, episodes of v&#243;mitos can significantly impact a patient's treatment compliance, suggesting that managing this symptom is crucial for effective healthcare outcomes.</data>
      <data key="d2">68c55f61003b7c0a490a0ee3bc97fcf2,e279d3a0da085b47528c08f486afe0a5,e4b62c2ae5857a5dd11f609286271bb4</data>
