    <node id="GASTRITIS ATR&#211;FICA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Gastritis atr&#243;fica is a medical condition characterized by inflammation and thinning of the stomach lining. This condition can lead to impaired absorption of essential nutrients, including iron. The diagnosis of gastritis atr&#243;fica indicates that the patient is experiencing these inflammatory changes in the stomach lining, which may have significant implications for their overall health and nutritional status.</data>
      <data key="d2">6595cec039fe5a2c290eea9ab7e3b2fc,e279d3a0da085b47528c08f486afe0a5</data>
