    <node id="HOSPITAL UNIVERSITARIO REINA SOF&#205;A">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Hospital Universitario Reina Sof&#237;a is a medical institution located in C&#243;rdoba, Spain. It serves as a clinical management unit that specializes in endocrinology and nutrition. Additionally, the hospital is involved in the treatment of oncology patients, providing a range of healthcare services to meet the needs of its community.</data>
      <data key="d2">5e934738b2a8cb03468f4ebf4eec0cd2,7852af9e2886d0d889fbc056d0a75f21,e70fa2e099766154321f13c0112d436a</data>
