    <node id="HIPERLIPEMIA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">HIPERLIPEMIA is a medical condition characterized by elevated levels of lipids in the blood. This condition is significant as it can increase the risk of cardiovascular diseases. Additionally, hyperlipemia may also be a symptom associated with certain types of glucogenosis. The patient mentioned in the context has a history of this condition, indicating its relevance to her personal medical background.</data>
      <data key="d2">39ea441f219d949e8bc3c6f430970689,73896da11a9ec209fb3e5b61f19f81df,b92f47a5ea6a962826cedb992b832f70,eb8877823f796fc9a02f5103dc4650cc</data>
      <data key="d3">1399</data>
