      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">6643</data>
      <data key="d7">25880d47c3c94ec3a056cb32dc10d190</data>
    </node>
    <node id="DRENAJE">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">DRENAJE refers to the process of removing excess fluid from the body, which can include lymphatic fluid in conditions such as chylothorax or chylous ascites, in order to alleviate symptoms. In a specific case, drainage was performed on a patient to manage the dirty output following bariatric surgery. This procedure is essential for addressing complications that may arise postoperatively, ensuring the patient's recovery and comfort.</data>
      <data key="d2">67f96f3e5c366f82de31f1bf189aa71f,b55a8ca77c67f4c18eea7abe52c3d2f9</data>
      <data key="d3">1798</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">3</data>
      <data key="d6">6644</data>
      <data key="d7">eaa6556dd12848eabe1fb2dafd09b061</data>
    </node>
    <node id="FEDERACI&#211;N INTERNACIONAL DE DIABETES">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The Federaci&#243;n Internacional de Diabetes (IDF) is an organization dedicated to establishing guidelines and recommendations for the treatment of diabetes. It plays a crucial role in providing guidance on various aspects of diabetes management, including the consideration of metabolic surgery for patients suffering from morbid obesity. Through its efforts, the IDF aims to improve the care and outcomes for individuals affected by diabetes worldwide.</data>
      <data key="d2">445e6aeaae0e8edb3faf2d36be2073ce,efe29025266e1689abb9b0a2783e5ea3</data>
      <data key="d3">1366</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">2</data>
      <data key="d6">6645</data>
      <data key="d7">91af270c79044259bfa734b5e2c8add6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="CONTROL GLUC&#201;MICO">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Control Gluc&#233;mico is the process of managing blood glucose levels in individuals with diabetes, which is a crucial aspect of their treatment. This management involves dietary adjustments and the administration of insulin to effectively regulate blood glucose levels. Throughout the treatment, maintaining appropriate control gluc&#233;mico is essential for the patient's health, ensuring that their blood glucose levels remain stable. In particular, it has been noted that the control gluc&#233;mico was adequate during treatment with NET (Nutritional Enteral Therapy) and NPT (Nutritional Parenteral Therapy), highlighting the importance of continuous monitoring and management of glucose levels in diabetic patients.</data>
      <data key="d2">17b7995dcf275c50629c7e3d4723882e,4681f41ebd69a732f7a8be6c2ed0f51a,abf638322cfb1c522bfbee1852e28a19,efe29025266e1689abb9b0a2783e5ea3</data>
      <data key="d3">1080</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">6646</data>
      <data key="d7">db55505db1e64b60bce06e44c81637e3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="TRATAMIENTO M&#201;DICO INTENSIVO">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">El tratamiento m&#233;dico intensivo se refiere a las intervenciones m&#233;dicas que se aplican a la paciente para el control de la diabetes tipo 2, complementando la cirug&#237;a bari&#225;trica.</data>
      <data key="d2">efe29025266e1689abb9b0a2783e5ea3</data>
      <data key="d3">1371</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">6647</data>
      <data key="d7">f5bd907bd5cd4b77903af8577db21e62</data>
    </node>
    <node id="ESTUDIO STAMPEDE">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">El estudio STAMPEDE es una investigaci&#243;n que demuestra la efectividad de la cirug&#237;a bari&#225;trica en el control gluc&#233;mico en pacientes obesos con diabetes tipo 2.</data>
      <data key="d2">efe29025266e1689abb9b0a2783e5ea3</data>
      <data key="d3">1371</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">6648</data>
      <data key="d7">699f22a6df794da3af6f2c4da31bba29</data>
    </node>
    <node id="ASOCIACI&#211;N AMERICANA DE DIABETES">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The Asociaci&#243;n Americana de Diabetes (ADA) provides recommendations for diabetes management, including the possibility of surgery for certain patients.</data>
      <data key="d2">445e6aeaae0e8edb3faf2d36be2073ce</data>
      <data key="d3">1366</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
