    <node id="TRASPLANTE DE C&#201;LULAS HEMATOPI&#201;TICAS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Hematopoietic cell transplantation, also known as stem cell transplantation, is a medical procedure designed to restore blood cell production in patients suffering from specific diseases. This treatment involves the transplantation of hematopoietic stem cells, which are crucial for generating blood cells. Although hematopoietic stem cell transplantation was considered as a treatment option for the patient, it was ultimately rejected.</data>
      <data key="d2">27c75984e62c5adcac1ac33cbdc520dc,763c8ac63b4c91616bcea6f1f4aa38c9</data>
