      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Dr. Mercedes V&#225;zquez Guti&#233;rrez is a specialist in endocrinology and nutrition at the Hospital Universitario de Torrec&#225;rdenas in Almer&#237;a. She is actively involved in providing nutritional support for renal patients, demonstrating her expertise in both endocrinology and nutrition within the healthcare setting.</data>
