    <node id="VAR&#211;N">
      <data key="d0" />
      <data key="d1">VAR&#211;N is a 75-year-old male individual who has been admitted due to an ischemic stroke. He weighs 70 kg and has a height of 1.67 m. His energy expenditure is calculated using specific formulas, and he requires enteral nutrition to support his recovery.</data>
      <data key="d2">148443357888793655b663333268775a,3356667d6f35de6a8587ece00f8c6580,4b0e0d4e1d3067bf7e0e850063a43d21,a633c156fb0077e3f669d8eb258be944</data>
