    <node id="LASSEN K">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Lassen K is a notable contributor in the field of perioperative care, particularly in colorectal surgery and pancreaticoduodenectomy. They have played a significant role in the consensus review of optimal perioperative care practices for colorectal surgery. Additionally, Lassen K has contributed to the development of guidelines for perioperative care in pancreaticoduodenectomy, specifically as an author for the guidelines established by the ERAS Society. Their research and contributions are instrumental in enhancing the standards of care in these surgical areas.</data>
