    <node id="BRAUNSCHWEIG C">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Braunschweig C is a researcher who has made significant contributions to the field of clinical guidelines, particularly in the management of hyperglycemia. Additionally, Braunschweig C is one of the authors involved in developing guidelines for nutrition support therapy in critically ill patients. Furthermore, Braunschweig C has also contributed to discussions regarding treatment outcomes comparing early enteral nutrition to early parenteral nutrition. Through these efforts, Braunschweig C has played a vital role in advancing knowledge and practices related to nutrition and metabolic management in clinical settings.</data>
