      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The Universidad de Valladolid is a prominent higher education institution located in Spain, known for its comprehensive research and educational programs across various fields, particularly in medicine and nutrition. The university is recognized for its significant contributions to research in endocrinology and nutrition. Notably, Prof. Dr. Daniel de Luis Rom&#225;n serves as a professor of Endocrinology and Nutrition at this esteemed institution, further enhancing its reputation in these specialized areas of study.</data>
      <data key="d2">2206bb4d5efe2dcf644ee48468ea112c,488affd4bfc1b1b4b9f5b6a054c97d80,7949b821c1ca2e4adc524e7775626396</data>
