    </node>
    <node id="UTCA">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">UTCA, or Unidad de Trastornos de la Conducta Alimentaria, is a specialized healthcare facility dedicated to the treatment of eating disorders. It offers comprehensive care that addresses both nutritional and psychological issues faced by patients. The unit operates through a collaborative approach, integrating the expertise of various disciplines, including Psychiatry, Psychology, and Endocrinology, to provide holistic treatment tailored to the needs of individuals struggling with these disorders.</data>
      <data key="d2">1033f1626ca6ac2b3bab298805a17aec,933d6526b2d313c95c9f4aaa950a62a3</data>
      <data key="d3">1080</data>
