    <node id="DIGESTIVO">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The DIGESTIVO service is dedicated to managing patients with gastrointestinal disorders, particularly those related to nutrition. This service is consulted for the endoscopic placement of enteral feeding tubes for patients, ensuring that individuals with specific dietary needs receive appropriate nutritional support.</data>
      <data key="d2">4b4f297dec86d7f65e362ad688bbb28f,dbfd111867924ed831f05d8fff01888b</data>
