    <node id="RANSON">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">RANSON refers to a scoring system utilized to evaluate the severity of acute pancreatitis in patients. This system comprises a set of criteria that incorporates both clinical and laboratory findings, allowing healthcare professionals to assess the condition's seriousness effectively. The Ranson criteria are essential for guiding treatment decisions and predicting patient outcomes in cases of acute pancreatitis.</data>
      <data key="d2">178140d0d29364593546d7d21393f2c6,4b4f297dec86d7f65e362ad688bbb28f</data>
      <data key="d3">1080</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">2</data>
      <data key="d6">6840</data>
      <data key="d7">e371e4282d0048fdb8b43050c33c2ea0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="APACHE II">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">APACHE II is a severity scoring system designed to evaluate the prognosis of critically ill patients, including those suffering from acute pancreatitis. This scoring system measures the severity of illness in patients, providing a quantitative assessment that helps in determining the risk of complications. Specifically, a score of 10 or higher on the APACHE II scale indicates an increased risk of adverse outcomes. The tool is widely utilized in clinical settings to guide treatment decisions and improve patient management for those in critical condition.</data>
      <data key="d2">178140d0d29364593546d7d21393f2c6,4b4f297dec86d7f65e362ad688bbb28f,5d4476c2c40af44f9d54628af0ac463d</data>
      <data key="d3">1178</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">3</data>
      <data key="d6">6841</data>
      <data key="d7">933ba4ccab134726a1c9e6ca08d71034</data>
    </node>
    <node id="SONDA DE ALIMENTACI&#211;N ENTERAL">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">La sonda de alimentaci&#243;n enteral es un dispositivo que se planea colocar para proporcionar nutrici&#243;n al paciente de manera directa al yeyuno.</data>
      <data key="d2">4b4f297dec86d7f65e362ad688bbb28f</data>
      <data key="d3">1080</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">6842</data>
