    </node>
    <node id="VANCOMICINA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Vancomicina is a broad-spectrum antibiotic that has been administered empirically to patients during their treatment. It has been shown to increase the abundance of Akkermansia muciniphila in rodents, indicating its potential effects on gut microbiota.</data>
      <data key="d2">15ac197b57d904b3bf72905c4d946c0d,7c10030e29c1434df3b10b1533710486</data>
      <data key="d3">1009</data>
