    <node id="DICKERSON RN">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Dickerson RN is an author known for contributions to research in the field of nutrition and metabolism. Specifically, Dickerson RN has focused on studying resting energy expenditure in patients with pancreatitis, providing valuable insights into the metabolic needs of this patient population. Additionally, Dickerson RN has conducted research on parenteral nutrition solutions, further enhancing the understanding of nutritional support for individuals unable to consume food orally.</data>
      <data key="d2">60d24674009cc67523f1ecdc63975fdc,6935432f69970131a6485f38e3f06003,719fff2d16bc334d3d4b53f070373a10,c84372864fd2ee7b7ed425b2d597efdb</data>
