    <node id="MCCLAVE SA">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">McClave SA is a prominent author recognized for significant contributions to the field of nutrition support, particularly in the context of acute pancreatitis. They conducted a systematic review on nutrition support in this condition and have published various works addressing the topic. Additionally, McClave SA played a vital role in the consensus recommendations from the North American Surgical Nutrition Summit, further establishing their expertise in surgical nutrition. Furthermore, McClave SA is one of the authors involved in developing guidelines for nutrition support therapy in critically ill patients, highlighting their commitment to improving nutritional care in critical settings.</data>
      <data key="d2">3f1d1c7c7c62b83f62f6fa31c25f65b2,6935432f69970131a6485f38e3f06003,c84372864fd2ee7b7ed425b2d597efdb,ceb66a898fed371e013171c43a87e1d1</data>
