    <node id="MARIK PE">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Marik PE is a researcher and author recognized for his significant contributions to the field of nutrition in acutely ill patients. He is particularly known for conducting systematic reviews on early enteral nutrition, which is crucial for the management of such patients. Additionally, Marik PE has authored a meta-analysis comparing parenteral and enteral nutrition specifically in cases of acute pancreatitis, further establishing his expertise in this area. His work includes multiple meta-analyses focused on nutrition strategies for patients suffering from acute pancreatitis, highlighting his commitment to improving clinical outcomes through evidence-based practices.</data>
      <data key="d2">3d5af63a33abe5094b25a96394f69969,6935432f69970131a6485f38e3f06003,c84372864fd2ee7b7ed425b2d597efdb</data>
