      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Abou-Assi S is an author known for his research on hypocaloric jejunal feeding in the context of acute pancreatitis. His work includes a comparative study of hypocaloric jejunal feeding versus total parenteral nutrition, contributing valuable insights into nutritional strategies for managing this condition. Through his studies, Abou-Assi S has focused on the implications and effectiveness of hypocaloric jejunal feeding as a therapeutic approach in acute pancreatitis.</data>
