      <data key="d1">O'Keefe SJ is an author who has conducted significant research in the field of nutrition, particularly focusing on its role in the management of acute pancreatitis. He has specifically investigated hypocaloric jejunal feeding as a therapeutic approach in acute pancreatitis and has also explored nutritional strategies for managing necrotizing pancreatitis. Through his work, O'Keefe SJ contributes valuable insights into the nutritional management of these serious gastrointestinal conditions.</data>
