    </node>
    <node id="NUTRITIONAL RESEARCH">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Nutritional research is a scientific field dedicated to studying dietary practices and their effects on health. It particularly emphasizes the impact of nutrition on various health conditions, including liver disease and acute pancreatitis. This area of research aims to understand how diet and nutrition influence overall health and the progression of diseases, thereby contributing to improved dietary recommendations and interventions for patients suffering from these conditions.</data>
      <data key="d2">6935432f69970131a6485f38e3f06003,c45c1688135653a80812cdaf426ec9a3</data>
      <data key="d5">0</data>
      <data key="d6">6933</data>
