    <node id="ICTUS ISQU&#201;MICO">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Ictus isqu&#233;mico refers to a type of stroke that occurs due to a blockage in blood flow to the brain. This interruption in circulation can result in potential brain damage, highlighting the critical nature of timely medical intervention in such cases.</data>
      <data key="d2">4b0e0d4e1d3067bf7e0e850063a43d21,ea7d8ba0550547d4cff0b5d18c3f6ae5</data>
