      <data key="d1">Gasometr&#237;a venosa is a medical test that measures the levels of gases in the blood, specifically assessing respiratory and metabolic function. This venous blood gas analysis is particularly useful for evaluating the acid-base balance and oxygenation in patients, including those with eating disorders.</data>
