      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">RADIOGRAF&#205;A DE T&#211;RAX refers to a chest X-ray that is utilized to visualize the lungs and heart, allowing for the evaluation of lung health and the detection of any abnormalities or complications. This imaging technique is particularly important in assessing conditions related to eating disorders, as it helps identify potential health issues that may arise in the lungs.</data>
