    <node id="NUTRITION ENTERAL">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Nutrition enteral (NE) is a method of providing nutrition directly to the gastrointestinal tract, which is particularly beneficial for patients who have undergone surgery or are suffering from burns. This approach involves delivering nutrition directly to the stomach or intestine through a tube, ensuring that the body receives essential nutrients efficiently. The physiological benefits of enteral nutrition make it a preferred choice in clinical settings, especially for patients recovering from surgical procedures or those with specific dietary needs.</data>
      <data key="d2">396dda5c9597828f0749f963f42142b4,7a6970183393c5ef1adc99851ef3eada,aeb399b3f90c6a50eed8adfa8a140451</data>
