    <node id="DIETA HIPERCAL&#211;RICA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">The "DIETA HIPERCAL&#211;RICA" refers to a hypercaloric diet, which is a high-calorie dietary regimen specifically designed to provide an increased energy intake. This type of diet is often preferred for patients who require volume restriction, making it suitable for individuals with specific health needs. Additionally, it is commonly utilized for patients experiencing malnutrition, as it aims to help them gain weight and improve their overall nutritional status.</data>
      <data key="d2">532561f62a972376f3f898b265623fc0,aeb399b3f90c6a50eed8adfa8a140451</data>
