      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The "Servicio de Cirug&#237;a" is a specialized unit within a hospital dedicated to conducting surgical procedures and providing postoperative care. This department is responsible for evaluating patients and performing various surgical interventions, including the gastrostomy procedure.</data>
