    <node id="RADIOLOG&#205;A INTERVENCIONISTA">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Radiolog&#237;a Intervencionista is a medical specialty that focuses on utilizing imaging techniques to guide minimally invasive surgical procedures. This specialty is often essential for various techniques, including gastrostomy and yeyunostomy. Within this context, the interventional radiology department has actively engaged in procedures such as the placement of a gastrostomy tube for patients, demonstrating its critical role in providing advanced medical care through minimally invasive methods.</data>
      <data key="d2">0b3eea4ed6da979f796aeba1ff2ee8d9,e7df0ed14559db764d393fb9411fec33</data>
