    </node>
    <node id="RETRASO DEL CRECIMIENTO">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">"RETRASO DEL CRECIMIENTO" refers to a condition indicating that the patient is not growing at the expected rate, which is often associated with underlying health issues. This growth delay is characterized by an individual not reaching expected growth milestones, and it is frequently observed in cases of metabolic disorders.</data>
      <data key="d2">a81765e6d24ccef0c86801f71673de98,c3975fe03d2af26b95b09795c7769e8b</data>
