    </node>
    <node id="CYSTIC FIBROSIS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Cystic Fibrosis is a genetic disorder that significantly impacts the lungs and digestive system, resulting in severe respiratory and nutritional challenges for patients. This condition necessitates specialized nutritional care to manage the associated complications effectively.</data>
      <data key="d2">1e997b2a6bf1c926a7a17d8b5ac1e699,39a32082aa23f1e71dc12d92750ca657,4eb41f33f9aba3b8ecd3906de91a1345,6d15ecf6cc2367b96e3ff917060f7f68,6f500b6f65f41f4fc89abcf53a4e409e,c3e74ddf9529482684f4b62e713df49b,cb63c034c676fa9dbbd8e5a07dd8c279,ea8be3e3b3d7195ddc85512be460b6f8,fea8c7e37cd76ac988e0b242cb84fe6f</data>
      <data key="d3">1042</data>
