      <data key="d1">Exploratory laparotomy is a surgical procedure conducted to investigate the underlying causes of a patient's abdominal problems. On March 25, 1998, an exploratory laparotomy was performed, which revealed the presence of neoplasia in the pancreas along with multiple nodules in the liver.</data>
