    <node id="ILEOSTOM&#205;A TERMINAL">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">A terminal ileostomy is a surgical procedure that involves creating an opening in the abdominal wall to allow waste to exit the body after the removal of part of the intestine. This procedure is typically performed on patients who experience complications that necessitate such an intervention.</data>
      <data key="d2">449d46789f604265753884e2d371ec8c,bc381304b682e075c7356c6edbfb0c2d</data>
