    <node id="YEYUNOSTOM&#205;A DE DESCARGA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">The "YEYUNOSTOM&#205;A DE DESCARGA" refers to a jejunostomy procedure specifically designed for decompression. This surgical intervention involves creating an opening in the jejunum to alleviate intestinal obstruction or to manage excessive output from an ileostomy. While the procedure is essential for diverting intestinal contents due to the patient's medical condition, it also carries the risk of leading to nutritional deficiencies. Therefore, careful management of nutrition is crucial following the surgery to ensure the patient's health and well-being.</data>
      <data key="d2">449d46789f604265753884e2d371ec8c,896ddfd9f06dc3ec8b1cfb986fae97fe,bc381304b682e075c7356c6edbfb0c2d</data>
