    <node id="CODE&#205;NA">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">CODE&#205;NA is a medication utilized for two primary purposes. Firstly, it is employed in the treatment of diarrhea and is included among the treatment options for patients with FEC (a specific condition). Secondly, CODE&#205;NA is also used for pain management, as indicated by a patient who is currently taking it for this purpose. This dual functionality highlights CODE&#205;NA's versatility in addressing both gastrointestinal and pain-related issues.</data>
      <data key="d2">5cf8b1c5491f78fda9bca97f3d14c5a2,e5838e52fbc5d3d18fc0533b71148201</data>
