    <node id="GU&#205;AS EUROPEAS">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The entity "GU&#205;AS EUROPEAS" refers to a set of recommendations aimed at improving the nutritional management of patients, particularly in critical care settings. These guidelines suggest an earlier initiation of parenteral nutrition for critically ill patients, emphasizing the importance of timely nutritional support. Additionally, the European guidelines provide protocols specifically designed for the nutritional management of patients with intestinal disorders, ensuring that these individuals receive appropriate care tailored to their unique needs. Overall, the "GU&#205;AS EUROPEAS" serve as a comprehensive framework for enhancing nutritional strategies in various patient populations.</data>
      <data key="d2">111edb0e21c873322871e35619a1ebf5,896ddfd9f06dc3ec8b1cfb986fae97fe</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">7054</data>
      <data key="d7">aeb9caa1b0b84da283ebfd89c82d0bbf</data>
    </node>
    <node id="HIDROELECTROL&#205;TICAS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
