    <node id="INSULINOTERAPIA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Insulinoterapia, or insulin therapy, is a treatment method that involves the administration of insulin to manage blood glucose levels in patients. This therapy is particularly important for individuals receiving nutritional support and is essential for those with secondary diabetes, especially in cases related to pancreatitis. Additionally, insulin therapy may be necessary for patients with diabetes in the context of pancreatic cancer, highlighting its critical role in managing blood glucose levels in various medical conditions.</data>
      <data key="d2">5f4610a3d5efde69d7f34ec14c4bed0b,67106be274787fd7f400ce3023c33a3d,896ddfd9f06dc3ec8b1cfb986fae97fe</data>
