    <node id="COMIT&#201; DE TUMORES">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The Comit&#233; de Tumores is a medical committee dedicated to evaluating patients' cases to determine appropriate treatment options for cancer. This committee plays a crucial role in assessing cancer diagnoses and formulating treatment plans, ensuring that patients receive tailored and effective care based on their specific medical needs.</data>
      <data key="d2">0b901814a09392d24880be465dcbce6f,3356667d6f35de6a8587ece00f8c6580</data>
