    <node id="DM">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">DM refers to diabetes mellitus, a condition that necessitates specific nutritional formulas and insulin management for effective treatment. Additionally, diabetes mellitus complicates the management of patients with rumination syndrome, highlighting the need for careful consideration of both conditions in clinical practice.</data>
