    <node id="RT">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">RT refers to radiotherapy, a treatment that can lead to complications such as mucositis in patients. Additionally, it is noted that the patient underwent RT, which affected their appetite and weight.</data>
