    <node id="ENFERMEDAD ESTABLE">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">The entity "ENFERMEDAD ESTABLE" refers to the patient's condition, which has been characterized as stable following treatment. According to the evolution controls conducted up until March 2008, the patient has maintained a stable disease state, with no changes observed in the peripancreatic adenopathies. This indicates that there has been no progression of the disease, affirming the overall stability of the patient's health condition.</data>
