    <node id="EVEROLIMUS">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Everolimus is a medication that has been utilized in the treatment of patients with oncological conditions. It serves as a substitute for ciclosporin in certain treatment scenarios, indicating its versatility and importance in managing various health issues.</data>
      <data key="d2">0c6c9eb4aba5c4642a75d76bd7ea08ba,6edff59a3b151e946e7664f13bcb0931</data>
