    <node id="VITAMINS AND MINERALS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Vitamins and minerals are essential nutrients that play a crucial role in maintaining health and preventing deficiencies. They are particularly important for patients with specific health conditions, such as celiac disease, where monitoring and supplementation may be necessary to correct specific deficits. While vitamins and minerals can support overall health, it is noted that supplementation may not be beneficial for diabetic patients unless they have existing deficiencies. Overall, these nutrients are vital for health maintenance and are often provided as supplements to support patients' well-being.</data>
      <data key="d2">6edff59a3b151e946e7664f13bcb0931,a3d1ea55509c69a04f3268ea20a33ba4,a826c03dcc41919d172b2e1ae8eeceb2,b1698ec972215d493ab6114914dde2a4</data>
