    <node id="BIBLIOGRAPHY">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The bibliography encompasses a range of clinical guidelines and studies that focus on nutritional support specifically for cancer patients, as well as broader research related to nutrition, health, and disease prevention. This collection serves as a comprehensive resource for understanding the role of nutrition in the context of health and disease management, particularly in oncology.</data>
      <data key="d2">6edff59a3b151e946e7664f13bcb0931,e33729f8eea62e59507c132b7c2437df</data>
