    <node id="INSUFICIENCIA RESPIRATORIA AGUDA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">INSUFICIENCIA RESPIRATORIA AGUDA, or acute respiratory failure, is a serious medical condition characterized by the inability of the respiratory system to maintain adequate gas exchange, leading to critical health issues for the patient. In managing this condition, Oxepa is a nutritional product specifically designed to support patients suffering from acute respiratory failure, providing essential nutrients that may aid in their recovery.</data>
      <data key="d2">6edff59a3b151e946e7664f13bcb0931,ceea9bf255384db1726c76c13ce560c8</data>
      <data key="d3">1257</data>
