    <node id="PLIEGUE CUT&#193;NEO TRICIPITAL">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">The Pliegue Cut&#225;neo Tricipital, also known as the Triceps Skinfold, is a measurement utilized to evaluate body fat and nutritional status. This specific skinfold measurement is an important tool in assessing an individual's nutritional health, providing insights into their body composition.</data>
      <data key="d2">3356667d6f35de6a8587ece00f8c6580,cb8368db73f739b1f11f2a202c776e6d</data>
