    <node id="NUTRITIONAL SUPPLEMENT">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Nutritional supplements are specialized products, such as Ensure Plus Advance and Fresubin, designed to provide essential nutrients for individuals with specific dietary needs. These supplements are particularly beneficial for patients requiring enhanced caloric and protein intake, including those managing diabetes. They serve to support overall health and nutritional requirements in various medical and dietary contexts.</data>
      <data key="d2">77c2b5963fab84c30e6eb596b49336bf,7a6970183393c5ef1adc99851ef3eada</data>
