    <node id="RADIOTHERAPY">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Radiotherapy is a treatment method that employs high doses of radiation to effectively kill cancer cells and reduce the size of tumors. This therapeutic approach is often accompanied by side effects, one of which can include diarrhea. In a specific case, a patient underwent radiotherapy consisting of five sessions to address a medical condition, highlighting its application in clinical settings.</data>
      <data key="d2">7a6970183393c5ef1adc99851ef3eada,cae7bf8d7b8c9d1f34a87ef41ff39a17</data>
