    </node>
    <node id="GASTROENTEROLOG&#205;A">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Gastroenterolog&#237;a is the branch of medicine dedicated to the study, diagnosis, and treatment of disorders related to the digestive system. This specialty encompasses a wide range of conditions affecting the gastrointestinal tract, including those specific to pediatric patients. The field involves comprehensive medical services that focus on diagnosing and treating various diseases of the digestive system, ensuring that patients receive the necessary care for their gastrointestinal health.</data>
      <data key="d2">a4b56b993221a7065a59bca622c02953,ce4c057e0a625bc9e64301a0cca1e206</data>
