    <node id="PSIQUIATR&#205;A">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">PSIQUIATR&#205;A is a field of medicine that specializes in the diagnosis and treatment of mental health disorders. It plays a crucial role in assessing patients' attitudes towards enteral nutrition, ensuring that mental health considerations are taken into account in the treatment process. Additionally, a medical service within this field evaluated a patient during their admission and determined that there was no psychiatric pathology present. This comprehensive approach highlights the importance of PSIQUIATR&#205;A in both the assessment and treatment of individuals with mental health concerns.</data>
      <data key="d2">4fbc9ba7c1f3ff190b594c75e7eac015,ce4c057e0a625bc9e64301a0cca1e206</data>
