    <node id="SULPIRIDA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Sulpirida is an antipsychotic medication that is primarily used to treat schizophrenia and other mental health disorders. It was tested in a patient as part of their treatment for regurgitation, indicating its potential application beyond its typical use in psychiatric conditions.</data>
      <data key="d2">1ff94f3fcc6eff16c2fdae5eb9b3aefa,ce4c057e0a625bc9e64301a0cca1e206</data>
