    <node id="RUMINATION SYNDROME">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Rumination syndrome is a poorly understood disorder that is likely underdiagnosed, characterized by the regurgitation of food and its re-chewing or re-swallowing.</data>
      <data key="d2">44d6374ee887ebef4cba5ec2a31f0673</data>
      <data key="d3">243</data>
      <data key="d4">1</data>
      <data key="d5">12</data>
