    <node id="CEDERHOLM T">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Cederholm T is a researcher focused on the study of sarcopenia and its implications for aging and health. Additionally, Cederholm T is one of the authors of the GLIM criteria for the diagnosis of malnutrition, which holds significance in the context of rumination syndrome. This dual involvement highlights Cederholm T's contributions to both the understanding of age-related muscle loss and the assessment of nutritional status in clinical settings.</data>
      <data key="d2">3be9d646c354d76527755d79a77c916b,44d6374ee887ebef4cba5ec2a31f0673</data>
      <data key="d3">244</data>
