      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Electromyography of the abdominal wall is a diagnostic tool that helps assess muscle function in patients with gastrointestinal disorders.</data>
      <data key="d2">44d6374ee887ebef4cba5ec2a31f0673</data>
