    </node>
    <node id="NUTRITIONAL FORMULAS">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Nutritional formulas are specialized dietary products specifically designed to meet the nutritional needs of patients, particularly those with specific health conditions such as diabetes and dietary restrictions. These products provide essential nutrients and are often utilized in clinical settings for patients who may be unable to consume food orally. They are particularly beneficial for individuals with medical needs, including those with diabetes mellitus and rumination syndrome, as they help improve metabolic control. Overall, nutritional formulas serve as a vital resource for ensuring adequate nutrition in patients with various health challenges.</data>
      <data key="d2">44d6374ee887ebef4cba5ec2a31f0673,502bae6c907e900b95f5fe6aa963b0fc,97a728c18b63007d07b6a4a5fc22d5e4,9d9a14a936949ac8d78c0a7d53e9f741,bb209dcfffac9c89dae0ad4ed2908d85,eadd983c9f28c11a1c279e4b923351cd</data>
