    </node>
    <node id="BICI">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">BICI is a comprehensive treatment protocol and medical device designed for managing insulin delivery in patients with diabetes, particularly in oncology settings. It stands for "Infusor subcut&#225;neo continuo de insulina," which translates to a continuous subcutaneous insulin infuser. This device is specifically utilized to assist in the management of severe hypoglycemia in diabetic patients, ensuring a consistent and effective delivery of insulin to maintain optimal blood glucose levels.</data>
      <data key="d2">3ed179f6e734d9fe4921fb0be0b018e4,a960ccbf15a28151d1461c4203408408,acd36e6dbcd98757c4cf33ff090764ee</data>
      <data key="d3">1109</data>
