      <data key="d1">VARIABILIDAD GLUC&#201;MICA refers to the fluctuations in blood sugar levels that a patient experiences, which is significant in the management of diabetes. This concept encompasses the variations in glucose levels over time, highlighting the importance of monitoring these fluctuations for effective diabetes care.</data>
