    <node id="HOSPITALIZACIONES">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Hospitalizaciones refer to hospital admissions, which can be influenced by various health conditions and management strategies. In this context, hospitalizations occurred primarily due to severe anemia and complications related to the patient's cancer and its treatment. The patient's hospitalizations were brief and specifically aimed at correcting the anemia and managing these complications. Additionally, it is noted that effective management of frailty and sarcopenia can help reduce the need for such hospital admissions.</data>
      <data key="d2">56da8c0bffe9c7811cc9790d767f4972,83b82871866963bb43f901dd9ca09fcb,da58ef987e74d508eb95395230f21cdc</data>
