    <node id="PSICOF&#193;RMACOS">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">PSICOF&#193;RMACOS, or psychopharmaceuticals, are medications commonly employed in the treatment of various psychiatric conditions. They are particularly utilized to address depressive episodes in patients suffering from severe illnesses, such as cancer. Additionally, psychopharmaceuticals play a significant role in the management of eating disorders, helping to alleviate symptoms related to associated psychiatric conditions.</data>
      <data key="d2">3bc554a0031c436483a977c2b9e57b48,5f4610a3d5efde69d7f34ec14c4bed0b</data>
