      <data key="d1">Dr. Estrella Petrina J&#225;uregui is a medical professional specializing in hospital diet planning. She serves as the head of the Clinical Nutrition and Dietetics section at the Complejo Hospitalario de Navarra, where she plays a crucial role in overseeing dietary practices and nutritional care within the hospital setting.</data>
