    <node id="ALIMENTACI&#211;N SALUDABLE">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">"ALIMENTACI&#211;N SALUDABLE" refers to dietary patterns that promote health and prevent chronic diseases. Healthy eating is linked to improved health outcomes and a decreased risk of developing chronic illnesses. This concept emphasizes the importance of making nutritious food choices to enhance overall well-being.</data>
      <data key="d2">035d53a7f46fdb72c0a939265667044b,a0ef28095dacaada520d8e6fbaf518f1,abf638322cfb1c522bfbee1852e28a19,ea5b0e748b16db9640ab70c394ca1a4c</data>
