      <data key="d6">7349</data>
      <data key="d7">c4b62cca319742fe8c8426be66f60888</data>
    </node>
    <node id="ACEITE DE OLIVA VIRGEN EXTRA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">ACEITE DE OLIVA VIRGEN EXTRA, or extra virgin olive oil, is an essential component of the Mediterranean diet. It is widely used for both cooking and dressing dishes, and it is renowned for its numerous health benefits. Notably, this type of olive oil is associated with improved cardiovascular health and is recognized for its role in reducing the risk of type 2 diabetes.</data>
      <data key="d2">4e6568999eba5abd852eedecc5fc580f,72d0be9d03c79097f867a8af2e3e89e4</data>
      <data key="d3">1379</data>
