    <node id="SALUD P&#218;BLICA">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">SALUD P&#218;BLICA encompasses strategies aimed at promoting healthy eating patterns, such as the Mediterranean diet, to enhance the health of the population and safeguard the environment. It refers to the overall health of the community, recognizing that the effects of gastrointestinal symptoms, including diarrhea and constipation, can differ greatly depending on socio-economic factors.</data>
      <data key="d2">035d53a7f46fdb72c0a939265667044b,235520bdfb411a2997762c99ac421bf3,55aabc274c460459322072406f17d52c</data>
