    <node id="WORLD HEALTH ORGANIZATION">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The World Health Organization (WHO) is a specialized agency of the United Nations that is responsible for international public health. Its mandate includes the development of guidelines on various aspects of health, including nutrition. The WHO plays a crucial role in coordinating global health efforts and setting standards to improve health outcomes worldwide.</data>
      <data key="d2">1e6677459719ee2aa18d6d2ffbe46330,6907c82f1f024ed1b75f6aea88c47b3e,844d065cac5f5304fffed35b5da90416,e173daca5490a19b057aecb1ee4edca2,e33729f8eea62e59507c132b7c2437df</data>
