    <node id="WANG X">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Wang X is an author engaged in various research studies focusing on health outcomes related to dietary habits. This includes investigations into urinary excretion and its implications for health, as well as the relationship between fruit consumption and gastric cancer. Additionally, Wang X has contributed to a systematic review that examines the association between fruit and vegetable consumption and mortality rates. Through these studies, Wang X has made significant contributions to understanding the impact of diet on health.</data>
      <data key="d2">581527a14dedf97c7a839eff5c40cbc2,b96414a52f13cac336436d9e8173baef,e33729f8eea62e59507c132b7c2437df</data>
