    <node id="ECKEL RH">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Eckel RH is a prominent researcher and co-author of the 2013 American Heart Association (AHA) and American College of Cardiology (ACC) guideline on lifestyle management aimed at reducing cardiovascular risk. In addition to being a co-author, Eckel RH also served as a contributor to this important guideline, which provides recommendations for lifestyle changes to help mitigate cardiovascular risk factors.</data>
      <data key="d2">6907c82f1f024ed1b75f6aea88c47b3e,e032cf926bee7048e207a0e28604f60e,e33729f8eea62e59507c132b7c2437df</data>
