    <node id="BANTLE JP">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Bantle JP is a notable researcher and co-author of the American Diabetes Association's position statement on nutrition recommendations for diabetes. He has made significant contributions to the field through his studies on the metabolic effects of dietary sucrose and fructose in diabetic subjects, enhancing the understanding of how these sugars impact individuals with diabetes.</data>
