    <node id="ABURTO NJ">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Aburto NJ is a researcher known for conducting systematic reviews on the health effects of lower sodium intake. In addition to this work, Aburto NJ has also studied the impact of increased potassium intake on cardiovascular risk factors and disease. Through these research efforts, Aburto NJ contributes valuable insights into dietary influences on health, particularly concerning sodium and potassium intake.</data>
