    <node id="ANN ONCOL">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Ann Oncol, also known as Annals of Oncology, is a peer-reviewed scientific journal dedicated to the field of oncology. It publishes a wide range of research related to cancer, including studies that explore the relationship between cancer risk and dietary factors, as well as advancements in cancer treatment. The journal serves as a significant resource for professionals in the medical community, contributing to the ongoing discourse and research in oncology.</data>
