    <node id="BUIJSEE B">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Buijsse B is an author known for conducting significant research in the field of nutrition and health. They have carried out a study focusing on the relationship between fruit and vegetable intake and type 2 diabetes, highlighting the importance of dietary habits in managing this condition. Additionally, Buijsse B has conducted a systematic review and meta-analysis that examines the effects of fruit and vegetable consumption on anthropometric changes, further contributing to the understanding of how these dietary factors influence physical health and body measurements. Through these studies, Buijsse B has provided valuable insights into the role of diet in chronic disease prevention and health promotion.</data>
