      <data key="d1">Mozaffarian D is an author recognized for his extensive research on the effects of dietary choices on health. He has conducted a systematic review focusing on the health risks associated with the consumption of red and processed meats. Additionally, Mozaffarian D has evaluated the risks and benefits of fish intake, particularly concerning contaminants and their impact on human health. His work also includes significant research on the effects of trans fatty acids, further contributing to the understanding of how various dietary components influence overall health.</data>
