      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">CIRCULATION is a peer-reviewed journal that specializes in cardiovascular medicine, focusing on research related to heart and vascular health. It publishes a wide range of studies, including systematic reviews and original research articles. Notably, CIRCULATION has published research on various topics such as the health risks associated with red and processed meat consumption, as well as the impact of plant seed consumption on cardiovascular health. The journal covers a broad spectrum of cardiovascular health issues, including studies on coronary heart disease and other related diseases, making it a significant resource for advancements in cardiovascular research and medicine.</data>
