    <node id="HUANG W">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Huang W is a researcher and author known for significant contributions to the field of health and nutrition. They co-authored a study focusing on glutamine supplementation in hematopoietic stem cell transplantation, exploring its potential benefits in this medical context. Additionally, Huang W conducted a meta-analysis examining the relationship between red and processed meat intake and the risk of esophageal adenocarcinoma, providing valuable insights into dietary impacts on cancer risk. Through these studies, Huang W has contributed to the understanding of both nutritional supplementation and dietary risks in relation to health outcomes.</data>
