      <data key="d1">Han Y is a notable author and researcher who has contributed to the field of medical studies. They co-authored a study published in the International Journal of Surgery, which examined the effect of early oral feeding on the short-term outcomes of patients undergoing laparoscopic distal gastrectomy. Additionally, Han Y conducted a meta-analysis investigating the relationship between red and processed meat intake and the risk of esophageal adenocarcinoma. Through these contributions, Han Y has demonstrated a commitment to advancing knowledge in surgical outcomes and cancer risk factors.</data>
