      <data key="d1">Wu L is an author known for conducting significant meta-analyses in the field of nutrition and cancer research. One of Wu L's notable studies focused on the relationship between dietary nitrates, nitrites, and nitrosamines intake and the risk of gastric cancer. Additionally, Wu L conducted another meta-analysis examining the association between red meat consumption and the risk of stomach cancer. Through these studies, Wu L has contributed valuable insights into dietary factors that may influence gastric cancer risk.</data>
