    <node id="NUTR J">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">NUTR J, also known as Nutrition Journal, is an open-access journal dedicated to publishing research focused on nutrition and dietary practices. The journal covers a wide range of topics related to nutrition, including its effects on health and disease. Notably, it includes studies on parenteral nutrition specifically for surgical patients, highlighting its commitment to advancing knowledge in the field of nutrition and its critical role in health management.</data>
      <data key="d2">3f1d1c7c7c62b83f62f6fa31c25f65b2,d0b74d75847bdd3e0d4962e7cc2ca5fe,ea920d08266b329db73fb7b804bbb9ce</data>
