    <node id="OBES REV">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Obesity Reviews (OBES REV) is a journal dedicated to publishing systematic reviews and research on obesity-related topics. It focuses on various aspects of obesity, including dietary fiber and its implications for health. The journal serves as a platform for disseminating knowledge about obesity and its associated health issues, contributing to the understanding and management of this significant public health concern.</data>
      <data key="d2">1f465485ab8858e532f511401e7558f9,d0b74d75847bdd3e0d4962e7cc2ca5fe</data>
      <data key="d3">1244</data>
