      <data key="d7">f482ef09bd3347218c66e7fa0384d3d5</data>
    </node>
    <node id="BLADDER CANCER">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Bladder cancer is a type of cancer that affects the bladder, originating from the cells within this organ. Research has been conducted to explore various factors that may influence the risk of developing bladder cancer, including dietary influences such as fish consumption. These studies aim to better understand the relationship between diet and the incidence of this disease, highlighting the importance of nutrition in cancer risk assessment.</data>
      <data key="d2">97c27548ceb554d425303875efc5f9b4,d0b74d75847bdd3e0d4962e7cc2ca5fe</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
