    <node id="DIETARY FIBRE">
      <data key="d0" />
      <data key="d1">Dietary fibre is a type of carbohydrate that the body cannot digest. It plays a significant role in digestive health and may also have an impact on chronic diseases, such as Chronic Obstructive Pulmonary Disease (COPD).</data>
      <data key="d2">d0b74d75847bdd3e0d4962e7cc2ca5fe,ea8be3e3b3d7195ddc85512be460b6f8</data>
