    <node id="NUTR METAB CARDIOVASC DIS">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">NUTR METAB CARDIOVASC DIS, also known as Nutrition, Metabolism and Cardiovascular Diseases, is a journal dedicated to the research and publication of studies focusing on the interplay between nutrition, metabolism, and cardiovascular health. The journal emphasizes the impact of nutrition on cardiovascular diseases and aims to advance understanding in this critical area of health. It serves as a platform for disseminating research that explores the relationship between dietary factors and cardiovascular well-being, contributing to the broader field of cardiovascular disease research.</data>
      <data key="d2">1388342730ee9177144f78f9e9d7816e,1f465485ab8858e532f511401e7558f9,8cdedff25a6a366c17615073d05a5aa2,cf833689453c8ce13d3650766a8b47a7,e271766bdc88e84209e5cdac4adc0724,f8c0a9f795e94be1048ffba0007831de</data>
