    <node id="COCHRANE DATABASE SYST REV">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The Cochrane Database of Systematic Reviews is a comprehensive database that offers systematic reviews of healthcare interventions. It focuses on synthesizing primary research related to human health care and policy, providing valuable insights and evidence-based information for healthcare professionals and policymakers. The database is renowned for its rigorous methodology and commitment to high-quality research, making it a critical resource in the field of healthcare.</data>
      <data key="d2">36823f72c2a40918b243d0c6f175c0e4,9ef354c0ee5ac877ce8fba79fcc7e2b3,f8c0a9f795e94be1048ffba0007831de</data>
