    <node id="DIABETOLOGIA">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Diabetologia is a scientific journal dedicated to publishing research on diabetes and its complications. The journal encompasses a wide range of studies, including those related to gut microbiota and metabolic health, reflecting its commitment to advancing knowledge in the field of diabetes. Through its publications, Diabetologia aims to contribute to the understanding and management of diabetes and its associated health issues.</data>
