    <node id="CORONARY HEART DISEASE">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Coronary heart disease is a type of cardiovascular disease that is influenced by various dietary factors. Research indicates that the consumption of omega-3 fatty acids can have an impact on the condition, as well as dietary fiber intake, which has been supported by various studies. These dietary components play a significant role in the management and prevention of coronary heart disease, highlighting the importance of nutrition in cardiovascular health.</data>
