    <node id="YANG J">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Yang J is a co-author of a study published in the International Journal of Surgery, which investigates the effect of early oral feeding on the short-term outcomes of patients undergoing laparoscopic distal gastrectomy. In addition to this work, Yang J is also a researcher engaged in studies that explore the impact of dietary factors on cancer risk.</data>
