    <node id="BMC CANCER">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">BMC Cancer is a peer-reviewed medical journal dedicated to publishing research articles related to cancer. It encompasses a wide range of topics, including meta-analyses, systematic reviews, and studies focusing on nutritional outcomes in cancer patients. Notably, BMC Cancer has also published the study protocol for the PROPILS trial, further contributing to the body of research in the field of oncology.</data>
      <data key="d2">97c27548ceb554d425303875efc5f9b4,b9a7e8e8fec7968cf56017bf41f92bb4,bef1f848ac9b922f7361b740210a8314</data>
