      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">32</data>
      <data key="d6">7687</data>
      <data key="d7">a3020ab800514b6fa57421939b1a0c67</data>
    </node>
    <node id="AMERICAN JOURNAL OF CLINICAL NUTRITION">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The "American Journal of Clinical Nutrition" is a leading, peer-reviewed journal dedicated to publishing original research and reviews in the field of clinical nutrition. It focuses on the effects of nutrition on health and disease, encompassing a wide range of topics including obesity, dietary intake, and various health outcomes. The journal features studies related to specific dietary components, such as dairy consumption, dietary fat intake, calcium, phosphorus, and copper metabolism, as well as their implications for disease risk, including cancer and heart disease.

The American Journal of Clinical Nutrition serves as a vital resource for researchers and practitioners in the field of nutrition and dietetics, providing insights into the dietary management of conditions like phenylketonuria and metabolic disorders. By publishing research on the impact of nutrition on health, the journal contributes significantly to the understanding of how dietary choices influence overall well-being and the prevention of chronic diseases.</data>
      <data key="d2">08bc4a83d18482b48f5bbef4fbf316f3,1bba475c47cc7e804e16c70787b247f9,2de75b0403c279c1781dfec3cdd2a3e2,41a33a13610bbae73208f0d201781724,428616513e9e654c21ede19bd544ffbc,4a59488a9440b38afba989ca88d49ca3,63593ac5546e44eaddb37a2f257bfa80,6533cbcb76873caf6fd68eb95d313d24,6c509f5e704c690cfa39b3f7b19eb766,9783830959445135c718dc21daa0a46b,97c27548ceb554d425303875efc5f9b4,bb2e69a0ff4c25a21149882162922c8d,bfb5dadab0c08f9f5f549ddd4b5db30c,c3182f51249513a920db6b935632fead,dbdb3cd3b9065e8846fd2eb15b9d5879,e757275b1935a42dabd03a0b528649a3,e7a633f303c813ee9f0b7f55e7a0968a,eb275fa50517d86a71589fd318784a5b,f2b8b21255397ebbaf2b5d66ff6bde88</data>
      <data key="d3">1698</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
