    <node id="FISH CONSUMPTION">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Fish consumption refers to the dietary intake of fish, which has been extensively studied for its health benefits. It is particularly linked to cardiovascular health due to the presence of omega-3 fatty acids found in fish. Additionally, research has explored the potential associations between fish consumption and various cancer risks. Overall, fish consumption is recognized for its significant impact on health, especially concerning heart health and cancer prevention.</data>
      <data key="d2">97c27548ceb554d425303875efc5f9b4,bb2e69a0ff4c25a21149882162922c8d,e271766bdc88e84209e5cdac4adc0724</data>
