    <node id="RENAL CANCER">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Renal cancer, or kidney cancer, is a type of cancer that affects the kidneys, with studies examining dietary factors such as fish consumption in relation to its risk.</data>
      <data key="d2">97c27548ceb554d425303875efc5f9b4</data>
