    <node id="DIETARY FAT">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Dietary fat refers to the types and amounts of fat that should be consumed in a child's diet, as outlined in dietary guidelines. It encompasses essential nutrients necessary for health, playing a crucial role in various bodily functions. However, it is important to note that while dietary fat is vital, excessive consumption can lead to weight gain and other health issues. Therefore, moderation and balance are key when incorporating dietary fats into a child's nutrition.</data>
      <data key="d2">2a351a5c3cb70af0293c0897583049cc,428616513e9e654c21ede19bd544ffbc</data>
