      <data key="d1">The ESC, or European Society of Cardiology, is an organization dedicated to improving cardiovascular health. It is known for issuing comprehensive guidelines that pertain to both the diagnosis and treatment of heart failure, as well as dietary recommendations aimed at promoting heart health. Through its efforts, the ESC plays a crucial role in advancing knowledge and practices related to cardiovascular care.</data>
