    <node id="ESPOSITO K">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Esposito K is a researcher known for significant contributions to the field of nutrition, particularly through a meta-analysis on the Mediterranean diet. This researcher has been involved in multiple studies examining the effects of the Mediterranean diet on diabetes and cardiovascular health, highlighting its potential benefits in these areas.</data>
      <data key="d2">63593ac5546e44eaddb37a2f257bfa80,a739523b87def5cdfa8fe97cdf423fe7</data>
