    <node id="HOSPITAL REGIONAL UNIVERSITARIO DE M&#193;LAGA">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The Hospital Regional Universitario de M&#225;laga is a clinical institution that specializes in various medical treatments, with a particular focus on nutrition and dietetics research. It provides nutrition support for patients suffering from pulmonary diseases, highlighting its commitment to comprehensive patient care. The hospital is staffed by a team of specialists, including Gabriel Olveira Fuster, Victoria Contreras Bol&#237;var, and Casilda Olveira Fuster, who contribute to its reputation as a leading medical facility in the region.</data>
      <data key="d2">04b13f0ccbff81f5f7e92e7bd239cd92,0bf272be187cbf9ec33184c8052e19c6,1388342730ee9177144f78f9e9d7816e</data>
      <data key="d3">341</data>
      <data key="d4">1</data>
