    </node>
    <node id="NUTRICI&#211;N INTERACTIVA">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">NUTRICI&#211;N INTERACTIVA is an interactive platform developed by the Society of Spanish Endocrinology and Nutrition (SEEN) aimed at promoting nutrition education and awareness. This web platform serves as a valuable resource for online nutritional calculations, providing users with tools to estimate energy requirements and assess nutritional needs. Through its comprehensive offerings, NUTRICI&#211;N INTERACTIVA seeks to enhance understanding of nutrition and support individuals in making informed dietary choices.</data>
      <data key="d2">148443357888793655b663333268775a,62cb70a5fd28a7c444f52a64ce2a7f75,dea64d5eb807430bc52e8bed6e30c393</data>
      <data key="d3">1457</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">3</data>
      <data key="d6">7818</data>
      <data key="d7">40af3ce211af4f0fa7fc2f9aaa1505e4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="GEB">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">GEB, or Gasto Energ&#233;tico Basal, refers to the basal energy expenditure, which is the measure of the energy required by the body at rest to maintain essential physiological functions. This concept is crucial for estimating energy needs and is calculated based on factors such as weight and height, particularly for children. GEB serves as a fundamental metric in understanding the energy requirements of individuals, highlighting its importance in both health and nutrition contexts.</data>
      <data key="d2">8d7280a9f9085fe677f5993b12910ea2,bd31c6face847551241359e37e4baa2e,dea64d5eb807430bc52e8bed6e30c393</data>
      <data key="d3">1033</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">14</data>
      <data key="d6">7819</data>
      <data key="d7">28689cf1b65c4163bbfa88b9e05816e6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="GER">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">GER, which stands for Gasto Energ&#233;tico en Reposo, is a measure of resting energy expenditure that is particularly important for dietary management in patients with cystic fibrosis. It is also referred to as Gasto Energ&#233;tico de Reposo, highlighting its relevance to energy expenditure in individuals. This metric plays a crucial role in understanding and managing the energy needs of those affected by cystic fibrosis.</data>
      <data key="d2">c2211f0deb7328a77cb632140690da03,dea64d5eb807430bc52e8bed6e30c393</data>
      <data key="d3">1033</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">2</data>
      <data key="d6">7820</data>
      <data key="d7">068ebc8d8483400695b079b05f719d04</data>
    </node>
    <node id="GET">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Gasto Energ&#233;tico Total (GET) refers to the total energy expenditure, which is calculated based on physical activity.</data>
      <data key="d2">c2211f0deb7328a77cb632140690da03,dea64d5eb807430bc52e8bed6e30c393</data>
      <data key="d3">1035</data>
