    <node id="ALCOHOL CONSUMPTION">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Alcohol consumption, especially in chronic cases, is a significant lifestyle factor that can contribute to the development of osteoporosis. Additionally, the event of alcohol consumption is associated with various health risks and has implications for mortality. These effects highlight the importance of understanding the impact of alcohol consumption on overall health and well-being.</data>
      <data key="d2">65ba063e1a9e43a87dbfe9cf627674b1,7ff62e1dc423be2f4b2fe08546751d0d</data>
