      <data key="d7">1630b625fed44c67b1d02a8a365ac816</data>
    </node>
    <node id="VEGETARIAN DIET">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">The vegetarian diet is a dietary pattern that emphasizes the consumption of fruits, vegetables, whole grains, legumes, seeds, and nuts. It may also include dairy and eggs, depending on the specific type of vegetarianism practiced. This diet has been extensively studied for its association with cardiovascular disease risk factors and is linked to various health benefits. Additionally, the vegetarian diet is relevant in discussions about protein quality and dietary recommendations tailored for individuals with diverse eating habits. Overall, the vegetarian diet is recognized for its potential to promote health and well-being.</data>
      <data key="d2">4b79601d85087d62f0d4890761776c04,6a95bf35e698b03ca552f2c75d5d60ef,7ff62e1dc423be2f4b2fe08546751d0d</data>
      <data key="d3">1631</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">4</data>
      <data key="d6">7866</data>
      <data key="d7">8030d470178845818b2d0626b07241a1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="VEGETALES">
      <data key="d0">GEO</data>
      <data key="d1">Los vegetales son fuentes naturales de nutrientes esenciales, incluyendo &#225;cido f&#243;lico y vitamina C, que son importantes para la salud general.</data>
      <data key="d2">b68dc7398a80c0b67d28b1d9f73ff885</data>
      <data key="d5">0</data>
      <data key="d6">7867</data>
      <data key="d7">6345bcd771774e29a5a2f32b0f1fb8fe</data>
    </node>
    <node id="DIETAS VEGETARIANAS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">"DIETAS VEGETARIANAS" refers to dietary patterns that predominantly exclude meat. These diets can be beneficial for health, particularly for individuals with diabetes, when they are well-planned. However, it is important for those following vegetarian diets to pay special attention to their intake of certain nutrients, such as vitamin B12 and iron, to ensure they meet their nutritional needs.</data>
      <data key="d2">62afbb83c3f69bd45bf24467ac5b47b8,b68dc7398a80c0b67d28b1d9f73ff885</data>
      <data key="d3">674</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">6</data>
      <data key="d6">7868</data>
      <data key="d7">d1abc13623224a55a67c37103fb54e56</data>
    </node>
    <node id="SUPLEMENTOS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Los suplementos, que incluyen hierro, &#225;cido f&#243;lico, calcio y vitaminas, son productos esenciales utilizados para aumentar la ingesta de nutrientes necesarios, especialmente en pacientes con POIC (P&#233;rdida &#211;sea Inducida por C&#225;ncer) y en poblaciones con dietas restrictivas o deficiencias confirmadas. Estos suplementos son fundamentales para prevenir deficiencias nutricionales y asegurar una adecuada salud y bienestar en estos grupos vulnerables.</data>
      <data key="d2">b68dc7398a80c0b67d28b1d9f73ff885,eb8fe6b54f7eab9cbe7b90c53e7007ed</data>
      <data key="d3">652</data>
