    </node>
    <node id="MUJERES EMBARAZADAS">
      <data key="d0" />
      <data key="d1">Mujeres embarazadas are pregnant women who undergo monitoring for anemia, a condition that can affect their health and the health of their unborn child. During pregnancy, these women may require iron supplementation to address any deficiencies and ensure a healthy pregnancy.</data>
      <data key="d2">7db70a783ce99dcbd067aa16de5d8059,b68dc7398a80c0b67d28b1d9f73ff885</data>
