    <node id="HEALTHY DIET PATTERNS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Healthy diet patterns, such as the Mediterranean diet, emphasize the consumption of fruits, vegetables, and healthy fats to reduce chronic disease risk.</data>
      <data key="d2">a826c03dcc41919d172b2e1ae8eeceb2</data>
