    <node id="NUTRITIONAL DEFICIENCIES">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Nutritional deficiencies are health issues that arise from the inadequate intake or absorption of essential nutrients. These deficiencies can lead to various health problems and are often associated with conditions such as celiac disease. The body requires a sufficient amount of essential nutrients to function properly, and when these nutrients are lacking, it can result in significant health complications. Nutritional guidelines are designed to help prevent these deficiencies by promoting adequate nutrient intake.</data>
      <data key="d2">a3d1ea55509c69a04f3268ea20a33ba4,a826c03dcc41919d172b2e1ae8eeceb2,e6153f0024d75c281071b521b08ed53a</data>
