    <node id="EUROPEAN UNION">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The European Union is a political and economic union comprising 27 member states primarily located in Europe. It plays a significant role in regulating various standards, including those related to organic product labeling, among other areas.</data>
