    <node id="NATIONAL ACADEMY PRESS">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The National Academy Press is a publishing entity that specializes in producing reports and books on a wide range of topics, with a particular focus on health and nutrition. This includes the publication of materials related to dietary reference intakes, among other subjects. Through its publications, the National Academy Press aims to disseminate valuable information and research findings to inform and educate the public and professionals in the field.</data>
