    <node id="GENEVA">
      <data key="d0">GEO</data>
      <data key="d1">Geneva is a city in Switzerland that serves as a global hub for diplomacy and international organizations, including the World Health Organization (WHO). The city is notable for hosting consultations and publishing guidelines on nutrition, reflecting its significant role in international health discussions and initiatives.</data>
