    <node id="NATIONAL ACADEMIES PRESS">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The National Academies Press is a prominent publisher that specializes in producing reports and guidelines on a wide range of topics, particularly focusing on health and nutrition. It is known for its publications related to dietary reference intakes for macronutrients and other scientific subjects. The reports and books published by the National Academies Press are issued by the National Academies of Sciences, Engineering, and Medicine, and they provide expert advice and insights on various health-related issues.</data>
      <data key="d2">6907c82f1f024ed1b75f6aea88c47b3e,9303a85464d02f1cc012aaca21edf9bb,d26aec24f3f8c930c1c4b1d464bacd6b,e40d5e26456fbd223dc887d7d6d0eeb7</data>
