      <data key="d1">The Complejo Hospitalario Universitario de Ferrol is a healthcare facility situated in A Coru&#241;a, Spain. It offers a range of medical services, with a particular focus on endocrinology and nutrition. This institution is recognized for its commitment to providing comprehensive healthcare to the community, ensuring access to specialized medical care in these important fields.</data>
