    <node id="NUTRITIONAL LABELING">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Nutritional labeling refers to the practice of providing information about the nutritional content of food products to help consumers make informed choices. This includes details about various dietary attributes, such as gluten content, enabling individuals to better understand the nutritional value and ingredients of the foods they consume.</data>
      <data key="d2">70e4538100be270d06e7a3cdc254ba28,dfb6e1826ded0b8ca7cf3304d1b75d1a</data>
      <data key="d3">1244</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">2</data>
      <data key="d6">7905</data>
      <data key="d7">e7f4b20b2e274e7e915ed5eda71a959e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="CONSUMO ALIMENTARIO">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Consumo alimentario refers to the act of consuming food, which is linked to health and the preparation of meals at home.</data>
      <data key="d2">b003f8a156374bb4430475f4ffe8e074</data>
      <data key="d3">1163</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">3</data>
      <data key="d6">7906</data>
      <data key="d7">43c8fa74060c4368a19b4f5125c8d5f3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="ETIQUETADO NUTRICIONAL">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">The entity "ETIQUETADO NUTRICIONAL" refers to nutritional labeling, which encompasses the regulations and information presented on food packaging. This labeling is designed to inform consumers about the nutritional content of food products, helping them make informed dietary choices.</data>
      <data key="d2">b003f8a156374bb4430475f4ffe8e074,e0102bb655b6476ce3296726e3aceb4a</data>
      <data key="d3">1559</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">4</data>
      <data key="d6">7907</data>
      <data key="d7">5d2e1976ee3c440f8fa3e4b0bc23f087</data>
    </node>
    <node id="REGLAMENTO (UE) N&#186; 1169/2011">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Reglamento (UE) N&#186; 1169/2011 is a legal framework established by the European Parliament and Council that governs the information related to food that must be provided to consumers. This regulation aims to ensure that consumers receive clear and accurate information about the food products they purchase, thereby promoting informed choices and enhancing food safety.</data>
      <data key="d2">5bda98c244ed300cfc07192e54c7eb88,b003f8a156374bb4430475f4ffe8e074</data>
      <data key="d3">1561</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">3</data>
      <data key="d6">7908</data>
      <data key="d7">a264ca2a01c9475ca4f249adb98947b0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="ALIMENTOS ENVASADOS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Packaged foods are those that are sealed before sale, requiring clear labeling of their contents.</data>
      <data key="d2">b003f8a156374bb4430475f4ffe8e074</data>
      <data key="d3">1559</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">7909</data>
      <data key="d7">8b5be344151c45119a692bb1915cb085</data>
    </node>
    <node id="PRODUCTOS ALIMENTARIOS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Food products are items that are consumed and require clear labeling to inform consumers about their nutritional content.</data>
      <data key="d2">b003f8a156374bb4430475f4ffe8e074</data>
      <data key="d3">720</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">7910</data>
      <data key="d7">b6140f0f506b4267b10c028103927d3c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="ETIQUETADO">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">ETIQUETADO refers to the labeling process that encompasses the information required to be present on food products, particularly those with very low caloric content, as mandated by regulations. This includes adherence to specific norms that govern the information displayed on food items, especially concerning allergens. Additionally, ETIQUETADO involves providing essential details such as the minimum durability date and nutritional information, which aids consumers in understanding the contents and nutritional value of the food they purchase. Overall, ETIQUETADO plays a crucial role in ensuring transparency and safety in food labeling.</data>
      <data key="d2">0f0303399f29734dede9db544e1dda9e,3926ed628d3d5919b8a65e44fffbc3b9,4196233cbb95a9ab194177cc11875e7a,b003f8a156374bb4430475f4ffe8e074</data>
      <data key="d3">720</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">5</data>
      <data key="d6">7911</data>
      <data key="d7">ff5e41f4844541c4b26b1f64221b5c8f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="REAL DECRETO 1245/2008">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">El Real Decreto 1245/2008 es una legislaci&#243;n espa&#241;ola que regula la informaci&#243;n sobre los aditivos alimentarios y su etiquetado.</data>
      <data key="d2">8255943be503f6709a8e63d7d33b79d1</data>
      <data key="d3">1556</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">7912</data>
      <data key="d7">32483c16bc4f4ec4868b3eee22b599aa</data>
    </node>
    <node id="EMPRESA ALIMENTARIA">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">La empresa alimentaria es la entidad responsable de la producci&#243;n y etiquetado de productos alimenticios, incluyendo la informaci&#243;n sobre ingredientes y al&#233;rgenos.</data>
      <data key="d2">8255943be503f6709a8e63d7d33b79d1</data>
      <data key="d3">523</data>
      <data key="d4">1</data>
      <data key="d5">2</data>
      <data key="d6">7913</data>
      <data key="d7">beaab520d3874b5eb81ed6cfebac079a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="CONSUMIDORES">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Los consumidores son las personas que compran y consumen productos alimenticios, y tienen derecho a recibir informaci&#243;n clara sobre los mismos.</data>
      <data key="d2">8255943be503f6709a8e63d7d33b79d1</data>
      <data key="d3">523</data>
      <data key="d4">1</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">7914</data>
      <data key="d7">fd447082d0094aa7b62766486d60cc20</data>
    </node>
    <node id="PRODUCTOS ALIMENTICIOS">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Los productos alimenticios son bienes que se consumen y que deben cumplir con regulaciones espec&#237;ficas sobre etiquetado y seguridad alimentaria.</data>
      <data key="d2">8255943be503f6709a8e63d7d33b79d1</data>
      <data key="d3">523</data>
      <data key="d4">1</data>
      <data key="d5">13</data>
      <data key="d6">7915</data>
      <data key="d7">9353d6ae76a04fe796ccc1773936059c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="MANTEQUILLA">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">MANTEQUILLA, commonly known as butter, is a dairy product derived from the fat and protein components of milk. It is characterized by its composition, which includes 50.5% saturated fats, 23.4% monounsaturated fats, and 3.1% polyunsaturated fats. While butter can enhance the flavor of meals and is often used in cooking and as a spread, it is important to consume it in moderation according to dietary guidelines. 

MANTEQUILLA is included in various dietary plans, but it is not permitted in modified diets, particularly those that are strict or low-sodium. Additionally, it is noted that butter can contain lactose, which may pose issues for individuals with lactose intolerance; however, it is also mentioned that butter can be lactose-free due to the separation of its aqueous and fatty components during production. 

Furthermore, clear labeling regarding ingredients and potential allergens is essential for MANTEQUILLA, especially in children's diets, where it should be consumed occasionally and in moderation. Overall, MANTEQUILLA is a versatile dairy product that plays a role in culinary applications while requiring careful consideration in dietary contexts.</data>
      <data key="d2">06f547bc6311ffa370bc1a65dc7184d2,1d959525e9a5fe22094271d67d0b9108,347e3d175ef7f30e3dcad731f84fb375,3d053ac744015b40d8790ff91b5d02f2,4b19145e0977ee48b7132c9915d8c284,527c3c962d22018377b32c52e984d4e1,61b84039de5ac2d9e25890c3b8f4f87a,8255943be503f6709a8e63d7d33b79d1,8d7a18d8258ab74a0e56129f937a8a84,a562e90891c11da0293bc7de511acc8f</data>
      <data key="d3">523</data>
