    <node id="FIBRA ALIMENTARIA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">FIBRA ALIMENTARIA refers to dietary fiber that can be included in optional nutritional information. It plays a significant role in nutrition, contributing to various health benefits associated with a balanced diet.</data>
