    <node id="VALOR ENERG&#201;TICO">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">VALOR ENERG&#201;TICO refers to the energy value provided by food, which is measured in kilojoules or kilocalories. This term encompasses the amount of energy that food supplies to the body, highlighting its importance in nutrition and dietary considerations. The energy value is expressed in both kilojoules and kilocalories, providing a standardized way to quantify the energy content of various food items.</data>
