    <node id="AZ&#218;CARES">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Az&#250;cares, a type of carbohydrate, are included in nutritional information and are categorized as simple carbohydrates. They provide energy but are advised to be limited in dietary guidelines to reduce cardiovascular risk.</data>
