    <node id="FACE">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">FACE, or Federaci&#243;n de Asociaciones de Celiacos de Espa&#241;a, is an organization dedicated to supporting individuals with celiac disease in Spain. It provides essential information and resources for those affected by this condition. Additionally, FACE plays a crucial role in overseeing the certification of gluten-free products across Europe, ensuring that these products comply with strict regulations regarding gluten content. Specifically, FACE is responsible for granting the European License System (ELS) certification for gluten-free products, which guarantees that items bearing its mark contain gluten levels below 10 parts per million (ppm). Through its efforts, FACE aims to enhance the safety and quality of gluten-free options available to consumers.</data>
      <data key="d2">1d8aa686c6377246fee05010ef969018,d3ffabc46da9b238994a7769ffc8f6b7,dfb6e1826ded0b8ca7cf3304d1b75d1a,e4edae03f8089b7bc1c46e697e658e3c,edc9ccbe5d98671343d0119a309cddaf</data>
      <data key="d3">830</data>
