    <node id="AOECS">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The AOECS, or Association of European Coeliacs, is an organization dedicated to regulating the use of the gluten-free symbol and certifying gluten-free products throughout Europe. It oversees the certification process across its member associations, ensuring that products meet the necessary standards for gluten-free labeling. The AOECS plays a crucial role in supporting individuals with celiac disease by providing assurance regarding the safety and quality of gluten-free products available in the market.</data>
      <data key="d2">d3ffabc46da9b238994a7769ffc8f6b7,dfb6e1826ded0b8ca7cf3304d1b75d1a</data>
