    <node id="EUROPEAN REGULATIONS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">European regulations govern the labeling and production standards for both ecological and organic products across member states. These regulations include specific guidelines for gluten-free certifications, ensuring that products meet established criteria for quality and safety.</data>
      <data key="d2">d3ffabc46da9b238994a7769ffc8f6b7,dfb6e1826ded0b8ca7cf3304d1b75d1a</data>
