    <node id="ITALY">
      <data key="d0">GEO</data>
      <data key="d1">Italy is a country located in Europe known for its rich cultural heritage and significant contributions to various fields, including health and nutrition. Research conducted in Italy has focused on dietary antioxidant capacity and its relationship with cancer risk, highlighting the country's commitment to advancing public health knowledge. Additionally, Italy is home to the Italian Celiac Association, which plays a crucial role in promoting gluten-free products by granting ELS certification, ensuring that consumers have access to safe and reliable food options.</data>
      <data key="d2">594e6f43e0098791036927da2623b2f5,d3ffabc46da9b238994a7769ffc8f6b7</data>
      <data key="d3">1687</data>
