    </node>
    <node id="ROUBENOFF R">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Roubenoff R is a researcher and author who has made significant contributions to the understanding of sarcopenia and its implications for the elderly. In addition to his work on sarcopenia, he is also involved in researching malnutrition syndromes and their clinical implications, highlighting the importance of nutrition in the health and well-being of older adults.</data>
      <data key="d2">628cd3e2664561301cbe6679f48c4bd3,933cfaece6287ed7626c5216a1e5c54d</data>
      <data key="d3">733</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
