    </node>
    <node id="GERIATRIC NUTRITIONAL ASSESSMENT">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Geriatric nutritional assessment focuses on evaluating the nutritional needs and status of elderly patients, ensuring they receive appropriate care.</data>
      <data key="d2">86d733befbaaebe4eccbc45db498a0b0</data>
      <data key="d3">693</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">8059</data>
      <data key="d7">9d4aea4cc09f4131b92a79945efd752d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="CIRCUNFERENCIA DEL BRAZO">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">The "CIRCUNFERENCIA DEL BRAZO" refers to a measurement utilized in nutritional assessment to evaluate muscle mass and overall nutritional status. This measurement is taken at the midpoint of the non-dominant arm, serving as an important indicator for assessing body composition.</data>
      <data key="d2">86d733befbaaebe4eccbc45db498a0b0,9562f39f9e78644164daeff3177a2f84</data>
      <data key="d3">695</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">2</data>
      <data key="d6">8060</data>
      <data key="d7">75aebf9bb9624fa5aae555026654cff7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="CIRCUNFERENCIA MUSCULAR DEL BRAZO">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">The "CIRCUNFERENCIA MUSCULAR DEL BRAZO" is a measurement used to assess the muscle mass of individuals, particularly in the context of nutritional evaluations. This measurement is significant as it can indicate changes in muscle mass, which may decrease in cases of malnutrition. Thus, the circumferential measurement of the arm serves as an important tool in evaluating an individual's nutritional status and overall health.</data>
      <data key="d2">61564a330848cb173088bd08e1a9a181,86d733befbaaebe4eccbc45db498a0b0</data>
      <data key="d3">693</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">2</data>
      <data key="d6">8061</data>
      <data key="d7">157e97fe4a1347e494b05d1934dad232</data>
    </node>
    <node id="PROTE&#205;NAS PLASM&#193;TICAS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">"PROTE&#205;NAS PLASM&#193;TICAS" se refiere a las prote&#237;nas presentes en el plasma sangu&#237;neo, cuya concentraci&#243;n es un indicador clave del estado del compartimento proteico visceral. Estas prote&#237;nas son fundamentales en la evaluaci&#243;n nutricional, ya que se miden durante las valoraciones nutricionales para determinar el estado nutricional de los pacientes.</data>
      <data key="d2">86d733befbaaebe4eccbc45db498a0b0,9562f39f9e78644164daeff3177a2f84</data>
      <data key="d3">1155</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">2</data>
      <data key="d6">8062</data>
      <data key="d7">743c12fe0ac448228529adc7cf11ac3d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="RBP">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">RBP, or retinol-binding protein, is a crucial protein that plays a significant role in the transport of vitamin A within the body. It binds to retinol, which is essential for nutritional assessment and overall health. RBP is characterized by its short half-life, indicating that it is rapidly metabolized in the body. This protein is vital for maintaining adequate levels of vitamin A, which is important for various physiological functions, including vision, immune response, and cellular communication.</data>
      <data key="d2">14039baea6555ffc156768e503ff0b90,d66eff5b0a0e16993c167d3a6ffef395</data>
      <data key="d3">684</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">2</data>
      <data key="d6">8063</data>
      <data key="d7">954b9a853e254c68b8c218c9b5d33d56</data>
    </node>
    <node id="CARDONA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Cardona is a method used for nutritional assessment in hospitalized patients.</data>
      <data key="d2">14039baea6555ffc156768e503ff0b90</data>
      <data key="d3">702</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">8064</data>
      <data key="d7">5618e9dc66554ee585ae3701a8450146</data>
    </node>
    <node id="UL&#205;BARRI">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Ul&#237;barri is an automated method for assessing nutritional risk.</data>
      <data key="d2">14039baea6555ffc156768e503ff0b90</data>
      <data key="d3">702</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">8065</data>
      <data key="d7">a6b5317bd035406fa8884767b784c5a9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="CHANG">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Chang is a diagnostic test for assessing nutritional status.</data>
      <data key="d2">14039baea6555ffc156768e503ff0b90</data>
      <data key="d3">702</data>
