      <data key="d6">8067</data>
      <data key="d7">07f15600bce647708030e9848486caa9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="ISOTOPIC DILUTION TECHNIQUES">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Isotopic dilution techniques are methods used to assess body composition and nutritional status.</data>
      <data key="d2">14039baea6555ffc156768e503ff0b90</data>
      <data key="d3">693</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">8068</data>
      <data key="d7">0439989600984a718d227639e36681a9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="BIOELECTRICAL IMPEDANCE">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Bioelectrical impedance is a method and technique utilized to assess body composition and nutritional status. It is particularly effective in evaluating body composition in malnourished patients, providing valuable insights into their nutritional health.</data>
      <data key="d2">14039baea6555ffc156768e503ff0b90,f5660be03d70d5dd506c197283dd79ae</data>
      <data key="d3">693</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">8069</data>
      <data key="d7">68813fc6621f4966b9799d2e2b5eb6e1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="ALIANZA M&#193;SNUTRIDOS">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Alianza M&#225;snutridos is a coalition in Spain dedicated to tackling malnutrition associated with disease through a multidisciplinary approach. The organization focuses on implementing screening processes at various levels of healthcare to identify and address malnutrition effectively. Additionally, Alianza M&#225;snutridos aims to raise awareness and integrate the issue of malnutrition into national and regional health strategies, ensuring that it is recognized as a critical component of public health initiatives.</data>
      <data key="d2">969bdfc6cc15b9089e96000addd87561,ba214f6f228224af19c5ca2dcc9c6772</data>
      <data key="d3">1158</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">17</data>
      <data key="d6">8070</data>
      <data key="d7">e48ccacad59e4e54a9c8ff3f8a643155</data>
    </node>
    <node id="SOCIEDAD ESPA&#209;OLA DE NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL Y PARENTERAL">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The "Sociedad Espa&#241;ola de Nutrici&#243;n Enteral y Parenteral" (SENPE) is a professional organization dedicated to the promotion and development of enteral and parenteral nutrition in Spain. It focuses on providing resources and support for clinical nutrition, particularly for patients with specific needs such as renal insufficiency and those undergoing hemodialysis. SENPE publishes guidelines and studies that address various aspects of nutritional support, including the administration and absorption of medications in patients receiving enteral nutrition. Through its efforts, SENPE aims to enhance the quality of nutritional care and ensure that healthcare professionals have access to the latest information and best practices in the field of enteral and parenteral nutrition.</data>
      <data key="d2">532561f62a972376f3f898b265623fc0,850572c4d004fc52f65ced939eda06bf,969bdfc6cc15b9089e96000addd87561,b6336e61e2a290a5c471fd72297d6093,ba214f6f228224af19c5ca2dcc9c6772,d1e7cd9fdc3093bc5902030d654d0763</data>
      <data key="d3">1158</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">6</data>
      <data key="d6">8071</data>
      <data key="d7">e6284cc2edcd45c39bcfa82715130ab6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="CONSEJO DE EUROPA">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The Consejo de Europa is an international organization dedicated to promoting human rights, democracy, and the rule of law across Europe. In 2003, the Consejo de Europa issued recommendations specifically addressing the issue of hospital malnutrition, which included the establishment of guidelines aimed at guiding future actions in this critical area.</data>
      <data key="d2">4b9cc8ae09d12c1bf2e3c9b103a1050a,ba214f6f228224af19c5ca2dcc9c6772</data>
      <data key="d3">1556</data>
