    <node id="NUTRITION DAY">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Nutrition Day is an initiative organized by ESPEN that focuses on evaluating the nutrition of patients admitted to hospitals in order to assess the prevalence of malnutrition. This initiative aims to raise awareness and address the issue of malnutrition across Europe, highlighting its significance in healthcare settings.</data>
      <data key="d2">969bdfc6cc15b9089e96000addd87561,ba214f6f228224af19c5ca2dcc9c6772</data>
