    </node>
    <node id="BRAUN">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Braun is a company recognized for its innovative contributions to health and personal care, particularly through the development of nutritional assessment tools. Additionally, Braun is a manufacturer that specializes in producing nutritional solutions, which encompass a range of products, including parenteral nutrition offerings. This dual focus on both assessment and nutritional solutions highlights Braun's commitment to enhancing health and well-being through advanced technology and quality products.</data>
      <data key="d2">2f5d9123a78d23b1bc3d9f06d7a53d78,45628dcc866de3617e83105d66f901ad</data>
