    <node id="RECORDATORIO DE 24 HORAS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">The "RECORDATORIO DE 24 HORAS" is a dietary assessment tool utilized to evaluate an individual's food intake, which is particularly important for managing obesity. This method involves individuals recalling all foods and beverages they have consumed over the past 24 hours. It serves as a retrospective dietary assessment technique that quantifies food and beverage intake, providing valuable insights into dietary habits and nutritional status.</data>
      <data key="d2">701eb4c24e94839def8d18882a2dda63,a4d8922d5e65304a84f8a61999f77933,f9aab8a2d805b64afaa1c261f3947869</data>
