      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">The "Cuestionario de Frecuencia de Consumo" is a survey method designed to evaluate how frequently specific foods are consumed within a defined time frame. It serves as a predefined questionnaire that assesses habitual food intake, allowing for a comprehensive analysis of dietary patterns. This tool is instrumental in measuring dietary intake over a specified period, providing valuable insights into individuals' eating habits.</data>
      <data key="d2">0c83fbbd4b26fbfe03a1df6d36025796,a4d8922d5e65304a84f8a61999f77933,f14ec70726a24a574ae5d437903fddb8</data>
