    <node id="IENVA">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">IENVA is an online platform and organization dedicated to providing individuals with tools for nutritional analysis and dietary record-keeping. It offers access to comprehensive food composition databases and nutritional information, enabling users to track their food intake and understand the nutritional composition of their meals. Additionally, IENVA features a food composition table and a nutritional analysis program that includes detailed reporting, making it a valuable resource for those looking to manage their diet effectively.</data>
      <data key="d2">6da89a24c60015649c1d669e4e23fb2d,701eb4c24e94839def8d18882a2dda63,91ec0cc70cd70254acbbebc425f84163</data>
