    <node id="SHIM ET AL.">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Shim et al. are researchers noted for their contributions to dietary assessment methodologies. In their 2014 study, they highlighted the effectiveness of the 24-hour recall method for evaluating dietary intake. Additionally, they provided valuable insights into the administration of dietary questionnaires, further enhancing the understanding of dietary assessment techniques.</data>
      <data key="d2">bbb1a87c3287956d3da7d37a9b24e8f3,f14ec70726a24a574ae5d437903fddb8</data>
      <data key="d3">1478</data>
