      <data key="d7">e939ece232d64b72b7c687215c0f2a01</data>
    </node>
    <node id="MARGETTS &amp; NELSON">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Margetts &amp; Nelson (1997) is a reference cited in discussions regarding the limitations of dietary assessment methods. They are recognized as researchers who have made significant contributions to the methodology of dietary assessment, enhancing the understanding and application of these methods in nutritional research.</data>
      <data key="d2">bbb1a87c3287956d3da7d37a9b24e8f3,f14ec70726a24a574ae5d437903fddb8</data>
