    <node id="LECHE ENTERA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">LECHE ENTERA, or whole milk, is a dairy product that is included in dietary plans and is also listed in food frequency questionnaires. It serves as a significant component in various nutritional guidelines, highlighting its importance in a balanced diet.</data>
      <data key="d2">8d7a18d8258ab74a0e56129f937a8a84,bbb1a87c3287956d3da7d37a9b24e8f3</data>
      <data key="d5">0</data>
