    </node>
    <node id="LECHE SEMIDESNATADA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">LECHE SEMIDESNATADA refers to semi-skimmed milk, which is a moderate-fat dairy product. It is commonly included in food frequency questionnaires, indicating its relevance in dietary assessments. This type of milk offers a balance between full-fat and skim milk, making it a popular choice for those seeking a lower fat option while still enjoying the taste and nutritional benefits of milk.</data>
      <data key="d2">5e5296bf59e1f2b0fbeace9cc0e62ef5,bbb1a87c3287956d3da7d37a9b24e8f3</data>
      <data key="d5">0</data>
      <data key="d6">8138</data>
      <data key="d7">a9d50b8f86474256bdf42b20a5b23fc0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="LECHE DESCREMADA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Leche descremada, also known as skim milk, is a lower-fat milk option that is commonly consumed. It is a dairy product that is often included in food frequency questionnaires, highlighting its relevance in dietary assessments.</data>
      <data key="d2">5e5296bf59e1f2b0fbeace9cc0e62ef5,bbb1a87c3287956d3da7d37a9b24e8f3</data>
      <data key="d5">0</data>
