    <node id="POLLO O PAVO SIN PIEL">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">The entity "POLLO O PAVO SIN PIEL" refers to chicken or turkey that is prepared without skin. This option is included in the food frequency questionnaire, indicating its relevance in dietary assessments. Additionally, skinless chicken or turkey is permitted in modified diets, making it a suitable choice for individuals seeking healthier protein options.</data>
      <data key="d2">347e3d175ef7f30e3dcad731f84fb375,bbb1a87c3287956d3da7d37a9b24e8f3</data>
      <data key="d5">0</data>
