    <node id="CARNE DE CORDERO">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">CARNE DE CORDERO, or lamb, is a type of meat that is noted for its higher phosphorus content compared to other meats, which makes it less recommended for certain dietary considerations. Despite this, lamb is included in food frequency questionnaires, indicating its relevance in dietary assessments and consumption patterns.</data>
      <data key="d2">26e7a15d14f527bbd2b99f7a7bc55d81,bbb1a87c3287956d3da7d37a9b24e8f3</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">8156</data>
