    <node id="CSIC">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The Spanish National Research Council (CSIC) is involved in the development of food composition tables.</data>
      <data key="d2">87cb06eed8a8c92c589d25ea2d5cfaec</data>
      <data key="d3">1445</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">8171</data>
      <data key="d7">c4ed88caa52e48b7891743e1b285979e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="TABLAS DE COMPOSICI&#211;N DE ALIMENTOS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">TABLAS DE COMPOSICI&#211;N DE ALIMENTOS, or Food Composition Tables, are comprehensive compilations of data that detail the nutritional composition of a wide variety of foods. These tables provide essential information regarding the nutritional content of foods, including specific nutrients such as phosphorus levels. They serve as a valuable resource for understanding the dietary contributions of different foods and are utilized in nutrition research, dietary planning, and food labeling.</data>
      <data key="d2">87cb06eed8a8c92c589d25ea2d5cfaec,ae1766e8ae855b3c79ad6d5fdefab1b0</data>
      <data key="d3">1445</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">3</data>
      <data key="d6">8172</data>
      <data key="d7">23c8fcfaafd7492fa959bb360deb52cd</data>
    </node>
    <node id="BASES DE DATOS DE ALIMENTOS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Food Databases are digital collections of nutritional information about food items.</data>
      <data key="d2">87cb06eed8a8c92c589d25ea2d5cfaec</data>
