    <node id="DIETA HOSPITALARIA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">"DIETA HOSPITALARIA" refers to a structured dietary plan specifically designed for patients in a hospital setting. This dietary protocol is crucial for patient recovery and management, as it focuses on meeting the nutritional needs and restrictions based on individual medical conditions. The planning of hospital diets involves careful consideration of various dietary restrictions and guidelines to ensure that patients receive proper nutrition, which is essential for their health management and overall recovery.</data>
      <data key="d2">47ba8105b81c59f81a9038446898d200,8d7a18d8258ab74a0e56129f937a8a84,aaef63df030ff97e66b358358491e6a5,c6406ac5c0c7b03d4ee61ca311fd783f</data>
