    <node id="FRUTA">
      <data key="d0">FOOD</data>
      <data key="d1">FRUTA refers to a variety of fruits that are included in dietary plans, specifically noted to exclude bananas. These fruits serve as a dessert option within the diet plan and are often incorporated into meals and snacks due to their nutritional benefits and natural sweetness.</data>
      <data key="d2">4b19145e0977ee48b7132c9915d8c284,5700f71dc6a101296f5bfec99b1e796f,8d7a18d8258ab74a0e56129f937a8a84</data>
