    <node id="TORTILLA DE CALABAC&#205;N">
      <data key="d0">FOOD</data>
      <data key="d1">Tortilla de Calabac&#237;n is a gluten-free zucchini omelet that is part of the gluten-free meal plan and included in dietary recommendations. This dish serves as a nutritious option within the second course selections for dinner, highlighting its versatility and suitability for those seeking gluten-free meal choices.</data>
