    <node id="DIETA SEMIL&#205;QUIDA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">The "DIETA SEMIL&#205;QUIDA" is recognized as the second step in dietary progression. It consists of a combination of liquid and pasty foods, which are designed to stimulate digestion more effectively than a strictly liquid diet. This dietary approach serves as a transitional phase, allowing individuals to gradually reintroduce more solid foods while still maintaining a focus on easily digestible options.</data>
      <data key="d2">4b19145e0977ee48b7132c9915d8c284,4d74cee5793710b781c0b83db2f27209</data>
      <data key="d3">46</data>
      <data key="d4">0</data>
      <data key="d5">4</data>
      <data key="d6">8306</data>
      <data key="d7">e00cb74fe70e490a8e0f2d6db76f0887</data>
    </node>
    <node id="DIETA SEMIBLANDA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">The "DIETA SEMIBLANDA" is a dietary phase that follows the semiliquid diet, characterized by the inclusion of soft foods that are easier to chew and digest. This diet serves as a transitional step in the progression of dietary intake, introducing solid foods while assessing the individual's tolerance to protein and encouraging the process of chewing.</data>
      <data key="d2">4b19145e0977ee48b7132c9915d8c284,4d74cee5793710b781c0b83db2f27209</data>
      <data key="d3">46</data>
      <data key="d4">0</data>
      <data key="d5">6</data>
      <data key="d6">8307</data>
      <data key="d7">bd27f6373d364b7ebfc94c1c387438d9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="DIETA BLANDA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">"Dieta blanda" is a dietary phase characterized by the inclusion of soft foods that are easy to digest, making it particularly suitable for patients recovering from surgery. It serves as a progression from the semi-soft diet and is indicated for individuals experiencing digestive alterations. This diet encompasses a variety of solid textures, ensuring that it meets the nutritional needs of those who may have difficulty with more complex foods.</data>
      <data key="d2">4b19145e0977ee48b7132c9915d8c284,4d74cee5793710b781c0b83db2f27209</data>
      <data key="d3">46</data>
      <data key="d4">0</data>
      <data key="d5">5</data>
      <data key="d6">8308</data>
      <data key="d7">0048c1440573497f88463bf07fc52e66</data>
    </node>
    <node id="GALLETAS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Galletas, commonly known as cookies, are a type of baked good that can vary significantly in their gluten content. While some galletas may be suitable for gluten-free diets, many traditional varieties contain gluten, making them unsuitable for individuals with celiac disease. Galletas are often consumed as a snack, providing enjoyment and energy, and they are included in various dietary recommendations. Nutritionally, galletas contain approximately 2 mg of iron per 100 grams. However, it is important to note that some galletas can be hard and may fragment easily, which poses risks for patients with dysphagia, a condition that affects swallowing. Overall, galletas are a versatile snack option, but considerations regarding gluten content and texture are essential for certain dietary needs.</data>
      <data key="d2">4b19145e0977ee48b7132c9915d8c284,7d2050a2481adc105bdebbcf2af1a173,8d7a18d8258ab74a0e56129f937a8a84,bd22bf95ac5fc6dc95539efb99c5b11a,e742c891694171ad455b038f416b7728,f713611b23199b8a9eb9c28377b9f128</data>
      <data key="d3">1874</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">3</data>
      <data key="d6">8309</data>
      <data key="d7">0ea0bc9751854986a767b8a126fa9136</data>
    </node>
    <node id="MERENDA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Merienda is a light meal or snack typically consumed in the afternoon. It often includes items such as galletas (cookies) and leche (milk). This tradition emphasizes a casual and enjoyable break during the day, allowing individuals to recharge with simple yet satisfying food options.</data>
      <data key="d2">4b19145e0977ee48b7132c9915d8c284</data>
      <data key="d3">1874</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">3</data>
      <data key="d6">8310</data>
      <data key="d7">9dc277b49cdd4e70b35a7a08344af5b6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="DESAYUNO">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Desayuno refers to breakfast, the first meal of the day, which is essential for providing the necessary energy and nutrients to start the day. This meal can include a variety of specific items tailored for dietary management and restrictions, making it suitable for patients with particular health needs. Common components of a traditional desayuno may include leche (milk), pan (bread), and mermelada (jam), as well as other foods such as dairy products, cereals, and fruit. These items are important for meeting nutritional requirements and ensuring a balanced diet.</data>
      <data key="d2">4b19145e0977ee48b7132c9915d8c284,8d7a18d8258ab74a0e56129f937a8a84,bd22bf95ac5fc6dc95539efb99c5b11a,f96dd2fbe3cd9aa6516522de8ed33145</data>
      <data key="d3">823</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">6</data>
      <data key="d6">8311</data>
      <data key="d7">85c5823332744214811f908f62ed5c17</data>
    </node>
    <node id="DIETA DE TRANSICI&#211;N">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">La dieta de transici&#243;n es el &#250;ltimo paso en la progresi&#243;n diet&#233;tica, que incluye todos los grupos de alimentos y resulta en una dieta variada y equilibrada.</data>
      <data key="d2">4d74cee5793710b781c0b83db2f27209</data>
      <data key="d3">46</data>
      <data key="d4">0</data>
      <data key="d5">2</data>
      <data key="d6">8312</data>
      <data key="d7">7617ab664135459094f22029810141a0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="DIETA DE F&#193;CIL MASTICACI&#211;N">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">The "DIETA DE F&#193;CIL MASTICACI&#211;N" is a specialized diet intended for patients who experience difficulties with chewing or salivating. This diet comprises a diverse, complete, and balanced array of soft-textured foods, ensuring that individuals can meet their nutritional needs despite their chewing challenges. It is specifically designed to accommodate the dietary requirements of those with masticatory or salivary issues, promoting both health and comfort in eating.</data>
      <data key="d2">1130db2843c569042990b711cf15d8ee,4d74cee5793710b781c0b83db2f27209</data>
      <data key="d3">1080</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">3</data>
      <data key="d6">8313</data>
      <data key="d7">427a68bfaa94424cbe22e40d14e16f15</data>
    </node>
    <node id="PUR&#201; DE VERDURA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">El pur&#233; de verdura es un alimento que se incluye en las dietas semil&#237;quidas y semiblandas, facilitando la digesti&#243;n y la masticaci&#243;n.</data>
      <data key="d2">4d74cee5793710b781c0b83db2f27209</data>
      <data key="d3">46</data>
      <data key="d4">0</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
