    <node id="QUESO FRESCO">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">QUESO FRESCO is a type of fresh cheese that is known for its soft and crumbly texture. It is often used in various culinary applications, particularly in Mexican cuisine. However, it is important to note that fresh cheese can be sticky, which may pose a risk for patients with dysphagia, a condition that affects swallowing. Therefore, caution should be exercised when serving QUESO FRESCO to individuals with this condition.</data>
      <data key="d2">26e7a15d14f527bbd2b99f7a7bc55d81,bd22bf95ac5fc6dc95539efb99c5b11a</data>
