    </node>
    <node id="PATATAS CHIPS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Patatas chips, commonly known as potato chips, are a popular snack food characterized by their high fat and salt content. While they are enjoyed by many for their taste and crunch, it is important to note that these chips can easily fragment, which poses a risk for individuals with swallowing difficulties.</data>
      <data key="d2">bd22bf95ac5fc6dc95539efb99c5b11a,eff56271e184ab2f11877bfab7f715c4</data>
      <data key="d5">0</data>
      <data key="d6">8323</data>
