    </node>
    <node id="BOMBONES RELLENOS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Filled chocolates that can release liquids when chewed, posing risks for patients with dysphagia.</data>
      <data key="d2">bd22bf95ac5fc6dc95539efb99c5b11a</data>
      <data key="d5">0</data>
      <data key="d6">8324</data>
      <data key="d7">ee4ab66bdda9478d8936842353896dc5</data>
    </node>
    <node id="ACEITUNAS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Aceitunas, or olives, are a staple in Mediterranean diets and are recognized for their numerous health benefits. They are rich in oleic acid, which contributes to their nutritional value and association with healthy eating patterns. While aceitunas can be enjoyed in various culinary applications, it is important to note that they may contain pits, which can pose a risk for individuals with swallowing difficulties. Overall, aceitunas are a versatile food that plays a significant role in Mediterranean cuisine.</data>
      <data key="d2">bd22bf95ac5fc6dc95539efb99c5b11a,e04e16f606e0bc5eeb59e2d5388ab061,eff56271e184ab2f11877bfab7f715c4</data>
      <data key="d3">1883</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">8325</data>
      <data key="d7">ec9c6db5a8c24abfadd631f74521b36b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="UVAS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">UVAS refers to grapes, a type of fruit that offers some dietary fiber. However, it is important to note that grapes can pose a choking hazard for patients with dysphagia, a condition that affects swallowing. Therefore, while UVAS can be a nutritious addition to the diet, caution should be exercised when they are consumed by individuals with swallowing difficulties.</data>
      <data key="d2">b2bdb1e00976001800583298f8dddc7a,bd22bf95ac5fc6dc95539efb99c5b11a</data>
      <data key="d5">0</data>
      <data key="d6">8326</data>
      <data key="d7">d24ee7d7dc7f4cd992efa8d9f0918d3b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="SAND&#205;A">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Sand&#237;a, commonly known as watermelon, is a type of fruit recognized for its high water content and sweetness. It is often enjoyed in various forms, including fresh slices, juiced, or incorporated into desserts. Additionally, Sand&#237;a contains a higher amount of galactose, which can be a consideration for certain dietary needs. It is important to note that watermelon can have seeds, which may pose a risk for individuals with swallowing difficulties.</data>
      <data key="d2">160d4259ba08a1bfcdc877b63a4c799d,5f60e39bc965632761d15273062b91fe,bd22bf95ac5fc6dc95539efb99c5b11a</data>
      <data key="d5">2</data>
      <data key="d6">8327</data>
      <data key="d7">8eadc3f2bf2b4361846b88a13ea3a157</data>
    </node>
    <node id="ESP&#193;RRAGOS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Esp&#225;rragos, or asparagus, are vegetables known for their nutritional benefits but also have certain characteristics that may pose risks for specific individuals. They contain hard fibers, which can be problematic for patients with dysphagia, a condition that makes swallowing difficult. Additionally, esp&#225;rragos have moderate purine levels, which can influence uric acid levels in the body, potentially affecting individuals with conditions such as gout. Therefore, while esp&#225;rragos can be a healthy addition to many diets, caution is advised for those with swallowing difficulties or issues related to uric acid.</data>
      <data key="d2">393fd6c0f1d43f0413a5b82d1dc0c2fc,bd22bf95ac5fc6dc95539efb99c5b11a</data>
      <data key="d5">0</data>
      <data key="d6">8328</data>
      <data key="d7">868b4513bb8940669351916a4b5e63bb</data>
    </node>
    <node id="PUERROS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Puerros, commonly known as leeks, are a type of vegetable that contribute to dietary fiber intake. However, they are characterized by having hard fibers, which may pose a risk for patients with dysphagia, a condition that affects swallowing. Therefore, while puerros can be a nutritious addition to a diet, caution should be exercised when consumed by individuals with swallowing difficulties.</data>
      <data key="d2">b2bdb1e00976001800583298f8dddc7a,bd22bf95ac5fc6dc95539efb99c5b11a</data>
      <data key="d5">0</data>
      <data key="d6">8329</data>
      <data key="d7">5b3974aafb2c45f283bc36e45d89a400</data>
    </node>
    <node id="FIBRAS DURAS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Hard fibers in foods that can pose risks for patients with swallowing difficulties.</data>
