    <node id="DIETA POBRE EN RESIDUO">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">The "DIETA POBRE EN RESIDUO" is a specialized dietary regimen aimed at minimizing fecal volume to reduce the risk of intestinal obstruction, particularly indicated for patients with specific medical conditions. This low-residue diet is designed to limit the amount of undigested food that passes through the intestines, making it particularly beneficial for individuals suffering from certain gastrointestinal disorders. By focusing on reducing residue, the diet helps manage symptoms and improve overall digestive health for those affected.</data>
      <data key="d2">8a7b2d5e0440750e36603c8d3f93a68a,8d7a18d8258ab74a0e56129f937a8a84</data>
