    <node id="ACELGA CON PATATA">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">"ACELGA CON PATATA" is a dish that consists of Swiss chard and potatoes. It is recognized for its inclusion in various dietary plans, making it a versatile option for those seeking healthy meal choices. Additionally, this dish is gluten-free, making it suitable for individuals following a gluten-free diet.</data>
