    <node id="GUISANTES">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Guisantes, commonly known as peas, are legumes that are valued for their sweet flavor and nutritional benefits. They are a gluten-free food, making them suitable for individuals following a gluten-free diet. Guisantes provide a notable amount of iron, offering 1.7 mg per 100 grams. Due to their versatility and health benefits, they are frequently included in various dietary plans.</data>
