    <node id="CAMPFR&#205;O FOOD GROUP">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Campofr&#237;o Food Group is a food company that specializes in the production and distribution of processed meat products. In addition to its core business, the company has also published works on hospital nutrition and food standards, indicating its commitment to promoting health and quality in food consumption.</data>
      <data key="d2">49279a0184d5222e806637f084f42c50,89e0e7fac6984f367ae1649e9eaab7d7</data>
