    <node id="D&#205;AZ DE SANTOS">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">D&#237;az de Santos is a prominent publishing company based in Spain, recognized for its extensive range of academic and professional publications. The company specializes in educational literature, with a particular focus on medical and nutritional topics. Among its notable works is the "Manual de Nutrici&#243;n Cl&#237;nica y Diet&#233;tica," which highlights its commitment to providing valuable resources in the field of nutrition. Overall, D&#237;az de Santos is well-regarded for its contributions to both academic and professional literature, particularly in the areas of health and education.</data>
      <data key="d2">477da86aa038212a1e2b555b5a854cba,49279a0184d5222e806637f084f42c50,89e0e7fac6984f367ae1649e9eaab7d7,e5542485c64706310c70513397de07f9</data>
