    </node>
    <node id="FOOD ALLERGIES">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Food allergies are adverse reactions to certain foods that must be documented and managed in a hospital setting to ensure patient safety.</data>
      <data key="d2">49279a0184d5222e806637f084f42c50</data>
      <data key="d5">0</data>
      <data key="d6">8441</data>
      <data key="d7">582917be49984adcb33faf3f0d53c013</data>
    </node>
    <node id="NUTRITIONAL SUPPLEMENTS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Nutritional supplements are additional nutrients provided to patients when their dietary intake is insufficient for their health needs. They are particularly recommended for patients post-bariatric surgery to ensure adequate protein and nutrient intake. These products are also intended to enhance the diet of individuals with specific health conditions, such as cancer and diabetes, to improve nutritional intake and support recovery. Nutritional supplements are commonly used in clinical settings for patients with specific nutritional needs, offering a means to provide essential vitamins, minerals, and trace elements that may be lacking in their regular diet. Overall, nutritional supplements play a crucial role in enhancing dietary intake and ensuring that individuals receive the necessary nutrients for optimal health.</data>
      <data key="d2">49279a0184d5222e806637f084f42c50,594e6f43e0098791036927da2623b2f5,69bfdb98603d3d8c4733cb795f4c82f3,8ad412c188e4086d686c217c6c5c5324,bb209dcfffac9c89dae0ad4ed2908d85,c879347903aabeef630597c99cff2275,eeb6e04f12698ee82912bdf775d79381</data>
      <data key="d3">1012</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">6</data>
      <data key="d6">8442</data>
      <data key="d7">4464bc0bff2e490da4d5d69627fa3500</data>
    </node>
    <node id="HYPERCHOLESTEROLEMIA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Hypercholesterolemia is a condition of elevated cholesterol levels in the blood, which may require dietary modifications.</data>
      <data key="d2">49279a0184d5222e806637f084f42c50</data>
      <data key="d5">0</data>
      <data key="d6">8443</data>
