    </node>
    <node id="FOOD INTOLERANCES">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Food intolerances refer to adverse reactions to specific foods that do not engage the immune system. These intolerances often require individuals to make dietary modifications to avoid discomfort and other related symptoms.</data>
      <data key="d2">49279a0184d5222e806637f084f42c50,fa4851ce095f27e98350dcb826e5b09c</data>
