    <node id="ALFONSO VIDAL CASARIEGO">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Alfonso Vidal Casariego is a distinguished medical professional specializing in endocrinology and nutrition, with a significant focus on the treatment of obesity. He serves as a researcher in clinical nutrition at the Clinical Nutrition Unit of the University Hospital of Le&#243;n. In addition to his clinical work, Alfonso Vidal Casariego is also an author in the field of clinical nutrition and dietetics, contributing valuable insights and knowledge to the discipline.</data>
      <data key="d2">89e0e7fac6984f367ae1649e9eaab7d7,9df735d7829302712be068a5d1b1540b,c879347903aabeef630597c99cff2275</data>
