    <node id="ALICIA CALLEJA FERN&#193;NDEZ">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Alicia Calleja Fern&#225;ndez is a medical professional specializing in endocrinology and nutrition, with a focus on the treatment of obesity. She is also a researcher in the field of clinical nutrition and dietetics, affiliated with the Clinical Nutrition Unit at the University Hospital of Le&#243;n. Through her work, she contributes significantly to advancing knowledge and practices in nutrition and obesity management.</data>
