    <node id="FESNAD-SEEDO">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">FESNAD-SEEDO is a consensus organization dedicated to outlining dietary management strategies for obesity. It provides nutritional recommendations aimed at the prevention and treatment of overweight and obesity in adults. Through its guidelines, FESNAD-SEEDO seeks to promote effective dietary practices to address these significant health concerns.</data>
