    <node id="AMERICAN ASSOCIATION OF CLINICAL ENDOCRINOLOGIST">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The American Association of Clinical Endocrinologists is a professional organization dedicated to advancing the field of endocrinology. It plays a crucial role in providing guidelines for the diagnosis and treatment of obesity and related conditions. Additionally, the organization offers alternative classifications for obesity that take into account body mass index (BMI) and associated comorbidities, thereby enhancing the understanding and management of this complex health issue.</data>
      <data key="d2">20863ac06779722abc2cbc2dd023777e,f9aab8a2d805b64afaa1c261f3947869</data>
