    <node id="WEIGHT MANAGEMENT">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Weight management involves strategies and practices aimed at maintaining a healthy weight, particularly in the context of obesity. It refers to the process of adopting long-term lifestyle modifications to achieve and sustain a healthy weight. This encompasses various approaches, including dietary changes, physical activity, and behavioral adjustments, all designed to promote overall health and prevent weight-related issues.</data>
      <data key="d2">0381a11415dca4cfeda74f1de745d6ae,20863ac06779722abc2cbc2dd023777e</data>
