      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The American College of Endocrinology is a professional organization dedicated to the treatment and management of endocrine disorders, with a particular emphasis on obesity. It collaborates with the American Association of Clinical Endocrinologists to develop and provide guidelines for effective obesity management, ensuring that healthcare professionals have access to the latest standards and practices in the field.</data>
