    <node id="APNEA DEL SUE&#209;O">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">APNEA DEL SUE&#209;O is a condition characterized by repeated interruptions in breathing during sleep, which can significantly affect overall health. It is often associated with obesity, making it a relevant consideration in the context of very low-calorie diets (VLCD). This relationship highlights the importance of addressing sleep apnea in individuals who are managing obesity, as it can be a comorbid condition that complicates health outcomes.</data>
      <data key="d2">3926ed628d3d5919b8a65e44fffbc3b9,f9aab8a2d805b64afaa1c261f3947869</data>
