    <node id="CL&#205;NICA MAYO">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Cl&#237;nica Mayo, also known as Mayo Clinic, is a prominent medical institution recognized for its extensive research and innovative treatment protocols. Among its notable contributions to medical science is the MELD score, a critical tool used for assessing liver disease severity. In addition to its medical research, Cl&#237;nica Mayo offers a variety of dietary programs, some of which are categorized as miracle diets, reflecting its commitment to holistic health and wellness.</data>
      <data key="d2">1911ce26c118381473eccb438875b29c,64347a9be918a67f786cbdf9f9db9c8a</data>
      <data key="d3">1790</data>
