    <node id="DIETAS MILAGRO">
      <data key="d0" />
      <data key="d1">"DIETAS MILAGRO" refers to miracle diets, which are weight loss plans that claim to deliver rapid results. However, these diets often lack scientific backing and may pose various health risks to individuals who follow them.</data>
      <data key="d2">64347a9be918a67f786cbdf9f9db9c8a,89ca65c4bdc30027c9c9ed1e1b442939</data>
