    </node>
    <node id="CENTRO DE SALUD LUCERO">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Centro de Salud Lucero is a primary healthcare center located in Madrid, dedicated to providing essential health services to the community. This facility, also referred to as the Lucero Health Center, plays a vital role in delivering medical services to the residents of the area, ensuring accessible healthcare for all.</data>
      <data key="d2">89ca65c4bdc30027c9c9ed1e1b442939,b92f47a5ea6a962826cedb992b832f70</data>
      <data key="d3">834</data>
