      <data key="d1">S&#237;ntomas depresivos refers to depressive symptoms that may occur in patients taking fentermina and topiramato.)&lt;|COMPLETE|&gt;</data>
      <data key="d2">af631316aa8584710d755d8c59e851b6</data>
