    </node>
    <node id="XENDOS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">XENDOS is a randomized double-blind study involving 3,305 non-diabetic obese patients, aimed at evaluating the effectiveness of the weight loss drug Xenical in preventing diabetes. The study specifically focuses on the prevention of diabetes among obese individuals through the administration of this medication.</data>
      <data key="d2">1cc73922b5279318629905f2bdc66906,488970234520652b063db88e8346031c</data>
      <data key="d3">1432</data>
