    </node>
    <node id="DPP-IV">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Dipeptidyl peptidase-IV (DPP-IV) is an enzyme that degrades GLP-1, and liraglutida is resistant to its action.</data>
      <data key="d2">f44811ae5b3e9dab0f295efe8842767a</data>
