    </node>
    <node id="ANOREXIA NERVOSA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Anorexia Nervosa (AN) is a serious psychological condition and a specific type of restrictive eating disorder characterized by an intense fear of gaining weight and a distorted body image. This disorder leads individuals to significantly restrict their food intake, resulting in severe weight loss and various health complications. The intense fear of weight gain and the distorted perception of body image are central to the condition, making it a complex and challenging disorder to treat. Anorexia Nervosa is contraindicated for the use of certain treatments, such as BN, highlighting the need for specialized care in managing this serious eating disorder.</data>
      <data key="d2">0692eb750371d46b9fff71ec305df6ce,203ff7a2671a44d48a1a326f469c5543,341d121c4c1cc1e4fb942e4b23f6931b,770e8796aac9c96d967ef99d1f307e06,bb6a2caec3fa27e00fc1044b17147ccb,f44811ae5b3e9dab0f295efe8842767a</data>
      <data key="d3">1588</data>
