    </node>
    <node id="EPILEPSY">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Epilepsy is a neurological disorder characterized by recurrent seizures. It may be precipitated by the use of certain substances, such as BN, particularly in patients who are on anticomicial drugs. In addition to traditional medical treatments, dietary therapies, including the ketogenic diet, are being explored as potential treatments for managing epilepsy.</data>
      <data key="d2">55b85a76a2c3d515bd3fe6137255abac,f44811ae5b3e9dab0f295efe8842767a</data>
      <data key="d3">577</data>
