    </node>
    <node id="CART">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">CART (Cocaine and Amphetamine-Regulated Transcript) is a neuropeptide that plays a role in the regulation of appetite and energy homeostasis.</data>
      <data key="d2">419657aaa9492bbff3d218e00d2b0fd4</data>
