    <node id="OBESITY SOCIETY">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The Obesity Society is a professional organization dedicated to the study and treatment of obesity. It plays a significant role in advancing the understanding of obesity and has contributed to the development of guidelines for managing this condition. Through its efforts, the organization aims to improve the health and well-being of individuals affected by obesity.</data>
      <data key="d2">1cc73922b5279318629905f2bdc66906,22a361e57659e072600d6575631f6160</data>
      <data key="d3">1544</data>
