      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Apovian CM is a prominent researcher and author specializing in clinical practice guidelines for obesity management. In addition to their contributions to clinical guidelines, Apovian CM is actively involved in the COR-II Study Group, which conducted a randomized, phase 3 trial investigating the effects of naltrexone SR/bupropion SR on weight and obesity-related risk factors. Through these efforts, Apovian CM plays a significant role in advancing the understanding and treatment of obesity.</data>
