    <node id="COR-I">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">COR-I is a multicenter, randomized, double-blind, placebo-controlled, phase 3 clinical trial designed to study the effects of naltrexone combined with bupropion on weight loss in overweight and obese adults. The trial specifically investigates the efficacy of bupropion, alongside naltrexone, in promoting weight loss in this population.</data>
      <data key="d2">1cc73922b5279318629905f2bdc66906,3eddab8e3e55bbd7e6cbcd3776fecb29</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
