    </node>
    <node id="COR-II">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">COR-II is a randomized, phase 3 trial designed to investigate the effects of naltrexone SR (sustained release) and bupropion SR on weight management and obesity-related risk factors. The trial aims to assess the efficacy of this combination treatment in promoting weight loss and improving associated health risks.</data>
      <data key="d2">1cc73922b5279318629905f2bdc66906,3eddab8e3e55bbd7e6cbcd3776fecb29</data>
