    <node id="BILIOPANCREATIC DIVERSION">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Biliopancreatic diversion is a surgical procedure primarily aimed at treating obesity. It is classified as a type of weight-loss surgery that entails the removal of a portion of the stomach, along with the rerouting of the intestines. This procedure has been the subject of various studies, highlighting its significance in the management of obesity.</data>
