    <node id="POLISAC&#193;RIDOS INDIGERIBLES">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Indigestible polysaccharides are substances that require microbiota to convert them into absorbable monosaccharides and short-chain fatty acids (SCFA), playing a role in energy extraction.</data>
      <data key="d2">ffdc08ec09899ab7dfa255af4cecac1c</data>
