    <node id="TURNBAUGH PJ">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Turnbaugh PJ is a prominent researcher recognized for his significant contributions to the understanding of the human microbiome and its impact on health. He has conducted important experiments that demonstrate the causal relationship between microbiota and obesity, highlighting how microbial ecology is associated with this condition. Through his work, Turnbaugh PJ has advanced the field of microbiome research, particularly in relation to its implications for obesity and overall health.</data>
      <data key="d2">05360f0d7332f748b436b98d64e4eeb7,2582e3a8c599c599624ee99e7754a7e0,b657f30c2c5c24c0d4bb1ecb836c402d</data>
