    </node>
    <node id="ALIIVIBRIO">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Aliivibrio is a genus of bacteria that has been positively associated with obesity and may have implications for gut health. This connection suggests that Aliivibrio could play a significant role in understanding the relationship between gut microbiota and obesity, highlighting its potential importance in studies related to metabolic health and dietary impacts.</data>
      <data key="d2">05360f0d7332f748b436b98d64e4eeb7,959173b0e9d9c5ea2edabff579240462</data>
