    <node id="MARINOMONAS">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Marinomonas is a genus of bacteria that has been positively associated with obesity and has been studied for its potential effects on health. This genus is of interest in the field of microbiology due to its implications in understanding the relationship between gut microbiota and metabolic conditions.</data>
      <data key="d2">05360f0d7332f748b436b98d64e4eeb7,959173b0e9d9c5ea2edabff579240462</data>
