    <node id="LACTOBACILLUS REUTERI">
      <data key="d0" />
      <data key="d1">Lactobacillus reuteri is a type of beneficial bacteria that is found in the gut microbiota. It has been associated with various studies related to obesity, highlighting its potential role in influencing metabolic health and weight management.</data>
      <data key="d2">959173b0e9d9c5ea2edabff579240462,e7a633f303c813ee9f0b7f55e7a0968a</data>
