      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The International Journal of Obesity is a scientific journal dedicated to publishing research related to obesity and weight loss. It emphasizes studies that explore the impact of obesity on health, contributing to the understanding of this significant public health issue.</data>
