    <node id="WORLD JOURNAL OF GASTROENTEROLOGY">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The World Journal of Gastroenterology is a peer-reviewed journal dedicated to advancing research in the field of gastroenterology. It focuses on a wide range of topics related to gastrointestinal diseases and treatments, including the study of gut microbiota and its connection to obesity. The journal also covers research on gastrointestinal health, emphasizing areas such as nutrition support in pancreatitis. By publishing articles on various aspects of gastroenterology, the World Journal of Gastroenterology serves as a vital resource for researchers and healthcare professionals interested in the latest findings and developments in gastrointestinal health and diseases.</data>
      <data key="d2">1d7ac56ec0eb2f724386a39de8551134,242fceb82929615af653d9f8574b0ef5,60d24674009cc67523f1ecdc63975fdc,7a389f3625ba13c74ce52213197b01ae,c3c8c4edabc77ed1f0a834676de2939c,e7a633f303c813ee9f0b7f55e7a0968a</data>
