    <node id="HEALTHY DIET">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">A healthy diet is crucial for managing diabetes, as it focuses on balanced nutrition to maintain stable blood sugar levels. It is essential for diabetic patients to achieve glycemic control and promote overall health. A healthy diet encompasses a variety of foods that provide necessary nutrients, helping to maintain or improve overall health.</data>
