    <node id="CALOR&#205;AS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">CALOR&#205;AS refers to the units of energy that are essential for nutritional needs in patients. It represents the energy content in food, which plays a critical role in managing diabetes through diet. Additionally, calor&#237;as are a measure of energy that the body obtains from food, and their appropriate intake is fundamental for maintaining nutritional status in patients with renal diseases.</data>
      <data key="d2">2c60ced31055ac58d76da9c1e90c8e9d,ab9a942f3aa9ca3eb88bcd26fcd60ddb,c07baf818737d704c290ca0f5eefd30f,c958206b5546e8b46ab48b3f50e60611</data>
