    <node id="ASPARTAMO">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Aspartame (E951), commonly referred to as Aspartamo, is a low-calorie artificial sweetener widely utilized in a variety of food products and beverages. It is particularly noted in dietary recommendations for individuals with diabetes, as it provides a sweet taste without the added calories associated with sugar.</data>
      <data key="d2">b1698ec972215d493ab6114914dde2a4,c958206b5546e8b46ab48b3f50e60611</data>
      <data key="d3">870</data>
