    </node>
    <node id="SUCRALOSA">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Sucralosa, also known as sucralose (E955), is a non-caloric sweetener that serves as a chlorinated derivative of sucrose. It is widely utilized in various food products and is particularly relevant in the context of dietary management for diabetes, offering a sweetening option without contributing calories.</data>
      <data key="d2">b1698ec972215d493ab6114914dde2a4,c958206b5546e8b46ab48b3f50e60611</data>
