    </node>
    <node id="TAUMATINA">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Taumatina is a natural sweetener derived from the katemfe fruit, recognized for its intense sweetness. It is often mentioned in dietary recommendations for diabetes management, highlighting its potential benefits for individuals seeking healthier alternatives to sugar. As a natural sweetener, Taumatina (also known as Thaumatin, E957) serves as a suitable option for those looking to reduce sugar intake while still enjoying sweet flavors.</data>
      <data key="d2">b1698ec972215d493ab6114914dde2a4,c958206b5546e8b46ab48b3f50e60611</data>
