    </node>
    <node id="ESTEVIA">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Estevia is a natural sweetener that is particularly relevant in the context of dietary management for diabetes. It is derived from the leaves of the Stevia rebaudiana plant and is known by its food additive code E960. Estevia serves as a sugar substitute, providing a sweetening option that can help individuals manage their sugar intake while still enjoying sweet flavors.</data>
      <data key="d2">b1698ec972215d493ab6114914dde2a4,c958206b5546e8b46ab48b3f50e60611</data>
