    <node id="CHROMIUM">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Chromium is a trace mineral that has garnered attention for its potential role in enhancing insulin sensitivity, particularly in individuals with diabetes. It is recognized as an essential nutrient, with recommended daily intake levels specified in dietary guidelines. This mineral, often referred to as "Cromo," plays a significant role in metabolic processes and is important for overall health.</data>
