      <data key="d1">Franz MJ is a prominent researcher and co-author of the American Diabetes Association's nutrition therapy recommendations for diabetes management. He is recognized for his expertise in evidence-based nutrition principles and has made significant contributions to the field of diabetes treatment and prevention.</data>
