    <node id="KROMHOUT D">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Kromhout D is a researcher known for his significant contributions to the field of nutrition and cardiovascular health. He is involved in the Seven Countries Study, which investigates the impact of dietary fats on heart disease mortality. Additionally, Kromhout D has conducted research examining the relationship between n-3 fatty acids and cardiovascular events specifically in post-myocardial infarction patients who have diabetes. His work highlights the importance of dietary components in managing heart health and preventing cardiovascular diseases.</data>
      <data key="d2">70715c061c27ab1993ef057601f5489d,e032cf926bee7048e207a0e28604f60e</data>
