    <node id="KRIS-ETHERTON PM">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Kris-Etherton PM is a prominent researcher and author known for his extensive studies on the impact of fish consumption and omega-3 fatty acids on cardiovascular disease. His research also delves into the effects of individual fatty acids on plasma lipids and lipoproteins, contributing valuable insights to the understanding of dietary influences on heart health.</data>
      <data key="d2">70715c061c27ab1993ef057601f5489d,f2b8b21255397ebbaf2b5d66ff6bde88</data>
