    <node id="DIETARY APPROACHES TO STOP HYPERTENSION (DASH)">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">The DASH diet is a dietary plan aimed at reducing blood pressure and improving overall health, which may be relevant for individuals with diabetes mellitus.</data>
      <data key="d2">3b21a011b73cb6fe2bb548f624a8c45c</data>
      <data key="d3">1246</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">9320</data>
      <data key="d7">e4c9f9ceb6ab486bbc4aa5930c6d60cc</data>
    </node>
    <node id="DIETOTHERAPY">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Dietotherapy is the use of diet to treat or manage health conditions, particularly relevant for individuals with diabetes mellitus.</data>
      <data key="d2">3b21a011b73cb6fe2bb548f624a8c45c</data>
      <data key="d3">1246</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">9321</data>
      <data key="d7">b0820e92239544db96640444f9e02c99</data>
    </node>
    <node id="LACTATION">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Lactation is the period after childbirth during which a mother produces milk, and it is recommended for women with diabetes as it can help lower blood sugar levels.</data>
      <data key="d2">27f06efb5e9ac8bbc3f8bd31ee5a2777</data>
      <data key="d3">870</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">9322</data>
      <data key="d7">ae23359ad9584f33ab024b9384339b3e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="VEGETARIAN DIETS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Vegetarian diets, when well-planned, can be suitable for individuals with diabetes, offering health benefits such as lower saturated fat intake.</data>
      <data key="d2">27f06efb5e9ac8bbc3f8bd31ee5a2777</data>
      <data key="d3">870</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">9323</data>
      <data key="d7">10b4a348e9994161a0a4638eaadf7bae</data>
    </node>
    <node id="CALORIES">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">CALORIES refer to a measure of energy provided by food and nutritional products, which is essential for individuals requiring additional energy intake. Managing caloric intake is particularly crucial for individuals with diabetes, as it plays a significant role in their health management across different life stages, including pregnancy and old age. Additionally, CALORIES are the focus of a multicentre, randomised controlled trial that compares the clinical effectiveness and cost-effectiveness of early nutritional support delivered via the parenteral route versus the enteral route in critically ill patients. This trial aims to enhance understanding of how caloric support can be optimized in critical care settings.</data>
      <data key="d2">27f06efb5e9ac8bbc3f8bd31ee5a2777,77c2b5963fab84c30e6eb596b49336bf,ceb66a898fed371e013171c43a87e1d1</data>
      <data key="d3">688</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">8</data>
      <data key="d6">9324</data>
      <data key="d7">e47184b7724944b48571feeee5bbc2a9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="RAMAD&#193;N">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Ramad&#225;n is a holy month in the Islamic calendar during which Muslims fast from dawn until sunset, impacting dietary habits and glucose management for those with diabetes.</data>
      <data key="d2">62afbb83c3f69bd45bf24467ac5b47b8</data>
      <data key="d3">151</data>
      <data key="d4">1</data>
      <data key="d5">3</data>
      <data key="d6">9325</data>
      <data key="d7">41d232c6f8a2401a92d5b5277f9e106a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="COLEGIO AMERICANO DE MEDICINA DEL DEPORTE">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The American College of Sports Medicine is an organization that provides guidelines and recommendations for sports medicine and nutrition.</data>
      <data key="d2">62afbb83c3f69bd45bf24467ac5b47b8</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">9326</data>
      <data key="d7">554efd7079a04e3f9fea895187128a3a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="ASOCIACIONES AMERICANA Y CANADIENSE DE DIET&#201;TICA">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The American and Canadian Dietetic Associations are professional organizations that provide dietary guidelines and recommendations for nutrition.</data>
      <data key="d2">62afbb83c3f69bd45bf24467ac5b47b8</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">9327</data>
      <data key="d7">46b2afbb5d6a43a192401a7e4e1f06e7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="SEHRI">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Sehri is a pre-dawn meal consumed by Muslims during Ramadan to prepare for the day's fast.</data>
      <data key="d2">62afbb83c3f69bd45bf24467ac5b47b8</data>
      <data key="d3">151</data>
      <data key="d4">1</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">9328</data>
      <data key="d7">fa2d24c770e54f1eab7c9b9da4efeb27</data>
    </node>
    <node id="IFTARI">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Iftari is the meal that breaks the fast at sunset during Ramadan, often rich in sweets and balanced foods.</data>
      <data key="d2">62afbb83c3f69bd45bf24467ac5b47b8</data>
      <data key="d3">151</data>
      <data key="d4">1</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">9329</data>
      <data key="d7">be1c25b810814aa2824866c3722ef76c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="KARELA">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Karela is a mixture of vegetables and garlic used by some traditional healers, believed to have hypoglycemic effects.</data>
      <data key="d2">62afbb83c3f69bd45bf24467ac5b47b8</data>
      <data key="d3">1031</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">9330</data>
      <data key="d7">432cd2561281475b8b52b2323f19910a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="PERSONAS VEGETARIANAS">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Vegetarians are individuals who do not consume meat and may require specific dietary considerations for health management.</data>
      <data key="d2">62afbb83c3f69bd45bf24467ac5b47b8</data>
      <data key="d3">1031</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">2</data>
      <data key="d6">9331</data>
      <data key="d7">70c7b4acfc214b33a09424c6dabcca5e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="PRODUCTOS ENRIQUECIDOS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Enriched products are foods that have been fortified with additional nutrients, such as vitamin B12 and vitamin D, to support health.</data>
      <data key="d2">62afbb83c3f69bd45bf24467ac5b47b8</data>
      <data key="d3">870</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">9332</data>
      <data key="d7">9f0b4bc1d2774adda5cd70539b90eb1b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="COMIT&#201; OL&#205;MPICO INTERNACIONAL">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The Comit&#233; Ol&#237;mpico Internacional (COI) is an organization that plays a crucial role in the realm of sports nutrition and performance. It is responsible for setting protein intake guidelines specifically tailored for athletes involved in both strength and endurance sports. In addition to these protein intake recommendations, the COI provides comprehensive guidelines and consensus statements that address various aspects of sports nutrition, ensuring that athletes have access to the necessary information to optimize their performance.</data>
      <data key="d2">043ed163c427b880fe39884076cae7ea,dcb97f7ffdb0aea3051bdf53e04bcc29</data>
      <data key="d3">1594</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">3</data>
      <data key="d6">9333</data>
      <data key="d7">c29c4077a8f44023b7efa3ed3195fff4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="SUPLEMENTOS DE AMINO&#193;CIDOS Y PROTE&#205;NAS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Suplementos de amino&#225;cidos y prote&#237;nas are products that athletes may use to enhance performance, but the necessity of such supplements is questioned by the Comit&#233; Ol&#237;mpico Internacional.</data>
      <data key="d2">043ed163c427b880fe39884076cae7ea</data>
      <data key="d3">1602</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">2</data>
      <data key="d6">9334</data>
      <data key="d7">eca13e8de45e4b4689233e8516628ea7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="ALIMENTOS ERGOG&#201;NICOS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Alimentos ergog&#233;nicos are substances that are believed to improve physical performance without being toxic, though their effectiveness is not clearly demonstrated.</data>
      <data key="d2">043ed163c427b880fe39884076cae7ea</data>
      <data key="d3">1602</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">2</data>
      <data key="d6">9335</data>
      <data key="d7">705d9e5bf21e4abb9869706529d0feec</data>
    </node>
    <node id="CAFE&#205;NA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Cafe&#237;na is a medication and a naturally occurring alkaloid that has notable effects on the central nervous system. It can decrease the stimulating effect on this system, which may seem counterintuitive given its common use as a stimulant. Additionally, Cafe&#237;na is recognized for its potential to reduce the incidence of hypoglycemia during and after exercise when consumed prior to physical activity. This makes it a popular choice among athletes, as it is often used to enhance performance and endurance in various physical activities. Overall, Cafe&#237;na serves as an ergogenic aid, improving athletic performance and physical capacity.</data>
      <data key="d2">043ed163c427b880fe39884076cae7ea,04f886244ff7d736eb270f175d6b120e,3e8ab018917854d76a0137102e0392bd,fae6538f87888794da1ff0aaf0d842fe</data>
      <data key="d3">1748</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">8</data>
      <data key="d6">9336</data>
      <data key="d7">bc62bdf52728419da2f1ef4ad479159d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="CARBOHIDRATOS">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Carbohidratos, or carbohydrates, are essential nutrients that play a crucial role in providing energy for the human body. They are organic compounds predominantly found in cereals and are considered a major energy source in the human diet. Carbohidratos are classified as macronutrients that are easily absorbed in the small intestine, particularly within the first 100 centimeters. Their intake is especially important for individuals with diabetes, as it is critical for managing energy levels, particularly during exercise.</data>
      <data key="d2">06ffde2dc989dcf66c55a8058f4f51d9,21339c051dc2f47471026673b3ac6436,281c46dd2bcde6e6fbb1505ed667b0e9,638446780cdd61df83a06944c4e15c15</data>
      <data key="d3">1740</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">4</data>
      <data key="d6">9337</data>
      <data key="d7">a19985d64e494bf6bfa304e5fefc8f4d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="EHH">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">EHH, or hyperglycemic hyperosmolar non-ketotic state, is a severe complication of diabetes. It is characterized by extremely high blood sugar levels without the presence of ketones, and it is often observed in elderly patients.</data>
      <data key="d2">ac2955cad85e541f3b61de2f4df0a3a9,eeb6e04f12698ee82912bdf775d79381</data>
      <data key="d3">876</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">4</data>
      <data key="d6">9338</data>
      <data key="d7">3edca6462cd742d19157d2ccd64ac189</data>
    </node>
    <node id="SUPLEMENTOS DE HIDRATOS DE CARBONO">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Carbohydrate supplements are used to provide quick energy and prevent hypoglycemia during physical activities for individuals with diabetes.</data>
      <data key="d2">ac2955cad85e541f3b61de2f4df0a3a9</data>
      <data key="d3">1783</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">4</data>
      <data key="d6">9339</data>
      <data key="d7">a22774c6c3644c559774eff552128692</data>
    </node>
    <node id="MONITORIZACI&#211;N GLUC&#201;MICA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Glycemic monitoring is essential for individuals with diabetes to track blood sugar levels and prevent complications such as hypoglycemia.</data>
      <data key="d2">ac2955cad85e541f3b61de2f4df0a3a9</data>
      <data key="d3">876</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">3</data>
      <data key="d6">9340</data>
      <data key="d7">b408d4b2ebdc47f6ab104937edb5e936</data>
    </node>
    <node id="CARBOHIDRATOS DE ABSORCI&#211;N LENTA">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Slow-absorbing carbohydrates are recommended for individuals with diabetes to help maintain stable blood sugar levels and prevent hypoglycemia.</data>
      <data key="d2">ac2955cad85e541f3b61de2f4df0a3a9</data>
      <data key="d3">1783</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">9341</data>
      <data key="d7">0d3796ff09394870853a0aef0129374a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="NICE-SUGAR STUDY">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">The NICE-SUGAR study investigated the effects of intensive glucose control in critically ill patients, revealing increased mortality rates with strict control.</data>
      <data key="d2">eeb6e04f12698ee82912bdf775d79381</data>
      <data key="d3">1724</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">9342</data>
      <data key="d7">db483c83f4c9415fbc9e62ef6edcd7ec</data>
    </node>
    <node id="HYPERGLYCEMIA CONTROL">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Hyperglycemia control involves the management of blood glucose levels in both critically ill patients and diabetic individuals to prevent adverse outcomes and complications. This process is crucial for maintaining optimal health and reducing the risk of serious health issues associated with elevated blood sugar levels. By effectively regulating blood glucose, healthcare providers aim to improve patient outcomes and enhance overall well-being.</data>
      <data key="d2">a66b01654a2f495559fd1a24efc0e64e,eeb6e04f12698ee82912bdf775d79381</data>
      <data key="d3">1724</data>
