    <node id="METZGER BE">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Metzger BE is a prominent researcher recognized for his significant contributions to the field of gestational diabetes mellitus. He is a key author of the summary and recommendations from the Fifth International Workshop-Conference on Gestational Diabetes Mellitus. Additionally, Metzger BE played a vital role in the development of the International Association of Diabetes and Pregnancy Study Groups recommendations, specifically focusing on the diagnosis and classification of hyperglycemia in pregnancy. His work has been influential in shaping guidelines and practices related to diabetes management during pregnancy.</data>
