    <node id="AMERICAN COLLEGE OF SPORTS MEDICINE">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The American College of Sports Medicine is a professional organization dedicated to the fields of sports medicine and exercise science. It plays a crucial role in providing guidelines and position statements that emphasize the importance of exercise and health, particularly concerning diabetes. Additionally, the organization offers specific recommendations on physical activity and nutrition tailored for individuals with diabetes, aiming to enhance their overall health and well-being.</data>
      <data key="d2">a4b144210b0a4b654a260ebc394de0af,cd2217af0cd2e70226661f038043911b</data>
