    <node id="HOSPITAL UNIVERSITARIO INSULAR DE GRAN CANARIA">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The Hospital Universitario Insular de Gran Canaria is a healthcare institution situated in Las Palmas de Gran Canaria. It specializes in endocrinology and nutrition services, and is also involved in research related to these fields. This institution plays a significant role in providing specialized medical care and advancing knowledge in endocrinology and nutrition.</data>
      <data key="d2">4c4d1882f0ac14b7c55941ec1c17b650,9f0dc667db1447b9e51420cc6ba091c9,ce62d279f86b3364fed4e121ad2d5e1f</data>
