      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Chocolate negro, also known as dark chocolate, is a type of chocolate characterized by its high cocoa content, which contributes to its rich flavor. It typically contains a higher percentage of cocoa compared to other types of chocolate, making it a popular choice among those seeking a more intense chocolate experience. Additionally, dark chocolate is often regarded as a healthier option due to its higher cocoa content, which is associated with various health benefits.</data>
