    <node id="CHOCOLATE">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Chocolate is a food product that can contain lactose, particularly in milk chocolate varieties. It is also recognized for its magnesium content, although consumption should be moderated due to its potential health implications. Additionally, chocolate has a high phosphorus/protein ratio, which makes it discouraged for renal patients. Notably, dark chocolate is highlighted for its flavonoid content and is associated with potential health benefits related to heart health.</data>
      <data key="d2">2f1fed346bb25032751634adf513337a,6ff2742793c37a38db1c11c14d2a6629,846a0cb8b0428de4dd313cf55913d6bd,da58daf0bc31441182ccfd5807a91127</data>
