    </node>
    <node id="CEREALES DE DESAYUNO">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">CEREALES DE DESAYUNO, or breakfast cereals, encompass a wide variety of products that can differ significantly in their ingredients and nutritional content. These cereals may vary in gluten content, with some options being suitable for gluten-free diets, catering to individuals with gluten sensitivities or celiac disease. Additionally, CEREALES DE DESAYUNO may contain lactose as an ingredient, which is important for those who are lactose intolerant to consider when selecting their breakfast options. Overall, CEREALES DE DESAYUNO offers diverse choices that can accommodate different dietary needs and preferences.</data>
      <data key="d2">6ff2742793c37a38db1c11c14d2a6629,f713611b23199b8a9eb9c28377b9f128</data>
