    <node id="DULCES">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">DULCES refers to sweets and candies, which may contain lactose. These treats are typically enjoyed for their delightful flavors and textures. However, dietary guidelines suggest that DULCES should be consumed occasionally and in moderation to maintain a balanced diet.</data>
