    <node id="CARAMELOS">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Caramelos are sweet confections that are enjoyed as snacks and can come in various forms, including candies and gummies. These candies may include lactose in their ingredients and often contain high levels of fructose and sorbitol, which can contribute to dietary intolerances. Additionally, it is important to note that caramelos and gummies may contain gluten, so individuals with celiac disease should verify the ingredients before consumption.</data>
      <data key="d2">6ff2742793c37a38db1c11c14d2a6629,7d2050a2481adc105bdebbcf2af1a173,eff56271e184ab2f11877bfab7f715c4,fb0fe813a0b63d3b7f4a1bccaf15d291</data>
