    <node id="ALIMENTO">
      <data key="d0" />
      <data key="d1">Alimento refers to food products, encompassing a wide range of items that vary in sodium content, including both processed and fresh foods. These food products are often subject to thermal treatment to ensure their safety and quality.</data>
