    <node id="D&#201;FICIT CONG&#201;NITO">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Congenital deficit is a hereditary autosomal recessive disease with very low prevalence, affecting 5-10% of the population in Greenland and Canada, caused by a mutation in the SI gene, leading to symptoms upon the introduction of sucrose in the diet.</data>
      <data key="d2">a079902e52676a05df746098c930a0e7</data>
