    <node id="D&#201;FICIT SECUNDARIO">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Secondary deficit occurs due to any intestinal pathology that reduces the activity of disaccharidases, similar to secondary lactase deficiency, with enzymatic activity usually recovering when the intestinal disease is resolved.</data>
      <data key="d2">a079902e52676a05df746098c930a0e7</data>
