    <node id="ROMAGNUOLE J">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Romagnuole J is an author recognized for contributions to the field of gastroenterology, specifically focusing on the use of breath tests. They have participated in a study that examines the application of breath tests within gastroenterology practices and have also conducted a review of these tests, highlighting their relevance and utility in clinical settings.</data>
      <data key="d2">37124cb23ee078d1ff25425727336ae5,f713611b23199b8a9eb9c28377b9f128</data>
