    </node>
    <node id="ARROZ">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">ARROZ, commonly known as rice, is a cereal that is safe for patients with celiac disease, as it does not contain gluten. It is recognized as a staple food and is often recommended for individuals with gluten intolerance. Additionally, rice is permitted in modified diets and is categorized as part of the cereal group, making it a versatile and essential component of many dietary plans.</data>
      <data key="d2">347e3d175ef7f30e3dcad731f84fb375,8eef8cced3d7433de267e8e624813566,e0208971287419e734607191646ae36d,f713611b23199b8a9eb9c28377b9f128</data>
      <data key="d3">829</data>
