    </node>
    <node id="QUINOA">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Quinoa is a gluten-free grain that is highly regarded for its nutritional benefits, particularly its high protein content. It is commonly used in products specifically designed for individuals with celiac disease, making it a popular choice for gluten-free diets.</data>
      <data key="d2">8eef8cced3d7433de267e8e624813566,f713611b23199b8a9eb9c28377b9f128</data>
      <data key="d3">829</data>
