      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">9805</data>
      <data key="d7">a5e22f3e5188456f98bb36b849c1412c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="CAF&#201;">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">CAF&#201; refers to coffee, a popular beverage enjoyed by many individuals. It is gluten-free and has no established guidelines for consumption by children. Coffee is included in modified diets as part of the beverage group. Additionally, it is noted that coffee can have a variable effect on cardiovascular risk, with moderate consumption associated with a lower risk. Furthermore, coffee is mentioned in the context of a strict low-sodium diet.</data>
      <data key="d2">11662a6f83b8217976d8c9c5d33fe7fd,1d959525e9a5fe22094271d67d0b9108,347e3d175ef7f30e3dcad731f84fb375,e04d44fa9d8f83cab42b04dd086695fc,f713611b23199b8a9eb9c28377b9f128</data>
