    <node id="T&#201;">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">T&#201; is a beverage that has been the subject of various studies, particularly concerning its relationship with cardiovascular risk, which shows non-linear effects based on the quantity consumed. Additionally, T&#201; contains oxalate, a compound that may increase the risk of developing kidney stones. Despite these concerns, T&#201; is gluten-free, making it a suitable option for many individuals. Furthermore, T&#201; is included in the list of permitted beverages for modified diets, highlighting its versatility and acceptance in various dietary contexts.</data>
