    <node id="KETOGENIC DIET">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">The ketogenic diet is a high-fat, low-carbohydrate dietary approach that has been utilized in the management of various health conditions, particularly certain metabolic disorders and intractable seizure disorders. It has been studied for its effects on glycogen storage disease type III and is primarily recognized for its efficacy in treating epilepsy, especially in children and adults with intractable seizures. The diet has shown significant effectiveness in seizure control and the management of various neurological disorders, making it a valuable intervention in both clinical and research settings.</data>
      <data key="d2">19d0093eea71a0652dc1aa027fb454bb,3704ab8452a14a91fe92eee82e9739fb,55b85a76a2c3d515bd3fe6137255abac,ccd3c800d2985d4ad5e2c8d6e88b1b68,e3203d9f5bd82749de9eee35c52c67ce,e533f9391cb85c02809d6f09d3a4d08e</data>
      <data key="d3">576</data>
      <data key="d4">1</data>
      <data key="d5">48</data>
      <data key="d6">9898</data>
