    <node id="HIGH-PROTEIN DIET">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">A high-protein diet is a dietary intervention that is often recommended for individuals with certain metabolic disorders, including glycogen storage disease type III. This type of diet is designed to help manage symptoms associated with these disorders while providing adequate nutrition. The focus on increased protein intake can play a crucial role in supporting metabolic health and addressing specific dietary needs related to these conditions.</data>
      <data key="d2">ccd3c800d2985d4ad5e2c8d6e88b1b68,e3203d9f5bd82749de9eee35c52c67ce</data>
