    <node id="J AM DIET ASSOC">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The "J AM DIET ASSOC," also known as the Journal of the American Dietetic Association, is a scholarly journal that focuses on publishing research related to dietary practices and nutrition. It includes studies that are pertinent to various health conditions, including cystic fibrosis. The journal serves as a significant resource for professionals in the fields of dietetics and nutrition, contributing valuable insights and findings to enhance understanding and practices in these areas.</data>
