    <node id="FOOD INTOLERANCE">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Food intolerance is a condition characterized by adverse reactions in the body triggered by certain foods, primarily affecting the digestive system. Unlike food allergies, which involve an immune system response, food intolerance results in discomfort due to difficulties in digesting specific foods. This condition often leads to gastrointestinal symptoms, necessitating dietary adjustments to manage and alleviate the associated discomfort.</data>
      <data key="d2">16d282094937dc2b58bfd40e13934fd2,bfb5dadab0c08f9f5f549ddd4b5db30c,dea403b707c5339329451aa7494d9ca5</data>
