    <node id="AM J GASTROENTEROL">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The American Journal of Gastroenterology, abbreviated as AM J GASTROENTEROL, is a peer-reviewed journal dedicated to publishing research on gastrointestinal health. It covers a wide range of topics related to gastrointestinal diseases, including significant studies on nutrition in acute pancreatitis. The journal serves as a vital resource for researchers and healthcare professionals in the field of gastroenterology, contributing to the advancement of knowledge and treatment options for gastrointestinal conditions.</data>
      <data key="d2">60d24674009cc67523f1ecdc63975fdc,dea403b707c5339329451aa7494d9ca5</data>
      <data key="d3">714</data>
