    </node>
    <node id="MAP DIET">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">The MAP diet is a dietary approach used for the treatment of irritable bowel syndrome, focusing on specific carbohydrate intake to alleviate symptoms.</data>
