      <data key="d1">Clinical Gastroenterology and Hepatology is a journal dedicated to the dissemination of clinical research and information pertaining to the fields of gastroenterology and hepatology. It emphasizes the clinical aspects of these medical specialties, providing valuable insights and findings that contribute to the understanding and treatment of gastrointestinal and liver diseases.</data>
