    <node id="IRRITABLE BOWEL SYNDROME">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Irritable Bowel Syndrome (IBS) is a common gastrointestinal disorder that affects the large intestine. It is characterized by a range of symptoms including abdominal pain, cramping, bloating, gas, and altered bowel habits, which may manifest as diarrhea or constipation. Additionally, IBS can be associated with various food intolerances, further complicating the management of the condition.</data>
      <data key="d2">16d282094937dc2b58bfd40e13934fd2,1d7ac56ec0eb2f724386a39de8551134,bfb5dadab0c08f9f5f549ddd4b5db30c,fa4851ce095f27e98350dcb826e5b09c</data>
