    <node id="LIVER INT">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Liver Int, also known as Liver International, is a medical journal dedicated to publishing research on liver diseases and related topics. The journal focuses on a wide range of subjects, including studies on cirrhosis and the nutritional aspects of liver health. It serves as a platform for disseminating important findings and advancements in the field of hepatology.</data>
      <data key="d2">49e6a5571bf2f206ac38ac536d70f710,994c13f250eafe4b1a52d40b56230a0c</data>
