    <node id="JPEN">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">JPEN, or the Journal of Parenteral and Enteral Nutrition, is a specialized publication dedicated to the field of nutrition support, particularly focusing on parenteral and enteral nutrition. The journal publishes clinical guidelines, research findings, and studies related to nutritional therapy and management, addressing various nutritional parameters in patients. It serves as a vital resource for healthcare professionals, providing insights into nutrition science, especially in clinical settings such as liver disease. Through its comprehensive coverage of research and guidelines, JPEN aims to advance the understanding and application of nutrition support in medical practice.</data>
      <data key="d2">49e6a5571bf2f206ac38ac536d70f710,60d24674009cc67523f1ecdc63975fdc,7a389f3625ba13c74ce52213197b01ae,aae3f23f674724518bcb311a99d764d6,ce6821fbd8f78047e06917383f25f037,ec69668515f0a014f1a602bcdc46c47f</data>
