    <node id="MAYO CLIN PROC">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Mayo Clinic Proceedings is a peer-reviewed medical journal that publishes research and reviews in clinical medicine. It covers a wide range of medical topics, including but not limited to liver transplantation. The journal serves as a platform for disseminating significant findings and advancements in the field of medicine, contributing to the ongoing education and knowledge of healthcare professionals.</data>
      <data key="d2">49e6a5571bf2f206ac38ac536d70f710,e376d9f50b7608f5b6d1f88877fde59e</data>
