    <node id="HEPATOLOGY">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Hepatology is both a specialized branch of medicine and a journal dedicated to the study, diagnosis, and treatment of liver diseases. This field encompasses a wide range of liver-related conditions, including cirrhosis and its complications. The journal serves as a platform for publishing research that advances the understanding and management of these diseases, contributing significantly to the medical community's knowledge in hepatology.</data>
      <data key="d2">36823f72c2a40918b243d0c6f175c0e4,49e6a5571bf2f206ac38ac536d70f710,5aaadc19de8fb96a4951c0ba38192991,64378df2be6b08b39bd652c0a2d3789c,bf2e1510b4d6b43da85e8086d93e5602</data>
