    <node id="MADDEN AM">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Madden AM is a researcher and author who has made significant contributions to the study of cirrhosis. They have conducted research on taste perception in patients with cirrhosis, exploring how this condition affects sensory experiences. Additionally, Madden AM has authored a comparative study on skinfold anthropometry and bioelectrical impedance analysis in cirrhosis, highlighting the importance of these methods in assessing body composition in affected individuals. Through their work, Madden AM has provided valuable insights into the complexities of cirrhosis and its impact on various physiological aspects.</data>
