    <node id="LIVER CIRRHOSIS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Liver cirrhosis is a chronic liver disease marked by the progressive replacement of healthy liver tissue with scar tissue, which significantly impairs liver function and metabolism. It represents a late stage of scarring, known as fibrosis, resulting from various liver diseases and conditions, including hepatitis and chronic alcoholism.</data>
      <data key="d2">9ea9816b490492ba0030e6ba4bc3bb9f,bf2e1510b4d6b43da85e8086d93e5602,e2f9ec03a9b71e608bdd14455b0595a6</data>
      <data key="d3">1513</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">14</data>
      <data key="d6">10220</data>
      <data key="d7">812ce7c36e23470fa4c8d182b1253601</data>
    </node>
    <node id="JOHN DOE">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">John Doe is a hypothetical patient used in clinical studies to represent individuals with liver cirrhosis.</data>
      <data key="d2">9ea9816b490492ba0030e6ba4bc3bb9f</data>
      <data key="d5">0</data>
      <data key="d6">10221</data>
      <data key="d7">89df3603df564197b629dad4033484b3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="ENERGY EXPENDITURE">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Energy expenditure refers to the total amount of energy used by the body. This measurement can be influenced by various factors, including metabolic changes that occur in patients with liver cirrhosis. In such individuals, the body's energy expenditure may be altered, reflecting the impact of the disease on metabolic processes.</data>
      <data key="d2">9ea9816b490492ba0030e6ba4bc3bb9f,ec94449c6ffff75664588262301de0a6</data>
      <data key="d3">1214</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">3</data>
      <data key="d6">10222</data>
      <data key="d7">570db763bae048099116485f71e483c1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="PROTEIN DEPLETION">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Protein depletion is a condition that can occur in patients with liver cirrhosis, affecting their nutritional status and overall health.</data>
      <data key="d2">9ea9816b490492ba0030e6ba4bc3bb9f</data>
      <data key="d3">1513</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">2</data>
      <data key="d6">10223</data>
      <data key="d7">5e4e3220237f45bea34ab5a772a18879</data>
    </node>
    <node id="BODY COMPOSITION ANALYSIS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Body composition analysis is a method used to assess the nutritional status of patients with liver cirrhosis, helping to identify protein depletion.</data>
      <data key="d2">9ea9816b490492ba0030e6ba4bc3bb9f</data>
      <data key="d3">1513</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
