    <node id="LIVER TRANSPLANT">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Liver transplant refers to a surgical procedure in which a diseased liver is replaced with a healthy liver from a donor. This procedure often requires careful nutritional assessment both before and after the operation to ensure optimal patient outcomes. Additionally, the topic of liver transplantation is explored in the journal "Liver Transpl," which publishes studies related to nutritional parameters in liver disease, highlighting the importance of nutrition in the management and treatment of liver conditions.</data>
      <data key="d2">22f9164844b9778cfef429e45de95060,c45c1688135653a80812cdaf426ec9a3</data>
