      <data key="d1">Schutz T is an author recognized for contributions to the field of gastroenterology, particularly in the areas of malnutrition assessment in cirrhosis and enteral nutrition. He has participated in studies that focus on evaluating malnutrition in patients with liver disease and has also co-authored discussions on the European Society for Clinical Nutrition and Metabolism (ESPEN) guidelines regarding enteral nutrition practices. Through his work, Schutz T has played a significant role in advancing the understanding and management of nutritional issues in gastroenterological conditions.</data>
