    <node id="TRACE ELEMENTS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">TRACE ELEMENTS are essential nutrients that play a critical role in various bodily functions, including recovery from burn injuries. These minerals are present in small amounts in the body and are vital for numerous physiological processes. Additionally, the levels of trace elements can be affected by conditions such as liver cirrhosis, highlighting their importance in maintaining overall health and supporting recovery in different medical contexts.</data>
      <data key="d2">7f3e164582a504c9fe6bdbc56e1a8e97,c45c1688135653a80812cdaf426ec9a3</data>
