    <node id="MUSCLE ATROPHY">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Muscle atrophy is the loss of muscle mass that can occur in patients with cirrhosis. This condition is often associated with poor nutritional status, highlighting the importance of adequate nutrition in maintaining muscle health.</data>
      <data key="d2">c45c1688135653a80812cdaf426ec9a3,cea5f90ebf49c4157cab16ee26b9d97c</data>
