    <node id="JOURNAL OF HEPATOLOGY">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The Journal of Hepatology is a prominent peer-reviewed medical journal that specializes in the field of liver disease. It is recognized for publishing a wide range of research articles and reviews that cover various aspects of hepatology. The journal focuses on liver diseases and related topics, including clinical guidelines and specific conditions such as Wilson's disease. As a leading publication in its field, the Journal of Hepatology plays a crucial role in disseminating important findings and advancements in liver health and disease management.</data>
      <data key="d2">125bf798b37a7f42c661002099924973,41a33a13610bbae73208f0d201781724,bf2e1510b4d6b43da85e8086d93e5602</data>
