    <node id="NUTR CLIN PRACT">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">"NUTR CLIN PRACT" is a journal dedicated to the field of clinical nutrition and its significant implications for patient care. It encompasses a wide range of topics, including the management of chyle leaks and the nutritional needs of burn patients. The journal serves as a platform for guidelines and research related to clinical nutrition practices, emphasizing the role of nutrition in various clinical settings, including studies pertinent to liver health. Notably, it is also the publication venue for Krenitsky's work on adjusted body weight, further highlighting its commitment to advancing knowledge in clinical nutrition. Overall, "NUTR CLIN PRACT" plays a crucial role in disseminating research and best practices in the field of clinical nutrition.</data>
      <data key="d2">3534154ea7562c7d4abe51bf29546109,52d93d6adba464a2397ddec01d152840,7f3e164582a504c9fe6bdbc56e1a8e97,bf2e1510b4d6b43da85e8086d93e5602,deb3afabda4adf3c61e4b9e1545103cc,fba8cc8092875a542f3b63663ce5c8d9</data>
