    <node id="LIVER DISEASE">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Liver disease encompasses a variety of conditions that impact the liver's function and structure, including serious ailments such as cirrhosis and liver cancer. It can also manifest in patients with cystic fibrosis, highlighting the need for specialized care and management tailored to this specific patient population.</data>
