    <node id="ACEITE">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Aceite refers to oils, which are sources of dietary fats that can be categorized as either TCM (Traditional Chinese Medicine) or TCL (Traditional Chinese Lifestyle). It is an important ingredient in low-sodium diets, where it is utilized for cooking and dressing foods. In modified diets, specifically TCM oil is permitted, highlighting its significance in dietary practices. However, when selecting oils for cooking, it is essential to choose them carefully to avoid gluten contamination, ensuring that they align with dietary restrictions and health considerations.</data>
      <data key="d2">1aab735899b0c557ec11da0558bcfc15,1d959525e9a5fe22094271d67d0b9108,347e3d175ef7f30e3dcad731f84fb375,3c2bb3d9d6534668e58f571710c9bb02</data>
