    <node id="FRESUBIN">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Fresubin is a brand under Fresenius Kabi that specializes in producing a diverse range of nutritional drinks and products. These offerings are specifically designed to cater to patients with dietary restrictions, including individuals with celiac disease.</data>
      <data key="d2">e6153f0024d75c281071b521b08ed53a,f5e31a6599b8198e736e732c44f8eaa4</data>
