    </node>
    <node id="LINFOMA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Lymphoma is a type of cancer that primarily affects the lymphatic system, which is a crucial part of the immune system. This condition can lead to various complications, including ascitis quilosa, a specific type of fluid accumulation in the abdominal cavity. Additionally, lymphoma may be associated with refractory celiac disease, and it can present with gastrointestinal symptoms, highlighting its potential impact on digestive health.</data>
      <data key="d2">c77caafffd9b5d42c51cb2359ad9cc6d,e6153f0024d75c281071b521b08ed53a</data>
      <data key="d3">1796</data>
