    <node id="SCOTT">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">E.M. Scott is a researcher with a focus on developing guidelines for osteoporosis in patients with celiac disease. In addition to this work, Scott has also conducted a trial examining the costs and consequences associated with systematic nutrition team follow-up after percutaneous endoscopic gastrostomy. Through these efforts, Scott contributes to advancing knowledge and improving patient care in both osteoporosis management and nutritional support in clinical settings.</data>
      <data key="d2">17593b5969d4126aef1c56a7d32dc922,4b0d0238a19e23ffee592c9d0817e226</data>
