      <data key="d1">Huevo entero refers to a whole egg, which is a common ingredient in cooking. However, in the context of a modified diet, whole eggs are not permitted. It is important to note that whole eggs have a phosphorus ratio at the limit of 16 mg/g, and therefore, they are recommended to be consumed in moderation.</data>
