      <data key="d1">LECHE DE VACA refers to cow's milk, which is a staple in many diets and commonly used in the production of infant formulas. However, it is important to note that cow's milk may not be suitable for all infants and is generally recommended to be introduced only after the first year of age. The composition of cow's milk is regulated by specific norms to ensure its safety and nutritional adequacy for various uses, including infant feeding.</data>
