    <node id="AMINO&#193;CIDOS DE CADENA RAMIFICADA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Amino&#225;cidos de cadena ramificada, commonly known as branched-chain amino acids (BCAAs), are essential amino acids that include leucine, isoleucine, and valine. These amino acids play a significant role in various metabolic processes and are particularly noted for their ability to enhance muscle mass and function, especially in elderly individuals. BCAAs are crucial for maintaining muscle health and may help in addressing metabolic disorders.</data>
      <data key="d2">06b374fc6a6ebf2091ac0a00329bd027,a25b0f84bc321cad942a2e33f681a5e4</data>
      <data key="d3">1744</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
