    <node id="BCAA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">BCAA, or Branched-Chain Amino Acids, are essential nutrients that play a crucial role in muscle metabolism. They are significant in dietary management for metabolic disorders and are obtained from proteins found in food. These amino acids are vital for maintaining muscle health and supporting various metabolic processes in the body.</data>
      <data key="d2">4351677d6166c9c88ab941dc8dcecb82,91c1a9b0c0d7cb718d7711ef7384a142</data>
      <data key="d3">800</data>
