    </node>
    <node id="MSUD">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">MSUD, or Maple Syrup Urine Disease, is a metabolic disorder that impairs the body's ability to process specific amino acids. This condition necessitates careful dietary management to prevent complications and may require liver transplantation in severe cases.</data>
      <data key="d2">4351677d6166c9c88ab941dc8dcecb82,91c1a9b0c0d7cb718d7711ef7384a142</data>
      <data key="d3">800</data>
