    <node id="TABLE 6">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Table 6 provides a comprehensive overview of dietary treatment strategies during metabolic decompensations in patients with Maple Syrup Urine Disease (MSUD). Additionally, it outlines the fluid needs of children, utilizing the Holliday-Segar equation to determine appropriate hydration requirements. This table serves as a valuable resource for understanding both the nutritional management of MSUD and the fluid intake necessary for pediatric patients.</data>
