    <node id="TRATAMIENTO DIET&#201;TICO-NUTRICIONAL">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">"TRATAMIENTO DIET&#201;TICO-NUTRICIONAL" refers to dietary management strategies aimed at controlling protein intake and managing symptoms in patients with urea cycle disorders. This treatment also focuses on regulating levels of homocysteine and related amino acids in affected individuals. Through these dietary interventions, the goal is to improve the overall health and well-being of patients by addressing specific metabolic needs associated with these disorders.</data>
      <data key="d2">0487e1a4525547575a1d284297280f9a,b1d588e0c9c4cef32da41373afbd1901</data>
