      <data key="d1">Tromboembolismo is a serious condition that can arise from elevated homociste&#237;na levels, resulting in blockages in blood vessels.</data>
      <data key="d2">b1d588e0c9c4cef32da41373afbd1901</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
