      <data key="d1">Hyperhomocysteinemia is a condition characterized by elevated levels of homocysteine in the blood, which can lead to various health issues, including cardiovascular diseases.</data>
      <data key="d2">7754f367b453475179218cac4bc24de1</data>
      <data key="d3">1658</data>
