    <node id="N-ACETILGLUTAMATO SINTETASA">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">N-acetilglutamato sintetasa (NAGS) is an enzyme involved in the urea cycle, which helps in the metabolism of nitrogen in the body.</data>
