      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Carbamilfosfato sintetasa (CPS) is an enzyme that plays a crucial role in the urea cycle, converting ammonia into urea.</data>
      <data key="d2">0487e1a4525547575a1d284297280f9a</data>
      <data key="d5">2</data>
      <data key="d6">10686</data>
