    <node id="VITAFLO EAA">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Vitaflo EAA is a dietary supplement specifically designed for the treatment of patients with urea cycle disorders, providing essential amino acids necessary for their health. It is particularly beneficial for individuals with severe metabolic disorders, including those suffering from carbamoyl phosphate synthetase (CPS) and ornithine transcarbamylase (OTC) deficiencies. This product plays a crucial role in amino acid supplementation, helping to manage the dietary needs of affected patients.</data>
      <data key="d2">0487e1a4525547575a1d284297280f9a,0906c46e832ce2db9f1c58e6e8b54880</data>
