      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">UCD 1 is a specialized medical product designed for managing specific metabolic conditions, particularly those related to amino acid deficiencies. It serves as a dietary product specifically tailored for patients with urea cycle disorders, helping them to effectively manage their amino acid intake.</data>
      <data key="d2">0487e1a4525547575a1d284297280f9a,0906c46e832ce2db9f1c58e6e8b54880</data>
