    <node id="UCD 2">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">UCD 2 is a dietary formulation specifically designed to support individuals with urea cycle disorders. This medical product aims to assist in the treatment of metabolic disorders that involve amino acids, providing essential nutritional support for those affected by these conditions.</data>
      <data key="d2">0487e1a4525547575a1d284297280f9a,0906c46e832ce2db9f1c58e6e8b54880</data>
