    <node id="DIALAMINE">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Dialamine is a nutritional product specifically designed for the management of urea cycle disorders. It provides essential amino acids that are crucial for patients with metabolic deficiencies. This formulation supports individuals who require supplementation of these vital nutrients to help maintain metabolic balance and overall health.</data>
      <data key="d2">0487e1a4525547575a1d284297280f9a,0906c46e832ce2db9f1c58e6e8b54880</data>
