    <node id="OMIM">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">OMIM (Online Mendelian Inheritance in Man) is a comprehensive and authoritative compendium that serves as a database of human genes and genetic disorders. It includes detailed information on various genetic conditions, such as homocystinuria and phenylketonuria, making it a vital resource for researchers and healthcare professionals interested in genetics.</data>
