      <data key="d1">The European Journal of Pediatrics is a scholarly publication that focuses on various aspects of pediatric health. It publishes a wide range of research and articles, including those related to nutrition and reviews on pediatric health. Additionally, the journal features studies on metabolic disorders, such as glycogen storage diseases, contributing to the understanding and advancement of pediatric medicine.</data>
