    </node>
    <node id="ACEITE DE PALMA">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">El aceite de palma es un tipo de grasa que contiene una mayor proporci&#243;n de &#225;cidos grasos saturados de cadena larga, lo que lo relaciona con el riesgo de ECV.</data>
      <data key="d2">e0227f83ebee602b6c9d7163630e495e</data>
      <data key="d3">1399</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">10766</data>
      <data key="d7">6c2c2dab203042b7a1be05e6a857f643</data>
    </node>
    <node id="FITOESTEROLES">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Fitoesteroles, also known as phytosterols, are plant-derived compounds recognized for their potential health benefits, particularly in relation to cardiovascular health. They are known to aid in reducing cholesterol levels by decreasing cholesterol absorption in the intestines, which can lead to lower levels of LDL cholesterol. This dual action of helping to reduce overall cholesterol and improving heart health makes fitoesteroles a valuable component in dietary strategies aimed at promoting cardiovascular well-being.</data>
      <data key="d2">5b7201af7da852101713ee9f11864f50,e0227f83ebee602b6c9d7163630e495e</data>
      <data key="d3">1621</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">2</data>
      <data key="d6">10767</data>
      <data key="d7">64062319a6f34b6d9eaf6c8e22833d4c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="FIBRA SOLUBLE">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">La fibra soluble es un tipo de fibra que puede influir positivamente en la salud cardiovascular.</data>
