    <node id="ECV">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">ECV, which stands for cardiovascular disease, is a health condition that is being analyzed in relation to dietary fats. Additionally, ECV refers to cerebrovascular disease (Enfermedad Cerebrovascular), which is an acute process that can benefit from appropriate nutritional management.</data>
      <data key="d2">0482404f71667592ce2b0f771153ece8,3d053ac744015b40d8790ff91b5d02f2,59a6475dbe0ccafda60f2647dea78371</data>
