    <node id="VERDOLAGA">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Verdolaga is a plant that contains omega-3 fatty acids and is suggested for dietary inclusion.</data>
      <data key="d2">e1766b4a9f6cff776650a29195cee9fc</data>
      <data key="d5">0</data>
      <data key="d6">10832</data>
      <data key="d7">0df0d52fc1dc4070b14c027c9d8d3ec0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="BORRAJA">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Borraja is a plant known for its omega-3 fatty acid content, beneficial for health.</data>
      <data key="d2">e1766b4a9f6cff776650a29195cee9fc</data>
      <data key="d5">0</data>
      <data key="d6">10833</data>
      <data key="d7">7442e35befa0447a85bbc14f007c3962</data>
    </node>
    <node id="SEMILLAS DE LINO">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Semillas de lino, or flaxseeds, are a rich source of omega-3 fatty acids and are recommended for consumption.</data>
      <data key="d2">e1766b4a9f6cff776650a29195cee9fc</data>
      <data key="d5">0</data>
      <data key="d6">10834</data>
      <data key="d7">46d5792c510b484986f87a02644c929d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="EMBARAZADAS">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Embarazadas refers to pregnant women who are advised to avoid certain fish due to mercury content.</data>
      <data key="d2">e1766b4a9f6cff776650a29195cee9fc</data>
      <data key="d5">0</data>
      <data key="d6">10835</data>
      <data key="d7">e1ac8415e59c48a6908dc98063e0ed71</data>
    </node>
    <node id="NI&#209;OS PEQUE&#209;OS">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Ni&#241;os peque&#241;os refers to young children who are advised to limit fish consumption due to mercury exposure.</data>
      <data key="d2">e1766b4a9f6cff776650a29195cee9fc</data>
      <data key="d5">0</data>
      <data key="d6">10836</data>
      <data key="d7">cac45cd77c4b42b784f44985b3d1928e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="C&#193;PSULAS DE &#937;-3">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">C&#225;psulas de &#969;-3 are supplements containing omega-3 fatty acids, recommended for various populations.</data>
      <data key="d2">e1766b4a9f6cff776650a29195cee9fc</data>
      <data key="d5">0</data>
      <data key="d6">10837</data>
      <data key="d7">401873d9dc654a30a895e89073265469</data>
    </node>
    <node id="ALIMENTOS ANIMALES">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Alimentos animales refer to animal-based foods that contain dietary cholesterol, impacting cardiovascular health.</data>
      <data key="d2">e1766b4a9f6cff776650a29195cee9fc</data>
      <data key="d5">0</data>
      <data key="d6">10838</data>
      <data key="d7">6a23e086e2c44c01a5996e99462d976b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="ESTEROL VEGETAL">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Esterol vegetal refers to plant sterols that can influence lipid levels and cardiovascular risk.</data>
      <data key="d2">e1766b4a9f6cff776650a29195cee9fc</data>
      <data key="d5">0</data>
      <data key="d6">10839</data>
      <data key="d7">8e1228bde81f49cca570651f023bfc3a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="ESTANOL">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Estanol refers to plant-derived compounds that can help manage cholesterol levels.</data>
      <data key="d2">e1766b4a9f6cff776650a29195cee9fc</data>
      <data key="d5">0</data>
      <data key="d6">10840</data>
      <data key="d7">821acc1ece264a22be52c885186d4612</data>
    </node>
    <node id="L&#205;PIDOS PLASM&#193;TICOS">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">L&#237;pidos plasm&#225;ticos refer to lipids in the blood that are influenced by diet and can affect cardiovascular risk.</data>
      <data key="d2">e1766b4a9f6cff776650a29195cee9fc</data>
      <data key="d5">0</data>
      <data key="d6">10841</data>
      <data key="d7">b72f54a055ae4a358a763d0b06de5ac5</data>
    </node>
    <node id="EFECTOS POSITIVOS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Efectos positivos refer to the beneficial impacts of omega-3 fatty acids on health.</data>
      <data key="d2">e1766b4a9f6cff776650a29195cee9fc</data>
      <data key="d5">0</data>
      <data key="d6">10842</data>
      <data key="d7">47dcc043cd034b1085b03502b997776b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="CONTAMINANTES AMBIENTALES">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Contaminantes ambientales refer to environmental pollutants that can affect health, particularly in relation to omega-3 fatty acids.)&lt;|COMPLETE|&gt;</data>
      <data key="d2">e1766b4a9f6cff776650a29195cee9fc</data>
      <data key="d5">0</data>
      <data key="d6">10843</data>
      <data key="d7">e67928748bb042d28df5fee852403fbe</data>
    </node>
    <node id="AHA/ACC">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The American Heart Association and American College of Cardiology provide guidelines for cardiovascular health and dietary recommendations.</data>
      <data key="d2">633a3a90a82e02d05096b361ddba3ad7</data>
      <data key="d3">1400</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">2</data>
      <data key="d6">10844</data>
      <data key="d7">7a03cf662a4343e79b17352a889eb7d3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="DASH">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">DASH, which stands for Dietary Approaches to Stop Hypertension, is a dietary model specifically designed to control and manage blood pressure through targeted food consumption. This dietary plan emphasizes the importance of increasing the intake of fruits and vegetables, which are rich in essential nutrients, including calcium. The DASH diet is recommended not only for preventing hypertension but also for improving overall health. Research from the DASH study indicates that adhering to a diet rich in these food groups can lead to beneficial effects on blood pressure, making it an effective approach for those looking to manage hypertension through nutritional changes.</data>
      <data key="d2">3fab4e796fd2145b2d0f62ffa60775aa,633a3a90a82e02d05096b361ddba3ad7,66b7c4d336056f832579dc20ffb92992,92ae465a11b49807321be06ec9f5bc5a,b5db5210dfb726bf3f6d3fae82598596</data>
      <data key="d3">1400</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">12</data>
      <data key="d6">10845</data>
      <data key="d7">078dbdee81ff4b2594c9698f7a3d5339</data>
    </node>
    <node id="OMNIHEART">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">The OmniHeart study introduced three dietary variations aimed at optimizing macronutrient intake for heart health.</data>
      <data key="d2">633a3a90a82e02d05096b361ddba3ad7</data>
      <data key="d3">1400</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">10846</data>
      <data key="d7">0964465b01f34659b4d5b57357e0a526</data>
    </node>
    <node id="PRODUCTOS INTEGRALES">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Whole grains are recommended in dietary guidelines to promote cardiovascular health and are included in both DASH and Mediterranean diets.</data>
      <data key="d2">633a3a90a82e02d05096b361ddba3ad7</data>
      <data key="d5">0</data>
      <data key="d6">10847</data>
      <data key="d7">8c3b06e913bd458bb3f87dedd73be1f6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="L&#193;CTEOS BAJOS EN GRASAS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Low-fat dairy products are part of the DASH diet and Mediterranean diet, contributing to a heart-healthy eating pattern.</data>
      <data key="d2">633a3a90a82e02d05096b361ddba3ad7</data>
      <data key="d5">0</data>
      <data key="d6">10848</data>
      <data key="d7">da98c58aeeab4c2896b6a64e80a1be8a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="CARNES MAGRAS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">CARNES MAGRAS, or lean meats, are defined as cuts of meat that contain less fat. Research indicates that these meats have a neutral effect on cardiovascular risk, making them a beneficial choice for heart health. They are included in dietary recommendations, particularly in the DASH (Dietary Approaches to Stop Hypertension) diet, which promotes heart health. Additionally, lean meats are permitted in modified diets and are recommended as a protein source in children's diets, highlighting their versatility and nutritional value.</data>
      <data key="d2">347e3d175ef7f30e3dcad731f84fb375,61b84039de5ac2d9e25890c3b8f4f87a,633a3a90a82e02d05096b361ddba3ad7,e04d44fa9d8f83cab42b04dd086695fc</data>
      <data key="d3">630</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">3</data>
      <data key="d6">10849</data>
      <data key="d7">bd8246656c3240eca9cc040601125a26</data>
    </node>
    <node id="VEGAN DIET">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">A vegan diet that excludes all animal products, focusing solely on plant-based foods, which may have cardiovascular benefits.</data>
      <data key="d2">4b79601d85087d62f0d4890761776c04</data>
      <data key="d3">1631</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">2</data>
      <data key="d6">10850</data>
      <data key="d7">03188d91ab3d440ab1dd4944950cf129</data>
    </node>
    <node id="AMERICAN HEART ASSOCIATION (AHA)">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The AHA is a non-profit organization that provides guidelines and recommendations for cardiovascular health, including dietary advice.</data>
      <data key="d2">4b79601d85087d62f0d4890761776c04</data>
      <data key="d3">1581</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">10851</data>
      <data key="d7">9b9fea605875416b80281cc5102b495d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="HYPOGLYCEMIC INDEX">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">A measure that ranks foods based on their effect on blood sugar levels, which is relevant in dietary recommendations for preventing obesity and diabetes.</data>
      <data key="d2">4b79601d85087d62f0d4890761776c04</data>
      <data key="d5">0</data>
      <data key="d6">10852</data>
      <data key="d7">adfe46d7712a4eb9b415627ebfde4a83</data>
    </node>
    <node id="FITOQU&#205;MICOS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Bioactive compounds found in plants that may have health benefits, particularly in relation to cardiovascular health.</data>
      <data key="d2">4b79601d85087d62f0d4890761776c04</data>
      <data key="d3">1631</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">10853</data>
      <data key="d7">88a52d00938f43648beb019cb029a3a8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="NUTS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Nuts are a significant component of dietary recommendations due to their nutritional profile, particularly their phosphorus content, which has implications for renal patients. They are recognized for being high in healthy fats and essential nutrients, contributing to a lower risk of cardiovascular diseases when incorporated into a balanced diet.</data>
      <data key="d2">4b79601d85087d62f0d4890761776c04,da58daf0bc31441182ccfd5807a91127</data>
      <data key="d3">1631</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">10854</data>
      <data key="d7">cd72649b518f49078951a3a9360d8dc3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="ADDED SUGARS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Added sugars are sugars that are incorporated into foods and beverages, which can contribute to obesity and cardiovascular disease when consumed in high amounts.</data>
      <data key="d2">4b79601d85087d62f0d4890761776c04</data>
      <data key="d3">1631</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">10855</data>
      <data key="d7">06463bb43c5e46c3827ea1ccbb2dc71d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="ACEITE OLIVA VIRGEN EXTRA">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">El aceite de oliva virgen extra es un tipo de aceite vegetal que se ha asociado con beneficios para la salud cardiovascular, especialmente en la dieta mediterr&#225;nea.</data>
      <data key="d2">e04d44fa9d8f83cab42b04dd086695fc</data>
      <data key="d3">1402</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">2</data>
      <data key="d6">10856</data>
      <data key="d7">40df8acb3ec449a089410f3015147ce3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="CARNES PROCESADAS">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">CARNES PROCESADAS se refiere a productos c&#225;rnicos que han sido modificados con el fin de mejorar su conservaci&#243;n y sabor. Sin embargo, el consumo de carnes procesadas ha sido objeto de preocupaci&#243;n debido a su asociaci&#243;n con un mayor riesgo cardiovascular. Adem&#225;s, se ha discutido su posible v&#237;nculo con el c&#225;ncer en el contexto de las recomendaciones diet&#233;ticas. Estas consideraciones resaltan la importancia de evaluar el consumo de carnes procesadas en la dieta, dado su impacto potencial en la salud.</data>
      <data key="d2">56e7bab8da5c5e8d37b7545618a648bb,e04d44fa9d8f83cab42b04dd086695fc</data>
      <data key="d3">1402</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">3</data>
      <data key="d6">10857</data>
      <data key="d7">9eb54b5b8d1e4df3bf7f56b85fad4e18</data>
    </node>
    <node id="LACTEOS">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">LACTEOS refers to dairy products, which include items such as milk, cheese, and yogurt. These products are considered neutral in their effect on cardiovascular risk. They are recommended for patients, with a suggested intake of one serving per day, preferably in a semi-skimmed form. Additionally, LACTEOS have a high phosphorus to protein ratio, which necessitates monitoring in patients with hyperphosphatemia and chronic kidney disease.</data>
      <data key="d2">ae1766e8ae855b3c79ad6d5fdefab1b0,cb892163c42e6e5ec9dede2d66693978,e04d44fa9d8f83cab42b04dd086695fc</data>
      <data key="d3">1625</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">5</data>
      <data key="d6">10858</data>
      <data key="d7">c54a8cf96edc419c90a0b8fab36debce</data>
    </node>
    <node id="MORTALIDAD ECV">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">La mortalidad por enfermedad cardiovascular (ECV) se refiere a las muertes causadas por condiciones cardiovasculares, y se relaciona con factores de riesgo como la dieta.</data>
      <data key="d2">e04d44fa9d8f83cab42b04dd086695fc</data>
      <data key="d3">1402</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">5</data>
      <data key="d6">10859</data>
      <data key="d7">73930ace59104a48a24a17b9bc905883</data>
    </node>
    <node id="SOY PROTEIN">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Soy protein is recognized for its health benefits, including its antioxidant properties and role in reducing cardiovascular risk.</data>
      <data key="d2">2f1fed346bb25032751634adf513337a</data>
      <data key="d3">1644</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">10860</data>
      <data key="d7">f3404647387e4d8e95a1a0c6d8fdd106</data>
    </node>
    <node id="FRUITS AND VEGETABLES">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Fruits and vegetables are recommended for their high content of vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants that promote heart health.</data>
      <data key="d2">2f1fed346bb25032751634adf513337a</data>
      <data key="d3">1650</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">3</data>
      <data key="d6">10861</data>
      <data key="d7">89a8e89aa2804c3e82405b7838cf3fa9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="CAROTENOS">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Carotenoids are pigments found in fruits and vegetables that have antioxidant properties and may influence health.</data>
      <data key="d2">eff56271e184ab2f11877bfab7f715c4</data>
