    </node>
    <node id="GRUNDY SM">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Grundy SM is a prominent researcher and author recognized for his significant contributions to the field of dietary fats and their impact on cardiovascular health. His work focuses on the dietary influences on serum lipids and lipoproteins, highlighting the critical relationship between nutrition and heart health. Through his research, Grundy SM has advanced the understanding of how dietary choices can affect lipid profiles and overall cardiovascular risk.</data>
      <data key="d2">63593ac5546e44eaddb37a2f257bfa80,f2b8b21255397ebbaf2b5d66ff6bde88</data>
      <data key="d3">1698</data>
