    </node>
    <node id="ROS E">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Ros E is an author recognized for her contributions to the understanding of dietary influences on health. She has discussed the impact of dietary cholesterol on cholesterol levels and cardiovascular risk, providing valuable insights into how diet can affect heart health. Additionally, Ros E has played a significant role in establishing a consensus on the consumption of fats and oils in the diet specifically for the Spanish adult population, highlighting her expertise in nutritional guidelines and public health.</data>
      <data key="d2">6a95bf35e698b03ca552f2c75d5d60ef,f2b8b21255397ebbaf2b5d66ff6bde88</data>
      <data key="d3">1256</data>
