      <data key="d1">Nutrition Metabolism and Cardiovascular Disease is a journal dedicated to exploring the intricate relationship between nutrition and cardiovascular health. It publishes research findings that highlight various aspects of this connection, including studies on the association between polyphenol intake and cardiovascular events. The journal serves as a valuable resource for understanding how dietary factors influence cardiovascular conditions and overall metabolic health.</data>
