      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Controlled diets in fatty acids are dietary interventions aimed at managing conditions like adrenoleucodistrofia by regulating the intake of specific fatty acids.</data>
      <data key="d2">8cdedff25a6a366c17615073d05a5aa2</data>
