    </node>
    <node id="NEUROPAT&#205;A">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Neuropat&#237;a is a disorder that affects the nerves and can be a symptom of metabolic disorders related to &#946;-oxidation. It is also recognized as a potential complication of metabolic disorders such as Adrenoleukodystrophy, which impacts nerve function.</data>
      <data key="d2">2f96bbc5eafd39b659620da7282a2079,c4abdcd9f1628aa02ca6ed662b795fd6</data>
