    </node>
    <node id="ARRITMIAS CARD&#205;ACAS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Arritmias card&#237;acas are heart rhythm disorders that can manifest in patients with various metabolic disorders, including Adrenoleukodystrophy. These cardiac arrhythmias are characterized as alterations in the heart's rhythm and may serve as a symptom of disorders related to the &#946;-oxidation of fatty acids.</data>
      <data key="d2">2f96bbc5eafd39b659620da7282a2079,c4abdcd9f1628aa02ca6ed662b795fd6</data>
