    <node id="TCM">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">TCM, or Triglycerides of Medium Chain, refers to a type of dietary fat characterized by a chain length of 6 to 12 carbon atoms. These fats are known for their rapid absorption and metabolism in the body, making them beneficial for improving energy absorption and metabolism. TCM is commonly derived from coconut oil and is utilized in various nutritional products aimed at providing energy. Additionally, TCM is significant in dietary treatments, particularly for patients with specific conditions such as adrenoleucodystrophy, where the intake of medium-chain triglycerides may need to be restricted. Furthermore, TCM is used to reduce the intake of omega-6 fatty acids in lipid emulsions, highlighting its role in nutritional management.</data>
      <data key="d2">12b6478763cfb60ad144be6b81778e03,347e3d175ef7f30e3dcad731f84fb375,3c2bb3d9d6534668e58f571710c9bb02,87da0f3b46604498629565db45667b3b,9ceafecc91648750126099fd54024495</data>
      <data key="d3">486</data>
      <data key="d4">1</data>
      <data key="d5">11</data>
      <data key="d6">11048</data>
      <data key="d7">dc09b2b86ea741bc909aac72fbd8524c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="TCL">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">TCL is an organization that focuses on dietary modifications and nutritional supplementation, with a particular emphasis on low-fat diets and medium-chain triglycerides (TCM). In the context of nutrition, TCL also refers to Triglycerides of Long Chain, which are dietary fats that require bile salts for absorption and are metabolized differently than TCM. Additionally, TCL is associated with the treatment of nutritional disorders related to &#946;-oxidation, where long-chain triglycerides play a significant role. Overall, TCL encompasses both the promotion of specific dietary practices and the understanding of different types of triglycerides in nutritional health.</data>
      <data key="d2">347e3d175ef7f30e3dcad731f84fb375,3c2bb3d9d6534668e58f571710c9bb02,9ceafecc91648750126099fd54024495</data>
      <data key="d3">486</data>
      <data key="d4">1</data>
      <data key="d5">9</data>
      <data key="d6">11049</data>
      <data key="d7">94f2c66cf8ca4301912a159011d7f5a3</data>
    </node>
