    <node id="HURLER SYNDROME">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Hurler syndrome is a genetic disorder caused by the deficiency of an enzyme needed to break down glycosaminoglycans, leading to various physical and cognitive impairments.</data>
