    <node id="SISTEMA LINF&#193;TICO">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The "SISTEMA LINF&#193;TICO" is a vital system in the body responsible for transporting lymph, a fluid that contains white blood cells and various other components, through lymphatic vessels to the circulatory system. It is a complex network of tissues and organs that plays a crucial role in the body's immune function by helping to eliminate toxins, waste, and other unwanted materials. This system is essential for maintaining overall health and supporting the body's defense mechanisms.</data>
      <data key="d2">0f2aa9d202fbabe2b0f310000e6987e7,6bbb4df989ed7353f621a7d44dbc7972</data>
      <data key="d3">1797</data>
