      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">AN&#193;LISIS MICROBIOL&#211;GICO refers to a microbiological analysis procedure that is essential for various medical evaluations. This analysis is particularly important in clinical settings, as it can be necessary to rule out infections in cases such as pleural effusion or ascites. Additionally, microbiological analysis plays a crucial role in the evaluation of enteral nutrition products, ensuring their safety and efficacy for patient use.</data>
