    <node id="LINFOCITOS T">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">LINFOCITOS T, or T lymphocytes, are a type of white blood cell that play a central role in cell-mediated immunity. They are crucial for the immune response, helping the body to identify and eliminate pathogens and infected cells.</data>
