    <node id="MOLUSCOS Y CRUST&#193;CEOS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">MOLUSCOS Y CRUST&#193;CEOS, which refers to shellfish and crustaceans, are known to be high in purines, which can lead to elevated uric acid levels in the body. However, they are permitted in modified diets, indicating that their consumption can be managed or included under certain dietary guidelines.</data>
      <data key="d2">347e3d175ef7f30e3dcad731f84fb375,393fd6c0f1d43f0413a5b82d1dc0c2fc</data>
