    <node id="CARNES GRASAS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">CARNES GRASAS refers to fatty meats that are characterized by their high fat content. These meats should be limited in children's diets to promote better health outcomes, as they can contribute to various health issues. Additionally, CARNES GRASAS are high in purines, which can lead to increased uric acid levels in the body. Due to these health concerns, fatty meats are not permitted in modified diets, emphasizing the need for careful dietary management to ensure overall well-being.</data>
      <data key="d2">06f547bc6311ffa370bc1a65dc7184d2,347e3d175ef7f30e3dcad731f84fb375,393fd6c0f1d43f0413a5b82d1dc0c2fc</data>
