    <node id="YEMA DE HUEVO">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">YEMA DE HUEVO, or egg yolk, is characterized by a high phosphorus content, exceeding 30 mg/g. Due to this elevated phosphorus ratio, it is recommended that egg yolk be limited in consumption. Furthermore, in the context of a modified diet, egg yolk is not permitted, indicating that individuals following such a diet should avoid its inclusion.</data>
      <data key="d2">26e7a15d14f527bbd2b99f7a7bc55d81,347e3d175ef7f30e3dcad731f84fb375</data>
