      <data key="d1">PESCADO AZUL refers to blue fish, which is generally discouraged in dietary recommendations due to its higher phosphorus content. However, it is noted that some blue fish may have a favorable phosphorus to protein ratio. Despite this, in the context of a modified diet, blue fish is not permitted.</data>
