    <node id="OCTREOTIDA">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Octreotide is a synthetic analog of somatostatin, primarily utilized in the treatment of various medical conditions, including quilot&#243;rax and ascitis quilosa. It is often administered through continuous infusion. In addition to its standalone use, octreotide is also employed in conjunction with dietary treatments to help reduce lymphatic flow, thereby enhancing clinical outcomes for patients.</data>
      <data key="d2">ae05ce71cf124553fea10e6c602f8d16,b55a8ca77c67f4c18eea7abe52c3d2f9</data>
      <data key="d3">1795</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">4</data>
      <data key="d6">11156</data>
      <data key="d7">8a672cf8ab864778b31f6e9f42cb7730</data>
    </node>
    <node id="ETILNEFRINA">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Etilnefrina is a sympathomimetic drug that reduces lymphatic flow in the thoracic duct by contracting the smooth muscle of its wall.</data>
      <data key="d2">b55a8ca77c67f4c18eea7abe52c3d2f9</data>
      <data key="d3">1795</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">2</data>
      <data key="d6">11157</data>
      <data key="d7">35c3129ffc2a440186209aded7ba0dd1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="TRATAMIENTO QUIR&#218;RGICO">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">The entity "TRATAMIENTO QUIR&#218;RGICO" refers to surgical treatment options indicated for various medical conditions. Specifically, surgical treatment is recommended for patients suffering from severe pancreatic conditions, especially in cases where complications arise, such as bile duct obstruction or the presence of pseudo cysts. Additionally, surgical intervention is advised for refractory cases of chylothorax and chylous ascites, which involves procedures aimed at repairing injuries to the lymphatic ducts. This comprehensive approach highlights the critical role of surgical treatment in managing complex medical issues.</data>
      <data key="d2">32642463df83d3626d7a9c5acf121825,b55a8ca77c67f4c18eea7abe52c3d2f9</data>
      <data key="d3">1799</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">4</data>
      <data key="d6">11158</data>
      <data key="d7">abd2168ec6244989b4742790b23bc966</data>
    </node>
    <node id="F&#205;STULAS LINF&#193;TICAS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Lymphatic fistulas are abnormal connections that can form between lymphatic vessels and other structures, often requiring surgical intervention.</data>
      <data key="d2">b55a8ca77c67f4c18eea7abe52c3d2f9</data>
      <data key="d3">1799</data>
