    <node id="EMBOLIZACI&#211;N">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Embolization is a minimally invasive procedure used to treat conditions such as quilot&#243;rax and lymphatic fistulas, showing high success rates in traumatic cases.</data>
