    </node>
    <node id="CHYLOTHORAX">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Chylothorax is a medical condition characterized by the accumulation of lymphatic fluid, specifically chyle, in the pleural cavity. This condition can arise due to various factors, including trauma or complications from surgical procedures. Management of chylothorax often necessitates specific nutritional support to address the underlying issues associated with the accumulation of this fluid.</data>
      <data key="d2">a35fdf8cbbb5fe4783572ea6e86f7776,fba8cc8092875a542f3b63663ce5c8d9</data>
