    <node id="ARCH SURG">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Arch Surg is a journal dedicated to the field of surgery, encompassing a wide range of surgical practices and research. It publishes studies that address various aspects of surgical care, including postoperative complications such as chylous ascites, as well as topics related to immunonutrition. Through its contributions, Arch Surg aims to advance the understanding and application of surgical techniques and patient management in the medical community.</data>
      <data key="d2">b9a7e8e8fec7968cf56017bf41f92bb4,fba8cc8092875a542f3b63663ce5c8d9</data>
