    <node id="BRITISH JOURNAL OF COMMUNITY NURSING">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The British Journal of Community Nursing (Br J Comun Nurs) is a scholarly journal dedicated to the exploration and discussion of community nursing practices. It focuses on various aspects of community nursing, including the management of nutritional issues related to chyle leaks and chylous effusions. The journal publishes a range of research articles and discussions that contribute to the field of community nursing, emphasizing the importance of effective nutritional management within this context.</data>
