    </node>
    <node id="STATUS EPILEPTICUS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Status epilepticus is a serious medical condition characterized by prolonged or repeated seizures without recovery between them. It is considered a medical emergency due to the potential for significant complications. In cases where status epilepticus is refractory to standard treatments, the ketogenic diet may be utilized as a therapeutic option.</data>
      <data key="d2">a8929d6c031b44205ed738ec0a0cd435,e533f9391cb85c02809d6f09d3a4d08e</data>
      <data key="d3">580</data>
      <data key="d4">1</data>
      <data key="d5">3</data>
      <data key="d6">11229</data>
      <data key="d7">b016847363a94f3ca482da048ac2d9b2</data>
    </node>
    <node id="CUIDADOS INTENSIVOS">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">CUIDADOS INTENSIVOS, or intensive care, refers to the specialized treatment provided to patients who are critically ill. This care is typically administered in intensive care units (ICUs), which are specialized medical facilities designed to offer comprehensive support to these patients. In ICUs, critically ill individuals receive close monitoring of vital signs, including glucose levels, and nutritional support tailored to their specific needs. Additionally, cuidados intensivos encompasses the management of severe medical conditions, such as status epilepticus, ensuring that patients receive the necessary interventions and therapies to stabilize their health.</data>
      <data key="d2">a8929d6c031b44205ed738ec0a0cd435,cd63370bdd798f0b060b047dc29056ae,d42b833940d845abc98aa8e8ea05d6ae</data>
      <data key="d3">580</data>
      <data key="d4">1</data>
      <data key="d5">3</data>
      <data key="d6">11230</data>
      <data key="d7">77f89fa2ece9440d84752e888311e414</data>
    </node>
    <node id="ANTICONVULSIVANTES">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Los anticonvulsivantes son medicamentos utilizados para prevenir o tratar las crisis epil&#233;pticas.</data>
      <data key="d2">a8929d6c031b44205ed738ec0a0cd435</data>
      <data key="d3">1940</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">11231</data>
      <data key="d7">b9943d19908c46578a225ba6691fa34d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="CRISIS AT&#211;NICAS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Las crisis at&#243;nicas son episodios de p&#233;rdida repentina del tono muscular, lo que puede llevar a ca&#237;das o colapsos.</data>
      <data key="d2">a8929d6c031b44205ed738ec0a0cd435</data>
      <data key="d3">1940</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">11232</data>
      <data key="d7">95b859cc49194adeacc1aa7baeadbb2d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="CRISIS PARCIALES">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Las crisis parciales son crisis epil&#233;pticas que afectan solo una parte del cerebro y pueden manifestarse de diversas maneras, dependiendo de la regi&#243;n afectada.</data>
      <data key="d2">a8929d6c031b44205ed738ec0a0cd435</data>
      <data key="d3">1940</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">11233</data>
      <data key="d7">97ca008229124ec081ac98f5e653f101</data>
    </node>
    <node id="CRISIS T&#211;NICO-CL&#211;NICAS GENERALIZADAS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Las crisis t&#243;nico-cl&#243;nicas generalizadas son un tipo de crisis epil&#233;ptica que involucra contracciones musculares t&#243;nicas seguidas de sacudidas cl&#243;nicas, afectando todo el cuerpo.</data>
      <data key="d2">a8929d6c031b44205ed738ec0a0cd435</data>
      <data key="d3">1940</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">11234</data>
      <data key="d7">e2082c60ca0a44bf9931a90a7a3009f2</data>
    </node>
    <node id="EPILEPSIA MIOCL&#211;NICA SEVERA DE LA INFANCIA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">La epilepsia miocl&#243;nica severa de la infancia es un tipo de epilepsia que se presenta en la infancia y se caracteriza por convulsiones miocl&#243;nicas frecuentes y severas.</data>
      <data key="d2">a8929d6c031b44205ed738ec0a0cd435</data>
      <data key="d3">1940</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">11235</data>
      <data key="d7">1db7c3eee61e48fcb7b2a25efc8c243b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="ACETAZOLAMIDA">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Acetazolamida is a medication that is recommended to be taken on an empty stomach to enhance its absorption. It functions as a carbonic anhydrase inhibitor, which can lead to a significant risk of acidosis if used concurrently with a ketogenic diet.</data>
      <data key="d2">04f886244ff7d736eb270f175d6b120e,0a9b42ff082f2d0bb036ec3365d9a6e9</data>
      <data key="d3">1413</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">2</data>
      <data key="d6">11236</data>
      <data key="d7">8e1b91eedbcf4a108cd64c94ddee0101</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&#193;CIDO VALPROICO">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">El &#225;cido valproico es un medicamento que inhibe la &#946;-oxidaci&#243;n y se conjuga con la carnitina acil-transferasa, lo que puede llevar a un d&#233;ficit de carnitina.</data>
      <data key="d2">0a9b42ff082f2d0bb036ec3365d9a6e9</data>
      <data key="d3">1940</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">11237</data>
      <data key="d7">37b4f0e34b004b80809f67eb2b38c9f4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="HIPERAMONIEMIA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">La hiperamonemia es una condici&#243;n m&#233;dica caracterizada por niveles elevados de amon&#237;aco en la sangre, que puede ser un efecto secundario en algunos pacientes.</data>
      <data key="d2">0a9b42ff082f2d0bb036ec3365d9a6e9</data>
      <data key="d3">1940</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">11238</data>
      <data key="d7">e9e63e7db2d14c64aab3c3cf8042f1a6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="EDEMA CEREBRAL">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Edema cerebral, or cerebral edema, is the swelling of the brain caused by an accumulation of excess fluid. This condition can arise in severe cases of hyponatremia and is considered a medical emergency that necessitates immediate intervention. Additionally, cerebral edema can be a complication in patients suffering from various metabolic conditions. The presence of excess fluid in the brain can lead to increased intracranial pressure and potentially serious health consequences, highlighting the importance of prompt diagnosis and treatment.</data>
      <data key="d2">05a2506becec805cd1374d73de9a9fec,0a9b42ff082f2d0bb036ec3365d9a6e9</data>
      <data key="d3">1427</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">2</data>
      <data key="d6">11239</data>
      <data key="d7">ddabb04a510b434295d3c7f8ff1dbd55</data>
    </node>
    <node id="CRISIS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Crisis refers to seizures experienced by patients with refractory epilepsy, characterized by episodes of abnormal electrical activity in the brain. The ketogenic diet is designed to reduce or eliminate these seizures in affected individuals. This dietary approach specifically targets the control of these episodes, aiming to improve the quality of life for patients suffering from epilepsy.</data>
      <data key="d2">0a9b42ff082f2d0bb036ec3365d9a6e9,0ebd0c517a3d578a6823dc39797e4da1,2d07762e6db07c2587caceac3427a1c7</data>
      <data key="d3">1940</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">2</data>
      <data key="d6">11240</data>
      <data key="d7">9d13d335326d4459b387c0764b67238a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="ENSAYOS CL&#205;NICOS ALEATORIZADOS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Los ensayos cl&#237;nicos aleatorizados son estudios que se utilizan para evaluar la eficacia de la dieta cetog&#233;nica en comparaci&#243;n con grupos de control.</data>
      <data key="d2">0a9b42ff082f2d0bb036ec3365d9a6e9</data>
      <data key="d3">1940</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">11241</data>
      <data key="d7">8b1e737b539544779b59a520b5775cfa</data>
    </node>
    <node id="REVISI&#211;N COCHRANE">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">La Revisi&#243;n Cochrane es un an&#225;lisis exhaustivo que incluye ensayos cl&#237;nicos sobre la eficacia de la dieta cetog&#233;nica, proporcionando evidencia sobre su uso en pacientes. Adem&#225;s, se trata de una revisi&#243;n sistem&#225;tica que eval&#250;a la efectividad de las f&#243;rmulas inmunomoduladoras en pacientes con c&#225;ncer. En conjunto, estas revisiones reflejan el compromiso de la Revisi&#243;n Cochrane con la evaluaci&#243;n rigurosa de intervenciones m&#233;dicas y nutricionales, contribuyendo a la base de evidencia en el &#225;mbito de la salud.</data>
      <data key="d2">0a9b42ff082f2d0bb036ec3365d9a6e9,d77e49d1dba3a67fbc9cf58911dc2478</data>
      <data key="d3">1940</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">2</data>
      <data key="d6">11242</data>
      <data key="d7">61c4a684a790472683e882b22f4750ad</data>
    </node>
    <node id="NI&#209;OS Y ADOLESCENTES">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Los ni&#241;os y adolescentes son el grupo demogr&#225;fico m&#225;s estudiado en relaci&#243;n con la dieta cetog&#233;nica y su eficacia en la reducci&#243;n de crisis epil&#233;pticas.</data>
      <data key="d2">0a9b42ff082f2d0bb036ec3365d9a6e9</data>
      <data key="d3">1940</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">11243</data>
      <data key="d7">7c66f0d3c0a94c54a42ba2528f0f3f9a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="HIPOGLICEMIA HIPOCET&#211;SICA">
      <data key="d0" />
      <data key="d1" />
      <data key="d2">0a9b42ff082f2d0bb036ec3365d9a6e9</data>
      <data key="d3">1940</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">11244</data>
      <data key="d7">5637d9d7c7204098a6cc12b69d926324</data>
    </node>
    <node id="DIETA ATKINS MODIFICADA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">La Dieta Atkins Modificada es un enfoque diet&#233;tico que se caracteriza por la limitaci&#243;n de la ingesta de gl&#250;cidos. Esta dieta ha sido objeto de varios estudios que eval&#250;an su eficacia en el tratamiento de crisis epil&#233;pticas. Se considera una variante de la dieta cetog&#233;nica, ya que tambi&#233;n tiene como objetivo el control de las crisis, aunque se diferencia en las proporciones de macronutrientes que se utilizan.</data>
      <data key="d2">2d07762e6db07c2587caceac3427a1c7,c58e4b0e4e936cc1fd696a32d8390bdc</data>
      <data key="d3">1943</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">8</data>
      <data key="d6">11245</data>
      <data key="d7">220ef0d00e114318b779b02620b9fab3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="CUMPLIMIENTO">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">El cumplimiento es el grado en que los pacientes siguen las recomendaciones de la dieta, lo cual afecta la eficacia del tratamiento.</data>
      <data key="d2">2d07762e6db07c2587caceac3427a1c7</data>
      <data key="d3">1943</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">2</data>
      <data key="d6">11246</data>
      <data key="d7">366f0b28b42f47cfb2ae49ce453bce01</data>
    </node>
    <node id="EFICACIA">
      <data key="d0" />
      <data key="d1" />
      <data key="d2">2d07762e6db07c2587caceac3427a1c7</data>
      <data key="d3">1943</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">2</data>
      <data key="d6">11247</data>
      <data key="d7">d8494e9f28f3437394e7afa331c10426</data>
    </node>
    <node id="MULTIVITAM&#205;NICO">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Un preparado multivitam&#237;nico con minerales y elementos traza es recomendado para evitar carencias en la dieta cetog&#233;nica.</data>
      <data key="d2">1592143354d1ef792f8618ec03a32a16</data>
      <data key="d3">1940</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">11248</data>
      <data key="d7">59c2e6e2c9d641f799cf16b40b1bc9ec</data>
    </node>
    <node id="EXCIPIENTES">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Los excipientes de los medicamentos pueden influir en la efectividad de la dieta cetog&#233;nica, siendo importante verificar su contenido.</data>
      <data key="d2">4d84210c815fb41f2fa44f3e01aafa02</data>
      <data key="d3">1940</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">11249</data>
      <data key="d7">92a2a65339c040868cc2e64065461c9c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="CONTROL AMBULATORIO">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">El control ambulatorio es necesario durante la realizaci&#243;n de la dieta cetog&#233;nica para asegurar un adecuado desarrollo pondoestatural y evitar complicaciones.</data>
      <data key="d2">4d84210c815fb41f2fa44f3e01aafa02</data>
      <data key="d3">1940</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">11250</data>
      <data key="d7">f50611d2ba614aeb8e1be82f13b0826c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="JOHNS HOPKINS HOSPITAL">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Johns Hopkins Hospital is a medical institution known for its research and treatment protocols, including the classic ketogenic diet for refractory epilepsy.</data>
      <data key="d2">0ebd0c517a3d578a6823dc39797e4da1</data>
      <data key="d3">1947</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">2</data>
      <data key="d6">11251</data>
      <data key="d7">c59c638c87a5402db0c730a741e5ea62</data>
    </node>
    <node id="DC">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">DC refers to a dietary treatment that has been extensively studied for its effects on various health parameters in children, particularly in relation to metabolic disorders and nutritional complications. Specifically, DC is recognized as the classic ketogenic diet, which has served as a standard treatment for refractory epilepsy for many years. This diet is commonly utilized for managing epileptic seizures and has been compared with other dietary approaches, such as the DAM, in several studies.</data>
      <data key="d2">0ebd0c517a3d578a6823dc39797e4da1,214cb2b8ddec52ff69849d87feb8e141,c58e4b0e4e936cc1fd696a32d8390bdc</data>
      <data key="d3">1947</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">19</data>
      <data key="d6">11252</data>
      <data key="d7">9870a8cfb72445fa8e5437c1dc840c93</data>
    </node>
    <node id="DCSA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">DCSA is a modified ketogenic diet without initial fasting, implemented gradually to achieve the desired caloric intake.</data>
      <data key="d2">0ebd0c517a3d578a6823dc39797e4da1</data>
      <data key="d3">1940</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">11253</data>
      <data key="d7">804c9f8c49e5479d895c100340aa1748</data>
    </node>
    <node id="DGSA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">DGSA is a gradual ketogenic diet that progresses the ketogenic ratio from 1:1 to 4:1 over several days.</data>
      <data key="d2">0ebd0c517a3d578a6823dc39797e4da1</data>
      <data key="d3">1940</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">11254</data>
      <data key="d7">5904101e46344839990317b32d72023a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="VARIANTES DE DIETAS CETOG&#201;NICAS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Variants of ketogenic diets include different types and modifications aimed at improving tolerability and effectiveness.</data>
      <data key="d2">0ebd0c517a3d578a6823dc39797e4da1</data>
      <data key="d3">1940</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">11255</data>
      <data key="d7">80981c7809aa4f7293ae30ab46a7360f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="HUTTENLOCHER">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Huttenlocher is a researcher who initially described the medium-chain triglyceride (MCT) ketogenic diet in 1971.</data>
      <data key="d2">55b85a76a2c3d515bd3fe6137255abac</data>
      <data key="d3">576</data>
      <data key="d4">1</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">11256</data>
      <data key="d7">5209b0cd81654f24bda784853c7095b0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="ATKINS DIET">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">The Atkins diet is a low-carbohydrate diet originally developed for weight loss. It has gained recognition as an alternative for individuals who may find the ketogenic diet too restrictive. In addition to its weight loss benefits, the Atkins diet has also been studied for its potential effectiveness in treating intractable epilepsy.</data>
      <data key="d2">19d0093eea71a0652dc1aa027fb454bb,55b85a76a2c3d515bd3fe6137255abac</data>
      <data key="d3">577</data>
      <data key="d4">1</data>
      <data key="d5">2</data>
      <data key="d6">11257</data>
      <data key="d7">61933f142d21441d876e6b33003d2587</data>
    </node>
    <node id="MEDIUM-CHAIN TRIGLYCERIDES">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Medium-chain triglycerides (MCTs) are a type of fat that can be used in ketogenic diets to enhance ketosis and improve palatability.</data>
      <data key="d2">55b85a76a2c3d515bd3fe6137255abac</data>
      <data key="d3">576</data>
      <data key="d4">1</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">11258</data>
      <data key="d7">1cf607779a034e3285780b35f3bf3ed2</data>
    </node>
    <node id="CLASSIC KETOGENIC DIET">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">The classic ketogenic diet is a high-fat, low-carbohydrate diet that has been traditionally used to treat epilepsy.</data>
      <data key="d2">55b85a76a2c3d515bd3fe6137255abac</data>
      <data key="d3">577</data>
      <data key="d4">1</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">11259</data>
      <data key="d7">8264438cd7cf47c480e104f6b649d8ec</data>
    </node>
    <node id="DIETARY PROTOCOL">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Dietary protocols are structured plans for implementing specific diets, such as the gradual ketogenic diet protocol described in the text.</data>
      <data key="d2">55b85a76a2c3d515bd3fe6137255abac</data>
      <data key="d3">576</data>
      <data key="d4">1</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">11260</data>
      <data key="d7">15025a34f00e413fb631c22f4aaea973</data>
    </node>
    <node id="COLLEGIATE STUDY">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">A collegiate study refers to research conducted in academic settings, often comparing different dietary approaches for medical conditions.</data>
      <data key="d2">55b85a76a2c3d515bd3fe6137255abac</data>
      <data key="d3">576</data>
      <data key="d4">1</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">11261</data>
      <data key="d7">991dc0959cbc4627992dbe2bb2f8ee32</data>
    </node>
    <node id="DIETARY THERAPIES">
      <data key="d0" />
      <data key="d1" />
      <data key="d2">55b85a76a2c3d515bd3fe6137255abac</data>
      <data key="d3">577</data>
      <data key="d4">1</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">11262</data>
      <data key="d7">be8e44acd3ff4f24982e056682e0d3c3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="DAM">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">La DAM es un tratamiento diet&#233;tico que se utiliza en combinaci&#243;n con antiepil&#233;pticos para reducir la frecuencia de crisis epil&#233;pticas.</data>
      <data key="d2">c58e4b0e4e936cc1fd696a32d8390bdc</data>
      <data key="d3">1948</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">6</data>
      <data key="d6">11263</data>
      <data key="d7">173452c32d1b4b95be222841f6a9216f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="LECHE CETOG&#201;NICA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">La Leche Cetog&#233;nica es un complemento diet&#233;tico que se utiliza en la dieta cetog&#233;nica, especialmente para ni&#241;os y pacientes con secuelas neurol&#243;gicas.</data>
      <data key="d2">c58e4b0e4e936cc1fd696a32d8390bdc</data>
      <data key="d3">1948</data>
