    <node id="KOSSOFF EH">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Kossoff E. H. is a prominent researcher and author recognized for his extensive work on the ketogenic diet and its application in treating epilepsy. He has conducted significant studies that explore the efficacy of dietary therapies, particularly the ketogenic diet, in managing this neurological condition. His contributions to the field have been influential in advancing the understanding of how dietary interventions can benefit individuals with epilepsy.</data>
