    <node id="SOPA">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">SOPA, or soup, is a type of food that plays a significant role in a strict low-sodium diet. It is recognized for its benefits in hydration and nutrition, particularly during episodes of diarrhea, making it a valuable option for maintaining health in such situations.</data>
      <data key="d2">1d959525e9a5fe22094271d67d0b9108,e318ae466c5fed49e6aeb9c9a23d2d38</data>
