      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The National High Blood Pressure Education Program is an initiative designed to educate both the public and healthcare professionals about hypertension, its prevention, and treatment. The program focuses on raising awareness regarding high blood pressure and aims to provide valuable information to help individuals manage and prevent this common health issue.</data>
      <data key="d2">3fab4e796fd2145b2d0f62ffa60775aa,b49f181ca7099fc110f35ccc27e7fafc</data>
