      <data key="d1">The Joint National Committee is a collective that focuses on establishing guidelines for the prevention, detection, evaluation, and treatment of high blood pressure, also known as hypertension. This committee offers comprehensive recommendations for managing hypertension, which include considerations for dietary sodium and potassium intake, among other factors.</data>
