    <node id="DASH COLLABORATIVE RESEARCH GROUP">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The DASH Collaborative Research Group is a dedicated team that conducts clinical trials aimed at studying the effects of dietary patterns on blood pressure. Their research focuses on understanding how different dietary approaches can influence blood pressure levels, contributing valuable insights to the field of nutrition and cardiovascular health.</data>
      <data key="d2">4a59488a9440b38afba989ca88d49ca3,b49f181ca7099fc110f35ccc27e7fafc</data>
