    <node id="TRIALS OF HYPERTENSION PREVENTION COLLABORATIVE RESEARCH GROUP">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The Trials of Hypertension Prevention Collaborative Research Group is a dedicated research entity focused on investigating interventions aimed at preventing hypertension. This group conducts comprehensive studies to evaluate the impact of lifestyle changes on the development and management of hypertension, contributing valuable insights into effective prevention strategies.</data>
