      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Ana Isabel Ilundain Gonz&#225;lez is a medical professional affiliated with the Hospital Cl&#237;nico Universitario Lozano Blesa, where she specializes in endocrinology and nutrition. She is also a co-author engaged in research related to nephrolithiasis and dietary management, contributing to the understanding of how diet impacts kidney stone formation and overall health.</data>
