      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Mar&#237;a Julia Oc&#243;n Bret&#243;n is a medical professional affiliated with the Hospital Cl&#237;nico Universitario Lozano Blesa, where she specializes in endocrinology and nutrition. In addition to her clinical work, she is also an author and researcher, with a particular focus on nephrolithiasis and dietary treatments. Her expertise encompasses both the medical and research aspects of her fields, contributing to advancements in understanding and managing conditions related to nutrition and kidney health.</data>
