      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Jud&#237;as blancas are a type of white bean that serve as a rich source of dietary fiber. These legumes are also recognized for their high magnesium content, making them a nutritious addition to a balanced diet.</data>
