    <node id="GARBANZOS">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Garbanzos, also known as chickpeas, are legumes that play a significant role in nutrition. They are particularly high in fiber, making them a beneficial addition to a healthy diet. Additionally, garbanzos contribute to magnesium intake and contain 6.7 mg of iron per 100 grams, further enhancing their nutritional value.</data>
      <data key="d2">846a0cb8b0428de4dd313cf55913d6bd,b2bdb1e00976001800583298f8dddc7a,e742c891694171ad455b038f416b7728</data>
