    <node id="CANADA">
      <data key="d0">GEO</data>
      <data key="d1">Canada is a country that has its own data on Non-Persistent Disease (NPD), reporting a prevalence of 13.3 cases per million in 2012. Additionally, Canada is home to the Osteoporosis Society of Canada, which provides guidelines for the management of osteoporosis, contributing to the country's healthcare framework and support for individuals affected by this condition.</data>
