    </node>
    <node id="HETEROCIGOTOS C282Y/H63D">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Heterocigotos C282Y/H63D refers to individuals with two different mutations in the HFE gene, which can also lead to iron overload.</data>
      <data key="d2">1cdec368125a3e3fd5c3c7accc5b89ec</data>
