    <node id="DEFEROXAMINE">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Deferoxamine is a medication used as an iron chelator, recommended for patients who cannot tolerate phlebotomy or have contraindications, such as severe heart failure or anemia.</data>
