    <node id="HEMATOCHROMATOSIS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Hemochromatosis is a condition characterized by excessive iron accumulation in the body, which can lead to serious health issues, including liver damage and diabetes.</data>
