    <node id="VIRUS DE HEPATITIS B">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Hepatitis B virus is a virus that attacks the liver and can cause both acute and chronic diseases, increasing the risk of cirrhosis and liver cancer.</data>
