    <node id="VIRUS DE HEPATITIS C">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Hepatitis C virus is a virus that primarily affects the liver and can lead to chronic liver disease, cirrhosis, and liver cancer.</data>
