      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The European Association for the Study of the Liver is an organization dedicated to advancing the understanding and management of liver diseases. It plays a crucial role in providing clinical practice guidelines for various liver conditions, including Wilson's disease and HFE Hemochromatosis. Through its guidelines, the association aims to improve patient care and promote best practices in the diagnosis and treatment of liver-related disorders.</data>
