    <node id="HEMOCHROMATOSIS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Hemochromatosis is a genetic disorder characterized by excessive iron accumulation in the body, often resulting from genetic factors. This condition can lead to various health complications due to the body's inability to regulate iron absorption effectively.</data>
