    <node id="MUTACI&#211;N DEL GEN ATP7A">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">The entity "MUTACI&#211;N DEL GEN ATP7A" refers to a genetic alteration that can lead to the disease known as Menkes disease, as well as other disorders related to copper metabolism. This mutation specifically impacts the function of the ATP7A gene, which is crucial for the regulation and transport of copper within the body.</data>
      <data key="d2">232591ff32b33e56e95717d4582a5903,4216916ebab948061d2dca4afe7e1e84</data>
