    <node id="PENICILAMINA">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Penicillamine is a medication primarily used to treat Wilson's disease, a condition characterized by the accumulation of copper in the body. It works by reducing this copper buildup, thereby alleviating the symptoms associated with the disease. Additionally, penicillamine is known to cause abnormal taste sensations as a side effect.</data>
      <data key="d2">04f886244ff7d736eb270f175d6b120e,b5c30f293b197b201d278f0660640b86</data>
      <data key="d3">1413</data>
