    <node id="C&#193;LCULOS RENALES">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">C&#225;lculos renales are solid masses made of crystals that originate in the kidneys. These formations can lead to severe pain and various health complications. They are a significant concern in renal health, as their presence can disrupt normal kidney function and result in discomfort for the affected individual.</data>
      <data key="d2">a29197a0d36ee2c688c9c959435e999f,b703f173982cf68d36653cc0d9cc1fcb</data>
      <data key="d3">315</data>
