    <node id="DIARREA Y ESTRE&#209;IMIENTO">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Diarrea y estre&#241;imiento are gastrointestinal symptoms that signify potential underlying structural or functional alterations within the digestive system. These conditions are often discussed in the context of nutrition pathology, highlighting their significance in understanding digestive health. Additionally, the topic of diarrea y estre&#241;imiento is closely related to the role of probiotics and prebiotics in promoting gut health, suggesting that these beneficial microorganisms may play a crucial role in managing and alleviating these symptoms.</data>
      <data key="d2">0d9c11c44c3cf4e1e3148949cc0a4096,6533cbcb76873caf6fd68eb95d313d24</data>
