      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The American Journal of Kidney Diseases is a peer-reviewed journal that focuses on research related to kidney disease and its management.</data>
      <data key="d2">6533cbcb76873caf6fd68eb95d313d24</data>
