    </node>
    <node id="HUMAN MICROBIOME PROJECT">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The Human Microbiome Project is a research initiative launched in 2008, focused on understanding the role of the human microbiome in health and disease. This project aims to characterize the human microbiome through the application of modern genetic techniques, providing insights into how these microbial communities influence various aspects of human health.</data>
      <data key="d2">0d9c11c44c3cf4e1e3148949cc0a4096,582f520c5400d8dfa8ec81c8afdc31a8</data>
      <data key="d3">325</data>
