    </node>
    <node id="ALFRED NISSLE">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Alfred Nissle was a German professor who isolated a non-pathogenic strain of E. coli from a soldier's feces during World War I, contributing to the understanding of probiotics.</data>
      <data key="d2">113f5fda648e7322f4771e2ade72481f</data>
      <data key="d3">1024</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">12088</data>
      <data key="d7">8d8a0a5f8b864c4e90f041b6d88af9a4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="ORGANIZACI&#211;N MUNDIAL DE GASTROENTEROLOG&#205;A">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The Organizaci&#243;n Mundial de Gastroenterolog&#237;a (World Gastroenterology Organization) is an influential organization dedicated to advancing gastrointestinal health. It plays a crucial role in setting criteria for probiotics, ensuring that their health benefits are scientifically validated. Additionally, the organization provides comprehensive guidelines and recommendations related to gastrointestinal health, which include the use of both probiotics and prebiotics. Through its efforts, the Organizaci&#243;n Mundial de Gastroenterolog&#237;a promotes research in the field, contributing to the overall understanding and improvement of gastrointestinal health practices.</data>
      <data key="d2">113f5fda648e7322f4771e2ade72481f,582f520c5400d8dfa8ec81c8afdc31a8,5a1ea1a4dfb1b591756a8dc60f504da2</data>
      <data key="d3">1025</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">7</data>
      <data key="d6">12089</data>
      <data key="d7">8cf726b7cc0d4a1cba62e72ae48e116e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="PROBI&#211;TICOS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Probiotics are live microorganisms that confer health benefits to the host, particularly in the realm of gastrointestinal health. These beneficial bacteria have the potential to reduce inflammation and improve health outcomes in various conditions when consumed in adequate amounts. Overall, probiotics play a significant role in promoting health and well-being.</data>
      <data key="d2">113f5fda648e7322f4771e2ade72481f,379909adba66c6e316f560669cd30472,5a1ea1a4dfb1b591756a8dc60f504da2,f1f6ad756644e84b6caa8e4e3adb94da</data>
      <data key="d3">1024</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">13</data>
      <data key="d6">12090</data>
      <data key="d7">7bc0b7ce042743b2918da0d58467e913</data>
    </node>
    <node id="DISBIOSIS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">DISBIOSIS refers to an imbalance in the gut microbiota, which can lead to various health issues and diseases in both children and adults. Probiotics are often used to correct this imbalance, aiming to improve health outcomes. The condition is associated with a range of diseases, highlighting the importance of maintaining a healthy gut microbiome for overall well-being.</data>
      <data key="d2">113f5fda648e7322f4771e2ade72481f,5a1ea1a4dfb1b591756a8dc60f504da2,90f122c65fbb08f52e052d0e22714849</data>
      <data key="d3">1003</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">14</data>
      <data key="d6">12091</data>
      <data key="d7">39252344bdd9465fa0fa5d9be11529aa</data>
    </node>
    <node id="SCCHAROMYCES CEREVISIAE">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Sccharomyces cerevisiae is a species of yeast used as a probiotic, known for its role in fermentation and health benefits.</data>
      <data key="d2">5a1ea1a4dfb1b591756a8dc60f504da2</data>
      <data key="d3">1025</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">2</data>
      <data key="d6">12092</data>
      <data key="d7">fc79e259f3204979b3c0b01bfa228288</data>
    </node>
    <node id="DIARREA ASOCIADA A ANTIBI&#211;TICOS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">DIARREA ASOCIADA A ANTIBI&#211;TICOS (Antibiotic-Associated Diarrhea) is a condition that probiotics have shown potential benefits in treating.</data>
      <data key="d2">5a1ea1a4dfb1b591756a8dc60f504da2</data>
      <data key="d3">1025</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
