    <node id="ESCHERICHIA COLI NISSLE 1917">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Escherichia coli Nissle 1917 is a probiotic strain that has been studied for its beneficial effects in the gastrointestinal tract. It has demonstrated effectiveness in preventing relapses in ulcerative colitis (UC) and may also aid in the treatment of this condition, according to some studies. This specific strain of probiotic bacteria is recognized for its potential therapeutic properties in managing gastrointestinal health, particularly in individuals suffering from ulcerative colitis.</data>
      <data key="d2">379909adba66c6e316f560669cd30472,6886c5b652319bea0ba2427a3fdbf701,b6057c29c69893d65ebeb35c05eb845a</data>
