    <node id="VSL#3">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">VSL#3 is a probiotic formulation that has been studied for its potential benefits in treating ulcerative colitis. It is a specific mixture of probiotics that may also be utilized for the treatment of pouchitis or reservoritis. However, it is important to note that there is a lack of evidence supporting its effectiveness over a placebo in these contexts.</data>
      <data key="d2">0bdc356a46149def2545e7939372c20d,6886c5b652319bea0ba2427a3fdbf701</data>
