    <node id="CISAPRIDA">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Cisaprida is a procin&#233;tico medication that aids in gastric emptying and stimulates intestinal motility, which can enhance the absorption of enteral nutrition. It is recommended to be taken with meals to minimize gastrointestinal discomfort. However, it is important to note that Cisaprida can be associated with the production of diarrhea. Additionally, the levels of Cisaprida in the body can be increased by the consumption of grapefruit juice, which may affect its efficacy and safety.</data>
      <data key="d2">04f886244ff7d736eb270f175d6b120e,44f263c31f91c1bc594cbb28bd397c89,4f1c852e5d25eed4db322b75624d3e2b,5eb14e2cbec104d89ad73e2ac968b7fd,fc664efd4e1c463dc21857e596b68b46</data>
