      <data key="d1">Domperidona is a procin&#233;tico medication that enhances gastric emptying and stimulates intestinal motility. It is recommended to be taken with meals to decrease gastrointestinal discomfort. However, it may also be associated with the production of diarrhea.</data>
      <data key="d2">04f886244ff7d736eb270f175d6b120e,44f263c31f91c1bc594cbb28bd397c89,5eb14e2cbec104d89ad73e2ac968b7fd</data>
