    <node id="5-FLUOROURACILO">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">5-fluorouracilo, also known as 5-fluorouracil, is an antineoplastic chemotherapy medication used to treat cancer. It is often administered in combination with other drugs, such as cisplatin, to enhance its effectiveness. One of the notable side effects associated with 5-fluorouracilo is the potential for diarrhea, which can occur during treatment.</data>
