    </node>
    <node id="NADYA">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">NADYA is a comprehensive group dedicated to the study and support of artificial nutrition, specifically focusing on home and outpatient settings in Spain. The group is involved in both home parenteral nutrition and home enteral nutrition, with a particular emphasis on patients suffering from neurological diseases. Since its establishment in 1992, NADYA has maintained a registry that collects and reports data on patients receiving home parenteral nutrition (NPD), as well as on complications related to enteral nutrition. Through its efforts, NADYA aims to enhance nutritional support and improve outcomes for patients requiring specialized nutritional care.</data>
      <data key="d2">4cf0c8d0f4e711be85d16ee71317aa4e,651bf69cdd5aec52b456cbea567f1987,9449ed00392e250aa871c689af51a540,beef8f83c872431c6e371987b717e43b,efc0b55f4e91f02e4708b7cc43c64608</data>
      <data key="d3">1925</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">16</data>
      <data key="d6">12188</data>
      <data key="d7">01db1085f8c74a9999d6dd72b86781cf</data>
    </node>
    <node id="MISOPROSTOL">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Misoprostol is a drug used for patients with functional defecation disorders, acting as a prostaglandin analogue.</data>
      <data key="d2">beef8f83c872431c6e371987b717e43b</data>
      <data key="d3">1404</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">12189</data>
      <data key="d7">bc790b620199435ba28b269ccf4923f2</data>
    </node>
    <node id="COLCHICINE">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Colchicine is a medication used in the treatment of certain conditions affecting bowel function.</data>
      <data key="d2">beef8f83c872431c6e371987b717e43b</data>
      <data key="d3">1404</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">12190</data>
      <data key="d7">d52bb30fbd6d47a4befd0f501266b96c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="LUBIPROSTONE">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Lubiprostone is a local activator of chloride channels used for treating bowel movement issues.</data>
      <data key="d2">beef8f83c872431c6e371987b717e43b</data>
      <data key="d3">1404</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
