    <node id="NUTRICI&#211;N EN PATOLOG&#205;A DEL TUBO DIGESTIVO">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">"NUTRICI&#211;N EN PATOLOG&#205;A DEL TUBO DIGESTIVO" encompasses a comprehensive examination of nutrition as it relates to various pathologies of the digestive tract. This section emphasizes dietary recommendations specifically tailored for patients suffering from inflammatory bowel disease (EII), addressing the critical role of nutritional management in these cases. It discusses both enteral and parenteral nutrition methods, which are essential for patients facing intestinal issues. Additionally, the content highlights the importance of nutrition in the context of surgical patients and explores various studies and findings that underscore the significance of nutritional management in clinical settings. Overall, the focus is on how effective nutritional strategies can mitigate malnutrition and deficiencies that arise from digestive tract diseases, thereby promoting better gastrointestinal health.</data>
      <data key="d2">5785beff5a0642d55deb146b2a454807,582f520c5400d8dfa8ec81c8afdc31a8,7906ee47aaf0c271f072790eaea05866,803363886f385b089938bf122246dfa2,94afd4bf40b661992e66cf7963ef236c,cd56385abb6f8c594bf532666bdf1860,d42b833940d845abc98aa8e8ea05d6ae,e5838e52fbc5d3d18fc0533b71148201</data>
