    <node id="HOSPITAL UNIVERSITARIO INFANTA ELENA">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Hospital Universitario Infanta Elena is a medical institution located in Valdemoro, Madrid. It offers a range of healthcare services and is known for its commitment to providing quality medical care. Teresa de Grado Manchado is one of the professionals working at this hospital, contributing to its operations and patient care.</data>
      <data key="d2">afdd80af18df0213292a5858afeae9cc,dce680808e039e852dc0f2639835db32</data>
      <data key="d3">431</data>
