      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Brummer RJM is a researcher specializing in clinical nutrition and metabolism. He is also an author who focuses on the study of nutrition in relation to Crohn's disease. Through his work, Brummer RJM contributes to the understanding of how nutritional factors can impact metabolic processes and the management of specific health conditions, particularly Crohn's disease.</data>
