      <data key="d1">Levi AJ is a researcher and author who is actively involved in the study of Crohn's disease. He has made significant contributions to the understanding of food intolerance in relation to this condition, enhancing the body of research surrounding both Crohn's disease and dietary factors that may influence its management.</data>
