    <node id="PIRONI L">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Pironi L is an author recognized for significant contributions to the field of nutrition, particularly in relation to chronic nutrition, as evidenced by their involvement in the ESPEN guidelines. Additionally, Pironi L has co-authored bibliographic references that address the definitions of intestinal failure and short bowel syndrome, further highlighting their expertise and influence in these medical areas.</data>
