    <node id="BOZZETTI F">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Bozzetti F is a prominent researcher and author recognized for significant contributions to the field of nutritional support, particularly in the context of cancer patients. He has been actively involved in research focusing on artificial nutritional support and its clinical applications. Bozzetti F has also played a crucial role in developing the ESPEN guidelines on chronic nutrition, as well as guidelines specifically addressing enteral nutrition in oncology. Additionally, he is one of the authors of bibliographic references that discuss guidelines on chronic intestinal failure in adults, further highlighting his expertise and influence in the area of nutritional care for patients with complex medical needs.</data>
      <data key="d2">3f1d1c7c7c62b83f62f6fa31c25f65b2,719fff2d16bc334d3d4b53f070373a10,7e3e2024996e402fc0ab62933ab9417b,81d0f9e0238db446bd67439b8222ab32,ce6821fbd8f78047e06917383f25f037</data>
