    <node id="CUERDA C">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Cuerda C is a prominent member of the NADYA group, where they play a significant role in contributing to reports on home parenteral nutrition in Spain. As a dedicated researcher, Cuerda C focuses on studies related to health-related quality of life for patients receiving home nutritional support. Additionally, Cuerda C is an author involved in the development of the ESPEN guidelines on chronic nutrition, further showcasing their expertise in the field. They are also recognized for their contributions to bibliographic references that discuss guidelines on chronic intestinal failure in adults, highlighting their commitment to advancing knowledge and practices in nutritional support.</data>
      <data key="d2">4b0d0238a19e23ffee592c9d0817e226,4cf0c8d0f4e711be85d16ee71317aa4e,719fff2d16bc334d3d4b53f070373a10,81d0f9e0238db446bd67439b8222ab32</data>
