    <node id="REHABILITACI&#211;N MULTIMODAL">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">REHABILITACI&#211;N MULTIMODAL refers to a comprehensive set of post-surgical interventions designed to accelerate recovery and minimize complications following surgery. This approach incorporates various protocols, including early postoperative feeding, which is specifically aimed at enhancing the recovery process for patients.</data>
      <data key="d2">a089d87928ddde83e1945eece488d3f5,f087e20586f6b263059597e194a04993</data>
