    <node id="GUIDELINES">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">GUIDELINES are systematic recommendations established by ASPEN to provide nutritional support for surgical patients. These guidelines serve as protocols aimed at improving patient care and outcomes, particularly focusing on the prevention of complications in transplant recipients. They are designed to assist healthcare professionals in making informed decisions about patient care based on evidence, ensuring that the best practices are followed in various clinical settings.</data>
      <data key="d2">73d47e377c2910da3393d7bb65f80e8e,e98937544f56006f5d327136c593c969,faa6d27a781e64a98fe101236a44dc16</data>
