    <node id="RYU SW">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Ryu SW is a researcher known for his contributions to the field of nutritional assessments, particularly in the context of gastric cancer patients. He is the author of a study that compares various nutritional assessment methods to detect malnutrition among these patients, which was published in the World Journal of Gastroenterology. Through his work, Ryu SW has played a significant role in advancing the understanding of nutritional needs and challenges faced by individuals with gastric cancer.</data>
