    <node id="MUSCARITOLI M">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Muscaritoli M is a prominent author and researcher in the fields of nutrition and oncology. He has made significant contributions to the guidelines on enteral nutrition specifically tailored for oncology patients. Additionally, Muscaritoli M has played a crucial role in defining key concepts such as sarcopenia, cachexia, and pre-cachexia, which are critical in understanding the nutritional challenges faced by patients with chronic diseases. His research also explores the intricate relationship between sarcopenia and various chronic conditions. Furthermore, Muscaritoli M has contributed to the European Respiratory Society's statement on nutritional assessment and therapy in chronic obstructive pulmonary disease (COPD), highlighting his commitment to improving nutritional care in respiratory illnesses.</data>
      <data key="d2">39a32082aa23f1e71dc12d92750ca657,3be9d646c354d76527755d79a77c916b,3f1d1c7c7c62b83f62f6fa31c25f65b2,933cfaece6287ed7626c5216a1e5c54d</data>
