    </node>
    <node id="OBSERVATORY OF SARCOPENIA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">The Observatory of Sarcopenia is a research initiative established by the Spanish Society of Geriatrics and Gerontology. Its primary focus is on the study and understanding of sarcopenia, a condition characterized by the loss of muscle mass and strength, particularly in older adults. The project aims to address the challenges posed by sarcopenia, enhancing knowledge and promoting strategies to mitigate its effects on the aging population.</data>
      <data key="d2">3be9d646c354d76527755d79a77c916b,e155d9b2d1858daab734fd68a45d0c0a</data>
      <data key="d3">1780</data>
