      <data key="d1">Alejandra Dur&#225;n Rodr&#237;guez-Hervada is an attending physician in the Endocrinology and Nutrition Service at Hospital Cl&#237;nico San Carlos in Madrid.</data>
      <data key="d2">afdd80af18df0213292a5858afeae9cc</data>
