    </node>
    <node id="JPEN JOURNAL OF PARENTERAL AND ENTERAL NUTRITION">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The JPEN Journal of Parenteral and Enteral Nutrition is a scholarly journal dedicated to publishing research focused on nutrition support within clinical settings. It specifically addresses practices and protocols related to both parenteral and enteral nutrition, providing a platform for the dissemination of knowledge and advancements in the field of nutritional support.</data>
      <data key="d2">3d5af63a33abe5094b25a96394f69969,64378df2be6b08b39bd652c0a2d3789c</data>
      <data key="d3">1240</data>
