    <node id="PARENTERAL FEEDING">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Parenteral feeding is a method of delivering nutrients directly into the bloodstream, bypassing the gastrointestinal tract, typically used when enteral feeding is not possible.</data>
      <data key="d2">3d5af63a33abe5094b25a96394f69969</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">12936</data>
      <data key="d7">55f041587d244e1c89429e1af2dd7c06</data>
    </node>
    <node id="SEPTIC MORBIDITY">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Septic morbidity refers to complications arising from infections that can occur in patients, particularly those with abdominal trauma.</data>
      <data key="d2">3d5af63a33abe5094b25a96394f69969</data>
      <data key="d5">0</data>
      <data key="d6">12937</data>
      <data key="d7">92d54bfd317c464ba28693350951b464</data>
    </node>
    <node id="MECHANICALLY VENTILATED PATIENTS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Mechanically ventilated patients are individuals who require assistance with breathing through mechanical ventilation, often in critical care settings.</data>
      <data key="d2">3d5af63a33abe5094b25a96394f69969</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">12938</data>
      <data key="d7">4923e84ebd694daeb0e93c802491cc6f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="GASTRIC FEEDING">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Gastric feeding is a method of enteral nutrition where food is delivered directly into the stomach.</data>
      <data key="d2">3d5af63a33abe5094b25a96394f69969</data>
      <data key="d5">0</data>
      <data key="d6">12939</data>
      <data key="d7">d35d72e4c59544119e78609c98a0c769</data>
    </node>
    <node id="POST-PYLORIC FEEDING">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Post-pyloric feeding is a method of enteral nutrition where food is delivered beyond the stomach, into the small intestine.</data>
      <data key="d2">3d5af63a33abe5094b25a96394f69969</data>
      <data key="d5">0</data>
      <data key="d6">12940</data>
      <data key="d7">afe25b89d7714a068412ec68abde4c60</data>
    </node>
    <node id="IMMUNONUTRITION">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Immunonutrition is a specialized nutritional approach designed to enhance the immune response, particularly in patients undergoing surgery for cancer, those suffering from trauma, and critically ill individuals. This field of study focuses on the effects of specific nutrients on the immune system, aiming to improve outcomes for patients in critical conditions. By implementing targeted nutritional strategies, immunonutrition seeks to bolster the immune system's effectiveness, thereby supporting recovery and overall health in vulnerable populations.</data>
      <data key="d2">3d5af63a33abe5094b25a96394f69969,6216a2d06144ebde48b78330f488c603,9d9a14a936949ac8d78c0a7d53e9f741,ee3700469e1c419d283b34f38100fa29</data>
      <data key="d3">1238</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">11</data>
      <data key="d6">12941</data>
      <data key="d7">73fb2cdfb7aa46a9ad3c631e79f215bc</data>
    </node>
    <node id="ASPIRATION IN CRITICALLY ILL PATIENTS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Aspiration in critically ill patients refers to the inhalation of food, liquid, or vomit into the lungs, which can lead to serious complications.</data>
      <data key="d2">3d5af63a33abe5094b25a96394f69969</data>
      <data key="d3">1841</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">12942</data>
      <data key="d7">3d47fa2c56834f12a474b75ec5ff4dc5</data>
    </node>
    <node id="INSTITUTO DE INVESTIGACI&#211;N BIOM&#201;DICA DE M&#193;LAGA">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The Instituto de Investigaci&#243;n Biom&#233;dica de M&#225;laga is a prominent research institute dedicated to biomedical studies and advancements in healthcare. It is particularly associated with the work of Gabriel Olveira Fuster, who specializes in endocrinology and nutrition. The institute plays a significant role in advancing research in these fields, contributing to the overall improvement of health outcomes through its focused studies and innovative approaches.</data>
      <data key="d2">04b13f0ccbff81f5f7e92e7bd239cd92,0bf272be187cbf9ec33184c8052e19c6</data>
      <data key="d3">341</data>
      <data key="d4">1</data>
      <data key="d5">2</data>
      <data key="d6">12943</data>
      <data key="d7">ffc063af91434a8283759718875b6832</data>
    </node>
    <node id="VICTORIA CONTRERAS BOL&#205;VAR">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Victoria Contreras Bol&#237;var is a specialist in Endocrinology and Nutrition, currently practicing at the UGC de Endocrinolog&#237;a y Nutrici&#243;n, which is part of the Hospital Regional Universitario de M&#225;laga. She is recognized for her expertise in the field, contributing to the healthcare services provided within the UGC of Endocrinology and Nutrition.</data>
      <data key="d2">04b13f0ccbff81f5f7e92e7bd239cd92,0bf272be187cbf9ec33184c8052e19c6</data>
      <data key="d3">341</data>
      <data key="d4">1</data>
      <data key="d5">4</data>
      <data key="d6">12944</data>
      <data key="d7">0fb5d4885aff4da68e56d4a6cc020cb7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="PULMONARY DISEASE">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Pulmonary disease encompasses various conditions affecting the lungs, including chronic obstructive pulmonary disease (COPD), bronchiectasis, and cystic fibrosis, which may require specialized nutritional support.</data>
      <data key="d2">04b13f0ccbff81f5f7e92e7bd239cd92</data>
      <data key="d3">341</data>
      <data key="d4">1</data>
      <data key="d5">4</data>
      <data key="d6">12945</data>
      <data key="d7">4aa40cc4294945b692606ed0f78ba3bb</data>
    </node>
    <node id="CRITICAL ILLNESS">
      <data key="d0" />
      <data key="d1" />
      <data key="d2">04b13f0ccbff81f5f7e92e7bd239cd92</data>
      <data key="d3">1239</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">2</data>
      <data key="d6">12946</data>
      <data key="d7">6359f4a1112c4c37aad2a846229064c5</data>
    </node>
    <node id="CASILDA OLVEIRA FUSTER">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Casilda Olveira Fuster is a specialist in Pulmonology at the UGC de Neumolog&#237;a y Cirug&#237;a Tor&#225;cica, Hospital Regional Universitario de M&#225;laga, and the University of M&#225;laga.</data>
      <data key="d2">0bf272be187cbf9ec33184c8052e19c6</data>
      <data key="d3">341</data>
