    <node id="ALFA-1-ANTITRIPSINA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">ALFA-1-ANTITRIPSINA, also known as alpha-1-antitrypsin, is a protein that plays a critical role in protecting the lungs. It is particularly relevant in the context of various pulmonary diseases. A deficiency in this protein can lead to serious lung conditions, such as emphysema, and it is commonly tested in patients who present with respiratory symptoms.</data>
      <data key="d2">b62146237c90c7a018b9a3d2c060c722,d22c91140c11f7344e9aeebb21454cee</data>
