    <node id="S&#205;NTOMAS RESPIRATORIOS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Respiratory symptoms include a range of issues such as shortness of breath, wheezing, and chronic cough, which are common in patients with EPOC and other lung diseases.</data>
