    <node id="EUROPEAN RESPIRATORY SOCIETY">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The European Respiratory Society is a professional organization dedicated to promoting lung health and advancing research in respiratory medicine. It focuses on various aspects of respiratory health, including chronic obstructive pulmonary disease (COPD) and cystic fibrosis. The Society is known for publishing guidelines that aid in the diagnosis and management of respiratory diseases, ensuring that healthcare professionals have access to the latest research and best practices in the field. Through its efforts, the European Respiratory Society plays a crucial role in enhancing the understanding and treatment of respiratory conditions.</data>
      <data key="d2">39a32082aa23f1e71dc12d92750ca657,6d15ecf6cc2367b96e3ff917060f7f68,8efd8d610de6aced043032198b436f3f,cb63c034c676fa9dbbd8e5a07dd8c279</data>
