    <node id="ALTERACI&#211;N DE M&#218;SCULOS RESPIRATORIOS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Alteration of respiratory muscles refers to changes in the function or structure of the muscles involved in breathing, often seen in EPOC patients.</data>
