    </node>
    <node id="MINERALES Y OLIGOELEMENTOS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Minerals and trace elements are essential nutrients that may need to be supplemented in various health conditions, particularly in patients with specific dietary deficiencies.</data>
      <data key="d2">a4886f74d848ccd61cefcaab3103f233</data>
      <data key="d3">584</data>
