    <node id="OLIVEIRA G">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Oliveira G is a researcher known for significant contributions to the field of nutrition, particularly in relation to cystic fibrosis. They have focused on the nutritional aspects of the condition, exploring the importance of nutritional support for individuals with cystic fibrosis. Additionally, Oliveira G has investigated the effectiveness of various methods for estimating trends in home enteral nutrition, further emphasizing their commitment to improving nutritional care for patients. Through their work, Oliveira G has played a vital role in advancing the understanding of nutritional needs and support strategies in the context of cystic fibrosis.</data>
      <data key="d2">c3e74ddf9529482684f4b62e713df49b,c926a8237fba5d5bc497ac2165bbb039,fff76d1cd0e64233a5727a707d80e2b9</data>
