      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The Sociedad Espa&#241;ola de Medicina Intensiva, Cr&#237;tica y Unidades Coronarias (SEMICYUC) provides guidelines and recommendations for nutritional support in critically ill patients with respiratory failure.</data>
