    <node id="SOCIEDAD ESPA&#209;OLA DE NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL Y ENTERAL">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The Sociedad Espa&#241;ola de Nutrici&#243;n Parenteral y Enteral (SENPE) is an organization dedicated to establishing quality criteria for clinical nutrition. It plays a crucial role in providing recommendations for nutritional support specifically aimed at patients who require artificial nutrition. Through its efforts, SENPE aims to enhance the standards and practices related to parenteral and enteral nutrition in clinical settings.</data>
      <data key="d2">07e45dae0f017eba9ef9f48439de5c59,7e539a13a598e4ff2d2d4d6641a044d5</data>
