    <node id="IVACAFTOR">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Ivacaftor is a medication specifically designed to treat cystic fibrosis in patients who have certain mutations. It works by correcting the function of the RTFQ protein, which leads to improvements in lung function and nutritional status for these patients.</data>
      <data key="d2">c3e74ddf9529482684f4b62e713df49b,f1f6ad756644e84b6caa8e4e3adb94da</data>
