    <node id="LACTOBACILLUS GG">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Lactobacillus GG is a strain of probiotic bacteria known for its potential health benefits. It has been shown to have a beneficial effect in the prevention of atopic dermatitis, although its effectiveness in addressing food allergies remains unproven. Additionally, Lactobacillus GG may help in reducing inflammation markers, further contributing to its reputation as a valuable probiotic.</data>
      <data key="d2">d10e6c00bbb982bda449b9cb815691a3,f1f6ad756644e84b6caa8e4e3adb94da</data>
