    <node id="OLVEIRA G">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Olveira G is a researcher and author specializing in the fields of cystic fibrosis and nutrition. They have conducted studies focused on various aspects of patient care, including providing recommendations for managing hyperglycemia in individuals receiving artificial nutrition. Additionally, Olveira G has investigated the issues of fat-free mass depletion and inflammation in patients with bronchiectasis. Their contributions to the literature include writing about the relationship between nutrition and cystic fibrosis, as well as studying the impact of parenteral nutrition on in-hospital mortality, with findings published in the journal Diabetes Care.</data>
      <data key="d2">152aeb8f10c2f4548114403c05af6b55,4eb41f33f9aba3b8ecd3906de91a1345,64378df2be6b08b39bd652c0a2d3789c,6d15ecf6cc2367b96e3ff917060f7f68,fea8c7e37cd76ac988e0b242cb84fe6f</data>
