    <node id="FERREIRA IM">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Ferreira IM is a notable author and editor who has made significant contributions to the field of respiratory health, particularly in relation to Chronic Obstructive Pulmonary Disease (COPD). They played a key role in the European Respiratory Society statement on nutritional assessment and therapy in COPD, highlighting the importance of nutrition in managing this condition. Additionally, Ferreira IM is actively involved as a researcher in the Cochrane Database of Systematic Reviews, where their focus is on nutritional supplementation for individuals with COPD. Through these efforts, Ferreira IM has contributed to advancing the understanding and treatment of nutritional needs in patients suffering from COPD.</data>
