    <node id="ENTERAL TUBE FEEDING">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Enteral tube feeding is a method of delivering nutrition directly to the stomach or intestines through a tube. This approach is primarily utilized for patients who are unable to eat by mouth, including those with advanced dementia. It serves as a critical nutritional support system for individuals who cannot consume food orally, ensuring they receive the necessary nutrients for their health and well-being.</data>
      <data key="d2">91b470ee527a45d8e81a821eeb9ce259,c879347903aabeef630597c99cff2275,d26aec24f3f8c930c1c4b1d464bacd6b,ea8be3e3b3d7195ddc85512be460b6f8</data>
