    </node>
    <node id="NUTRITION PARENTERAL">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Parenteral nutrition (NP) is a method of delivering nutrients directly into the bloodstream, often used when enteral feeding is not possible.</data>
