      <data key="d1">The Sociedad Espa&#241;ola de Medicina Intensiva Cr&#237;tica y Unidades Coronarias (SEMICYUC) is an organization focused on critical care medicine and guidelines for the treatment of critically ill patients, including those with severe burns.</data>
