    <node id="PROTEIN-ENERGY MALNUTRITION">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Protein-energy malnutrition is a form of malnutrition characterized by inadequate protein and energy intake, which can occur in critically ill patients.</data>
