    <node id="AMINO&#193;CIDOS RAMIFICADOS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">AMINO&#193;CIDOS RAMIFICADOS, also known as branched-chain amino acids (BCAAs), are supplements commonly utilized by athletes to enhance muscle recovery and performance. Additionally, BCAAs are employed in intravenous supplementation for patients in a vegetative state, aiming to improve their disability scores.</data>
      <data key="d2">01704aec4089b2f0f24dd0f0841b5ecf,3e8ab018917854d76a0137102e0392bd,fae6538f87888794da1ff0aaf0d842fe</data>
