    </node>
    <node id="INFECCIONES NOSOCOMIALES">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">INFECCIONES NOSOCOMIALES refer to hospital-acquired infections that occur in a healthcare setting. These infections have been the subject of studies aimed at evaluating the effectiveness of immunonutrition as a potential intervention. Research indicates that specific nutritional strategies can help reduce the incidence of nosocomial infections, highlighting the importance of nutrition in the management and prevention of these infections within hospitals.</data>
      <data key="d2">01704aec4089b2f0f24dd0f0841b5ecf,9e4c5851293c18ef6b304ff6293b0be5</data>
      <data key="d3">640</data>
