      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">J Trauma is a medical journal that focuses on publishing research related to trauma and emergency medicine. It encompasses a wide range of topics within trauma care, including studies on enteral feeding and burn injuries. The journal serves as a platform for disseminating important findings and advancements in the field of trauma care, contributing to the ongoing development of best practices in emergency medicine.</data>
      <data key="d2">3534154ea7562c7d4abe51bf29546109,7f3e164582a504c9fe6bdbc56e1a8e97,d6a596828c4ca22ce0a49c5ba26b33e8</data>
