    <node id="HERNDON DN">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Herndon DN is a researcher and author who has made significant contributions to the fields of nutrition and burn care. He has been actively involved in studies that focus on these areas, enhancing the understanding and treatment of burn injuries. Additionally, Herndon DN played a role in formulating recommendations from the North American Surgical Nutrition Summit, further emphasizing his expertise and commitment to advancing nutritional practices in surgical care.</data>
