    <node id="COMPLEJO ASISTENCIAL UNIVERSITARIO">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The Complejo Asistencial Universitario is a university hospital complex located in Le&#243;n, Spain. It serves as a comprehensive healthcare institution that offers a wide range of medical services and educational opportunities. The facility is particularly noted for its involvement in the treatment and nutritional support of patients with neurological diseases. Additionally, it provides specialized services in various medical fields, including endocrinology and neurology, making it a vital resource for both patient care and medical education in the region.</data>
      <data key="d2">0ea889003f06c1b62aea79aae0901061,651bf69cdd5aec52b456cbea567f1987,e5542485c64706310c70513397de07f9</data>
