    </node>
    <node id="TANIA RAMOS MART&#205;NEZ">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Dr. Tania Ramos Mart&#237;nez is a healthcare professional specializing in diet-drug interactions. She is a resident physician in the Endocrinology and Nutrition section at the Complejo Asistencial Universitario in Le&#243;n. In addition to her clinical work, she is also an author who contributes to the field of diet and drug interactions, furthering the understanding of how dietary factors can influence medication efficacy and safety.</data>
      <data key="d2">47ba8105b81c59f81a9038446898d200,651bf69cdd5aec52b456cbea567f1987,6efaddddefe1cf5ab78825e1d8c53cab,fa5c0208b983c59b247a65e6bb166f2a</data>
