      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Dr. Mar&#237;a Dolores Ballesteros Pomar is a healthcare professional specializing in Endocrinology and Nutrition at the Complejo Asistencial Universitario in Le&#243;n. She is associated with the Service of Endocrinology and Nutrition, where she contributes to evidence-based nutrition practices. As a specialist in nutrition and hydration, Dr. Ballesteros Pomar plays a significant role in providing expert care and guidance in her field.</data>
      <data key="d2">0ea889003f06c1b62aea79aae0901061,651bf69cdd5aec52b456cbea567f1987,6efaddddefe1cf5ab78825e1d8c53cab,e5542485c64706310c70513397de07f9,fa5c0208b983c59b247a65e6bb166f2a</data>
