    <node id="GRUPO NADYA-SENPE">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The GRUPO NADYA-SENPE is a Spanish organization dedicated to home enteral nutrition. It functions as a working group that focuses on artificial nutrition in the home setting, engaging in various reports and studies related to enteral nutrition. Through its efforts, GRUPO NADYA-SENPE aims to enhance the understanding and implementation of enteral nutrition practices in Spain.</data>
      <data key="d2">0482404f71667592ce2b0f771153ece8,4cf0c8d0f4e711be85d16ee71317aa4e,7e3e2024996e402fc0ab62933ab9417b</data>
