    </node>
    <node id="DANIEL ANTONIO DE LUIS ROM&#193;N">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Daniel Antonio De Luis Rom&#225;n is a distinguished medical professional specializing in advanced nutritional support, particularly in the areas of enteral and parenteral nutrition. He is associated with the Hospital Cl&#237;nico Universitario de Valladolid and serves as the Executive Director of the Instituto de Endocrinolog&#237;a y Nutrici&#243;n. His contributions to the field of clinical nutrition are significant, as he has co-authored studies on water metabolism in patients receiving artificial nutrition and has researched immunonutrition in artificial nutritional support.

In addition to his work in general nutrition, Daniel Antonio De Luis Rom&#225;n has focused on the nutritional needs of patients undergoing head and neck tumor surgery, demonstrating his expertise in this specialized area. His extensive involvement in various topics related to nutrition underscores his commitment to advancing knowledge and practices in the field, making him a key figure in the study and application of nutritional support in clinical settings.</data>
      <data key="d2">0356b6c10b29c66d9b064df6bfef178d,2206bb4d5efe2dcf644ee48468ea112c,34f5f2681b28d568aea92e2633ebae56,41dee7570059d609c99074f155d4f927,488affd4bfc1b1b4b9f5b6a054c97d80,8ff1cad741bacfef19d53bb8941b5ca9,91b470ee527a45d8e81a821eeb9ce259,e5ec5005272f7691eba86e2cc7240f5a,ec69668515f0a014f1a602bcdc46c47f</data>
      <data key="d3">1828</data>
