    <node id="EMILIA G&#211;MEZ HOYOS">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Emilia G&#243;mez Hoyos is a medical professional and researcher specializing in nutrition, with a particular focus on enteral and parenteral nutrition. She has made significant contributions to the field of immunonutrition in artificial nutritional support, emphasizing its importance in clinical settings. Her research extends to the study of nutrition in oncology, where she has specifically investigated the nutritional needs of patients with head and neck tumors. Additionally, Emilia is recognized as an author in the field of clinical nutrition, contributing to various studies, including one on water metabolism in patients receiving artificial nutrition. Through her work, Emilia G&#243;mez Hoyos has established herself as a key figure in advancing knowledge and practices related to nutritional support in medical care.</data>
      <data key="d2">0356b6c10b29c66d9b064df6bfef178d,2206bb4d5efe2dcf644ee48468ea112c,34f5f2681b28d568aea92e2633ebae56,41dee7570059d609c99074f155d4f927,8ff1cad741bacfef19d53bb8941b5ca9,91b470ee527a45d8e81a821eeb9ce259,ec69668515f0a014f1a602bcdc46c47f</data>
