      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Juan Jos&#233; L&#243;pez G&#243;mez is a distinguished medical professional specializing in nutrition, particularly in the areas of enteral and parenteral nutrition. He has made significant contributions to the field through his research and clinical practice. L&#243;pez G&#243;mez is a co-author of a study focused on water metabolism in patients receiving artificial nutrition and has also contributed to research on immunonutrition in artificial nutritional support. His expertise extends to oncology nutrition, where he is involved in the nutritional management of patients undergoing treatment for head and neck tumors. Overall, Juan Jos&#233; L&#243;pez G&#243;mez is recognized for his comprehensive work in clinical nutrition, with a particular emphasis on enteral nutrition and its various indications.</data>
