      <data key="d1">Beatriz Torres Torres is a distinguished medical professional and researcher specializing in clinical nutrition, particularly in the context of artificial nutrition. She has co-authored a study on water metabolism in patients receiving artificial nutrition and has contributed significantly to research on immunonutrition in artificial nutritional support. Her expertise extends to both enteral and parenteral nutrition, where she has been actively involved in both study and practice. Additionally, Beatriz Torres Torres focuses on oncology nutrition, with a particular emphasis on the nutritional needs of patients with head and neck tumors. Through her work, she has established herself as a key figure in the field of clinical nutrition and parenteral nutrition.</data>
