      <data key="d1">Alitraq is a specialized nutritional formula designed for enteral feeding, specifically formulated to meet the needs of patients requiring enteral nutrition. It contains a carefully balanced composition of macronutrients, providing specific caloric and protein content essential for these patients. Alitraq aims to support the nutritional requirements of individuals who cannot consume food orally, ensuring they receive adequate nutrition through enteral means.</data>
      <data key="d2">2bbe847617971cacfe15b2c970de2d21,9d9a14a936949ac8d78c0a7d53e9f741,ede4d21db7723c6b72e8493236b217ad</data>
