    <node id="AMERICAN CANCER SOCIETY">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The American Cancer Society is a nationwide voluntary health organization committed to eliminating cancer and enhancing the quality of life for individuals affected by the disease. In addition to its overarching mission, the organization offers specific guidelines regarding the nutritional needs of cancer patients, advising the use of multivitamins during chemotherapy and radiotherapy to support their health during treatment.</data>
