    <node id="OROPHARYNGEAL DYSPHAGIA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Oropharyngeal dysphagia refers to difficulty swallowing that arises from issues in the oropharynx. This condition is commonly observed in patients who have head and neck cancer, highlighting its association with this specific type of malignancy.</data>
      <data key="d2">3b361c0a9b5d08df1a67476a3ae3b968,8c198f866d8fb49a782cb57139b30d76</data>
