    <node id="SUPPORT CARE CANCER">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Support Care Cancer is a journal dedicated to publishing research on supportive care in cancer treatment. It emphasizes the importance of nutritional therapy for cancer patients and explores various aspects of supportive care, including the nutritional status and overall quality of life of individuals undergoing cancer treatment. The journal serves as a valuable resource for healthcare professionals seeking to improve the well-being of cancer patients through comprehensive supportive care strategies.</data>
      <data key="d2">8c198f866d8fb49a782cb57139b30d76,bef1f848ac9b922f7361b740210a8314</data>
