    <node id="CANCER PATIENTS">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Cancer patients are individuals diagnosed with cancer who are undergoing treatment and may require nutritional support to manage their health. These patients often face various complications related to their condition, including dysphagia, which can further complicate their nutritional needs. As subjects of various studies, cancer patients are also the focus of research aimed at understanding the relationship between nutrition and treatment outcomes. Overall, the care and support of cancer patients encompass a comprehensive approach to address their medical and nutritional challenges during their treatment journey.</data>
      <data key="d2">4b0d0238a19e23ffee592c9d0817e226,8c198f866d8fb49a782cb57139b30d76,bef1f848ac9b922f7361b740210a8314</data>
      <data key="d3">1231</data>
