    </node>
    <node id="JOURNAL OF PARENTERAL AND ENTERAL NUTRITION">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The Journal of Parenteral and Enteral Nutrition is a specialized publication dedicated to the dissemination of research and guidelines concerning parenteral and enteral nutrition. It serves as a vital resource for healthcare professionals by focusing on the latest findings and best practices related to nutritional support for patients. Through its publications, the journal aims to enhance the understanding and application of nutritional therapies in clinical settings.</data>
      <data key="d2">0a742cf103e30cf0fadaf6ffabbbde2d,38547636a4ef9fd045b438047fb629fc,c3182f51249513a920db6b935632fead</data>
