    <node id="ANNALS OF SURGICAL ONCOLOGY">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The "Annals of Surgical Oncology" is a peer-reviewed medical journal dedicated to the field of surgical oncology. It publishes a wide range of research studies related to cancer surgery, including specific investigations into esophageal cancer and its treatment. The journal serves as a significant resource for professionals in the field, contributing to the advancement of knowledge and practices in surgical oncology.</data>
      <data key="d2">c3c8c4edabc77ed1f0a834676de2939c,ce2e5f8df5ad472bb255174d496cc1d7</data>
