    <node id="JPEN J PARENTER ENTERAL NUTR">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">JPEN J PARENTER ENTERAL NUTR, also known as the Journal of Parenteral and Enteral Nutrition (JPEN), is a scholarly journal dedicated to the publication of research and guidelines concerning parenteral and enteral nutrition. It serves as a vital platform for advancements in nutritional practices, focusing on both clinical and research aspects of nutrition therapy. The journal encompasses a wide range of topics, including studies on immunonutrition and its effects on surgical outcomes, thereby contributing to the understanding and improvement of nutritional interventions in various medical contexts. Through its comprehensive coverage of research related to nutrition therapy, JPEN plays a significant role in enhancing the field of parenteral and enteral nutrition.</data>
      <data key="d2">29cd22ec41c1cb5160d9987958d6ae16,477da86aa038212a1e2b555b5a854cba,4e86ca77481672995a03989d321652bc,6216a2d06144ebde48b78330f488c603,a265c943c66b9cb5d09f89d40ddb995f</data>
