    <node id="ONCOLOGICAL PATIENT">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">An oncological patient is an individual diagnosed with cancer who is undergoing treatment for the disease. These patients often face significant challenges, including complications related to their condition and the effects of treatment. Common issues they may encounter include anorexia and nutritional deficiencies, which can arise as a result of both the cancer itself and the therapies employed to combat it.</data>
      <data key="d2">11cbdce47eee11a80ab609f3b786bcc1,fb7b0d121f195e2a472f3d47e28ccff9</data>
      <data key="d3">1235</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">13</data>
      <data key="d6">13632</data>
      <data key="d7">42c5dc46fa654127895f5ea741973923</data>
    </node>
    <node id="INFLAMMATION">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Inflammation is a common response in cancer patients that can affect metabolism and contribute to cachexia.</data>
      <data key="d2">fb7b0d121f195e2a472f3d47e28ccff9</data>
      <data key="d3">1206</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">13633</data>
      <data key="d7">1e0e1421715c4484a87ce313c5b85c9f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="INMUNOTERAPIA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">La inmunoterapia es un tratamiento que puede causar cansancio, n&#225;useas y anorexia, y a menudo se combina con quimioterapia en casos avanzados.</data>
      <data key="d2">9c3716c3860855ce045a1e5d9d30b9d1</data>
      <data key="d3">1086</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">3</data>
      <data key="d6">13634</data>
      <data key="d7">7b2bdf2c9074421ea82578299c4f177b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="PACIENTE NEOPL&#193;SICO">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">El paciente neopl&#225;sico es una persona diagnosticada con c&#225;ncer que enfrenta desaf&#237;os nutricionales y de salud debido a la enfermedad y sus tratamientos.</data>
      <data key="d2">9c3716c3860855ce045a1e5d9d30b9d1</data>
      <data key="d3">1086</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">6</data>
