    <node id="ALTERACIONES PSICOL&#211;GICAS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Alteraciones Psicol&#243;gicas refer to the psychological changes that patients may experience when undergoing enteral nutrition. These changes can include body image issues and depressive disorders, which may significantly influence the patients' food intake and overall nutritional status.</data>
      <data key="d2">9562f39f9e78644164daeff3177a2f84,cff2f16dff598dbf0bff544091c77837</data>
      <data key="d3">1080</data>
