      <data key="d7">74cf344102324ec89283787d4ee47a09</data>
    </node>
    <node id="KARNOFSKY SCALE">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">The Karnofsky scale is a specific tool used to assess a patient's functional status and ability to carry out daily activities.</data>
      <data key="d2">11cbdce47eee11a80ab609f3b786bcc1</data>
      <data key="d3">1235</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">13653</data>
      <data key="d7">a8f919a782734e0483e57b9014fe412e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="MINI NUTRITIONAL ASSESSMENT (MNA)">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">The Mini Nutritional Assessment (MNA) is a tool used to evaluate the nutritional status of adults and the elderly.</data>
      <data key="d2">11cbdce47eee11a80ab609f3b786bcc1</data>
      <data key="d3">1235</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">13654</data>
      <data key="d7">287e5257fe454ffd87e75679328b5280</data>
    </node>
    <node id="NUTRITIONAL COUNSELING">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Nutritional counseling involves providing dietary advice to patients to help them maintain or improve their nutritional status during treatment.</data>
      <data key="d2">11cbdce47eee11a80ab609f3b786bcc1</data>
      <data key="d3">1235</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">2</data>
      <data key="d6">13655</data>
      <data key="d7">178ec9bab37944d0bc5f4a1ef126246a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="NUTRIENT DEFICIENCY">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Nutrient deficiency occurs when the body does not get enough of the essential nutrients it needs, which can be particularly problematic for cancer patients.</data>
      <data key="d2">11cbdce47eee11a80ab609f3b786bcc1</data>
      <data key="d3">1235</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">2</data>
      <data key="d6">13656</data>
      <data key="d7">1993aedfca98430aa373d3921bd2c7a6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="EFFECTS OF TREATMENT">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Effects of treatment refer to the side effects and complications that arise from cancer therapies, which can impact a patient's nutritional intake and overall health.</data>
      <data key="d2">11cbdce47eee11a80ab609f3b786bcc1</data>
      <data key="d3">1235</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">13657</data>
      <data key="d7">955c3bfe102d4c92bc0b5df971837d14</data>
    </node>
    <node id="SCREENING">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Screening involves assessing patients for potential nutritional issues to provide timely interventions, particularly in oncological care. It refers to the process of evaluating individuals for malnutrition risk using various assessment tools such as the Mini Nutritional Assessment (MNA), Nutritional Risk Screening 2002 (NRS 2002), and the Malnutrition Universal Screening Tool (MUST). This comprehensive approach ensures that patients receive appropriate nutritional support based on their specific needs.</data>
      <data key="d2">11cbdce47eee11a80ab609f3b786bcc1,7d1eed82db6d0ad62418f3f965316c39</data>
      <data key="d3">1235</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">13658</data>
      <data key="d7">0ad40b6587ec45af8c6995575cd61e23</data>
    </node>
    <node id="MIRTAPAZINA">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Mirtazapina is a tetracyclic antidepressant that enhances the release of norepinephrine and serotonin, improving appetite and quality of life in cancer patients.</data>
      <data key="d2">42e8a4a4bff905ef121f1101d65c959f</data>
      <data key="d3">1116</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">13659</data>
      <data key="d7">27ac54fe5ab74e5e86373457ad232da1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="ANABOLIZANTES">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Anabolizantes, also known as anabolics, are testosterone derivatives that are considered for therapeutic use, particularly in the treatment of cancer patients. Their primary purpose is to counteract muscle mass loss, which can be a significant issue for individuals undergoing cancer treatment.</data>
      <data key="d2">16887bf1589e9515213d2e392bbc8c69,42e8a4a4bff905ef121f1101d65c959f</data>
      <data key="d3">1117</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">3</data>
      <data key="d6">13660</data>
      <data key="d7">b5039268b2674bc38afa3b63249bccc7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="HIPOGEUSIA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Hipogeusia refers to a reduced ability to taste, which can impact the dietary choices of cancer patients.</data>
      <data key="d2">42e8a4a4bff905ef121f1101d65c959f</data>
      <data key="d3">1116</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">13661</data>
      <data key="d7">8ddbfe5fd551459fabc2ce1f12c1069a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="DISGEUSIA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Disgeusia is a condition characterized by a distorted sense of taste, often affecting cancer patients' appetite and food preferences.</data>
      <data key="d2">42e8a4a4bff905ef121f1101d65c959f</data>
      <data key="d3">1116</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">13662</data>
      <data key="d7">652dba943f2345fe8679aad783861714</data>
    </node>
    <node id="ESOFAGITIS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Esofagitis is inflammation of the esophagus that can cause pain and difficulty swallowing, impacting nutrition in cancer patients.</data>
      <data key="d2">42e8a4a4bff905ef121f1101d65c959f</data>
      <data key="d3">1116</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">13663</data>
      <data key="d7">1fcba9a388304dbb9ffc012b1324099f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="SACIEDAD PRECOZ">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Saciedad precoz refers to early satiety, a condition where patients feel full after consuming only a small amount of food, affecting their nutritional intake.</data>
      <data key="d2">42e8a4a4bff905ef121f1101d65c959f</data>
      <data key="d3">1116</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">13664</data>
      <data key="d7">c5e94ac5045e497d97fd2c888cf01af6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="ENOBOSARM">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Enobosarm is a selective androgen receptor modulator currently in phase II studies, showing promise in increasing lean mass and strength.</data>
      <data key="d2">16887bf1589e9515213d2e392bbc8c69</data>
      <data key="d3">1117</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">13665</data>
      <data key="d7">d00d14c3ea184b51abecbc7cfc6e7f9e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="DRONABINOL">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Dronabinol is a synthetic form of THC used in the US as an appetite stimulant and antiemetic, with psychoactive properties.</data>
      <data key="d2">16887bf1589e9515213d2e392bbc8c69</data>
      <data key="d3">1117</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">13666</data>
      <data key="d7">b2996dd0c8304e3f98e8ab25a396ce71</data>
    </node>
    <node id="GRELINA">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Grelina is a hormone that has shown to increase appetite in healthy individuals and cancer patients but is not commercially available due to its short half-life.</data>
      <data key="d2">16887bf1589e9515213d2e392bbc8c69</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">13667</data>
      <data key="d7">9160773344bb4d27abbd45e7e5f8e6fb</data>
    </node>
    <node id="ANAMORELINA">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Anamorelina is a ghrelin analog that has demonstrated improvements in appetite, body weight, and lean mass in phase III studies, though it is not yet available.</data>
      <data key="d2">16887bf1589e9515213d2e392bbc8c69</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">13668</data>
      <data key="d7">528ee3d69f994d64b65738d2b53c2311</data>
    </node>
    <node id="PACIENTE ONCOL&#211;GICO">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">The "PACIENTE ONCOL&#211;GICO" refers to an adult cancer patient who is undergoing treatment for cancer. This individual may experience nutritional deficiencies or malnutrition as a result of the disease and its associated treatments. Due to these challenges, the oncological patient often requires nutritional support to help maintain their health and well-being throughout the treatment process.</data>
      <data key="d2">395385fad73fd5b7ed9eda114b482624,40dcfaa6144c6424068ba46fdf288dd2,d667e6abc204bbfa6aba210705db6d56,e510500bd5a5f16a0bf0353cfdb79c13</data>
      <data key="d3">1145</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">39</data>
      <data key="d6">13669</data>
      <data key="d7">a96883ba98d941a9bebb3c162245d0ab</data>
    </node>
    <node id="C&#193;NCER PULMONAR">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">El c&#225;ncer pulmonar es un tipo de c&#225;ncer que tambi&#233;n puede aumentar el gasto energ&#233;tico en reposo de los pacientes.</data>
      <data key="d2">d667e6abc204bbfa6aba210705db6d56</data>
      <data key="d3">1145</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">13670</data>
      <data key="d7">35b0126cff0f42e79a2f2192817a1327</data>
    </node>
    <node id="DIETA TRADICIONAL">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">La dieta tradicional es la alimentaci&#243;n habitual que se modifica para mejorar la nutrici&#243;n de los pacientes oncol&#243;gicos.</data>
      <data key="d2">d667e6abc204bbfa6aba210705db6d56</data>
      <data key="d3">1145</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">13671</data>
      <data key="d7">9f786cf8d1bd479e8a1958700fab8014</data>
    </node>
    <node id="SUPLEMENTOS DE ISOFLAVONAS">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Los suplementos que contienen isoflavonas no se aconsejan para pacientes oncol&#243;gicos debido a su contenido elevado en comparaci&#243;n con la dieta.</data>
      <data key="d2">d667e6abc204bbfa6aba210705db6d56</data>
      <data key="d3">1145</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">13672</data>
      <data key="d7">2489b6a36e424c85afcd71762aebef5c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="DERIVADOS DE SOJA">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Los derivados de soja son productos que no se pueden recomendar actualmente para pacientes oncol&#243;gicos debido a la falta de informaci&#243;n sobre sus interacciones.</data>
      <data key="d2">d667e6abc204bbfa6aba210705db6d56</data>
      <data key="d3">1145</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">13673</data>
      <data key="d7">76098605abe0434cb3e417fc4b221e4f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="LESLER M">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Lesler M is an author of the work titled 'Oncology Nutrition for Clinical Practice' published in 2013, which discusses nutritional needs for cancer patients.</data>
      <data key="d2">ec94449c6ffff75664588262301de0a6</data>
      <data key="d3">1259</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">13674</data>
      <data key="d7">0ef3daa6e56548baa3c4cf15fde02bc1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="ONCOLOGY NUTRITION FOR CLINICAL PRACTICE">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">A publication that provides guidelines and recommendations for nutritional support in oncology patients.</data>
      <data key="d2">ec94449c6ffff75664588262301de0a6</data>
      <data key="d3">1259</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">5</data>
      <data key="d6">13675</data>
      <data key="d7">db75cda38e5f4023a3ff0b243f5e9ac4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="HEMATOPOIETIC TRANSPLANT">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">A medical procedure that may require specific nutritional support as indicated in the guidelines.</data>
      <data key="d2">ec94449c6ffff75664588262301de0a6</data>
      <data key="d3">1259</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">13676</data>
      <data key="d7">2662823923294b21a8e1b220fa959b90</data>
    </node>
    <node id="PROTEIN NEEDS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Protein needs refer to the specific dietary requirements for protein intake, which can vary significantly for patients, especially those with cancer or undergoing treatment.</data>
      <data key="d2">ec94449c6ffff75664588262301de0a6</data>
      <data key="d3">1230</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">2</data>
      <data key="d6">13677</data>
      <data key="d7">4ad2a9727fc94d03890997294893524c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="ALIMENTOS DE ALTO CONTENIDO CAL&#211;RICO">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Los alimentos de alto contenido cal&#243;rico son aquellos que proporcionan una gran cantidad de energ&#237;a y son recomendados para pacientes con desnutrici&#243;n.</data>
      <data key="d2">e510500bd5a5f16a0bf0353cfdb79c13</data>
      <data key="d3">1145</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">13678</data>
      <data key="d7">80a24e61acdf449db2418fb8721abf2c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="DIETA ENRIQUECIDA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">La dieta enriquecida es un tipo de alimentaci&#243;n que se utiliza para aumentar la ingesta cal&#243;rica y proteica de los pacientes oncol&#243;gicos.</data>
      <data key="d2">e510500bd5a5f16a0bf0353cfdb79c13</data>
      <data key="d3">1145</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">13679</data>
      <data key="d7">d0063d927e2c4fc998d84ab8237c42c9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="H&#193;BITOS ALIMENTICIOS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Los h&#225;bitos alimenticios son las costumbres y pr&#225;cticas relacionadas con la alimentaci&#243;n, que deben ser consideradas en el consejo nutricional para pacientes oncol&#243;gicos.</data>
      <data key="d2">e510500bd5a5f16a0bf0353cfdb79c13</data>
      <data key="d3">1145</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">13680</data>
      <data key="d7">5afa9c28eda2444f90cb8255230f6c77</data>
    </node>
    <node id="ASOCIACI&#211;N EUROPEA DE NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL Y PARENTERAL">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The European Association of Enteral and Parenteral Nutrition (ESPEN) recommends preoperative enteral nutrition for patients undergoing major abdominal surgery.</data>
      <data key="d2">395385fad73fd5b7ed9eda114b482624</data>
      <data key="d3">1178</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">2</data>
      <data key="d6">13681</data>
      <data key="d7">0ca4a0995b22472d91be26fde89dd910</data>
    </node>
    <node id="TUMOR NO OPERABLE">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">An inoperable tumor is a type of cancer that cannot be surgically removed, impacting nutritional intake.</data>
      <data key="d2">395385fad73fd5b7ed9eda114b482624</data>
      <data key="d5">0</data>
      <data key="d6">13682</data>
      <data key="d7">08526c0b93ff44fca20e143bc2d98cd9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="FORMULAS ENRIQUECIDAS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Enriched formulas are specialized nutritional products designed to provide additional nutrients for patients undergoing surgery.</data>
      <data key="d2">395385fad73fd5b7ed9eda114b482624</data>
      <data key="d3">1145</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">13683</data>
      <data key="d7">fcc8fbeb9089401c8dfa53f7a4b2a0d4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="HIPOREXIA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Hyporexia is a condition characterized by a reduced appetite, often seen in cancer patients.</data>
      <data key="d2">395385fad73fd5b7ed9eda114b482624</data>
      <data key="d3">1145</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">13684</data>
      <data key="d7">6caebc3d33cf4d22a3c6aa5f050a74d7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="SENSACI&#211;N DE SACIEDAD PRECOZ">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Early satiety is a feeling of fullness that occurs after eating only a small amount of food, common in cancer patients.</data>
      <data key="d2">395385fad73fd5b7ed9eda114b482624</data>
      <data key="d3">1145</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">13685</data>
      <data key="d7">cd0cf80ffa01449d93141aac1286ff58</data>
    </node>
    <node id="NUTRITIONAL PARENTERAL">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Nutritional parenteral is a method of delivering nutrients directly into the bloodstream, bypassing the gastrointestinal tract, often used for patients unable to consume food orally.</data>
      <data key="d2">bb209dcfffac9c89dae0ad4ed2908d85</data>
      <data key="d3">1208</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">13686</data>
      <data key="d7">1d6ce54f206f40fd9ed2fde6fdb0e07a</data>
    </node>
