    </node>
    <node id="FSIS">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The Food Safety and Inspection Service (FSIS) is an agency of the United States Department of Agriculture responsible for ensuring the safety of the nation's commercial supply of meat, poultry, and egg products.</data>
      <data key="d2">2194de4eaed685b07d8f4c7a397de0ce</data>
      <data key="d3">1554</data>
