    </node>
    <node id="CATHETER">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">A catheter is a thin tube inserted into the body to deliver or remove fluids, commonly utilized in medical settings. It serves as a medical device for administering nutritional support, although it carries risks of infection if not managed properly.</data>
      <data key="d2">10bde114bd1285b3aeeec94dd4292d9e,3d5e0a3ef45c7ba15063791545dc4826,be901905a9eef428a784ea179931028a</data>
