    <node id="INTENSIVE CARE MED">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Intensive Care Med is a journal dedicated to the field of intensive care medicine, publishing a wide range of research and reviews that focus on critical care practices. The journal covers various topics, including studies on immunonutrition, which is an important aspect of patient care in intensive settings. Through its publications, Intensive Care Med aims to advance knowledge and improve outcomes in intensive care and critical care medicine.</data>
      <data key="d2">d6a596828c4ca22ce0a49c5ba26b33e8,ddd686507e25374444e2e7525a5aacf4</data>
      <data key="d3">737</data>
