    <node id="FOOD ALLERGY">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Food Allergy refers to a medical condition characterized by an immune response triggered by the ingestion of certain foods. This abnormal reaction of the immune system can lead to a variety of allergic symptoms, which may vary in severity from mild to life-threatening.</data>
      <data key="d2">16d282094937dc2b58bfd40e13934fd2,bfb5dadab0c08f9f5f549ddd4b5db30c,e119877a92b580500f5e5b0307401732</data>
