      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The American Academy of Pediatrics is a professional association of pediatricians dedicated to the health and well-being of infants, children, adolescents, and young adults.</data>
      <data key="d2">16d282094937dc2b58bfd40e13934fd2</data>
