    </node>
    <node id="TEST DE TOLERANCIA ORAL A LA GLUCOSA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">El Test de Tolerancia Oral a la Glucosa (TTOG) es un procedimiento diagn&#243;stico utilizado para detectar alteraciones en el metabolismo de los carbohidratos, que implica la administraci&#243;n de una bebida con glucosa y la medici&#243;n de los niveles de glucemia en diferentes intervalos de tiempo.</data>
      <data key="d2">48e690b80c196e397d9ab9527b38c3d4</data>
      <data key="d3">884</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">5</data>
      <data key="d6">14150</data>
      <data key="d7">a5dee127a4004ac9ac99ad107176e528</data>
    </node>
    <node id="GASTRECTOM&#205;AS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Las gastrectom&#237;as son procedimientos quir&#250;rgicos que implican la extirpaci&#243;n parcial o total del est&#243;mago, lo que puede afectar la interpretaci&#243;n de pruebas como el TTOG.</data>
      <data key="d2">48e690b80c196e397d9ab9527b38c3d4</data>
      <data key="d3">884</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">14151</data>
      <data key="d7">648663babe714b66b0e1d21a1a8c6d0e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="NATIONAL DIABETES DATA GROUP">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The National Diabetes Data Group (NDDG) is an organization dedicated to providing guidelines and standards for the diagnosis and management of diabetes, including gestational diabetes. It has established criteria for the classification and diagnosis of diabetes mellitus and other categories of glucose intolerance, ensuring a comprehensive approach to understanding and addressing diabetes-related health issues.</data>
      <data key="d2">4c37affdd97e7772d1ea27aee34533b8,54bdd3faa067cdbb44671453ffaf4be5</data>
      <data key="d3">882</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">4</data>
      <data key="d6">14152</data>
      <data key="d7">5d4e2943b89c4040b88a1ad7a397387f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="TTOG">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">The TTOG (test de tolerancia oral a la glucosa) is a medical test used to diagnose diabetes by measuring blood glucose levels after the ingestion of glucose.</data>
      <data key="d2">4c37affdd97e7772d1ea27aee34533b8</data>
      <data key="d3">882</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">4</data>
      <data key="d6">14153</data>
      <data key="d7">24ffdac7610345f49d4a22abc3909c34</data>
    </node>
    <node id="O'SULLIVAN TEST">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">The O'Sullivan test is a screening test for gestational diabetes that involves measuring blood glucose levels after consuming a glucose solution.</data>
      <data key="d2">4c37affdd97e7772d1ea27aee34533b8</data>
      <data key="d3">883</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">14154</data>
      <data key="d7">c017421603c941e7a2380b9ae78f170e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="GLUC&#211;METRO">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">A gluc&#243;metro is a device used for measuring blood glucose levels, particularly in patients with diabetes.</data>
      <data key="d2">4c37affdd97e7772d1ea27aee34533b8</data>
      <data key="d3">883</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">14155</data>
      <data key="d7">03553e62ed5c4c209e3b00422db0760a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="AN&#193;LISIS QU&#205;MICO DE VAN DE KAMER">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">The an&#225;lisis qu&#237;mico de Van de Kamer is a reference method used for the quantitative determination of fat in fecal samples, important for diagnosing conditions like esteatorrea.</data>
      <data key="d2">4c37affdd97e7772d1ea27aee34533b8</data>
      <data key="d3">1052</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">14156</data>
      <data key="d7">b7fe2aa5cc744a0aa81bc55609f305bf</data>
    </node>
    <node id="ACIDO ASCORBICO">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">A substance that can interfere with medical tests and is commonly known as Vitamin C.</data>
      <data key="d2">029a82f84eb8dfda723f9feabe2384d7</data>
      <data key="d3">1317</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">14157</data>
      <data key="d7">0b8d551669904ac7b31059a4736c5537</data>
    </node>
    <node id="TOCOFEROL">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">TOCOFEROL is a substance commonly known as Vitamin E, which can interfere with medical tests. It is a form of vitamin E that is utilized as an antioxidant in dietary supplements.</data>
      <data key="d2">029a82f84eb8dfda723f9feabe2384d7,1ff94f3fcc6eff16c2fdae5eb9b3aefa</data>
      <data key="d3">1317</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">14158</data>
      <data key="d7">344d8a6a1efc413f9c660a620c5f9cf7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="ADITIVOS ANTIOXIDANTES">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Antioxidant additives that should be removed from the diet prior to certain medical tests to avoid false negatives.</data>
      <data key="d2">029a82f84eb8dfda723f9feabe2384d7</data>
      <data key="d3">832</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">14159</data>
      <data key="d7">f7398d2930d34b64ad4b0b603c612930</data>
    </node>
    <node id="METODO DE OXIDACION DE CUERPOS FENOLICOS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">A method used to detect blood in feces that requires dietary restrictions to avoid false positives.</data>
      <data key="d2">029a82f84eb8dfda723f9feabe2384d7</data>
      <data key="d3">832</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">14160</data>
      <data key="d7">438cba6a268047639ce3f39675057547</data>
    </node>
    <node id="METODO DE INTERACCION ANTIGENO-ANTICUERPO">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">A method used to detect blood in feces that does not require dietary restrictions.</data>
      <data key="d2">029a82f84eb8dfda723f9feabe2384d7</data>
      <data key="d3">832</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">14161</data>
      <data key="d7">796782c2ca7a4193b75d0b6b77002f23</data>
    </node>
    <node id="ACIDO 5-HIDROXIINDOLACETICO">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">A metabolite of serotonin that is eliminated in urine and is used to diagnose carcinoid tumors.</data>
      <data key="d2">029a82f84eb8dfda723f9feabe2384d7</data>
      <data key="d3">1123</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">14162</data>
      <data key="d7">bc17e3009f4240ae800bf4ed1034e5a1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="5-HIA">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">5-Hydroxyindoleacetic acid (5-HIA) is a metabolite of serotonin that is eliminated through urine and is used as a marker in diagnosing carcinoid tumors.</data>
      <data key="d2">7d4d879207b235ab3018772eea448b2a</data>
      <data key="d3">1122</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">2</data>
      <data key="d6">14163</data>
      <data key="d7">2912f786f2314a5b83457dc9c8d459e9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="VAMA">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Vanilmandelic acid (VAMA) is a test used to diagnose tumors derived from chromaffin cells, such as pheochromocytomas and paragangliomas.</data>
      <data key="d2">7d4d879207b235ab3018772eea448b2a</data>
      <data key="d3">976</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">2</data>
      <data key="d6">14164</data>
      <data key="d7">b66f8f073caf48cbb54f39d142285948</data>
    </node>
    <node id="DIETA ESPECIAL">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">A special diet is required before urine collection for tests to avoid false positives in the determination of metabolites like 5-HIA and VAMA.</data>
      <data key="d2">7d4d879207b235ab3018772eea448b2a</data>
      <data key="d3">1122</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">3</data>
      <data key="d6">14165</data>
      <data key="d7">4e0c0334c0f8434893dbc7dc83d1a04c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="NEUROBLASTOMAS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Neuroblastomas are tumors that can arise from neuroblasts and are associated with catecholamine secretion, similar to pheochromocytomas.</data>
      <data key="d2">7d4d879207b235ab3018772eea448b2a</data>
      <data key="d3">976</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">14166</data>
      <data key="d7">9bf6b89601a14b47b98f12a2ca5e788b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&#193;CIDOS HOMOVAN&#205;LICO Y VANILMAND&#201;LICO">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Homovanillic acid and vanilmandelic acid are metabolites of catecholamines used in the diagnosis of neuroendocrine tumors.</data>
      <data key="d2">7d4d879207b235ab3018772eea448b2a</data>
      <data key="d3">976</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">14167</data>
      <data key="d7">999810fab9054a3a86a55b616dc5fea9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="ALIMENTOS RICOS EN YODO">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Los alimentos ricos en yodo son aquellos que pueden afectar la eficacia de los tratamientos relacionados con el tiroides.</data>
      <data key="d2">072912695b1cff9f390d4ead3b9ad742</data>
      <data key="d3">1350</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">14168</data>
      <data key="d7">cc71126ced7946fa94f8c668666cb104</data>
    </node>
    <node id="ALIMENTOS CON M&#205;NIMO RESIDUO">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Los alimentos con m&#237;nimo residuo son aquellos que se deben consumir para facilitar estudios diagn&#243;sticos del tubo digestivo.</data>
      <data key="d2">072912695b1cff9f390d4ead3b9ad742</data>
      <data key="d3">1189</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">14169</data>
      <data key="d7">560ffcd666554d038d819699b624f225</data>
    </node>
    <node id="PET/TC">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">PET/TC is a non-invasive imaging diagnostic technique that uses a radiopharmaceutical to detect cancerous cells and evaluate glucose metabolism in various tissues.</data>
      <data key="d2">108b158c33fead285203903273758748</data>
      <data key="d3">1646</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">2</data>
      <data key="d6">14170</data>
      <data key="d7">ea9fa910cebd42ac80db6866ebb175fd</data>
    </node>
    <node id="18FLUORODESOXYGLUCOSE">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">18fluorodesoxiglucosa (FDG) is a radiopharmaceutical used in PET scans, primarily taken up by cells with high glucose consumption, including cancer cells.</data>
      <data key="d2">108b158c33fead285203903273758748</data>
      <data key="d3">1646</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">14171</data>
      <data key="d7">57e4e5a2428d4dc6854bd655fe3b3c16</data>
    </node>
    <node id="NUTRITIONAL SOLUTIONS">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Nutritional solutions are specialized supplements designed to ensure nutritional balance, particularly during dietary restrictions that may occur before medical tests. These solutions encompass a variety of formulations aimed at providing essential nutrients to patients, especially those who are unable to consume food orally. They play a crucial role in maintaining health and supporting recovery in individuals with specific dietary needs.</data>
      <data key="d2">108b158c33fead285203903273758748,bb7584256e051f1c3d8cb13502ade155</data>
      <data key="d3">1647</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">3</data>
      <data key="d6">14172</data>
      <data key="d7">a03ca62a5f9e4334a376db471b241ef2</data>
    </node>
    <node id="CANCER CELLS">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Cancer cells are cells that grow uncontrollably and are primarily targeted in PET scans for diagnosis and monitoring.</data>
      <data key="d2">108b158c33fead285203903273758748</data>
      <data key="d3">1717</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">14173</data>
      <data key="d7">86e8efc2069d45f0a27b649ff190060f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="CARNE FIBROSA">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Carne fibrosa refers to fibrous meats that are typically avoided in diets leading up to medical tests to ensure clarity in imaging.</data>
      <data key="d2">108b158c33fead285203903273758748</data>
      <data key="d5">0</data>
      <data key="d6">14174</data>
      <data key="d7">9d1705a6dfeb4bec8313e95f4784e130</data>
    </node>
    <node id="FRUTAS Y VERDURAS FRESCAS">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Frutas y verduras frescas are fresh fruits and vegetables that are generally restricted in diets before medical tests to avoid interference with results.</data>
      <data key="d2">108b158c33fead285203903273758748</data>
      <data key="d5">0</data>
      <data key="d6">14175</data>
      <data key="d7">5a402c27e721487eae2ba09ca9572ff9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="FRUTAS DESSECADAS">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Frutas dessecadas are dried fruits that are usually eliminated from diets prior to medical tests to ensure accurate imaging results.</data>
      <data key="d2">108b158c33fead285203903273758748</data>
      <data key="d5">0</data>
      <data key="d6">14176</data>
      <data key="d7">464acaddb52349928723becad6012056</data>
    </node>
    <node id="ZUMO DE CIRUELAS">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Zumo de ciruelas is prune juice that is typically restricted in diets before medical tests to minimize interference with imaging results.</data>
      <data key="d2">108b158c33fead285203903273758748</data>
      <data key="d5">0</data>
      <data key="d6">14177</data>
      <data key="d7">9046b4922f8b4de5aabf148e3176851d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="CEREALES REFINADOS">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Cereales refinados are refined grains that are allowed in diets before medical tests, as they are easier to digest.</data>
      <data key="d2">108b158c33fead285203903273758748</data>
      <data key="d5">0</data>
      <data key="d6">14178</data>
      <data key="d7">048de3211b7f41279849e94bf7208556</data>
    </node>
    <node id="PATATAS PELADAS">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Patatas peladas are peeled potatoes that are permitted in diets leading up to medical tests.</data>
      <data key="d2">108b158c33fead285203903273758748</data>
      <data key="d5">0</data>
      <data key="d6">14179</data>
      <data key="d7">af23b4c183244b5a94f965adfcdf1e7b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="CARNE TIERNA">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Carne tierna refers to tender meat that is allowed in diets before medical tests.</data>
      <data key="d2">108b158c33fead285203903273758748</data>
      <data key="d5">0</data>
      <data key="d6">14180</data>
      <data key="d7">5a4d39aa97204de990fadcb599e55b5b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="AGUA NO SABORIZADA">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Agua no saborizada is plain water that is the only liquid permitted during the fasting period before a PET/TC scan.</data>
      <data key="d2">108b158c33fead285203903273758748</data>
      <data key="d5">0</data>
      <data key="d6">14181</data>
      <data key="d7">1f8bc4e8a5d44f71acb25c4e7eaf7cfa</data>
    </node>
    <node id="EJERCICIO F&#205;SICO INTENSO">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Se aconseja evitar el ejercicio f&#237;sico intenso 24 horas antes de la prueba para no afectar los resultados.</data>
      <data key="d2">e82ce4aa73097ca70936be74cdafc12b</data>
      <data key="d3">832</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">14182</data>
      <data key="d7">4f438bf1edeb40caae140dfd3e5a232e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="PRUEBAS DIAGN&#211;STICAS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Procedimientos m&#233;dicos que requieren ayuno previo para obtener resultados precisos.</data>
      <data key="d2">e82ce4aa73097ca70936be74cdafc12b</data>
      <data key="d3">1028</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">14183</data>
      <data key="d7">c183374f6deb4d1db3ff7c12f0025d53</data>
    </node>
    <node id="RADIOTRAZADOR">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Sustancia utilizada en pruebas m&#233;dicas que puede ser afectada por la ingesta de alimentos y glucosa.</data>
      <data key="d2">e82ce4aa73097ca70936be74cdafc12b</data>
      <data key="d3">663</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
