    </node>
    <node id="BARCELONA">
      <data key="d0">GEO</data>
      <data key="d1">Barcelona is a city in Spain renowned for its rich cultural heritage. It serves as a significant publishing location for Ediciones Doyma, which is known for producing various publications on medical ethics and nutrition. This dual role highlights Barcelona's importance not only as a cultural hub but also as a center for important academic and professional literature.</data>
      <data key="d2">193f43446f6311107c8a73b6111fa25a,47ba8105b81c59f81a9038446898d200</data>
      <data key="d3">507</data>
      <data key="d4">1</data>
