      <data key="d6">14198</data>
      <data key="d7">ae0606ef62504c4ba4236105e2e4a7f1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="INTERACCIONES">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">INTERACCIONES refers to the interactions between drugs and diet, as well as between drugs and nutrients, which are significant in clinical settings and can affect treatment outcomes. These interactions are particularly relevant in nutritional therapy and must be considered to avoid adverse effects. Understanding these interacciones is crucial for optimizing treatment efficacy and ensuring patient safety.</data>
      <data key="d2">1ff94f3fcc6eff16c2fdae5eb9b3aefa,7f0ee0bea2b1dfd09e75026d4c027291,fa5c0208b983c59b247a65e6bb166f2a</data>
      <data key="d3">1144</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">3</data>
      <data key="d6">14199</data>
      <data key="d7">d6466a2deab542a79ede61ad9fbabd6b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="INTERACCI&#211;N FARMACO-NUTRIENTE">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">La interacci&#243;n f&#225;rmaco-nutriente se refiere a c&#243;mo los f&#225;rmacos y los nutrientes pueden influenciarse mutuamente en su eficacia y absorci&#243;n.</data>
      <data key="d2">ac274a54f27601e9d60118e72fc2ba94</data>
      <data key="d3">619</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">4</data>
      <data key="d6">14200</data>
      <data key="d7">ae241f02fa0d4ccaa8a44efb1f66705e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="AMOXICILINA">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">La amoxicilina es un antibi&#243;tico que puede tener su biodisponibilidad afectada por la fibra de la dieta.</data>
      <data key="d2">ac274a54f27601e9d60118e72fc2ba94</data>
      <data key="d3">1523</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">14201</data>
      <data key="d7">98b15bd1cea345b49fb8524c7cc17ae9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="PARACETAMOL">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Paracetamol is a widely used analgesic and antipyretic medication that is effective in treating mild to moderate pain and reducing fever. Its absorption can be influenced by dietary components, which may affect its overall efficacy.</data>
      <data key="d2">1ff94f3fcc6eff16c2fdae5eb9b3aefa,ac274a54f27601e9d60118e72fc2ba94</data>
      <data key="d3">1526</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">3</data>
      <data key="d6">14202</data>
      <data key="d7">c6982b3aefcb41d7b1c9811a27c3ce3b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="LEVODOPA">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Levodopa is a medication primarily used in the treatment of Parkinson's disease. It is known to interact with various substances, including iron, which can chelate the drug, potentially affecting its efficacy. Additionally, levodopa's metabolism can be influenced by vitamin B6, indicating a possible interaction that may alter its therapeutic effects. The absorption of levodopa is also significantly impacted by dietary factors, particularly the presence of food, with high-protein meals being particularly detrimental to its absorption. Overall, these interactions highlight the importance of considering dietary and nutritional factors when administering levodopa to patients with Parkinson's disease.</data>
      <data key="d2">18d237ccee6cf99bff4690087156025a,1ff94f3fcc6eff16c2fdae5eb9b3aefa,ac274a54f27601e9d60118e72fc2ba94</data>
      <data key="d3">584</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">2</data>
      <data key="d6">14203</data>
      <data key="d7">5b6c617d5d894439978536f9db5a294b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="ZUMOS">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Los zumos son bebidas que pueden tener un pH &#225;cido y afectar la absorci&#243;n de ciertos f&#225;rmacos.</data>
      <data key="d2">ac274a54f27601e9d60118e72fc2ba94</data>
      <data key="d3">1752</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">14204</data>
      <data key="d7">01d6de6683c447388435e1a3043586a6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="INTERACCI&#211;N MEDICAMENTO-NUTRIENTE">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">La interacci&#243;n medicamento-nutriente se refiere a c&#243;mo los medicamentos pueden afectar la utilizaci&#243;n de los nutrientes y el estado nutricional.</data>
      <data key="d2">ac274a54f27601e9d60118e72fc2ba94</data>
      <data key="d3">619</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
