    </node>
    <node id="FENITO&#205;NA">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Fenito&#237;na is an anticonvulsant medication that requires careful monitoring when administered with enteral nutrition due to its narrow therapeutic range. It is important to note that the plasma levels of Fenito&#237;na can be significantly reduced when given alongside enteral nutrition, which necessitates close observation of its effectiveness. To minimize gastrointestinal discomfort, it is recommended that Fenito&#237;na be taken with meals. Additionally, Fenito&#237;na can impact vitamin D metabolism, which is an important consideration in its use.</data>
      <data key="d2">04f886244ff7d736eb270f175d6b120e,0e014859b304da60c29590e36c9cbc85,1ff94f3fcc6eff16c2fdae5eb9b3aefa,5eb14e2cbec104d89ad73e2ac968b7fd</data>
      <data key="d3">1186</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
