    <node id="RETINOL">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Retinol is a form of vitamin A that plays a significant role in both dietary intake and skincare. It is associated with specific dietary recommendations for consumption, highlighting its importance in nutrition. Additionally, retinol is widely utilized in skincare products and dietary supplements, underscoring its versatility and effectiveness in promoting skin health and overall well-being.</data>
