    <node id="TEOFILINA">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Teofilina is a medication primarily used to treat respiratory diseases, including asthma and chronic obstructive pulmonary disease (COPD). Its therapeutic action can be influenced by dietary factors, as it is metabolized more quickly when a diet rich in proteins is consumed. This interaction may affect the effectiveness of the medication in managing respiratory conditions.</data>
