    <node id="FORMULACIONES">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Las formulaciones l&#237;quidas son preparaciones que pueden contener nutrientes y f&#225;rmacos, y su composici&#243;n puede influir en las interacciones que ocurren en el tracto gastrointestinal.</data>
      <data key="d2">7f0ee0bea2b1dfd09e75026d4c027291</data>
      <data key="d3">1178</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">14340</data>
      <data key="d7">f46e19318b0342fb99c404c017bcf873</data>
    </node>
    <node id="SORBITO">
      <data key="d0" />
      <data key="d1" />
      <data key="d2">7f0ee0bea2b1dfd09e75026d4c027291</data>
      <data key="d3">1144</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">14341</data>
      <data key="d7">9698f871e5c4412ebb2aa5223b5d809c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="AGENCIA ESPA&#209;OLA DE PROTECCI&#211;N DE LA SALUD EN EL DEPORTE">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The Agency for the Protection of Health in Sports (AEPSAD) is responsible for promoting health and nutrition in sports in Spain.</data>
      <data key="d2">cca60bfbb1e73ceda513fbcaf0866a8f</data>
      <data key="d5">2</data>
      <data key="d6">14342</data>
      <data key="d7">ada92a5a1ba44283866e7cc794c92461</data>
    </node>
    <node id="NIEVES PALACIOS GIL DE ANTU&#209;ANO">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Nieves Palacios Gil de Antu&#241;ano is the Head of the Medicine, Endocrinology, and Nutrition Service at AEPSAD.</data>
      <data key="d2">cca60bfbb1e73ceda513fbcaf0866a8f</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">14343</data>
      <data key="d7">537a28ffdbe54015b75751dc943573a9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="FERNANDO GARC&#205;A P&#201;REZ-SEVILLANO">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Fernando Garc&#237;a P&#233;rez-Sevillano is a specialist in Endocrinology and Nutrition based in Sevilla.</data>
      <data key="d2">cca60bfbb1e73ceda513fbcaf0866a8f</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">14344</data>
      <data key="d7">3a632cd581e64abf9c4770db615a3369</data>
    </node>
    <node id="HIP&#211;CRATES">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Hippocrates was an ancient Greek physician who emphasized the importance of diet and exercise for health.</data>
      <data key="d2">cca60bfbb1e73ceda513fbcaf0866a8f</data>
      <data key="d3">1741</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">2</data>
      <data key="d6">14345</data>
      <data key="d7">50f284e617644bfa80080a88009aefb6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="DIETA SANA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">A healthy diet is a key component of maintaining good health and is emphasized in the context of physical activity.</data>
      <data key="d2">cca60bfbb1e73ceda513fbcaf0866a8f</data>
      <data key="d3">1741</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">3</data>
      <data key="d6">14346</data>
      <data key="d7">954d760bf1c8435294e3c0665ced8844</data>
    </node>
    <node id="DEPORTISTA">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">A "DEPORTISTA" is an individual who actively engages in sports or physical exercise, with a strong emphasis on enhancing performance through proper training and nutrition. This athlete not only participates in physical activities but also adheres to specific dietary guidelines and hydration practices to achieve optimal results. The deportista is dedicated to improving their performance and overall health by following structured and regulated exercise routines. Their commitment to both physical activity and nutritional needs is essential for maximizing their athletic capabilities.</data>
      <data key="d2">364aa13581a973c2e55c25191bad27cc,39da0855b83941d97766254aa36ed2fd,470e6bb2e8b8ca543addb0f07464f38c,638446780cdd61df83a06944c4e15c15,ab9a942f3aa9ca3eb88bcd26fcd60ddb</data>
      <data key="d3">1740</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">30</data>
      <data key="d6">14347</data>
      <data key="d7">5ca6875855c04a8f8daad2ad106e178b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="ALIMENTACI&#211;N EQUILIBRADA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">La alimentaci&#243;n equilibrada es un plan nutricional que satisface los requerimientos de energ&#237;a necesarios para sostener el programa de competici&#243;n y rendir a alto nivel.</data>
      <data key="d2">ab9a942f3aa9ca3eb88bcd26fcd60ddb</data>
      <data key="d3">1740</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">14348</data>
      <data key="d7">d24d8136a0e34fcab76a6ca1e6a27c88</data>
    </node>
    <node id="ENTRENAMIENTO DEPORTIVO">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">El entrenamiento deportivo es la pr&#225;ctica sistem&#225;tica, regular y progresiva del ejercicio f&#237;sico para mejorar el rendimiento deportivo.</data>
      <data key="d2">ab9a942f3aa9ca3eb88bcd26fcd60ddb</data>
      <data key="d3">1740</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">14349</data>
      <data key="d7">bdb52fb7d4d949c0aac0da9dbc806b18</data>
    </node>
    <node id="SISTEMAS ENERG&#201;TICOS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Los sistemas energ&#233;ticos son las v&#237;as utilizadas por el m&#250;sculo esquel&#233;tico para cubrir sus demandas energ&#233;ticas durante el ejercicio.</data>
      <data key="d2">ab9a942f3aa9ca3eb88bcd26fcd60ddb</data>
      <data key="d3">1742</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">2</data>
      <data key="d6">14350</data>
      <data key="d7">97d4f94aa7a34884b711ebba99c3002f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="RENDIMIENTO">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">El rendimiento se refiere a la capacidad de un deportista para ejecutar su deporte de manera efectiva, influenciado por la nutrici&#243;n y el entrenamiento.</data>
      <data key="d2">ab9a942f3aa9ca3eb88bcd26fcd60ddb</data>
      <data key="d3">1740</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">14351</data>
      <data key="d7">82e08ac070214b638dcb9ace120dfb89</data>
    </node>
    <node id="DEPORTISTAS">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Deportistas refers to athletes who actively engage in physical activities and sports, focusing on improving their performance through various nutritional and physical aids. They are the primary subjects of the nutritional guidelines and recommendations discussed in the document. These individuals face health and performance challenges related to their available energy and are particularly susceptible to iron deficiency. As such, specific nutritional guidelines are essential for enhancing their performance and recovery.</data>
      <data key="d2">3e8ab018917854d76a0137102e0392bd,490f5e3c6dbf3754eee50c52154da09a,54a47e2936e787ab5943e2d75afc03f1,700a4472a23342b891a5685b622437d2,d600b483c44c0647e40e4775e0936044,dcb97f7ffdb0aea3051bdf53e04bcc29</data>
      <data key="d3">1747</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">27</data>
      <data key="d6">14352</data>
      <data key="d7">189f834989294a58bbbaca94a264bf73</data>
    </node>
    <node id="COMPETICIONES">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Las competiciones son eventos deportivos donde los deportistas participan y pueden beneficiarse de una adecuada ingesta de hidratos de carbono.</data>
      <data key="d2">490f5e3c6dbf3754eee50c52154da09a</data>
      <data key="d3">1747</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">14353</data>
      <data key="d7">3468ead72fb94248b770290533019c72</data>
    </node>
    <node id="DIETA DEL DEPORTISTA">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">La dieta del deportista debe incluir una alta ingesta de hidratos de carbono para optimizar el rendimiento f&#237;sico.</data>
      <data key="d2">490f5e3c6dbf3754eee50c52154da09a</data>
      <data key="d3">1735</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">14354</data>
      <data key="d7">bdc3718ce5654f8a86d31fd38f33c534</data>
    </node>
    <node id="RESERVAS DE GLUC&#211;GENO">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Las reservas de gluc&#243;geno son la cantidad de gluc&#243;geno almacenado en los m&#250;sculos y el h&#237;gado, crucial para el rendimiento deportivo.</data>
      <data key="d2">490f5e3c6dbf3754eee50c52154da09a</data>
      <data key="d3">1747</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">14355</data>
      <data key="d7">92f918f0a0ce45f7a3c36c701df0eee3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="CLOSE ET AL">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Close et al (2015) proposed practical guidelines for carbohydrate intake to optimize training loads with reduced muscle glycogen levels</data>
      <data key="d2">470e6bb2e8b8ca543addb0f07464f38c</data>
      <data key="d3">376</data>
      <data key="d4">1</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">14356</data>
      <data key="d7">8eb92762c6b84ed1ae568dff8582fb9b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="CARGA DE ENTRENAMIENTO">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Refers to the training load or intensity that an athlete undergoes during their training sessions</data>
      <data key="d2">470e6bb2e8b8ca543addb0f07464f38c</data>
      <data key="d3">462</data>
      <data key="d4">1</data>
      <data key="d5">2</data>
      <data key="d6">14357</data>
      <data key="d7">61b1d9328da14594b7d258d6af4c46df</data>
    </node>
    <node id="INGESTA DE HIDRATOS DE CARBONO">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">The process of consuming carbohydrates before, during, and after exercise to enhance performance</data>
      <data key="d2">470e6bb2e8b8ca543addb0f07464f38c</data>
      <data key="d3">462</data>
      <data key="d4">1</data>
      <data key="d5">3</data>
      <data key="d6">14358</data>
      <data key="d7">1cadbdaa3eb34e85a1c558528a9328e1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="ALTA INTENSIDAD">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Refers to high-intensity training sessions that require specific carbohydrate intake for optimal performance</data>
      <data key="d2">470e6bb2e8b8ca543addb0f07464f38c</data>
      <data key="d3">462</data>
      <data key="d4">1</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">14359</data>
      <data key="d7">e79f636ba7b943cfb71717a7f78d5109</data>
    </node>
    <node id="BAJA INTENSIDAD">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Refers to low-intensity training sessions that have different carbohydrate intake requirements</data>
      <data key="d2">470e6bb2e8b8ca543addb0f07464f38c</data>
      <data key="d3">462</data>
      <data key="d4">1</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">14360</data>
      <data key="d7">37b0593e8e2d429cb15238c4c37a6d1c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="PRODUCTOS PARA DEPORTISTAS">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Los productos para deportistas incluyen una variedad de alimentos y bebidas dise&#241;ados para proporcionar carbohidratos de f&#225;cil consumo durante el ejercicio.</data>
      <data key="d2">638446780cdd61df83a06944c4e15c15</data>
      <data key="d3">1740</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">14361</data>
      <data key="d7">11e963499fb645329bfd300b602d8a06</data>
    </node>
    <node id="GLUC&#211;GENO MUSCULAR">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">El gluc&#243;geno muscular es la forma en que se almacena la glucosa en los m&#250;sculos, y es crucial para el rendimiento durante el ejercicio.</data>
      <data key="d2">638446780cdd61df83a06944c4e15c15</data>
      <data key="d3">1740</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">14362</data>
      <data key="d7">8e7094c1bc424eb7a2def4d7cfdb409e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="S&#205;NTESIS DE GLUC&#211;GENO">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">La s&#237;ntesis de gluc&#243;geno es el proceso mediante el cual el cuerpo repone el gluc&#243;geno muscular y hep&#225;tico despu&#233;s del ejercicio, crucial para la recuperaci&#243;n.</data>
      <data key="d2">638446780cdd61df83a06944c4e15c15</data>
      <data key="d3">1740</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">14363</data>
      <data key="d7">a1e0d7bab12b43feb6a04d18f1ab7501</data>
    </node>
    <node id="TRANSPORTADORES DE GLUCOSA">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Los transportadores de glucosa son prote&#237;nas que facilitan la absorci&#243;n de glucosa en el cuerpo, esenciales para el metabolismo de los carbohidratos.</data>
      <data key="d2">638446780cdd61df83a06944c4e15c15</data>
      <data key="d3">1740</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">14364</data>
      <data key="d7">6dc5ad5f8569469b83a9b7652d4e2a52</data>
    </node>
    <node id="EJERCICIO DE ULTRARESISTENCIA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">El ejercicio de ultrarresistencia se refiere a actividades f&#237;sicas que duran m&#225;s de 2,5-3 horas, donde se requiere una ingesta elevada de carbohidratos para mantener el rendimiento.</data>
      <data key="d2">638446780cdd61df83a06944c4e15c15</data>
      <data key="d3">1739</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">14365</data>
      <data key="d7">0770f033fd394572bbd13ba539debaf5</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&#205;NDICE GLUC&#201;MICO">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">&#205;NDICE GLUC&#201;MICO is a measure that indicates how quickly a carbohydrate-containing food raises blood glucose levels. It classifies foods based on their impact on blood glucose levels, which is particularly important for the selection of carbohydrates after exercise.</data>
      <data key="d2">440978f75b135fa97eb7b99ca379e9a4,638446780cdd61df83a06944c4e15c15</data>
      <data key="d3">1248</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">2</data>
      <data key="d6">14366</data>
      <data key="d7">7ec9c028c5ff461588fa1f03beb6e70f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="ALMACENAMIENTO DE GLUC&#211;GENO">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">The process of glycogen storage is vital for athletes to maintain energy levels during prolonged physical activities.</data>
      <data key="d2">39da0855b83941d97766254aa36ed2fd</data>
      <data key="d3">1757</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">14367</data>
      <data key="d7">446490c3e43d46c0af1c89447db93712</data>
    </node>
    <node id="ADAPTACI&#211;N">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Adaptation refers to the physiological changes that occur in the body in response to training, improving performance and efficiency in energy use.</data>
      <data key="d2">39da0855b83941d97766254aa36ed2fd</data>
      <data key="d3">1756</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">14368</data>
      <data key="d7">31d2a7630d1242b2b40494aa0233b749</data>
    </node>
    <node id="STUART M. PHILLIPS">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Stuart M. Phillips is a researcher who suggests optimal protein intake for muscle synthesis and hypertrophy.</data>
      <data key="d2">dcb97f7ffdb0aea3051bdf53e04bcc29</data>
      <data key="d3">1594</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">14369</data>
      <data key="d7">b9bc50346fce4fd8af87c2da116e02b4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="EJERCICIO DE FUERZA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Strength training exercises that promote muscle growth and increase protein synthesis.</data>
      <data key="d2">dcb97f7ffdb0aea3051bdf53e04bcc29</data>
      <data key="d3">1756</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">2</data>
      <data key="d6">14370</data>
      <data key="d7">7af8a576535f4e75b68c600214e6a45a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="EJERCICIO DE RESISTENCIA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">"EJERCICIO DE RESISTENCIA" refers to endurance exercises that are crucial for muscle development. These activities not only enhance physical performance but also consistently increase the protein requirements for individuals, particularly athletes. This type of exercise plays a fundamental role in promoting muscle growth and overall physical fitness.</data>
      <data key="d2">bb9a5c32408b601f9ecedc2a2b82d6b6,dcb97f7ffdb0aea3051bdf53e04bcc29</data>
      <data key="d3">673</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">5</data>
      <data key="d6">14371</data>
      <data key="d7">27246ee08fd8426da775d75e7620b277</data>
    </node>
    <node id="ENTRENAMIENTO DE FUERZA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">El entrenamiento de fuerza es un tipo de ejercicio que, cuando se asocia con un incremento en la ingesta de prote&#237;nas, puede conducir a un aumento del desarrollo muscular.</data>
      <data key="d2">bb9a5c32408b601f9ecedc2a2b82d6b6</data>
      <data key="d3">672</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">3</data>
      <data key="d6">14372</data>
      <data key="d7">14b357b2741345fca61de392d80e468c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="TR&#205;ADA DE LA MUJER DEPORTISTA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">La tr&#237;ada de la mujer deportista es un s&#237;ndrome que incluye des&#243;rdenes alimentarios, amenorrea y osteoporosis, afectando la salud de las deportistas.</data>
      <data key="d2">700a4472a23342b891a5685b622437d2</data>
      <data key="d3">1747</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">2</data>
      <data key="d6">14373</data>
      <data key="d7">6533e5d21b5142308808611d1d9cb2ac</data>
    </node>
    <node id="TERMORREGULACI&#211;N">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">La termorregulaci&#243;n es el proceso que el cuerpo utiliza para disipar el calor acumulado durante el ejercicio, crucial para el rendimiento deportivo.</data>
      <data key="d2">700a4472a23342b891a5685b622437d2</data>
      <data key="d3">1435</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">14374</data>
      <data key="d7">fbec97a1028f4a23822ef501376a2687</data>
    </node>
    <node id="MENSTRUACI&#211;N">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">La menstruaci&#243;n puede aumentar la p&#233;rdida de hierro en algunas mujeres, contribuyendo a la deficiencia de hierro en deportistas.</data>
      <data key="d2">700a4472a23342b891a5685b622437d2</data>
      <data key="d3">1747</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">14375</data>
      <data key="d7">059da576afac41fc87ea4314190cdc14</data>
    </node>
    <node id="NUTRICI&#211;N INADECUADA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">La nutrici&#243;n inadecuada, combinada con ejercicio intenso, puede llevar a un d&#233;ficit energ&#233;tico en deportistas.</data>
      <data key="d2">700a4472a23342b891a5685b622437d2</data>
      <data key="d3">1747</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">14376</data>
      <data key="d7">44f7547d5f1243ee9c7f58c4b783ef26</data>
    </node>
    <node id="SUDOR">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">El sudor es un l&#237;quido producido por las gl&#225;ndulas sudor&#237;paras que ayuda a regular la temperatura corporal durante el ejercicio.</data>
      <data key="d2">364aa13581a973c2e55c25191bad27cc</data>
      <data key="d3">1740</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">14377</data>
      <data key="d7">fd3d3606074c4cf8b56e3e9ad3f9ca68</data>
    </node>
    <node id="CALAMBRES">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Los calambres son contracciones musculares involuntarias que pueden ocurrir como resultado de la deshidrataci&#243;n y el desequilibrio electrol&#237;tico.</data>
      <data key="d2">364aa13581a973c2e55c25191bad27cc</data>
      <data key="d3">1740</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">14378</data>
      <data key="d7">c45866aa38534817888454fd9f873af1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="CONSCIENCIA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">La consciencia se refiere al estado de alerta y percepci&#243;n de una persona, que puede verse afectado por la deshidrataci&#243;n.</data>
      <data key="d2">364aa13581a973c2e55c25191bad27cc</data>
      <data key="d3">1740</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">14379</data>
      <data key="d7">6a9c87e2ff5f42558ec04c2fec9ac8e1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="ESTRATEGIA DE HIDRATACI&#211;N">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Una estrategia de hidrataci&#243;n es un plan dise&#241;ado para asegurar que un deportista mantenga un nivel adecuado de l&#237;quidos durante el ejercicio.</data>
      <data key="d2">364aa13581a973c2e55c25191bad27cc</data>
      <data key="d3">1740</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">14380</data>
      <data key="d7">dc6001da38174896b37a67e83374bde2</data>
    </node>
    <node id="RADIACI&#211;N SOLAR">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">La radiaci&#243;n solar es la energ&#237;a emitida por el sol, que puede afectar la temperatura corporal y la necesidad de hidrataci&#243;n durante el ejercicio.</data>
      <data key="d2">364aa13581a973c2e55c25191bad27cc</data>
      <data key="d3">1740</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">14381</data>
      <data key="d7">ea2a7235d4274b35829fae5cad15a659</data>
    </node>
    <node id="HUMEDAD">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">La humedad es la cantidad de vapor de agua en el aire, que puede afectar la hidrataci&#243;n y el rendimiento de los deportistas durante el ejercicio.</data>
      <data key="d2">364aa13581a973c2e55c25191bad27cc</data>
      <data key="d3">1740</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">14382</data>
      <data key="d7">c27e6ae0230b4ccd90cdb77521933a8f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="TEMPERATURA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">TEMPERATURA refers to the degree of heat in the environment, which can significantly influence various factors, including the hydration needs of athletes during exercise. Additionally, TEMPERATURA encompasses the temperature conditions under which clinical nutrition products are processed, which is crucial for maintaining the stability and solubility of proteins and other ingredients in clinical nutrition formulations. Therefore, temperature is a critical element that affects both physical performance in sports and the quality of nutritional products.</data>
      <data key="d2">364aa13581a973c2e55c25191bad27cc,d9e4179f945ec9152199511522d70159,dc38a37c30b175667931b84a9c9103bb</data>
      <data key="d3">1740</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">2</data>
      <data key="d6">14383</data>
      <data key="d7">d9c540e8c20646a78fed0e08f51d48a6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="COMIT&#201; CIENT&#205;FICO EN ALIMENTACI&#211;N HUMANA">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The Scientific Committee on Human Nutrition (CCAH) of the European Union provides guidelines on the composition of foods and beverages for energy expenditure during intense muscular effort, especially for athletes.</data>
      <data key="d2">cfe1de28f01fa6428be1486b6af8f0a2</data>
      <data key="d3">1556</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">14384</data>
      <data key="d7">433d39cc13d84d12a78be87922a1fb70</data>
    </node>
    <node id="BEBIDAS DEPORTIVAS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">BEBIDAS DEPORTIVAS, or sports drinks, are specially designed beverages intended for athletes to maintain proper hydroelectrolytic balance during physical activity. These drinks provide essential hydration and energy, supporting athletes in their performance and endurance while engaging in sports or exercise.</data>
      <data key="d2">cfe1de28f01fa6428be1486b6af8f0a2,fae6538f87888794da1ff0aaf0d842fe</data>
      <data key="d3">1735</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">7</data>
      <data key="d6">14385</data>
      <data key="d7">56460d3ef1c34894990765ebb0bae027</data>
    </node>
    <node id="GASTO DE GLUC&#211;GENO MUSCULAR">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Muscle glycogen expenditure refers to the use of stored carbohydrates in muscles during physical activity, which can be influenced by hydration and carbohydrate intake.</data>
      <data key="d2">cfe1de28f01fa6428be1486b6af8f0a2</data>
      <data key="d3">1739</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">14386</data>
      <data key="d7">9ec47eeeb2734dbcb5c5a499b26da359</data>
    </node>
    <node id="CCAH">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The Comisi&#243;n de Alimentaci&#243;n Humana (CCAH) is an organization dedicated to promoting health and nutrition, particularly in the context of athletic performance. CCAH advocates for specific guidelines concerning isotonic beverages, focusing on their osmolality to ensure optimal hydration and energy replenishment for athletes. Additionally, the organization has drafted a comprehensive report on the composition of foods and beverages designed to meet the energy expenditure needs of individuals engaged in intense muscular efforts, emphasizing the importance of proper nutrition in athletic training and performance.</data>
      <data key="d2">3e8ab018917854d76a0137102e0392bd,54a47e2936e787ab5943e2d75afc03f1</data>
      <data key="d3">1560</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">2</data>
      <data key="d6">14387</data>
      <data key="d7">465108d9d01b4e33931bb90df5e45f6e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="FEDERACI&#211;N ESPA&#209;OLA DE MEDICINA DEL DEPORTE">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The Federaci&#243;n Espa&#241;ola de Medicina del Deporte is a group that published a consensus document on nutrition in 2008, endorsing specific beverage compositions for athletes.</data>
      <data key="d2">3e8ab018917854d76a0137102e0392bd</data>
      <data key="d3">1560</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">14388</data>
      <data key="d7">1a2b5d6033b94a239c254bc9661cc997</data>
    </node>
    <node id="ERGOGENIA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Ergogenia refers to methods and techniques aimed at enhancing physical and mental performance in sports.</data>
      <data key="d2">3e8ab018917854d76a0137102e0392bd</data>
      <data key="d3">1747</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">14389</data>
      <data key="d7">25b543c50ab54390932a416b5af97281</data>
    </node>
    <node id="TAURINA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">TAURINA, also known as taurine, is a sulfur-containing amino acid that plays a crucial role in various physiological functions. It is often discussed in nutritional contexts due to its potential benefits. In the realm of infant nutrition, TAURINA may be added to infant formulas to support immune function and promote gastrointestinal development. Additionally, taurine is recognized for its use among athletes, as it may enhance physical performance. Overall, TAURINA is significant for both developmental and performance-related applications.</data>
      <data key="d2">3e8ab018917854d76a0137102e0392bd,8f2e38ed25a683975b314e8e56721ad6,b789dfd7a5aa36fac33c5c881a1a4981</data>
