      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Hebuterne X is a researcher recognized for significant contributions to the field of home enteral nutrition and its practices across Europe. Additionally, Hebuterne X is one of the authors involved in discussing the European Society for Clinical Nutrition and Metabolism (ESPEN) guidelines pertaining to enteral nutrition in gastroenterology.</data>
