    <node id="CLINICAL GUIDELINES TASK FORCE">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The Clinical Guidelines Task Force is a specialized group within the American Society for Parenteral and Enteral Nutrition (ASPEN) dedicated to the development of clinical guidelines for nutrition support therapy. This task force focuses on creating evidence-based guidelines aimed at optimizing nutrition support for patients, ensuring that healthcare providers have access to the best practices in the field.</data>
      <data key="d2">9ef354c0ee5ac877ce8fba79fcc7e2b3,ceb66a898fed371e013171c43a87e1d1</data>
