    <node id="SOCIETY OF CRITICAL CARE MEDICINE">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The Society of Critical Care Medicine (SCCM) is a professional organization dedicated to enhancing the care of critically ill patients. It focuses on various aspects of critical care, including the development of guidelines for nutrition support therapy. The organization aims to improve patient outcomes through research, education, and the establishment of best practices in critical care medicine.</data>
      <data key="d2">29cd22ec41c1cb5160d9987958d6ae16,4ce6342fdfe4419826c1ab2f84c56247,d26aec24f3f8c930c1c4b1d464bacd6b</data>
