    <node id="OLIVEIRA FUSTER G.">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Oliveira Fuster G. is an author recognized for his contributions to the field of clinical nutrition, particularly in the area of parenteral nutrition. He authored a practical guide that addresses the prescription and monitoring of parenteral nutrition, providing valuable insights for healthcare professionals. Additionally, he contributed to the "Manual de Nutrici&#243;n Cl&#237;nica y Diet&#233;tica," further emphasizing his expertise and focus on parenteral nutrition within clinical dietary practices.</data>
