    <node id="SUBCUTANEOUS RESERVOIR">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">A subcutaneous reservoir is a device implanted under the skin to provide access to the venous system for medication delivery, often used in conjunction with catheters.</data>
      <data key="d2">3d5e0a3ef45c7ba15063791545dc4826</data>
