    <node id="SUERO GLUCOSADO">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">SUERO GLUCOSADO, or glucose solution, is a type of intravenous fluid utilized in medical treatments. It plays a crucial role in managing sodium levels in patients and is particularly important in the treatment of hyponatremia. This solution is often used in conjunction with treatments for patients receiving artificial nutrition, aiding in the management of fluid balance.</data>
      <data key="d2">306519cca8810e0ff1c973128a75200a,e4b62c2ae5857a5dd11f609286271bb4</data>
      <data key="d3">1427</data>
