    <node id="FURSEMIDA">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">FURSEMIDA, also known as Furosemide, is a diuretic medication primarily utilized to treat fluid retention. It is particularly effective in managing conditions associated with excess fluid accumulation in the body. Additionally, Furosemide is employed in the treatment of patients experiencing hyponatremia, especially those who are receiving artificial nutrition. This medication plays a crucial role in regulating fluid balance and electrolyte levels in various clinical settings.</data>
      <data key="d2">306519cca8810e0ff1c973128a75200a,fa0165b0420f4c761829a08a3ab08508</data>
