      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Hypo-natremia hypervolemic is a type of hyponatremia that occurs when there is an excess of fluid in the body, diluting sodium levels.</data>
      <data key="d2">a56fad7f6dac4a75bd4748b247aa9215</data>
      <data key="d3">1426</data>
