    <node id="NUTRICI&#211;N PEDI&#193;TRICA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">NUTRICI&#211;N PEDI&#193;TRICA is a specialized field of medicine dedicated to addressing the nutritional needs and dietary management of infants and children. This area encompasses a comprehensive range of topics, including dietary recommendations for various age groups, focusing on essential macronutrients and micronutrients necessary for healthy growth and development. 

The guidelines within NUTRICI&#211;N PEDI&#193;TRICA emphasize the importance of appropriate sodium intake, milk consumption, and the gradual introduction of diverse foods to stimulate appetite and meet nutritional requirements. It also addresses the energy needs and nutrient intake during different stages of childhood, ensuring that dietary plans are tailored to support both undernutrition and overnutrition.

Furthermore, NUTRICI&#211;N PEDI&#193;TRICA includes nutritional assessments and interventions aimed at promoting optimal growth and health in pediatric patients. It provides specific dietary guidelines for critical conditions, focusing on medical nutrition therapy and the administration of parenteral nutrition for those with particular medical needs. The field also highlights the significance of enteral nutrition as the preferred method for delivering nutrients to children, ensuring that their dietary needs are met effectively.

Overall, NUTRICI&#211;N PEDI&#193;TRICA is essential for guiding healthcare professionals in the nutritional support and dietary management of infants, children, and adolescents, ultimately promoting their health and development.</data>
      <data key="d2">06f547bc6311ffa370bc1a65dc7184d2,11662a6f83b8217976d8c9c5d33fe7fd,1ceaa92ed88d3f829122e1554f2e7277,222519e556047fafecd61c2964aaaeed,507eeea555c496a467930836fc4c1a39,61b84039de5ac2d9e25890c3b8f4f87a,62bb1dedc96b7530649f4c9762faab9d,70e48774a3f732e015a59d38ba2fa5d5,767d564db2dbf0182707caaf1b0a52d2,8f2e38ed25a683975b314e8e56721ad6,9303a85464d02f1cc012aaca21edf9bb,b6c8d5ff1536806d6512fb9d1af1e6db,b789dfd7a5aa36fac33c5c881a1a4981,ccac97d61bc412a8574fd71aa26dad79,d0fb942f9036630b4cf0727dea808fd2,df73c75d84a055e0a67bc7f14d35e9d5,e5313f692c0a8259c93be803a704413c,e55003dbf85cc1fb81cac90716ce0e87,e5b3805730df59cb36030c92aa33c194,e742c891694171ad455b038f416b7728,ec4fd77add427ab49ea4b8687b94b263,f96dd2fbe3cd9aa6516522de8ed33145</data>
      <data key="d3">630</data>
