    <node id="INDIA">
      <data key="d0">GEO</data>
      <data key="d1">India is a country that plays a significant role in providing data on child growth and nutrition within the context of the World Health Organization (WHO). It is also included in the WHO's international growth reference patterns for children, contributing to global standards and understanding of child health and development.</data>
      <data key="d2">21634801ee74e0828836551dbeb8b1ed,7894b38e96733cb8fb258b4666f7d7b7</data>
