    <node id="GHANA">
      <data key="d0">GEO</data>
      <data key="d1">Ghana is a country that plays a significant role in providing data on child growth and nutrition within the context of the World Health Organization (WHO). It is included in the WHO's international growth reference patterns for children, which contributes to the global understanding of child growth. Through its participation, Ghana aids in the development of comprehensive insights into the nutritional status and growth patterns of children, thereby supporting global health initiatives.</data>
      <data key="d2">21634801ee74e0828836551dbeb8b1ed,7894b38e96733cb8fb258b4666f7d7b7</data>
