    <node id="UNU">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The United Nations University (UNU) is an international community of scholars dedicated to addressing global issues through research, capacity development, and the dissemination of knowledge. As an academic and research institution, UNU focuses on conducting research and providing education that contributes to the understanding and resolution of pressing global challenges.</data>
