      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">The entity "1-3 A&#209;OS" refers to the age group of toddlers, specifically those aged between one to three years. This age group is associated with specific dietary recommendations, particularly concerning the recommended dietary allowances for essential nutrients such as calcium and iron. These guidelines are crucial for supporting the growth and development of children in this formative stage.</data>
