    <node id="REAL DECRETO 867/2008">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">REAL DECRETO 867/2008 is a Spanish regulation that establishes technical and sanitary standards for the production of infant formulas and follow-up formulas. It governs the composition and safety of these products, ensuring that they meet specific technical-sanitary regulations in Spain. This regulation plays a crucial role in safeguarding the health and well-being of infants by setting clear guidelines for the formulation and quality of infant nutrition products.</data>
      <data key="d2">4752b173a12652aa3728cbfaf3d6cb37,8f2e38ed25a683975b314e8e56721ad6,9303a85464d02f1cc012aaca21edf9bb</data>
