      <data key="d1">A dietist is a professional who specializes in diet and nutrition, playing a crucial role in the assessment and management of malnutrition. They assist in calculating nutritional compositions to ensure that patients achieve adequate nutrient intake, thereby promoting overall health and well-being.</data>
