    </node>
    <node id="NUTRITIONAL FACTORS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Nutritional factors are elements that contribute to the development of cholestasis during total parenteral nutrition.</data>
      <data key="d2">384e13475cc83e77e160fd6be9a88e73</data>
      <data key="d5">0</data>
      <data key="d6">15777</data>
      <data key="d7">bae0e6735fc84c7aa73f8f2d98518ad4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="CHOLESTASIS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Cholestasis is a condition that can occur in patients receiving parenteral nutrition, particularly in infants and children.</data>
      <data key="d2">384e13475cc83e77e160fd6be9a88e73</data>
      <data key="d5">0</data>
      <data key="d6">15778</data>
      <data key="d7">63a290ae8bbd40c4a64670e90de622a2</data>
    </node>
    <node id="HOME PARENTERAL NUTRITION">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Home parenteral nutrition is a medical treatment designed for patients who are unable to obtain sufficient nutrition through oral intake. This therapy involves delivering nutrients directly into the bloodstream, allowing patients to receive essential nutrition intravenously in the comfort of their own homes. It is particularly beneficial for individuals with severe digestive issues, who may require this form of nutritional support to maintain their health and well-being.</data>
      <data key="d2">384e13475cc83e77e160fd6be9a88e73,4b0d0238a19e23ffee592c9d0817e226,c879347903aabeef630597c99cff2275</data>
      <data key="d3">210</data>
      <data key="d4">1</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">15779</data>
      <data key="d7">bb8b06557f0e45588658878e41ebb00a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="LONG-TERM PARENTERAL NUTRITION">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Long-term parenteral nutrition refers to the extended use of parenteral nutrition in patients, often leading to complications.</data>
      <data key="d2">384e13475cc83e77e160fd6be9a88e73</data>
      <data key="d5">0</data>
      <data key="d6">15780</data>
      <data key="d7">087cbac6176d43acb49a7e65ebd9cfbf</data>
    </node>
    <node id="REVIEW">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">A review is a comprehensive assessment of existing literature on a particular subject, such as the management of complications in home parenteral nutrition.</data>
      <data key="d2">384e13475cc83e77e160fd6be9a88e73</data>
      <data key="d5">0</data>
      <data key="d6">15781</data>
      <data key="d7">d91f31fd6d52440aa9fe5288fccfead9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="CASE SERIES">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">A case series is a type of research study that tracks patients with a known exposure or treatment, such as central venous catheter thrombosis in pediatric patients.</data>
      <data key="d2">384e13475cc83e77e160fd6be9a88e73</data>
      <data key="d5">0</data>
      <data key="d6">15782</data>
      <data key="d7">5dfed71ef915405d914c6b26cc7df975</data>
    </node>
    <node id="PROSPECTIVE TRIAL">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">A prospective trial is a research study that follows participants forward in time to evaluate the effects of a treatment, such as taurolidine lock in preventing infections.</data>
      <data key="d2">384e13475cc83e77e160fd6be9a88e73</data>
      <data key="d5">0</data>
      <data key="d6">15783</data>
      <data key="d7">4e002b268c154819b7fb67a54a8e351e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="PEDIATRIC SURGICAL ASSOCIATION">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The American Pediatric Surgical Association is an organization focused on improving surgical care for children, including those with intestinal failure.</data>
      <data key="d2">384e13475cc83e77e160fd6be9a88e73</data>
      <data key="d5">0</data>
      <data key="d6">15784</data>
      <data key="d7">5f98adef135d486e844b7110f967620a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="NUTRITIONAL HOSPITAL">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Nutritional Hospital is a facility that specializes in providing nutritional support and care for patients, particularly those requiring parenteral nutrition.</data>
      <data key="d2">384e13475cc83e77e160fd6be9a88e73</data>
      <data key="d5">0</data>
      <data key="d6">15785</data>
      <data key="d7">7b86bdc24350437a9d4b64edc1002472</data>
    </node>
