    <node id="LEY ORG&#193;NICA 1/1979">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The Ley Org&#225;nica 1/1979, enacted on September 26, 1979, is known as the General Penitentiary Law in Spain. This law establishes regulations concerning the life, integrity, and health of individuals incarcerated in penitentiary institutions. It aims to ensure the humane treatment of inmates and outlines the standards that govern their conditions of confinement.</data>
      <data key="d2">3a39d5a157094736650455097e986fdd,9df735d7829302712be068a5d1b1540b</data>
      <data key="d3">1482</data>
