    </node>
    <node id="REAL DECRETO 190/1996">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The "REAL DECRETO 190/1996" is a significant legislative measure in Spain, enacted on February 9, 1996. It approves the Penitentiary Regulations, which are designed to develop and implement the provisions of the Ley Org&#225;nica 1/1979. This decree establishes the framework for the management and operation of penitentiary institutions in Spain, ensuring that the regulations align with the overarching legal principles set forth in the earlier law.</data>
      <data key="d2">3a39d5a157094736650455097e986fdd,9df735d7829302712be068a5d1b1540b</data>
      <data key="d3">1482</data>
