    <node id="ADMINISTRACI&#211;N PENITENCIARIA">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The Administraci&#243;n Penitenciaria is the governmental entity tasked with overseeing the management of prisons. Its primary responsibilities include safeguarding the life, integrity, and health of inmates within penitentiary institutions. This organization plays a crucial role in ensuring that the rights of inmates are upheld while they serve their sentences.</data>
      <data key="d2">1f8ce52208981fd781dcf23f690f6c3c,3a39d5a157094736650455097e986fdd</data>
