    <node id="GRAPO">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">GRAPO is a collective of political prisoners in Spain, recognized for their participation in hunger strikes. This group of inmates has raised significant ethical and legal concerns regarding their treatment within the prison system. Their actions highlight the ongoing struggle for improved conditions and rights for prisoners, drawing attention to the broader issues of justice and human rights in the context of incarceration.</data>
      <data key="d2">87ab96c9e47970751fc97c244c4b4534,f8440456e04065bd27e87482b8d2db89</data>
      <data key="d3">1938</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
