      <data key="d1">The Society of Spanish Parenteral and Enteral Nutrition is an organization dedicated to enhancing nutritional support in clinical settings. It emphasizes specialized nutritional support and addresses the ethical aspects associated with this field. Through its initiatives, the society aims to improve the quality of care provided to patients requiring parenteral and enteral nutrition.</data>
