    <node id="CONVENIO PARA LA PROTECCI&#211;N DE LOS DERECHOS HUMANOS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">The "CONVENIO PARA LA PROTECCI&#211;N DE LOS DERECHOS HUMANOS," also known as the Convention for the Protection of Human Rights and Dignity of the Human Being with regard to the Applications of Biology and Medicine, is a significant international treaty that emphasizes the dignity of human beings in the context of biological applications. This convention was signed in Oviedo on April 4, 1997, and it aims to safeguard human rights in relation to advancements in biology and medicine.</data>
      <data key="d2">193f43446f6311107c8a73b6111fa25a,9df735d7829302712be068a5d1b1540b</data>
