    <node id="COMPLEJO ASISTENCIAL UNIVERSITARIO LE&#211;N">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The Complejo Asistencial Universitario Le&#243;n, also known as the University Assistance Complex of Le&#243;n, is a prominent healthcare institution that employs professionals such as Roc&#237;o Villar Taibo, Ana Urioste Fondo, and Paula Fern&#225;ndez Mart&#237;nez. This institution is actively involved in clinical nutrition and dietetics, providing specialized services in these areas. Additionally, the University Hospital of Le&#243;n, which is part of this complex, features a Clinical Nutrition Unit dedicated to both research and patient care in nutrition, further emphasizing its commitment to advancing healthcare in this field.</data>
      <data key="d2">4e86ca77481672995a03989d321652bc,9df735d7829302712be068a5d1b1540b,c879347903aabeef630597c99cff2275</data>
