    <node id="GOBIERNO DE ESPA&#209;A">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The Government of Spain is the national executive body responsible for the administration of the country. It plays a crucial role in establishing health policies and regulations, which encompass areas related to nutrition and healthcare services. As the governing authority, the Government of Spain is tasked with the implementation of laws and the overall management of the nation's affairs.</data>
