    <node id="GESTI&#211;N SANITARIA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">GESTI&#211;N SANITARIA refers to the management of health services, emphasizing the importance of efficiency and effectiveness in achieving positive health outcomes while maintaining reasonable costs. This concept encompasses healthcare management, which involves making strategic decisions aimed at optimizing patient care and the allocation of resources within health services.</data>
      <data key="d2">26765fd0d663c8708d7bd6a545de3e2c,66c092d222e72c03a1f36507ce355cd4,f70e5dee3fad44cd9576113c0bb941d5</data>
