    </node>
    <node id="MEDICINA BASADA EN LA EVIDENCIA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">"MEDICINA BASADA EN LA EVIDENCIA" (MBE) is a clinical practice approach that emphasizes the integration of the best current evidence with clinical expertise and patient values in making decisions about patient care. This model of medical practice prioritizes the use of the most relevant and up-to-date clinical evidence to inform medical decision-making, ensuring that patient care is both effective and aligned with individual patient needs and preferences.</data>
      <data key="d2">0ea889003f06c1b62aea79aae0901061,66c092d222e72c03a1f36507ce355cd4,7dbb13ddc40e2f4d060338cabf9ecea7</data>
      <data key="d3">1277</data>
