    </node>
    <node id="COSTES NO SANITARIOS">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">COSTES NO SANITARIOS refer to the costs incurred by patients that are not directly related to medical services. These costs include expenses associated with transportation, personal care assistance, and other indirect costs linked to health services.</data>
      <data key="d2">409d25455161e69d9ba9654d875917a3,f70e5dee3fad44cd9576113c0bb941d5</data>
