      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">15938</data>
      <data key="d7">3426fbffa7e641c8812d4bb52f9f82b3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="NUTRICI&#211;N Y ASPECTOS LEGALES">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">The entity "NUTRICI&#211;N Y ASPECTOS LEGALES" encompasses a comprehensive examination of the economic and legal dimensions associated with nutrition and healthcare costs. This section highlights the significance of nutrition, alongside the legal considerations pertinent to the research and development of clinical nutrition products. Additionally, it addresses the nutritional analysis and the legal frameworks governing product development, ensuring compliance with European legislation regarding nutrient values. Overall, "NUTRICI&#211;N Y ASPECTOS LEGALES" serves as a critical resource for understanding the interplay between nutrition, legal requirements, and economic factors in the healthcare sector.</data>
      <data key="d2">067a2eec3da66594167147aca615fa03,409d25455161e69d9ba9654d875917a3,4cbb124f28ea6f426c4aa7bc0edbb742</data>
      <data key="d3">125</data>
      <data key="d4">1</data>
      <data key="d5">3</data>
      <data key="d6">15939</data>
      <data key="d7">efcb7d532733432da9e11416eb06818c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="COSTE IDENTIFICACI&#211;N">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">An analysis method that evaluates the cost of a procedure or treatment, particularly when comparing two therapeutic options with identical outcomes</data>
      <data key="d2">409d25455161e69d9ba9654d875917a3</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">15940</data>
      <data key="d7">b3d1186130464b8e952e30adfbca6f0d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="COSTE EFECTIVIDAD">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">An analysis method used to compare the relative costs and outcomes of different interventions</data>
      <data key="d2">409d25455161e69d9ba9654d875917a3</data>
      <data key="d5">2</data>
      <data key="d6">15941</data>
      <data key="d7">b1e708fafc5e4a0596fb18eb92839ba0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="COSTE UTILIDAD">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">An analysis method that assesses the cost in relation to the utility gained from a treatment or intervention</data>
      <data key="d2">409d25455161e69d9ba9654d875917a3</data>
      <data key="d5">2</data>
      <data key="d6">15942</data>
      <data key="d7">e34df788758c41e783d975c12185393c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="COSTE BENEFICIO">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">An analysis method that compares the costs of an intervention to its benefits, often expressed in monetary terms</data>
      <data key="d2">409d25455161e69d9ba9654d875917a3</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">15943</data>
      <data key="d7">0cf2c3eb91324019a5ebd8ef80eea7b8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="COSTE DIRECTO">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Direct costs associated with healthcare services, calculated based on established reference prices in a competitive market.</data>
      <data key="d2">409d25455161e69d9ba9654d875917a3</data>
      <data key="d3">277</data>
      <data key="d4">1</data>
      <data key="d5">2</data>
      <data key="d6">15944</data>
      <data key="d7">36f17aa7ea2442749770cec077a662ff</data>
    </node>
    <node id="COSTE INDIRECTO">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Indirect costs related to productivity loss due to morbidity or the cost of replacing lost labor.</data>
      <data key="d2">409d25455161e69d9ba9654d875917a3</data>
      <data key="d3">277</data>
      <data key="d4">1</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">15945</data>
      <data key="d7">d362270b276742748ff40925a60d0632</data>
    </node>
    <node id="COSTE TOTAL">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">The total cost of a clinical process, calculated as the sum of fixed and variable costs.</data>
      <data key="d2">409d25455161e69d9ba9654d875917a3</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">15946</data>
      <data key="d7">7639cb7e85c74d5c8f5544211c19d5cb</data>
    </node>
    <node id="COSTE MEDIO">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">The average cost of resources used per unit produced in a healthcare setting.</data>
      <data key="d2">409d25455161e69d9ba9654d875917a3</data>
      <data key="d5">2</data>
      <data key="d6">15947</data>
      <data key="d7">6cc274db0fe545caa8de417e7795740f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="COSTE MARGINAL">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">The cost of producing one additional unit of service or treatment in healthcare.</data>
      <data key="d2">409d25455161e69d9ba9654d875917a3</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">15948</data>
      <data key="d7">d56588a949ee4129aca49ddc614554f0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="COSTE-UTILIDAD">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Coste-utilidad is a type of cost-effectiveness analysis that includes quality of life and life expectancy, allowing comparisons of interventions with different outcomes.</data>
      <data key="d2">c1fce1d059978d0a9ee9e63f75c8ca98</data>
      <data key="d3">958</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">3</data>
      <data key="d6">15949</data>
      <data key="d7">3a8c8c19b8854b8283b9a0a5508e1367</data>
    </node>
    <node id="COSTE-BENEFICIO">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">COSTE-BENEFICIO refers to a method of analysis that evaluates the relationship between the costs associated with a particular intervention and the benefits derived from it. This analysis is a complex economic evaluation that examines the cost-benefit relationship in monetary terms, allowing for the comparison of different treatments and their respective outcomes. Through this approach, COSTE-BENEFICIO provides insights into the efficiency and effectiveness of various interventions by quantifying their financial implications.</data>
      <data key="d2">c1fce1d059978d0a9ee9e63f75c8ca98,cf8a6f1b6d59546ed7bd297d032f6b30</data>
      <data key="d3">1434</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">3</data>
      <data key="d6">15950</data>
      <data key="d7">74fbc98c05fd4f319f74b42f7737fc4c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="CONTABILIDAD ANALITICA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Contabilidad anal&#237;tica allows for the breakdown of costs of all healthcare resources used in clinical practice, relating them to care activity.</data>
      <data key="d2">c1fce1d059978d0a9ee9e63f75c8ca98</data>
      <data key="d3">1274</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">2</data>
      <data key="d6">15951</data>
      <data key="d7">c77229ebbd0e4d189065882246494759</data>
    </node>
    <node id="A&#209;OS DE VIDA AJUSTADOS POR CALIDAD">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">A&#241;os de vida ajustados por calidad (AVAC) is a metric used to assess the value of medical interventions by considering both the quantity and quality of life gained.</data>
      <data key="d2">c1fce1d059978d0a9ee9e63f75c8ca98</data>
      <data key="d3">958</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">15952</data>
      <data key="d7">eda53be436de48c59e6da78eaec902ab</data>
    </node>
    <node id="ESTUDIOS DE COSTE-EFECTIVIDAD">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Estudios de coste-efectividad are research analyses that compare the costs and outcomes of different healthcare interventions to determine their efficiency.</data>
      <data key="d2">c1fce1d059978d0a9ee9e63f75c8ca98</data>
      <data key="d3">1434</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">15953</data>
      <data key="d7">901e7013516744f399465c4fcf5a8b37</data>
    </node>
    <node id="DECISIONES ESTRAT&#201;GICAS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Decisiones estrat&#233;gicas refer to the choices made in healthcare management based on analyses like cost-effectiveness to optimize resource allocation.</data>
      <data key="d2">c1fce1d059978d0a9ee9e63f75c8ca98</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">15954</data>
      <data key="d7">5d3fcdca80334d769522fcce0d5dd497</data>
    </node>
    <node id="MICROGESTI&#211;N SANITARIA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Microgesti&#243;n sanitaria involves the detailed management of healthcare resources and interventions at a local level, often informed by cost analyses.</data>
      <data key="d2">c1fce1d059978d0a9ee9e63f75c8ca98</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">15955</data>
      <data key="d7">cd915807174a432a861de63f74c6dc0e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="POL&#205;TICA DE LA MESOGESTI&#211;N">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Pol&#237;tica de la mesogesti&#243;n refers to the mid-level management policies in healthcare that guide resource allocation and intervention strategies.</data>
      <data key="d2">c1fce1d059978d0a9ee9e63f75c8ca98</data>
      <data key="d5">0</data>
      <data key="d6">15956</data>
      <data key="d7">b37826c7014a49bdb4c7e29f2ada9caf</data>
    </node>
    <node id="EFECTIVIDAD">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Efectividad refers to the success of an intervention in achieving desired health outcomes, a key measure in cost-effectiveness studies.</data>
      <data key="d2">c1fce1d059978d0a9ee9e63f75c8ca98</data>
      <data key="d3">1440</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">15957</data>
      <data key="d7">ad89b796fb29436e98f42f72a3a85985</data>
    </node>
    <node id="UNIDADES DE NUTRICI&#211;N CL&#205;NICA">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Las Unidades de Nutrici&#243;n Cl&#237;nica son centros que se encargan de la atenci&#243;n nutricional de los pacientes en un entorno hospitalario, evaluando y gestionando su estado nutricional.</data>
      <data key="d2">f53d37f60efeb5d6cdba204bf8f2bd9b</data>
      <data key="d3">1079</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">2</data>
      <data key="d6">15958</data>
      <data key="d7">8f37f516afec472bb11664678e95a5e8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="SISTEMAS DE INFORMACI&#211;N DE ATENCI&#211;N ESPECIALIZADA">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Los Sistemas de Informaci&#243;n de Atenci&#243;n Especializada son herramientas utilizadas para gestionar la actividad hospitalaria y mejorar la atenci&#243;n al paciente.</data>
      <data key="d2">f53d37f60efeb5d6cdba204bf8f2bd9b</data>
      <data key="d3">1079</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">15959</data>
      <data key="d7">3822cb3a156e4426b27dbe1a4a78bb9f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="CMBD">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">El Conjunto M&#237;nimo B&#225;sico de Datos (CMBD) es un sistema que contiene datos cl&#237;nicos y administrativos de cada episodio de hospitalizaci&#243;n, utilizado para la gesti&#243;n y an&#225;lisis de la actividad hospitalaria.</data>
      <data key="d2">f53d37f60efeb5d6cdba204bf8f2bd9b</data>
      <data key="d3">1278</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">15960</data>
      <data key="d7">c5352f5c386845e995e88bdaa3ca04a4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="GRUPOS RELACIONADOS CON EL DIAGN&#211;STICO">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Los Grupos Relacionados con el Diagn&#243;stico (GRD) son un sistema de clasificaci&#243;n dise&#241;ado para agrupar episodios de hospitalizaci&#243;n de pacientes que presentan caracter&#237;sticas cl&#237;nicas semejantes. Este sistema tiene como objetivo principal evaluar el consumo de recursos en los cuidados hospitalarios, facilitando as&#237; la gesti&#243;n eficiente de estos recursos. Al agrupar a los pacientes con caracter&#237;sticas similares, los GRD permiten una mejor organizaci&#243;n y administraci&#243;n de los servicios de salud.</data>
      <data key="d2">b6336e61e2a290a5c471fd72297d6093,f53d37f60efeb5d6cdba204bf8f2bd9b</data>
      <data key="d3">1278</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">9</data>
      <data key="d6">15961</data>
      <data key="d7">b0b6824487f940cf9e697e424bdd290a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="AN&#193;LISIS COSTE-EFECTIVIDAD">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">El an&#225;lisis coste-efectividad es un procedimiento que permite evaluar la relaci&#243;n entre los costos y los resultados de diferentes intervenciones m&#233;dicas.</data>
      <data key="d2">f53d37f60efeb5d6cdba204bf8f2bd9b</data>
      <data key="d3">1163</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">15962</data>
      <data key="d7">91218cc290fc4e0fa67cb56aca9dcf06</data>
    </node>
    <node id="SOCIEDAD ESPA&#209;OLA DE DOCUMENTACI&#211;N M&#201;DICA">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">La Sociedad Espa&#241;ola de Documentaci&#243;n M&#233;dica (SEDOM) se enfoca en la mejora de la documentaci&#243;n m&#233;dica y la codificaci&#243;n en el &#225;mbito sanitario.</data>
      <data key="d2">b6336e61e2a290a5c471fd72297d6093</data>
      <data key="d3">1278</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">15963</data>
      <data key="d7">d10f2869a15e451299fcf4df708b607a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="CIE-9 MC">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">La Clasificaci&#243;n Internacional de Enfermedades, 9&#170; revisi&#243;n, Modificaci&#243;n Cl&#237;nica (CIE-9 MC) es un sistema de codificaci&#243;n anterior al CIE-10, utilizado para clasificar diagn&#243;sticos y procedimientos m&#233;dicos.</data>
      <data key="d2">b6336e61e2a290a5c471fd72297d6093</data>
      <data key="d3">1278</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">15964</data>
      <data key="d7">872429621e554bf1b04ddad2ecf53281</data>
    </node>
    <node id="SERVICIO DE DIGESTIVO">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">El Servicio de Digestivo es una unidad dentro de un hospital que se especializa en el diagn&#243;stico y tratamiento de enfermedades del sistema digestivo.</data>
      <data key="d2">b6336e61e2a290a5c471fd72297d6093</data>
      <data key="d3">1266</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">15965</data>
      <data key="d7">5b46aceb2a8947b4a6e3c2bc83139d61</data>
    </node>
    <node id="MARASMO NUTRICIONAL">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Marasmo nutricional is a type of malnutrition resulting from a deficiency in caloric intake, leading to significant weight loss and muscle wasting.</data>
      <data key="d2">2a387a0f62fd64b31ecf55b1538932c2</data>
      <data key="d3">1436</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">15966</data>
      <data key="d7">75ea5b3f533d4a19b5abdea4e7f9bd16</data>
    </node>
    <node id="DISPOSITIVO DE ALIMENTACI&#211;N">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Dispositivo de alimentaci&#243;n refers to medical devices used to deliver nutrition directly to the stomach or intestines of patients who cannot eat normally.</data>
      <data key="d2">2a387a0f62fd64b31ecf55b1538932c2</data>
      <data key="d3">1103</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">3</data>
      <data key="d6">15967</data>
      <data key="d7">52dfc9301fe943e58155c05222aaac6f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="COSTES DE SERVICIO FUNCIONAL">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Costes de servicio funcional involves the financial aspects related to the provision of healthcare services, including the breakdown of costs associated with various healthcare activities.</data>
      <data key="d2">2a387a0f62fd64b31ecf55b1538932c2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">15968</data>
      <data key="d7">e39a68886e3a4be09801924beaca50d7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="GFH">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">GFH refers to functional health groups that play a crucial role in organizing, managing, and supporting healthcare activities. These groups are instrumental in the allocation and management of costs associated with healthcare services, ensuring that resources are utilized effectively to enhance the overall efficiency of healthcare delivery.</data>
      <data key="d2">2a387a0f62fd64b31ecf55b1538932c2,f73cc4b49b42b9c9d60bc906430ffe90</data>
      <data key="d5">5</data>
      <data key="d6">15969</data>
      <data key="d7">1f1e753ab77249909e89080f0b7106dc</data>
    </node>
    <node id="MALNUTRICI&#211;N CAL&#211;RICO-PROTEICA MODERADA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Malnutrici&#243;n cal&#243;rico-proteica moderada refers to a moderate level of malnutrition characterized by deficiencies in caloric and protein intake.</data>
      <data key="d2">2a387a0f62fd64b31ecf55b1538932c2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">15970</data>
      <data key="d7">62242279dc0a43199531ed4e1c198527</data>
    </node>
    <node id="MALNUTRICI&#211;N CAL&#211;RICO-PROTEICA LEVE">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Malnutrici&#243;n cal&#243;rico-proteica leve indicates a mild form of malnutrition where there are slight deficiencies in caloric and protein consumption.</data>
      <data key="d2">2a387a0f62fd64b31ecf55b1538932c2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">15971</data>
      <data key="d7">123d66bdb55a4132a56906f5e9d9f03d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="MALNUTRICI&#211;N CAL&#211;RICO-PROTEICA NO ESPECIFICADA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Malnutrici&#243;n cal&#243;rico-proteica no especificada refers to a form of malnutrition that is not clearly defined but involves a lack of both calories and proteins.</data>
      <data key="d2">2a387a0f62fd64b31ecf55b1538932c2</data>
      <data key="d5">0</data>
      <data key="d6">15972</data>
      <data key="d7">8c405e5e13b542feb61d14e861d0851b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="INTRODUCCI&#211;N EN VENA PERIF&#201;RICA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Introducci&#243;n en vena perif&#233;rica de sustancia nutricional is a medical procedure for delivering nutritional substances directly into the peripheral veins of patients.</data>
      <data key="d2">2a387a0f62fd64b31ecf55b1538932c2</data>
      <data key="d3">1103</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">15973</data>
      <data key="d7">53b6c909ce7b443a9373c4ec10dd6a40</data>
    </node>
    <node id="INTRODUCCI&#211;N EN VENA CENTRAL">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Introducci&#243;n en vena central de sustancia nutricional is a procedure for administering nutritional substances directly into the central veins of patients.</data>
      <data key="d2">2a387a0f62fd64b31ecf55b1538932c2</data>
      <data key="d5">0</data>
      <data key="d6">15974</data>
      <data key="d7">3d51468b8a3b4ee1b0a8fa26a0bc4ed2</data>
    </node>
    <node id="INTRODUCCI&#211;N EN BOCA Y FARINGE">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Introducci&#243;n en boca y faringe de sustancia nutricional is a method of delivering nutrition through the mouth and throat, typically for patients who can swallow.</data>
      <data key="d2">2a387a0f62fd64b31ecf55b1538932c2</data>
      <data key="d5">0</data>
      <data key="d6">15975</data>
      <data key="d7">1671661a53bb4b04862221bf7d4c7570</data>
    </node>
    <node id="INTRODUCCI&#211;N EN GASTROINTESTINAL SUPERIOR">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Introducci&#243;n en gastrointestinal superior de sustancia nutricional is a procedure for delivering nutrition directly into the upper gastrointestinal tract.</data>
      <data key="d2">2a387a0f62fd64b31ecf55b1538932c2</data>
      <data key="d5">0</data>
      <data key="d6">15976</data>
      <data key="d7">601ff2a427f44d178725eeb7481b518d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="INTRODUCCI&#211;N EN GASTROINTESTINAL INFERIOR">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Introducci&#243;n en gastrointestinal inferior de sustancia nutricional is a method for administering nutrition directly into the lower gastrointestinal tract.</data>
      <data key="d2">2a387a0f62fd64b31ecf55b1538932c2</data>
      <data key="d5">0</data>
      <data key="d6">15977</data>
      <data key="d7">e767fd341bd54f7fa72dab9c02657738</data>
    </node>
    <node id="INSERCI&#211;N EN VENA CAVA SUPERIOR">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Inserci&#243;n en vena cava superior de dispositivo de infusi&#243;n is a medical procedure for placing an infusion device into the superior vena cava for nutritional support.</data>
