    </node>
    <node id="PRODUCTO">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The PRODUCTO refers to the clinical nutrition items being developed, which are designed to maintain both organoleptic and nutritional quality. This product represents the final output of a comprehensive design and development process in clinical nutrition, undergoing various stages of testing and validation prior to its market launch.</data>
      <data key="d2">4196233cbb95a9ab194177cc11875e7a,62f527b38024e8807d3e63a0cf488046</data>
      <data key="d3">1443</data>
