    <node id="EVIDENCE BASED MEDICINE">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Evidence Based Medicine (EBM) is a medical practice model that emphasizes the integration of the best available research evidence with clinical expertise and patient values in making decisions about the care of individual patients. It represents a systematic approach to clinical problem-solving, ensuring that healthcare decisions are informed by current best evidence, thereby enhancing the quality of patient care.</data>
      <data key="d2">0ea889003f06c1b62aea79aae0901061,56fede71b721264441e35be77e3ed1d1</data>
      <data key="d3">1484</data>
