      <data key="d7">febb8646c2f74792a1952bac2f5399b3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="NUTRICI&#211;N BASADA EN LA EVIDENCIA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">"NUTRICI&#211;N BASADA EN LA EVIDENCIA" refers to an approach that integrates the principles of evidence-based medicine (EBM) into the fields of nutrition and dietary practices. This methodology, also known as Nutrition based on Evidence (NuBE), emphasizes the application of the best available scientific evidence to inform clinical nutrition practices and community nutrition recommendations. By prioritizing scientific research and data, this approach aims to enhance the effectiveness and reliability of dietary recommendations and practices, ensuring that they are grounded in solid evidence.</data>
      <data key="d2">56fede71b721264441e35be77e3ed1d1,7dbb13ddc40e2f4d060338cabf9ecea7,dd05b76341cb3efe3f7a515a4ed1a030</data>
      <data key="d3">275</data>
      <data key="d4">1</data>
      <data key="d5">5</data>
      <data key="d6">16176</data>
      <data key="d7">358d1f80518d4ae68fd769050ebf25ee</data>
    </node>
    <node id="HABILIDADES">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Las habilidades necesarias para una pr&#225;ctica cl&#237;nica &#243;ptima incluyen la b&#250;squeda eficiente de informaci&#243;n y el abordaje cr&#237;tico de la literatura m&#233;dica.</data>
      <data key="d2">7dbb13ddc40e2f4d060338cabf9ecea7</data>
      <data key="d3">1277</data>
