      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">GU&#205;AS DE PR&#193;CTICA CL&#205;NICA are structured recommendations designed to enhance patient care by utilizing the best available evidence. These guidelines serve as evidence-based recommendations that assist healthcare professionals in making informed decisions regarding patient treatment and management.</data>
      <data key="d2">07a16ed299a7f8bafcaa44a54495a9c3,4261c82c43dac1a06d46f91f46f6d510</data>
