    <node id="ALERGIA O INTOLERANCIA A LAS PROTE&#205;NAS DE LECHE DE VACA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Allergy or intolerance to cow's milk proteins in infants may require specialized enteral nutrition.</data>
