    </node>
    <node id="SUECIA">
      <data key="d0">GEO</data>
      <data key="d1">Suecia, which refers to Sweden, is identified as one of the eight countries that face limitations in data collection for epidemiological studies. Additionally, it is noted that Sweden has limited data on home nutrition, highlighting challenges in gathering comprehensive nutritional information within the country.</data>
      <data key="d2">eab1daf48c7ca09f43fc115a3379cc10,f84386a9907d954b9cf46475d0d45243</data>
      <data key="d3">1928</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">16289</data>
      <data key="d7">43b15f574f5e408cb23a0f990dec7c9b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="REGULACI&#211;N">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Regulaci&#243;n refers to the establishment of rules or laws governing the provision of NPD and NED, which varies by country.</data>
