    <node id="PROGRAMAS DE MEDICARE">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Programas de Medicare are federal health insurance programs in the United States for individuals aged 65 and older or disabled, covering aspects of NED.</data>
