      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The group of Artificial Nutrition Domiciliary and Ambulatory is involved in the study and registration of NED in Spain.</data>
      <data key="d2">eab1daf48c7ca09f43fc115a3379cc10</data>
