      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">De Cos Blanco AI is a researcher and author who has made significant contributions to the field of home enteral nutrition in Spain. They have played a pivotal role in developing guidelines specifically focused on home artificial nutrition for oncological patients, showcasing their expertise and commitment to improving nutritional care for individuals undergoing cancer treatment.</data>
