    <node id="QALY">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">QALY, which stands for Quality-Adjusted Life Year, is a measure utilized in cost-utility analysis to evaluate the effectiveness of medical treatments, including home artificial nutrition. It assesses the value of medical interventions by considering both the quality and quantity of life they provide.</data>
      <data key="d2">0d083c309fb6f4d0d16c0e2b23ea5c8b,123ef22fb42b6ade4fa2dda096df8490</data>
