    <node id="WANDEN-BERGHE C">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Wanden-Berghe C is a researcher actively engaged in various reports and studies concerning nutritional practices in Spain and Europe. Specifically, Wanden-Berghe C has focused on home parenteral nutrition and home enteral nutrition, contributing to multiple studies and registries in these areas. Additionally, Wanden-Berghe C has made significant contributions to research on artificial nutrition practices across Europe, highlighting their expertise and involvement in the field of nutritional science.</data>
