    <node id="ESTUDIO ECOL&#211;GICO">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">El estudio ecol&#243;gico es un tipo de estudio observacional que analiza datos a nivel de poblaci&#243;n para identificar patrones de salud y factores de riesgo.</data>
      <data key="d2">15bf355c0b0b669417d28ad0aad190c2</data>
      <data key="d3">347</data>
      <data key="d4">1</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">16395</data>
      <data key="d7">876cd1c8737e45169c56412df5f97610</data>
    </node>
    <node id="ESTUDIO TRANSVERSAL">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">"ESTUDIO TRANSVERSAL" refers to a type of study that is designed to describe the presence of a causal factor or disease within a population at a specific point in time. This method allows researchers to gather data and analyze the prevalence of certain conditions or characteristics without manipulating any variables, providing a snapshot of the situation being studied.</data>
      <data key="d2">15bf355c0b0b669417d28ad0aad190c2,aa23fba9db8a99e47f06acbb3a025bf4</data>
      <data key="d3">347</data>
      <data key="d4">1</data>
      <data key="d5">2</data>
      <data key="d6">16396</data>
      <data key="d7">e20b4cb26caf4b979726af7cd507246b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="ASPECTOS LEGALES">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Los aspectos legales se refieren a las normativas y regulaciones que afectan la investigaci&#243;n y la pr&#225;ctica en el &#225;mbito de la salud y la nutrici&#243;n.</data>
      <data key="d2">15bf355c0b0b669417d28ad0aad190c2</data>
      <data key="d3">1163</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">16397</data>
      <data key="d7">d8d05b198ea84dbabbbfcba487f4255a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="ESTUDIOS EPIDEMIOL&#211;GICOS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Los estudios epidemiol&#243;gicos son investigaciones que buscan entender la salud de poblaciones y evaluar intervenciones sanitarias.</data>
      <data key="d2">15bf355c0b0b669417d28ad0aad190c2</data>
      <data key="d5">2</data>
      <data key="d6">16398</data>
      <data key="d7">fb1b86e0e96346d69c01fbc8ffed9fb3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="VARIABLES">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Las variables son factores que se miden y analizan en los estudios para determinar su relaci&#243;n con la salud y la enfermedad.</data>
      <data key="d2">15bf355c0b0b669417d28ad0aad190c2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">16399</data>
      <data key="d7">5be6ea9986094e849a99e3b31fc36ed0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="HIP&#211;TESIS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">La hip&#243;tesis es una suposici&#243;n que se pone a prueba en un estudio para determinar su validez en relaci&#243;n con la salud.</data>
      <data key="d2">15bf355c0b0b669417d28ad0aad190c2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">16400</data>
      <data key="d7">4c8e3abb72934ec79341740aa44f3db1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="ENSAYO">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Ensayo es un estudio que se utiliza para probar la eficacia de intervenciones terap&#233;uticas o preventivas y evaluar la causalidad de enfermedades.</data>
      <data key="d2">cf8a6f1b6d59546ed7bd297d032f6b30</data>
      <data key="d3">1163</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">16401</data>
      <data key="d7">6a089f97dc434d97b046502eb7829f4d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="ESTUDIOS TRANSVERSALES">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Estudios transversales son investigaciones que permiten estimar la prevalencia de una enfermedad en una poblaci&#243;n espec&#237;fica en un momento determinado.</data>
      <data key="d2">cf8a6f1b6d59546ed7bd297d032f6b30</data>
      <data key="d3">1168</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">2</data>
      <data key="d6">16402</data>
      <data key="d7">69a4c61bb84f40969ed3995efcce49b5</data>
    </node>
    <node id="HISTORIA NATURAL DE LA ENFERMEDAD">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Historia natural de la enfermedad se refiere al curso de una enfermedad en ausencia de intervenci&#243;n m&#233;dica, &#250;til para entender su evoluci&#243;n.</data>
      <data key="d2">cf8a6f1b6d59546ed7bd297d032f6b30</data>
      <data key="d3">1167</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">16403</data>
      <data key="d7">3c86e0f5966f420e8a46a03be394f867</data>
    </node>
    <node id="INCIDENCIA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Incidencia refers to the occurrence of new cases of a disease within a specified time frame. It is a crucial epidemiological measure that indicates the number of new cases in a population during a defined period. Notably, incidencias are not directly measured in case-control studies, which focus on existing cases rather than new occurrences.</data>
      <data key="d2">6799d5deb7130f888605e5e2d58c9de5,cf8a6f1b6d59546ed7bd297d032f6b30</data>
      <data key="d3">1167</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">16404</data>
      <data key="d7">c7692fab083a4a9782551648ee20b5e0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="MORIANA ET AL">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Moriana et al is a group of researchers who conducted a study in 2013 on nutritional assessment methods in a tertiary hospital.</data>
      <data key="d2">aa23fba9db8a99e47f06acbb3a025bf4</data>
      <data key="d3">347</data>
      <data key="d4">1</data>
      <data key="d5">2</data>
      <data key="d6">16405</data>
      <data key="d7">0c45a7d221c546d3abf16ea24674f838</data>
    </node>
    <node id="LOPEZ-ABENTE ET AL">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">L&#243;pez-Abente et al is a group of researchers who conducted a study in 2012 relating colorectal cancer presence to pollution in cities.</data>
      <data key="d2">aa23fba9db8a99e47f06acbb3a025bf4</data>
      <data key="d5">2</data>
      <data key="d6">16406</data>
      <data key="d7">db11259bc43c4c4c83c807e83c30d233</data>
    </node>
    <node id="NUTRITIONAL ASSESSMENT STUDY">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">A study conducted by Moriana et al in 2013 to evaluate nutritional assessment methods and prevalence of malnutrition in a tertiary hospital.</data>
      <data key="d2">aa23fba9db8a99e47f06acbb3a025bf4</data>
      <data key="d3">347</data>
      <data key="d4">1</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">16407</data>
      <data key="d7">08fe878dea74496ea5faa2c16ab0f207</data>
    </node>
    <node id="CANCER AND POLLUTION STUDY">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">A study conducted by L&#243;pez-Abente et al in 2012 to investigate the relationship between colorectal cancer and pollution in cities.</data>
      <data key="d2">aa23fba9db8a99e47f06acbb3a025bf4</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">16408</data>
      <data key="d7">5bd09ac6e5f94f5ea4dadaf4cdb8c36f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="ESTUDIOS ECOLOGICOS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Estudios ecol&#243;gicos que analizan factores de riesgo poblacionales y correlaciones entre distintas poblaciones.</data>
      <data key="d2">aa23fba9db8a99e47f06acbb3a025bf4</data>
      <data key="d5">2</data>
      <data key="d6">16409</data>
      <data key="d7">b8d23f2b66a94d7ba54d6d0fae93a5ee</data>
    </node>
    <node id="ESTUDIOS DE CASOS Y CONTROLES">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Estudios que comparan dos grupos de individuos, uno con la enfermedad de inter&#233;s y otro sano, para determinar la frecuencia de exposici&#243;n a factores de riesgo.</data>
      <data key="d2">aa23fba9db8a99e47f06acbb3a025bf4</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">16410</data>
      <data key="d7">9eebcdeec2564cca86a49fe309215652</data>
    </node>
    <node id="CASOS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Casos refers to individuals with the disease of interest in the context of case-control studies.</data>
      <data key="d2">6799d5deb7130f888605e5e2d58c9de5</data>
      <data key="d3">1167</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">4</data>
      <data key="d6">16411</data>
      <data key="d7">1aaf9ef9d3034f079188788e714b2be0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="CONTROLES">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Controles refers to healthy individuals used as a comparison group in case-control studies.</data>
      <data key="d2">6799d5deb7130f888605e5e2d58c9de5</data>
      <data key="d3">1167</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">4</data>
      <data key="d6">16412</data>
      <data key="d7">519cca130f694a88966a5ffb65ec9a48</data>
    </node>
    <node id="SESGO">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Sesgo refers to biases that can affect the validity of case-control studies, particularly in the selection of participants and information gathering.</data>
      <data key="d2">6799d5deb7130f888605e5e2d58c9de5</data>
      <data key="d3">1167</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">2</data>
      <data key="d6">16413</data>
      <data key="d7">aa7bff6c959e4fd49ab84300f5257a6a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="MEMORIA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Memoria refers to the recollection of past exposures by participants, which can influence the accuracy of data in case-control studies.</data>
      <data key="d2">6799d5deb7130f888605e5e2d58c9de5</data>
      <data key="d3">1167</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">2</data>
      <data key="d6">16414</data>
      <data key="d7">1575b34b20e14305a12676e22fb10c59</data>
    </node>
    <node id="LUCAS ET AL">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Lucas et al is a group of researchers who conducted a study comparing pancreatic cancer patients and healthy subjects to assess dietary risk factors.</data>
      <data key="d2">a13a13b249ba729ec581f7a16ec5eae5</data>
      <data key="d3">1083</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">2</data>
      <data key="d6">16415</data>
      <data key="d7">f5b08e54b0f14cf995950000e66f9dfb</data>
    </node>
    <node id="THAO-SALUD INFANTIL">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">THAO-SALUD INFANTIL is a national program in Spain aimed at promoting healthy lifestyle habits and understanding their impact on obesity development in the study population.</data>
      <data key="d2">a13a13b249ba729ec581f7a16ec5eae5</data>
      <data key="d3">1083</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">3</data>
      <data key="d6">16416</data>
      <data key="d7">d2c894eb1f5f42ed9999bfd36c408065</data>
    </node>
    <node id="PROYECTO PREDIMED">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">El Proyecto PREDIMED es un ensayo cl&#237;nico importante realizado en Espa&#241;a que estudi&#243; el papel de la dieta mediterr&#225;nea en la enfermedad cardiovascular en sujetos inicialmente sanos.</data>
      <data key="d2">dabdb883b39fe459da7aab4a4e7242cb</data>
      <data key="d3">1369</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">16417</data>
      <data key="d7">bb61d7095f3e4f6d9083bdbb7f7810f4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="COMIT&#201;S &#201;TICOS DE INVESTIGACI&#211;N CL&#205;NICA">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Los Comit&#233;s &#201;ticos de Investigaci&#243;n Cl&#237;nica son entidades que revisan y aprueban los protocolos de investigaci&#243;n para asegurar que se cumplan los est&#225;ndares &#233;ticos y de seguridad en los ensayos cl&#237;nicos.</data>
      <data key="d2">dabdb883b39fe459da7aab4a4e7242cb</data>
      <data key="d3">347</data>
      <data key="d4">1</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">16418</data>
      <data key="d7">5db2f55e3d9f49289c094a09819c0e0a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="INVESTIGACI&#211;N B&#193;SICA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">La investigaci&#243;n b&#225;sica es un tipo de estudio que busca entender los mecanismos fundamentales de las enfermedades y la biolog&#237;a, proporcionando la base para el desarrollo de nuevas terapias.</data>
      <data key="d2">dabdb883b39fe459da7aab4a4e7242cb</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">16419</data>
      <data key="d7">1073d73e0043479aa8b1af36ed52ac95</data>
    </node>
    <node id="INVESTIGACI&#211;N EPIDEMIOL&#211;GICA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">La investigaci&#243;n epidemiol&#243;gica se centra en el estudio de la distribuci&#243;n y determinantes de la salud y enfermedades en poblaciones, ayudando a establecer relaciones causales.</data>
      <data key="d2">dabdb883b39fe459da7aab4a4e7242cb</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">16420</data>
      <data key="d7">7138ac0bdc2c4933ba819d26ccd71996</data>
    </node>
    <node id="NUTRIGEN&#211;MICA">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">La nutrigen&#243;mica es un campo de estudio que investiga c&#243;mo los nutrientes afectan la expresi&#243;n gen&#233;tica y c&#243;mo la gen&#233;tica influye en la respuesta a los nutrientes.</data>
      <data key="d2">dabdb883b39fe459da7aab4a4e7242cb</data>
      <data key="d5">0</data>
      <data key="d6">16421</data>
      <data key="d7">cdcd73e60c8d462db46f3bf2ade14b22</data>
    </node>
    <node id="REAL DECRETO 1090/2015">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Real Decreto 1090/2015 is the legislation that regulates clinical trials with medications in Spain, focusing on ethical and methodological standards for trials.</data>
      <data key="d2">0fd4d7a9544dd7c2999b9ce1708919bc</data>
      <data key="d3">860</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">6</data>
      <data key="d6">16422</data>
      <data key="d7">bb7e696390f64e968c6df70558021935</data>
    </node>
    <node id="AGENCIA ESPA&#209;OLA DE MEDICAMENTOS Y PRODUCTOS SANITARIOS">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The Agencia Espa&#241;ola de Medicamentos y Productos Sanitarios is the Spanish Agency responsible for the regulation and oversight of medications and clinical trials.</data>
      <data key="d2">0fd4d7a9544dd7c2999b9ce1708919bc</data>
      <data key="d3">859</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">2</data>
      <data key="d6">16423</data>
      <data key="d7">31899cfa91964ae48ea4b125687dc73a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="LEY ORG&#193;NICA 15/1999">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Ley Org&#225;nica 15/1999 is the Spanish law concerning the protection of personal data, ensuring the privacy of individuals involved in clinical trials.</data>
      <data key="d2">0fd4d7a9544dd7c2999b9ce1708919bc</data>
      <data key="d3">860</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">16424</data>
      <data key="d7">0ebe461b1c3a49618a94c255d68b5c47</data>
    </node>
    <node id="DECLARACI&#211;N DE HELSINKI">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The Declaration of Helsinki outlines ethical principles for medical research involving human subjects, which must be adhered to in clinical trials.</data>
      <data key="d2">0fd4d7a9544dd7c2999b9ce1708919bc</data>
      <data key="d3">861</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">16425</data>
      <data key="d7">b0c5343f00104fa996ed7f82018323fc</data>
    </node>
    <node id="ESTUDIOS POSTAUTORIZACI&#211;N">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Post-authorization studies are observational studies conducted with approved medications to monitor their effects in the general population.</data>
      <data key="d2">0fd4d7a9544dd7c2999b9ce1708919bc</data>
      <data key="d3">859</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">2</data>
      <data key="d6">16426</data>
      <data key="d7">1100aa729aef45cb9a8879dd5fdacdd1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="REAL DECRETO 577/2013">
      <data key="d0" />
      <data key="d1" />
      <data key="d2">0fd4d7a9544dd7c2999b9ce1708919bc</data>
      <data key="d3">1047</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">2</data>
      <data key="d6">16427</data>
      <data key="d7">7fde2ed105284c1ab1a3160abb6f8886</data>
    </node>
    <node id="COMIT&#201;S DE &#201;TICA DE LA INVESTIGACI&#211;N">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Comit&#233;s de &#201;tica de la Investigaci&#243;n are ethical committees that oversee clinical trials to ensure they meet ethical standards.</data>
      <data key="d2">0fd4d7a9544dd7c2999b9ce1708919bc</data>
      <data key="d3">860</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">16428</data>
      <data key="d7">ad51ae4b31bd4c8c9ad5bab3653d43f2</data>
    </node>
    <node id="REGISTRO ESPA&#209;OL DE ESTUDIOS CL&#205;NICOS">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Registro Espa&#241;ol de Estudios Cl&#237;nicos is the official registry for clinical studies conducted in Spain, ensuring transparency and compliance with regulations.</data>
      <data key="d2">0fd4d7a9544dd7c2999b9ce1708919bc</data>
      <data key="d3">860</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">16429</data>
      <data key="d7">89a711d815b5468cb1f63e8922298af4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="AGENCIA ESPA&#209;OLA DEL MEDICAMENTO">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The Agencia Espa&#241;ola del Medicamento is the Spanish agency tasked with the regulation and oversight of medications and clinical trials. As a regulatory body in Spain, it is responsible for the evaluation and supervision of both medicines and medical devices, ensuring their safety, efficacy, and quality for public health.</data>
      <data key="d2">0fd4d7a9544dd7c2999b9ce1708919bc,ce0de74f95e1a41a930b2df09da1f887</data>
      <data key="d3">1047</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">2</data>
      <data key="d6">16430</data>
      <data key="d7">da1991594a754103a5670c885f03d13a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="CIBER">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">CIBER, which stands for Centros de Investigaci&#243;n Biom&#233;dica en Red, is a consortium in Spain designed to enhance biomedical research and health sciences. It serves as a cooperative research structure that aims to promote and strengthen research and development in health by incorporating new thematic areas and research groups. Through its collaborative approach, CIBER seeks to advance the field of biomedical research and improve health outcomes.</data>
      <data key="d2">ce0de74f95e1a41a930b2df09da1f887,f91257e7ffb4b7202ece2853953bd62f</data>
      <data key="d3">1935</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">21</data>
      <data key="d6">16431</data>
      <data key="d7">0d61fbecd03a49f9b6f996c9459e95c1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="ISCIII">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The Instituto de Salud Carlos III (ISCIII) is a public research institution in Spain that promotes and finances biomedical research.</data>
      <data key="d2">ce0de74f95e1a41a930b2df09da1f887</data>
      <data key="d3">1935</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">2</data>
      <data key="d6">16432</data>
      <data key="d7">976a5da4e5b94d028d72ec65a0dfb33e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="CIBEROBN">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">CIBERobn focuses on obesity and nutrition research, aiming to understand mechanisms contributing to obesity and related health issues.</data>
      <data key="d2">ce0de74f95e1a41a930b2df09da1f887</data>
      <data key="d3">1935</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">2</data>
      <data key="d6">16433</data>
      <data key="d7">6c594f9be6774529a8f5a82e2247908f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="RETICS">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">RETICS, or Redes tem&#225;ticas de investigaci&#243;n cooperativa en salud, are organizational structures established in collaboration with the Instituto de Salud Carlos III (ISCIII). These thematic networks are designed to facilitate cooperative research projects in health across various autonomous communities in Spain. RETICS aim to enhance coordination among research groups within the Spanish National Health System, promoting collaborative efforts to advance health research and improve health outcomes.</data>
      <data key="d2">5173ac9bd92d5f238acade41f8c65ebf,ce0de74f95e1a41a930b2df09da1f887,f91257e7ffb4b7202ece2853953bd62f</data>
