    <node id="INSTITUTO DE SALUD CARLOS III">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The Instituto de Salud Carlos III is a public research institution located in Spain, dedicated to advancing health research and innovation. It plays a crucial role in coordinating various health research networks and platforms, fostering scientific collaboration among researchers. Additionally, the institution provides funding for a wide range of health-related projects, further supporting the development and implementation of health technologies. Through its efforts, the Instituto de Salud Carlos III aims to enhance public health and contribute to the scientific community's understanding of health issues.</data>
