    <node id="PROYECTOS DE INVESTIGACI&#211;N EN SALUD">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">"PROYECTOS DE INVESTIGACI&#211;N EN SALUD" refers to a series of research initiatives that concentrate on health-related issues. These projects are funded and supported by various programs, including the CIBER (Centro de Investigaci&#243;n Biom&#233;dica en Red), and often receive backing from both national and European funding sources. The primary aim of these research projects is to address and explore significant health challenges, contributing to advancements in medical knowledge and public health.</data>
