    <node id="INGESTAS DIARIAS RECOMENDADAS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Ingestas diarias recomendadas (RDA) refer to the daily intake levels of essential nutrients that are recommended for various age groups and population groups. These guidelines are designed to ensure that individuals receive adequate nutrition to maintain health and prevent deficiencies.</data>
      <data key="d2">74a9c62d0f932e27419151241f7db445,b46fefa9f55d92c74acad101fc4f812e</data>
      <data key="d3">583</data>
      <data key="d4">2</data>
      <data key="d5">6</data>
      <data key="d6">16533</data>
      <data key="d7">ee0b7f77e33840dcacf220d039f65c7f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="INGESTAS ADECUADAS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Ingestas adecuadas (AI) refer to the adequate intake levels of essential nutrients that are established for various population groups. These intake levels are particularly important in situations where the Recommended Dietary Allowance (RDA) cannot be determined. In essence, AIs serve as a guideline to ensure that individuals receive sufficient nutrients to maintain health and prevent deficiencies.</data>
      <data key="d2">74a9c62d0f932e27419151241f7db445,b46fefa9f55d92c74acad101fc4f812e</data>
      <data key="d3">583</data>
