      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">The entity "9-13 A&#209;OS" refers to the age group of preteens, specifically encompassing children aged 9 to 13 years old. This demographic is categorized for health and demographic statistics, which include specific dietary recommendations tailored to their developmental needs. Additionally, this age group is associated with various health metrics and developmental indicators that are crucial for understanding their growth and well-being.</data>
