      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">The term "14-18 a&#241;os" refers to the age group of teenagers, specifically encompassing individuals from 14 to 18 years old. This demographic is often categorized for health and demographic statistics, highlighting the unique developmental indicators and health metrics associated with this age range. Additionally, there are specific dietary recommendations tailored to meet the nutritional needs of teenagers within this group, ensuring their health and well-being during these formative years.</data>
      <data key="d2">4fe098dece0637a1082d6a439757620a,565aef05382a327b4bdefb2ab3d3b4be,6c65beaf6ed5575b0945052270630136</data>
