      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Girasol is a type of sunflower oil that is widely recognized for its health benefits and high vitamin E content. It is commonly used in dietary products and various nutritional formulations. Girasol serves as a popular cooking oil, valued for its nutritional properties and is often included in a range of food products due to its beneficial oil content.</data>
