      <data key="d1">Colza is a type of oil derived from the rapeseed plant, widely recognized for its nutritional properties and health benefits. It is commonly used in various food products and dietary items, particularly due to its richness in omega fatty acids. As an ingredient in nutritional products, colza oil is valued for its positive contributions to a healthy diet.</data>
