      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The Hospital Universitario Pr&#237;ncipe de Asturias collaborates with Vegenat HEALTHCARE to provide solutions for oropharyngeal dysphagia.</data>
      <data key="d10">4a84ad8115beacfc311b44b973743dde</data>
