    <edge source="HOSPITAL UNIVERSITARIO PR&#205;NCIPE DE ASTURIAS" target="DISFAGIA OROFAR&#205;NGEA">
      <data key="d8">24.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The Hospital Universitario Pr&#237;ncipe de Asturias is a leading institution in the field of oropharyngeal dysphagia, actively developing solutions and addressing this condition through multidisciplinary approaches. The hospital has implemented various initiatives aimed at tackling oropharyngeal dysphagia, as detailed in relevant literature. Their comprehensive efforts highlight the institution's commitment to improving the management and treatment of this swallowing disorder.</data>
      <data key="d10">4a84ad8115beacfc311b44b973743dde,734812860aa1e2e5c5ae35a39eb5a865,ea0b88195d04b227bedf7fa3cb3b6513</data>
