    </edge>
    <edge source="HOSPITAL UNIVERSITARIO PR&#205;NCIPE DE ASTURIAS" target="JULIA &#193;LVAREZ HERN&#193;NDEZ">
      <data key="d8">56.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Julia &#193;lvarez Hern&#225;ndez is a medical professional at the Hospital Universitario Pr&#237;ncipe de Asturias, where she serves as the Head of the Endocrinology and Nutrition Section. In her role, she has coordinated the development of recipes specifically designed for managing oropharyngeal dysphagia. Julia &#193;lvarez Hern&#225;ndez specializes in endocrinology and nutrition, contributing her expertise to enhance patient care at the hospital.</data>
      <data key="d10">6533cbcb76873caf6fd68eb95d313d24,734812860aa1e2e5c5ae35a39eb5a865,7c37a605ce9323c724b713aa64b7fae5,a519216aaee7bf8a1317f5d6b522c4b6,c56e48073639b88eaeeaf183cbcdeb20,dce680808e039e852dc0f2639835db32,ea0b88195d04b227bedf7fa3cb3b6513</data>
