    <edge source="HOSPITAL UNIVERSITARIO PR&#205;NCIPE DE ASTURIAS" target="UNIDAD FUNCIONAL DE DISFAGIA OROFAR&#205;NGEA">
      <data key="d8">48.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The Hospital Universitario Pr&#237;ncipe de Asturias has established the Unidad Funcional de Disfagia Orofar&#237;ngea (UFDOF) to enhance patient care specifically for individuals suffering from dysphagia. This specialized unit operates within the hospital, focusing on the management and treatment of dysphagia, which is a condition that affects swallowing. The UFDOF was created with the support of the Hospital Universitario Pr&#237;ncipe de Asturias and is dedicated to providing comprehensive care, including nutritional support, for patients with this condition. Through its establishment, the hospital aims to improve the quality of care and outcomes for dysphagia patients.</data>
      <data key="d10">06484c3fe8af6e4c44bbfc3ac2fa2590,1955c09ee453969c7603ae8206c088f8,669a55d41ff26c3ea749aaa095688593,929b14ae2554caeaab2a010ad94222eb,a3fd9c0d942a044ac2490f16d4ecc520,dfc3b0905ab9fc1fca9fc64473ebed80</data>
