    <edge source="SENPE" target="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL">
      <data key="d8">16.0</data>
      <data key="d9">SENPE, which focuses on enteral nutrition, provides comprehensive guidelines and discussions on enteral nutrition practices. This includes specific guidelines tailored for pediatric patients, ensuring that the nutritional needs of this demographic are adequately addressed.</data>
      <data key="d10">7ea112a550fd775a80c3eda15663fba5,820640c45c3a696fca3c8c45b680b19b</data>
