    </edge>
    <edge source="SENPE" target="SEMICYUC">
      <data key="d8">15.0</data>
      <data key="d9">SENPE and SEMICYUC are two entities that collaborate to provide comprehensive guidelines and recommendations for nutritional approaches in clinical settings, particularly focusing on critical care. Their joint efforts emphasize the importance of nutritional support for critically ill patients, ensuring that healthcare professionals have access to updated and effective nutritional guidelines. This collaboration highlights their shared commitment to improving patient care through proper nutritional strategies in critical environments.</data>
      <data key="d10">51ccbecf506101052f08de7cbbaa6b62,762a80a4c9f24d778b79fdd596f343e3,f1f6ad756644e84b6caa8e4e3adb94da</data>
