    <edge source="SENPE" target="PEDR&#211;N GINER C">
      <data key="d8">16.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Pedr&#243;n Giner C is a member of the SENPE's standardization group, where he contributes to the development of guidelines for pediatric enteral nutrition. His involvement in this group underscores his commitment to enhancing nutritional standards and practices for pediatric care within the framework established by SENPE.</data>
