    <edge source="SENPE" target="SEGHNP">
      <data key="d8">14.0</data>
      <data key="d9">SENPE and SEGHNP collaborate on establishing standards and guidelines for pediatric nutrition and enteral nutrition. Their joint efforts focus on ensuring that best practices are developed and implemented to support the nutritional needs of children.</data>
      <data key="d10">5a69e2f952998ea5b7109ad2d51a7849,b410dfc796e4ac9178ac19ac368e2036</data>
