      <data key="d9">SENPE and ESPEN are organizations dedicated to the field of nutrition, with SENPE specifically serving Spain and ESPEN focusing on Europe as a whole. Both organizations work collaboratively to promote clinical nutrition and facilitate the sharing of research findings across Europe, highlighting their commitment to advancing nutritional science and practice.</data>
