    <edge source="SEEN" target="GRUPO AULA M&#201;DICA">
      <data key="d8">21.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Grupo Aula M&#233;dica collaborates with the Spanish Society of Endocrinology and Nutrition (SEEN) to provide a range of educational resources focused on nutrition and clinical practices, particularly in the field of oncology. Their partnership includes the publication of various works, such as a document on pediatric nutrition and a clinical nutrition text, where SEEN has contributed to the authorship. Both entities are actively involved in the fields of nutrition and health, emphasizing their commitment to advancing knowledge and practices in clinical nutrition and metabolism through their collaborative efforts.</data>
      <data key="d10">4c4d1882f0ac14b7c55941ec1c17b650,57a5157c4312ac09073e72ad7789ad7c,6906ee13020e48a5d50fc97dc22928fa,ce62d279f86b3364fed4e121ad2d5e1f,da9a9fd67ac55e9180d1609d1df2a255,dce680808e039e852dc0f2639835db32</data>
