      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Grupo Aula M&#233;dica, S.L. published the book discussing oropharyngeal dysphagia and its solutions.</data>
      <data key="d10">734812860aa1e2e5c5ae35a39eb5a865</data>
      <data key="d11">76e63608feb540fd9dbd155590f24822</data>
