      <data key="d8">24.0</data>
      <data key="d9">M&#243;nica Benito Fern&#225;ndez is a dedicated professional actively involved in the field of oropharyngeal dysphagia. She serves as a co-author contributing to the treatment of this condition, demonstrating her commitment to advancing knowledge and practices related to dysphagia management. In addition to her research contributions, M&#243;nica provides direct care for patients suffering from oropharyngeal dysphagia, ensuring they receive the necessary support and treatment. Her multifaceted involvement highlights her significant role in both the clinical and research aspects of oropharyngeal dysphagia.</data>
      <data key="d10">1719a8d20788e3b25240980cad2b6c5d,7a685dfeed939ab716eb2f6e86a6cc04,e2aeed1cae3c67005a57b0695a907fbf</data>
