      <data key="d8">15.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Nuria Gil-Fournier Esquerra is a notable contributor to the guidelines addressing oropharyngeal dysphagia, a condition characterized by difficulty in swallowing due to issues in the oropharynx. In addition to her contributions to these guidelines, she is also a dedicated researcher focused on developing and improving dysphagia screening methods. Her work plays a significant role in enhancing the understanding and management of oropharyngeal dysphagia.</data>
      <data key="d10">7a685dfeed939ab716eb2f6e86a6cc04,dae3d2cddf63b2af4067a27d8b9d7ab5</data>
