      <data key="d8">16.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Virginia Rodr&#237;guez Campuzano is a professional dedicated to the care of patients suffering from oropharyngeal dysphagia. She is actively involved in developing and implementing solutions aimed at effectively managing this condition, which affects the ability to swallow. Through her work, she contributes to improving the quality of life for individuals dealing with the challenges posed by oropharyngeal dysphagia.</data>
      <data key="d10">1719a8d20788e3b25240980cad2b6c5d,7a685dfeed939ab716eb2f6e86a6cc04</data>
