    <edge source="DISFAGIA OROFAR&#205;NGEA" target="MANUAL DE DISFAGIA OROFAR&#205;NGEA">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The "Manual de Disfagia Orofaringea" is a comprehensive resource that offers guidelines and solutions for managing oropharyngeal dysphagia. It serves as a valuable tool for healthcare professionals, providing effective strategies to address the challenges associated with this condition.</data>
