    </edge>
    <edge source="DISFAGIA OROFAR&#205;NGEA" target="CALIDAD DE VIDA">
      <data key="d8">2.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Oropharyngeal dysphagia significantly affects the quality of life of individuals who are impacted by this condition. Patients suffering from dysphagia often experience a severe decline in their overall quality of life, highlighting the profound challenges and limitations posed by this swallowing disorder.</data>
      <data key="d10">754053396bd343e6bea58cadc2842462,a76f25b0b56092f8125f49ec456f78df</data>
      <data key="d11">7c22d41d8bec4409b7fbdd020133c984</data>
      <data key="d12">132</data>
