    <edge source="DISFAGIA OROFAR&#205;NGEA" target="MANUEL RODR&#205;GUEZ PARADINAS">
      <data key="d8">16.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Manuel Rodr&#237;guez Paradinas has made significant contributions to the understanding and treatment of oropharyngeal dysphagia. He is a co-author of a study focused on the rehabilitation of this condition and has also played a key role in developing guidelines that address oropharyngeal dysphagia. Through his work, Rodr&#237;guez Paradinas has enhanced the knowledge and resources available for managing this complex disorder.</data>
      <data key="d10">28503044e98192e03a043b0103f37a9b,a76f25b0b56092f8125f49ec456f78df,dae3d2cddf63b2af4067a27d8b9d7ab5</data>
