      <data key="d9">Teresa Rivera Rodr&#237;guez is a contributor to the guidelines addressing oropharyngeal dysphagia</data>
      <data key="d10">dae3d2cddf63b2af4067a27d8b9d7ab5</data>
      <data key="d11">dcaa13bec9d54ea8b3d814db3f3fc094</data>
      <data key="d12">138</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DISFAGIA OROFAR&#205;NGEA" target="VIDEOENDOSCOPIA DE LA DEGLUCI&#211;N">
      <data key="d8">17.0</data>
      <data key="d9">DISFAGIA OROFAR&#205;NGEA refers to a condition characterized by difficulty in swallowing, particularly affecting the oropharyngeal region. VIDEOENDOSCOPIA DE LA DEGLUCI&#211;N, or videoendoscopy of swallowing, is a crucial diagnostic method employed to assess this condition. The relationship between these two entities is significant, as videoendoscopy serves as a key tool for evaluating oropharyngeal dysphagia, allowing for a detailed examination of the swallowing process and identification of any abnormalities.</data>
      <data key="d10">a3444da30e339275da1056c3e13bcae5,dae3d2cddf63b2af4067a27d8b9d7ab5</data>
      <data key="d11">3deb67092e13450cb56a079649d56ef4</data>
      <data key="d12">139</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DISFAGIA OROFAR&#205;NGEA" target="VIDEOFLOUROSCOPIA">
      <data key="d8">17.0</data>
      <data key="d9">DISFAGIA OROFAR&#205;NGEA and VIDEOFLOUROSCOPIA are closely related in the context of diagnosis and assessment. Videofluoroscopia, or videofluoroscopy, is a critical diagnostic method employed to evaluate oropharyngeal dysphagia. This technique allows for a detailed examination of swallowing mechanics, establishing a direct relationship between the two entities. Through videofluoroscopy, healthcare professionals can effectively diagnose and understand the complexities of oropharyngeal dysphagia, facilitating appropriate treatment and management strategies.</data>
      <data key="d10">a3444da30e339275da1056c3e13bcae5,dae3d2cddf63b2af4067a27d8b9d7ab5</data>
      <data key="d11">d8d3a42ee1a54b8d9fb0f0094c0b0750</data>
      <data key="d12">140</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
