      <data key="d12">300</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DISFAGIA" target="GILCKSMAN">
      <data key="d8">3.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Gilcksman proporciona informaci&#243;n sobre la clasificaci&#243;n de hidrocoloides que puede ser relevante para el estudio de la disfagia</data>
      <data key="d10">306c653730f336c5553a6d1acf1f0932</data>
      <data key="d11">321c9d46f6094d629a174bb950509031</data>
      <data key="d12">301</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DISFAGIA" target="REOLOG&#205;A">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La reolog&#237;a es fundamental para entender los trastornos de la degluci&#243;n, como la disfagia, al estudiar las propiedades del bolo alimenticio</data>
      <data key="d10">306c653730f336c5553a6d1acf1f0932</data>
      <data key="d11">981aa21f7ad34d68939077520bf0c684</data>
      <data key="d12">302</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DISFAGIA" target="ESPESANTES">
      <data key="d8">18.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Dysphagia, a condition characterized by difficulty in swallowing, is often managed with the use of thickeners. Thickeners play a crucial role in this management by modifying the viscosity of liquids and foods, making them easier and safer for individuals with dysphagia to swallow. They are specifically designed to assist patients in swallowing liquids safely, thereby reducing the risk of aspiration and improving overall swallowing function. By altering the consistency of liquids, thickeners help ensure that individuals with dysphagia can consume fluids without experiencing discomfort or danger.</data>
      <data key="d10">4aeca0ee5f2663f449cfd017d3e3bbfb,c1fcea6b2c2290b4c90ae1a511ca05d4,f7b4cba3bbdeec64513c036fd4166835</data>
      <data key="d11">d647955f13dd4f1c92b1bb24d1d2adb9</data>
      <data key="d12">303</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DISFAGIA" target="&#913;-AMILASA SALIVAL">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">&#945;-Amilasa salival plays a significant role in the management of dysphagia by affecting the viscosity of thickened liquids</data>
      <data key="d10">4aeca0ee5f2663f449cfd017d3e3bbfb</data>
      <data key="d11">5593452f095a41b4b47559293b438892</data>
      <data key="d12">304</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DISFAGIA" target="AGUA GELIFICADA">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Gelified water is a recommended product for hydration in patients with dysphagia</data>
      <data key="d10">4aeca0ee5f2663f449cfd017d3e3bbfb</data>
      <data key="d11">445dfd740b9d495db67eaccfc2b3fe93</data>
      <data key="d12">305</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DISFAGIA" target="PRODUCTOS COMERCIALES RTU">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Ready-to-use commercial products are designed specifically to support nutritional needs in patients with dysphagia</data>
      <data key="d10">4aeca0ee5f2663f449cfd017d3e3bbfb</data>
      <data key="d11">7de5dc4fa39948f8ae4ab91cb484741c</data>
      <data key="d12">306</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DISFAGIA" target="FLUIDOS ESPESADOS">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Thickened fluids are specifically designed to aid individuals with dysphagia in swallowing</data>
      <data key="d10">4aeca0ee5f2663f449cfd017d3e3bbfb</data>
      <data key="d11">e0aba43490f34cf1878c9ee0c4739352</data>
      <data key="d12">307</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DISFAGIA" target="HIDRATACI&#211;N">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Hydration is a critical aspect of care for individuals with dysphagia to prevent dehydration</data>
      <data key="d10">4aeca0ee5f2663f449cfd017d3e3bbfb</data>
      <data key="d11">e9ce42f5163d47aba06b4592ea88aa85</data>
      <data key="d12">308</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DISFAGIA" target="NUTRICI&#211;N">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Dysphagia and nutrition are closely interconnected, as dysphagia can complicate nutritional intake, necessitating the implementation of tailored nutritional strategies. It is essential for individuals with dysphagia to focus on nutrition to ensure they receive adequate dietary intake, thereby addressing their specific needs and challenges related to swallowing difficulties.</data>
      <data key="d10">2b8c323c265f8f7f3d15bf988bf1f9ee,4aeca0ee5f2663f449cfd017d3e3bbfb</data>
      <data key="d11">9ad1bedaf66042d0a6a8623f18b8b1b6</data>
      <data key="d12">309</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
