    <edge source="DISFAGIA" target="CALIDAD DE VIDA">
      <data key="d8">17.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Dysphagia is a condition that negatively affects the quality of life of patients and individuals who are impacted by it. The challenges associated with dysphagia can lead to significant difficulties in daily living, ultimately diminishing the overall well-being of those affected.</data>
