    <edge source="DISFAGIA" target="UMCE">
      <data key="d8">11.0</data>
      <data key="d9">UMCE is actively involved in both the assessment and treatment of dysphagia in at-risk patients. This organization focuses on providing comprehensive care for individuals suffering from this condition, ensuring that they receive the necessary evaluations and therapeutic interventions to manage their dysphagia effectively.</data>
