    </edge>
    <edge source="DISFAGIA" target="PROTOCOLO DE DIAGN&#211;STICO Y SEGUIMIENTO NUTRICIONAL DE LA DISFAGIA">
      <data key="d8">10.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The "PROTOCOLO DE DIAGN&#211;STICO Y SEGUIMIENTO NUTRICIONAL DE LA DISFAGIA" is a specialized protocol designed to address the condition of dysphagia. It provides comprehensive guidelines and recommendations specifically aimed at managing dysphagia effectively.</data>
      <data key="d10">2d50b3b46d83d6e824edc64e142cbf8a,806140d9fadd08a1e72238d53c829eb2</data>
      <data key="d11">c456a32b50024ecbbf8d3929f160409c</data>
      <data key="d12">360</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DISFAGIA" target="ESPESANTE">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Dysphagia is a condition that affects an individual's ability to swallow, and it can pose significant challenges during eating and drinking. To aid those with dysphagia, a thickening agent known as "espesante" is utilized. Espesante modifies the textures of food and liquids, making them easier and safer to consume for individuals experiencing swallowing difficulties. This thickening agent plays a crucial role in enhancing the safety and comfort of patients with dysphagia by ensuring that liquids are appropriately thickened to prevent choking and aspiration.</data>
      <data key="d10">2d50b3b46d83d6e824edc64e142cbf8a,806140d9fadd08a1e72238d53c829eb2</data>
      <data key="d11">f37fe33276554fdcbd10bc2cc83808f6</data>
      <data key="d12">361</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
