    <edge source="DISFAGIA" target="NUTR HOSP">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Nutr Hosp publishes research and articles related to dysphagia management</data>
      <data key="d10">d96ab48565912e67fdb51ccdf5a100ac</data>
      <data key="d11">9ec8b01c05c14dbf86222631c80a1b76</data>
      <data key="d12">366</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DISFAGIA" target="GU&#205;A DE NUTRICI&#211;N PARA PERSONAS CON DISFAGIA">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The guide provides essential nutritional recommendations for individuals with dysphagia</data>
      <data key="d10">d96ab48565912e67fdb51ccdf5a100ac</data>
      <data key="d11">e3d4dbc3cde04a6cab029d5eae983a5d</data>
      <data key="d12">367</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DISFAGIA" target="NUTRITIONAL SUPPORT">
      <data key="d8">15.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Dysphagia necessitates nutritional support strategies to ensure adequate intake. This condition often requires tailored approaches to nutrition to help individuals maintain sufficient dietary consumption despite the challenges posed by swallowing difficulties.</data>
      <data key="d10">b3760fcb9c0421b66d37c20b1dc68577,f7b4cba3bbdeec64513c036fd4166835</data>
      <data key="d11">4fc7e93c3d2846d8809635dc9271a2ca</data>
      <data key="d12">368</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DISFAGIA" target="ENFERMEDADES NEUROL&#211;GICAS">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Neurological diseases can lead to dysphagia, complicating nutritional intake</data>
      <data key="d10">f7b4cba3bbdeec64513c036fd4166835</data>
      <data key="d11">0c536937999f461e951727945b2af164</data>
      <data key="d12">369</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DISFAGIA" target="PACIENTE">
      <data key="d8">34.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The patient presents with dysphagia, a condition that significantly impacts their ability to eat and drink properly. This condition necessitates specialized nutritional interventions to ensure that the patient can maintain adequate nutrition. Patients with dysphagia often require modified diets tailored to facilitate safe swallowing, as the difficulty in swallowing complicates their nutritional intake.</data>
      <data key="d10">1130db2843c569042990b711cf15d8ee,99900c6d95f85a5b4b88fcfed6775cec,9c43759c41fe226a2702de300b9e580a,f7b4cba3bbdeec64513c036fd4166835</data>
      <data key="d11">be953db63cb44688a39025f1dac6b7e7</data>
      <data key="d12">370</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DISFAGIA" target="MALNUTRICI&#211;N RELACIONADA CON LA ENFERMEDAD">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Dysphagia is a contributing factor to disease-related malnutrition</data>
      <data key="d10">45c3281fd6beffb0e9ac61ae5700af3d</data>
      <data key="d11">3a347d1170554b4db584fbf0daff664b</data>
      <data key="d12">371</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DISFAGIA" target="VAR&#211;N DE 66 A&#209;OS">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The 66-year-old male patient experienced disfagia, which was a significant factor in his medical evaluation</data>
      <data key="d10">0b901814a09392d24880be465dcbce6f</data>
      <data key="d11">ff1f99288ec945739740edd403d8f509</data>
      <data key="d12">372</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DISFAGIA" target="HOSPITAL">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Hospitals implement dietary modifications for patients with dysphagia to ensure safety</data>
      <data key="d10">1130db2843c569042990b711cf15d8ee</data>
      <data key="d11">49255091827e4dc9b718992f31f75de0</data>
      <data key="d12">373</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DISFAGIA" target="BRONCOASPIRACI&#211;N">
      <data key="d8">15.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Dysphagia and bronchoaspiration are closely related medical conditions. Dysphagia, which refers to difficulty swallowing, significantly increases the risk of bronchoaspiration. This occurs when food or liquid inadvertently enters the lungs instead of the stomach, often leading to serious health complications. Patients suffering from dysphagia are particularly vulnerable to bronchoaspiration, highlighting the critical need for careful management and intervention to prevent such occurrences.</data>
      <data key="d10">9449ed00392e250aa871c689af51a540,b44e720874efa74c538dd573ee936378</data>
      <data key="d11">5558c4544f294ee7bfd0c7709e814582</data>
      <data key="d12">374</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DISFAGIA" target="ENFERMEDAD NEUROL&#211;GICA">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Neurological diseases can lead to dysphagia as a symptom, affecting the patient's ability to swallow</data>
      <data key="d10">b44e720874efa74c538dd573ee936378</data>
      <data key="d11">9eb740eaf7404210a2d2ca92f9c1a594</data>
      <data key="d12">375</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DISFAGIA" target="DESNUTRICI&#211;N">
      <data key="d8">17.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Dysphagia, a condition characterized by difficulties in swallowing, can lead to desnutrici&#243;n (malnutrition) as individuals struggle to consume adequate food. The challenges associated with dysphagia often result in insufficient nutritional intake, which can significantly impact overall health and well-being.</data>
      <data key="d10">38c7f97d650c77986c2dc9132aa20fdb,b44e720874efa74c538dd573ee936378</data>
      <data key="d11">1c3479985fe44654b335c1783eaa60a4</data>
      <data key="d12">376</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DISFAGIA" target="TEST DEL AGUA DE DEPIPPO">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The DePippo water test is used to assess the risk of dysphagia in patients</data>
      <data key="d10">b44e720874efa74c538dd573ee936378</data>
      <data key="d11">72bba7e81ae4460a83bba13bd0d126c9</data>
      <data key="d12">377</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DISFAGIA" target="VIDEOFLOROSCOPIA">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Videofluoroscopy is a key diagnostic tool for evaluating dysphagia</data>
      <data key="d10">b44e720874efa74c538dd573ee936378</data>
      <data key="d11">1b02ffaef5ac4501bbaa50b1e9c4f9ed</data>
      <data key="d12">378</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DISFAGIA" target="FIBROSCOPIA">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Fibroscopy provides direct visualization of swallowing, helping to assess dysphagia</data>
      <data key="d10">b44e720874efa74c538dd573ee936378</data>
      <data key="d11">1140e53067ee477699e64bf11cff9553</data>
      <data key="d12">379</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DISFAGIA" target="EQUIPOS M&#201;DICOS Y DE ENFERMER&#205;A">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Medical and nursing teams play a crucial role in diagnosing and managing dysphagia in patients</data>
      <data key="d10">b44e720874efa74c538dd573ee936378</data>
      <data key="d11">75d73b9f5bde4eefa6bf3dd78107e12d</data>
      <data key="d12">380</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DISFAGIA" target="EVALUACI&#211;N DE SENSIBILIDAD FAR&#205;NGEA">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Pharyngeal sensitivity evaluation is essential for diagnosing dysphagia</data>
      <data key="d10">b44e720874efa74c538dd573ee936378</data>
      <data key="d11">b468390a337444b48e27e47cab194a51</data>
      <data key="d12">381</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DISFAGIA" target="S&#205;NTOMAS Y SIGNOS DE ATRAGANTAMIENTO">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Symptoms and signs of choking are directly related to the presence of dysphagia</data>
      <data key="d10">b44e720874efa74c538dd573ee936378</data>
      <data key="d11">7892e203e3ba4dc780f93ea0c653857a</data>
      <data key="d12">382</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DISFAGIA" target="TEST GUSS">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The GUSS test is utilized to screen for dysphagia in clinical settings</data>
      <data key="d10">b44e720874efa74c538dd573ee936378</data>
      <data key="d11">29945d53cd6644c8b4b53e885fd5eb86</data>
      <data key="d12">383</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DISFAGIA" target="SSA">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The SSA is a bedside assessment tool used to evaluate swallowing and detect dysphagia</data>
      <data key="d10">b44e720874efa74c538dd573ee936378</data>
      <data key="d11">09c1b3efc0eb4cc5847c1446d363fe25</data>
      <data key="d12">384</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DISFAGIA" target="ALIMENTOS DE TEXTURA MODIFICADA">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La disfagia requiere el uso de alimentos de textura modificada para facilitar la alimentaci&#243;n</data>
      <data key="d10">bd3be91ff178508497a810f873861eca</data>
      <data key="d11">b2f715f9d61e402dbb121288bbdeab81</data>
      <data key="d12">385</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DISFAGIA" target="DIETOTERAPIA">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La dietoterapia busca disminuir la disfagia mediante modificaciones en la consistencia de los alimentos</data>
      <data key="d10">1adf391b13598f3ffe28ae596ff49438</data>
      <data key="d11">c032b6b827b043f0a39d06f1196083c3</data>
      <data key="d12">386</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DISFAGIA" target="NUTRICI&#211;N EN ONCOLOG&#205;A">
      <data key="d8">14.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Disfagia, a condition that significantly impacts dietary management, is particularly relevant in the context of oncology patients. It is addressed in nutritional guidelines specifically designed for this group, highlighting its importance in ensuring proper nutrition. Furthermore, disfagia is recognized as a critical condition that requires specialized nutritional management for oncology patients, underscoring the need for tailored dietary approaches to support their health and treatment outcomes.</data>
      <data key="d10">38c7f97d650c77986c2dc9132aa20fdb,7c43869fff0960219e47d176597b35b8</data>
      <data key="d11">502690da9aac41d2b2b27fe09c1f525f</data>
      <data key="d12">387</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DISFAGIA" target="TUMORES DE CABEZA Y CUELLO">
      <data key="d8">15.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Dysphagia, a condition characterized by difficulty in swallowing, is frequently associated with head and neck tumors. These tumors can significantly impair a patient's ability to eat and drink, leading to nutritional challenges and a decline in overall health. Additionally, surgical interventions aimed at treating head and neck tumors often exacerbate dysphagia, further complicating the patient's swallowing capabilities. Thus, individuals diagnosed with head and neck tumors commonly face the dual challenge of managing their tumors while also addressing the swallowing difficulties that arise from both the tumors themselves and the treatments employed.</data>
      <data key="d10">38c7f97d650c77986c2dc9132aa20fdb,99900c6d95f85a5b4b88fcfed6775cec</data>
      <data key="d11">1718e5f61ea046a48047c47f769d17a4</data>
      <data key="d12">388</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DISFAGIA" target="DESCENSO DE LA HABILIDAD DE DEGLUTIR">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Dysphagia directly causes a descenso de la habilidad de deglutir, complicating eating</data>
      <data key="d10">38c7f97d650c77986c2dc9132aa20fdb</data>
      <data key="d11">935db8e9bc3c41539ef8bf62a21df83f</data>
      <data key="d12">389</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DISFAGIA" target="DIETISTA">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The dietitian provides nutritional assessments and dietary modifications for patients suffering from dysphagia</data>
      <data key="d10">99900c6d95f85a5b4b88fcfed6775cec</data>
      <data key="d11">e46fd04c21de4b508e3f7e63fe326565</data>
      <data key="d12">390</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DISFAGIA" target="LOGOPEDA">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The logopedist evaluates and treats the functional problems associated with dysphagia</data>
      <data key="d10">99900c6d95f85a5b4b88fcfed6775cec</data>
      <data key="d11">0790fa645bfc427887d1623f6f6b279d</data>
      <data key="d12">391</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DISFAGIA" target="ENFERMERA">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The nurse manages the care of patients with dysphagia, including monitoring their nutritional status</data>
      <data key="d10">99900c6d95f85a5b4b88fcfed6775cec</data>
      <data key="d11">6dda11415c9c41bcbbf4ec01cb63588a</data>
      <data key="d12">392</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DISFAGIA" target="C&#193;NCER DE ES&#211;FAGO">
      <data key="d8">15.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La disfagia es un s&#237;ntoma caracter&#237;stico y com&#250;n del c&#225;ncer de es&#243;fago, que afecta significativamente la capacidad de los pacientes para alimentarse adecuadamente. Este s&#237;ntoma no solo dificulta la ingesta de alimentos, sino que tambi&#233;n contribuye a la p&#233;rdida de peso en quienes padecen esta enfermedad.</data>
      <data key="d10">5664277128c865feb0e93f9fd56a3d05,f0d279ccc92a98dc953edafb1080630b</data>
      <data key="d11">d8cc55e3582e42cc82132c16c7a6e637</data>
      <data key="d12">393</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DISFAGIA" target="P&#201;RDIDA DE PESO">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La disfagia contribuye a la p&#233;rdida de peso en pacientes con c&#225;ncer de es&#243;fago al dificultar la ingesta de alimentos.</data>
      <data key="d10">5664277128c865feb0e93f9fd56a3d05</data>
      <data key="d11">d17190fd514b49c49205c6d70739a21c</data>
      <data key="d12">394</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DISFAGIA" target="C&#193;NCER ESOF&#193;GICO">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La disfagia es un s&#237;ntoma com&#250;n en pacientes con c&#225;ncer esof&#225;gico, afectando su calidad de vida.</data>
      <data key="d10">397cb82cce268866351c44a5b38ccb8b</data>
      <data key="d11">cb930874b85e4153b1e8ae64102037a0</data>
      <data key="d12">395</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DISFAGIA" target="QUIMIORADIOTERAPIA">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La quimiorradioterapia puede agravar la disfagia en pacientes, dificultando su alimentaci&#243;n.</data>
      <data key="d10">397cb82cce268866351c44a5b38ccb8b</data>
      <data key="d11">fb10720b106a49c2a29abe5de8d66337</data>
      <data key="d12">396</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DISFAGIA" target="TRATAMIENTO NUTRICIONAL">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">El tratamiento nutricional busca aliviar la disfagia en pacientes con c&#225;ncer esof&#225;gico mediante ajustes diet&#233;ticos.</data>
      <data key="d10">397cb82cce268866351c44a5b38ccb8b</data>
      <data key="d11">4dd00b2bccbe43638b3bda3234bf7465</data>
      <data key="d12">397</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DISFAGIA" target="PROSURE">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Prosure is a nutritional product designed to assist individuals with swallowing difficulties (disfagia)</data>
      <data key="d10">7d929a0137a287c5c96416fa5fc36239</data>
      <data key="d11">4aad28fb04eb4bf5a419b686ad3f4eb9</data>
      <data key="d12">398</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DISFAGIA" target="RESOURCE SUPPORT PLUS">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Resource Support Plus is formulated to support individuals with swallowing difficulties (disfagia)</data>
      <data key="d10">7d929a0137a287c5c96416fa5fc36239</data>
      <data key="d11">5aab2f368bde4ed3b646178260fdd0dd</data>
      <data key="d12">399</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DISFAGIA" target="FORTICARE">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Forticare is intended for individuals with swallowing difficulties (disfagia)</data>
      <data key="d10">7d929a0137a287c5c96416fa5fc36239</data>
      <data key="d11">aee71e5eae604b99ba54277c4b7157c6</data>
      <data key="d12">400</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DISFAGIA" target="SUPPORTAN DRINK">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Supportan Drink is designed for those experiencing swallowing difficulties (disfagia)</data>
      <data key="d10">7d929a0137a287c5c96416fa5fc36239</data>
      <data key="d11">f1645b193c0b497e8348ca75a2d31b3f</data>
      <data key="d12">401</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DISFAGIA" target="FRESUBIN THICKENED">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Fresubin Thickened is specifically formulated for individuals with swallowing difficulties (disfagia)</data>
      <data key="d10">7d929a0137a287c5c96416fa5fc36239</data>
      <data key="d11">a415a9b49a0c451f9e20d16fd1f76260</data>
      <data key="d12">402</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="UNIDAD FUNCIONAL DE DISFAGIA OROFAR&#205;NGEA" target="F&#201;LIX BRAVO SANZ">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">F&#233;lix Bravo Sanz oversees the Unidad Funcional de Disfagia Orofar&#237;ngea as part of his role at the hospital</data>
      <data key="d10">ea0b88195d04b227bedf7fa3cb3b6513</data>
      <data key="d11">176e48231129433ea6962a7e688783ab</data>
      <data key="d12">403</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="UNIDAD FUNCIONAL DE DISFAGIA OROFAR&#205;NGEA" target="PREDYCES">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The PREDyCES study provides evidence that informs the work of the Functional Unit of Oropharyngeal Dysphagia in addressing patient care</data>
      <data key="d10">02c3924fac2660b8531f61207f3b04bb</data>
      <data key="d11">8da76364f1374f2f98e71d2f129ff5ac</data>
      <data key="d12">404</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="UNIDAD FUNCIONAL DE DISFAGIA OROFAR&#205;NGEA" target="DOF">
      <data key="d8">17.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The UNIDAD FUNCIONAL DE DISFAGIA OROFAR&#205;NGEA (UFDOF) is a specialized unit that concentrates on the diagnosis and treatment of patients experiencing Dysphagia Orofar&#237;ngea, commonly referred to as DOF. This functional unit is committed to providing comprehensive care for individuals suffering from this condition, ensuring that they receive the necessary medical attention and support for their dysphagia-related challenges.</data>
      <data key="d10">02c3924fac2660b8531f61207f3b04bb,06484c3fe8af6e4c44bbfc3ac2fa2590</data>
      <data key="d11">2a6e63ab0457443e95040008e98f7723</data>
      <data key="d12">405</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="UNIDAD FUNCIONAL DE DISFAGIA OROFAR&#205;NGEA" target="MULTIDISCIPLINARY APPROACH">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The Functional Unit of Oropharyngeal Dysphagia employs a multidisciplinary approach to address the needs of patients</data>
      <data key="d10">02c3924fac2660b8531f61207f3b04bb</data>
      <data key="d11">048ef328917648a199500526a87d7523</data>
      <data key="d12">406</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="UNIDAD FUNCIONAL DE DISFAGIA OROFAR&#205;NGEA" target="PREVENTIVE MEASURES">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The Functional Unit of Oropharyngeal Dysphagia advocates for preventive measures to enhance patient care and outcomes</data>
      <data key="d10">02c3924fac2660b8531f61207f3b04bb</data>
      <data key="d11">f3912c1b13a84dbb8c467344e5105f5e</data>
      <data key="d12">407</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="UNIDAD FUNCIONAL DE DISFAGIA OROFAR&#205;NGEA" target="INTERNATIONAL DYSPHAGIA DIET STANDARDISATION INITIATIVE">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The functional unit utilizes the standards set by the initiative to improve patient care</data>
      <data key="d10">929b14ae2554caeaab2a010ad94222eb</data>
