    <edge source="UNIDAD FUNCIONAL DE DISFAGIA OROFAR&#205;NGEA" target="ENFERMER&#205;A">
      <data key="d8">12.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The Unidad Funcional de Disfagia Orofar&#237;ngea is a specialized unit focused on the care of patients with dysphagia, a condition that affects swallowing. Within this unit, Enfermer&#237;a, or nursing, plays a crucial supportive role in patient care. The nursing team is integral to the operations of the Unidad Funcional de Disfagia Orofar&#237;ngea, ensuring that patients receive comprehensive and attentive care tailored to their specific needs related to dysphagia.</data>
