    <edge source="UNIDAD FUNCIONAL DE DISFAGIA OROFAR&#205;NGEA" target="PACIENTES">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The Unidad Funcional de Disfagia Orofar&#237;ngea is dedicated to providing specialized care for patients with oropharyngeal dysphagia, a condition that affects their ability to swallow. This unit focuses on the treatment of swallowing disorders, ensuring that patients receive comprehensive care tailored to their needs. The primary goal of the Unidad Funcional de Disfagia Orofar&#237;ngea is to enhance patient satisfaction while effectively addressing the challenges associated with dysphagia.</data>
