    <edge source="PACIENTES" target="INFECCIONES">
      <data key="d8">11.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The entity "PACIENTES" refers to patients who may be at risk of infections, particularly those suffering from cerebrovascular disease. These patients can experience alterations in their nutritional requirements due to the presence of infections. Additionally, the entity "INFECCIONES" is relevant in the context of studies that evaluate the incidence of infections among patients, specifically in relation to nutritional support. Overall, the relationship between patients with cerebrovascular disease and infections highlights the importance of monitoring and addressing nutritional needs in this vulnerable population.</data>
