    <edge source="PACIENTES" target="TRAUMATISMOS">
      <data key="d8">13.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The entity "PACIENTES" refers to individuals who may experience "TRAUMATISMOS," which are injuries that necessitate medical attention. These patients may require the use of immunomodulatory formulas to aid in their recovery. Additionally, certain types of traumatismos can result in the need for surgical interventions, such as faringostom&#237;a, to address the complications arising from these injuries.</data>
