    <edge source="PACIENTES" target="NUTRICI&#211;N ARTIFICIAL DOMICILIARIA">
      <data key="d8">16.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The entity "PACIENTES" refers to individuals who are the primary beneficiaries of "NUTRICI&#211;N ARTIFICIAL DOMICILIARIA" (home artificial nutrition). This form of nutrition is designed to meet the nutritional needs of patients who are unable to fulfill these needs through conventional means. Thus, patients receive home artificial nutrition to ensure their dietary requirements are adequately satisfied.</data>
      <data key="d10">123ef22fb42b6ade4fa2dda096df8490,ed9b8701ef76cf4813eccfc58d6be998</data>
      <data key="d11">63e195440f3d4ef8969cc3e2da885ed4</data>
      <data key="d12">661</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N" target="DEGLUCI&#211;N">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Nutrition is dependent on the successful process of degluci&#243;n (swallowing)</data>
      <data key="d10">afc1e23538d13759662d0a4ea2d45191</data>
      <data key="d11">f00444f8c63d4d3b9057c4f629965064</data>
      <data key="d12">662</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N" target="PACIENTE">
      <data key="d8">45.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The entity "PACIENTE" is currently receiving nutritional attention due to a state of malnutrition. This patient is undergoing nutritional assessments and interventions specifically designed to improve their health, particularly in the context of severe malnutrition. Nutritional support is deemed essential for this patient, especially given their risk of malnutrition, which is critical for recovery from any underlying health issues, including eating disorders. Adequate nutrition through specialized diets is necessary to restore the patient's body weight and enhance overall health. Thus, the focus on "NUTRICI&#211;N" is vital for the patient's recovery and well-being.</data>
      <data key="d10">1130db2843c569042990b711cf15d8ee,2ebe12524f7750215eee73b328b601ee,3bd6f34f55dc7500746b997ebeecf327,514518b96e32b025815b45cc2a504f0d,b7a2c1e4dd77f47605fdb33f4a2c2bdf,ebfa3e3e6e6101b4d607871e17276705</data>
