    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N" target="NUTRICI&#211;N HOSPITALARIA">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">NUTRICI&#211;N and NUTRICI&#211;N HOSPITALARIA are closely related entities that emphasize the importance of nutritional practices within hospital settings. The publication "Nutrici&#243;n Hospitalaria" serves as a key resource, focusing on various aspects of nutrition in hospitals. It specifically addresses the nutritional needs of patients, including those with dysphagia, highlighting the critical role that tailored nutritional interventions play in patient care and recovery.</data>
