    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N" target="PLAN DE TRATAMIENTO">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Nutrition is a key component of the treatment plan for patients with oropharyngeal dysphagia, ensuring they meet their dietary needs.</data>
      <data key="d10">e14475004a93d47a14d98dd4c5b5d02b</data>
