    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N" target="INSUFICIENCIA RENAL">
      <data key="d8">15.0</data>
      <data key="d9">NUTRICI&#211;N and INSUFICIENCIA RENAL are closely interconnected, as nutrition is crucial for the management of renal insufficiency. A proper dietary intake can significantly minimize complications associated with this condition. Therefore, effective nutritional strategies are essential for patients suffering from renal insufficiency, highlighting the importance of tailored dietary plans to support their health and well-being.</data>
