    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N" target="CONSUMO ALIMENTARIO">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Nutrition is directly related to food consumption and the health outcomes associated with it</data>
      <data key="d10">b003f8a156374bb4430475f4ffe8e074</data>
      <data key="d11">c150a376bb274dd3b7fd22f243f0d24b</data>
      <data key="d12">740</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N" target="ALIMENTOS">
      <data key="d8">16.0</data>
      <data key="d9">NUTRICI&#211;N and ALIMENTOS are closely interconnected, as alimentos are evaluated within the field of nutrici&#243;n to determine their health impacts. They serve as the primary focus of nutritional education and management for patients, highlighting their importance in dietary planning and health maintenance. Additionally, alimentos are the subject of various nutritional studies and claims that investigate their health benefits, further emphasizing their role in promoting overall well-being.</data>
      <data key="d10">3dbf07634cee8d4d443f59ed50f98b54,caf1d075a295b93dcd3c6f5cf72b028d,cb892163c42e6e5ec9dede2d66693978</data>
      <data key="d11">0cfaa00ddf264134a15338f1db2a0847</data>
      <data key="d12">741</data>
