    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N" target="M&#201;TODO DE ELMORE">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The Elmore method is utilized in nutritional assessments to evaluate risk based on specific clinical criteria</data>
      <data key="d10">2ebe12524f7750215eee73b328b601ee</data>
      <data key="d11">17cea8d51f7e40c48d0fc92e73ff88f1</data>
      <data key="d12">743</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N" target="M&#201;TODO CONUT">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The CONUT method is employed in nutritional assessments to provide early alerts for malnutrition risks</data>
