    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N" target="ANTROPOMETR&#205;A">
      <data key="d8">15.0</data>
      <data key="d9">NUTRICI&#211;N and ANTROPOMETR&#205;A are closely interconnected fields, with antropometr&#237;a serving as a vital tool within nutrici&#243;n for evaluating dietary needs. Specifically, antropometr&#237;a is employed to assess nutritional status and monitor the growth of children, highlighting its importance in understanding and addressing the dietary requirements of this population.</data>
