    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N" target="INSUFICIENCIA RENAL AGUDA">
      <data key="d8">15.0</data>
      <data key="d9">NUTRICI&#211;N plays a vital role in the management of INSUFICIENCIA RENAL AGUDA (acute renal failure). Adequate nutrition is essential for maintaining the health of patients during their recovery from this condition. Nutritional assistance is crucial as it directly impacts dietary needs and metabolic balance, helping to support the overall well-being of individuals affected by acute renal failure.</data>
      <data key="d10">2c60ced31055ac58d76da9c1e90c8e9d,31b61ae47905168ef430433c9eb5237a</data>
      <data key="d11">849a38745924427cba02ca5c110081a2</data>
      <data key="d12">755</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N" target="INSUFICIENCIA RENAL CR&#211;NICA">
      <data key="d8">17.0</data>
      <data key="d9">NUTRICI&#211;N and INSUFICIENCIA RENAL CR&#211;NICA are closely interconnected, as nutrition plays a crucial role in the management of chronic renal failure. Effective nutritional management is essential for ensuring adequate dietary intake, which helps improve the quality of life for patients and reduces morbidity associated with the condition. Additionally, nutritional support is vital in preventing protein-energy wasting, a common complication in individuals with chronic kidney disease. Overall, a well-structured nutritional approach is fundamental in managing the challenges posed by INSUFICIENCIA RENAL CR&#211;NICA.</data>
      <data key="d10">2c60ced31055ac58d76da9c1e90c8e9d,31b61ae47905168ef430433c9eb5237a,7ba4a7e7b4c409f6d4c6979a7de6c832</data>
      <data key="d11">0737e11b411f4860a2db23a406495aa2</data>
      <data key="d12">756</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N" target="DIETISTAS">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Los dietistas son expertos en nutrici&#243;n y juegan un papel importante en la evaluaci&#243;n y seguimiento de la dieta de los pacientes</data>
      <data key="d10">a87e8e113488b153c5b4b2d2fca712c0</data>
      <data key="d11">aacd0b6588a84677ab8ec85731b56bdb</data>
      <data key="d12">757</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
