      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N" target="PANCREATITIS CR&#211;NICA">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Nutritional support is essential for managing pancreatitis cr&#243;nica and ensuring adequate nutrient intake</data>
      <data key="d10">67106be274787fd7f400ce3023c33a3d</data>
      <data key="d11">9b5a789fb9ee4b9a94032421dee3ab38</data>
      <data key="d12">784</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N" target="ENFERMEDAD INFLAMATORIA INTESTINAL">
      <data key="d8">17.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La nutrici&#243;n juega un papel crucial en el manejo de la enfermedad inflamatoria intestinal (EII), ya que esta condici&#243;n impacta negativamente en la salud nutricional de los pacientes. Es esencial prestar atenci&#243;n a la nutrici&#243;n para prevenir d&#233;ficits nutricionales que pueden surgir como consecuencia de la EII. Por lo tanto, una adecuada gesti&#243;n nutricional no solo es importante para el bienestar general de los pacientes, sino que tambi&#233;n es fundamental para el control y tratamiento de la enfermedad inflamatoria intestinal.</data>
      <data key="d10">45ae0837b0632b026fac1053b7d9d4e8,c9790e5e47712b100fb4870d35a3edfa</data>
      <data key="d11">57f97e6405484d0e9878c5f6080499f0</data>
      <data key="d12">785</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N" target="ENFERMEDADES INFLAMATORIAS INTESTINALES">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Las enfermedades inflamatorias intestinales requieren un manejo nutricional adecuado para evitar desnutrici&#243;n y d&#233;ficits de micronutrientes.</data>
      <data key="d10">df0e6695be23c07606ca5b9accc62df2</data>
      <data key="d11">6cea4d0b8ae2460dbf4f02441bc1d03c</data>
      <data key="d12">786</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N" target="AYUNO PREOPERATORIO">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The role of nutrition is crucial in the context of preoperative fasting practices to ensure patient safety</data>
      <data key="d10">2b8c323c265f8f7f3d15bf988bf1f9ee</data>
      <data key="d11">562f841fc37743e0b16415003c5264cb</data>
      <data key="d12">787</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N" target="CALOR&#205;AS">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">CALOR&#205;AS are a key component in determining the nutritional needs of patients</data>
      <data key="d10">c07baf818737d704c290ca0f5eefd30f</data>
      <data key="d11">c4b1fe2aa1be4d48a8127b80416d66f4</data>
      <data key="d12">788</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N" target="NE">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Nutritional support is provided through enteral nutrition (NE) in critical care settings</data>
      <data key="d10">2cc103269ed63bac1a1b5cb76eab1916</data>
      <data key="d11">43e967e531a547e6b6f4eb3212818f4d</data>
      <data key="d12">789</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N" target="NP">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Nutritional support may also involve parenteral nutrition (NP) when enteral nutrition is not feasible</data>
      <data key="d10">2cc103269ed63bac1a1b5cb76eab1916</data>
      <data key="d11">d0ac3f689ff3458286eff6a795fdd394</data>
      <data key="d12">790</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N" target="FIBROSIS QU&#205;STICA">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Proper nutrition is essential for managing Fibrosis Qu&#237;stica due to the risk of malnutrition</data>
      <data key="d10">f3d21fef234a5c6fed6ef3fb2c8da1f4</data>
      <data key="d11">e97b08127e4c444e84458110dbe61341</data>
      <data key="d12">791</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N" target="VITAMINAS LIPOSOLUBLES">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Supplementation with fat-soluble vitamins is part of nutritional management in Fibrosis Qu&#237;stica</data>
      <data key="d10">f3d21fef234a5c6fed6ef3fb2c8da1f4</data>
      <data key="d11">6cf1ebd8ccbe48cfbcf54879e483112a</data>
      <data key="d12">792</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N" target="ENFERMEDAD DE PARKINSON">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La nutrici&#243;n es fundamental en el manejo de la enfermedad de Parkinson para mejorar la calidad de vida de los pacientes</data>
      <data key="d10">0482404f71667592ce2b0f771153ece8</data>
      <data key="d11">6f21815b130741fcb35df3125b091957</data>
      <data key="d12">793</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N" target="L-DOPA">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La absorci&#243;n de L-DOPA se ve afectada por la dieta, lo que resalta la importancia de la nutrici&#243;n en su efectividad</data>
      <data key="d10">0482404f71667592ce2b0f771153ece8</data>
      <data key="d11">7e8d9979516849498111c07ff103860f</data>
      <data key="d12">794</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N" target="ECV">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Un manejo nutricional adecuado se asocia con una mejor evoluci&#243;n en pacientes con ECV</data>
      <data key="d10">0482404f71667592ce2b0f771153ece8</data>
      <data key="d11">e2b6097f2b8b4e87b6716a4d3e41eb99</data>
      <data key="d12">795</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N" target="ENFERMEDAD DE MOTONEURONA">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La nutrici&#243;n es esencial para el manejo de la enfermedad de motoneurona, similar a su papel en la enfermedad de Parkinson</data>
      <data key="d10">0482404f71667592ce2b0f771153ece8</data>
      <data key="d11">70ad37d0987147b2808a8f9a5ad8d5fc</data>
      <data key="d12">796</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N" target="CALIDAD DE VIDA">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Un buen tratamiento nutricional puede contribuir a mejorar la calidad de vida de los pacientes con enfermedades neurol&#243;gicas</data>
      <data key="d10">0482404f71667592ce2b0f771153ece8</data>
      <data key="d11">044657a6dc9c4cd6a8e98f9eea5210b3</data>
      <data key="d12">797</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N" target="C&#193;NCER DE ES&#211;FAGO">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La nutrici&#243;n es un aspecto clave en el manejo de pacientes con c&#225;ncer de es&#243;fago, ayudando a mejorar la calidad de vida</data>
      <data key="d10">7c0d1f274b31d130e4feb8e46fbeb764</data>
      <data key="d11">12ac9b1d0d85492da0911108d5170a2f</data>
      <data key="d12">798</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N" target="C&#193;NCER DE P&#193;NCREAS">
      <data key="d8">13.0</data>
      <data key="d9">NUTRICI&#211;N plays a crucial role in the treatment of patients diagnosed with C&#193;NCER DE P&#193;NCREAS, particularly during the course of chemotherapy. Proper nutritional support is essential for these patients to help manage symptoms and improve overall health. Additionally, the field of nutrici&#243;n is closely linked to the investigation of dietary factors that may influence the risk of developing C&#193;NCER DE P&#193;NCREAS, highlighting the importance of nutrition not only in treatment but also in prevention strategies.</data>
      <data key="d10">7c0d1f274b31d130e4feb8e46fbeb764,a13a13b249ba729ec581f7a16ec5eae5</data>
      <data key="d11">5aa01da0034e4a56abcbf86c5f285953</data>
      <data key="d12">799</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N" target="GASTROSTOM&#205;A">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La gastrostom&#237;a se utiliza para proporcionar nutrici&#243;n enteral a pacientes que no pueden alimentarse por v&#237;a oral</data>
      <data key="d10">7c0d1f274b31d130e4feb8e46fbeb764</data>
      <data key="d11">54d69f8ab01e4cbe995290504b01a543</data>
      <data key="d12">800</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N" target="C&#193;NCER">
      <data key="d8">16.0</data>
      <data key="d9">NUTRICI&#211;N and C&#193;NCER are closely interconnected, as cancer significantly impacts nutrition, making it a critical factor in the treatment and management of cancer patients. The nutritional intervention is essential to mitigate the effects of cancer on the patient's health, highlighting the importance of addressing dietary needs and nutritional support in cancer care.</data>
      <data key="d10">a96b8f4fe52b5b963b28242c3352aa7c,ce62d279f86b3364fed4e121ad2d5e1f</data>
      <data key="d11">efb6a588aecd4badb2102c02b19acb9f</data>
      <data key="d12">801</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N" target="PACIENTE NEOPL&#193;SICO">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La nutrici&#243;n es fundamental para el paciente neopl&#225;sico, ya que influye en su recuperaci&#243;n y calidad de vida.</data>
      <data key="d10">9c3716c3860855ce045a1e5d9d30b9d1</data>
      <data key="d11">99c2eeede2864734b2fef0031ba0feaa</data>
      <data key="d12">802</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N" target="PACIENTES ONCOL&#211;GICOS">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Los pacientes oncol&#243;gicos necesitan intervenciones nutricionales para mejorar su ingesta energ&#233;tica y calidad de vida</data>
      <data key="d10">a96b8f4fe52b5b963b28242c3352aa7c</data>
      <data key="d11">de4d2d8abc7a4c429bbc02a55c9a5107</data>
      <data key="d12">803</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N" target="QUIMIOTERAPIA">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Quimioterapia can lead to nutritional deficiencies, making proper nutrition essential for patient recovery</data>
      <data key="d10">16887bf1589e9515213d2e392bbc8c69</data>
      <data key="d11">f5a3a200e30a4062b70616dc1b46cb4b</data>
      <data key="d12">804</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N" target="SUPLEMENTOS VITAM&#205;NICOS">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Suplementos vitam&#237;nicos are often used to enhance nutrition in patients, especially those with cancer</data>
      <data key="d10">16887bf1589e9515213d2e392bbc8c69</data>
      <data key="d11">685594b0fa284cfbb58d5c40ff6c3c40</data>
      <data key="d12">805</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N" target="PACIENTE ONCOL&#211;GICO">
      <data key="d8">17.0</data>
      <data key="d9">NUTRICI&#211;N plays a crucial role in the care of PACIENTE ONCOL&#211;GICO, as nutritional support is essential for maintaining their nutritional status throughout treatment. Proper nutrition is fundamental not only for the treatment process but also for the recovery of cancer patients, contributing to an overall improvement in their general health.</data>
      <data key="d10">40dcfaa6144c6424068ba46fdf288dd2,d667e6abc204bbfa6aba210705db6d56</data>
      <data key="d11">3554af3a357c4960a723f19613465628</data>
      <data key="d12">806</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N" target="RADIOTERAPIA">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">El soporte nutricional puede disminuir los efectos adversos de la radioterapia sobre el estado nutricional del paciente</data>
      <data key="d10">40dcfaa6144c6424068ba46fdf288dd2</data>
      <data key="d11">a70e5dd15ab041e5ad773a03de5d629c</data>
      <data key="d12">807</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N" target="C&#201;LULAS HEMATOPI&#201;TICAS">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La nutrici&#243;n adecuada es esencial para el manejo de pacientes sometidos a trasplante de c&#233;lulas hematopoy&#233;ticas, ya que sus requerimientos nutricionales est&#225;n aumentados.</data>
      <data key="d10">86a4647fb1fa580f7b72aa4833965ecb</data>
      <data key="d11">f9ab584f717c49348e5a2bc38b84ce76</data>
      <data key="d12">808</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N" target="ALERGIAS ALIMENTARIAS">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Nutrition is crucial for individuals with food allergies to ensure they receive adequate nutrients while avoiding allergens.</data>
      <data key="d10">a562e90891c11da0293bc7de511acc8f</data>
      <data key="d11">36a0729171f3492e9763b243e9721350</data>
      <data key="d12">809</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N" target="PROTE&#205;NAS DE LA LECHE DE VACA">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Nutrition is impacted by cow's milk protein allergies, necessitating careful dietary management.</data>
      <data key="d10">a562e90891c11da0293bc7de511acc8f</data>
      <data key="d11">dde936c1d6824b888c4ddeded8c04715</data>
      <data key="d12">810</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N" target="INTERACCIONES">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Interacciones between drugs and diet are crucial for understanding nutritional impacts on health</data>
      <data key="d10">fa5c0208b983c59b247a65e6bb166f2a</data>
      <data key="d11">0b361537632d40b89d4abf5fe05ff20f</data>
      <data key="d12">811</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N" target="ENFERMEDAD">
      <data key="d8">13.0</data>
      <data key="d9">NUTRICI&#211;N and ENFERMEDAD are interconnected fields of study, with research in nutrition focusing on identifying causal associations between dietary factors and various diseases. The nutritional status of individuals plays a significant role in influencing the severity and management of these diseases, highlighting the importance of understanding how dietary choices can impact health outcomes.</data>
      <data key="d10">6799d5deb7130f888605e5e2d58c9de5,fa5c0208b983c59b247a65e6bb166f2a</data>
      <data key="d11">dcf2df9ca3464d588158add73cbe1495</data>
      <data key="d12">812</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N" target="DIETA SANA">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Nutrition is fundamentally linked to a healthy diet, as it involves the intake of necessary nutrients</data>
      <data key="d10">cca60bfbb1e73ceda513fbcaf0866a8f</data>
      <data key="d11">da7d3902176a446eaea654c39de11232</data>
      <data key="d12">813</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N" target="DEPORTISTA">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La nutrici&#243;n adecuada es fundamental para un deportista, ya que influye en su rendimiento y salud general.</data>
      <data key="d10">ab9a942f3aa9ca3eb88bcd26fcd60ddb</data>
      <data key="d11">42a0dc717c7443cb8f5d4fd2e1ce1195</data>
      <data key="d12">814</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N" target="EJERCICIO F&#205;SICO">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Nutrici&#243;n is directly related to ejercicio f&#237;sico as it addresses the dietary needs of individuals engaging in physical exercise</data>
      <data key="d10">54a47e2936e787ab5943e2d75afc03f1</data>
      <data key="d11">304443dfd3db48b0ade2e219bf7581fe</data>
      <data key="d12">815</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N" target="DEPORTISTAS">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Deportistas are the target group for the nutritional guidelines and recommendations provided in the document</data>
      <data key="d10">54a47e2936e787ab5943e2d75afc03f1</data>
      <data key="d11">02b6b85307f248c69fa441bdfb98a827</data>
      <data key="d12">816</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N" target="FISIOLOG&#205;A">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Nutritional guidelines are based on physiological principles relevant to exercise and athletic performance</data>
      <data key="d10">54a47e2936e787ab5943e2d75afc03f1</data>
      <data key="d11">cae198403216404abe1720f779ab4f23</data>
      <data key="d12">817</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N" target="ENFERMEDAD RENAL CR&#211;NICA">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La nutrici&#243;n es un aspecto crucial en el manejo de la enfermedad renal cr&#243;nica, afectando la salud del paciente</data>
      <data key="d10">169eceabd2bd24183f24faccb2c00088</data>
      <data key="d11">94940eee55824cf19b0248cf6f8f6fea</data>
      <data key="d12">818</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N" target="HOSPITALIZADOS">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Hospitalized patients often require specialized nutritional support to improve their clinical outcomes</data>
      <data key="d10">428ea9c156fe3f0571b20d5d81648868</data>
      <data key="d11">7d6ab91836604254ad5ecc1686cec615</data>
      <data key="d12">819</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N" target="REQUERIMIENTOS NUTRICIONALES">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La nutrici&#243;n se adapta a los requerimientos nutricionales espec&#237;ficos de cada paciente.</data>
      <data key="d10">8178ba40e7ef08e569845c1f3f1621cc</data>
      <data key="d11">8a03df76b0064886a415a5a96770c268</data>
      <data key="d12">820</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N" target="ADMINISTRACI&#211;N">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La nutrici&#243;n se puede administrar de diferentes maneras, dependiendo de las necesidades del paciente y el tipo de f&#243;rmula utilizada.</data>
      <data key="d10">8178ba40e7ef08e569845c1f3f1621cc</data>
      <data key="d11">717f89ab6390416cb93c647400253bd5</data>
      <data key="d12">821</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N" target="PACIENTES CR&#205;TICOS">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Critical patients are the subjects of studies evaluating different nutritional support methods</data>
      <data key="d10">9e4c5851293c18ef6b304ff6293b0be5</data>
      <data key="d11">4302a17f8b6348e2a753be7847550452</data>
      <data key="d12">822</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N" target="HIPONATREMIA">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Nutrition management is crucial in treating hyponatremia</data>
      <data key="d10">fa0165b0420f4c761829a08a3ab08508</data>
      <data key="d11">71f3e5fa31e44a9ea51ba8d2c7b9c2ee</data>
      <data key="d12">823</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N" target="HEMATOL&#211;GIA">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Hematology studies are essential for understanding the impact of nutrition on blood health, particularly in malnutrition cases</data>
      <data key="d10">a6ed8551aad722adcaf8fced4ac8685b</data>
      <data key="d11">34367c69141945e3aa9d365fc3c02f0e</data>
      <data key="d12">824</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N" target="ALBUMINA S&#201;RICA">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Serum albumin levels are used to evaluate nutritional status and liver function in patients</data>
      <data key="d10">a6ed8551aad722adcaf8fced4ac8685b</data>
      <data key="d11">a17366f2e25e429d96145469db2562ca</data>
