    <edge source="DESHIDRATACI&#211;N" target="HIDRATACI&#211;N">
      <data key="d8">18.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The entities "DESHIDRATACI&#211;N" and "HIDRATACI&#211;N" are closely related concepts in the context of physical health and activity. Effective hydration strategies are essential to prevent dehydration during physical activities, as adequate hydration plays a crucial role in maintaining bodily functions. Proper hydration not only helps to prevent dehydration but also mitigates its negative effects on the body. Therefore, understanding and implementing effective hydration practices is vital for overall health and performance during physical exertion.</data>
      <data key="d10">364aa13581a973c2e55c25191bad27cc,cfe1de28f01fa6428be1486b6af8f0a2</data>
      <data key="d11">afb1d5db2e3745809474d40f03c28177</data>
      <data key="d12">917</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DESHIDRATACI&#211;N" target="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La nutrici&#243;n enteral mal manejada puede resultar en deshidrataci&#243;n si no se ajusta adecuadamente la hidrataci&#243;n</data>
      <data key="d10">e7a9d9aa3031b4c032d724047f80ebe9</data>
      <data key="d11">8003fd75bd614607ad5a2f8af0e60b43</data>
      <data key="d12">918</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DESNUTRICI&#211;N" target="S&#205;NDROME DE REALIMENTACI&#211;N">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Severe malnutrition is a primary factor that can lead to the development of refeeding syndrome</data>
      <data key="d10">6bd3e5b773cab27e91a4a150de700918</data>
      <data key="d11">568ebf20cc11459586bccb90b9a3953d</data>
      <data key="d12">919</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DESNUTRICI&#211;N" target="ALIMENTACI&#211;N HOSPITALARIA">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La calidad de la alimentaci&#243;n hospitalaria puede influir en la condici&#243;n de desnutrici&#243;n de los pacientes</data>
      <data key="d10">4de75db0e24f0f89d890287e2a3f3dcc</data>
      <data key="d11">25f4f42f6838455280e6f1fb8a298f45</data>
      <data key="d12">920</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DESNUTRICI&#211;N" target="DOF">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Dysphagia (DOF) can lead to malnutrition, as patients may struggle to consume adequate nutrients</data>
      <data key="d10">5dd39815651d2d44f18c16e69696c0cf</data>
      <data key="d11">ad8c6544e73d4434865cdf63e74b3647</data>
      <data key="d12">921</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DESNUTRICI&#211;N" target="LA FE HOSPITAL UNIVERSITARI I POLIT&#200;CNIC">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Desnutrici&#243;n is a critical concern addressed by La Fe Hospital Universitari i Polit&#232;cnic in their nutritional care practices</data>
      <data key="d10">c67141db7734dcc583e60c351c2e0772</data>
      <data key="d11">55fc69b8fe4a4ca89175cdd82ce02068</data>
      <data key="d12">922</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DESNUTRICI&#211;N" target="HOSPITAL UNIVERSITARIO Y POLIT&#201;CNICO LA FE">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The hospital addresses various forms of malnutrition, including Desnutrici&#243;n</data>
      <data key="d10">4734ce2075bc72c352950c018bab7185</data>
      <data key="d11">641d0c438c04422488249e6a0d761b79</data>
      <data key="d12">923</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DESNUTRICI&#211;N" target="DESNUTRICI&#211;N LEVE">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Desnutrici&#243;n leve is a specific classification under the broader category of Desnutrici&#243;n</data>
      <data key="d10">4734ce2075bc72c352950c018bab7185</data>
      <data key="d11">2529b7bcec434d7f85b5bc11322cd017</data>
      <data key="d12">924</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DESNUTRICI&#211;N" target="DESNUTRICI&#211;N MODERADA">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Desnutrici&#243;n moderada is a specific classification under the broader category of Desnutrici&#243;n</data>
      <data key="d10">4734ce2075bc72c352950c018bab7185</data>
      <data key="d11">0a4242041c084576ae22e853f5e1cdee</data>
      <data key="d12">925</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DESNUTRICI&#211;N" target="DESNUTRICI&#211;N GRAVE">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Desnutrici&#243;n grave is a specific classification under the broader category of Desnutrici&#243;n</data>
      <data key="d10">4734ce2075bc72c352950c018bab7185</data>
      <data key="d11">6102a4147b104ce68f0e8b54711a123f</data>
      <data key="d12">926</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DESNUTRICI&#211;N" target="SURGICAL PATIENT">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Desnutrici&#243;n is a condition that affects many surgical patients and can complicate recovery</data>
      <data key="d10">d23c564df025cf16e37f2ef2be83ec34</data>
      <data key="d11">9e27f8a8c3f146f3988e032a923524cf</data>
      <data key="d12">927</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DESNUTRICI&#211;N" target="HEPATOPAT&#205;AS">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Hepatopathies can lead to malnutrition due to various metabolic and dietary factors</data>
      <data key="d10">82adde9844cf0b1ccd052f91b304fb6e</data>
      <data key="d11">07305a3d62a8477da99eaef5066b86e2</data>
      <data key="d12">928</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DESNUTRICI&#211;N" target="INSUFICIENCIA HEP&#193;TICA">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Liver failure often results in malnutrition due to metabolic changes and dietary restrictions</data>
      <data key="d10">82adde9844cf0b1ccd052f91b304fb6e</data>
      <data key="d11">a0f371a545964ed698f93aff010896ac</data>
      <data key="d12">929</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DESNUTRICI&#211;N" target="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL">
      <data key="d8">27.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Malnutrition is a significant condition that often necessitates the use of parenteral nutrition, particularly in patients who are unable to meet their nutritional requirements through oral or enteral means. This is especially relevant for individuals suffering from liver diseases, where parenteral nutrition serves as a critical intervention to address malnutrition. Patients experiencing malnutrition typically have increased caloric needs, and parenteral nutrition is employed to fulfill these needs effectively. Thus, both "DESNUTRICI&#211;N" and "NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" are closely linked, with parenteral nutrition being a vital solution for managing malnutrition in various patient populations.</data>
      <data key="d10">2d14f6773b107ec9a872245c32ae0a94,82adde9844cf0b1ccd052f91b304fb6e,cd63370bdd798f0b060b047dc29056ae</data>
      <data key="d11">a4c18c6a3947411dadbac488b5dbfac3</data>
      <data key="d12">930</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DESNUTRICI&#211;N" target="TRASPLANTE HEP&#193;TICO">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Malnutrition is a frequent condition in liver disease patients and can negatively influence the prognosis of liver transplantation</data>
      <data key="d10">b86f20e3d8bb0128635881d88ba6bdfa</data>
      <data key="d11">f1063349b98849999912c316896c7932</data>
      <data key="d12">931</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DESNUTRICI&#211;N" target="C&#193;NCER">
      <data key="d8">16.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Desnutrici&#243;n is a common consequence of c&#225;ncer, significantly impacting both the efficacy of treatment and the overall quality of life for patients. This condition is particularly prevalent among individuals with advanced stages of c&#225;ncer, highlighting the critical need for nutritional support in this population to improve health outcomes.</data>
      <data key="d10">5549895a3a7f54651e6c54f5a5d7d833,9ce201472321f20b339146bb6b452f60</data>
      <data key="d11">5c97f1d27ee24598bfac95ef0246da77</data>
      <data key="d12">932</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DESNUTRICI&#211;N" target="PACIENTE">
      <data key="d8">16.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The entity "DESNUTRICI&#211;N" is closely related to "PACIENTE," particularly in the context of patients suffering from cancer. Patients with cancer frequently experience desnutrici&#243;n, which is a form of malnutrition that can arise as a consequence of the disease itself and the various treatments they undergo. This condition necessitates nutritional interventions to address the malnutrition and support the patients' overall health and recovery.</data>
      <data key="d10">9ce201472321f20b339146bb6b452f60,beaa66c30582232126ce2c762a9c6bdb</data>
      <data key="d11">bb568e1c5d324cffaa39ba2418be9e52</data>
      <data key="d12">933</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DESNUTRICI&#211;N" target="TRASPLANTE ALOG&#201;NICO">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La desnutrici&#243;n puede complicar el proceso de trasplante alog&#233;nico, afectando la recuperaci&#243;n del paciente.</data>
      <data key="d10">b2b9da64e886eb0b5a8b332d2ba9c7fb</data>
      <data key="d11">a62d0a0dcd70473ead3a29fa085c19ba</data>
      <data key="d12">934</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DESNUTRICI&#211;N" target="TRASPLANTE DE C&#201;LULAS HEMATOPOY&#201;TICAS">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La desnutrici&#243;n es un riesgo elevado en pacientes que se someten a un trasplante de c&#233;lulas hematopoy&#233;ticas, afectando su recuperaci&#243;n</data>
      <data key="d10">af40d7a664dbfc9c14307a26f52b9bff</data>
      <data key="d11">4b924aafc2b048e58e8b132b2580cc2f</data>
      <data key="d12">935</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DESNUTRICI&#211;N" target="CICLOFOSFAMIDA">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">El uso de ciclofosfamida puede contribuir a la desnutrici&#243;n en pacientes debido a su efecto en la malabsorci&#243;n</data>
      <data key="d10">af40d7a664dbfc9c14307a26f52b9bff</data>
      <data key="d11">6230b39e3dec458b853f21f9439bcdc3</data>
      <data key="d12">936</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DESNUTRICI&#211;N" target="CICLOSPORINA">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La ciclosporina puede causar hipomagnesemia, lo que puede llevar a un estado de desnutrici&#243;n en pacientes en tratamiento</data>
      <data key="d10">af40d7a664dbfc9c14307a26f52b9bff</data>
      <data key="d11">b5a483805bc54a4c808fc6d4e98f70bb</data>
      <data key="d12">937</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DESNUTRICI&#211;N" target="EICH">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La EICH puede agravar la desnutrici&#243;n en pacientes trasplantados, lo que requiere un soporte nutricional espec&#237;fico</data>
      <data key="d10">af40d7a664dbfc9c14307a26f52b9bff</data>
      <data key="d11">ca28dd0a4d454b10bb8cfee95eefdbe5</data>
      <data key="d12">938</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DESNUTRICI&#211;N" target="EVOH">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La EVOH puede influir en el estado nutricional de los pacientes trasplantados, aumentando el riesgo de desnutrici&#243;n</data>
      <data key="d10">af40d7a664dbfc9c14307a26f52b9bff</data>
      <data key="d11">681de9cd304245f88e797fdb4076a64e</data>
      <data key="d12">939</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DESNUTRICI&#211;N" target="MALABSORCI&#211;N">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La malabsorci&#243;n contribuye al desarrollo de la desnutrici&#243;n en pacientes, especialmente aquellos en tratamiento oncol&#243;gico</data>
      <data key="d10">af40d7a664dbfc9c14307a26f52b9bff</data>
      <data key="d11">a00ce51f555c4f14a599f0d9ab937e97</data>
      <data key="d12">940</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DESNUTRICI&#211;N" target="HIPOMAGNESEMIA">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La hipomagnesemia puede ser un factor que agrava la desnutrici&#243;n en pacientes en tratamiento con ciertos medicamentos</data>
      <data key="d10">af40d7a664dbfc9c14307a26f52b9bff</data>
      <data key="d11">326e34b6aee94ed289eaab590f31c324</data>
      <data key="d12">941</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DESNUTRICI&#211;N" target="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La desnutrici&#243;n puede ser una raz&#243;n para iniciar la nutrici&#243;n enteral en pacientes pedi&#225;tricos.</data>
      <data key="d10">029b25f481d41458f45f1711f98c970f</data>
      <data key="d11">9210d26b60154a78bb9033a035e5666d</data>
      <data key="d12">942</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DESNUTRICI&#211;N" target="DIABETES MELLITUS">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Diabetes mellitus is associated with an increased risk of malnutrition in elderly individuals</data>
      <data key="d10">54633fef79a422c0fada846ff2b861ba</data>
      <data key="d11">c644678768904327b1f16b87bc446bc1</data>
      <data key="d12">943</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DESNUTRICI&#211;N" target="COSTES POR PROCESO">
      <data key="d8">5.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Malnutrition during hospitalization is associated with increased costs per medical process</data>
      <data key="d10">54633fef79a422c0fada846ff2b861ba</data>
      <data key="d11">3d837ee7fa6e4bfbbd36e836b33ae0c3</data>
      <data key="d12">944</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DESNUTRICI&#211;N" target="NUTRITIONAL ASSESSMENT">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Nutritional assessment is crucial for identifying and managing malnutrition in patients.</data>
      <data key="d10">17444b83ec19bdcc65ff0722869e7b4b</data>
      <data key="d11">a78511edbd0d400a8a4c408b8a03dcd4</data>
      <data key="d12">945</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DESNUTRICI&#211;N" target="SARCOPENIA">
      <data key="d8">14.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Sarcopenia is a condition characterized by the loss of muscle mass, which significantly increases the risk of malnutrition (desnutrici&#243;n). This condition is closely associated with fragility and dependence in patients, as the decline in muscle mass adversely affects their overall nutritional status. Consequently, sarcopenia not only contributes to malnutrition but also exacerbates the challenges faced by individuals in maintaining their health and independence.</data>
      <data key="d10">02b61e2d4f840772c76a05502aa4f171,1bad878c6efa9d3f5719546bb51bccb6</data>
      <data key="d11">62f863505e8b4f058ae60819970480b1</data>
      <data key="d12">946</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DESNUTRICI&#211;N" target="ALTA HOSPITALARIA">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Nutritional status is critical during the hospital discharge process to ensure proper recovery</data>
      <data key="d10">1bad878c6efa9d3f5719546bb51bccb6</data>
      <data key="d11">825ad0f44a6440d18e8e0cff859cae2f</data>
      <data key="d12">947</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DESNUTRICI&#211;N" target="MAASTRICHT INDEX">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The Maastricht Index is used to assess the risk of malnutrition, particularly in individuals experiencing undernutrition</data>
      <data key="d10">0597a142067272f25431b8b42cb5288f</data>
      <data key="d11">b8db938197484a849d77241b704b936f</data>
      <data key="d12">948</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DESNUTRICI&#211;N" target="ANOREXIA NERVIOSA">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Anorexia nerviosa often results in malnutrition due to self-imposed starvation and inadequate nutrient intake.</data>
      <data key="d10">8029c950c540c731bb9334bd90348239</data>
      <data key="d11">56ed605b116e44e4bfa743c1bf6938c6</data>
      <data key="d12">949</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DESNUTRICI&#211;N" target="S&#205;NDROME DE WERNICKE-KORSAKOFF">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Wernicke-Korsakoff syndrome can occur as a result of severe malnutrition, particularly due to thiamine deficiency.</data>
      <data key="d10">8029c950c540c731bb9334bd90348239</data>
      <data key="d11">e6a52e5093b6489498ab9ec6e8e9f1ed</data>
      <data key="d12">950</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DESNUTRICI&#211;N" target="PANCREATITIS AGUDA">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La pancreatitis aguda grave puede llevar a la desnutrici&#243;n debido a un catabolismo elevado y una respuesta inflamatoria sist&#233;mica</data>
      <data key="d10">88dcf64f61e33adc3702b1ec401e2d4e</data>
      <data key="d11">26e3b51fe99c4d09bf6b105c6dc261e3</data>
      <data key="d12">951</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DESNUTRICI&#211;N" target="FIBROSIS QU&#205;STICA">
      <data key="d8">14.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Cystic Fibrosis (FIBROSIS QU&#205;STICA) is a genetic disorder that significantly affects the body's ability to absorb nutrients, leading to malnutrition (DESNUTRICI&#211;N) as a common complication. The disease's impact on nutrient absorption and overall health results in a heightened risk of malnutrition among patients. This malabsorption of nutrients is a critical concern for individuals with cystic fibrosis, necessitating careful management of their dietary needs to support their health and well-being.</data>
      <data key="d10">7f4fe49df6d472c0b2e39db535bd01ab,b62146237c90c7a018b9a3d2c060c722</data>
      <data key="d11">7f6f85f8f2a6430182fc819efb0f0284</data>
      <data key="d12">952</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DESNUTRICI&#211;N" target="SAMUEL">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Samuel is at risk of desnutrici&#243;n due to his condition and dietary challenges</data>
      <data key="d10">dc7539b4d637d6dd09963c2564f4f084</data>
      <data key="d11">378501c06536465a8e1a818c7f56facb</data>
      <data key="d12">953</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DESNUTRICI&#211;N" target="HOMBRE">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">El paciente var&#243;n de 66 a&#241;os est&#225; en riesgo de desnutrici&#243;n debido a su condici&#243;n m&#233;dica y tratamientos</data>
      <data key="d10">e474ebdcd3e5392e4b2bed8434293849</data>
      <data key="d11">6203e6b7d6b248d98a6522aa379f26b3</data>
      <data key="d12">954</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DESNUTRICI&#211;N" target="ENFERMEDAD ONCOL&#211;GICA">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La desnutrici&#243;n se asocia con la enfermedad oncol&#243;gica, especialmente en estadios avanzados donde su prevalencia puede elevarse hasta el 80%</data>
      <data key="d10">02b61e2d4f840772c76a05502aa4f171</data>
      <data key="d11">bf4fc32bee3f4ddfbb57b654d53b7d98</data>
      <data key="d12">955</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DESNUTRICI&#211;N" target="MORBIMORTALIDAD">
      <data key="d8">18.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The entities "DESNUTRICI&#211;N" and "MORBIMORTALIDAD" are closely related, as desnutrici&#243;n (malnutrition) significantly contributes to an increase in morbimortalidad (morbidity and mortality). Desnutrici&#243;n negatively impacts the health of patients, leading to higher rates of illness and death. Furthermore, it is associated with a substantial public health concern, highlighting its critical role in affecting overall health outcomes in the population.</data>
      <data key="d10">02b61e2d4f840772c76a05502aa4f171,3159307e5633698722f72fde1e82702f</data>
      <data key="d11">f496bffaee374a84beb903897089ee8f</data>
      <data key="d12">956</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DESNUTRICI&#211;N" target="PACIENTES ONCOL&#211;GICOS">
      <data key="d8">16.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The entity "PACIENTES ONCOL&#211;GICOS" is significantly affected by "DESNUTRICI&#211;N," as these patients exhibit a high prevalence of nutritional deficiencies. This condition complicates their treatment and recovery processes. Due to the nature of their illness, patients with cancer are at an increased risk of developing malnutrition, which further exacerbates their health challenges.</data>
      <data key="d10">02b61e2d4f840772c76a05502aa4f171,5277ea34ef65b7d029950f2c905c6732</data>
      <data key="d11">d1081b55b4b643cda28aa15f6b691f41</data>
      <data key="d12">957</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DESNUTRICI&#211;N" target="PACIENTES HOSPITALIZADOS">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Los pacientes hospitalizados son propensos a la desnutrici&#243;n, lo que puede aumentar el riesgo de complicaciones</data>
      <data key="d10">02b61e2d4f840772c76a05502aa4f171</data>
      <data key="d11">23888e1f00bb414d947717539506e3fe</data>
      <data key="d12">958</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DESNUTRICI&#211;N" target="GRUPOS POBLACIONALES SUSCEPTIBLES">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Los grupos poblacionales susceptibles son m&#225;s vulnerables a la desnutrici&#243;n, lo que afecta su salud y bienestar</data>
      <data key="d10">02b61e2d4f840772c76a05502aa4f171</data>
      <data key="d11">0100db30834243fc805c1c5e6669d405</data>
      <data key="d12">959</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DESNUTRICI&#211;N" target="NUTRICI&#211;N CL&#205;NICA">
      <data key="d8">17.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Clinical nutrition, or nutrici&#243;n cl&#237;nica, is a specialized field that focuses on preventing and treating desnutrici&#243;n, particularly in hospitalized patients. It aims to improve the health status of individuals by addressing nutritional deficiencies and related issues. The practice involves identifying and managing desnutrici&#243;n through comprehensive nutritional assessments, ensuring that patients receive the necessary support to enhance their overall well-being.</data>
      <data key="d10">0ed0218136adceb16e9f246f3072e6dd,3159307e5633698722f72fde1e82702f,fbbb8c2530f7ac5635ecf5110ea186b2</data>
      <data key="d11">6c68a1c580944b5ebca6ebdc6c99bd1b</data>
      <data key="d12">960</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DESNUTRICI&#211;N" target="DIETOTERAPIA">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Dietoterapia is used to address malnutrition by improving dietary intake</data>
      <data key="d10">701eb4c24e94839def8d18882a2dda63</data>
      <data key="d11">a2f23492d55a49239a877b0dc25e48af</data>
      <data key="d12">961</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DESNUTRICI&#211;N" target="UNIDAD DE NUTRICI&#211;N">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The Unidad de Nutrici&#243;n works to prevent desnutrici&#243;n in hospitalized patients through proper dietary planning</data>
      <data key="d10">b624abf4d303854800e88f2364d190f0</data>
      <data key="d11">9f35e370d11c4bc1b89002b4bad1a814</data>
      <data key="d12">962</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DESNUTRICI&#211;N" target="PERSONAL DE ENFERMER&#205;A">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The Personal de Enfermer&#237;a monitors patients to prevent desnutrici&#243;n by ensuring adherence to dietary guidelines</data>
      <data key="d10">b624abf4d303854800e88f2364d190f0</data>
      <data key="d11">dffc11756b9a48f791e88b3aa644798d</data>
      <data key="d12">963</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DESNUTRICI&#211;N" target="M&#201;DICOS">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">M&#233;dicos assess patients for signs of desnutrici&#243;n and collaborate with the Unidad de Nutrici&#243;n for dietary interventions</data>
      <data key="d10">b624abf4d303854800e88f2364d190f0</data>
      <data key="d11">04aadc4af5154a74b03c96603d7d78cf</data>
      <data key="d12">964</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DESNUTRICI&#211;N" target="QUILOT&#211;RAX">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La desnutrici&#243;n puede estar asociada con la aparici&#243;n de quilot&#243;rax, afectando el estado general del paciente.</data>
      <data key="d10">8d4057f6ab3a5d00b2ae7609742cdf86</data>
      <data key="d11">ce4395013ca24a6c9bdebde18a3a0ff7</data>
      <data key="d12">965</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DESNUTRICI&#211;N" target="ENERG&#205;A">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Energy expenditure is a critical factor in assessing and managing the risk of malnutrition in critically ill patients</data>
      <data key="d10">d92f4ecdee41ca35485c997a95642c5b</data>
      <data key="d11">ca086ca5e3894abbab0287fb1a62050b</data>
      <data key="d12">966</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DESNUTRICI&#211;N" target="SOPORTE NUTRICIONAL">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Nutritional support aims to prevent and treat desnutrici&#243;n in critically ill patients</data>
      <data key="d10">21e6d7085f520d8a2f415746dc7eab71</data>
      <data key="d11">ade3be954dd349f6a1553f436f73a1ad</data>
      <data key="d12">967</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DESNUTRICI&#211;N" target="EPOC">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">EPOC patients often experience malnutrition as a result of the disease's progression and increased energy expenditure</data>
      <data key="d10">b62146237c90c7a018b9a3d2c060c722</data>
      <data key="d11">d60e560be27e4cac8a9bd4c8de662924</data>
      <data key="d12">968</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DESNUTRICI&#211;N" target="PACIENTE QUEMADO">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Burn patients are at high risk of malnutrition due to the destruction of muscle and increased metabolic needs</data>
      <data key="d10">b1b42f264a7bfe8d5c9b931ef8b29b02</data>
      <data key="d11">b2551cce5e1a481d9e056042b085120b</data>
      <data key="d12">969</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DESNUTRICI&#211;N" target="PACIENTES QUEMADOS">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Los pacientes quemados cr&#237;ticos tienen un alto riesgo de desnutrici&#243;n debido a su condici&#243;n hipermetab&#243;lica</data>
      <data key="d10">111edb0e21c873322871e35619a1ebf5</data>
      <data key="d11">631a9c41577c4d37a16b9dc65825ec98</data>
      <data key="d12">970</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DESNUTRICI&#211;N" target="INFECCI&#211;N">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Malnutrition can lead to infections due to a weakened immune system</data>
      <data key="d10">b44e720874efa74c538dd573ee936378</data>
      <data key="d11">f3dd57cf30d54c2193c4928f61a146c9</data>
      <data key="d12">971</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DESNUTRICI&#211;N" target="P&#201;RDIDA DE MASA MUSCULAR">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Malnutrition often results in loss of muscle mass, particularly in patients with dysphagia</data>
      <data key="d10">b44e720874efa74c538dd573ee936378</data>
      <data key="d11">232ffcf2bb3444778e3031fe666913d8</data>
      <data key="d12">972</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DESNUTRICI&#211;N" target="INMUNODEPRESI&#211;N">
      <data key="d8">14.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Desnutrici&#243;n and inmunodepresi&#243;n are closely related conditions, where desnutrici&#243;n, or malnutrition, can lead to inmunodepresi&#243;n, resulting in an increased risk of infections. This relationship highlights how inadequate nutrition can compromise the immune system, making individuals more susceptible to various infectious diseases.</data>
      <data key="d10">38c7f97d650c77986c2dc9132aa20fdb,b44e720874efa74c538dd573ee936378</data>
      <data key="d11">521ada0ceaaa4ddda8f77b1abe936418</data>
      <data key="d12">973</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DESNUTRICI&#211;N" target="MALA CICATRIZACI&#211;N">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Malnutrition can impair healing processes, leading to poor recovery from injuries</data>
      <data key="d10">b44e720874efa74c538dd573ee936378</data>
      <data key="d11">ce481ebb6a0644da85c77abd633ed71a</data>
      <data key="d12">974</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DESNUTRICI&#211;N" target="ALTERACIONES CICATRIZACI&#211;N">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Desnutrici&#243;n can cause alteraciones cicatrizaci&#243;n, affecting recovery from surgeries</data>
      <data key="d10">38c7f97d650c77986c2dc9132aa20fdb</data>
      <data key="d11">038b6e2456c14e2db0d536c5d85d212b</data>
      <data key="d12">975</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DESNUTRICI&#211;N" target="DESCENSO MASA MAGRA">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Desnutrici&#243;n often leads to a descenso masa magra, impacting overall health</data>
      <data key="d10">38c7f97d650c77986c2dc9132aa20fdb</data>
      <data key="d11">7f0c5ae2704845ea89d317668fa53680</data>
      <data key="d12">976</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DESNUTRICI&#211;N" target="TUMORES DE CABEZA Y CUELLO">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Head and neck tumors can lead to malnutrition due to difficulties in eating and swallowing</data>
      <data key="d10">58af2bdd20eeb5647ecc8088732833d8</data>
      <data key="d11">dd1f2698b4d6479db7d24e6c253ef950</data>
      <data key="d12">977</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DESNUTRICI&#211;N" target="P&#201;RDIDA DE PESO">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">P&#201;RDIDA DE PESO is a common symptom of DESNUTRICI&#211;N</data>
      <data key="d10">5277ea34ef65b7d029950f2c905c6732</data>
      <data key="d11">b30cbe1373c047c8b86a727c566c71b9</data>
      <data key="d12">978</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DESNUTRICI&#211;N" target="EDMAS">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">EDMAS can complicate the diagnosis of DESNUTRICI&#211;N</data>
      <data key="d10">5277ea34ef65b7d029950f2c905c6732</data>
      <data key="d11">7c76a00fac514fd99f66ab19c9f29b7a</data>
      <data key="d12">979</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DESNUTRICI&#211;N" target="ASCITIS">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">ASCITIS can interfere with the assessment of nutritional status and DESNUTRICI&#211;N</data>
      <data key="d10">5277ea34ef65b7d029950f2c905c6732</data>
      <data key="d11">b661ae8c4b9f46119c0187176e5c2d88</data>
      <data key="d12">980</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DESNUTRICI&#211;N" target="MORBILIDAD">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">DESNUTRICI&#211;N can lead to increased MORBILIDAD in patients</data>
      <data key="d10">5277ea34ef65b7d029950f2c905c6732</data>
      <data key="d11">f322bd0c59ec431380ae2bc110090dc1</data>
      <data key="d12">981</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DESNUTRICI&#211;N" target="MORTALIDAD">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">DESNUTRICI&#211;N is associated with higher MORTALIDAD rates in patients</data>
      <data key="d10">5277ea34ef65b7d029950f2c905c6732</data>
      <data key="d11">cb8b47375f6c4f7c87b484c8fe0ca128</data>
      <data key="d12">982</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DESNUTRICI&#211;N" target="PACIENTE ONCOL&#211;GICO">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Los pacientes oncol&#243;gicos a menudo enfrentan el riesgo de desnutrici&#243;n debido a su enfermedad y tratamientos</data>
      <data key="d10">e510500bd5a5f16a0bf0353cfdb79c13</data>
      <data key="d11">951de4464553472eb6cbb47c7e30d844</data>
      <data key="d12">983</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DESNUTRICI&#211;N" target="NUTRICI&#211;N ARTIFICIAL">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Desnutrici&#243;n is a significant concern for patients post-transplant, often requiring artificial nutrition</data>
      <data key="d10">c7577b8eccf83ced48f5ecf36717b4e1</data>
      <data key="d11">735f82ac05cb400a977616c0802c97d2</data>
      <data key="d12">984</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DESNUTRICI&#211;N" target="PACIENTES PEDI&#193;TRICOS">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Pediatric patients are at a higher risk of malnutrition, especially during hospitalization.</data>
      <data key="d10">ec4fd77add427ab49ea4b8687b94b263</data>
      <data key="d11">d60a50bcc4bc494fa1b582ee197cbe2e</data>
      <data key="d12">985</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DESNUTRICI&#211;N" target="PACIENTES SANITARIOS">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Malnutrition affects patients, necessitating healthcare interventions</data>
      <data key="d10">66c092d222e72c03a1f36507ce355cd4</data>
      <data key="d11">b57efd21655f47dabb579c2c72502aae</data>
      <data key="d12">986</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DESNUTRICI&#211;N" target="GRUPOS RELACIONADOS CON EL DIAGN&#211;STICO">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Los Grupos Relacionados con el Diagn&#243;stico incluyen clasificaciones para la desnutrici&#243;n, ayudando a gestionar los recursos en el tratamiento de pacientes desnutridos</data>
      <data key="d10">f53d37f60efeb5d6cdba204bf8f2bd9b</data>
      <data key="d11">b5960068443b4f42b1e9c9c5320b6a75</data>
      <data key="d12">987</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DESNUTRICI&#211;N" target="CIE-10">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La CIE-10 clasifica la desnutrici&#243;n y otros problemas de salud, permitiendo su codificaci&#243;n y an&#225;lisis en el contexto hospitalario</data>
      <data key="d10">f53d37f60efeb5d6cdba204bf8f2bd9b</data>
      <data key="d11">be0aa7f9fe4e4d4caf493153a8b4e677</data>
      <data key="d12">988</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HOSPITAL" target="DOF">
      <data key="d8">5.0</data>
      <data key="d9">DOF is a consultation service that should be available in hospitals for swallowing disorder evaluations</data>
      <data key="d10">a76f6268d6065b1baabb9e13ef7f098c</data>
      <data key="d11">4a04ded1804340dead7fb6f774c0fdeb</data>
      <data key="d12">989</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HOSPITAL" target="MALNUTRITION UNIVERSAL SCREENING TOOL">
      <data key="d8">16.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Hospitals utilize the Malnutrition Universal Screening Tool (MUST) to assess patients' nutritional status and identify those at risk of malnutrition. This tool is essential for healthcare providers in hospitals, as it helps in the early detection of malnutrition, allowing for timely interventions to improve patient outcomes.</data>
      <data key="d10">bf0cc16dc61df5b90a5a1e961322391a,f764c1a74fbbce262e79b50639acb7bd</data>
      <data key="d11">d3b279d9eed34dde8a671e3bcc52ee3e</data>
      <data key="d12">990</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HOSPITAL" target="UNIDAD DE NUTRICI&#211;N CL&#205;NICA Y DIET&#201;TICA">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The Clinical Nutrition and Dietetics Unit works within the hospital to enhance patient care through nutrition</data>
      <data key="d10">544f7d3afd9f7def46c357525e55cabf</data>
      <data key="d11">45c34d8762b2462ea1b737d8201cd506</data>
      <data key="d12">991</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HOSPITAL" target="SERVICIO DE COCINA">
      <data key="d8">15.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The Hospital's Kitchen Service operates within its facilities to prepare and provide meals for patients. This service is essential for ensuring that patients receive nutritious and appropriate meals during their stay at the hospital.</data>
      <data key="d10">544f7d3afd9f7def46c357525e55cabf,aacbc2a88a21cd749df3c22de5daea04</data>
      <data key="d11">fc730c5f6ef64beba835799f650e7fef</data>
      <data key="d12">992</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HOSPITAL" target="PACIENTE">
      <data key="d8">50.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The hospital is the institution responsible for the monitoring and management of patients. One such patient has been receiving medical attention at the hospital for chronic health issues, specifically undergoing treatment for pancreatic adenocarcinoma. The hospital provides comprehensive care and treatment to patients, which includes the management of various medical needs such as catheter care and dietary management. Additionally, patients may receive enteral or parenteral nutrition based on their individual requirements. Overall, the hospital plays a crucial role in ensuring that patients receive the necessary medical support and treatment for their health conditions.</data>
      <data key="d10">0c6c9eb4aba5c4642a75d76bd7ea08ba,544f7d3afd9f7def46c357525e55cabf,5cf1703fd601b27dd0ebda9f20cb3259,83b82871866963bb43f901dd9ca09fcb,c58712e2ee5757b5175054fcc54f4dd6,d6469f98d2161058fb7b214a1a800441</data>
      <data key="d11">11bac78ebc4b4587a350acd0d220d817</data>
      <data key="d12">993</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HOSPITAL" target="DRE">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The quality of food in hospitals is crucial to prevent disease-related malnutrition (DRE) in patients</data>
      <data key="d10">b4d5429d9b553438d3404c57e35c5c56</data>
      <data key="d11">bc9ec2b75b8e489a95486b427f0b1db4</data>
      <data key="d12">994</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HOSPITAL" target="ALIMENTACI&#211;N HOSPITALARIA">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Hospital food service is a fundamental aspect of patient care and treatment</data>
      <data key="d10">b4d5429d9b553438d3404c57e35c5c56</data>
      <data key="d11">7a75f38b70384b5697e8c9527bfe0627</data>
      <data key="d12">995</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HOSPITAL" target="CALIDAD DE LOS ALIMENTOS">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Hospitals must ensure food quality to meet patient satisfaction and nutritional needs</data>
      <data key="d10">b4d5429d9b553438d3404c57e35c5c56</data>
      <data key="d11">65091dd770474099be5365e6de4c7755</data>
      <data key="d12">996</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HOSPITAL" target="COCINA HOSPITALARIA">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The hospital contains a specialized kitchen (Cocina Hospitalaria) to prepare meals for patients</data>
      <data key="d10">18b4ac5d9393f776e63cac226bb6b12b</data>
      <data key="d11">af4d8e9b6dc548f1815e773a4d1a5963</data>
      <data key="d12">997</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HOSPITAL" target="MANUAL DE DISFAGIA OROFAR&#205;NGEA">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The Manual de Disfagia Orofar&#237;ngea provides guidelines for managing dysphagia in hospital settings</data>
      <data key="d10">18b4ac5d9393f776e63cac226bb6b12b</data>
      <data key="d11">67304c130a654920ac3523f05cf62e19</data>
      <data key="d12">998</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
