    <edge source="HOSPITAL" target="NUTRITIONAL RISK SCREENING 2002">
      <data key="d8">14.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Nutritional Risk Screening 2002 is a specialized tool designed for use in hospitals to assess patients' nutritional risks. It is implemented within hospital settings to effectively evaluate and identify individuals who may be at risk of nutritional deficiencies, ensuring that appropriate interventions can be made to support their health and recovery.</data>
