    <edge source="HOSPITAL" target="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL">
      <data key="d8">24.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The hospital provides parenteral nutrition as a specialized nutritional support for patients who are unable to receive nutrition through traditional means, such as oral or enteral routes. This form of nutrition is administered to individuals who require therapeutic intervention due to their inability to consume food normally, ensuring that they receive the necessary nutrients for their health and recovery.</data>
      <data key="d10">caf14765027dbf6266841af0571a522e,d6469f98d2161058fb7b214a1a800441,f5175f0c433eb4e10840a41d8052c8e0,ff844169c2b512733f5bde26e6f1ed32</data>
