      <data key="d12">1146</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MANUAL DE DISFAGIA OROFAR&#205;NGEA" target="ACEITES">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Oils, especially olive oil, are recommended in the manual for enhancing the energy content and flavor of dysphagia diets</data>
      <data key="d10">398be32cb0a16895225a8b29c9d118df</data>
      <data key="d11">20207889156b437e91872200441cc4a9</data>
      <data key="d12">1147</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MANUAL DE DISFAGIA OROFAR&#205;NGEA" target="IDDSI">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The "Manual de Disfagia Orofar&#237;ngea" is a comprehensive guide that incorporates the standards set forth by the International Dysphagia Diet Standardisation Initiative (IDDSI) for the management of dysphagia. The IDDSI provides a framework and descriptors that are essential for effective dysphagia treatment, and these are referenced throughout the manual. This integration ensures that the manual aligns with internationally recognized practices for dysphagia management, enhancing its utility for healthcare professionals in the field.</data>
      <data key="d10">adb71bc02844276a2ecb4c4302938319,c30b47b534824f4d1b74f3c0bb00ffd9</data>
      <data key="d11">d940d71c63854c238f73b8f247567af2</data>
      <data key="d12">1148</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MANUAL DE DISFAGIA OROFAR&#205;NGEA" target="NIVEL 3">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The manual provides guidelines for different food texture levels, including Level 3 for individuals with slight lingual control issues.</data>
      <data key="d10">85615e916e16fc7d0e49d66102bfedec</data>
      <data key="d11">4185739c7c5a4e90a994bba99c126546</data>
      <data key="d12">1149</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MANUAL DE DISFAGIA OROFAR&#205;NGEA" target="NIVEL 4">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The manual outlines Level 4 food texture, which is extremely thick puree, for individuals with significant lingual control issues.</data>
      <data key="d10">85615e916e16fc7d0e49d66102bfedec</data>
      <data key="d11">67af5f6b47e14b79994d1c621cfcb9bc</data>
      <data key="d12">1150</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MANUAL DE DISFAGIA OROFAR&#205;NGEA" target="NIVEL 5">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The manual includes Level 5 food texture guidelines, which are minced and moist, for individuals with minimal chewing ability.</data>
      <data key="d10">85615e916e16fc7d0e49d66102bfedec</data>
      <data key="d11">cfdf1eed83244b2ca0245018a36a8ced</data>
      <data key="d12">1151</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MANUAL DE DISFAGIA OROFAR&#205;NGEA" target="NIVEL 6">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The manual describes Level 6 food texture, which is soft and bite-sized, suitable for individuals who can manage some chewing.</data>
      <data key="d10">85615e916e16fc7d0e49d66102bfedec</data>
      <data key="d11">1919d0468b2747238f852eca3e2f4b38</data>
      <data key="d12">1152</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MANUAL DE DISFAGIA OROFAR&#205;NGEA" target="NIVEL 1">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The manual provides guidelines for Level 1 food texture, which is thin and suitable for individuals with normal swallowing capabilities.</data>
      <data key="d10">85615e916e16fc7d0e49d66102bfedec</data>
      <data key="d11">91aa9edc07e64769992be67a065672e0</data>
      <data key="d12">1153</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MANUAL DE DISFAGIA OROFAR&#205;NGEA" target="NIVEL 2">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The manual includes Level 2 food texture guidelines, which are slightly thickened for individuals with mild swallowing difficulties.</data>
      <data key="d10">85615e916e16fc7d0e49d66102bfedec</data>
      <data key="d11">63b59eac135b49a1b227b67fd9302038</data>
      <data key="d12">1154</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MANUAL DE DISFAGIA OROFAR&#205;NGEA" target="NIVEL 3. LICUADA O MODERADAMENTE ESPESA">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The manual describes Level 3 food texture, which is liquefied or moderately thick, requiring some effort to consume through a straw.</data>
      <data key="d10">85615e916e16fc7d0e49d66102bfedec</data>
      <data key="d11">e2ef742c04cb4c79bf7e18e90d8c9e69</data>
      <data key="d12">1155</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MANUAL DE DISFAGIA OROFAR&#205;NGEA" target="NIVEL 4. PUR&#201; EXTREMADAMENTE ESPESO">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The manual outlines Level 4 food texture, which is extremely thick puree, suitable for individuals with significant lingual control issues.</data>
      <data key="d10">85615e916e16fc7d0e49d66102bfedec</data>
      <data key="d11">36abfdc9d3d44acda81222dafce3e07e</data>
      <data key="d12">1156</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MANUAL DE DISFAGIA OROFAR&#205;NGEA" target="NIVEL 5. PICADA Y H&#218;MEDA">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The manual includes Level 5 food texture guidelines, which are minced and moist, for individuals with minimal chewing ability.</data>
      <data key="d10">85615e916e16fc7d0e49d66102bfedec</data>
      <data key="d11">c3d0905638cb49edb7984f353cd4a14e</data>
      <data key="d12">1157</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MANUAL DE DISFAGIA OROFAR&#205;NGEA" target="NIVEL 6. SUAVE Y TAMA&#209;O BOCADO">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The manual describes Level 6 food texture, which is soft and bite-sized, suitable for individuals who can manage some chewing.</data>
      <data key="d10">85615e916e16fc7d0e49d66102bfedec</data>
      <data key="d11">2bd16f6fb038456f93cd0467cf525759</data>
      <data key="d12">1158</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MANUAL DE DISFAGIA OROFAR&#205;NGEA" target="ALIMENTOS A EVITAR">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The manual includes a section specifically addressing foods to avoid for individuals with oropharyngeal dysphagia</data>
      <data key="d10">5367d7f3e598922a050de5ed400cd0c4</data>
      <data key="d11">0c1d12cd28a9457bb436bc7bccd31cf2</data>
      <data key="d12">1159</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MANUAL DE DISFAGIA OROFAR&#205;NGEA" target="ADAPTACI&#211;N DE VISCOSIDADES">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The manual provides guidelines on how to adapt liquid viscosities for patients with oropharyngeal dysphagia</data>
      <data key="d10">5367d7f3e598922a050de5ed400cd0c4</data>
      <data key="d11">529f9a992a864c279493441f7077be87</data>
      <data key="d12">1160</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MANUAL DE DISFAGIA OROFAR&#205;NGEA" target="HIDRATACI&#211;N EN EL PACIENTE CON DOF">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The manual discusses the importance of hydration in the management of oropharyngeal dysphagia</data>
      <data key="d10">5367d7f3e598922a050de5ed400cd0c4</data>
      <data key="d11">dabf729ad222499e96bdccb3196ccb99</data>
      <data key="d12">1161</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MANUAL DE DISFAGIA OROFAR&#205;NGEA" target="GOMA GUAR">
      <data key="d8">4.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The manual may reference goma guar as a thickening agent for foods suitable for individuals with oropharyngeal dysphagia</data>
      <data key="d10">5367d7f3e598922a050de5ed400cd0c4</data>
      <data key="d11">e46aa4d9f83f4c8c8d45659259fb2de9</data>
      <data key="d12">1162</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MANUAL DE DISFAGIA OROFAR&#205;NGEA" target="GOMA XANTANA">
      <data key="d8">4.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The manual may reference goma xantana as a thickening agent for foods suitable for individuals with oropharyngeal dysphagia</data>
      <data key="d10">5367d7f3e598922a050de5ed400cd0c4</data>
      <data key="d11">9d79ca08e8b94b8a8d9c0454ddde8497</data>
      <data key="d12">1163</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MANUAL DE DISFAGIA OROFAR&#205;NGEA" target="DOF">
      <data key="d8">16.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The "MANUAL DE DISFAGIA OROFAR&#205;NGEA" serves as a comprehensive resource for managing dysphagia, specifically focusing on patients with Dysphagia Orofar&#237;ngea (DOF). It offers detailed guidelines and solutions aimed at addressing the hydration and nutritional needs of individuals affected by this condition. The manual emphasizes dietary adaptations as a crucial component in the effective management of dysphagia, ensuring that patients receive appropriate care tailored to their specific requirements.</data>
      <data key="d10">186a95fdfe908123ad6f42d43b52ee1d,c30b47b534824f4d1b74f3c0bb00ffd9</data>
      <data key="d11">0ff16ab993c548dbb71887abe92ca70f</data>
      <data key="d12">1164</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MANUAL DE DISFAGIA OROFAR&#205;NGEA" target="VALERO ZANUY">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Valero Zanuy is cited in the manual for providing diagnostic criteria for dehydration related to DOF.</data>
      <data key="d10">186a95fdfe908123ad6f42d43b52ee1d</data>
      <data key="d11">e6daf19f93af478fbf4a191abc602959</data>
      <data key="d12">1165</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MANUAL DE DISFAGIA OROFAR&#205;NGEA" target="TABLA VII">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Table VII is part of the manual and provides essential information on fluid balance for patients with dysphagia.</data>
      <data key="d10">186a95fdfe908123ad6f42d43b52ee1d</data>
      <data key="d11">2c127e7980c1466bbfea98a65eac435d</data>
      <data key="d12">1166</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MANUAL DE DISFAGIA OROFAR&#205;NGEA" target="TABLA VIII">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Table VIII is included in the manual and details the diagnostic signs and symptoms of dehydration.</data>
      <data key="d10">186a95fdfe908123ad6f42d43b52ee1d</data>
      <data key="d11">ce9f2d57cbe44c9d815966e931cd6454</data>
      <data key="d12">1167</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
