    <edge source="MANUAL DE DISFAGIA OROFAR&#205;NGEA" target="AL&#201;RGENOS">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The "Manual de Disfagia Orofaringea" is a comprehensive resource that addresses various aspects of oropharyngeal dysphagia, including dietary considerations. A significant focus of the manual is the management of allergens, which is crucial for ensuring safe and appropriate dietary choices for individuals with dysphagia. The manual includes a list of allergens relevant to the recipes provided, highlighting the importance of allergen awareness in the context of dysphagia management.</data>
      <data key="d10">4431bc1a109798ef648c103ac4eb321a,ec9e9b1519699c4c01b955945ea892d5</data>
      <data key="d11">2958094e7dab46938222d91639800e76</data>
      <data key="d12">1172</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MANUAL DE DISFAGIA OROFAR&#205;NGEA" target="DIETA">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The manual provides guidelines for creating therapeutic diets for patients with oropharyngeal dysphagia</data>
      <data key="d10">058edb7500a486cc3196de4ca335b375</data>
      <data key="d11">f368208ad3e646febc4d4ca831a7a081</data>
      <data key="d12">1173</data>
