    <edge source="MANUAL DE DISFAGIA OROFAR&#205;NGEA" target="FIGURA 13">
      <data key="d8">13.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The "MANUAL DE DISFAGIA OROFAR&#205;NGEA" includes "FIGURA 13," which serves a dual purpose in the context of the manual. Firstly, Figure 13 illustrates an exercise focused on mouth opening techniques, which is essential for individuals dealing with dysphagia. Secondly, it also depicts p&#226;t&#233;-like texture food, specifically designed for dysphagia diets, highlighting the manual's comprehensive approach to addressing the dietary and therapeutic needs of those with swallowing difficulties.</data>
      <data key="d10">60f20082b58784c6b2a2ff01d0e29e85,dad5cb424b9586e4e672ed57db1f4fd6</data>
      <data key="d11">d1d3850f0fd046ceaac0a1e1df69854f</data>
      <data key="d12">1184</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MANUAL DE DISFAGIA OROFAR&#205;NGEA" target="FIGURA 14">
      <data key="d8">13.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The "MANUAL DE DISFAGIA OROFAR&#205;NGEA" includes "FIGURA 14," which serves a dual purpose. Firstly, Figure 14 demonstrates a technique for stimulating the soft palate, as outlined in the manual. Secondly, it illustrates a food processor that is utilized in the recipes designed for dysphagia diets. This comprehensive approach highlights both the therapeutic techniques and practical tools recommended for managing dysphagia.</data>
      <data key="d10">60f20082b58784c6b2a2ff01d0e29e85,dad5cb424b9586e4e672ed57db1f4fd6</data>
      <data key="d11">432085a4a9354f359482aa8f8b62fcdb</data>
      <data key="d12">1185</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MANUAL DE DISFAGIA OROFAR&#205;NGEA" target="FIGURA 15">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The "MANUAL DE DISFAGIA OROFAR&#205;NGEA" includes "FIGURA 15," which serves a dual purpose. Firstly, it illustrates a hand blender set that is utilized in the preparation of recipes specifically designed for dysphagia diets. Secondly, "FIGURA 15" also depicts an exercise aimed at enhancing the muscle tone of the soft palate, a topic that is addressed within the manual. This comprehensive approach in the manual provides both practical tools and exercises to assist individuals with dysphagia.</data>
      <data key="d10">60f20082b58784c6b2a2ff01d0e29e85,dad5cb424b9586e4e672ed57db1f4fd6</data>
      <data key="d11">3068402d7b404dae8995cefa735b9c54</data>
      <data key="d12">1186</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MANUAL DE DISFAGIA OROFAR&#205;NGEA" target="HOSPITALARIA">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The manual is intended for use in hospital settings to assist patients with dysphagia.</data>
      <data key="d10">dad5cb424b9586e4e672ed57db1f4fd6</data>
