    <edge source="MANUAL DE DISFAGIA OROFAR&#205;NGEA" target="VERDURAS HERVIDAS CON CREMA DE GUISANTES">
      <data key="d8">16.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The "MANUAL DE DISFAGIA OROFAR&#205;NGEA" serves as a comprehensive guide for individuals dealing with dysphagia, a condition that affects swallowing. Within this manual, there is a specific recipe for "VERDURAS HERVIDAS CON CREMA DE GUISANTES," which translates to boiled vegetables with pea sauce. This recipe is designed as a nutritious solution for those experiencing difficulties in swallowing, ensuring that the meal is both safe and enjoyable for individuals with dysphagia. The manual emphasizes the importance of providing suitable food options that cater to the dietary needs of this population.</data>
      <data key="d10">8eaa5c33797ca6e96f578139f2831f47,b8fd422921866f53cdaa6c24db528ee5</data>
