    <edge source="DIABETES MELLITUS" target="PATIENT">
      <data key="d8">26.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Diabetes mellitus is a chronic condition that requires patients to actively manage their health through various strategies. Patients with diabetes mellitus must implement lifestyle changes and dietary adjustments to maintain their well-being. This includes careful monitoring of their condition, which often involves insulin administration as part of their treatment plan. The management of diabetes mellitus significantly impacts the dietary management and overall treatment strategies for patients, necessitating a comprehensive approach to their health care.</data>
      <data key="d10">1f2b31f5a0bba00ecee5e3a8fb2c83ea,aeb399b3f90c6a50eed8adfa8a140451,eeb6e04f12698ee82912bdf775d79381</data>
      <data key="d11">1a1bb8bd4eb644fcaf8d31fc6f315f18</data>
      <data key="d12">1554</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
