    <edge source="DIABETES MELLITUS" target="FIBRA">
      <data key="d8">12.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Diabetes Mellitus is a chronic condition that affects how the body processes blood sugar (glucose). Dietary fiber, known as "fibra," plays a significant role in managing this condition. It is recommended for individuals with diabetes as it can help lower the risk of developing type 2 diabetes and assist in managing blood sugar levels. Incorporating fiber into the diet can improve overall health for those living with diabetes, making it an essential component of their nutritional strategy.</data>
      <data key="d10">7ba4c7b49d445c147394ac626d055ef3,c958206b5546e8b46ab48b3f50e60611</data>
