    <edge source="DIABETES MELLITUS" target="MACRONUTRIENTS">
      <data key="d8">14.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Diabetes mellitus is a condition that requires careful dietary management, particularly concerning the balance of macronutrients. The appropriate distribution of macronutrients&#8212;carbohydrates, proteins, and fats&#8212;is essential for individuals managing diabetes, as it plays a crucial role in maintaining blood glucose levels and overall health. Therefore, achieving a balanced intake of these macronutrients is important for effective diabetes management.</data>
      <data key="d10">1f2b31f5a0bba00ecee5e3a8fb2c83ea,27f06efb5e9ac8bbc3f8bd31ee5a2777</data>
      <data key="d11">303af8e7204144e6b69f9f2d32a156b5</data>
