      <data key="d8">10.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Diabetes Mellitus is a condition that requires careful dietary management, particularly concerning the intake of Hidratos de Carbono (carbohydrates). Hidratos de Carbono play a crucial role in influencing blood sugar levels, making them a significant focus in the dietary management of diabetes. Proper management of carbohydrate consumption is essential for effective blood sugar control in individuals with Diabetes Mellitus.</data>
