    <edge source="SARCOPENIA" target="ENVEJECIMIENTO">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Sarcopenia is a condition characterized by the progressive loss of muscle mass and strength, and it becomes increasingly prevalent with aging. Aging is recognized as a primary factor that contributes to both the onset and progression of sarcopenia. As individuals age, the likelihood of developing sarcopenia rises, highlighting the significant relationship between aging and this muscular condition.</data>
      <data key="d10">a527688a9f74d33efc23a2a94d33163b,b7465350e74a3bada96615deb0d7b031</data>
      <data key="d11">ba0e6cd63fbb4fd7ae90a817f445a4e2</data>
      <data key="d12">1707</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="SARCOPENIA" target="MUSCLE STRENGTH">
