      <data key="d12">1709</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="SARCOPENIA" target="DEXA">
      <data key="d8">10.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Sarcopenia is a condition characterized by the loss of muscle mass and strength, which can significantly impact an individual's mobility and overall health. DEXA, or Dual-Energy X-ray Absorptiometry, is recognized as the gold standard method for measuring muscle mass. This technique is essential for accurately diagnosing sarcopenia, as it provides critical data regarding the amount of muscle tissue present in the body. By utilizing DEXA, healthcare professionals can effectively assess muscle mass, which is a key factor in identifying and managing sarcopenia.</data>
      <data key="d10">066ca85c476fdb709bb2b588cb86a55a,a527688a9f74d33efc23a2a94d33163b</data>
      <data key="d11">c12da9046bb24f0094bc91dbcb49b728</data>
      <data key="d12">1710</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
