    <edge source="SARCOPENIA" target="EUROPEAN WORKING GROUP ON SARCOPENIA IN OLDER PEOPLE">
      <data key="d8">18.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Sarcopenia is a condition characterized by the loss of muscle mass and strength, particularly in older adults. The European Working Group on Sarcopenia in Older People plays a crucial role in addressing this issue by defining and diagnosing sarcopenia. This group not only establishes the criteria for identifying the condition but also provides comprehensive guidelines for its diagnosis, ensuring that healthcare professionals have the necessary tools to recognize and manage sarcopenia effectively in the aging population.</data>
      <data key="d10">066ca85c476fdb709bb2b588cb86a55a,8205166235be6abd77947eb2f7c5ab27</data>
      <data key="d11">906bcb1e70964647af6bd41c99e03855</data>
