    <edge source="SARCOPENIA" target="PROTE&#205;NAS">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">El aumento en la ingesta de prote&#237;nas puede ayudar a prevenir o tratar la sarcopenia en ancianos</data>
      <data key="d10">78d3252445aa1a02df4627450218fb59</data>
      <data key="d11">5e165c26c11841a381d90eeb88552cb4</data>
      <data key="d12">1734</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="SARCOPENIA" target="PROT-AGE STUDY GROUP">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">El PROT-AGE Study Group investiga la relaci&#243;n entre la ingesta de prote&#237;nas y la sarcopenia en ancianos</data>
      <data key="d10">78d3252445aa1a02df4627450218fb59</data>
      <data key="d11">1242b89d7375416f9456d83e11491220</data>
      <data key="d12">1735</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="SARCOPENIA" target="GRUPO DE EXPERTOS DE ESPEN">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">El Grupo de Expertos de ESPEN proporciona recomendaciones sobre la ingesta de prote&#237;nas para combatir la sarcopenia</data>
      <data key="d10">78d3252445aa1a02df4627450218fb59</data>
      <data key="d11">e85b40849f284be998e048c191b29395</data>
      <data key="d12">1736</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="SARCOPENIA" target="VITAMINA D">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Vitamin D supplementation is part of the nutritional interventions aimed at combating sarcopenia</data>
      <data key="d10">a25b0f84bc321cad942a2e33f681a5e4</data>
      <data key="d11">330a9a61f11d44fd968d6d0a4935c398</data>
      <data key="d12">1737</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="SARCOPENIA" target="AGPI">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">AGPI supplementation is part of the nutritional strategies to improve muscle response in sarcopenia</data>
      <data key="d10">a25b0f84bc321cad942a2e33f681a5e4</data>
      <data key="d11">bb45dbeb28a142dc8b21496c0ceb85ef</data>
      <data key="d12">1738</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="SARCOPENIA" target="TESTOSTERONA">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Testosterone treatment may help improve muscle mass and strength in men with sarcopenia</data>
      <data key="d10">a6a4604a5fc2c91b714b6ba568bb0090</data>
      <data key="d11">55fe701d24004bf6858233646219e289</data>
      <data key="d12">1739</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="SARCOPENIA" target="HMB">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Sarcopenia is a condition characterized by the loss of muscle mass and strength, particularly prevalent among the elderly and those who are ill. HMB, or beta-hydroxy-beta-methylbutyrate, is a dietary supplement that is utilized to combat sarcopenia. Research indicates that HMB supplementation can effectively increase muscle mass and strength in elderly individuals suffering from this condition. By improving muscle strength, HMB plays a significant role in enhancing the overall physical health and quality of life for those affected by sarcopenia.</data>
      <data key="d10">a6a4604a5fc2c91b714b6ba568bb0090,eadd983c9f28c11a1c279e4b923351cd</data>
      <data key="d11">6eb411fcd1074d8eaa487a2ad20b3f1c</data>
      <data key="d12">1740</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="SARCOPENIA" target="ACEITE DE PESCADO">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Fish oil supplementation has been associated with improvements in muscle strength during exercise in elderly women</data>
      <data key="d10">a6a4604a5fc2c91b714b6ba568bb0090</data>
      <data key="d11">108a625507b7476dbe3a9fc3dbe5a101</data>
      <data key="d12">1741</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="SARCOPENIA" target="FIBRA DIET&#201;TICA">
      <data key="d8">5.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Dietary fiber can positively affect digestive health, which is crucial for overall health in the elderly, potentially impacting sarcopenia</data>
      <data key="d10">a6a4604a5fc2c91b714b6ba568bb0090</data>
      <data key="d11">4cde97c4a5d54d3697592a3791a6fda7</data>
      <data key="d12">1742</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="SARCOPENIA" target="FRUCTOOLIGOSAC&#193;RIDOS">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Supplementation with fructooligosaccharides has been shown to improve muscle strength in frail elderly individuals</data>
      <data key="d10">a6a4604a5fc2c91b714b6ba568bb0090</data>
      <data key="d11">bec409951fee41c0b4faa0a1589f2855</data>
      <data key="d12">1743</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="SARCOPENIA" target="NUTRIENTES">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Adequate nutrient intake is essential for preventing and managing sarcopenia in the elderly</data>
      <data key="d10">a6a4604a5fc2c91b714b6ba568bb0090</data>
      <data key="d11">7a32360477094091a8c1ab2b8270996b</data>
      <data key="d12">1744</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="SARCOPENIA" target="ANTIOXIDANTES">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Diets high in antioxidants may help mitigate the effects of sarcopenia by reducing oxidative stress</data>
      <data key="d10">a6a4604a5fc2c91b714b6ba568bb0090</data>
      <data key="d11">2d01715ac89a4349a0c237f2ceb16e56</data>
      <data key="d12">1745</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="SARCOPENIA" target="EJERCICIO F&#205;SICO">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Exercise interventions are critical in addressing sarcopenia and improving muscle function in the elderly</data>
      <data key="d10">3f21321c62f3e5ee31c822e90ca6b89e</data>
      <data key="d11">e14d59d7176641638577669c5f23b27f</data>
      <data key="d12">1746</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="SARCOPENIA" target="EXERCISE">
      <data key="d8">18.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Sarcopenia is a condition characterized by the loss of muscle mass and strength, particularly in the elderly. Exercise is recognized as a crucial intervention for addressing this issue. It plays a significant role in improving both muscle mass and function in individuals affected by sarcopenia. Specifically, engaging in regular physical activity is recommended to combat sarcopenia and enhance muscle strength among older adults.</data>
      <data key="d10">5898660be8944e9248ba187ffd7553b1,8205166235be6abd77947eb2f7c5ab27</data>
      <data key="d11">a6d0ed25f8ba4434abbbb5205445e165</data>
      <data key="d12">1747</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="SARCOPENIA" target="HERTFORDSHIRE COHORT STUDY">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The Hertfordshire Cohort Study investigates the prevalence of sarcopenia among older adults</data>
      <data key="d10">8205166235be6abd77947eb2f7c5ab27</data>
      <data key="d11">14df4059bad0474ead3e3b4d4f85a696</data>
      <data key="d12">1748</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="SARCOPENIA" target="ELLI STUDY">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The ELLI study focuses on the prevalence of sarcopenia in geriatric patients</data>
      <data key="d10">8205166235be6abd77947eb2f7c5ab27</data>
      <data key="d11">480533feb8784bdb9a65d65f367d0241</data>
      <data key="d12">1749</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="SARCOPENIA" target="NUTRITION">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Proper nutrition is essential for preventing and managing sarcopenia in older adults</data>
      <data key="d10">8205166235be6abd77947eb2f7c5ab27</data>
      <data key="d11">047d28a9195548849affb3b256003d0a</data>
      <data key="d12">1750</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="SARCOPENIA" target="VITAMIN D">
      <data key="d8">14.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Sarcopenia is a condition characterized by the loss of muscle mass and strength, particularly in older adults. Vitamin D plays a crucial role in muscle health and is often studied for its potential in preventing or treating sarcopenia. Research suggests that adequate levels of vitamin D may aid in the management of sarcopenia, highlighting the importance of this vitamin in maintaining muscle function and overall health in individuals at risk of this condition.</data>
      <data key="d10">8205166235be6abd77947eb2f7c5ab27,e155d9b2d1858daab734fd68a45d0c0a</data>
      <data key="d11">2b026c19df5644f693d7bd0acac4dabc</data>
      <data key="d12">1751</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="SARCOPENIA" target="OMEGA-3 FATTY ACIDS">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Omega-3 fatty acids may support muscle health and function, potentially aiding in the treatment of sarcopenia</data>
      <data key="d10">8205166235be6abd77947eb2f7c5ab27</data>
      <data key="d11">a3aa5ecdc4e24ebca2b1c9bbdea3f381</data>
      <data key="d12">1752</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="SARCOPENIA" target="N-3 POLYUNSATURATED FATTY ACIDS">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">N-3 polyunsaturated fatty acids are researched for their potential benefits in muscle health and sarcopenia</data>
      <data key="d10">e155d9b2d1858daab734fd68a45d0c0a</data>
      <data key="d11">720393c863e740f5913aa6dd12d1dbb6</data>
      <data key="d12">1753</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="SARCOPENIA" target="HIGH-PROTEIN ORAL NUTRITIONAL SUPPLEMENTS">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">High-protein supplements are often recommended to combat sarcopenia in older adults</data>
      <data key="d10">e155d9b2d1858daab734fd68a45d0c0a</data>
      <data key="d11">1cfb5cc56bab49b396d33e5712d79a1c</data>
      <data key="d12">1754</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="SARCOPENIA" target="C&#193;NCER">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">El sedentarismo en pacientes con c&#225;ncer puede provocar sarcopenia, afectando negativamente su estado f&#237;sico</data>
      <data key="d10">f7871bbaa57d50bb5f5675cd580cb0af</data>
      <data key="d11">ff6c65b5ed5744a8bc3fb01d3ecef97b</data>
      <data key="d12">1755</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="SARCOPENIA" target="C&#193;NCER GASTROINTESTINAL">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Sarcopenia is a common issue in gastrointestinal cancer patients, affecting their physical capacity and treatment tolerance</data>
      <data key="d10">639ebafae8a95bb03a09e111172b9a4e</data>
      <data key="d11">944de8db18bf40f8936c5c495b8bc211</data>
      <data key="d12">1756</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="SARCOPENIA" target="NUTRITIONAL SUPPLEMENTATION">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Nutritional supplementation is often indicated for patients suffering from sarcopenia to improve their muscle mass and overall health.</data>
      <data key="d10">eadd983c9f28c11a1c279e4b923351cd</data>
      <data key="d11">1ca11e0d38f144e590ba9390a938fe5b</data>
      <data key="d12">1757</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DINAPENIA" target="DOF">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Dinapenia can lead to difficulties in swallowing, contributing to the symptoms of dysphagia.</data>
      <data key="d10">0bff3417518c19ae80d20de8150be58b</data>
      <data key="d11">ecc2eade243e402b8a439f0eb551dade</data>
      <data key="d12">1758</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="F&#193;RMACOS" target="SERVICIO DE FARMACIA">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Servicio de Farmacia provides guidance on the administration of f&#225;rmacos for patients using enteral nutrition</data>
      <data key="d10">52a0434694f8face489cdb4c8d206a9e</data>
      <data key="d11">e034c91f64594c238598dfa9fb294d8a</data>
      <data key="d12">1759</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="F&#193;RMACOS" target="LEVOTIROXINA">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Certain medications can interfere with the absorption of levothyroxine, affecting its therapeutic effectiveness</data>
      <data key="d10">be2de576112f22070e8ef8a5cb9e1017</data>
      <data key="d11">ec05b19f71f1413e97a6724cd45fc9ce</data>
      <data key="d12">1760</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="F&#193;RMACOS" target="DIARREA CR&#211;NICA">
      <data key="d8">5.0</data>
      <data key="d9">El uso de ciertos f&#225;rmacos puede resultar en diarrea cr&#243;nica como efecto secundario</data>
      <data key="d10">449c8567a3aa59b49fbe65b7a3a26d46</data>
      <data key="d11">c11c6ba77c18499e8161b46224f7b491</data>
      <data key="d12">1761</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="F&#193;RMACOS" target="ESTRE&#209;IMIENTO">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Algunos f&#225;rmacos, como los laxantes, son utilizados para tratar el estre&#241;imiento, lo que establece una relaci&#243;n entre ambos</data>
      <data key="d10">44f263c31f91c1bc594cbb28bd397c89</data>
      <data key="d11">7882fb2d4d784ba78948c9f3a5afa4af</data>
      <data key="d12">1762</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="F&#193;RMACOS" target="DIARREA">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Ciertos f&#225;rmacos, como los antibi&#243;ticos, est&#225;n asociados con la producci&#243;n de diarrea, lo que establece una relaci&#243;n entre ambos</data>
      <data key="d10">44f263c31f91c1bc594cbb28bd397c89</data>
      <data key="d11">945782edca5a40f292ec85819a4b69f7</data>
      <data key="d12">1763</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="F&#193;RMACOS" target="INSULINA">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La insulina es un tipo de f&#225;rmaco utilizado en el tratamiento de pacientes quemados para controlar la hiperglucemia.</data>
      <data key="d10">2ec23f85b858abc42196ef48260e8cb0</data>
      <data key="d11">17af704d8a004d21a0d34553301ff112</data>
      <data key="d12">1764</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="F&#193;RMACOS" target="OXANDROLONA">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La oxandrolona es un f&#225;rmaco utilizado para tratar a pacientes quemados, ayudando en la recuperaci&#243;n de la masa magra.</data>
      <data key="d10">2ec23f85b858abc42196ef48260e8cb0</data>
      <data key="d11">a6c35471f42845e5b3620168fdefae32</data>
      <data key="d12">1765</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="F&#193;RMACOS" target="BETABLOQUEANTES">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Los betabloqueantes son un tipo de f&#225;rmaco que se utiliza en el tratamiento de pacientes quemados para mejorar la respuesta inmunitaria.</data>
      <data key="d10">2ec23f85b858abc42196ef48260e8cb0</data>
      <data key="d11">5c26f9d3a88c493299445174eaf03151</data>
      <data key="d12">1766</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="F&#193;RMACOS" target="HORMONA DEL CRECIMIENTO">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La hormona del crecimiento es un f&#225;rmaco que se utiliza en el tratamiento de pacientes quemados para mejorar la cicatrizaci&#243;n.</data>
      <data key="d10">2ec23f85b858abc42196ef48260e8cb0</data>
      <data key="d11">871158d8e15c4dcfbf0371545c9a4e4d</data>
      <data key="d12">1767</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="F&#193;RMACOS" target="DIETA">
      <data key="d8">14.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The relationship between F&#193;RMACOS (drugs) and DIETA (diet) is significant, as diet can greatly influence the effectiveness and absorption of various medications. Specifically, the diet may affect the efficacy and safety of drugs due to potential interactions that can occur during nutritional therapy. This highlights the importance of considering dietary factors when evaluating drug therapy, as they can play a crucial role in the overall treatment outcomes.</data>
      <data key="d10">7f0ee0bea2b1dfd09e75026d4c027291,fa5c0208b983c59b247a65e6bb166f2a</data>
      <data key="d11">6575737e5ce54deaa0955da9a91008e2</data>
      <data key="d12">1768</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="F&#193;RMACOS" target="INTERACCIONES">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">F&#225;rmacos can have interactions with diet that may alter their effectiveness</data>
      <data key="d10">fa5c0208b983c59b247a65e6bb166f2a</data>
      <data key="d11">872e812c14f5499db5246636a6b91b2b</data>
      <data key="d12">1769</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="F&#193;RMACOS" target="ENFERMEDAD">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Certain diseases can alter the way drugs are metabolized and their interactions with diet</data>
      <data key="d10">fa5c0208b983c59b247a65e6bb166f2a</data>
      <data key="d11">96bc55fea15f42fc8f900c0690040e05</data>
      <data key="d12">1770</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="F&#193;RMACOS" target="ALIMENTOS">
      <data key="d8">15.0</data>
      <data key="d9">F&#193;RMACOS y ALIMENTOS est&#225;n interrelacionados de manera significativa, ya que los alimentos pueden afectar la absorci&#243;n y eficacia de los f&#225;rmacos. Esta interacci&#243;n resalta la importancia de considerar c&#243;mo los alimentos pueden modificar la forma en que los f&#225;rmacos son absorbidos y su efectividad en el contexto de la terapia nutricional. Por lo tanto, es crucial tener en cuenta estas interacciones al administrar tratamientos que involucren f&#225;rmacos y la ingesta de alimentos.</data>
      <data key="d10">7f0ee0bea2b1dfd09e75026d4c027291,ac274a54f27601e9d60118e72fc2ba94</data>
      <data key="d11">e4a70d985e874382849faff7d6b69281</data>
      <data key="d12">1771</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="F&#193;RMACOS" target="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL">
      <data key="d8">16.0</data>
      <data key="d9">F&#225;rmacos and Nutrici&#243;n Enteral are interconnected entities in the context of gastrointestinal health. F&#225;rmacos can significantly alter gastrointestinal function, which in turn impacts the tolerance and absorption of enteral nutrition. Additionally, the administration of f&#225;rmacos can adversely affect enteral nutrition, leading to potential interactions that may compromise nutritional outcomes. Therefore, it is crucial to consider the effects of medications on gastrointestinal processes when managing enteral nutrition to ensure optimal patient care.</data>
      <data key="d10">7f0ee0bea2b1dfd09e75026d4c027291,fc664efd4e1c463dc21857e596b68b46</data>
      <data key="d11">22d79227f50c4ada966257417d2ad995</data>
      <data key="d12">1772</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="F&#193;RMACOS" target="SORBITO">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">El sorbitol puede interactuar con ciertos f&#225;rmacos, causando alteraciones gastrointestinales si se consume en dosis elevadas.</data>
      <data key="d10">7f0ee0bea2b1dfd09e75026d4c027291</data>
      <data key="d11">30c6f76b36d0423c9713cc8c9ac5d3ae</data>
      <data key="d12">1773</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="F&#193;RMACOS" target="DEPORTISTA">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Los f&#225;rmacos pueden alterar la termorregulaci&#243;n y afectar la hidrataci&#243;n de un deportista durante el ejercicio.</data>
      <data key="d10">364aa13581a973c2e55c25191bad27cc</data>
      <data key="d11">332a9d9f870a48ceaf6c6032bbe31183</data>
      <data key="d12">1774</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DOF" target="CABR&#201; ET AL">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Cabr&#233; et al conducted research on the characteristics of elderly patients with dysphagia, highlighting its prevalence and associated factors.</data>
      <data key="d10">0bff3417518c19ae80d20de8150be58b</data>
      <data key="d11">a44c7c1a3d7748f382d9b6695ff7784d</data>
      <data key="d12">1775</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DOF" target="NEUMON&#205;AS DE REPETICI&#211;N">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Dysphagia can lead to recurrent pneumonia due to aspiration and swallowing difficulties.</data>
      <data key="d10">0bff3417518c19ae80d20de8150be58b</data>
      <data key="d11">a7f3296f32e54d1d8e8d72d76cbd814a</data>
      <data key="d12">1776</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DOF" target="S&#205;NDROME GERI&#193;TRICO">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Dysphagia is often associated with geriatric syndromes, which include various health issues affecting older adults.</data>
      <data key="d10">0bff3417518c19ae80d20de8150be58b</data>
      <data key="d11">ee207bcef63c4c9fa2ac8605b89c3d40</data>
      <data key="d12">1777</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DOF" target="ICTUS">
      <data key="d8">21.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Dysphagia, a condition affecting the swallowing mechanism, can occur as a result of a stroke (ictus). This oropharyngeal dysfunction is particularly significant in patients who have experienced a stroke, highlighting the need for thorough evaluation and targeted interventions to address swallowing difficulties. Both DOF and ICTUS emphasize the importance of recognizing and managing dysphagia in the context of stroke recovery.</data>
      <data key="d10">0bff3417518c19ae80d20de8150be58b,4ae09eb472a346b355bc66df2fea519f,c257fcbbfdc5ac2678d371cee5c12edf</data>
      <data key="d11">7135696bf8e542babb468758ae1c5653</data>
      <data key="d12">1778</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DOF" target="CANCER DE CABEZA Y CUELLO">
      <data key="d8">12.0</data>
      <data key="d9">DOF, which focuses on the management and treatment of conditions related to "CANCER DE CABEZA Y CUELLO" (head and neck cancer), recognizes that dysphagia is a significant symptom experienced by patients with this type of cancer. This condition can severely impact their swallowing function, leading to challenges in nutrition and overall quality of life. Specifically, head and neck cancer can result in oropharyngeal dysphagia, necessitating the implementation of targeted rehabilitation techniques to address and manage these swallowing difficulties effectively.</data>
      <data key="d10">0bff3417518c19ae80d20de8150be58b,c257fcbbfdc5ac2678d371cee5c12edf</data>
      <data key="d11">b14aca647c06440a878cec377996f6c1</data>
      <data key="d12">1779</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DOF" target="MAYOR">
      <data key="d8">3.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The mayor may be involved in public health initiatives addressing dysphagia in the community.</data>
      <data key="d10">0bff3417518c19ae80d20de8150be58b</data>
      <data key="d11">72df83f0cc894054a2f5a4ff1083ebce</data>
      <data key="d12">1780</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DOF" target="TOS">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Coughing is a common symptom associated with dysphagia, acting as a defense mechanism against aspiration.</data>
      <data key="d10">0bff3417518c19ae80d20de8150be58b</data>
      <data key="d11">24c31dc772cf4aa3bc71f4914c15dc97</data>
      <data key="d12">1781</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DOF" target="DIFICULTAD PARA TRAGAR">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Difficulty swallowing is a primary characteristic of dysphagia, indicating a swallowing disorder.</data>
      <data key="d10">0bff3417518c19ae80d20de8150be58b</data>
      <data key="d11">7636189b767f407e8dc72385428a83c1</data>
      <data key="d12">1782</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DOF" target="BOCA SECA">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Dry mouth can exacerbate dysphagia by making swallowing more difficult due to lack of saliva.</data>
      <data key="d10">0bff3417518c19ae80d20de8150be58b</data>
      <data key="d11">3d98aaf986be4ae1bbd0e0558cbe73f1</data>
      <data key="d12">1783</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DOF" target="RESIDUOS EN LA GARGANTA">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Residual food in the throat is a common issue for patients with dysphagia, leading to choking risks.</data>
      <data key="d10">0bff3417518c19ae80d20de8150be58b</data>
      <data key="d11">f0abf6d33c784cbb953ea09ea4161df5</data>
      <data key="d12">1784</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DOF" target="SIGNOS CL&#205;NICOS">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Clinical signs are essential for diagnosing dysphagia and determining its severity.</data>
      <data key="d10">0bff3417518c19ae80d20de8150be58b</data>
      <data key="d11">7317e1f630cb4258a36a640258ae8f40</data>
      <data key="d12">1785</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DOF" target="PRUEBAS INSTRUMENTALES">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Instrumental tests are crucial for confirming the presence of dysphagia and assessing its impact.</data>
      <data key="d10">0bff3417518c19ae80d20de8150be58b</data>
      <data key="d11">7a8952ad906e444e89ec4917308e9767</data>
      <data key="d12">1786</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DOF" target="S&#205;NTOMA IGNORADO">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Dysphagia is often considered an ignored symptom in clinical practice, despite its significance.</data>
      <data key="d10">0bff3417518c19ae80d20de8150be58b</data>
      <data key="d11">2ca0fbc5c11947559467a7d1dbe6df3e</data>
      <data key="d12">1787</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DOF" target="PREVALENCIA">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Understanding the prevalence of dysphagia is important for public health awareness and resource allocation.</data>
      <data key="d10">0bff3417518c19ae80d20de8150be58b</data>
      <data key="d11">a45e0898fd254cd18e4d768d8d54cc71</data>
      <data key="d12">1788</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DOF" target="MALNUTRITION">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Dysphagia oropharyngeal (DOF) is associated with high rates of malnutrition among affected patients</data>
      <data key="d10">f093c7e72a5015556281394111990625</data>
      <data key="d11">43a93f85f87b481bb64aff2a01fefc57</data>
      <data key="d12">1789</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DOF" target="DEHYDRATION">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Dysphagia oropharyngeal (DOF) can lead to dehydration due to difficulties in swallowing</data>
      <data key="d10">f093c7e72a5015556281394111990625</data>
      <data key="d11">4b5a8ef549244f42af8340f3931df6c0</data>
      <data key="d12">1790</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DOF" target="NHDS">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The NHDS conducted a study evaluating the impact of dysphagia on hospital stays and mortality rates</data>
      <data key="d10">1835e55766e759ce3b8acec75f4b6875</data>
      <data key="d11">878e64ccb5c74e79a9243ff968051c65</data>
      <data key="d12">1791</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DOF" target="AHRQ">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The AHRQ published a study assessing the costs and utilization of healthcare services related to dysphagia</data>
      <data key="d10">1835e55766e759ce3b8acec75f4b6875</data>
      <data key="d11">14a96576a6394a79ae55f5fdc02f4f75</data>
      <data key="d12">1792</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DOF" target="UNITED STATES">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Dysphagia affects 3% of hospitalized adults in the United States, leading to increased hospital stays and costs</data>
      <data key="d10">1835e55766e759ce3b8acec75f4b6875</data>
      <data key="d11">5d07722b2a194f1bbb71fc841109c4fc</data>
      <data key="d12">1793</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DOF" target="DENMARK">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">A study in Denmark evaluated the costs associated with dysphagia in geriatric patients, showing higher costs compared to those without dysphagia</data>
      <data key="d10">1835e55766e759ce3b8acec75f4b6875</data>
      <data key="d11">4bad9f2e08724169b8cf5d6fcfbcc97e</data>
      <data key="d12">1794</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DOF" target="PNEUMONIA POR ASPIRACI&#211;N">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Dysphagia significantly increases the risk of developing aspiration pneumonia, which is a serious complication</data>
      <data key="d10">1835e55766e759ce3b8acec75f4b6875</data>
      <data key="d11">5e8043e43b6b46e885daab55798bc02c</data>
      <data key="d12">1795</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DOF" target="HOSPITALIZACI&#211;N">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Patients with dysphagia experience longer hospital stays compared to those without the condition</data>
      <data key="d10">1835e55766e759ce3b8acec75f4b6875</data>
      <data key="d11">c4fb6fd10472442f8f9e5342290db863</data>
      <data key="d12">1796</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DOF" target="COSTES ASOCIADOS">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Dysphagia leads to higher associated costs due to longer hospital stays and additional care</data>
      <data key="d10">1835e55766e759ce3b8acec75f4b6875</data>
      <data key="d11">910d2a9d570541b889c11925c57d6bdc</data>
      <data key="d12">1797</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DOF" target="REINGRESOS">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Patients with dysphagia have a higher likelihood of being readmitted to the hospital after discharge</data>
      <data key="d10">1835e55766e759ce3b8acec75f4b6875</data>
      <data key="d11">efe241a6c0d14ef99be7a8f01060bbca</data>
      <data key="d12">1798</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DOF" target="PACIENTES HOSPITALIZADOS">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">A significant percentage of hospitalized patients are diagnosed with dysphagia, impacting their treatment outcomes</data>
      <data key="d10">1835e55766e759ce3b8acec75f4b6875</data>
      <data key="d11">5a1d95fc55374368bd7b02849210625a</data>
      <data key="d12">1799</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DOF" target="PACIENTES GERI&#193;TRICOS">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Geriatric patients are more likely to suffer from dysphagia, leading to increased healthcare costs and complications</data>
      <data key="d10">1835e55766e759ce3b8acec75f4b6875</data>
      <data key="d11">5282b0369fd5406fa320e9ab4d65985b</data>
      <data key="d12">1800</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DOF" target="SARCOMA">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">DOF often occurs in conjunction with sarcopenia, particularly in older adults, impacting their health outcomes</data>
      <data key="d10">02c3924fac2660b8531f61207f3b04bb</data>
      <data key="d11">6c41e06a7096444ebee11aa0e5f07afd</data>
      <data key="d12">1801</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DOF" target="LANCASTER J.">
      <data key="d8">5.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Lancaster J. has contributed to the literature on dysphagia, enhancing understanding of DOF</data>
      <data key="d10">02c3924fac2660b8531f61207f3b04bb</data>
      <data key="d11">38e6c15726084ce3a0c44b02269319df</data>
      <data key="d12">1802</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DOF" target="CHICHERO J.">
      <data key="d8">5.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Chichero J. has researched the prevalence and burden of DOF, highlighting its significance in healthcare</data>
      <data key="d10">02c3924fac2660b8531f61207f3b04bb</data>
      <data key="d11">82902ccc8efc47009a185842ff0e58f9</data>
      <data key="d12">1803</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DOF" target="VELASCO MM.">
      <data key="d8">5.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Velasco MM. has provided insights into the nutritional management of patients with DOF</data>
      <data key="d10">02c3924fac2660b8531f61207f3b04bb</data>
      <data key="d11">50718eb22df94a589385fd42b5e6cc89</data>
      <data key="d12">1804</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DOF" target="GONZALEZ R.">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Gonzalez R. has studied the implications of DOF in neurological patients, contributing to the understanding of its impact</data>
      <data key="d10">02c3924fac2660b8531f61207f3b04bb</data>
      <data key="d11">47924f3f42db47ca8d200aea6d7c0e31</data>
      <data key="d12">1805</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DOF" target="MORBIMORTALITY">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Morbimortality is a critical concern for patients suffering from DOF, as it leads to serious health complications</data>
      <data key="d10">02c3924fac2660b8531f61207f3b04bb</data>
      <data key="d11">39492d6edf034de2bec6ec9943283fdc</data>
      <data key="d12">1806</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DOF" target="QUALITY OF LIFE">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">DOF negatively impacts the quality of life for patients due to difficulties in swallowing and associated health risks</data>
      <data key="d10">02c3924fac2660b8531f61207f3b04bb</data>
      <data key="d11">22f8dc0fb84141698debf32dc12ce01a</data>
      <data key="d12">1807</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DOF" target="MECV-V">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">MECV-V is a method indicated for patients with suspected dysphagia (DOF). It is specifically utilized to assess the viscosity needs of these patients, ensuring that their dietary requirements are appropriately met.</data>
      <data key="d10">4befdcd21a98898cec30bbac7b402d4b,c30b47b534824f4d1b74f3c0bb00ffd9</data>
      <data key="d11">38fd7492f9834eaca70ef010b0081691</data>
      <data key="d12">1808</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DOF" target="SSA">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">SSA is used to detect DOF in patients</data>
      <data key="d10">4befdcd21a98898cec30bbac7b402d4b</data>
      <data key="d11">b78e4d18b0aa4d558c852acf88d565b1</data>
      <data key="d12">1809</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DOF" target="CRIBADO">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">El cribado es necesario para detectar la disfunci&#243;n orofar&#237;ngea en pacientes con esclerosis m&#250;ltiple e ictus.</data>
      <data key="d10">4ae09eb472a346b355bc66df2fea519f</data>
      <data key="d11">9228f5aef48347aeaaeb5e654ec80103</data>
      <data key="d12">1810</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DOF" target="RECOMENDACI&#211;N">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Las recomendaciones establecen pautas para el manejo de la disfunci&#243;n orofar&#237;ngea en pacientes con esclerosis m&#250;ltiple e ictus.</data>
      <data key="d10">4ae09eb472a346b355bc66df2fea519f</data>
      <data key="d11">44e9d1cc1f4140e58e696d7a24dd92b5</data>
      <data key="d12">1811</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DOF" target="VFS">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">VFS is a key diagnostic tool used to evaluate the condition of dysphagia oropharyngea (DOF)</data>
      <data key="d10">be410757354948d16ee86e49a852101c</data>
      <data key="d11">dd4d1d3769f94b818e2166b2719267a9</data>
      <data key="d12">1812</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DOF" target="VED">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">VED is utilized in the assessment of dysphagia oropharyngea (DOF)</data>
      <data key="d10">be410757354948d16ee86e49a852101c</data>
      <data key="d11">7747ae75bf57474d985b6c8b29bdeb5a</data>
      <data key="d12">1813</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DOF" target="MANOMETR&#205;A ESOF&#193;GICA">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Esophageal manometry is a test that can help diagnose issues related to dysphagia oropharyngea (DOF)</data>
      <data key="d10">be410757354948d16ee86e49a852101c</data>
      <data key="d11">c486e264e6a44abba088eaa9ea98b3ab</data>
      <data key="d12">1814</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DOF" target="PH-METR&#205;A DE 24 HORAS">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">24-hour pH monitoring can assist in identifying acid-related issues that may affect swallowing in patients with dysphagia oropharyngea (DOF)</data>
      <data key="d10">be410757354948d16ee86e49a852101c</data>
      <data key="d11">d4569081b5e1495987b2d218117c41d6</data>
      <data key="d12">1815</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DOF" target="IMPEDANCIOMETR&#205;A INTRALUMINAL">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Intraluminal impedance testing can provide insights into swallowing difficulties associated with dysphagia oropharyngea (DOF)</data>
      <data key="d10">be410757354948d16ee86e49a852101c</data>
      <data key="d11">0146878632194b7b8ee2d340425367c5</data>
      <data key="d12">1816</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DOF" target="OTORRINOLARING&#211;LOGOS">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Otolaryngologists are specialists involved in diagnosing and treating dysphagia oropharyngea (DOF)</data>
      <data key="d10">be410757354948d16ee86e49a852101c</data>
      <data key="d11">1d33667f82884178a1a80e53bec2d354</data>
      <data key="d12">1817</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DOF" target="NUTRITIONAL TREATMENT">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Nutritional treatment is essential for patients suffering from DOF to prevent malnutrition</data>
      <data key="d10">67f60ae11335cf41da4f96400b69e67b</data>
      <data key="d11">4f966df2d9934371b4c5f7ced63950a7</data>
      <data key="d12">1818</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DOF" target="NUTRITIONAL REQUIREMENTS">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Nutritional requirements are specifically tailored for patients with DOF</data>
      <data key="d10">67f60ae11335cf41da4f96400b69e67b</data>
      <data key="d11">b99ce85ddcd145f0a0e5f5aeaf68155b</data>
      <data key="d12">1819</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DOF" target="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL">
      <data key="d8">10.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Dysphagia (DOF) may necessitate the use of enteral nutrition as a therapeutic intervention to ensure that patients receive adequate nutrient intake. For individuals with DOF who are unable to meet their nutritional needs through oral consumption, nutritional support via enteral nutrition is strongly recommended. This approach helps to address the challenges posed by dysphagia and ensures that patients maintain proper nutrition.</data>
      <data key="d10">186a95fdfe908123ad6f42d43b52ee1d,5dd39815651d2d44f18c16e69696c0cf</data>
      <data key="d11">e089b669fb6a448abc339f936171dcfd</data>
      <data key="d12">1820</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DOF" target="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Parenteral nutrition is suggested for patients with DOF when enteral nutrition is not feasible.</data>
      <data key="d10">186a95fdfe908123ad6f42d43b52ee1d</data>
      <data key="d11">5e716a683b4746aba7d702d5f2f83a28</data>
      <data key="d12">1821</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DOF" target="GRUPO NACIONAL DE TRABAJO SOBRE LA DIETA PARA LA DISFAGIA">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The National Working Group on Diet for Dysphagia provides guidelines for managing patients with dysphagia</data>
      <data key="d10">085d1e3702bc42fa47418095d541867f</data>
      <data key="d11">7a0a069f5fb843249366a55ba017786a</data>
      <data key="d12">1822</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DOF" target="ESPESANTES">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">DOF and ESPESANTES are associated with the use of thickeners, which play a crucial role in modifying food textures to assist patients with dysphagia. These thickeners are specifically designed to alter the consistency of liquids, making them safer and easier to swallow for individuals experiencing difficulties with swallowing. By enhancing the texture of foods and liquids, thickeners help improve the overall dining experience and nutritional intake for patients with dysphagia.</data>
      <data key="d10">085d1e3702bc42fa47418095d541867f,da965f79110bd8915deff461d0d91187</data>
      <data key="d11">389febdea4024dd78ddc7b2e3a89a743</data>
      <data key="d12">1823</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DOF" target="ALIMENTOS">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">DOF, which focuses on the dietary needs of patients with dysphagia, emphasizes the importance of modifying foods in texture to ensure safe consumption. Modified foods are specifically designed to meet the swallowing requirements of these patients, ensuring that they can eat safely and comfortably. ALIMENTOS, as part of this initiative, plays a crucial role in providing these specially adapted food options.</data>
      <data key="d10">085d1e3702bc42fa47418095d541867f,da965f79110bd8915deff461d0d91187</data>
      <data key="d11">8ef2d50d21b04ea1bf557ae6770440c7</data>
      <data key="d12">1824</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DOF" target="LIQUIDOS">
