    <edge source="ENVEJECIMIENTO" target="FRAGILIDAD">
      <data key="d8">16.0</data>
      <data key="d9">ENVEJECIMIENTO and FRAGILIDAD are closely interconnected concepts, with aging being a significant factor that contributes to the development of fragility syndrome. As individuals age, they may experience a state of fragility, particularly among the elderly, which underscores the critical role of nutrition in maintaining health during this stage of life. Additionally, fragility is recognized as a condition frequently associated with the aging process, highlighting the importance of understanding the relationship between these two entities.</data>
