    <edge source="SISTEMA NACIONAL DE SALUD" target="REAL DECRETO 1205/2010">
      <data key="d8">13.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The Sistema Nacional de Salud is governed by the Real Decreto 1205/2010, which regulates the inclusion of dietary products within the healthcare system. This royal decree, published on September 24, 2010, establishes provisions for special medical dietary foods, ensuring that these products are recognized and integrated into the national health framework.</data>
