    <edge source="REINO UNIDO" target="NED">
      <data key="d8">18.0</data>
      <data key="d9">NED operates in the Reino Unido, where it has been the subject of various studies, particularly focusing on its impact on elderly patients and nutritional support. The Reino Unido provides full funding for NED, facilitating its research and implementation within the country.</data>
      <data key="d10">0d083c309fb6f4d0d16c0e2b23ea5c8b,eab1daf48c7ca09f43fc115a3379cc10,f84386a9907d954b9cf46475d0d45243</data>
