    <edge source="JAP&#211;N" target="NED">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Japan is identified as one of the countries with limited data on home nutrition. Additionally, the Netherlands (NED) has been studied in Japan, among other countries, indicating a research interest in the nutritional practices or data comparisons between these two nations.</data>
