    <edge source="MALNUTRITION" target="NUTRITIONAL SUPPORT">
      <data key="d8">16.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Malnutrition is a significant concern that can adversely affect surgical outcomes and overall health. Nutritional support plays a crucial role in addressing malnutrition, particularly in patients with Enhanced Recovery After Surgery (EHCA). By providing adequate nutritional support, healthcare providers can improve patient recovery and mitigate the negative impacts of malnutrition.</data>
