    <edge source="MALNUTRITION" target="MUST">
      <data key="d8">16.0</data>
      <data key="d9">MUST, or the Malnutrition Universal Screening Tool, is a specialized screening tool created to identify patients who are at risk of malnutrition. It serves as an effective method for detecting malnutrition, allowing healthcare providers to take appropriate measures to address the nutritional needs of patients.</data>
