      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="VIDEOFLOUROSCOPIA" target="VIDEOENDOSCOPIA DE LA DEGLUCI&#211;N">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Both techniques are used to evaluate swallowing, with videoendoscopy focusing on the pharyngeal phase and videofluoroscopy assessing all three phases</data>
      <data key="d10">67cdbb6902307ad33e10fe5e37096083</data>
      <data key="d11">3df91bc0b56b44e5b4418e9e4bd4b558</data>
      <data key="d12">2274</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="VIDEOFLOUROSCOPIA" target="ESOFAOGOSCOPIA TRANSNASAL">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Both techniques are diagnostic methods used to evaluate swallowing, but esofagoscopia transnasal offers a different approach through the nasal cavity</data>
      <data key="d10">67cdbb6902307ad33e10fe5e37096083</data>
      <data key="d11">4d0d1138a7c24bfe828a7f0b603d6354</data>
      <data key="d12">2275</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="VIDEOFLOUROSCOPIA" target="UFDOF">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
