    <edge source="AGUA" target="PACIENTE">
      <data key="d8">11.0</data>
      <data key="d9">AGUA and PACIENTE are interconnected in the context of patient care, particularly for those who have undergone transplantation. It is crucial for transplanted patients to maintain an adequate balance of water to prevent complications associated with their condition. Additionally, water plays a significant role in the hygiene practices of these patients, as it is used for cleaning the feeding tube and for maintaining oral hygiene. This highlights the importance of water not only for health maintenance but also for the overall well-being of patients.</data>
