    <edge source="AGUA" target="NUTRICI&#211;N CL&#205;NICA">
      <data key="d8">18.0</data>
      <data key="d9">AGUA and NUTRICI&#211;N CL&#205;NICA are closely related in the context of clinical nutrition, where water plays a crucial role. Water is a fundamental ingredient in clinical nutrition formulations, significantly impacting both hydration and the stability of these products. It is essential in the formulation of clinical nutrition products, ensuring they meet the necessary standards for effective nutritional support.</data>
      <data key="d10">3d73ef14929e7391e915f739189e4dfa,d9e4179f945ec9152199511522d70159</data>
