    <edge source="EUROPEAN SOCIETY FOR CLINICAL NUTRITION AND METABOLISM" target="NUTRICI&#211;N CL&#205;NICA">
      <data key="d8">17.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The European Society for Clinical Nutrition and Metabolism (ESPEN) plays a crucial role in the field of clinical nutrition by providing comprehensive guidelines and standards that are essential for clinical nutrition practices. These guidelines are particularly significant in the management of patients with swallowing disorders, ensuring that healthcare professionals have the necessary framework to deliver effective nutritional care. Additionally, the organization, known in Spanish as Nutrici&#243;n Cl&#237;nica, emphasizes the importance of these standards in enhancing patient outcomes through proper nutritional management.</data>
      <data key="d10">59a97e6bf8748a66eb335bec2852ce38,f7d56bac9cc29e47690669e812094c99</data>
      <data key="d11">bf15d6843ad5498ea9774241abf69d28</data>
      <data key="d12">2480</data>
