    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N CL&#205;NICA" target="DIETOTERAPIA">
      <data key="d8">51.0</data>
      <data key="d9">NUTRICI&#211;N CL&#205;NICA and DIETOTERAPIA are closely interconnected fields that emphasize the importance of diet in health management. Clinical nutrition encompasses various practices aimed at improving health through dietary interventions, and dietotherapy serves as a significant component within this framework. Specifically, dietotherapy is particularly relevant for patients who require artificial nutrition and is essential in managing metabolic disorders. It focuses on tailored dietary interventions designed to enhance health outcomes. Both NUTRICI&#211;N CL&#205;NICA and DIETOTERAPIA prioritize the role of diet in promoting health and managing diseases, highlighting their collaborative nature in clinical practices.</data>
      <data key="d10">0148b1abded087a7c25eda89c8014f38,0379ef9e3f56ccd30c572884eb5bd723,2f5d9123a78d23b1bc3d9f06d7a53d78,7852af9e2886d0d889fbc056d0a75f21,8ff1cad741bacfef19d53bb8941b5ca9,a4b56b993221a7065a59bca622c02953,dce680808e039e852dc0f2639835db32,e5ec5005272f7691eba86e2cc7240f5a</data>
