    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL">
      <data key="d8">179.0</data>
      <data key="d9">NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL and NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL are two distinct methods of providing nutritional support to patients who are unable to consume food orally or utilize their digestive tract effectively. Both approaches are essential for patients with various medical conditions, including those with respiratory issues and those who have undergone gastrectomy. 

NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL is generally preferred over NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL due to its lower complication rates, reduced costs, and better outcomes in critically ill patients. It is particularly favored when the digestive tract is functional, such as in cases of severe pancreatitis, where enteral nutrition is the first choice. However, NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL is indicated when enteral nutrition is not tolerated or when the digestive system cannot be used adequately. 

Both methods can be utilized in pediatric care and may be employed in conjunction when enteral nutrition alone is insufficient. Nutritional support can transition from parenteral to enteral as patients adapt and their conditions improve. Overall, the choice between NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL and NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL depends on the specific needs and conditions of the patient, with a general preference for enteral methods when feasible.</data>
      <data key="d10">09e9623b3facc5045e80541b1cd2cada,0dab18980ece5562db9bbd4a3bb9f9ac,0e756c1673317aaf495b90b8bcb02515,111edb0e21c873322871e35619a1ebf5,125acd19edb76fa23986de56fc2517e8,140611dbb8a68fc40712c946de92b73f,1870ba6878c109f3023c9d15d0fa784b,2206bb4d5efe2dcf644ee48468ea112c,27b65be3bda292c9c26dfd7a87e74752,3159307e5633698722f72fde1e82702f,44346a4b1b9a6d3ae2bc161314ff9efd,4a65e02e4e364419b836920c093055fe,4ce6342fdfe4419826c1ab2f84c56247,4fbc9ba7c1f3ff190b594c75e7eac015,5d4476c2c40af44f9d54628af0ac463d,6906ee13020e48a5d50fc97dc22928fa,7b13bde26d33b4316c3183dd027ed909,7e539a13a598e4ff2d2d4d6641a044d5,896ddfd9f06dc3ec8b1cfb986fae97fe,95b0d21cd06eb29e984e0882f8fac544,b0ffa7260c4fc20462ad4c9bedcbfae7,df3e8fd56a2df522425984adc77392ab,df410977169e29218f41ff919bd4e44b,e34642244b0c7f309ab1c1be1e81da31,e5838e52fbc5d3d18fc0533b71148201,ec4fd77add427ab49ea4b8687b94b263,f087e20586f6b263059597e194a04993,f5175f0c433eb4e10840a41d8052c8e0,f5ac70db902f1361fd681d1d109828c0,f75d1340b39e345875bf878dba07ab8c,f7ca532ae3a834fd6643ad694d3e850c</data>
      <data key="d11">6f78d65fb1ef44e4ab8abdc9a39888eb</data>
