    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="PACIENTE">
      <data key="d8">151.0</data>
      <data key="d9">NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL is a medical procedure utilized to provide nutritional support to patients who are unable to consume food orally. This method is particularly important for patients like the PACIENTE, who may have specific medical conditions that necessitate enteral nutrition to ensure adequate nutrient intake. The PACIENTE is the recipient of this nutrition, which is tailored to meet their individual nutritional needs, influenced by their medical condition.

In cases where the PACIENTE has moderate malnutrition or conditions such as renal failure or dysphagia, enteral nutrition becomes essential. It is administered through various means, including gastrostomy and nasogastric tubes, to facilitate recovery and improve the patient's nutritional status. The decision to initiate enteral nutrition is often made when the PACIENTE is unable to meet their dietary requirements through oral intake, as seen in situations where they cannot feed themselves or have ineffective oral intake.

While enteral nutrition is beneficial, it can also lead to complications such as diarrhea, which may arise from factors related to the method of administration or the specific nutritional products used. Overall, enteral nutrition plays a critical role in the management of the PACIENTE's health, ensuring they receive the necessary nutrients for recovery and overall well-being.</data>
      <data key="d10">058edb7500a486cc3196de4ca335b375,13c6297da17b9be4a67cf439f62cd289,3f295222427803a7fc92b83386e5ec56,4fbc9ba7c1f3ff190b594c75e7eac015,64417661dbb019f8f4ceb9fcc2fbdaa6,6a5102072d17111dafe768ab7d38f41a,7b13bde26d33b4316c3183dd027ed909,8178ba40e7ef08e569845c1f3f1621cc,82d36ebbaaa026c713df2b7a47253efa,9934fdd98a0d66fb3ff7ac1b56b18460,99900c6d95f85a5b4b88fcfed6775cec,9c43759c41fe226a2702de300b9e580a,b7a2c1e4dd77f47605fdb33f4a2c2bdf,c3975fe03d2af26b95b09795c7769e8b,c92ceeeeae88c8288176cbfd00c75e17,ce4c057e0a625bc9e64301a0cca1e206,d3e1df90991ea82fcccbd02589473ead,d6469f98d2161058fb7b214a1a800441,ea7d8ba0550547d4cff0b5d18c3f6ae5,f7b4cba3bbdeec64513c036fd4166835</data>
