    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="PROTE&#205;NAS">
      <data key="d8">16.0</data>
      <data key="d9">NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL and PROTE&#205;NAS are closely related in the context of nutritional support for patients, particularly those with metabolic disorders. Proteins are an essential component of enteral nutrition, playing a crucial role in maintaining glucose levels in these patients. Nutritional support through enteral feeding prominently includes proteins as a key element, highlighting their importance in ensuring adequate nutrition and metabolic stability.</data>
      <data key="d10">658ee56030a35ceeeec05d15cfa49842,aea37ea74c52c952285b3ae7db228572</data>
      <data key="d11">3187432b302547e6aca8ddc982d6f845</data>
