    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="DIABETES">
      <data key="d8">13.0</data>
      <data key="d9">NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL and DIABETES are closely related in the context of nutritional management. Nutritional formulas specifically designed for managing diabetes play a crucial role in this process. These formulas are tailored to meet the dietary needs of individuals with diabetes, ensuring that their nutritional requirements are adequately addressed. Additionally, enteral nutrition is often utilized as a method to provide nutritional support for those managing diabetes, further emphasizing the importance of specialized nutritional strategies in this health condition.</data>
      <data key="d10">aea37ea74c52c952285b3ae7db228572,d3dab2869ed103bbf74ecb1a4a822567</data>
      <data key="d11">52cc12400f974871b7b877b4bec05f1a</data>
      <data key="d12">2609</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="INSUFICIENCIA RENAL">
      <data key="d8">14.0</data>
      <data key="d9">NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL is essential for patients suffering from INSUFICIENCIA RENAL, particularly those experiencing acute renal failure who are unable to maintain adequate nutritional intake. Specialized nutritional formulas are specifically designed to manage the dietary needs of individuals with renal insufficiency, ensuring they receive the necessary nutrients while considering their condition.</data>
      <data key="d10">aea37ea74c52c952285b3ae7db228572,e321db63d9b561eb98a4f01853b141ad</data>
      <data key="d11">5c78634613174a9db6648fd268c6717a</data>
