    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="TRIGLIC&#201;RIDOS DE CADENA MEDIA">
      <data key="d8">13.0</data>
      <data key="d9">NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL involves the use of TRIGLIC&#201;RIDOS DE CADENA MEDIA, which are utilized to ensure an adequate supply of nutrients for patients with dietary restrictions. These medium-chain triglycerides serve a dual purpose in enteral nutrition: they provide essential nutrients and offer a quick source of energy, making them particularly beneficial for individuals who may have difficulty absorbing other forms of fat.</data>
