    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="COMPLICACIONES">
      <data key="d8">3.0</data>
      <data key="d9">NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL refers to a method of providing nutrition directly to the gastrointestinal tract, often used in patients who are unable to consume food orally. However, this approach can lead to various COMPLICACIONES, or complications, that necessitate careful monitoring and intervention. These complications can arise particularly in pediatric patients receiving enteral nutrition, highlighting the need for vigilance in this demographic. Overall, complications associated with enteral nutrition can significantly impact the health of patients, underscoring the importance of addressing and managing these issues effectively during treatment.</data>
      <data key="d10">029b25f481d41458f45f1711f98c970f,3c6db755168f2fea94b2535a81ce6f58,6a5102072d17111dafe768ab7d38f41a</data>
      <data key="d11">84ba1e4274364f73a331a81a7eb44c8f</data>
      <data key="d12">2624</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="SONDA ENTERAL">
      <data key="d8">25.0</data>
      <data key="d9">NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL refers to the method of providing nutrition to patients who are unable to consume food orally. This is accomplished through the use of a SONDA ENTERAL, which is a feeding tube specifically designed for this purpose. The SONDA ENTERAL serves as the means by which nutrici&#243;n enteral is administered, ensuring that patients receive the necessary nutrients directly into their digestive system.</data>
      <data key="d10">0e014859b304da60c29590e36c9cbc85,52a0434694f8face489cdb4c8d206a9e,5d4476c2c40af44f9d54628af0ac463d</data>
      <data key="d11">37861651c2ec4ac295b2ff401102750d</data>
      <data key="d12">2625</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="SONDA">
      <data key="d8">19.0</data>
      <data key="d9">NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL se refiere al proceso de proporcionar nutrientes directamente al cuerpo a trav&#233;s de un dispositivo especializado. En este contexto, la SONDA es el medio a trav&#233;s del cual se administra la nutrici&#243;n enteral a los pacientes que no pueden alimentarse por v&#237;a oral. La SONDA es un dispositivo esencial para esta administraci&#243;n, permitiendo que los nutrientes sean entregados directamente a los pacientes, asegurando as&#237; que reciban la nutrici&#243;n necesaria para su salud y bienestar. En resumen, la SONDA juega un papel crucial en la nutrici&#243;n enteral, facilitando la entrega de nutrientes a aquellos que requieren este tipo de soporte alimentario.</data>
      <data key="d10">029b25f481d41458f45f1711f98c970f,6a5102072d17111dafe768ab7d38f41a,820640c45c3a696fca3c8c45b680b19b,c78e1786c296e2b8a7ad428c0fb10c36</data>
      <data key="d11">241182dfa219432da38451c7b0b0c5a2</data>
      <data key="d12">2626</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="SNG">
      <data key="d8">31.0</data>
      <data key="d9">NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL refers to the provision of nutrition through the gastrointestinal tract, typically in patients who are unable to consume food orally. The SNG, or sonda nasog&#225;strica, is a medical device specifically designed for this purpose. It is utilized to administer enteral nutrition to patients who cannot initiate oral intake or who are unable to feed themselves through normal means. The SNG is commonly employed in clinical settings to ensure that patients receive the necessary nutrients when oral feeding is not feasible.</data>
      <data key="d10">140611dbb8a68fc40712c946de92b73f,395385fad73fd5b7ed9eda114b482624,417548e99612a123d61f9fd10807ce34,838b9736f0199a50d032077e4b74cbc6</data>
      <data key="d11">e8a7b5cec8f54dfda179a91e5a680778</data>
      <data key="d12">2627</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
