      <data key="d9">Hepatopathy often requires enteral nutrition when oral intake is insufficient</data>
      <data key="d10">20491afa9a4770e93e6cff9034f8b0f0</data>
      <data key="d11">f65709d014614b029391bff92153f842</data>
      <data key="d12">2645</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="SUPLEMENTOS ORALES">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL refers to a method of providing nutrition directly to the gastrointestinal tract, often through a tube. This approach includes the use of SUPLEMENTOS ORALES, which are oral supplements designed to complement nutritional intake. These oral supplements are frequently utilized alongside enteral nutrition to help meet caloric and nutritional needs, ensuring that individuals receive adequate nourishment.</data>
      <data key="d10">20491afa9a4770e93e6cff9034f8b0f0,7e1b90e2c8714b39e283be229f6d5de3</data>
      <data key="d11">47325d5dba9a43db9a534ed96948acd8</data>
      <data key="d12">2646</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
