      <data key="d8">5.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Hyperproteic formulas are used in enteral nutrition for patients with increased protein needs</data>
      <data key="d10">20491afa9a4770e93e6cff9034f8b0f0</data>
      <data key="d11">b7ed982841d44c11af66814ac9b97923</data>
      <data key="d12">2649</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="AACR">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Amino acids of branched-chain are used in enteral nutrition for patients with liver disease</data>
      <data key="d10">20491afa9a4770e93e6cff9034f8b0f0</data>
      <data key="d11">55163b80b7bf40b28f76ac36d794ddb7</data>
      <data key="d12">2650</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="TRASPLANTE HEP&#193;TICO">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Nutritional support, including enteral nutrition, is critical for patients undergoing liver transplantation</data>
      <data key="d10">b86f20e3d8bb0128635881d88ba6bdfa</data>
      <data key="d11">d4c1f6744f3f4219adaf13b5a5d4430b</data>
      <data key="d12">2651</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="GASTROPARESIA DIAB&#201;TICA">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Gastroparesis complicates enteral nutrition in diabetic patients, requiring tailored feeding strategies</data>
      <data key="d10">d3dab2869ed103bbf74ecb1a4a822567</data>
      <data key="d11">9b7b1910937b4d85ad574b26b5a8e4ce</data>
      <data key="d12">2652</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="DIARREA">
      <data key="d8">28.0</data>
      <data key="d9">NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL and DIARREA are closely related, as diarrhea is a frequent complication that can arise in patients receiving enteral nutrition. This condition can indicate incompatibilities between medications and enteral nutrition, highlighting the need for careful management. Diarrhea not only serves as a symptom but also poses a risk to the nutritional status of patients, potentially affecting their overall health. Therefore, it is essential to monitor and address diarrhea in individuals undergoing enteral nutrition to ensure their well-being and nutritional adequacy.</data>
      <data key="d10">0bdc356a46149def2545e7939372c20d,6a5102072d17111dafe768ab7d38f41a,d3dab2869ed103bbf74ecb1a4a822567,e7a9d9aa3031b4c032d724047f80ebe9,fc664efd4e1c463dc21857e596b68b46</data>
      <data key="d11">493a7e1b8de34ef2bd089411035d39cd</data>
      <data key="d12">2653</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="ESTRE&#209;IMIENTO">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL and ESTRE&#209;IMIENTO are closely related, particularly in the context of patients receiving enteral nutrition. Constipation is a common issue that frequently arises in these patients, often necessitating dietary adjustments to manage the condition effectively. The challenges associated with constipation in this population highlight the importance of understanding enteral nutrition practices, as they can significantly influence bowel health. Overall, constipation is recognized as a prevalent complication for individuals on enteral nutrition, underscoring the need for careful dietary planning and management.</data>
      <data key="d10">09e9623b3facc5045e80541b1cd2cada,0bdc356a46149def2545e7939372c20d,d3dab2869ed103bbf74ecb1a4a822567</data>
      <data key="d11">4bb137baa75f45b788cc343d822e1bef</data>
      <data key="d12">2654</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="M&#201;TODOS DE ADMINISTRACI&#211;N">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Los m&#233;todos de administraci&#243;n son esenciales para la correcta implementaci&#243;n de la nutrici&#243;n enteral en pacientes</data>
      <data key="d10">2ad1c3591301bd2ea6f99c3782714d69</data>
      <data key="d11">c2888fd78e8d4467a1c75ee648596f09</data>
      <data key="d12">2655</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="PEDIATR&#205;A">
      <data key="d8">15.0</data>
      <data key="d9">NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL es un aspecto crucial dentro de la PEDIATR&#205;A, ya que se utiliza para tratar a pacientes pedi&#225;tricos que presentan necesidades nutricionales especiales. Este m&#233;todo se emplea para alimentar a ni&#241;os que no pueden alimentarse por s&#237; mismos, asegurando que reciban los nutrientes necesarios para su crecimiento y desarrollo.</data>
      <data key="d10">029b25f481d41458f45f1711f98c970f,29b85b34282f79a12349b7e1d967b1a7</data>
      <data key="d11">35eb769d78ac45139d930f1a28cf90a8</data>
      <data key="d12">2656</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="F&#211;RMULAS COMPLETAS">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Las f&#243;rmulas completas son un tipo de preparaci&#243;n utilizada en la nutrici&#243;n enteral para asegurar un aporte nutricional adecuado.</data>
      <data key="d10">029b25f481d41458f45f1711f98c970f</data>
      <data key="d11">5d9d5fb4811241acb18861940f1036eb</data>
      <data key="d12">2657</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="TABLA 1">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La Tabla 1 proporciona informaci&#243;n sobre las indicaciones cl&#237;nicas de la nutrici&#243;n enteral, lo que es relevante para su aplicaci&#243;n en pediatr&#237;a.</data>
      <data key="d10">029b25f481d41458f45f1711f98c970f</data>
      <data key="d11">04edac435daa4f7f9e11103cf7d6b087</data>
      <data key="d12">2658</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="F&#211;RMULAS POLIM&#201;RICAS">
      <data key="d8">28.0</data>
      <data key="d9">NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL se refiere a la administraci&#243;n de nutrientes directamente en el tracto gastrointestinal, y dentro de este contexto, las F&#211;RMULAS POLIM&#201;RICAS son un tipo espec&#237;fico de preparaci&#243;n utilizada. Estas f&#243;rmulas est&#225;n dise&#241;adas para pacientes que tienen una funci&#243;n gastrointestinal adecuada, lo que significa que pueden absorber y digerir los nutrientes sin problemas. En resumen, las f&#243;rmulas polim&#233;ricas son productos utilizados en la nutrici&#243;n enteral, especialmente indicadas para aquellos pacientes que no presentan dificultades en la absorci&#243;n o digesti&#243;n de los alimentos.</data>
      <data key="d10">029b25f481d41458f45f1711f98c970f,0a844e2dc679c0578ba4bdeda742c2eb,2def4be9506db96f8bdfe9e3ba6f9b6f,69de439cf1f8310eaa37927a74d94c6b</data>
      <data key="d11">69177fa777114c03ab3bcebe1e0eb690</data>
      <data key="d12">2659</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="F&#211;RMULAS OLIGOM&#201;RICAS">
      <data key="d8">19.0</data>
      <data key="d9">NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL refers to a method of providing nutrition directly to the gastrointestinal tract, typically through a feeding tube. Within this context, F&#211;RMULAS OLIGOM&#201;RICAS, or oligomeric formulas, are specifically designed for patients who experience difficulties with digestion or absorption. These formulas are particularly beneficial for individuals with various digestive issues, as they are easier to digest and absorb compared to standard formulas. Overall, oligomeric formulas serve as a vital component of enteral nutrition, offering essential nutritional support to patients with compromised digestive function.</data>
      <data key="d10">029b25f481d41458f45f1711f98c970f,69de439cf1f8310eaa37927a74d94c6b,d028f23d86d7ed32eebe35c5d90765f2</data>
      <data key="d11">316d94a989024dfc801a0670727e2b6d</data>
      <data key="d12">2660</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="F&#211;RMULAS ELEMENTALES">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Las f&#243;rmulas elementales son un tipo de nutrici&#243;n enteral indicada para casos digestivos severos.</data>
      <data key="d10">029b25f481d41458f45f1711f98c970f</data>
      <data key="d11">772df108f7d04d53af7e7b8892d14428</data>
      <data key="d12">2661</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="F&#211;RMULAS HIPOCAL&#211;RICAS">
      <data key="d8">4.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Las f&#243;rmulas hipocal&#243;ricas no son recomendadas en pediatr&#237;a, pero son parte de las opciones de nutrici&#243;n enteral.</data>
      <data key="d10">029b25f481d41458f45f1711f98c970f</data>
      <data key="d11">7bfb3042f8e8427d8a00f435c1b22d5e</data>
      <data key="d12">2662</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="F&#211;RMULAS NORMOCAL&#211;RICAS">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Las f&#243;rmulas normocal&#243;ricas son com&#250;nmente utilizadas en la nutrici&#243;n enteral pedi&#225;trica.</data>
      <data key="d10">029b25f481d41458f45f1711f98c970f</data>
      <data key="d11">91f9922bf47a42df84dada0c0511db0e</data>
      <data key="d12">2663</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="F&#211;RMULAS HIPERCAL&#211;RICAS">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Las f&#243;rmulas hipercal&#243;ricas son utilizadas en la nutrici&#243;n enteral para pacientes con necesidades cal&#243;ricas aumentadas.</data>
      <data key="d10">029b25f481d41458f45f1711f98c970f</data>
      <data key="d11">b8f5c09363064b01a7e3e8e44e3286dd</data>
      <data key="d12">2664</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="SONDAS G&#193;STRICAS Y YEYUNALES">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Las sondas g&#225;stricas y yeyunales son esenciales para la administraci&#243;n de nutrici&#243;n enteral.</data>
      <data key="d10">e4019011dbf10f2c4b73d33215d7631d</data>
      <data key="d11">8633fbaa46bb4bdcbb2f385eabeaf9d8</data>
      <data key="d12">2665</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="VACIAMIENTO G&#193;STRICO">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">El vaciamiento g&#225;strico adecuado es crucial para la administraci&#243;n efectiva de nutrici&#243;n enteral.</data>
      <data key="d10">e4019011dbf10f2c4b73d33215d7631d</data>
      <data key="d11">07804e170e814ea4a1e06ce0a0ba8072</data>
      <data key="d12">2666</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="RETINOPAT&#205;A DE LA PREMATURIDAD">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Proper enteral nutrition can help reduce the incidence of retinopathy of prematurity in infants</data>
      <data key="d10">a00805212febe78884955ddd3476f6ca</data>
      <data key="d11">96a6063dd7d5441b83cd586cf0c738f5</data>
      <data key="d12">2667</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="ALIMENTOS">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL refers to the practice of providing dietary needs through the digestive system using foods or specialized formulas. This method is particularly important for individuals who have difficulties swallowing, as it involves administering specialized food textures designed to meet their nutritional requirements. ALIMENTOS, or foods, play a crucial role in this process, as they are the primary components used in enteral nutrition to ensure that patients receive adequate nourishment despite their swallowing challenges.</data>
      <data key="d10">1870ba6878c109f3023c9d15d0fa784b,42cc35e2edb450d48bb31f7c51b7a02f</data>
      <data key="d11">1942b827c94e4ff3a815c306127be0c5</data>
      <data key="d12">2668</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="HOSPITAL MALNUTRITION">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Nutritional interventions like enteral nutrition are critical in managing hospital malnutrition for patients unable to consume food orally.</data>
      <data key="d10">d80f1e55925e0ce0cd958e35ad2e49ff</data>
      <data key="d11">b4911082ec4f4abba8aa5bdd7c969b8f</data>
      <data key="d12">2669</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="RECOMENDACIONES DIET&#201;TICAS">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Las f&#243;rmulas de nutrici&#243;n enteral deben cumplir con las recomendaciones diet&#233;ticas para asegurar que cubren las necesidades nutricionales del paciente</data>
      <data key="d10">285343ba92b89a1761b72d9d789ba8f6</data>
      <data key="d11">be1506fcd5d540d08739d7831cfe12d5</data>
      <data key="d12">2670</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="INGESTAS DIET&#201;TICAS DE REFERENCIA">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The IDR provides guidelines that include recommendations for enteral nutrition</data>
      <data key="d10">1870ba6878c109f3023c9d15d0fa784b</data>
      <data key="d11">a48497697b0944bcb9570303772d801f</data>
      <data key="d12">2671</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="CU&#201;LLAR OLMEDO LA">
      <data key="d8">12.0</data>
      <data key="d9">NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL is a field of study that focuses on providing nutrition to individuals who cannot consume food orally. Cu&#233;llar Olmedo LA is an author who has made significant contributions to this area by writing extensively about enteral nutrition. Through their work, Cu&#233;llar Olmedo LA has enhanced the understanding and knowledge surrounding the practices and principles of enteral nutrition.</data>
      <data key="d10">1870ba6878c109f3023c9d15d0fa784b,76bdd5f53571ff68dd1e439219572347</data>
      <data key="d11">6d08721db3274fae8c46af5a7b71f437</data>
      <data key="d12">2672</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
