      <data key="d8">12.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Cordero Vaquero AA is an author who has made significant contributions to the field of enteral nutrition. Through their writings, Cordero Vaquero AA has enhanced the understanding and knowledge surrounding this important area of nutrition.</data>
      <data key="d10">1870ba6878c109f3023c9d15d0fa784b,76bdd5f53571ff68dd1e439219572347</data>
      <data key="d11">de01ea2b9dd64731aafcdad3c2c841bb</data>
