    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="F&#211;RMULAS ESPEC&#205;FICAS">
      <data key="d8">15.0</data>
      <data key="d9">NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL encompasses various methods of providing nutrition directly to the gastrointestinal tract, and within this field, F&#211;RMULAS ESPEC&#205;FICAS play a crucial role. These specific formulas are designed to meet the unique dietary needs of individuals with particular health conditions, ensuring that their nutritional requirements are adequately addressed. Thus, F&#211;RMULAS ESPEC&#205;FICAS are a vital component of NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL, tailored to support the health and recovery of patients with specific medical needs.</data>
      <data key="d10">0a844e2dc679c0578ba4bdeda742c2eb,d028f23d86d7ed32eebe35c5d90765f2</data>
      <data key="d11">027bad0418994b07a0fec64c27ec90b2</data>
      <data key="d12">2685</data>
