    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="DUODENOPANCREATECTOM&#205;A">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La nutrici&#243;n enteral se recomienda para pacientes que se someten a duodenopancreatectom&#237;a para asegurar un aporte adecuado de nutrientes postoperatorios</data>
      <data key="d10">3ee948dc4ddfdc75daa8fe7db9bb471e</data>
      <data key="d11">a20fd2eb2fef49ad8d89e4ecc8e2d3fc</data>
      <data key="d12">2689</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="MALNUTRICI&#211;N">
      <data key="d8">15.0</data>
      <data key="d9">NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL is a medical intervention that is frequently employed to address MALNUTRICI&#211;N, particularly in patients who are unable to consume food orally. This form of nutrition is especially recommended for patients experiencing malnutrition who are undergoing surgical procedures. By providing essential nutrients directly into the gastrointestinal tract, enteral nutrition plays a crucial role in the management and treatment of malnutrition in various clinical settings.</data>
      <data key="d10">3ee948dc4ddfdc75daa8fe7db9bb471e,9da930839072b524410f2345ab1df8b1</data>
      <data key="d11">27ee440b62ed4c59b1df3f0dee50447e</data>
      <data key="d12">2690</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="OLVEIRA ET AL.">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Olveira et al. studied the prevalence of enteral nutrition in hospitalized patients, particularly those with diabetes</data>
      <data key="d10">1ba0aa1d1330351a62eb6319ffdd30db</data>
      <data key="d11">18c7adb0444740f6987ef3da102d7812</data>
      <data key="d12">2691</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="GERIATRIC RESIDENCE">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Geriatric residences implement enteral nutrition protocols for elderly patients who require nutritional support</data>
      <data key="d10">1ba0aa1d1330351a62eb6319ffdd30db</data>
      <data key="d11">85ba493c72554110ad1cda106880dca4</data>
      <data key="d12">2692</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="S&#205;NDROME DE MELAS">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Enteral nutrition is critical for patients with MELAS to improve their nutritional status and manage complications like diabetes.</data>
      <data key="d10">8b074745f27ee51afc8337a49fafacfa</data>
      <data key="d11">b1bb33b0f67d4533ac78d41068768e3b</data>
      <data key="d12">2693</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="CIRUG&#205;A DIGESTIVA">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Nutrici&#243;n enteral is recommended for patients undergoing cirug&#237;a digestiva when the gastrointestinal tract is functioning</data>
      <data key="d10">3dfc700a2eaec232c05b0a53f2089229</data>
      <data key="d11">789ee4fd145b47d2bf3ad23bc7d9ce7c</data>
      <data key="d12">2694</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL (NE)">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Nutritional support through enteral means is critical for managing patients with acute pancreatitis</data>
      <data key="d10">57d361381e6ea4ddbc948891f9645009</data>
      <data key="d11">cfe6080e333e4c3e9fd0b0dd1e70bced</data>
      <data key="d12">2695</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="APACHE II">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Una puntuaci&#243;n mayor o igual a 10 en el &#237;ndice APACHE II indica que los pacientes son candidatos para recibir nutrici&#243;n enteral.</data>
      <data key="d10">5d4476c2c40af44f9d54628af0ac463d</data>
      <data key="d11">2125387e85504f16a02aaa2509227bff</data>
      <data key="d12">2696</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="CRITERIOS DE RANSON">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La presencia de al menos 3 criterios de Ranson en pacientes con pancreatitis grave sugiere que la nutrici&#243;n enteral puede influir en la evoluci&#243;n cl&#237;nica.</data>
      <data key="d10">5d4476c2c40af44f9d54628af0ac463d</data>
      <data key="d11">a05e9b05932243b5a01c17acf13c0f60</data>
      <data key="d12">2697</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="UCI">
      <data key="d8">2.0</data>
      <data key="d9">NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL es un enfoque terap&#233;utico que se utiliza frecuentemente en la UCI (Unidad de Cuidados Intensivos) para mejorar el estado nutricional de los pacientes cr&#237;ticos. Este tipo de nutrici&#243;n puede ser especialmente beneficioso para aquellos pacientes que padecen condiciones graves, como la pancreatitis, ya que su administraci&#243;n puede contribuir a una mejor evoluci&#243;n cl&#237;nica. Adem&#225;s, se ha observado que la nutrici&#243;n enteral puede reducir la duraci&#243;n de la estancia en la UCI, lo que resalta su importancia en el manejo de pacientes en estado cr&#237;tico.</data>
      <data key="d10">27b65be3bda292c9c26dfd7a87e74752,5d4476c2c40af44f9d54628af0ac463d</data>
      <data key="d11">d7eb1bba38dc49748c14d60f07c693b5</data>
      <data key="d12">2698</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="HOSPITAL UNIVERSITARIO DE SAN JUAN">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Enteral nutrition was provided to the patient during her stay at the Hospital Universitario de San Juan</data>
      <data key="d10">bc381304b682e075c7356c6edbfb0c2d</data>
      <data key="d11">1931ef6154ef4fb99fbf43676f9f2e60</data>
      <data key="d12">2699</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="FLUIDOTERAPIA ENDOVENOSA">
      <data key="d8">4.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The patient received both enteral nutrition and intravenous fluid therapy as part of her treatment</data>
      <data key="d10">bc381304b682e075c7356c6edbfb0c2d</data>
      <data key="d11">e6d6d6faa3034954939130ab5e19bcd5</data>
      <data key="d12">2700</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="DIABETES MELLITUS TIPO 2">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La diabetes mellitus tipo 2 requiere un ajuste cuidadoso de la nutrici&#243;n enteral para controlar los niveles de glucosa en sangre</data>
      <data key="d10">e474ebdcd3e5392e4b2bed8434293849</data>
      <data key="d11">43d3759900ef41da9a9c2bd5489a5da8</data>
      <data key="d12">2701</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="SUPLEMENTOS NUTRICIONALES ORALES">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La nutrici&#243;n enteral puede complementarse con suplementos nutricionales orales para cubrir los requerimientos del paciente</data>
      <data key="d10">e474ebdcd3e5392e4b2bed8434293849</data>
      <data key="d11">406a77454f024c5bafa90aa420be3b7c</data>
      <data key="d12">2702</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="PEG">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL is a method of providing essential nutrients directly to individuals who may have difficulty consuming food orally. This process is often implemented through the placement of a gastrostom&#237;a percut&#225;nea endosc&#243;pica (PEG), which is a technique that facilitates the delivery of nutrition directly into the stomach. The PEG procedure ensures that patients receive adequate nutrient intake, thereby supporting their overall health and well-being.</data>
      <data key="d10">9c43759c41fe226a2702de300b9e580a,a089d87928ddde83e1945eece488d3f5</data>
      <data key="d11">7382571f4ca74aa59becd2680683d86c</data>
      <data key="d12">2703</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="DESNUTRICI&#211;N MODERADA">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Enteral nutrition is being implemented to address the patient's moderate malnutrition</data>
      <data key="d10">c92ceeeeae88c8288176cbfd00c75e17</data>
      <data key="d11">44e6ceab817d4fc5b7e0b7738b932a5a</data>
      <data key="d12">2704</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="SONDA DE GASTROYEYUNOSTOM&#205;A">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La sonda de gastroyeyunostom&#237;a se utiliza para administrar nutrici&#243;n enteral al paciente</data>
      <data key="d10">82d36ebbaaa026c713df2b7a47253efa</data>
      <data key="d11">14724f6c9c3d4619a32963b1178d150e</data>
      <data key="d12">2705</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="SONDA DE GASTROSTOM&#205;A">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La sonda de gastrostom&#237;a es otra opci&#243;n para la nutrici&#243;n enteral del paciente, utilizada cuando la sonda de gastroyeyunostom&#237;a no es efectiva</data>
      <data key="d10">82d36ebbaaa026c713df2b7a47253efa</data>
      <data key="d11">aba4e6ba5dad4e2aa0b183601410c4ac</data>
      <data key="d12">2706</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="F&#211;RMULA DE NUTRICI&#211;N">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Nutritional formulas are essential components of enteral nutrition for patients</data>
      <data key="d10">3a5d7e4dc412f1d4701672c3af3cb4ed</data>
      <data key="d11">b2348fc1e71f4b459cfc9e3cd9d16edf</data>
      <data key="d12">2707</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="DIETA SEMIBLANDA">
      <data key="d8">5.0</data>
      <data key="d9">If a patient has poor tolerance to dieta semiblanda, nutrici&#243;n enteral may be required</data>
      <data key="d10">4b19145e0977ee48b7132c9915d8c284</data>
      <data key="d11">936d4feafcb14fb49f054e7714f8d058</data>
      <data key="d12">2708</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="HEPATOPAT&#205;A CR&#211;NICA">
      <data key="d8">14.0</data>
      <data key="d9">NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL is a crucial aspect of care for patients suffering from HEPATOPAT&#205;A CR&#211;NICA, particularly for those who are unable to ingest food orally. Enteral nutrition provides the necessary nutrients to support these patients' health and well-being when they cannot adequately feed themselves. This form of nutrition is essential in managing the dietary needs of individuals with chronic liver disease, ensuring they receive the sustenance required for their condition.</data>
      <data key="d10">5b88c6556b90149ce0c0cea0bead7448,d59761afc53676cf5d1fe62616f0d7d7</data>
      <data key="d11">75d7a944420a40dda24c0a1375de0fa1</data>
      <data key="d12">2709</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="CIRUG&#205;A BARI&#193;TRICA">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La nutrici&#243;n enteral puede ser utilizada en el seguimiento postoperatorio de pacientes que se han sometido a cirug&#237;a bari&#225;trica</data>
      <data key="d10">de5f304890ba39f7c9e3d5c0201bc247</data>
      <data key="d11">58dd82692f0948cd9a1092a004f50f38</data>
      <data key="d12">2710</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="F&#211;RMULAS RICAS EN GRASA">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Fat-rich formulas are a specific type of enteral nutrition designed for diabetic patients</data>
      <data key="d10">8d1eb00b23450a2f2cb1243ea32aa36f</data>
      <data key="d11">7bc0e709fcb747738dfc0b03f2acada1</data>
      <data key="d12">2711</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="GSDI">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Enteral nutrition is often utilized in GSDI management to ensure adequate nutrient intake, especially at night.</data>
      <data key="d10">ae68887594ec21900691a1100f61b43e</data>
      <data key="d11">dc9513c01d9348b69efc3cec287ba14e</data>
      <data key="d12">2712</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="ALMID&#211;N DE MA&#205;Z">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">El almid&#243;n de ma&#237;z se utiliza en la nutrici&#243;n enteral para proporcionar carbohidratos y mantener los niveles de glucosa en sangre.</data>
      <data key="d10">658ee56030a35ceeeec05d15cfa49842</data>
      <data key="d11">f9a252010b5548c7b9b6556c463ddf8f</data>
      <data key="d12">2713</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="L&#205;PIDOS">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Los l&#237;pidos deben ser parte de una dieta equilibrada en la nutrici&#243;n enteral, contribuyendo a un perfil cardiosaludable.</data>
      <data key="d10">658ee56030a35ceeeec05d15cfa49842</data>
      <data key="d11">016d88b43e51482b90ceef5d838e5de8</data>
      <data key="d12">2714</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="FODMAP">
      <data key="d8">5.0</data>
      <data key="d9">FODMAPs can affect patients receiving nutrici&#243;n enteral, potentially leading to diarrhea</data>
      <data key="d10">6c98e1347f14c72617198a910cf8c246</data>
      <data key="d11">2598b7f4c19b481c96bea2aa61e6f0cc</data>
      <data key="d12">2715</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="INSUFICIENCIA RENAL AGUDA">
      <data key="d8">13.0</data>
      <data key="d9">NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL is an essential component in the management of patients suffering from INSUFICIENCIA RENAL AGUDA. It is particularly recommended for those individuals who are unable to adequately consume food orally. Enteral nutrition plays a crucial role in supporting the nutritional needs of these patients, ensuring they receive the necessary nutrients during their treatment for acute renal failure.</data>
      <data key="d10">532561f62a972376f3f898b265623fc0,9f77fc213da2123b013166c181a60323</data>
      <data key="d11">4807dbf4257a49a6b08286be1a28e9f9</data>
      <data key="d12">2716</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="FALLO RENAL AGUDO">
      <data key="d8">16.0</data>
      <data key="d9">NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL is essential for patients suffering from FALLO RENAL AGUDO, particularly for those who are unable to maintain adequate dietary intake. Nutritional support through enteral nutrition plays a crucial role in the management of acute renal failure, ensuring that these patients receive the necessary nutrients to support their health and recovery.</data>
      <data key="d10">665d7ba0d30bda94b0d549dc1822d7f7,e321db63d9b561eb98a4f01853b141ad</data>
      <data key="d11">3a47b59207ac4c3ab5eab5fb1ab9ef54</data>
      <data key="d12">2717</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="VITAMINA A">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Vitamin A levels need to be monitored in patients receiving enteral nutrition to prevent overdose</data>
      <data key="d10">665d7ba0d30bda94b0d549dc1822d7f7</data>
      <data key="d11">ae9ccde212664a81a801f25a61cacc2a</data>
      <data key="d12">2718</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="VITAMINA C">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Vitamin C levels must be monitored in patients receiving enteral nutrition to avoid toxicity</data>
      <data key="d10">665d7ba0d30bda94b0d549dc1822d7f7</data>
      <data key="d11">e40dbc32c202451ab45a0ea506bf97dc</data>
      <data key="d12">2719</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="SODIO">
      <data key="d8">5.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Sodium intake must be monitored in patients receiving enteral nutrition</data>
      <data key="d10">c947e3441a061fe1807f7aaf29becdce</data>
      <data key="d11">1d6d3551fe894dcba6650363815e3a36</data>
      <data key="d12">2720</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="POTASIO">
      <data key="d8">5.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Potassium intake must be monitored in patients receiving enteral nutrition</data>
      <data key="d10">c947e3441a061fe1807f7aaf29becdce</data>
      <data key="d11">f240b72ba42442d8b62318a8adf49529</data>
      <data key="d12">2721</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="HIERRO">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Iron supplementation may be necessary for patients receiving enteral nutrition and erythropoietin</data>
      <data key="d10">c947e3441a061fe1807f7aaf29becdce</data>
      <data key="d11">d6b5da0a7cf24f71bc05433392abf89b</data>
      <data key="d12">2722</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="LIPIDOS">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Lipid intake must be adjusted in enteral nutrition for patients with renal insufficiency</data>
      <data key="d10">c947e3441a061fe1807f7aaf29becdce</data>
      <data key="d11">8a0bec4f9e0e4f5fa6eda59433ff70cc</data>
      <data key="d12">2723</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="HIDRATOS DE CARBONO">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Carbohydrates are emphasized in enteral nutrition for patients with renal insufficiency</data>
      <data key="d10">c947e3441a061fe1807f7aaf29becdce</data>
      <data key="d11">830630c2134c43289cb9fb11b939bb77</data>
      <data key="d12">2724</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="GLUCOGENOSIS TIPO I">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Nutritional therapy through enteral feeding is crucial for managing glucogenosis tipo I</data>
      <data key="d10">28633689bf0b9bc990e61fb26722ce16</data>
      <data key="d11">c2de2b399ec049389c48152433eaab76</data>
      <data key="d12">2725</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="TRASTORNOS METAB&#211;LICOS">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La nutrici&#243;n enteral puede ser necesaria en el tratamiento de trastornos metab&#243;licos graves</data>
      <data key="d10">2f96bbc5eafd39b659620da7282a2079</data>
      <data key="d11">e511468254db4027ad3240e342ee7f8f</data>
      <data key="d12">2726</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="ASCITIS QUILOSA">
      <data key="d8">12.0</data>
      <data key="d9">NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL is a form of nutritional support that may be necessary for patients suffering from ASCITIS QUILOSA. This condition involves the accumulation of fluid in the abdominal cavity, which can complicate nutrient intake. Enteral nutrition can be utilized in the treatment of ASCITIS QUILOSA to ensure that patients receive adequate nutrients, thereby improving their nutritional status despite the challenges posed by fluid accumulation.</data>
      <data key="d10">6bbb4df989ed7353f621a7d44dbc7972,9927d054458e409309b9e917cbb6a10c</data>
      <data key="d11">8e5c34a7892b4394a8c332567bd01525</data>
      <data key="d12">2727</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="QUILOT&#211;RAX">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La nutrici&#243;n enteral se recomienda como tratamiento para pacientes con quilot&#243;rax que no pueden alimentarse por v&#237;a oral</data>
      <data key="d10">9927d054458e409309b9e917cbb6a10c</data>
      <data key="d11">eca9656afb3f4d6f940b71b94ce0ec75</data>
      <data key="d12">2728</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="F&#205;STULAS DEL CONDUCTO TOR&#193;CICO">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Las f&#237;stulas del conducto tor&#225;cico pueden ser tratadas con nutrici&#243;n enteral para asegurar un aporte adecuado de nutrientes</data>
      <data key="d10">9927d054458e409309b9e917cbb6a10c</data>
      <data key="d11">32f8192242414bbdbfd1dad35b9c6ffb</data>
      <data key="d12">2729</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="DANE">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">DANE is a complication associated with enteral nutrition, indicating a direct relationship</data>
      <data key="d10">0bdc356a46149def2545e7939372c20d</data>
      <data key="d11">15c49370eb1f4657b13bacfc3b777ef6</data>
      <data key="d12">2730</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="ASPEN">
      <data key="d8">26.0</data>
      <data key="d9">NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL is a field that is significantly influenced by the guidelines developed by ASPEN (the American Society for Parenteral and Enteral Nutrition). ASPEN creates comprehensive guidelines for enteral nutrition that are applicable to both adult and pediatric patients. These guidelines include specific recommendations for the use of enteral nutrition in various clinical scenarios, such as in patients with pancreatitis and those requiring nutritional support following surgery. Additionally, ASPEN emphasizes the importance of specialized nutritional support for patients who need enteral nutrition, ensuring that their unique needs are met effectively.</data>
      <data key="d10">428ea9c156fe3f0571b20d5d81648868,7ea112a550fd775a80c3eda15663fba5,be7eb01a6daf673db6a127f66c79c96c,f087e20586f6b263059597e194a04993</data>
      <data key="d11">3b01ded1e30d49f78797705da1cb0f80</data>
      <data key="d12">2731</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="KALFARENTZOS">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Kalfarentzos realiz&#243; un estudio que demuestra la eficacia de la nutrici&#243;n enteral en comparaci&#243;n con otros m&#233;todos en pacientes con pancreatitis aguda</data>
      <data key="d10">be7eb01a6daf673db6a127f66c79c96c</data>
      <data key="d11">2082066ce508480da78a6670a66521f7</data>
      <data key="d12">2732</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="OLAH">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Olah realiz&#243; un estudio que respalda el uso de nutrici&#243;n enteral en pacientes con pancreatitis aguda</data>
      <data key="d10">be7eb01a6daf673db6a127f66c79c96c</data>
      <data key="d11">a23042d7cc39428083e2de61e2c0520f</data>
      <data key="d12">2733</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="ABOU-ASSI">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Abou-Assi realiz&#243; un estudio que compara la nutrici&#243;n enteral y parenteral en pacientes con pancreatitis aguda</data>
      <data key="d10">be7eb01a6daf673db6a127f66c79c96c</data>
      <data key="d11">b1f5162211a04de09ee348b76754de3b</data>
      <data key="d12">2734</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="INFECCIONES">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL es un enfoque nutricional que se ha demostrado eficaz en la reducci&#243;n del riesgo de infecciones en diversos contextos cl&#237;nicos. En particular, se ha observado que la nutrici&#243;n enteral precoz puede disminuir el riesgo de infecciones postquir&#250;rgicas en pacientes con c&#225;ncer g&#225;strico. Adem&#225;s, este tipo de nutrici&#243;n tambi&#233;n ha mostrado una reducci&#243;n en la incidencia de infecciones en pacientes que sufren de pancreatitis aguda. Por lo tanto, la implementaci&#243;n de la nutrici&#243;n enteral puede ser una estrategia valiosa para mejorar los resultados cl&#237;nicos y minimizar el riesgo de infecciones en estos grupos de pacientes.</data>
      <data key="d10">be7eb01a6daf673db6a127f66c79c96c,e34642244b0c7f309ab1c1be1e81da31</data>
      <data key="d11">76b73ec6ec2d4c519990ca7367f04de5</data>
      <data key="d12">2735</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="COLITIS ULCEROSA">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Enteral nutrition is recommended for patients with severe ulcerative colitis to manage symptoms and support recovery</data>
      <data key="d10">4ec3e8cb1f21808e70bbc71cb26d7396</data>
      <data key="d11">74c241bbb3e64bab858f5fb8ad3f0f19</data>
      <data key="d12">2736</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="CORTICOIDES">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Corticosteroids are often used alongside enteral nutrition to enhance treatment outcomes in inflammatory bowel diseases</data>
      <data key="d10">4ec3e8cb1f21808e70bbc71cb26d7396</data>
      <data key="d11">0573673967d5448ab0e17a9c1e64f702</data>
      <data key="d12">2737</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="ENFERMEDAD INFLAMATORIA INTESTINAL">
      <data key="d8">23.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La nutrici&#243;n enteral es un m&#233;todo de tratamiento utilizado para pacientes con enfermedad inflamatoria intestinal. Este enfoque puede mejorar la situaci&#243;n intestinal y facilitar la recuperaci&#243;n de estos pacientes. Adem&#225;s, la nutrici&#243;n enteral es especialmente importante en casos de enfermedad inflamatoria intestinal grave, ya que asegura una nutrici&#243;n adecuada, lo que es crucial para el manejo de la condici&#243;n.</data>
      <data key="d10">417548e99612a123d61f9fd10807ce34,6321383c8b1370699d20007624cd87c8,b1464c57df2eaa651a10c1522ab7db68</data>
      <data key="d11">60761739c35d41ef83f4c637e80471bf</data>
      <data key="d12">2738</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="ACEITES DE OLIVA">
      <data key="d8">5.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Los aceites de oliva son utilizados en dietas enterales polim&#233;ricas para pacientes con enfermedad inflamatoria intestinal</data>
      <data key="d10">417548e99612a123d61f9fd10807ce34</data>
      <data key="d11">6668d75df437423894ac03a845251ea3</data>
      <data key="d12">2739</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="CORTICOIDEO">
      <data key="d8">5.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La nutrici&#243;n enteral se recomienda en pacientes que est&#225;n recibiendo tratamiento corticoideo para enfermedades inflamatorias intestinales.</data>
      <data key="d10">b4580c82418cd4df97f400e183702858</data>
      <data key="d11">53a60f3a488345f7a48337e7408131c8</data>
      <data key="d12">2740</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="FALLO INTESTINAL AGUDO">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Nutrici&#243;n enteral is a treatment method considered for patients experiencing fallo intestinal agudo</data>
      <data key="d10">3d03390859575cc2ead8aa5f917d0066</data>
      <data key="d11">9d2a3894edc5461d90f4459a90c92b84</data>
      <data key="d12">2741</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="FALLO INTESTINAL">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Enteral nutrition is a treatment method for patients with intestinal failure</data>
      <data key="d10">d9948a6c321263db8a8d220a4d079379</data>
      <data key="d11">566ee2bb134443c7ae029ea71a6ab8b9</data>
      <data key="d12">2742</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="PACIENTES CON FALLA INTESTINAL">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Enteral nutrition is a critical method for providing nutrients to patients with intestinal failure</data>
      <data key="d10">f5a758425c5e471b0421d16558001d59</data>
      <data key="d11">f7cb4977050345748f470dd96999637a</data>
      <data key="d12">2743</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="POIC">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La nutrici&#243;n enteral es preferida en el manejo de la POIC cuando es posible, para evitar complicaciones asociadas a la nutrici&#243;n parenteral.</data>
      <data key="d10">eb8fe6b54f7eab9cbe7b90c53e7007ed</data>
      <data key="d11">068abb3a22644ef0b67a22deaab2c118</data>
      <data key="d12">2744</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="SOPORTE NUTRICIONAL POSTOPERATORIO">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL is a key component of SOPORTE NUTRICIONAL POSTOPERATORIO for recovery</data>
      <data key="d10">a089d87928ddde83e1945eece488d3f5</data>
      <data key="d11">fb0bead4d10449f8995cc18eba7ec528</data>
      <data key="d12">2745</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="SONDA NASOENTERAL">
      <data key="d8">24.0</data>
      <data key="d9">NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL refers to the method of providing nutrition directly to the gastrointestinal tract, typically through a tube, for patients who are unable to consume food orally. The SONDA NASOENTERAL, or nasoenteric tube, is specifically designed for this purpose. It is utilized to administer enteral nutrition to patients who cannot feed themselves through traditional means. Both descriptions emphasize the role of the nasoenteric tube in facilitating enteral nutrition for individuals with feeding difficulties.</data>
      <data key="d10">09e9623b3facc5045e80541b1cd2cada,838b9736f0199a50d032077e4b74cbc6,a089d87928ddde83e1945eece488d3f5</data>
      <data key="d11">e0c4be0ee0c44d90aed8f822790b09c9</data>
      <data key="d12">2746</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="GASTROSTOM&#205;A QUIR&#218;RGICA">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">GASTROSTOM&#205;A QUIR&#218;RGICA is a method for providing NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL</data>
      <data key="d10">a089d87928ddde83e1945eece488d3f5</data>
      <data key="d11">840555dd9b374ceba2738b5cccc9dab3</data>
      <data key="d12">2747</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="PEY">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">PEY is a technique used for providing NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL</data>
      <data key="d10">a089d87928ddde83e1945eece488d3f5</data>
      <data key="d11">32d878ed7278493c9795847a8320182f</data>
      <data key="d12">2748</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="GASTROSTOM&#205;A ENDOSC&#211;PICA PERCUT&#193;NEA">
      <data key="d8">17.0</data>
      <data key="d9">NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL refers to the process of providing nutrition to patients who are unable to consume food orally. One common method of achieving this is through GASTROSTOM&#205;A ENDOSC&#211;PICA PERCUT&#193;NEA, which is a procedure that involves creating an opening in the stomach using an endoscopic technique. This procedure facilitates enteral nutrition by allowing direct access to the stomach for feeding, thereby ensuring that patients receive the necessary nutrients when they cannot eat by mouth.</data>
      <data key="d10">e55003dbf85cc1fb81cac90716ce0e87,f087e20586f6b263059597e194a04993</data>
      <data key="d11">80743108f2b746eb87a34ba64229655c</data>
      <data key="d12">2749</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="YEYUNOSTOM&#205;A ENDOSC&#211;PICA PERCUT&#193;NEA">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Yeyunostom&#237;a endosc&#243;pica percut&#225;nea is another method of providing enteral nutrition</data>
      <data key="d10">f087e20586f6b263059597e194a04993</data>
      <data key="d11">57f0c8f613374a7aa48deb4adb2e5ccc</data>
      <data key="d12">2750</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="REHABILITACI&#211;N MULTIMODAL">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Rehabilitaci&#243;n multimodal includes nutritional support as part of the recovery process</data>
      <data key="d10">f087e20586f6b263059597e194a04993</data>
      <data key="d11">5b617737a7d94ec59fd5569d87d01630</data>
      <data key="d12">2751</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="PROTOCOLOS ERAS">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Protocolos ERAS emphasize early enteral nutrition to improve recovery outcomes</data>
      <data key="d10">f087e20586f6b263059597e194a04993</data>
      <data key="d11">afd643ae5bd241fa9ea3cac93d5bf6e6</data>
      <data key="d12">2752</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="SOPORTE NUTRICIONAL">
      <data key="d8">17.0</data>
      <data key="d9">NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL is a preferred method of nutritional support in critically ill patients. It plays a crucial role as a key component of SOPORTE NUTRICIONAL for individuals who are unable to consume food orally. This approach ensures that patients receive the necessary nutrients to aid in their recovery and overall health management.</data>
      <data key="d10">21e6d7085f520d8a2f415746dc7eab71,afdd80af18df0213292a5858afeae9cc</data>
      <data key="d11">95609431c3f54b1787580a57ab148abd</data>
      <data key="d12">2753</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="PACIENTE CR&#205;TICO">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Enteral nutrition is recommended for critically ill patients who cannot maintain voluntary intake</data>
      <data key="d10">195affa22ecd2f7b1cdce3d72fc1cba4</data>
      <data key="d11">e7ac0fa025e94b159ae9a7ec4f5bed7a</data>
      <data key="d12">2754</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="PACIENTES CR&#205;TICOS">
      <data key="d8">16.0</data>
      <data key="d9">NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL is a recommended method of nutritional support for PACIENTES CR&#205;TICOS when the digestive tract is functional. This approach is essential for critically ill patients as it helps them meet their caloric requirements and prevents complications during hospitalization.</data>
      <data key="d10">01704aec4089b2f0f24dd0f0841b5ecf,4bf9e20e18b101e95ebd6a9ca591fc54</data>
      <data key="d11">8f295d7393454c11afec653744be2239</data>
      <data key="d12">2755</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="S&#205;NDROME DE REALIMENTACI&#211;N">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La nutrici&#243;n enteral puede provocar el s&#237;ndrome de realimentaci&#243;n si no se monitoriza adecuadamente la reintroducci&#243;n de la alimentaci&#243;n.</data>
      <data key="d10">4bf9e20e18b101e95ebd6a9ca591fc54</data>
      <data key="d11">ba76bdaeb2ef4320a6818803f1dd5493</data>
      <data key="d12">2756</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="F&#193;RMACOS VASOPRESORES">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">El uso de f&#225;rmacos vasopresores en pacientes cr&#237;ticos requiere precauci&#243;n al administrar nutrici&#243;n enteral para evitar complicaciones.</data>
      <data key="d10">4bf9e20e18b101e95ebd6a9ca591fc54</data>
      <data key="d11">538c9c84c82047dca215193bd627e854</data>
      <data key="d12">2757</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="ATROFIA DE LA MUCOSA G&#193;STRICA">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La nutrici&#243;n enteral adecuada puede prevenir la atrofia de la mucosa g&#225;strica en pacientes cr&#237;ticos.</data>
      <data key="d10">4bf9e20e18b101e95ebd6a9ca591fc54</data>
      <data key="d11">a04a3235c34247f68bbbdc1e76b775e3</data>
      <data key="d12">2758</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="MICROCIRCULACI&#211;N INTESTINAL">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La nutrici&#243;n enteral puede afectar la microcirculaci&#243;n intestinal en pacientes cr&#237;ticos, lo que puede llevar a complicaciones.</data>
      <data key="d10">4bf9e20e18b101e95ebd6a9ca591fc54</data>
      <data key="d11">b52ad0e1e1044b37808278827d214222</data>
      <data key="d12">2759</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="SIGNOS DE ISQUEMIA">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Es importante vigilar los signos de isquemia en pacientes que reciben nutrici&#243;n enteral para prevenir complicaciones.</data>
      <data key="d10">4bf9e20e18b101e95ebd6a9ca591fc54</data>
      <data key="d11">0eb4bb0ad55e4bae8cb6afa42017ce7f</data>
      <data key="d12">2760</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL" target="FIBROSIS QU&#205;STICA">
      <data key="d8">16.0</data>
      <data key="d9">NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL is a treatment method utilized for patients with FIBROSIS QU&#205;STICA, aimed at improving caloric intake. This approach is essential for providing nutritional support through enteral feeding, which plays a crucial role in the management of individuals affected by cystic fibrosis.</data>
      <data key="d10">95ef1473677a26ea6ad77c7db0c55e5e,c926a8237fba5d5bc497ac2165bbb039</data>
      <data key="d11">e2c5a0e053c443c48bf9f207463fb7c8</data>
      <data key="d12">2761</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
