      <data key="d9">ESPEN and SEMICYUC are two organizations that collaborate in providing recommendations for the nutritional management of burned and critically ill patients. ESPEN offers guidelines that are utilized by SEMICYUC, ensuring that their practices align with established standards for the care of these vulnerable patient populations. Together, they emphasize the importance of proper nutritional support in the treatment of individuals facing severe health challenges.</data>
