    <edge source="PACIENTE" target="ENFERMER&#205;A">
      <data key="d8">10.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The entity "PACIENTE" refers to individuals who are receiving care, specifically those experiencing oropharyngeal dysphagia, a condition that affects their ability to swallow. The entity "ENFERMER&#205;A" encompasses nursing professionals who play a crucial role in this context. These nursing staff members are responsible for assessing patients with swallowing disorders and providing them with the necessary care and support. Their expertise is essential in managing the challenges faced by patients with oropharyngeal dysphagia, ensuring that they receive appropriate interventions to improve their swallowing capabilities and overall well-being.</data>
      <data key="d10">1719a8d20788e3b25240980cad2b6c5d,fcc886f826047ced8783c4abfe3bf4a3</data>
      <data key="d11">0d53a3db20844920b6a679d74cc68c99</data>
      <data key="d12">3056</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PACIENTE" target="VALORACI&#211;N NUTRICIONAL">
      <data key="d8">39.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The entity "PACIENTE" is closely associated with "VALORACI&#211;N NUTRICIONAL," which plays a crucial role in understanding and addressing the dietary needs of patients, particularly those experiencing intestinal failure or swallowing disorders. The nutritional assessment is essential for evaluating the nutritional status of the patient, allowing healthcare providers to determine their specific dietary requirements. Patients typically undergo this assessment to gain insights into their dietary habits and nutritional needs, ensuring that they receive appropriate care tailored to their conditions. Overall, the nutritional assessment is a vital process in the management and treatment of patients, facilitating better health outcomes through personalized dietary planning.</data>
      <data key="d10">1033f1626ca6ac2b3bab298805a17aec,2ebe12524f7750215eee73b328b601ee,a2c6ccdc966e72b4675d71b4c072e1dc,ea7d8ba0550547d4cff0b5d18c3f6ae5,fcc886f826047ced8783c4abfe3bf4a3</data>
      <data key="d11">91109b705ef84617960f5646c50bd837</data>
      <data key="d12">3057</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PACIENTE" target="TEST DE VOLUMEN-VISCOSIDAD">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Patients are evaluated using the volume-viscosity test to assess their swallowing function</data>
      <data key="d10">fcc886f826047ced8783c4abfe3bf4a3</data>
      <data key="d11">3fe157e44b654bff99e86b370ae81a25</data>
      <data key="d12">3058</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PACIENTE" target="TRHLAB">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Patients participate in the TRHLab project to receive tele-rehabilitation for oropharyngeal dysphagia</data>
      <data key="d10">ac81cd68683925828178b289759d58a9</data>
