    <edge source="PACIENTE" target="COLUTORIO">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The paciente uses colutorio to rinse their mouth after brushing</data>
      <data key="d10">bfc7f52d9f15519c092dee53ea9dcc33</data>
      <data key="d11">0e915b7f32c24fe49bffa8b4a13978b5</data>
      <data key="d12">3067</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PACIENTE" target="ESTRATEGIAS POSTURALES">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Postural strategies are implemented to help the patient swallow safely and effectively during meals.</data>
      <data key="d10">7c842769e1890739769789ed10a08005</data>
      <data key="d11">c88111e7fa2945abaf4ca3503a5d589c</data>
      <data key="d12">3068</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PACIENTE" target="SONDA">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The patient is administered enteral nutrition through the feeding tube</data>
      <data key="d10">3c6db755168f2fea94b2535a81ce6f58</data>
      <data key="d11">e72dfc480b774e27bc9caa1022ff82a2</data>
      <data key="d12">3069</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PACIENTE" target="ALIMENTACI&#211;N CONTINUA">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The patient receives continuous feeding as part of their enteral nutrition regimen</data>
      <data key="d10">3c6db755168f2fea94b2535a81ce6f58</data>
      <data key="d11">8cc7fd4cb9f040389d1863010c8004d5</data>
      <data key="d12">3070</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PACIENTE" target="ADMINISTRACI&#211;N EN BOLO">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The patient may receive bolus feeding as part of their enteral nutrition regimen</data>
      <data key="d10">3c6db755168f2fea94b2535a81ce6f58</data>
      <data key="d11">de8dfa9826f0415f80ade7c2da7c9b6c</data>
      <data key="d12">3071</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PACIENTE" target="VALORACI&#211;N CL&#205;NICA">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Clinical assessment is performed on the patient to evaluate their nutritional status</data>
      <data key="d10">3c6db755168f2fea94b2535a81ce6f58</data>
      <data key="d11">3234b40818f145a0b7ced12b433a15fc</data>
      <data key="d12">3072</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PACIENTE" target="VALORACI&#211;N ANAL&#205;TICA">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Analytical evaluation is conducted on the patient to assess their nutritional status</data>
      <data key="d10">3c6db755168f2fea94b2535a81ce6f58</data>
      <data key="d11">0857c8dbe5b543268f993c0a26f2b72c</data>
      <data key="d12">3073</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PACIENTE" target="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL">
      <data key="d8">81.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The patient is the recipient of parenteral nutrition, a specialized form of nutritional support administered when individuals are unable to utilize their digestive system. This type of nutrition is particularly critical for patients with severe malnutrition or those undergoing treatments such as cancer therapy, where traditional dietary intake is not feasible. The patient's health status plays a significant role in determining the necessity for parenteral nutrition, which is provided to meet their specific nutritional requirements.

Parenteral nutrition is typically administered to patients who cannot receive nutrition through the digestive tract, ensuring that their nutritional needs are adequately met. However, patients receiving this form of nutrition are at risk for potential complications, including hyperglycemia. In some cases, patients may receive home parenteral nutrition to manage their nutritional needs effectively, especially in instances of intestinal failure. Overall, parenteral nutrition serves as a vital intervention for patients requiring alternative nutritional support due to their medical conditions.</data>
      <data key="d10">20b676e149e50ddc54c40e2e1577e9ac,36cffc3e7c3a6fe82e50787e939f7537,4a65e02e4e364419b836920c093055fe,4b4f297dec86d7f65e362ad688bbb28f,5cf1703fd601b27dd0ebda9f20cb3259,7b13bde26d33b4316c3183dd027ed909,8169062e4a75aaf466ffa4affa509241,99900c6d95f85a5b4b88fcfed6775cec,c58712e2ee5757b5175054fcc54f4dd6,d6469f98d2161058fb7b214a1a800441</data>
      <data key="d11">c44e7c220cc54d2c9e76c893010263aa</data>
      <data key="d12">3074</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PACIENTE" target="HISTORIA CL&#205;NICA">
      <data key="d8">23.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The "PACIENTE" and "HISTORIA CL&#205;NICA" are closely related entities in the context of medical care. The "HISTORIA CL&#205;NICA" serves as a comprehensive record that documents the patient's health status, treatment, and the decisions made regarding their medical care. It includes detailed information about the patient's condition, the treatments administered, and the choices made by the patient throughout their healthcare journey. This documentation is essential for ensuring continuity of care and facilitating informed decision-making in the patient's treatment process.</data>
      <data key="d10">5cf1703fd601b27dd0ebda9f20cb3259,9934fdd98a0d66fb3ff7ac1b56b18460,e475fe60f9aab6773eddfe8bad25eef6</data>
      <data key="d11">e995f4a2ea94476cb37412de11447a77</data>
      <data key="d12">3075</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PACIENTE" target="DENSITOMETR&#205;A &#211;SEA">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La densitometr&#237;a &#243;sea se realiza para evaluar la salud &#243;sea del paciente en el contexto de la nutrici&#243;n parenteral</data>
      <data key="d10">5cf1703fd601b27dd0ebda9f20cb3259</data>
      <data key="d11">5d6c4581ca094dd0aabfdbb864261031</data>
      <data key="d12">3076</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PACIENTE" target="CONTROL ANAL&#205;TICO">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">El control anal&#237;tico se lleva a cabo para evaluar el estado metab&#243;lico del paciente durante la nutrici&#243;n parenteral</data>
      <data key="d10">5cf1703fd601b27dd0ebda9f20cb3259</data>
      <data key="d11">958544ea9b0843b584f7f4020935ed44</data>
      <data key="d12">3077</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PACIENTE" target="SEGUIMIENTO">
      <data key="d8">14.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The patient is under seguimiento, which is essential for monitoring the effectiveness of their treatment. This follow-up care specifically focuses on the patient's diabetes and related complications, ensuring ongoing monitoring of their health and treatment response.</data>
      <data key="d10">5cf1703fd601b27dd0ebda9f20cb3259,acd36e6dbcd98757c4cf33ff090764ee,b00c312f46e790b32fe99743480f9e47</data>
      <data key="d11">272673d5f1304d39b8b0df3851216f00</data>
      <data key="d12">3078</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PACIENTE" target="FUNCION CARDIO-RESPIRATORIA">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La funci&#243;n cardio-respiratoria del paciente se controla peri&#243;dicamente durante el tratamiento de nutrici&#243;n parenteral</data>
      <data key="d10">5cf1703fd601b27dd0ebda9f20cb3259</data>
      <data key="d11">8a57e84247d3441ca5b51bd3dec3009b</data>
      <data key="d12">3079</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PACIENTE" target="TEMPERATURA CORPORAL">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La temperatura corporal del paciente se mide para detectar posibles complicaciones durante la nutrici&#243;n parenteral</data>
      <data key="d10">5cf1703fd601b27dd0ebda9f20cb3259</data>
      <data key="d11">b4634dd4817044728cf07e09b73ff155</data>
      <data key="d12">3080</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PACIENTE" target="CONTROL F&#205;SICO">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">El control f&#237;sico se realiza para evaluar el estado nutricional y de hidrataci&#243;n del paciente en tratamiento de nutrici&#243;n parenteral</data>
      <data key="d10">5cf1703fd601b27dd0ebda9f20cb3259</data>
      <data key="d11">2631035dfee64fbd9c11c82a701a10a7</data>
      <data key="d12">3081</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PACIENTE" target="ESTADO FUNCIONAL">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">El estado funcional del paciente se eval&#250;a para determinar su fuerza y resistencia durante la nutrici&#243;n parenteral</data>
      <data key="d10">5cf1703fd601b27dd0ebda9f20cb3259</data>
      <data key="d11">252f9df7a18241fdb21faa4a8490adc7</data>
      <data key="d12">3082</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PACIENTE" target="FUNCION GASTROINTESTINAL">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La funci&#243;n gastrointestinal del paciente se controla para asegurar una adecuada ingesta durante la nutrici&#243;n parenteral</data>
      <data key="d10">5cf1703fd601b27dd0ebda9f20cb3259</data>
      <data key="d11">c90cca428e7942c79924dc358401fc76</data>
      <data key="d12">3083</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PACIENTE" target="BALANCE NITROGENADO">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">El balance nitrogenado se mide para evaluar la efectividad de la nutrici&#243;n parenteral en el paciente</data>
      <data key="d10">5cf1703fd601b27dd0ebda9f20cb3259</data>
      <data key="d11">d6de1b1f0fc54863b91c70ce919c0b87</data>
      <data key="d12">3084</data>
