    </edge>
    <edge source="PACIENTE" target="CAT&#201;TER">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Patients are often treated with catheters, which can lead to various complications including infections</data>
      <data key="d10">c58712e2ee5757b5175054fcc54f4dd6</data>
      <data key="d11">d7a7d4417cf64fb39d9bd22307396aac</data>
      <data key="d12">3085</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PACIENTE" target="ALTERACIONES HIDROELECTROL&#205;TICAS">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Patients may experience hydroelectrolytic imbalances that require monitoring and management</data>
      <data key="d10">c58712e2ee5757b5175054fcc54f4dd6</data>
      <data key="d11">ba55e0ea8a8543d8ae8f878d762f93a0</data>
      <data key="d12">3086</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PACIENTE" target="V&#211;MITOS">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The entity "PACIENTE" is significantly impacted by "V&#211;MITOS," as vomiting can adversely affect patients' hydration and electrolyte balance, which may require medical attention. Additionally, vomiting can complicate the administration of enteral nutrition in patients, further highlighting the need for careful management of this condition to ensure patient well-being.</data>
      <data key="d10">beaa66c30582232126ce2c762a9c6bdb,c58712e2ee5757b5175054fcc54f4dd6</data>
      <data key="d11">46c12dcb382a405f827467c0949243f4</data>
      <data key="d12">3087</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PACIENTE" target="DIFICULTAD PARA LA INGESTA">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Un paciente con dificultad para la ingesta puede requerir nutrici&#243;n enteral para asegurar la adecuada ingesta de nutrientes</data>
      <data key="d10">140611dbb8a68fc40712c946de92b73f</data>
      <data key="d11">2fbd0d204a334e0184952a30065af89b</data>
      <data key="d12">3088</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PACIENTE" target="CIRUG&#205;A">
      <data key="d8">15.0</data>
      <data key="d9">El servicio de Cirug&#237;a est&#225; a cargo del tratamiento y manejo del paciente con pancreatitis aguda. Adem&#225;s, un paciente puede necesitar soporte nutricional antes y despu&#233;s de una cirug&#237;a para asegurar una recuperaci&#243;n adecuada.</data>
      <data key="d10">140611dbb8a68fc40712c946de92b73f,4b4f297dec86d7f65e362ad688bbb28f</data>
      <data key="d11">7d234ba723a74a67b766adc6a308194d</data>
      <data key="d12">3089</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PACIENTE" target="MALNUTRICI&#211;N SEVERA">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Un paciente que presenta malnutrici&#243;n severa puede requerir nutrici&#243;n enteral o parenteral para mejorar su estado nutricional</data>
      <data key="d10">140611dbb8a68fc40712c946de92b73f</data>
      <data key="d11">b814fb85ecf4403cba2928ced7e84297</data>
      <data key="d12">3090</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PACIENTE" target="INSUFICIENCIA RENAL CR&#211;NICA">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Patients suffering from chronic renal failure require specific dietary management to address their nutritional needs.</data>
      <data key="d10">64417661dbb019f8f4ceb9fcc2fbdaa6</data>
      <data key="d11">fa179053030d4a4f90d949f5c0f697b5</data>
      <data key="d12">3091</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PACIENTE" target="OLIGOELEMENTOS">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Patients with renal failure often require supplementation of trace elements to prevent deficiencies due to dietary restrictions.</data>
      <data key="d10">64417661dbb019f8f4ceb9fcc2fbdaa6</data>
      <data key="d11">483eafb7d1f449bbaad83db32ecad1d1</data>
      <data key="d12">3092</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PACIENTE" target="VITAMINAS">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Patients undergoing dialysis need vitamin supplementation to compensate for losses during treatment.</data>
      <data key="d10">64417661dbb019f8f4ceb9fcc2fbdaa6</data>
      <data key="d11">a92ad5417c6043c7901af72fff294217</data>
      <data key="d12">3093</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PACIENTE" target="PROTE&#205;NAS">
      <data key="d8">16.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The summary regarding the entities "PACIENTE" and "PROTE&#205;NAS" highlights the dietary needs of patients, particularly those with specific health conditions. Patients with high protein requirements must ensure that their diets include adequate protein to meet their nutritional needs. Conversely, patients with renal failure necessitate careful management of their protein intake. This management is crucial to prevent malnutrition while effectively addressing their medical condition. Thus, while some patients may need increased protein, those with renal issues must balance their intake to maintain health.</data>
      <data key="d10">1130db2843c569042990b711cf15d8ee,64417661dbb019f8f4ceb9fcc2fbdaa6</data>
      <data key="d11">b93f96f4adca4232aea778a1c9db52a6</data>
      <data key="d12">3094</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PACIENTE" target="ENERG&#205;A">
      <data key="d8">2.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The entity "PACIENTE" refers to patients, particularly those with renal failure, who require careful monitoring and adjustment of their energy intake to ensure adequate nutrition and health. The entity "ENERG&#205;A" pertains to the calculations of energy that are utilized by these patients to determine their dietary needs and insulin requirements. Together, these entities highlight the importance of managing energy intake for patients with renal failure to maintain their overall health and nutritional status.</data>
      <data key="d10">64417661dbb019f8f4ceb9fcc2fbdaa6,abf638322cfb1c522bfbee1852e28a19</data>
      <data key="d11">977c28f1425f4b64863537a7836de98e</data>
      <data key="d12">3095</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PACIENTE" target="C&#193;NCER">
      <data key="d8">25.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The entity "PACIENTE" refers to individuals who are diagnosed with "C&#193;NCER." These patients often face a range of challenges associated with their condition, including complications such as malnutrition and caquexia. The effects of cancer and its treatment can significantly impact their nutritional status, necessitating specialized nutritional support to address these issues. Overall, patients with cancer require comprehensive care that considers their unique nutritional needs and the symptoms they may experience.</data>
      <data key="d10">36cffc3e7c3a6fe82e50787e939f7537,6c8b41c09b1ada129f0908d6e5d18185,9ce201472321f20b339146bb6b452f60</data>
      <data key="d11">75153343a7b84863957ccaf100dd8f9c</data>
      <data key="d12">3096</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PACIENTE" target="VALORACI&#211;N SUBJETIVA GLOBAL">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Valoraci&#243;n Subjetiva Global is used to assess the nutritional status of pacientes</data>
      <data key="d10">9ce201472321f20b339146bb6b452f60</data>
      <data key="d11">a84b75632c124abfbb65ea324db689d5</data>
      <data key="d12">3097</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PACIENTE" target="ACETATO DE MEGESTROL">
      <data key="d8">12.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Acetato de Megestrol is a medication prescribed to pacientes to stimulate appetite and combat desnutrici&#243;n. It has been shown to be effective in helping patients increase their appetite, making it a valuable treatment option for those experiencing weight loss or nutritional deficiencies.</data>
      <data key="d10">9ce201472321f20b339146bb6b452f60,c3975fe03d2af26b95b09795c7769e8b</data>
      <data key="d11">22909c4e33b14c0b807c4d5c09844689</data>
      <data key="d12">3098</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PACIENTE" target="PREDNISONA">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Prednisona is used in pacientes to help increase appetite and manage symptoms of desnutrici&#243;n</data>
      <data key="d10">9ce201472321f20b339146bb6b452f60</data>
      <data key="d11">578815172fc44f418c18b9cbed895c11</data>
      <data key="d12">3099</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PACIENTE" target="METILFENIDATO">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Metilfenidato is administered to pacientes to help stimulate appetite in the context of cancer treatment</data>
      <data key="d10">9ce201472321f20b339146bb6b452f60</data>
      <data key="d11">d2b4769b519a493d9fb14a4f7368d363</data>
      <data key="d12">3100</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PACIENTE" target="METOCLOPRAMIDA">
      <data key="d8">11.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The patient utilized metoclopramide as part of their treatment for regurgitation. Metoclopramide is known for its effectiveness in treating nausea in patients, which can subsequently enhance their nutritional intake.</data>
      <data key="d10">9ce201472321f20b339146bb6b452f60,ce4c057e0a625bc9e64301a0cca1e206</data>
      <data key="d11">f201554aa01b482ba9983917f6412f91</data>
      <data key="d12">3101</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PACIENTE" target="PILOCARPINA">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Pilocarpina is used to alleviate xerostom&#237;a in pacientes, improving their ability to eat</data>
      <data key="d10">9ce201472321f20b339146bb6b452f60</data>
      <data key="d11">488ed6f39794432489c70ae7f7ee45ec</data>
      <data key="d12">3102</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PACIENTE" target="NISTATINA">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Nistatina is used to treat infections in pacientes that may contribute to xerostom&#237;a and nutritional issues</data>
      <data key="d10">9ce201472321f20b339146bb6b452f60</data>
      <data key="d11">71d693bd72d74618811bc11e8a8b4a9f</data>
      <data key="d12">3103</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PACIENTE" target="FLUCONAZOL">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Fluconazol is administered to pacientes to manage fungal infections that can affect their nutritional status</data>
      <data key="d10">9ce201472321f20b339146bb6b452f60</data>
      <data key="d11">aa620270fc2147499d5a6359410dea6b</data>
      <data key="d12">3104</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PACIENTE" target="ITRACONAZOL">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Itraconazol is used in pacientes to treat infections that may complicate their nutritional intake</data>
      <data key="d10">9ce201472321f20b339146bb6b452f60</data>
      <data key="d11">e63a014bd201457db29c9b336ccc8675</data>
      <data key="d12">3105</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PACIENTE" target="H&#205;GADO">
      <data key="d8">14.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The liver, or h&#237;gado, can be significantly affected by conditions such as cancer and malnutrition, which in turn impact the health of pacientes. In a recent assessment, the patient's liver was evaluated for lesions that may indicate potential metastasis, highlighting the importance of monitoring liver health in the context of cancer and overall patient well-being.</data>
      <data key="d10">9ce201472321f20b339146bb6b452f60,b00c312f46e790b32fe99743480f9e47</data>
      <data key="d11">7ccf5533d440462bbb655c7a634adaba</data>
      <data key="d12">3106</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PACIENTE" target="P&#193;NCREAS">
