      <data key="d9">The entity "PACIENTE" is highlighted in the context of "SOPORTE NUTRICIONAL," emphasizing the critical role of nutritional support in managing health, particularly during cancer treatment. Additionally, it is noted that patients may also require nutritional support following metabolic surgery due to complications. This underscores the importance of tailored nutritional interventions for patients in various medical situations to ensure optimal recovery and health management.</data>
