      <data key="d12">3174</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PACIENTE" target="TRATAMIENTO NUTRICIONAL">
      <data key="d8">23.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The entity "PACIENTE" is closely linked to "TRATAMIENTO NUTRICIONAL," which plays a crucial role in the recovery of patients suffering from eating disorders. Nutritional treatment is specifically designed to meet the individual health needs of patients, including those with conditions such as diabetes. Additionally, patients with metabolic disorders also require tailored nutritional treatment to effectively manage their conditions and prevent potential complications. Overall, nutritional treatment is essential for the health and recovery of various patient populations, addressing their unique dietary requirements and health challenges.</data>
      <data key="d10">3bd6f34f55dc7500746b997ebeecf327,76287e9b94faab94755c56fead3541d7,a5ee3f91f8571820c338a8db4d3db09d</data>
      <data key="d11">7e1101b1df454628a1d7aae4c037cde9</data>
      <data key="d12">3175</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PACIENTE" target="HEMOGLOBINA GLICOSILADA">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
