    <edge source="PACIENTE" target="INSULINA">
      <data key="d8">68.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The patient has been receiving insulin as a critical part of their treatment for Type 1 diabetes, aimed at controlling elevated blood glucose levels. Following their diabetes diagnosis, the patient's insulin levels were adjusted to better manage their condition. It is essential for the patient to adjust their insulin dosage based on their carbohydrate intake to maintain optimal glucose control. However, it has been noted that the patient has been omitting doses of insulin, which may impact their overall management of diabetes.</data>
      <data key="d10">48f1fe343d54cd0f353be34b736a352c,7c10030e29c1434df3b10b1533710486,83b82871866963bb43f901dd9ca09fcb,933d6526b2d313c95c9f4aaa950a62a3,abf638322cfb1c522bfbee1852e28a19,b00c312f46e790b32fe99743480f9e47,b7a2c1e4dd77f47605fdb33f4a2c2bdf,ce4c057e0a625bc9e64301a0cca1e206</data>
