    <edge source="PACIENTE" target="MALNUTRICI&#211;N">
      <data key="d8">31.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The entity "PACIENTE" is often associated with "MALNUTRICI&#211;N," particularly in the context of cancer treatment. Patients with cancer frequently face malnutrition due to inadequate nutrient intake, which can significantly impact their overall health and treatment outcomes. Additionally, patients undergoing hematopoietic cell transplantation are particularly vulnerable to malnutrition and necessitate thorough nutritional assessments to address their dietary needs. The presence of malnutrition in patients is a critical concern that requires attention during their treatment process, as failing to meet their dietary requirements can exacerbate their health issues.</data>
