    <edge source="PACIENTE" target="CAQUEXIA">
      <data key="d8">17.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The entity "PACIENTE" refers to individuals diagnosed with cancer who may experience "CAQUEXIA," a severe form of malnutrition. This condition significantly affects the patient's weight and overall quality of life, stemming from the cancer diagnosis. Cachexia is a serious complication that can arise in cancer patients, highlighting the importance of addressing nutritional needs in their treatment and care.</data>
