      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Cirug&#237;a can cause alterations in the digestive system, leading to p&#233;rdida de peso in cancer patients.</data>
      <data key="d10">b26b998479da515c234ce46b1bfa73db</data>
      <data key="d11">e857967e6a1245709d370843b497455a</data>
      <data key="d12">3627</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="P&#201;RDIDA DE PESO" target="NEONATOS">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Weight loss is a key indicator of health status in neonates and is closely monitored during their care</data>
