    <edge source="P&#201;RDIDA DE PESO" target="ODINOFAGIA">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La odinofagia puede llevar a la p&#233;rdida de peso en pacientes con c&#225;ncer de es&#243;fago debido a la dificultad para tragar.</data>
      <data key="d10">5664277128c865feb0e93f9fd56a3d05</data>
      <data key="d11">96f2240399174355ad11a6dc5c283281</data>
      <data key="d12">3636</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="P&#201;RDIDA DE PESO" target="MORBILIDAD">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">P&#201;RDIDA DE PESO can contribute to increased MORBILIDAD in patients</data>
      <data key="d10">5277ea34ef65b7d029950f2c905c6732</data>
      <data key="d11">f0e1ce58ecd54e06b6ec8990ff5e44ab</data>
      <data key="d12">3637</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="P&#201;RDIDA DE PESO" target="MORTALIDAD">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">P&#201;RDIDA DE PESO is linked to higher MORTALIDAD rates in patients</data>
      <data key="d10">5277ea34ef65b7d029950f2c905c6732</data>
      <data key="d11">7dfed279255046f2ba6aa9e1423bc8f4</data>
      <data key="d12">3638</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ERGE" target="PH-METR&#205;A">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">pH-metry is a diagnostic tool used to assess the severity and frequency of ERGE episodes</data>
      <data key="d10">f7c941bced546a7d607c30a9a5e9d887</data>
      <data key="d11">c8c46d8397bb48b390e0d49ae7ca6e41</data>
      <data key="d12">3639</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ERGE" target="S&#205;NTOMAS">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Symptoms are often associated with episodes of ERGE, indicating a correlation between the two</data>
      <data key="d10">f7c941bced546a7d607c30a9a5e9d887</data>
      <data key="d11">50a0ad107f3649daa928eb2c3ed31ff3</data>
      <data key="d12">3640</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PH-METR&#205;A" target="FUNCIONALIDAD">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">pH-metry is a functional test that assesses the effectiveness of treatments for esophageal conditions</data>
      <data key="d10">f7c941bced546a7d607c30a9a5e9d887</data>
      <data key="d11">b530693f97764513ae5da8231a087331</data>
      <data key="d12">3641</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PH-METR&#205;A" target="T&#201;CNICA CONVENCIONAL">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The conventional technique is a method used in pH-metry for measuring esophageal acidity</data>
      <data key="d10">f7c941bced546a7d607c30a9a5e9d887</data>
      <data key="d11">84d2e2ec3a2b46bba58302f8f62d84ca</data>
      <data key="d12">3642</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PH-METR&#205;A" target="T&#201;CNICA INAL&#193;MBRICA">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The wireless technique is an alternative method for conducting pH-metry, enhancing diagnostic capabilities</data>
      <data key="d10">f7c941bced546a7d607c30a9a5e9d887</data>
      <data key="d11">cc5e7ae883514ac99ac0b5ab7e3be99b</data>
      <data key="d12">3643</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="S&#205;NTOMAS" target="PH-IMPEDANCIOMETR&#205;A">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">pH-impedance testing helps correlate reflux episodes with the symptoms reported by patients.</data>
      <data key="d10">b58b0258891d9207b27237bab6a03946</data>
      <data key="d11">fc5977243eb041f48e6e1a7669184064</data>
      <data key="d12">3644</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="S&#205;NTOMAS" target="REFLUJO PATOL&#211;GICO NO &#193;CIDO">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Pathological non-acid reflux can be correlated with symptoms experienced by patients during testing.</data>
      <data key="d10">b58b0258891d9207b27237bab6a03946</data>
      <data key="d11">8719e58982a14c77bfe7849efea328d9</data>
      <data key="d12">3645</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="S&#205;NTOMAS" target="PACIENTES EXTRAESOF&#193;GICOS">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Extraesophageal patients may present symptoms that are related to reflux, such as cough or hoarseness, which can be evaluated through diagnostic tests.</data>
      <data key="d10">b58b0258891d9207b27237bab6a03946</data>
      <data key="d11">e31dc47ca12d44f49af500b58fa549eb</data>
      <data key="d12">3646</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="S&#205;NTOMAS" target="DIABETES">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Symptoms are key indicators of diabetes and are crucial for early diagnosis and management of the disease.</data>
      <data key="d10">f1bd89f4a1fcc385a19f5c5323ee2f89</data>
      <data key="d11">83dad90a26994972b33c59bde9abb3ad</data>
      <data key="d12">3647</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="S&#205;NTOMAS" target="S&#205;NDROMA DE DUMPING">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Los s&#237;ntomas descritos son caracter&#237;sticos del s&#237;ndrome de dumping, que se presenta tras la ingesta de alimentos.</data>
      <data key="d10">65e3dfcb7a0c5a2a09a98342c597c020</data>
      <data key="d11">0ca99f1e8ed748318c96c8a2727f4683</data>
      <data key="d12">3648</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="S&#205;NTOMAS" target="GALACTOSEMIA CL&#193;SICA">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Los s&#237;ntomas de la galactosemia cl&#225;sica son manifestaciones cl&#237;nicas que comienzan tras el nacimiento.</data>
      <data key="d10">f2f8594bddb0ab77444cdcd2a7799d59</data>
      <data key="d11">9b754f09ddcc4de89452b01daea585e9</data>
      <data key="d12">3649</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="S&#205;NTOMAS" target="DIETA CETOG&#201;NICA">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Los s&#237;ntomas como fatiga y debilidad muscular pueden aparecer en pacientes que siguen una dieta cetog&#233;nica</data>
      <data key="d10">4d84210c815fb41f2fa44f3e01aafa02</data>
      <data key="d11">e5cb8a721af2427bb52a544da6bdf65f</data>
      <data key="d12">3650</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="S&#205;NTOMAS" target="PANCREATITIS CR&#211;NICA">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Symptoms are a direct consequence of chronic pancreatitis, linking the two events</data>
      <data key="d10">803363886f385b089938bf122246dfa2</data>
      <data key="d11">afd6e3883b1d45d2af8569a17127c875</data>
      <data key="d12">3651</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="S&#205;NTOMAS" target="PACIENTES CR&#205;TICOS">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Los pacientes cr&#237;ticos deben ser evaluados diariamente por s&#237;ntomas que puedan indicar problemas con la nutrici&#243;n enteral.</data>
      <data key="d10">4bf9e20e18b101e95ebd6a9ca591fc54</data>
      <data key="d11">580125a6fbd241518a8d609d728e9d89</data>
      <data key="d12">3652</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="S&#205;NTOMAS" target="MALNUTRICI&#211;N">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Symptoms of cancer can lead to malnutrition, necessitating nutritional support</data>
      <data key="d10">5e934738b2a8cb03468f4ebf4eec0cd2</data>
      <data key="d11">48af356d1c9f44fe95f7bc7409b09673</data>
      <data key="d12">3653</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="S&#205;NTOMAS" target="ALERGIAS E INTOLERANCIAS ALIMENTARIAS">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Los s&#237;ntomas son una parte fundamental del diagn&#243;stico de alergias e intolerancias alimentarias.</data>
      <data key="d10">bc394d70461777b6300d5449185a7859</data>
      <data key="d11">16b4a269dcf6415484bc6c996311a6a0</data>
      <data key="d12">3654</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="S&#205;NTOMA" target="REFLUJO">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Symptoms are directly related to episodes of reflux, indicating a strong connection</data>
      <data key="d10">f7c941bced546a7d607c30a9a5e9d887</data>
      <data key="d11">61836409eb6d441ca5a815055aba0d02</data>
      <data key="d12">3655</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="RGE" target="PH-IMPEDANCIOMETR&#205;A">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">pH-impedance testing is utilized to diagnose and assess the severity of RGE in patients.</data>
      <data key="d10">b58b0258891d9207b27237bab6a03946</data>
      <data key="d11">c87f1e8132334ef8b326dec278627ab8</data>
      <data key="d12">3656</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="RGE" target="S&#205;NTOMAS T&#205;PICOS DE ERGE">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Typical symptoms of GERD are often evaluated in relation to the presence of RGE during diagnostic testing.</data>
      <data key="d10">b58b0258891d9207b27237bab6a03946</data>
      <data key="d11">c2362572822947c08fd336d44055f3ca</data>
      <data key="d12">3657</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PH-IMPEDANCIOMETR&#205;A" target="CAT&#201;TER">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">pH-impedance testing utilizes a catheter to measure pH and impedance levels in the esophagus.</data>
      <data key="d10">b58b0258891d9207b27237bab6a03946</data>
      <data key="d11">c2a4a4b582ef4f5190d244247ceacfa8</data>
      <data key="d12">3658</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="CAT&#201;TER" target="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">El cat&#233;ter es un dispositivo m&#233;dico utilizado para administrar nutrici&#243;n parenteral, que es un m&#233;todo de suministro de nutrientes directamente al torrente sangu&#237;neo. Aunque el cat&#233;ter es esencial para esta entrega de nutrientes, su uso puede conllevar complicaciones, como sepsis y trombosis venosa.</data>
      <data key="d10">7b34ed1eb4b09b2e0762c7e917f8a516,ace4abd79441a61d6688d67db2dc0747</data>
      <data key="d11">a11070c2f21f476aa25927d8da45fea1</data>
      <data key="d12">3659</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="CAT&#201;TER" target="TROMBOSIS VENOSA">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The use of a catheter can lead to venous thrombosis, a serious complication requiring careful management.</data>
      <data key="d10">c031cb3bc7513b4a3f8e4f264c00a675</data>
      <data key="d11">a58afdf3474c4263a9855d16717f8168</data>
      <data key="d12">3660</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="CAT&#201;TER" target="SOLUCI&#211;N SALINA">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Saline solution is used to flush catheters to prevent obstruction and maintain their function.</data>
      <data key="d10">c031cb3bc7513b4a3f8e4f264c00a675</data>
      <data key="d11">c49538401d5f429180c20a56350f3e66</data>
      <data key="d12">3661</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ENDOSCOPIA" target="S&#205;NTOMAS DIGESTIVOS">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La endoscopia se realiza para investigar los s&#237;ntomas digestivos del paciente, buscando causas subyacentes</data>
      <data key="d10">8b6f748cffc65b1521a9ee4b11f2273d</data>
      <data key="d11">f58915304c1343b38239ce13ed3dc369</data>
      <data key="d12">3662</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ENDOSCOPIA" target="C&#193;PSULA ENDOSC&#211;PICA">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Ambos procedimientos se utilizan para evaluar la condici&#243;n intestinal del paciente y est&#225;n relacionados en el diagn&#243;stico</data>
      <data key="d10">8b6f748cffc65b1521a9ee4b11f2273d</data>
      <data key="d11">46e54eceff4c4ecfa2eabc7072c80732</data>
      <data key="d12">3663</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ENDOSCOPIA" target="MUCOSA INTESTINAL">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La mucosa intestinal es evaluada durante la endoscopia, mostrando hallazgos relevantes para el diagn&#243;stico del paciente</data>
      <data key="d10">8b6f748cffc65b1521a9ee4b11f2273d</data>
      <data key="d11">09f216a2c4214a1ebb27b386e00a1ca7</data>
      <data key="d12">3664</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ENDOSCOPIA" target="DEFICIENCIA DE HIERRO">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La endoscopia se utiliza para investigar la causa de la deficiencia de hierro en pacientes con s&#237;ntomas de hemorragia digestiva</data>
      <data key="d10">49058309baf3bb1fadf8956dd9ed0e89</data>
      <data key="d11">58a00540ad47467ca83b9afc4f878174</data>
      <data key="d12">3665</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ENDOSCOPIA" target="ALERGIA ALIMENTARIA">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La endoscopia puede ser utilizada como una prueba diagn&#243;stica para evaluar condiciones relacionadas con la alergia alimentaria.</data>
      <data key="d10">4e38cc524978e9eb248721d211c4574b</data>
      <data key="d11">5ec89e4b66af4e7fb80b820146d08748</data>
      <data key="d12">3666</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ESOFAGITIS EOSINOF&#205;LICA" target="ALERGIAS ALIMENTARIAS">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Esofagitis eosinof&#237;lica can be a result of food allergies, affecting the esophagus</data>
      <data key="d10">9d84c9c66c832dd17e7247a6966c2ea1</data>
      <data key="d11">3acc0bfb7a484e899951628c2f9a1902</data>
      <data key="d12">3667</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ESOFAGITIS EOSINOF&#205;LICA" target="ALERGIA ALIMENTARIA">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La esofagitis eosinof&#237;lica es una condici&#243;n que se relaciona con alergias alimentarias, especialmente en ni&#241;os.</data>
      <data key="d10">693b5721c7fc52c8165c48b580777840</data>
      <data key="d11">8992e2488fd849b782351ba49b6264f8</data>
      <data key="d12">3668</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ESOFAGITIS EOSINOF&#205;LICA" target="PROTE&#205;NA DE LA LECHE DE VACA">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La esofagitis eosinof&#237;lica puede ser mediada por la prote&#237;na de la leche de vaca en ni&#241;os.</data>
      <data key="d10">693b5721c7fc52c8165c48b580777840</data>
      <data key="d11">5d3d8b393c384a0ba605a35ba9859b32</data>
      <data key="d12">3669</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ESOFAGITIS EOSINOF&#205;LICA" target="PROTE&#205;NA DE SOJA">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La esofagitis eosinof&#237;lica puede ser provocada por la prote&#237;na de soja en algunos casos.</data>
      <data key="d10">693b5721c7fc52c8165c48b580777840</data>
      <data key="d11">0af8f17e35d240e5973deee53971d9e3</data>
      <data key="d12">3670</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="TUMORES" target="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La nutrici&#243;n parenteral puede ser necesaria en pacientes con tumores g&#225;stricos o de colon que presentan malnutrici&#243;n</data>
      <data key="d10">4b5441741b392c27b7f7c29cc79e13a5</data>
      <data key="d11">6265e982a6934b88aa8ca5490d481321</data>
      <data key="d12">3671</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="TUMORES" target="HIPERPROLACTINEMIA">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Los tumores pueden causar una reducci&#243;n de la inhibici&#243;n dopamin&#233;rgica, lo que lleva a la hiperprolactinemia.</data>
      <data key="d10">2b6e6d589cd4e83086e44c77205b3740</data>
      <data key="d11">f65664759eed47babb69298caf010547</data>
      <data key="d12">3672</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="TUMORES" target="HIP&#211;FISIS">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Los tumores pueden afectar la hip&#243;fisis, causando hipopituitarismo y otros problemas hormonales.</data>
      <data key="d10">9b9d487a35d8197bfe9d1aa0fce19c32</data>
      <data key="d11">f3425cd637d547edba88c33dab1f1f0c</data>
      <data key="d12">3673</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="TUMORES" target="TRASPLANTE">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Los tumores son una de las principales razones por las cuales los pacientes requieren un trasplante de c&#233;lulas hematopoy&#233;ticas</data>
      <data key="d10">084639519c323a72fcf1322c38efd173</data>
      <data key="d11">062358dc5c934cc081c7eda4e204e4e7</data>
      <data key="d12">3674</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="TUMORES" target="SIADH">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Certain tumors can cause SIADH by stimulating the secretion of ADH</data>
      <data key="d10">addd6db95fafa3464a6f085f8d0041ce</data>
      <data key="d11">90b44b6127f3471a95b36c4fa7213af5</data>
      <data key="d12">3675</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="YATES RB" target="GASTROESOPHAGEAL REFLUX DISEASE">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Yates RB has contributed to the understanding of gastroesophageal reflux disease</data>
      <data key="d10">e2aeed1cae3c67005a57b0695a907fbf</data>
      <data key="d11">fe4940d9b379405b9d02d8123e48e39b</data>
      <data key="d12">3676</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="GASTROESOPHAGEAL REFLUX DISEASE" target="RICHARD JE">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Richard JE has contributed to the understanding of gastroesophageal reflux disease</data>
      <data key="d10">e2aeed1cae3c67005a57b0695a907fbf</data>
      <data key="d11">aed2245885be459a835cd3014d0074bc</data>
      <data key="d12">3677</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ROMMEL N" target="OROPHARYNGEAL DYSPHAGIA">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Rommel N studied the manifestations and diagnosis of oropharyngeal dysphagia</data>
      <data key="d10">3b361c0a9b5d08df1a67476a3ae3b968</data>
      <data key="d11">57e7af54adf34eac810057b2193ce36a</data>
      <data key="d12">3678</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICIONAL VALORATION" target="NUTRITIONAL REQUIREMENTS">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Nutritional valoration helps identify the specific nutritional requirements of patients with dysphagia.</data>
      <data key="d10">73fd366244763cef4b13c058330147b1</data>
      <data key="d11">d1bd93305b86499cbb5dde8560af3130</data>
      <data key="d12">3679</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRITIONAL REQUIREMENTS" target="NUTRITIONAL STATUS">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Nutritional requirements are determined based on the individual's nutritional status and health condition.</data>
      <data key="d10">c639615d7681ffeb945a996d231bb7aa</data>
      <data key="d11">e42bdee82791447897df277b0508569d</data>
      <data key="d12">3680</data>
