      <data key="d12">3704</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRITIONAL SUPPORT" target="MCT">
      <data key="d8">2.0</data>
      <data key="d9">NUTRITIONAL SUPPORT involves the use of Medium-Chain Triglycerides (MCTs) as a dietary intervention for patients with specific nutritional needs. MCTs are particularly beneficial in supporting patients with pancreatitis, as they help these individuals maintain their weight during treatment.</data>
      <data key="d10">69bfdb98603d3d8c4733cb795f4c82f3,f6135205f57ce2216ab62038ac34a2bb</data>
      <data key="d11">19583f877e46479da9e23b7b18b087f4</data>
      <data key="d12">3705</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRITIONAL SUPPORT" target="PANCREATIC ENZYMES">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Pancreatic enzymes are part of the nutritional support for patients with exocrine pancreatic insufficiency</data>
      <data key="d10">f6135205f57ce2216ab62038ac34a2bb</data>
      <data key="d11">bfa4a3f50f1d4a3cb7666d6b4a4b4694</data>
