    <edge source="NUTRITIONAL SUPPORT" target="BARIATRIC SURGERY">
      <data key="d8">16.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Nutritional support is a key component in the recovery process for patients undergoing bariatric surgery. It is essential for these patients to ensure they meet their dietary needs post-operation, facilitating a successful recovery and promoting overall health.</data>
      <data key="d10">6517add809ee588bede013f59f20b0ef,fab4b91ddb77bd16a93a3808a9c12b4c</data>
      <data key="d11">407d45dc5dd14eb0a150b191b08f576f</data>
