    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRITIONAL SUPPORT" target="GASTRECTOMY">
      <data key="d8">16.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Nutritional support is essential for patients undergoing gastrectomy, as it plays a critical role in preventing malnutrition and associated complications. After the procedure, patients face specific dietary restrictions that necessitate tailored nutritional support to help them adapt effectively to their new eating patterns. This support is vital for their recovery and overall health following gastrectomy.</data>
      <data key="d10">6517add809ee588bede013f59f20b0ef,fab4b91ddb77bd16a93a3808a9c12b4c</data>
      <data key="d11">f7b84d8dd6884471a4fa60aba7d635be</data>
