    <edge source="NUTRITIONAL SUPPORT" target="PANCREATITIS">
      <data key="d8">24.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Nutritional support is critical for managing pancreatitis and preventing complications associated with the condition. It plays a vital role in addressing the metabolic and dietary needs of patients suffering from pancreatitis, ensuring that their nutritional requirements are met to avoid deficiencies. This comprehensive approach to nutritional care is essential for the effective management of individuals with pancreatitis.</data>
      <data key="d10">178140d0d29364593546d7d21393f2c6,32642463df83d3626d7a9c5acf121825,69bfdb98603d3d8c4733cb795f4c82f3</data>
