    <edge source="NUTRITIONAL SUPPORT" target="HEMODIALYSIS">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Nutritional support is critical for patients undergoing hemodialysis, as it plays a vital role in improving their nutritional status. These patients require specific nutritional interventions to effectively manage their condition, ensuring that their dietary needs are met during treatment.</data>
      <data key="d10">5705dc62240c8f823dd1bc15770d5ab2,97a728c18b63007d07b6a4a5fc22d5e4</data>
      <data key="d11">4192ba53064548c8b3163be5b49389f4</data>
      <data key="d12">3736</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRITIONAL SUPPORT" target="NUTRITIONAL FORMULAS">
      <data key="d8">2.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Nutritional support encompasses various strategies and products designed to meet the dietary needs of individuals, particularly those with specific health challenges. Within this framework, nutritional formulas play a crucial role. These formulas are specifically formulated to provide essential nutrients and are vital for patients with dietary restrictions. They are often utilized as a form of nutritional support for individuals who are unable to consume food normally due to medical conditions. Thus, nutritional formulas are integral to ensuring that patients receive adequate nutrition when traditional food intake is not feasible.</data>
      <data key="d10">97a728c18b63007d07b6a4a5fc22d5e4,eadd983c9f28c11a1c279e4b923351cd</data>
      <data key="d11">85905d87b3d84719b20c0fc349790ca0</data>
      <data key="d12">3737</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
