    <edge source="NUTRITIONAL SUPPORT" target="NUTRITIONAL THERAPY">
      <data key="d8">10.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Nutritional support and nutritional therapy are closely related concepts aimed at enhancing patient health and recovery. Nutritional support is a specific form of nutritional therapy designed to aid recovery in patients by providing essential nutrients necessary for healing. It plays a crucial role in the care of individuals, particularly those with specific health challenges. Additionally, nutritional therapy itself can be viewed as a form of nutritional support, particularly beneficial for patients with renal insufficiency, as it focuses on improving their overall health through tailored nutritional interventions. Together, these approaches emphasize the importance of proper nutrition in the recovery and health maintenance of patients.</data>
      <data key="d10">10bde114bd1285b3aeeec94dd4292d9e,97a728c18b63007d07b6a4a5fc22d5e4,b0b96ec7b9f57581fe18f0ac902af707</data>
      <data key="d11">bcce5c0f835b40a9b81fdbc9d54aebc7</data>
      <data key="d12">3742</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
