    <edge source="NUTRITIONAL SUPPORT" target="GLUTAMINE">
      <data key="d8">12.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Nutritional support is an important aspect of care for patients with various health conditions, including pancreatitis and critical illnesses. Glutamine, an amino acid, is currently being studied for its potential benefits in the nutritional support of pancreatitis patients. However, in the context of critically ill patients, glutamine is discussed but not recommended due to a lack of demonstrated benefits. This highlights the complexity of glutamine's role in nutritional support, where it may be beneficial for certain conditions like pancreatitis, while its efficacy remains uncertain in critically ill populations.</data>
      <data key="d10">69bfdb98603d3d8c4733cb795f4c82f3,8d9c5b85d058d0d3cde4479b5589a7d1</data>
      <data key="d11">2a8a304f7c73469fa32dce62d7a5fec5</data>
