    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRITIONAL SUPPORT" target="POSTOPERATIVE COMPLICATIONS">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Effective nutritional support can help reduce postoperative complications in surgical patients.</data>
      <data key="d10">fab4b91ddb77bd16a93a3808a9c12b4c</data>
      <data key="d11">3deaed822ecc4e0497a52748c98108f5</data>
      <data key="d12">3757</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRITIONAL SUPPORT" target="HOSPITAL STAY">
      <data key="d8">13.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Nutritional support plays a crucial role in the healthcare setting, particularly in relation to hospital stays. Effective nutritional support can significantly reduce the length of hospital stays for patients. Additionally, the nutritional status of patients, especially surgical patients, can have a substantial impact on the duration of their hospital stay. Therefore, ensuring adequate nutritional support is essential for improving patient outcomes and minimizing the time spent in the hospital.</data>
      <data key="d10">ee3700469e1c419d283b34f38100fa29,fab4b91ddb77bd16a93a3808a9c12b4c</data>
      <data key="d11">fa1f6e91c19f4c44aef19fd5b280efa8</data>
      <data key="d12">3758</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRITIONAL SUPPORT" target="READMISSION RATES">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Proper nutritional support can help lower readmission rates for patients after surgery.</data>
      <data key="d10">fab4b91ddb77bd16a93a3808a9c12b4c</data>
      <data key="d11">4efaf1944c484c6f861561eee8c7af66</data>
      <data key="d12">3759</data>
