    <edge source="NUTRITIONAL SUPPORT" target="CYSTIC FIBROSIS">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Nutritional support is crucial for managing the health of patients with cystic fibrosis. This support involves dietary modifications that are necessary to meet the increased caloric needs of individuals with the condition. By providing appropriate nutritional interventions, healthcare providers can significantly improve patient outcomes and overall well-being for those living with cystic fibrosis.</data>
