    <edge source="NUTRITIONAL SUPPORT" target="NUTRITION">
      <data key="d8">16.0</data>
      <data key="d9">NUTRITIONAL SUPPORT and NUTRITION are essential components in the care of patients, particularly those facing serious health challenges such as cancer. Nutrition is fundamental in providing nutritional support for cancer patients, especially for those experiencing cachexia, a condition characterized by severe weight loss and muscle wasting. Additionally, nutrition plays a critical role in supporting patients undergoing treatments like bone marrow transplantation, where proper dietary intake can significantly impact recovery and overall health. Together, these aspects highlight the importance of nutrition in enhancing the well-being of patients during their treatment journeys.</data>
      <data key="d10">73d47e377c2910da3393d7bb65f80e8e,ce2e5f8df5ad472bb255174d496cc1d7</data>
      <data key="d11">3a0ed5a6c9bd42edb748b28bf199803b</data>
      <data key="d12">3789</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRITIONAL SUPPORT" target="ESOPHAGEAL CANCER">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Nutritional support is critical for patients undergoing surgery for esophageal cancer to reduce complications and improve recovery</data>
      <data key="d10">758bc764453f49b9097073c5175470cc</data>
      <data key="d11">1050086321e24c4eb3abc2b2dedf8433</data>
      <data key="d12">3790</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
