      <data key="d8">18.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Nutritional support is essential for oncological patients, as they often face nutritional deficiencies and health challenges during their treatment. This support plays a crucial role in managing their condition and ensuring they maintain optimal health throughout their therapy.</data>
      <data key="d10">11cbdce47eee11a80ab609f3b786bcc1,fb7b0d121f195e2a472f3d47e28ccff9</data>
      <data key="d11">6ea3dfc625c74fb8b751d6233c7d5d66</data>
