    </edge>
    <edge source="ALIMENTOS" target="DIETA HIPOS&#211;DICA ESTRICTA">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La dieta hipos&#243;dica estricta incluye una selecci&#243;n de alimentos espec&#237;ficos para controlar el sodio</data>
      <data key="d10">1d959525e9a5fe22094271d67d0b9108</data>
      <data key="d11">12b76b3dae644723ab81e380c1920ab1</data>
      <data key="d12">3860</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ALIMENTOS" target="MEDICAMENTOS">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Los medicamentos pueden contener sodio, lo que es relevante para la selecci&#243;n de alimentos en una dieta hipos&#243;dica</data>
      <data key="d10">1d959525e9a5fe22094271d67d0b9108</data>
      <data key="d11">4580713769aa47169cf6055da5f89279</data>
      <data key="d12">3861</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ALIMENTOS" target="HTA">
      <data key="d8">4.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Certain foods can impact blood pressure levels, either positively or negatively, depending on their composition.</data>
      <data key="d10">29b354fe9b007cadb55ce27555391d5a</data>
      <data key="d11">c9ed5b135d6c4ee78647d128de88da05</data>
      <data key="d12">3862</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ALIMENTOS" target="ADDITIVOS ALIMENTARIOS">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Food additives are used in various food products, affecting their nutritional profiles</data>
      <data key="d10">ae1766e8ae855b3c79ad6d5fdefab1b0</data>
      <data key="d11">02b8e2012cd341c99915d7c50325096d</data>
      <data key="d12">3863</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ALIMENTOS" target="HYPERFOSFATEMIA">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Certain foods can contribute to hyperphosphatemia if they contain high levels of phosphorus</data>
      <data key="d10">ae1766e8ae855b3c79ad6d5fdefab1b0</data>
      <data key="d11">2e2dd20277dc4e6d93935c63d43980b8</data>
      <data key="d12">3864</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ALIMENTOS" target="CUPROPLASMINA">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Los alimentos que contienen cobre son relevantes para la regulaci&#243;n de los niveles de ceruloplasmina en el cuerpo</data>
      <data key="d10">232591ff32b33e56e95717d4582a5903</data>
      <data key="d11">dbcb7ab945ee431ca0d258542ddc1930</data>
      <data key="d12">3865</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ALIMENTOS" target="ALIMENTOS COMERCIALMENTE EST&#201;RILES">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Commercially sterile foods are a category of foods that patients may consume to ensure safety during their treatment</data>
      <data key="d10">17fc469cf1ddbb8fa68bad4446bd65e6</data>
      <data key="d11">161f63d5b52749688d09fca1876f8d1c</data>
      <data key="d12">3866</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ALIMENTOS" target="ALIMENTOS MUY LIMPIOS">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Very clean foods are another category of foods that patients may consume to ensure safety during their treatment</data>
      <data key="d10">17fc469cf1ddbb8fa68bad4446bd65e6</data>
      <data key="d11">c4527ce310fe4f9b9bbb9a087bcde725</data>
      <data key="d12">3867</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ALIMENTOS" target="ALERGIAS ALIMENTARIAS">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Los alimentos son la causa de las alergias alimentarias en individuos predispuestos</data>
      <data key="d10">d10e6c00bbb982bda449b9cb815691a3</data>
      <data key="d11">92e2752bbe57472a831e85234191ab50</data>
      <data key="d12">3868</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ALIMENTOS" target="ALERGIAS E INTOLERANCIAS ALIMENTARIAS">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">El tema de alergias e intolerancias alimentarias se centra en los alimentos que pueden causar reacciones al&#233;rgicas.</data>
      <data key="d10">bc394d70461777b6300d5449185a7859</data>
      <data key="d11">bfe8ab4e65344e39be3e827998a15222</data>
      <data key="d12">3869</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ALIMENTOS" target="DIETAS DE ELIMINACI&#211;N">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Las dietas de eliminaci&#243;n se utilizan para identificar alimentos que causan reacciones al&#233;rgicas en individuos sensibles.</data>
      <data key="d10">bc394d70461777b6300d5449185a7859</data>
      <data key="d11">bd59aedae0324f97ad2e18993a0d99ca</data>
      <data key="d12">3870</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ALIMENTOS" target="YODO">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Los alimentos pueden contener yodo, lo que afecta el tratamiento y diagn&#243;stico del tiroides</data>
      <data key="d10">072912695b1cff9f390d4ead3b9ad742</data>
      <data key="d11">96488ae1abf646c29460dd67da3a9501</data>
      <data key="d12">3871</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ALIMENTOS" target="AMOXICILINA">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La amoxicilina puede tener su biodisponibilidad afectada por la fibra de la dieta, lo que muestra una interacci&#243;n entre ambos.</data>
      <data key="d10">ac274a54f27601e9d60118e72fc2ba94</data>
      <data key="d11">d5e9e640c8824962bc046eb619506bf9</data>
      <data key="d12">3872</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ALIMENTOS" target="PARACETAMOL">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">El paracetamol puede verse afectado en su absorci&#243;n por componentes de la dieta, indicando una interacci&#243;n.</data>
      <data key="d10">ac274a54f27601e9d60118e72fc2ba94</data>
      <data key="d11">f826fa230edd477684fa08e9826b390d</data>
      <data key="d12">3873</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ALIMENTOS" target="DIGOXINA">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La digoxina puede interactuar con la fibra de la dieta, afectando su biodisponibilidad.</data>
      <data key="d10">ac274a54f27601e9d60118e72fc2ba94</data>
      <data key="d11">49f2bbe826ea4d01a8b86fc0bab0665e</data>
      <data key="d12">3874</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ALIMENTOS" target="LOVASTATINA">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La lovastatina puede ser afectada por la ingesta de alimentos, mostrando una interacci&#243;n entre ambos.</data>
      <data key="d10">ac274a54f27601e9d60118e72fc2ba94</data>
      <data key="d11">bd808abd70d84a298066cb66c66cb309</data>
      <data key="d12">3875</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ALIMENTOS" target="ERITROMICINA">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La eritromicina puede ser degradada en un medio &#225;cido, afectando su absorci&#243;n por la presencia de alimentos.</data>
      <data key="d10">ac274a54f27601e9d60118e72fc2ba94</data>
      <data key="d11">02f8515568dc4edeacca930f068bb8e1</data>
      <data key="d12">3876</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ALIMENTOS" target="NUTRICI&#211;N PEDI&#193;TRICA">
      <data key="d8">14.0</data>
      <data key="d9">ALIMENTOS and NUTRICI&#211;N PEDI&#193;TRICA are closely related entities that emphasize the importance of nutrition in children's diets. NUTRICI&#211;N PEDI&#193;TRICA offers strategies aimed at helping children accept new foods, which is crucial for fostering healthy eating habits. Additionally, the nutritional guidelines provided by NUTRICI&#211;N PEDI&#193;TRICA focus on the introduction and consumption of a variety of food items, ensuring that children's diets are balanced and diverse. Together, these efforts highlight the significance of proper nutrition in pediatric health and development.</data>
      <data key="d10">11662a6f83b8217976d8c9c5d33fe7fd,61b84039de5ac2d9e25890c3b8f4f87a</data>
      <data key="d11">ca527cec55a4495fbe6c62ddadadc430</data>
      <data key="d12">3877</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ALIMENTOS" target="NUTRIENTES">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Alimentos are the sources from which nutrients are derived, essential for health</data>
      <data key="d10">f718747b68f5c2d9d67148f05fd2d4ef</data>
      <data key="d11">28854cc79c1044538f9834587fbd0cb8</data>
      <data key="d12">3878</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ALIMENTOS" target="CALIDAD ASISTENCIAL">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The quality of food provided to patients is a critical aspect of overall quality of care</data>
      <data key="d10">03b047c49cda5e7bb642efcc9109ccc6</data>
      <data key="d11">80641367053d42ddb722b6cb64a2b67a</data>
      <data key="d12">3879</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MALNUTRICI&#211;N UNIVERSAL SCREENING TOOL" target="BAPEN">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">BAPEN developed the MUST tool for malnutrition screening</data>
      <data key="d10">ebfa3e3e6e6101b4d607871e17276705</data>
      <data key="d11">78ea32989649426494181ff6e3f4a594</data>
      <data key="d12">3880</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="BAPEN" target="SOCIETY ESPA&#209;OLA DE NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL Y ENTERAL">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Both organizations are dedicated to improving nutritional care and addressing malnutrition in their respective regions</data>
      <data key="d10">b422a0b87e2f7205a53dc0a5f1c0ab39</data>
      <data key="d11">4f60e2e753d04b4f9aea999cd99e6747</data>
      <data key="d12">3881</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="BAPEN" target="ANNUAL BANS REPORT">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">BAPEN oversees the British Artificial Nutrition Survey which publishes the Annual BANS Report</data>
      <data key="d10">7e3e2024996e402fc0ab62933ab9417b</data>
      <data key="d11">b3e01581fc6c4b298816fca0a5776dc5</data>
      <data key="d12">3882</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="RIESGO NUTRICIONAL" target="HOMBRE">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">El paciente var&#243;n de 66 a&#241;os presenta riesgo nutricional debido a su diagn&#243;stico de c&#225;ncer y diabetes</data>
      <data key="d10">e474ebdcd3e5392e4b2bed8434293849</data>
      <data key="d11">36d142352c604606b8cfa9d5b1fb5eb7</data>
      <data key="d12">3883</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="RIESGO NUTRICIONAL" target="CIRUG&#205;A BARI&#193;TRICA">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La cirug&#237;a bari&#225;trica puede llevar a un riesgo nutricional que necesita ser gestionado</data>
      <data key="d10">01d01bb87220a5cf6d7b37d95834e15f</data>
      <data key="d11">c088c2f0892841f6be13634b9d785ecb</data>
      <data key="d12">3884</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PUNTUACI&#211;N" target="PACIENTES MAYORES DE 70 A&#209;OS">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Patients over 70 years receive an additional point in their nutritional assessment scoring</data>
      <data key="d10">ebfa3e3e6e6101b4d607871e17276705</data>
      <data key="d11">c3dc4ce9de0b44549bf5ca87f16cb6eb</data>
      <data key="d12">3885</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MALNUTRITION UNIVERSAL SCREENING TOOL" target="MINI NUTRITIONAL ASSESSMENT">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Both tools are methods for assessing nutritional status and risk of malnutrition in patients, particularly the elderly.</data>
      <data key="d10">f764c1a74fbbce262e79b50639acb7bd</data>
      <data key="d11">cde5567c3eda42909999e8841cb89350</data>
      <data key="d12">3886</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MALNUTRITION UNIVERSAL SCREENING TOOL" target="MALNUTRITION SCREENING TOOL">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Both are screening tools used to evaluate malnutrition risk in patients, with specific applications in different populations.</data>
      <data key="d10">f764c1a74fbbce262e79b50639acb7bd</data>
      <data key="d11">642d397fffa247fca70bdc968f79efc6</data>
      <data key="d12">3887</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MALNUTRITION UNIVERSAL SCREENING TOOL" target="ESPANA">
      <data key="d8">5.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The Malnutrition Universal Screening Tool was developed as part of a consensus in Spain regarding hospital malnutrition management.</data>
      <data key="d10">f764c1a74fbbce262e79b50639acb7bd</data>
      <data key="d11">79d4e840e7114c1e974d36fd7e30e156</data>
      <data key="d12">3888</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MALNUTRITION UNIVERSAL SCREENING TOOL" target="RESIDENCES DE MAYORES">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Residences for the elderly implement the Malnutrition Universal Screening Tool to monitor residents' nutritional health.</data>
      <data key="d10">f764c1a74fbbce262e79b50639acb7bd</data>
      <data key="d11">36fc94e8a98d4904a2801b9969ced3d7</data>
      <data key="d12">3889</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MALNUTRITION UNIVERSAL SCREENING TOOL" target="ATENCI&#211;N PRIMARIA">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Primary care services apply the Malnutrition Universal Screening Tool for regular nutritional assessments of patients.</data>
      <data key="d10">f764c1a74fbbce262e79b50639acb7bd</data>
      <data key="d11">58eb90b78581482da96582528a04cf33</data>
      <data key="d12">3890</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MALNUTRITION UNIVERSAL SCREENING TOOL" target="SOCIETY ESPA&#209;OLA DE NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL Y ENTERAL">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The MUST tool is promoted by the SENPE as part of their efforts to combat malnutrition</data>
      <data key="d10">b422a0b87e2f7205a53dc0a5f1c0ab39</data>
      <data key="d11">ae0a86f6fef5427884b7de9e0d3cff85</data>
      <data key="d12">3891</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MALNUTRITION UNIVERSAL SCREENING TOOL" target="JENSEN GL">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Jensen GL is involved in the development of guidelines that include the MUST</data>
      <data key="d10">b422a0b87e2f7205a53dc0a5f1c0ab39</data>
      <data key="d11">325e0c40222a42ea94b82ed72400e09d</data>
      <data key="d12">3892</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MALNUTRITION UNIVERSAL SCREENING TOOL" target="MIRTALLO J">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Mirtallo J contributed to the guidelines that endorse the use of the MUST</data>
      <data key="d10">b422a0b87e2f7205a53dc0a5f1c0ab39</data>
      <data key="d11">351ea204bf824396818d1d1cb19d9596</data>
      <data key="d12">3893</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MALNUTRITION UNIVERSAL SCREENING TOOL" target="COMPHER C">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Compher C is a co-author of the guidelines that include the MUST as a screening tool</data>
      <data key="d10">b422a0b87e2f7205a53dc0a5f1c0ab39</data>
      <data key="d11">0a647a83cda7480da9955a04ad8d9aae</data>
      <data key="d12">3894</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MALNUTRITION UNIVERSAL SCREENING TOOL" target="DHALIWAL R">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Dhaliwal R is part of the team that developed the guidelines for malnutrition screening, including the MUST</data>
