    </edge>
    <edge source="MALNUTRITION UNIVERSAL SCREENING TOOL" target="BRITISH JOURNAL OF NUTRITION">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The Malnutrition Universal Screening Tool is discussed in the British Journal of Nutrition as a predictor of health outcomes</data>
