      <data key="d8">16.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The Mini Nutritional Assessment is a tool developed by the Nestl&#233; Nutrition Institute to evaluate patients' nutritional status. This assessment aims to provide a comprehensive evaluation of an individual's nutritional health, facilitating better dietary management and care.</data>
