      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">BMI is a parameter included in the NRS-2002 screening tool</data>
      <data key="d10">7906ee47aaf0c271f072790eaea05866</data>
      <data key="d11">acf8a0bd551547e9baabeb9b1736952c</data>
      <data key="d12">3997</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&#205;NDICE DE MASA CORPORAL" target="PACIENTES CON TUMORES DE CABEZA Y CUELLO">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">BMI is used to assess the weight status of patients with head and neck tumors</data>
      <data key="d10">58af2bdd20eeb5647ecc8088732833d8</data>
      <data key="d11">ef6932057edc4e84b7d4f1ad28130b94</data>
      <data key="d12">3998</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&#205;NDICE DE MASA CORPORAL" target="C&#193;NCER">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">El IMC se eval&#250;a regularmente en pacientes con c&#225;ncer para detectar alteraciones nutricionales</data>
      <data key="d10">f7871bbaa57d50bb5f5675cd580cb0af</data>
      <data key="d11">314f28e7fd18406bb3b1e3c88cabd120</data>
      <data key="d12">3999</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HIDRATACI&#211;N" target="PACIENTE ANCIANO">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La adecuada hidrataci&#243;n es crucial para la salud del paciente anciano, previniendo complicaciones relacionadas con la deshidrataci&#243;n.</data>
      <data key="d10">2f548ddee569586dbe82ca124f2695e9</data>
      <data key="d11">c7f30e60a6cc4af2ae3424b89f330cef</data>
      <data key="d12">4000</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HIDRATACI&#211;N" target="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">HIDRATACI&#211;N and NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL are closely related concepts in the context of patient care, particularly for those who are unable to consume fluids orally. Hydration is a critical component of parenteral nutrition, which involves delivering nutrients directly into the bloodstream. It is essential that hydration levels are carefully monitored and adjusted according to the individual needs of the patient to ensure optimal health outcomes.</data>
      <data key="d10">37ca60bdc28109c9bec995e3c433c801,df3e8fd56a2df522425984adc77392ab</data>
      <data key="d11">040f3451e64b4c8f8c9dab4d4ea21fba</data>
      <data key="d12">4001</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HIDRATACI&#211;N" target="CETOACIDOSIS">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Hydration is essential in the treatment of cetoacidosis to restore fluid balance and improve patient outcomes</data>
      <data key="d10">afe0f4f37815c175f0faff06eb24a256</data>
      <data key="d11">56fe428089664962b3cc0ba5d2d3d75d</data>
      <data key="d12">4002</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HIDRATACI&#211;N" target="FALLO INTESTINAL">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Hydration is essential in managing patients with intestinal failure to prevent dehydration and maintain electrolyte balance</data>
      <data key="d10">9f3f6014b1a9e68b22c02862a9143a33</data>
      <data key="d11">1872adfb85af4b5c834656b90794e628</data>
      <data key="d12">4003</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HIDRATACI&#211;N" target="EJERCICIO F&#205;SICO">
      <data key="d8">33.0</data>
      <data key="d9">HIDRATACI&#211;N and EJERCICIO F&#205;SICO are closely interconnected, as adequate hydration is necessary during physical exercise to maintain both performance and health. Proper hydration is crucial for athletes, as it helps prevent dehydration and supports optimal functioning during workouts. Therefore, ensuring sufficient fluid intake is essential for anyone engaging in physical activity to achieve their best performance and safeguard their well-being.</data>
      <data key="d10">21339c051dc2f47471026673b3ac6436,364aa13581a973c2e55c25191bad27cc,cca60bfbb1e73ceda513fbcaf0866a8f,cfe1de28f01fa6428be1486b6af8f0a2</data>
      <data key="d11">1665a74ef87545caa3c12d4c9575757d</data>
      <data key="d12">4004</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HIDRATACI&#211;N" target="DIARREA AGUDA">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La hidrataci&#243;n es una intervenci&#243;n clave en el manejo de la diarrea aguda para prevenir la deshidrataci&#243;n y reducir la mortalidad.</data>
      <data key="d10">28f6d6818b8f0ce3d2b8f483fe0dac6c</data>
      <data key="d11">a3cbae1a9969445eb4f319b72a6eadbc</data>
      <data key="d12">4005</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HIDRATACI&#211;N" target="PACIENTE QUEMADO">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Burn patients require hydration as a fundamental aspect of their treatment to support recovery</data>
      <data key="d10">916d4d35de887923f4ea5b05928f13e3</data>
      <data key="d11">7a6ddc392342481eb05d4f362e5317a4</data>
      <data key="d12">4006</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HIDRATACI&#211;N" target="DEPORTISTA">
      <data key="d8">17.0</data>
      <data key="d9">HIDRATACI&#211;N es un aspecto fundamental para el DEPORTISTA, ya que es necesario mantener una adecuada hidrataci&#243;n para optimizar su rendimiento f&#237;sico y preservar su salud durante el ejercicio. La correcta hidrataci&#243;n no solo mejora el rendimiento, sino que tambi&#233;n ayuda a evitar problemas digestivos, lo que es crucial para el bienestar general del deportista.</data>
      <data key="d10">364aa13581a973c2e55c25191bad27cc,638446780cdd61df83a06944c4e15c15</data>
      <data key="d11">46c089e9ddb54126a3d9c489b07ef844</data>
      <data key="d12">4007</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HIDRATACI&#211;N" target="SODIO">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">El sodio es un componente importante en la hidrataci&#243;n, ya que ayuda a mantener el equilibrio de l&#237;quidos en el cuerpo.</data>
      <data key="d10">364aa13581a973c2e55c25191bad27cc</data>
      <data key="d11">d408883887424aecb56a91c050dfd309</data>
      <data key="d12">4008</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HIDRATACI&#211;N" target="BEBIDAS DEPORTIVAS">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Sports drinks are designed to aid in hydration during physical activity.</data>
      <data key="d10">cfe1de28f01fa6428be1486b6af8f0a2</data>
      <data key="d11">25303ad5a9af41068e1bb740296e4b0f</data>
      <data key="d12">4009</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HIDRATACI&#211;N" target="GLUCOSA">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Maintaining glucose levels is crucial for effective hydration and energy during exercise.</data>
      <data key="d10">cfe1de28f01fa6428be1486b6af8f0a2</data>
      <data key="d11">75544d6d6c32481aa9c6ec1ee03b44ae</data>
      <data key="d12">4010</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HIDRATACI&#211;N" target="GASTO DE GLUC&#211;GENO MUSCULAR">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Hydration can influence the rate of muscle glycogen expenditure during exercise.</data>
      <data key="d10">cfe1de28f01fa6428be1486b6af8f0a2</data>
      <data key="d11">35ac0ec1eda74050a1bb4d54e47504b0</data>
      <data key="d12">4011</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="AUTONOM&#205;A" target="MALNUTRICI&#211;N">
      <data key="d8">5.0</data>
      <data key="d9">A decrease in autonomy can indicate potential malnutrition, as it may affect a patient's ability to obtain and prepare food</data>
      <data key="d10">0bc48d0666e895b990c211acf7cbcf23</data>
      <data key="d11">dc5cf348f7cc4c59bbaf215f5de4b87a</data>
      <data key="d12">4012</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="AUTONOM&#205;A" target="CUIDADO">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The concept of autonomy influences how care is provided, particularly in cultures that prioritize individual decision-making</data>
      <data key="d10">46c8c4b701aeb8284e92c06443f5128d</data>
      <data key="d11">e37cfa3eeed7466c9caeefa97c5a9b66</data>
      <data key="d12">4013</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MEDICAMENTOS" target="COMPRIMIDOS">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Tablets must be crushed to be safely administered to patients with dysphagia</data>
      <data key="d10">0e756c1673317aaf495b90b8bcb02515</data>
      <data key="d11">a0e886de7f2946b1bd16c190817ca705</data>
      <data key="d12">4014</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MEDICAMENTOS" target="FORMULAS">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Liquid formulas must be thickened for safe consumption by patients with dysphagia</data>
