    <edge source="MEDICAMENTOS" target="SONDA ENTERAL">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Medicamentos must be carefully administered through enteral feeding tubes to prevent incompatibilities and ensure effective delivery</data>
