    <edge source="CONSENSO MULTIDISCIPLINAR" target="SPAIN">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The guidelines were developed in Spain to address malnutrition in hospitals</data>
      <data key="d10">28cd3f60e1ccd9129a7d4d386e241a93</data>
      <data key="d11">38c62c56f9544bdeb57ae943aa2f2776</data>
      <data key="d12">4019</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRITIONAL ASSESSMENT" target="HOSPITAL MALNUTRITION">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Nutritional assessment is a critical process for identifying and addressing hospital malnutrition. It plays a vital role in evaluating the nutritional status of patients within a hospital setting, ensuring that any instances of malnutrition are recognized and managed effectively. Through comprehensive nutritional assessments, healthcare providers can implement appropriate interventions to improve patient outcomes related to malnutrition in hospitals.</data>
      <data key="d10">28cd3f60e1ccd9129a7d4d386e241a93,67f60ae11335cf41da4f96400b69e67b</data>
      <data key="d11">8ba44036b1384063a17553eaecc77eae</data>
      <data key="d12">4020</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRITIONAL ASSESSMENT" target="NUTRITIONAL STATUS">
      <data key="d8">11.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Nutritional assessment is a critical process aimed at evaluating and determining the nutritional status of individuals. This assessment is particularly essential for patients with liver disease, as it helps identify their specific nutritional needs and deficiencies. The nutritional status itself is the outcome measured through these assessments, providing valuable insights into an individual's overall health and dietary requirements.</data>
      <data key="d10">025274b58725397020078dea52ea012b,28cd3f60e1ccd9129a7d4d386e241a93,2b5b30d7b9371f8fe9e686c89dde3cb7,c639615d7681ffeb945a996d231bb7aa</data>
      <data key="d11">9d1d31dd39b843368e269ae554ee5ec4</data>
      <data key="d12">4021</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRITIONAL ASSESSMENT" target="CLINICAL HISTORY">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Clinical history is an important component of the nutritional assessment process</data>
      <data key="d10">28cd3f60e1ccd9129a7d4d386e241a93</data>
      <data key="d11">1373611cd68643a6a43e0b806ceb80a3</data>
      <data key="d12">4022</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRITIONAL ASSESSMENT" target="ANTHROPOMETRY">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Anthropometry is a technique used in nutritional assessments to evaluate body composition</data>
      <data key="d10">28cd3f60e1ccd9129a7d4d386e241a93</data>
      <data key="d11">927e46f3f2e04a39a9f22e7f321cd572</data>
      <data key="d12">4023</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
