    <edge source="ENFERMEDAD" target="VALORACI&#211;N SUBJETIVA GLOBAL GENERADA POR EL PACIENTE">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La valoraci&#243;n subjetiva global se utiliza para evaluar el estado nutricional en el contexto de la enfermedad</data>
      <data key="d10">3f379d10d8c57694a1c646c072f7ed84</data>
      <data key="d11">7e70e56285fc48248af5fd6cf10d837e</data>
      <data key="d12">4310</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ENFERMEDAD" target="GALACTOSEMIA">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Galactosemia is classified as a metabolic disease that requires dietary management to prevent complications.</data>
      <data key="d10">c4056d00ff7cbd7d7e3464150ea3d5aa</data>
      <data key="d11">a4371104ecc347a48a41021685af4074</data>
      <data key="d12">4311</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ENFERMEDAD" target="ALERGIAS">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Las alergias son consideradas enfermedades que afectan la salud y pueden ser influenciadas por factores gen&#233;ticos y ambientales.</data>
      <data key="d10">39a7166ca777be46a1613c54a746e2b8</data>
      <data key="d11">ad81dc5e2a574b57ac9be3a09972f865</data>
      <data key="d12">4312</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ENFERMEDAD" target="NI&#209;OS">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Children with diseases may require nutritional support to prevent or correct malnutrition</data>
      <data key="d10">cd63370bdd798f0b060b047dc29056ae</data>
      <data key="d11">4fe2e103fd234f109fed489737bef58f</data>
      <data key="d12">4313</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ENFERMEDAD" target="FACTORES DE RIESGO">
      <data key="d8">15.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The entity "ENFERMEDAD" is influenced by various "FACTORES DE RIESGO" that are identified through nutritional studies. These factors are analyzed to determine their relationship with the onset of diseases. This analysis helps in understanding how specific risk factors contribute to the development of various health conditions.</data>
      <data key="d10">6799d5deb7130f888605e5e2d58c9de5,cf8a6f1b6d59546ed7bd297d032f6b30</data>
      <data key="d11">38a9811b341e44009c0b84fd8dac1e7f</data>
      <data key="d12">4314</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ENFERMEDAD" target="ESTUDIOS TRANSVERSALES">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Los estudios transversales permiten analizar la frecuencia de enfermedades en una poblaci&#243;n en un momento dado</data>
      <data key="d10">cf8a6f1b6d59546ed7bd297d032f6b30</data>
      <data key="d11">9d74bd6c2abe4d3f9da794983fb5b14a</data>
      <data key="d12">4315</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ENFERMEDAD" target="HISTORIA NATURAL DE LA ENFERMEDAD">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La historia natural de la enfermedad se estudia para entender c&#243;mo evoluciona una enfermedad sin intervenci&#243;n</data>
      <data key="d10">cf8a6f1b6d59546ed7bd297d032f6b30</data>
      <data key="d11">11a8b4ee8e0d43a3b3e0f55d72b32462</data>
      <data key="d12">4316</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ENFERMEDAD" target="INCIDENCIA">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The entity "ENFERMEDAD" refers to a disease, while "INCIDENCIA" pertains to the incidence or frequency of new cases of that disease within a population. The incidence is a crucial metric used to determine how often new cases of a disease occur over a specified period. In the context of studying "ENFERMEDAD," researchers aim to understand its incidencias over time, although it is important to note that this incidence is not directly measured in case-control studies. Thus, while the incidence provides valuable insights into the frequency of new cases, the methodology of certain studies may limit the direct measurement of this incidence.</data>
      <data key="d10">6799d5deb7130f888605e5e2d58c9de5,cf8a6f1b6d59546ed7bd297d032f6b30</data>
      <data key="d11">b61f63e6658040eaa7b0096a45daab8d</data>
      <data key="d12">4317</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
