      <data key="d10">7ea112a550fd775a80c3eda15663fba5</data>
      <data key="d11">ba95979dea534499b7d8df4a5086211d</data>
      <data key="d12">4363</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ASPEN" target="BAKER SS">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Baker SS is involved with ASPEN and has edited works related to pediatric nutrition</data>
      <data key="d10">7ea112a550fd775a80c3eda15663fba5</data>
      <data key="d11">916913b89af84dfbae623506b83db11d</data>
      <data key="d12">4364</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ASPEN" target="AGREE">
      <data key="d8">5.0</data>
      <data key="d9">AGREE collaborates with organizations like ASPEN to enhance the quality of clinical practice guidelines in nutrition</data>
      <data key="d10">07a16ed299a7f8bafcaa44a54495a9c3</data>
      <data key="d11">937d1624976547d4ac23be2a87f8d7c9</data>
      <data key="d12">4365</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ASPEN" target="NUTRICI&#211;N Y DIET&#201;TICA">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The field of Nutrition and Dietetics is supported by organizations like ASPEN that promote research and education in nutrition.</data>
      <data key="d10">c3182f51249513a920db6b935632fead</data>
      <data key="d11">78fdd317b5da47e0af5ae4d4c6cf3fae</data>
      <data key="d12">4366</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ENFERMEDADES" target="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Las enfermedades subyacentes afectan las necesidades nutricionales y la administraci&#243;n de nutrici&#243;n parenteral en ni&#241;os</data>
      <data key="d10">37ca60bdc28109c9bec995e3c433c801</data>
      <data key="d11">60227159f4e744bb8715afb0c06d9296</data>
      <data key="d12">4367</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ENFERMEDADES" target="DEPORTISTA">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Los deportistas pueden enfrentar enfermedades si no mantienen una adecuada ingesta energ&#233;tica y nutricional.</data>
      <data key="d10">ab9a942f3aa9ca3eb88bcd26fcd60ddb</data>
      <data key="d11">a93e1722adc54a42a4456c8221e01691</data>
      <data key="d12">4368</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="TRATAMIENTO ONCOL&#211;GICO" target="ALB&#218;MINA">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">El nivel de alb&#250;mina se mide antes del tratamiento oncol&#243;gico para evaluar el estado nutricional</data>
      <data key="d10">3f379d10d8c57694a1c646c072f7ed84</data>
      <data key="d11">bf3f53ddfd0141a4b30f78b2a3d25cd7</data>
      <data key="d12">4369</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="TRATAMIENTO ONCOL&#211;GICO" target="PREALB&#218;MINA">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La prealb&#250;mina se mide tras el tratamiento oncol&#243;gico para evaluar el estado nutricional del paciente</data>
      <data key="d10">3f379d10d8c57694a1c646c072f7ed84</data>
      <data key="d11">710eb6b4279f4312a5b3ab26d87098ea</data>
      <data key="d12">4370</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="TRATAMIENTO ONCOL&#211;GICO" target="C&#193;NCER">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">El tratamiento oncol&#243;gico es necesario para combatir el c&#225;ncer, pero puede afectar negativamente el estado nutricional</data>
      <data key="d10">5549895a3a7f54651e6c54f5a5d7d833</data>
      <data key="d11">502f48fcc2604b92a5f9e73ee1eee5ee</data>
      <data key="d12">4371</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="EXPLORACI&#211;N F&#205;SICA" target="PACIENTE CIRR&#211;TICO">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La exploraci&#243;n f&#237;sica ayuda a identificar problemas nutricionales en el paciente cirr&#243;tico</data>
      <data key="d10">c51fc76876398ca4252c2585fb1dbb6b</data>
      <data key="d11">6bcb7c261d284f50a9019627e2a6bc57</data>
      <data key="d12">4372</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="EXPLORACI&#211;N F&#205;SICA" target="DATOS ANTROPOM&#201;TRICOS">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La exploraci&#243;n f&#237;sica se complementa con datos antropom&#233;tricos para una evaluaci&#243;n m&#225;s completa del estado nutricional del paciente.</data>
      <data key="d10">f333e5a9af59dd8504607b2559ac35dd</data>
      <data key="d11">6e9fed4c630941bb9bc3b4e3f57828f6</data>
      <data key="d12">4373</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="EXPLORACI&#211;N F&#205;SICA" target="PAR&#193;METROS BIOQU&#205;MICOS">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La exploraci&#243;n f&#237;sica se utiliza junto con par&#225;metros bioqu&#237;micos para determinar el estado de salud del paciente.</data>
      <data key="d10">f333e5a9af59dd8504607b2559ac35dd</data>
      <data key="d11">194b72d656574641b8fedf8a74334539</data>
      <data key="d12">4374</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="EXPLORACI&#211;N F&#205;SICA" target="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Physical examination is a necessary part of the care for patients on parenteral nutrition</data>
      <data key="d10">2bd5549759c6a0d8393bb93fdccb747b</data>
      <data key="d11">81c3918fd62141629f754bf72e3ec5c7</data>
      <data key="d12">4375</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ASCITIS" target="CIRROSIS">
      <data key="d8">15.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Ascites is a common complication associated with cirrhosis, primarily resulting from portal hypertension. This condition can significantly impact nutritional evaluation in patients suffering from cirrhosis, highlighting the interconnectedness of these two entities in the context of liver disease.</data>
      <data key="d10">1911ce26c118381473eccb438875b29c,ecc0b96af9066f424f1c114102063682</data>
      <data key="d11">936d6b9283fb4ccb92ecf692df8a3f60</data>
      <data key="d12">4376</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ASCITIS" target="DIETA">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">ASCITIS and DIETA are closely related in the context of managing the condition of ascites. Dietary adjustments are essential for patients with ascites to effectively manage their health. Specifically, these patients often require certain dietary restrictions, particularly concerning salt and fluid intake, to alleviate symptoms and prevent complications associated with their condition.</data>
      <data key="d10">20491afa9a4770e93e6cff9034f8b0f0</data>
      <data key="d11">502bc57a71864df8bcba6044a3d5bed3</data>
      <data key="d12">4377</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ASCITIS" target="CIRROSIS HEP&#193;TICA">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Ascites is a common complication of cirrhosis, showing a direct relationship</data>
      <data key="d10">71dd228326087dc7aaa0d310d49b6f42</data>
      <data key="d11">4894a78f10024be3902a0543284814d3</data>
      <data key="d12">4378</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ASCITIS" target="PERITONITIS BACTERIANA ESPONT&#193;NEA (PBE)">
      <data key="d8">5.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Spontaneous bacterial peritonitis often occurs in patients with ascites due to cirrhosis, linking the two conditions</data>
      <data key="d10">71dd228326087dc7aaa0d310d49b6f42</data>
      <data key="d11">807900ff106f43c5b372c37d8acb072f</data>
      <data key="d12">4379</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ASCITIS" target="MALNUTRICI&#211;N">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La ascitis puede causar una disminuci&#243;n en la ingesta de nutrientes, contribuyendo a la malnutrici&#243;n en pacientes con enfermedad hep&#225;tica</data>
      <data key="d10">b4b789f8b1484fea88d0b5c58dfde854</data>
      <data key="d11">42ef140f9f9d47bd90974feb47a5d401</data>
      <data key="d12">4380</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ASCITIS" target="PACIENTE CIRR&#211;TICO">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La ascitis es una condici&#243;n que puede complicar el estado nutricional del paciente cirr&#243;tico</data>
      <data key="d10">c51fc76876398ca4252c2585fb1dbb6b</data>
      <data key="d11">9e99faba071d4910881acd8b28ab4779</data>
      <data key="d12">4381</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ASCITIS" target="PACIENTES CIRR&#211;TICOS">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Patients with cirrhosis often experience ascites, which affects their nutritional needs</data>
      <data key="d10">3437d6cdf014282ec447fc7f4de92cab</data>
      <data key="d11">40ef46befe1644c0a9d26f2815d03242</data>
      <data key="d12">4382</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ASCITIS" target="ENFERMEDAD CELIACA">
      <data key="d8">5.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La ascitis puede ser una complicaci&#243;n en pacientes con enfermedad cel&#237;aca, relacionada con la hipoalbuminemia.</data>
      <data key="d10">68c55f61003b7c0a490a0ee3bc97fcf2</data>
      <data key="d11">4f7d0c200f814f89bf61fe2530024c6b</data>
      <data key="d12">4383</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ASCITIS" target="HIPONATREMIA">
      <data key="d8">5.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La ascitis puede ser un signo de hiponatremia hipervol&#233;mica en los pacientes</data>
      <data key="d10">94481f05649e1ec83f8cc2e4a70b660b</data>
      <data key="d11">a70d5e9d5c504d04b367351263ff72be</data>
      <data key="d12">4384</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ESTRE&#209;IMIENTO" target="NAUSEAS">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Estre&#241;imiento can lead to nausea in patients, particularly those on certain medications</data>
      <data key="d10">79a751fb45e4b69c946d088100f43654</data>
      <data key="d11">e1252a78146d4584be4a64ce2a9c02ef</data>
      <data key="d12">4385</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ESTRE&#209;IMIENTO" target="ANOREXIA NERVIOSA">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Anorexia nerviosa is an eating disorder characterized by severe caloric restriction, which can lead to significant dietary changes. These changes often result in constipation, a common symptom among individuals suffering from this condition. The caloric restriction associated with anorexia nerviosa contributes to slowed gastrointestinal transit, further exacerbating the issue of constipation in affected patients.</data>
      <data key="d10">0f51b0c02b1e8200f9a98b830621c55c,7cc3d3c5826ce81977ed8ad725e1ddbe</data>
      <data key="d11">8c6221944f67499ea944830af4d0dfc0</data>
      <data key="d12">4386</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ESTRE&#209;IMIENTO" target="ROMA IV">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Los criterios de Roma IV son utilizados para diagnosticar el estre&#241;imiento funcional, lo que establece una relaci&#243;n directa entre ambos</data>
      <data key="d10">44f263c31f91c1bc594cbb28bd397c89</data>
      <data key="d11">04c527a07d5b400bace2032e2f76c172</data>
      <data key="d12">4387</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ESTRE&#209;IMIENTO" target="EEUU">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Estudios en Estados Unidos han investigado la prevalencia del estre&#241;imiento, lo que indica una relaci&#243;n entre el pa&#237;s y la condici&#243;n</data>
      <data key="d10">44f263c31f91c1bc594cbb28bd397c89</data>
      <data key="d11">7a051ee45ec64e299b0fe6c3be3426f2</data>
      <data key="d12">4388</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ESTRE&#209;IMIENTO" target="FIBRA">
      <data key="d8">16.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The entity "FIBRA" is recognized for its beneficial role in digestive health, particularly in alleviating constipation and enhancing bowel regularity. It is commonly recommended to increase fiber intake as a means to improve these aspects of gastrointestinal function. The entity "ESTRE&#209;IMIENTO" is directly related to these recommendations, as fiber is specifically suggested to help manage and relieve symptoms associated with constipation.</data>
      <data key="d10">0f51b0c02b1e8200f9a98b830621c55c,beef8f83c872431c6e371987b717e43b</data>
      <data key="d11">4897696dca0841f7a78e221225006458</data>
      <data key="d12">4389</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ESTRE&#209;IMIENTO" target="LAXANTES">
      <data key="d8">17.0</data>
      <data key="d9">ESTRE&#241;IMIENTO, commonly known as constipation, is a condition that can be effectively treated with LAXANTES, or laxatives. Laxatives are substances that promote bowel movements and are frequently utilized to alleviate the discomfort associated with constipation. They serve as a common therapeutic option for individuals seeking relief from this condition.</data>
      <data key="d10">0f51b0c02b1e8200f9a98b830621c55c,beef8f83c872431c6e371987b717e43b</data>
      <data key="d11">d8c8f7c858054417b0451e983a770bf2</data>
      <data key="d12">4390</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ESTRE&#209;IMIENTO" target="HIPOPOTASEMIA">
      <data key="d8">3.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Low potassium levels can contribute to muscle weakness and may affect bowel function</data>
      <data key="d10">0f51b0c02b1e8200f9a98b830621c55c</data>
      <data key="d11">142b5b806f134678b2e96c217fb5fb8f</data>
      <data key="d12">4391</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ESTRE&#209;IMIENTO" target="S&#205;NDROME DE INTESTINO IRRITABLE">
      <data key="d8">5.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Irritable bowel syndrome can lead to symptoms of constipation</data>
      <data key="d10">0f51b0c02b1e8200f9a98b830621c55c</data>
      <data key="d11">26d999210d2e43bf9be05982618d7d26</data>
      <data key="d12">4392</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ESTRE&#209;IMIENTO" target="NADYA">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">NADYA studies complications related to enteral nutrition, including constipation, which is a frequent issue in their research</data>
      <data key="d10">beef8f83c872431c6e371987b717e43b</data>
      <data key="d11">50570cb373904aa08c6f444a9998f46e</data>
      <data key="d12">4393</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ESTRE&#209;IMIENTO" target="MISOPROSTOL">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Misoprostol is used to treat functional defecation disorders, which can include constipation</data>
      <data key="d10">beef8f83c872431c6e371987b717e43b</data>
      <data key="d11">a65fb84b51cf41f0961c5fdc301e2402</data>
      <data key="d12">4394</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ESTRE&#209;IMIENTO" target="COLCHICINE">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Colchicine is utilized in treating conditions that may lead to constipation</data>
      <data key="d10">beef8f83c872431c6e371987b717e43b</data>
      <data key="d11">d6e46a4eba614cbe83ae3207630165db</data>
      <data key="d12">4395</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ESTRE&#209;IMIENTO" target="LUBIPROSTONE">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Lubiprostone is prescribed for patients experiencing constipation</data>
      <data key="d10">beef8f83c872431c6e371987b717e43b</data>
      <data key="d11">b217957ab135473babc244016e340601</data>
      <data key="d12">4396</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ESTRE&#209;IMIENTO" target="TOXINA BOTUL&#205;NICA">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Botulinum toxin is used in specific cases to address bowel function issues, including constipation</data>
      <data key="d10">beef8f83c872431c6e371987b717e43b</data>
      <data key="d11">21a9f107156741bba67bc9bebbd568ec</data>
      <data key="d12">4397</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ESTRE&#209;IMIENTO" target="DISBIOSIS">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Disbiosis can lead to constipation, affecting health and quality of life</data>
      <data key="d10">90f122c65fbb08f52e052d0e22714849</data>
      <data key="d11">3335b829584c4436b3e0c136a3abe364</data>
      <data key="d12">4398</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ESTRE&#209;IMIENTO" target="NUTRICI&#211;N EN CIRUG&#205;A DE TUMORES DE CABEZA Y CUELLO">
      <data key="d8">5.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Constipation management is a key component of nutritional care for patients undergoing surgery for head and neck tumors</data>
      <data key="d10">2bbe847617971cacfe15b2c970de2d21</data>
      <data key="d11">d0a901c9d731445b9da1d9fc56fbb086</data>
      <data key="d12">4399</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ESTRE&#209;IMIENTO" target="NUTRICI&#211;N EN ONCOLOG&#205;A">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Estre&#241;imiento is a common issue in cancer patients that can be managed through dietary changes</data>
      <data key="d10">42e8a4a4bff905ef121f1101d65c959f</data>
      <data key="d11">8504b89fbc314cd9a81ede5a0726d51c</data>
      <data key="d12">4400</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ESTRE&#209;IMIENTO" target="FIBRAS">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Fibers help prevent constipation</data>
      <data key="d10">d028f23d86d7ed32eebe35c5d90765f2</data>
      <data key="d11">e9201d8ec4c04395ac7a0f18eb25aa5e</data>
      <data key="d12">4401</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ESTRE&#209;IMIENTO" target="BENZODIACEPINAS">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Benzodiazepines are associated with increased risk of constipation</data>
      <data key="d10">09e9623b3facc5045e80541b1cd2cada</data>
      <data key="d11">db4af1ca2f114ed998eae7873b9fe9be</data>
      <data key="d12">4402</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ESTRE&#209;IMIENTO" target="OPI&#193;CEOS">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Opioids are known to cause constipation, particularly in patients receiving enteral nutrition</data>
      <data key="d10">09e9623b3facc5045e80541b1cd2cada</data>
      <data key="d11">601c22f963c94d3a8b5fc409bbce7afe</data>
      <data key="d12">4403</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DOLOR" target="PREGABALIN">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Pregabalin is used to manage the pain experienced by the patient</data>
      <data key="d10">3a5d7e4dc412f1d4701672c3af3cb4ed</data>
      <data key="d11">581d317e9f194ba8afbc01edc84098c2</data>
      <data key="d12">4404</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DOLOR" target="ACETYL SALICYLIC ACID">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Acetyl salicylic acid is used to alleviate pain that the patient experiences</data>
      <data key="d10">3a5d7e4dc412f1d4701672c3af3cb4ed</data>
      <data key="d11">70009563ae4d4f179b7d92fccf8c912f</data>
      <data key="d12">4405</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DOLOR" target="PANCREATITIS">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Pain is a common symptom associated with pancreatitis, affecting the quality of life of patients</data>
      <data key="d10">32642463df83d3626d7a9c5acf121825</data>
      <data key="d11">7646fc29cc7c4050b332e7d1d9f4c298</data>
      <data key="d12">4406</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DOLOR" target="DIE&#769;TICA">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Dietary management aims to reduce pain experienced by patients with pancreatic conditions through appropriate food choices</data>
      <data key="d10">32642463df83d3626d7a9c5acf121825</data>
      <data key="d11">3f0942f4023140cfb25098b63b9008a8</data>
      <data key="d12">4407</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DOLOR" target="MUCOSITIS">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La mucositis puede causar dolor, lo que afecta la ingesta de alimentos.</data>
      <data key="d10">9562f39f9e78644164daeff3177a2f84</data>
      <data key="d11">4a07f51d9a324edbbd7fd712f6154085</data>
      <data key="d12">4408</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DOLOR" target="SIADH">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Dolor can stimulate the release of ADH, contributing to the development of SIADH and subsequent hyponatremia</data>
      <data key="d10">fee4d9611c98c81859bccdb4ded03622</data>
      <data key="d11">b26bb61927e04a668bc8c7c45bed770f</data>
      <data key="d12">4409</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DEPRESI&#211;N" target="CORTISOL">
      <data key="d8">4.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La depresi&#243;n puede provocar alteraciones hormonales que afectan los niveles de cortisol</data>
      <data key="d10">e5103e718912067f1a2766544cf1b4db</data>
      <data key="d11">c464ed2460d44a478109511911ee109d</data>
      <data key="d12">4410</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DEPRESI&#211;N" target="OBESIDAD">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Obesity can lead to depression due to social stigma and health-related issues.</data>
      <data key="d10">3e40e9a9e041bbf1e7ca6eaa14080666</data>
      <data key="d11">1f2e539b09014dee9dd1c29e225b4e53</data>
      <data key="d12">4411</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DEPRESI&#211;N" target="SEROTONINA">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Alterations in serotonin levels are linked to the development of depression in patients with eating disorders</data>
      <data key="d10">3bc554a0031c436483a977c2b9e57b48</data>
      <data key="d11">18841b5b1d564aba826e0f0ac62d3623</data>
      <data key="d12">4412</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DEPRESI&#211;N" target="INSUFICIENCIA RENAL">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La depresi&#243;n puede ser un factor que contribuye a la malnutrici&#243;n en pacientes con insuficiencia renal</data>
      <data key="d10">a87e8e113488b153c5b4b2d2fca712c0</data>
      <data key="d11">907434c3ecc74d2a81f011cb4f450b92</data>
      <data key="d12">4413</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&#218;LCERAS POR PRESI&#211;N" target="P&#201;RDIDA MUSCULAR">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Las &#250;lceras por presi&#243;n pueden estar relacionadas con la p&#233;rdida muscular en pacientes con malnutrici&#243;n</data>
      <data key="d10">3f379d10d8c57694a1c646c072f7ed84</data>
      <data key="d11">92052622787e445e8d4175d2932da4f8</data>
      <data key="d12">4414</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&#218;LCERAS POR PRESI&#211;N" target="MALNUTRICI&#211;N">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Pressure ulcers are often a consequence of malnutrition and immobility in elderly patients.</data>
      <data key="d10">b6180d67d6fdf45ff73aa2a63a8e3f74</data>
      <data key="d11">32d4c4c0f59d4201a0bff88dc82ecbf7</data>
      <data key="d12">4415</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="FIEBRE/CORTICOIDES" target="P&#201;RDIDA ADIPOSA">
      <data key="d8">5.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La fiebre y el uso de corticoides pueden contribuir a la p&#233;rdida adiposa en pacientes</data>
      <data key="d10">3f379d10d8c57694a1c646c072f7ed84</data>
      <data key="d11">a6ea1c6f6dce4ccd83add8063c5894fc</data>
      <data key="d12">4416</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="TRATAMIENTO ANTINEOPL&#193;SICO" target="PACIENTE ONCOL&#211;GICO">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Los pacientes oncol&#243;gicos reciben tratamiento antineopl&#225;sico que puede afectar su estado nutricional</data>
      <data key="d10">e510500bd5a5f16a0bf0353cfdb79c13</data>
      <data key="d11">9d825ea9a3974a0e93080e8fcb930f30</data>
      <data key="d12">4417</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="TRATAMIENTO ANTINEOPL&#193;SICO" target="TRASPLANTE DE C&#201;LULAS HEMATOL&#211;GICAS">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">El trasplante de c&#233;lulas hematol&#243;gicas se utiliza como un tratamiento antineopl&#225;sico para erradicar tumores</data>
      <data key="d10">4015c8a1a16c5c93f3b853d9cac57bf4</data>
      <data key="d11">2714894b68d7450cb8b891ca7ca35eaa</data>
      <data key="d12">4418</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="P&#201;RDIDA MUSCULAR" target="EDEMAS/ASCITIS">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La presencia de edemas o ascitis puede estar relacionada con la p&#233;rdida muscular en el paciente</data>
      <data key="d10">3f379d10d8c57694a1c646c072f7ed84</data>
      <data key="d11">3b46195a8a4b40a79bebf67fdeb3a8f4</data>
      <data key="d12">4419</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="IMC" target="PLIEGUE TRICIPITAL">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">El IMC se utiliza junto con el Pliegue Tricipital para evaluar la adiposidad en el cuerpo</data>
      <data key="d10">c69834419bc4c69bcafd7a81ed8535d4</data>
      <data key="d11">94c7889131924c3ea27d3875c0b157dd</data>
      <data key="d12">4420</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="IMC" target="PER&#205;METRO ABDOMINAL">
      <data key="d8">5.0</data>
      <data key="d9">El Per&#237;metro Abdominal se considera un indicador de obesidad que complementa la evaluaci&#243;n del IMC</data>
      <data key="d10">c69834419bc4c69bcafd7a81ed8535d4</data>
      <data key="d11">138f19e470ba44b9b3b956ccb35486e0</data>
      <data key="d12">4421</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="IMC" target="CAMBIOS INVOLUNTARIOS EN EL PESO CORPORAL">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">El IMC se utiliza para evaluar el riesgo de desnutrici&#243;n relacionado con cambios involuntarios en el peso corporal</data>
      <data key="d10">cc6ee3d7bc9bfaf4a06f3f02c4907eb0</data>
      <data key="d11">606c6b6e67be47c8b0b5ee9cc40e389c</data>
      <data key="d12">4422</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="IMC" target="DIABETES MELLITUS TYPE 2">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">A high IMC is recognized as a risk factor for developing Diabetes Mellitus Type 2.</data>
      <data key="d10">34d62296f09da1a452febcc9ab8c18ad</data>
      <data key="d11">69f85cd2999444bd89dacd06ff73762c</data>
      <data key="d12">4423</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="IMC" target="PREDIABETES">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">A high IMC is a risk factor for prediabetes, which can lead to Diabetes Mellitus Type 2.</data>
      <data key="d10">34d62296f09da1a452febcc9ab8c18ad</data>
      <data key="d11">4de8510315af4b578f36b135b298e6f6</data>
      <data key="d12">4424</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="IMC" target="HARRIS BENEDICT">
      <data key="d8">5.0</data>
      <data key="d9">El IMC se utiliza como un par&#225;metro en la f&#243;rmula de Harris Benedict para calcular el gasto energ&#233;tico basal</data>
      <data key="d10">285343ba92b89a1761b72d9d789ba8f6</data>
      <data key="d11">324fc5799f754804a9aa9ed97dcde58f</data>
      <data key="d12">4425</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="IMC" target="SAMUEL">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Samuel's IMC is monitored to assess his nutritional status and guide treatment</data>
      <data key="d10">dc7539b4d637d6dd09963c2564f4f084</data>
      <data key="d11">216107adf5ce4f9c8d7ce51cb2ef89f7</data>
      <data key="d12">4426</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="IMC" target="CIRUG&#205;A BARI&#193;TRICA">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La cirug&#237;a bari&#225;trica est&#225; indicada para pacientes con un IMC superior a 40 kg/m2 o superior a 35 con comorbilidad importante</data>
      <data key="d10">6b2c4f18c643a0fdca707628511bf0aa</data>
      <data key="d11">f559ccdd02d04c0cbe012e0301c1a349</data>
      <data key="d12">4427</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="IMC" target="ANOREXIA NERVIOSA">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The severity of anorexia nervosa is assessed using the Body Mass Index (IMC) to determine weight classification</data>
      <data key="d10">3bc554a0031c436483a977c2b9e57b48</data>
      <data key="d11">163fa2bf0e894ba5b3af50472d458ecd</data>
      <data key="d12">4428</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="IMC" target="BULIMIA NERVIOSA">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The Body Mass Index (IMC) is also relevant in assessing the health of individuals with bulimia nervosa</data>
      <data key="d10">3bc554a0031c436483a977c2b9e57b48</data>
      <data key="d11">60aa270bb53f45d18df9157f8f8b86e2</data>
      <data key="d12">4429</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="IMC" target="CREATININE EXCRETION">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Both IMC and creatinine excretion are measures used to assess the nutritional and muscular status of patients</data>
      <data key="d10">f5660be03d70d5dd506c197283dd79ae</data>
      <data key="d11">2e9b54aa3b38447092fb9a9b040d55ff</data>
      <data key="d12">4430</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="IMC" target="HYPERTENSION">
      <data key="d8">14.0</data>
      <data key="d9">IMC, or Body Mass Index, is a crucial metric used to assess weight categories that can influence the risk of hypertension. Research indicates a clear relationship between IMC and hypertension, where maintaining a normal IMC is associated with a reduction in the risk of developing hypertension. This highlights the importance of managing body weight as a preventive measure against hypertension.</data>
      <data key="d10">3fab4e796fd2145b2d0f62ffa60775aa,e40d5e26456fbd223dc887d7d6d0eeb7</data>
      <data key="d11">ed6db499978d45c2b88e029a339517db</data>
      <data key="d12">4431</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="IMC" target="FRAGILITY">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">IMC is used as a measure to assess the risk of fragility in elderly individuals based on their body weight and height</data>
      <data key="d10">5d87d36fec170e242e5e50305a1bec49</data>
      <data key="d11">354dffa3ec044091be2cadc5e7ba8358</data>
      <data key="d12">4432</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="IMC" target="C&#193;NCER G&#193;STRICO">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Body Mass Index (IMC) is used to evaluate the nutritional status of gastric cancer patients, impacting their surgical outcomes</data>
      <data key="d10">f75d1340b39e345875bf878dba07ab8c</data>
      <data key="d11">888f550d3aec4bee9008e09f03a31c46</data>
      <data key="d12">4433</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="IMC" target="C&#193;NCER DE ES&#211;FAGO">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">El &#237;ndice de masa corporal se relaciona con la supervivencia de pacientes que se someten a esofagectom&#237;a por c&#225;ncer de es&#243;fago.</data>
      <data key="d10">5664277128c865feb0e93f9fd56a3d05</data>
      <data key="d11">35c4a1b85ee642a0ba9d7dc1ade8f579</data>
      <data key="d12">4434</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="IMC" target="TALLA">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La talla es un componente clave en el c&#225;lculo del &#205;ndice de Masa Corporal (IMC), que se utiliza para clasificar el estado nutricional</data>
      <data key="d10">21634801ee74e0828836551dbeb8b1ed</data>
      <data key="d11">b18d5ad43d224d419c103f6c15ea2063</data>
      <data key="d12">4435</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="IMC" target="PESO">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">El peso es un componente clave en el c&#225;lculo del &#205;ndice de Masa Corporal (IMC), que se utiliza para clasificar el estado nutricional</data>
      <data key="d10">21634801ee74e0828836551dbeb8b1ed</data>
      <data key="d11">cd566ca9979b4829870851cdfbacfe9d</data>
      <data key="d12">4436</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="VALORACI&#211;N SUBJETIVA GLOBAL" target="MUJERES">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The subjective global assessment is being applied to women to evaluate their nutritional status</data>
      <data key="d10">dad52b0e2f29edbe1c7e7e1fdee1d7cc</data>
      <data key="d11">af2e2e9f5c8f4176b7c1e47c75361ba8</data>
      <data key="d12">4437</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="VALORACI&#211;N SUBJETIVA GLOBAL" target="SUBJECTIVE GLOBAL ASSESSMENT">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Valoraci&#243;n Subjetiva Global is the Spanish term for Subjective Global Assessment, both referring to the same evaluation method</data>
      <data key="d10">83d00bec042a3fe8b69d68316d8569ff</data>
      <data key="d11">b0f2545efdd94ef6b66ad08d1b9b1230</data>
      <data key="d12">4438</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="S&#205;NDROME DE REALIMENTACI&#211;N" target="ELECTROLITOS">
      <data key="d8">5.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Electrolyte imbalances are a common issue associated with refeeding syndrome</data>
      <data key="d10">6bd3e5b773cab27e91a4a150de700918</data>
      <data key="d11">30d90cd1308f448d943c3e8eeb63d7c8</data>
      <data key="d12">4439</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="S&#205;NDROME DE REALIMENTACI&#211;N" target="NUTRICIONES COMERCIALIZADAS">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Refeeding syndrome must be monitored during the administration of commercial nutrition formulations to prevent complications</data>
      <data key="d10">12ceae17f5df9d7a1a40ebc43156a35e</data>
      <data key="d11">33b7a24ebf394a418b748ae00b92b62d</data>
      <data key="d12">4440</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="S&#205;NDROME DE REALIMENTACI&#211;N" target="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL">
      <data key="d8">24.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The S&#237;ndrome de Realimentaci&#243;n, or Refeeding Syndrome, is a significant risk associated with Nutrici&#243;n Parenteral, particularly in patients who are severely malnourished. This syndrome can occur if parenteral nutrition is not managed properly, as the reintroduction of feeding in these vulnerable patients can lead to serious complications. It is crucial to handle parenteral nutrition with care to prevent the onset of refeeding syndrome, which can arise from the rapid changes in metabolism that occur when feeding is resumed.</data>
      <data key="d10">140611dbb8a68fc40712c946de92b73f,241d358b60724c07a75223b79c9e5f41,6289e9e0b5871fb9a2f2f691429bb4f8,c06e5bcd7933ed338cd1257d11c709cf</data>
      <data key="d11">506918bed3c141bb9523b82d2e0caf3b</data>
      <data key="d12">4441</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="S&#205;NDROME DE REALIMENTACI&#211;N" target="ANOREXIA NERVIOSA">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Anorexia nerviosa can lead to refeeding syndrome when nutritional support is initiated in severely malnourished patients.</data>
      <data key="d10">8029c950c540c731bb9334bd90348239</data>
      <data key="d11">abefc700171148aab8be1932fff5e53d</data>
      <data key="d12">4442</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="S&#205;NDROME DE REALIMENTACI&#211;N" target="ALTERACIONES HIDROELECTROL&#205;TICAS">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Refeeding syndrome can cause significant electrolyte imbalances, which are critical to monitor during nutritional rehabilitation.</data>
      <data key="d10">8029c950c540c731bb9334bd90348239</data>
      <data key="d11">8913513e90164db787a5dc2944dfaaa5</data>
      <data key="d12">4443</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="S&#205;NDROME DE REALIMENTACI&#211;N" target="TIAMINA">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Refeeding syndrome is associated with thiamine deficiency, indicating a critical relationship.</data>
      <data key="d10">91f7ece6ed9226a98b3f59f46000ebf6</data>
      <data key="d11">111504b3e68e47cc96fa5f3fc9493fe3</data>
      <data key="d12">4444</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="S&#205;NDROME DE REALIMENTACI&#211;N" target="PACIENTES CON AN">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Los pacientes con anorexia nerviosa est&#225;n en riesgo de desarrollar s&#237;ndrome de realimentaci&#243;n durante su tratamiento</data>
      <data key="d10">da6937e21690cfcb43a43b3438ec7586</data>
      <data key="d11">cc0f9f646a13446eb72a6f14f63be748</data>
      <data key="d12">4445</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="S&#205;NDROME DE REALIMENTACI&#211;N" target="FALLO INTESTINAL">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Patients with intestinal failure are at risk of refeeding syndrome when nutritional support is introduced</data>
      <data key="d10">d9948a6c321263db8a8d220a4d079379</data>
      <data key="d11">60a3f89840be42e398225fa032b387f8</data>
      <data key="d12">4446</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="S&#205;NDROME DE REALIMENTACI&#211;N" target="PACIENTES CR&#205;TICOS">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Refeeding syndrome is a critical concern for malnourished patients in critical care</data>
      <data key="d10">a687eee1e8bfd2d98ce40a14628dd855</data>
      <data key="d11">f091b246d2154460a5ae63790029b77a</data>
      <data key="d12">4447</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="S&#205;NDROME DE REALIMENTACI&#211;N" target="PACIENTES DESNUTRIDOS">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Pacientes Desnutridos are at risk of developing S&#237;ndrome de Realimentaci&#243;n when receiving rapid nutrient administration</data>
      <data key="d10">241d358b60724c07a75223b79c9e5f41</data>
      <data key="d11">c2bf33b0bf4c4ad1b77e1a62c0a25131</data>
      <data key="d12">4448</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="S&#205;NDROME DE REALIMENTACI&#211;N" target="PACIENTE PEDI&#193;TRICO">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Pediatric patients are particularly vulnerable to refeeding syndrome during nutritional rehabilitation</data>
      <data key="d10">c06e5bcd7933ed338cd1257d11c709cf</data>
      <data key="d11">313fe9643d744ee0aee6db061f0f412c</data>
      <data key="d12">4449</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PACIENTES CON DISFAGIA" target="ALIMENTACI&#211;N VARIADA Y EQUILIBRADA">
      <data key="d8">5.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The recommendation for a varied and balanced diet is specifically aimed at patients with dysphagia</data>
      <data key="d10">6bd3e5b773cab27e91a4a150de700918</data>
      <data key="d11">8ac45f50acd04abea6115ca549e55aaf</data>
      <data key="d12">4450</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ALIMENTACI&#211;N VARIADA Y EQUILIBRADA" target="PIR&#193;MIDE DE ALIMENTACI&#211;N SALUDABLE">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The healthy eating pyramid serves as a guide for implementing a varied and balanced diet</data>
      <data key="d10">6bd3e5b773cab27e91a4a150de700918</data>
      <data key="d11">db969ca55d514cfcb6dd1aee89c15c17</data>
      <data key="d12">4451</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PIR&#193;MIDE DE ALIMENTACI&#211;N SALUDABLE" target="NUTRICI&#211;N PEDI&#193;TRICA">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">PIR&#193;MIDE DE ALIMENTACI&#211;N SALUDABLE is a visual tool used in NUTRICI&#211;N PEDI&#193;TRICA to promote healthy eating</data>
      <data key="d10">f96dd2fbe3cd9aa6516522de8ed33145</data>
      <data key="d11">3988d6d0a8a049fe9a094c4e5054374d</data>
      <data key="d12">4452</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="VALORACI&#211;N M&#201;DICA Y NUTRICIONAL" target="AN&#193;LISIS BIOQU&#205;MICO">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Biochemical analysis is a key component of the medical and nutritional assessment process</data>
      <data key="d10">6bd3e5b773cab27e91a4a150de700918</data>
      <data key="d11">53a37c44b3eb4b618beccc984c654244</data>
      <data key="d12">4453</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="VALORACI&#211;N M&#201;DICA Y NUTRICIONAL" target="SUPLEMENTACI&#211;N DE VITAMINAS">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Vitamin supplementation is recommended as part of the nutritional management process for patients</data>
      <data key="d10">6bd3e5b773cab27e91a4a150de700918</data>
      <data key="d11">7306585625b04ca3925b67f7a430252c</data>
      <data key="d12">4454</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ELECTROLITOS" target="MARCADORES NUTRICIONALES">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Los Electrolitos son componentes que se deben medir como parte de los Marcadores Nutricionales</data>
      <data key="d10">c69834419bc4c69bcafd7a81ed8535d4</data>
      <data key="d11">9fcaa636a4164ba9a0435d82619b7cfa</data>
      <data key="d12">4455</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ELECTROLITOS" target="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Electrolytes are essential components included in parenteral nutrition to maintain proper bodily functions and ensure a balanced physiological state. They play a crucial role in the overall effectiveness of parenteral nutrition by helping to regulate various bodily processes and maintaining homeostasis.</data>
      <data key="d10">45628dcc866de3617e83105d66f901ad,f757d4ff813fdf7b43b3382e7e1bd69c</data>
      <data key="d11">7b21f98204ef46a483a2a592ab18beca</data>
      <data key="d12">4456</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ELECTROLITOS" target="INSUFICIENCIA RENAL CR&#211;NICA">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Chronic kidney disease disrupts electrolyte balance, leading to various complications</data>
      <data key="d10">7ba4a7e7b4c409f6d4c6979a7de6c832</data>
      <data key="d11">1674ab52f34140be9edf9bb3d4b9883e</data>
      <data key="d12">4457</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ELECTROLITOS" target="ENFERMEDAD INFLAMATORIA INTESTINAL">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Los electrolitos deben ser medidos en pacientes con enfermedad inflamatoria intestinal para evaluar su estado de salud</data>
      <data key="d10">45ae0837b0632b026fac1053b7d9d4e8</data>
      <data key="d11">d27eb5b64d334e0c8157e823d5f840ca</data>
      <data key="d12">4458</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ELECTROLITOS" target="SOPORTE NUTRICIONAL AVANZADO">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Electrolitos are critical components in advanced nutritional support for maintaining fluid balance</data>
      <data key="d10">d1d2d307f9b3ceb8f8a21846f314b260</data>
      <data key="d11">5359850c133a48fba3e0797edacf6f53</data>
      <data key="d12">4459</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ELECTROLITOS" target="BAXTER">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Baxter's nutritional solutions include electrolytes, which are crucial for parenteral nutrition</data>
      <data key="d10">9f0536c07d1aae0e5d1a66d06697f416</data>
      <data key="d11">642c47f716624338ae76d9f85588317a</data>
      <data key="d12">4460</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ELECTROLITOS" target="SMOFKABIVEN">
      <data key="d8">5.0</data>
      <data key="d9">SmofKabiven's formulations may include electrolytes, making it relevant to electrolyte management in parenteral nutrition</data>
      <data key="d10">9f0536c07d1aae0e5d1a66d06697f416</data>
      <data key="d11">e34eb22328854c68a3558d2b776002ed</data>
      <data key="d12">4461</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ELECTROLITOS" target="OLICLINOMEL">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Oliclinomel's formulations also consider electrolyte levels, which are important in parenteral nutrition</data>
      <data key="d10">9f0536c07d1aae0e5d1a66d06697f416</data>
      <data key="d11">f0b0f0044b3343b0838a2d750c886e8c</data>
      <data key="d12">4462</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DINAMARCA" target="NPD">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Dinamarca was the first country to legislate NPD</data>
      <data key="d10">f84386a9907d954b9cf46475d0d45243</data>
      <data key="d11">e8a862a7aae244719595c789be0c8c2f</data>
      <data key="d12">4463</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DINAMARCA" target="NED">
      <data key="d8">5.0</data>
      <data key="d9">NED has been studied in Dinamarca among other countries</data>
      <data key="d10">eab1daf48c7ca09f43fc115a3379cc10</data>
      <data key="d11">bd6a8f4a3b8b469dac252182b2e5bad9</data>
      <data key="d12">4464</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="AUSTRIA" target="GALACTOSEMIA CL&#193;SICA">
      <data key="d8">5.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La mutaci&#243;n del gen GALT que causa galactosemia cl&#225;sica es relativamente frecuente en Austria.</data>
      <data key="d10">f2f8594bddb0ab77444cdcd2a7799d59</data>
      <data key="d11">0a5cd1bd56c246d18021edbb693bd02e</data>
      <data key="d12">4465</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="AUSTRIA" target="NED">
      <data key="d8">5.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Austria requires patients to cover all costs for NED treatment</data>
      <data key="d10">f84386a9907d954b9cf46475d0d45243</data>
      <data key="d11">916b30ba658b4657aedfed0d94a473b7</data>
      <data key="d12">4466</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ESTADOS UNIDOS" target="VITAMINA B">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">En Estados Unidos, un gran n&#250;mero de personas consumen suplementos de vitaminas B, buscando mejorar su salud cognitiva.</data>
      <data key="d10">fd3d9ab95227ef9290fe59028df2cda3</data>
      <data key="d11">92dbf46619ed4602b38d88926250f00c</data>
      <data key="d12">4467</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ESTADOS UNIDOS" target="DHA">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The United States has lower estimated intakes of DHA compared to other countries</data>
      <data key="d10">bfe7b32b596449644b274ed7486a507a</data>
      <data key="d11">71d7aaa4729b4ee9a9ead5b5c45f013e</data>
      <data key="d12">4468</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ESTADOS UNIDOS" target="FOOD AND NUTRITION BOARD">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The Food and Nutrition Board operates within the U.S. and establishes dietary reference intakes</data>
      <data key="d10">4198768cfbdf9c226ffba9074adf628f</data>
      <data key="d11">dd0ba1c2d2364903b87357dfe08bc905</data>
      <data key="d12">4469</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ESTADOS UNIDOS" target="INSTITUTO DE MEDICINA">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The IOM is a U.S. organization that provides dietary guidelines and recommendations</data>
      <data key="d10">4198768cfbdf9c226ffba9074adf628f</data>
      <data key="d11">ae2ba8636b1641c39e13ccdc34388086</data>
      <data key="d12">4470</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ESTADOS UNIDOS" target="GLUTEN-FREE CERTIFICATION ORGANIZATION">
      <data key="d8">5.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The United States lacks a federal regulation for gluten labeling, which is why organizations like the Gluten-Free Certification Organization are necessary</data>
      <data key="d10">1d8aa686c6377246fee05010ef969018</data>
      <data key="d11">638c4cf870164ab7b61a0546b016cf3f</data>
      <data key="d12">4471</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ESTADOS UNIDOS" target="F&#211;RMULA INMUNOMODULADORA">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">A study in the United States showed higher mortality rates in patients receiving immunonutrition</data>
      <data key="d10">9e4c5851293c18ef6b304ff6293b0be5</data>
      <data key="d11">9e73fdcb5c8e435dab8b5d944c5cc627</data>
      <data key="d12">4472</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ESTADOS UNIDOS" target="OMS">
      <data key="d8">5.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Estados Unidos proporciona datos sobre el crecimiento infantil y nutrici&#243;n a la OMS para establecer est&#225;ndares internacionales</data>
      <data key="d10">21634801ee74e0828836551dbeb8b1ed</data>
      <data key="d11">bba6c400256f43fea15ca3ac989b0241</data>
      <data key="d12">4473</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="CARNES" target="VITAMINA B&#8323;">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Las carnes son una fuente significativa de vitamina B&#8323;, esencial para la salud</data>
      <data key="d10">26629a423810543625be19deea4cc35f</data>
      <data key="d11">b495c63e4a034b5cbcadd518651f9783</data>
      <data key="d12">4474</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="CARNES" target="VITAMINA B12">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La baja ingesta de carnes, que son una fuente principal de vitamina B12, puede llevar a deficiencias.</data>
      <data key="d10">70b2393fa61e51fc3e772479a9792c98</data>
      <data key="d11">d28f2a9b9d8d43a587e82eec20479e8b</data>
      <data key="d12">4475</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="CARNES" target="DIETA CONTROLADA EN GLUTEN">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Las carnes frescas son recomendadas en la dieta controlada en gluten.</data>
      <data key="d10">08edfb59071449728499ca59eb51ac84</data>
      <data key="d11">7b3c54344701400f87ffcaf6ee820e0a</data>
      <data key="d12">4476</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="CARNES" target="PACIENTE CELIACO">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Celiac patients can consume meats as long as they are prepared without gluten.</data>
      <data key="d10">1aab735899b0c557ec11da0558bcfc15</data>
      <data key="d11">e2fb5acfc2024c2996bc8342b8561867</data>
      <data key="d12">4477</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="CARNES" target="GRASA SATURADA">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Las carnes son una fuente principal de &#225;cidos grasos saturados de cadena larga, que est&#225;n implicados en el desarrollo de la ECV</data>
      <data key="d10">e0227f83ebee602b6c9d7163630e495e</data>
      <data key="d11">ccecf1043b844860b0bba14a9e4ae8cf</data>
      <data key="d12">4478</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="CARNES" target="SODIO">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Carnes can be high in sodium, especially when processed or cured</data>
      <data key="d10">01d788abeab4fc29c425bf27168356e2</data>
      <data key="d11">2ec34abf4eb94f399b757a31799f08b9</data>
      <data key="d12">4479</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PESCADOS" target="VITAMINA B&#8321;&#8322;">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Los pescados son una de las principales fuentes de vitamina B&#8321;&#8322;, necesaria para la formaci&#243;n de gl&#243;bulos rojos</data>
      <data key="d10">26629a423810543625be19deea4cc35f</data>
      <data key="d11">95b7a9b8687144fca188a8532c215562</data>
      <data key="d12">4480</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PESCADOS" target="DIETA CONTROLADA EN GLUTEN">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Los pescados frescos son recomendados en la dieta controlada en gluten.</data>
      <data key="d10">08edfb59071449728499ca59eb51ac84</data>
      <data key="d11">be5433b5e8b74c8aa8347602c81c0ef4</data>
      <data key="d12">4481</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PESCADOS" target="ENFERMEDAD CARDIOVASCULAR">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">El consumo de pescado se asocia con un menor riesgo de enfermedad cardiovascular cuando se consume en cantidades adecuadas.</data>
      <data key="d10">e04d44fa9d8f83cab42b04dd086695fc</data>
      <data key="d11">444ace2ccedb4071bea329e441e97af9</data>
      <data key="d12">4482</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PESCADOS" target="MORTALIDAD ECV">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">El consumo regular de pescado puede estar asociado con una menor mortalidad por enfermedad cardiovascular.</data>
      <data key="d10">e04d44fa9d8f83cab42b04dd086695fc</data>
      <data key="d11">0fbcf0c17917499ea51e41ec19efede0</data>
      <data key="d12">4483</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PESCADOS" target="NUTRICIONAL RECOMMENDATIONS">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Fish consumption is recommended in dietary guidelines for its health benefits.</data>
      <data key="d10">f41688eecb31d8e55fc70e993e99c3e9</data>
      <data key="d11">960b6d641f364c7493495c4cbaf44fff</data>
      <data key="d12">4484</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PESCADOS" target="SODIO">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Pescados can be high in sodium, particularly when salted or canned</data>
      <data key="d10">01d788abeab4fc29c425bf27168356e2</data>
      <data key="d11">7b442e58a0d64f779ef8d182c614bdb7</data>
      <data key="d12">4485</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PESCADOS" target="DIETA">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Fish must be eliminated from the diet to avoid false positives in blood detection tests.</data>
      <data key="d10">029a82f84eb8dfda723f9feabe2384d7</data>
      <data key="d11">cde51ec8eb8c4855aa01923433b0ac1f</data>
      <data key="d12">4486</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PESCADOS" target="NUTRICI&#211;N PEDI&#193;TRICA">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Fish is recommended to be consumed several times a week as part of children's diets</data>
      <data key="d10">61b84039de5ac2d9e25890c3b8f4f87a</data>
      <data key="d11">e3b35195d49d48f7af9591dad908e362</data>
      <data key="d12">4487</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HUEVOS" target="BOMBA DE ARROZ Y BOLETUS CON SALSA DE TRIGUEROS">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Eggs are a key ingredient in the Bomba de Arroz y Boletus dish</data>
      <data key="d10">53ab21b47d6304cc0eba5a45de3e8b53</data>
      <data key="d11">b46c3698a82c4632aa72c7feee0377ce</data>
      <data key="d12">4488</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HUEVOS" target="FENILCETONURIA">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Individuals with phenylketonuria should restrict egg consumption because of their high phenylalanine content</data>
      <data key="d10">5f1b707b42d6235a666179f880d1d98a</data>
      <data key="d11">fb87e30190934a15a877e39d54ab3660</data>
      <data key="d12">4489</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HUEVOS" target="ENFERMEDAD CARDIOVASCULAR">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">HUEVOS, or eggs, are addressed in dietary guidelines concerning cardiovascular health, highlighting their significance in nutrition. The consumption of eggs may interact with cardiovascular risk, particularly in relation to the development of type 2 diabetes. This suggests that while eggs can be a part of a healthy diet, their impact on cardiovascular health and diabetes risk should be considered carefully.</data>
      <data key="d10">73896da11a9ec209fb3e5b61f19f81df,e04d44fa9d8f83cab42b04dd086695fc</data>
      <data key="d11">c643f80cd97b4c4380c04638bb1e9ca3</data>
      <data key="d12">4490</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HUEVOS" target="NUTRICI&#211;N PEDI&#193;TRICA">
      <data key="d8">15.0</data>
      <data key="d9">HUEVOS, or eggs, are highly recommended in NUTRICI&#211;N PEDI&#193;TRICA, particularly as a valuable protein source in children's diets. Additionally, they are recognized for their contribution of iron, making them an important food choice for promoting healthy growth and development in pediatric nutrition.</data>
      <data key="d10">61b84039de5ac2d9e25890c3b8f4f87a,e742c891694171ad455b038f416b7728</data>
      <data key="d11">1f272ffa14c441d5bc768368b9a6dc61</data>
      <data key="d12">4491</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HUEVOS" target="CARNES Y DERIVADOS, AVES, PESCADOS Y HUEVOS">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Huevos are included in the broader category of meats, poultry, fish, and eggs</data>
      <data key="d10">e0208971287419e734607191646ae36d</data>
      <data key="d11">9cc5cb552567491e9a8c95c7ce2ac79c</data>
      <data key="d12">4492</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HUEVOS" target="NI&#209;O">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Dietary guidelines suggest limiting egg consumption for children due to cholesterol concerns</data>
      <data key="d10">56e7bab8da5c5e8d37b7545618a648bb</data>
      <data key="d11">403d78757e3347ec817b35a1ab4d1ae9</data>
      <data key="d12">4493</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="LEGUMBRES" target="C&#193;NCER RENAL">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">El consumo de legumbres se ha asociado con una reducci&#243;n significativa del riesgo de c&#225;ncer renal.</data>
      <data key="d10">8f4f0fffa52482a1b5a520849d10c692</data>
      <data key="d11">ac20148319f04c78b743cb7037f279c2</data>
      <data key="d12">4494</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="LEGUMBRES" target="ENFERMEDADES CARDIOVASCULARES">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Las legumbres ayudan a reducir el colesterol s&#233;rico total y la fracci&#243;n LDL, lo que puede disminuir el riesgo de enfermedades cardiovasculares.</data>
