    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="SEPSIS">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Patients receiving parenteral nutrition are at risk of developing sepsis due to potential infections from catheters</data>
      <data key="d10">9fda43c414d32c5a8a3bb7354bfb1704</data>
      <data key="d11">b7f3c37277dd4b1f9fa3bf6527c14996</data>
      <data key="d12">4744</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="INSUFICIENCIA HEP&#193;TICA">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Insuficiencia hep&#225;tica necessitates careful management of lipid intake in parenteral nutrition</data>
      <data key="d10">9fda43c414d32c5a8a3bb7354bfb1704</data>
      <data key="d11">3b3b0a05989f460e9a9b9f28b00b2338</data>
      <data key="d12">4745</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="FALLO INTESTINAL">
      <data key="d8">44.0</data>
      <data key="d9">NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL, or parenteral nutrition, is a critical treatment for individuals experiencing FALL INTESTINAL, or intestinal failure. This condition often leads to an inability to absorb essential nutrients through the digestive system, making parenteral nutrition necessary to maintain the patient's health. It provides a means of delivering adequate nutrient intake directly into the bloodstream, ensuring that patients who cannot absorb nutrients through their intestines receive the necessary sustenance to support their overall well-being. Thus, parenteral nutrition plays a vital role in the management and treatment of intestinal failure, helping to sustain health in affected individuals.</data>
      <data key="d10">9f3f6014b1a9e68b22c02862a9143a33,d9948a6c321263db8a8d220a4d079379,e945adb09eb8d9984302b72f9a2a68cb,eb8fe6b54f7eab9cbe7b90c53e7007ed,f7d56bac9cc29e47690669e812094c99</data>
      <data key="d11">2bccf6255ca84a2aad7204710bb33346</data>
      <data key="d12">4746</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="HEPATOPAT&#205;A ASOCIADA A NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Hepatopathy can occur as a complication of prolonged home parenteral nutrition.</data>
      <data key="d10">4a65e02e4e364419b836920c093055fe</data>
      <data key="d11">0e6e6ca4ef004951a21fdf17325356d3</data>
      <data key="d12">4747</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="DUODENOPANCREATECTOM&#205;A">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La nutrici&#243;n parenteral se considera en casos donde la nutrici&#243;n enteral no es posible tras una duodenopancreatectom&#237;a</data>
      <data key="d10">3ee948dc4ddfdc75daa8fe7db9bb471e</data>
      <data key="d11">1eb7143cb8ed4ee3a4eb59a6a3b43110</data>
      <data key="d12">4748</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="CIRUG&#205;A DIGESTIVA">
      <data key="d8">5.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Nutrici&#243;n parenteral is an alternative when enteral nutrition is not feasible in cirug&#237;a digestiva</data>
      <data key="d10">3dfc700a2eaec232c05b0a53f2089229</data>
      <data key="d11">df04d3fe4d2b4211b2878d1ad1bceb7a</data>
      <data key="d12">4749</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL (NP)">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Parenteral nutrition is a method of providing nutrients when enteral nutrition is inadequate</data>
      <data key="d10">57d361381e6ea4ddbc948891f9645009</data>
      <data key="d11">101dac60c56a41cf86bb864e44b72ec6</data>
      <data key="d12">4750</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="NECESIDAD DE CIRUG&#205;A">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La necesidad de cirug&#237;a en pacientes con pancreatitis aguda puede llevar a la administraci&#243;n de nutrici&#243;n parenteral si la enteral no es viable.</data>
      <data key="d10">5d4476c2c40af44f9d54628af0ac463d</data>
      <data key="d11">f460d9347b88445c906359dddc81ac1d</data>
      <data key="d12">4751</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="MORTALIDAD">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La mortalidad en pacientes con pancreatitis aguda puede ser menor en aquellos que reciben nutrici&#243;n parenteral adecuada en comparaci&#243;n con aquellos que no la reciben.</data>
      <data key="d10">5d4476c2c40af44f9d54628af0ac463d</data>
      <data key="d11">17e83d81c693445d8caaac97cf6f92df</data>
      <data key="d12">4752</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="INSULINOTERAPIA">
      <data key="d8">5.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Insulin therapy is important for managing blood glucose levels in patients receiving parenteral nutrition</data>
      <data key="d10">896ddfd9f06dc3ec8b1cfb986fae97fe</data>
      <data key="d11">71557e84f7fb4402b1bef03677d79563</data>
      <data key="d12">4753</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="DIETA L&#205;QUIDA">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">In cases of poor tolerance to dieta l&#237;quida, nutrici&#243;n parenteral may be considered</data>
      <data key="d10">4b19145e0977ee48b7132c9915d8c284</data>
      <data key="d11">57546ed9c9bf42a992f47a66e76d0f21</data>
      <data key="d12">4754</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="CIRUG&#205;A BARI&#193;TRICA">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La nutrici&#243;n parenteral puede ser necesaria en el postoperatorio de cirug&#237;a bari&#225;trica si el paciente no puede alimentarse adecuadamente</data>
      <data key="d10">de5f304890ba39f7c9e3d5c0201bc247</data>
      <data key="d11">cbfa8dd878c44d998c8840732ae71e2b</data>
      <data key="d12">4755</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="INSUFICIENCIA RENAL AGUDA">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL is a medical intervention that may be necessary for patients suffering from INSUFICIENCIA RENAL AGUDA, particularly when these individuals require intensive nutritional support. This form of nutrition is utilized when enteral feeding is not feasible, making it a critical option for managing the nutritional needs of patients experiencing acute renal failure.</data>
      <data key="d10">532561f62a972376f3f898b265623fc0,9f77fc213da2123b013166c181a60323</data>
      <data key="d11">95a69020f10f4310b5801df969d53ede</data>
      <data key="d12">4756</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="HEPATOPAT&#205;A CR&#211;NICA">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Parenteral nutrition is used for patients with chronic liver disease who cannot tolerate enteral feeding</data>
      <data key="d10">d59761afc53676cf5d1fe62616f0d7d7</data>
      <data key="d11">aaacd51c83f34507b0de8cfa498bef13</data>
      <data key="d12">4757</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="ASCITIS QUILOSA">
      <data key="d8">15.0</data>
      <data key="d9">NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL is a medical intervention that may be necessary for patients suffering from ASCITIS QUILOSA, particularly in situations where enteral nutrition is inadequate. ASCITIS QUILOSA is a condition that can hinder patients' ability to meet their nutritional needs through diet alone. In such cases, parenteral nutrition becomes essential, especially for those who cannot tolerate enteral feeding due to their medical condition. Thus, NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL serves as a critical alternative for ensuring adequate nutrition in individuals affected by ASCITIS QUILOSA.</data>
      <data key="d10">6bbb4df989ed7353f621a7d44dbc7972,9927d054458e409309b9e917cbb6a10c,ae05ce71cf124553fea10e6c602f8d16</data>
      <data key="d11">a1fcda6406ab4813b836a46e8fdf0095</data>
      <data key="d12">4758</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="QUILOT&#211;RAX">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL is utilized in cases of QUILOT&#211;RAX, particularly when enteral nutrition is insufficient or not feasible. This form of nutrition is indicated for patients suffering from quilot&#243;rax who are experiencing significant nutritional deficiencies, ensuring that their dietary needs are met when traditional methods are inadequate.</data>
      <data key="d10">9927d054458e409309b9e917cbb6a10c,ae05ce71cf124553fea10e6c602f8d16</data>
      <data key="d11">313e35047f97461c938f08764824c175</data>
      <data key="d12">4759</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="F&#205;STULAS DEL CONDUCTO TOR&#193;CICO">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Las f&#237;stulas del conducto tor&#225;cico pueden requerir nutrici&#243;n parenteral en casos donde la nutrici&#243;n enteral no es suficiente</data>
      <data key="d10">9927d054458e409309b9e917cbb6a10c</data>
      <data key="d11">0ebd6709bd05496691f1b90b33c91c2c</data>
      <data key="d12">4760</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
