      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Vital P&#233;ptido 1.5&#174; can be included in nutritional parenteral therapy</data>
      <data key="d10">12b6478763cfb60ad144be6b81778e03</data>
      <data key="d11">9bca132c491a482c9795e41f110b8499</data>
      <data key="d12">4781</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="SEPSIS POR CAT&#201;TER">
      <data key="d8">14.0</data>
      <data key="d9">NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL refers to the intravenous administration of nutrients to patients who are unable to obtain adequate nutrition through oral or enteral means. However, this method of nutrition can increase the risk of SEPSIS POR CAT&#201;TER, which is a serious infection that can occur in patients receiving NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL through central venous catheters. The use of these catheters, while essential for delivering parenteral nutrition, poses a significant risk for the development of catheter-related sepsis, highlighting the need for careful management and monitoring in patients undergoing this treatment.</data>
      <data key="d10">4ce6342fdfe4419826c1ab2f84c56247,be7eb01a6daf673db6a127f66c79c96c</data>
      <data key="d11">1bf597a1d7a645b3a6c43196ddf7c6d7</data>
      <data key="d12">4782</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="PREDNISONA">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La prednisona es un tratamiento est&#225;ndar que se compara con la nutrici&#243;n parenteral en la efectividad para la enfermedad inflamatoria intestinal</data>
      <data key="d10">417548e99612a123d61f9fd10807ce34</data>
      <data key="d11">0d1b17d29f1e424da1256e43e3c63d65</data>
      <data key="d12">4783</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="PACIENTES CON FALLA INTESTINAL">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Nutritional support is essential for patients with intestinal failure to maintain their health and nutritional needs</data>
      <data key="d10">f5a758425c5e471b0421d16558001d59</data>
      <data key="d11">8734050d043e4f7595d55f8e6ed8d94f</data>
      <data key="d12">4784</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="TEDUGLUTIDA">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Teduglutida aims to reduce the need for parenteral nutrition in patients with short bowel syndrome</data>
      <data key="d10">e0196a8a0ead0a27b38ddfb16a5c5772</data>
      <data key="d11">ec45005b6f85413295deff69df53d361</data>
      <data key="d12">4785</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="TROMBOSIS VENOSA CENTRAL">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La nutrici&#243;n parenteral puede estar asociada a la trombosis venosa central en pacientes que requieren acceso venoso permanente</data>
      <data key="d10">ace4abd79441a61d6688d67db2dc0747</data>
      <data key="d11">2c42704197f843b592356a3ad560cb12</data>
      <data key="d12">4786</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="FEC">
      <data key="d8">16.0</data>
      <data key="d9">NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL is a critical component of nutritional support for patients diagnosed with FEC. These patients typically have heightened caloric and protein requirements, making parenteral nutrition essential for their management. As a result, nutritional support strategies for individuals with FEC often incorporate parenteral nutrition to adequately meet their needs.</data>
      <data key="d10">81d0f9e0238db446bd67439b8222ab32,c031cb3bc7513b4a3f8e4f264c00a675</data>
      <data key="d11">0651e7a6c8ae460aa7572fe1bdaad397</data>
      <data key="d12">4787</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="SIC">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Patients with SIC typically need nutritional support, often through parenteral means</data>
      <data key="d10">81d0f9e0238db446bd67439b8222ab32</data>
      <data key="d11">c421fb929f794a09bdbadb0cdfcce35c</data>
      <data key="d12">4788</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="OMS">
      <data key="d8">12.0</data>
      <data key="d9">NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL refers to the administration of nutrients directly into the bloodstream, bypassing the digestive system, which is essential for patients who cannot obtain adequate nutrition through oral intake. The OMS (World Health Organization) plays a significant role in this area by providing critical guidelines and formulas. Specifically, the OMS formula is utilized for calculating energy needs in pediatric patients receiving parenteral nutrition, ensuring that these vulnerable patients receive the appropriate caloric intake for their growth and development. Additionally, the OMS offers guidelines for rehydration solutions, which are crucial for patients undergoing parenteral nutrition, as they help maintain fluid and electrolyte balance. Together, these resources from the OMS support the effective management of nutritional needs in patients reliant on parenteral nutrition.</data>
      <data key="d10">2d14f6773b107ec9a872245c32ae0a94,81d0f9e0238db446bd67439b8222ab32</data>
      <data key="d11">7ba32bb536f34afbbfc55dedb3cd7c72</data>
      <data key="d12">4789</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="CIRUG&#205;A GASTROINTESTINAL">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Post-operative patients from gastrointestinal surgery may require parenteral nutrition if enteral nutrition is not feasible</data>
      <data key="d10">f087e20586f6b263059597e194a04993</data>
      <data key="d11">95029e13d5814eca8b8da4c6c9cfbb6f</data>
      <data key="d12">4790</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="SOPORTE NUTRICIONAL">
      <data key="d8">16.0</data>
      <data key="d9">NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL, also known as parenteral nutrition, serves as an alternative to SOPORTE NUTRICIONAL when enteral methods are not feasible. This form of nutrition provides essential nutrients intravenously, ensuring that individuals receive the necessary dietary components when they cannot obtain them through traditional enteral nutrition methods.</data>
      <data key="d10">21e6d7085f520d8a2f415746dc7eab71,afdd80af18df0213292a5858afeae9cc</data>
      <data key="d11">490d2abeec29480dabc40c6e4d78aee1</data>
      <data key="d12">4791</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="PACIENTE CR&#205;TICO">
      <data key="d8">14.0</data>
      <data key="d9">NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL is a form of nutrition that is particularly relevant for PACIENTE CR&#205;TICO, or critically ill patients. While parenteral nutrition serves as an essential alternative for those who are unable to receive nutrition through normal means, it is generally less preferred compared to enteral nutrition. This indicates that while it plays a crucial role in the management of critically ill patients, healthcare providers often prioritize enteral nutrition when feasible.</data>
      <data key="d10">195affa22ecd2f7b1cdce3d72fc1cba4,2bd5549759c6a0d8393bb93fdccb747b</data>
      <data key="d11">e7f1a1f12200449ab9a48cb842a40110</data>
      <data key="d12">4792</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="SOCIEDAD ESPA&#209;OLA DE NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL Y ENTERAL">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">SENPE offers recommendations for the use of parenteral nutrition in patients requiring artificial nutritional support</data>
      <data key="d10">7e539a13a598e4ff2d2d4d6641a044d5</data>
      <data key="d11">6be79ca5b65d41e4bc320e35ac104d7c</data>
      <data key="d12">4793</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="FALLO RESPIRATORIO AGUDO">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Fallo Respiratorio Agudo often necessitates the use of parenteral nutrition when enteral routes are not viable</data>
      <data key="d10">7e539a13a598e4ff2d2d4d6641a044d5</data>
      <data key="d11">3389cfd64deb42bda27811d98eaf8310</data>
      <data key="d12">4794</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="AGENTES NUTRICIONALES">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Agentes nutricionales are critical components in the formulation of parenteral nutrition</data>
      <data key="d10">7e539a13a598e4ff2d2d4d6641a044d5</data>
      <data key="d11">792e00fb4b1246eca1e1b44126ace359</data>
      <data key="d12">4795</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="PROPOFOL">
      <data key="d8">5.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Propofol is a medication that is considered in the context of parenteral nutrition due to its lipid content</data>
      <data key="d10">95b0d21cd06eb29e984e0882f8fac544</data>
      <data key="d11">bab86a5d52bd41b6b8036084b5e99671</data>
      <data key="d12">4796</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="L-GLN">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">L-Gln is a proposed supplement for parenteral nutrition, though its use is still debated</data>
      <data key="d10">95b0d21cd06eb29e984e0882f8fac544</data>
      <data key="d11">d8e837ddf7ae43f5a5ae912cb7a3d71d</data>
      <data key="d12">4797</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="PACIENTES CR&#205;TICOS">
      <data key="d8">25.0</data>
      <data key="d9">NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL is an essential treatment for PACIENTES CR&#205;TICOS who are unable to receive nutrition through oral means. This form of nutrition is particularly important for these patients, as they often have increased metabolic demands that must be met to support their recovery. Parenteral nutrition is utilized when enteral nutrition is either not feasible or inadequate, ensuring that critically ill patients receive the necessary nutrients to aid in their healing process.</data>
      <data key="d10">01704aec4089b2f0f24dd0f0841b5ecf,7b34ed1eb4b09b2e0762c7e917f8a516,c70d301baddcdcdefbba9b024ad4f3c5</data>
      <data key="d11">1ab23b1c9c324448829916ca130c0f7e</data>
      <data key="d12">4798</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="TCE">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Parenteral nutrition may be necessary for TCE patients when enteral nutrition cannot be administered.</data>
      <data key="d10">01704aec4089b2f0f24dd0f0841b5ecf</data>
      <data key="d11">aa2e8d8ca869411bbc7d93427863cff7</data>
      <data key="d12">4799</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="PACIENTES QUEMADOS">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La nutrici&#243;n parenteral se considera cuando la nutrici&#243;n enteral no es suficiente para los pacientes quemados</data>
      <data key="d10">111edb0e21c873322871e35619a1ebf5</data>
      <data key="d11">997666adb0c442e9b422c0368c147ca0</data>
      <data key="d12">4800</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="TUBO DIGESTIVO">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">If the digestive tube is not functional, parenteral nutrition is required</data>
      <data key="d10">99900c6d95f85a5b4b88fcfed6775cec</data>
      <data key="d11">9562fd3215db4c05a5b20d76a152936d</data>
      <data key="d12">4801</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="C&#193;NCER">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La nutrici&#243;n parenteral es necesaria para pacientes con c&#225;ncer que tienen insuficiencia intestinal grave</data>
      <data key="d10">f7871bbaa57d50bb5f5675cd580cb0af</data>
      <data key="d11">b7bab21a5e3f447ea3920bf01778e7a9</data>
      <data key="d12">4802</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="C&#193;NCER G&#193;STRICO">
      <data key="d8">12.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La nutrici&#243;n parenteral es un tratamiento esencial para pacientes con c&#225;ncer g&#225;strico, especialmente en aquellos que presentan malnutrici&#243;n. Se utiliza en situaciones donde la nutrici&#243;n enteral no es viable, proporcionando una alternativa crucial para asegurar que estos pacientes reciban los nutrientes necesarios. En particular, la nutrici&#243;n parenteral domiciliaria complementaria se aplica en casos de c&#225;ncer g&#225;strico avanzado, ayudando a mejorar la calidad de vida y el estado nutricional de los pacientes en esta etapa cr&#237;tica de la enfermedad.</data>
      <data key="d10">a7baff5fb024c516ea6ae8c236dc945d,e34642244b0c7f309ab1c1be1e81da31</data>
      <data key="d11">9aef65dccf9b4baa94c613db0e8542c7</data>
      <data key="d12">4803</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="KIM ET AL.">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Kim et al. tambi&#233;n compararon la nutrici&#243;n parenteral en su estudio sobre pacientes gastrectomizados.</data>
      <data key="d10">e34642244b0c7f309ab1c1be1e81da31</data>
      <data key="d11">dcd9a0e4f9ea47d68635f72bd3319aad</data>
      <data key="d12">4804</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="C&#193;NCER DE ES&#211;FAGO">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La nutrici&#243;n parenteral puede ser necesaria en pacientes con c&#225;ncer de es&#243;fago que no pueden alimentarse adecuadamente.</data>
      <data key="d10">a7baff5fb024c516ea6ae8c236dc945d</data>
      <data key="d11">664cb95c57b94f8e8b438da77ddf2834</data>
      <data key="d12">4805</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="NUTRICI&#211;N EN ONCOLOG&#205;A">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">NUTRICI&#211;N EN ONCOLOG&#205;A studies the effectiveness of NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL in managing patients who cannot consume food orally</data>
      <data key="d10">b0ffa7260c4fc20462ad4c9bedcbfae7</data>
      <data key="d11">80518fdff68b4dfe80e400ea457827f0</data>
      <data key="d12">4806</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="F&#205;STULA PANCRE&#193;TICA">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL may be used in the management of F&#205;STULA PANCRE&#193;TICA when enteral nutrition is not possible</data>
      <data key="d10">b0ffa7260c4fc20462ad4c9bedcbfae7</data>
      <data key="d11">a08cbdf5ffe44f4d83f95986f5278f2b</data>
      <data key="d12">4807</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="C&#193;NCER GASTROINTESTINAL">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Parenteral nutrition is used when enteral nutrition is inadequate for patients with gastrointestinal cancer</data>
      <data key="d10">639ebafae8a95bb03a09e111172b9a4e</data>
      <data key="d11">fb073a8f08694d3db9d40d4a5575a9ba</data>
      <data key="d12">4808</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="PACIENTES ONCOL&#211;GICOS">
      <data key="d8">5.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La nutrici&#243;n parenteral puede ser necesaria para pacientes oncol&#243;gicos con fallo intestinal</data>
      <data key="d10">a96b8f4fe52b5b963b28242c3352aa7c</data>
      <data key="d11">79b35b2e59d24afa904eea5c1b96e430</data>
      <data key="d12">4809</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="PACIENTE ONCOL&#211;GICO">
      <data key="d8">16.0</data>
      <data key="d9">NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL is a medical intervention utilized for PACIENTE ONCOL&#211;GICO when enteral nutrition is not feasible. This form of nutrition is considered essential for cancer patients who cannot receive adequate nutrition through other means. It provides the necessary nutrients directly into the bloodstream, ensuring that patients receive the support they need during their treatment.</data>
      <data key="d10">395385fad73fd5b7ed9eda114b482624,d667e6abc204bbfa6aba210705db6d56</data>
      <data key="d11">6db79b5c51184baeab9de61057061f03</data>
      <data key="d12">4810</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="ASOCIACI&#211;N EUROPEA DE NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL Y PARENTERAL">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">ESPEN provides guidelines on the use of parenteral nutrition for patients who cannot receive enteral nutrition.</data>
      <data key="d10">395385fad73fd5b7ed9eda114b482624</data>
      <data key="d11">5b0a5625367d4a1ca9c67ddab0b08351</data>
      <data key="d12">4811</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="PACIENTES CON C&#193;NCER">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Patients with cancer may require parenteral nutrition when they cannot meet their nutritional needs orally</data>
      <data key="d10">202e4fa915a698c9d9164c3fcc61534e</data>
      <data key="d11">1ef9687ef57f4960850f63f5432cc04e</data>
      <data key="d12">4812</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="PROTOCOLO ERAS">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Nutritional support is a key component of the ERAS protocol to minimize surgical stress and improve recovery</data>
      <data key="d10">202e4fa915a698c9d9164c3fcc61534e</data>
      <data key="d11">a60c4aa6ad0b4db9a90eb649379d6fe7</data>
      <data key="d12">4813</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="TRASPLANTE DE M&#201;DULA &#211;SEA">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Patients undergoing bone marrow transplants may require parenteral nutrition to prevent infections</data>
      <data key="d10">202e4fa915a698c9d9164c3fcc61534e</data>
      <data key="d11">dbc6864a3d4a463881f55e10ddeb644d</data>
      <data key="d12">4814</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="ADENOCARCINOMAS INTRAABDOMINALES">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Patients with advanced intra-abdominal adenocarcinomas may benefit from specialized parenteral nutrition</data>
      <data key="d10">202e4fa915a698c9d9164c3fcc61534e</data>
      <data key="d11">c71b0f9163cf4ad3a9cc952fa6d4dc05</data>
      <data key="d12">4815</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="TRASPLANTE DE C&#201;LULAS HEMATOL&#211;GICAS">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La nutrici&#243;n parenteral es un m&#233;todo de soporte nutricional que puede ser requerido en el contexto del trasplante de c&#233;lulas hematol&#243;gicas</data>
      <data key="d10">4015c8a1a16c5c93f3b853d9cac57bf4</data>
      <data key="d11">f1e617706e1f4b09a5129ce472945dc9</data>
      <data key="d12">4816</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="EICH AGUDA">
      <data key="d8">5.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La nutrici&#243;n parenteral puede ser necesaria en pacientes con EICH aguda que no pueden mantener una adecuada ingesta nutricional.</data>
      <data key="d10">5b26dc0fdf0ff94c225f96626b785972</data>
      <data key="d11">079557db8d934d049e9ba4f9dfa588df</data>
      <data key="d12">4817</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="EICH CR&#211;NICA">
      <data key="d8">5.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La nutrici&#243;n parenteral puede ser requerida en casos de EICH cr&#243;nica severa donde la dieta oral no es suficiente.</data>
      <data key="d10">5b26dc0fdf0ff94c225f96626b785972</data>
      <data key="d11">37ee964e5aac4ff99d3a74e332160fca</data>
      <data key="d12">4818</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="TRASPLANTE DE C&#201;LULAS HEMATOPI&#201;TICAS">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Parenteral nutrition is used when patients undergoing hematopoietic cell transplantation cannot receive adequate nutrition orally</data>
      <data key="d10">27c75984e62c5adcac1ac33cbdc520dc</data>
      <data key="d11">19c5702ffaa444fca23bd8320084ffa3</data>
      <data key="d12">4819</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="TRASPLANTE DE C&#201;LULAS HEMATOPOY&#201;TICAS">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Nutrici&#243;n parenteral is often necessary for patients who cannot eat after undergoing a trasplante de c&#233;lulas hematopoy&#233;ticas</data>
      <data key="d10">08d8220e35364eb95bacafae7dd2953b</data>
      <data key="d11">9a9c73cae5e64ebe87a7eabd2ea8f2e0</data>
      <data key="d12">4820</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="HIPONATREMIA">
      <data key="d8">14.0</data>
      <data key="d9">NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL refers to a method of providing nutrition to patients intravenously, bypassing the usual process of eating and digestion. Patients receiving parenteral nutrition are at a higher risk of developing HIPONATREMIA, a condition characterized by low sodium levels in the blood. This increased risk is primarily due to fluid overload and imbalances in sodium and other electrolytes that can occur during parenteral nutrition. Therefore, careful monitoring of fluid and electrolyte levels is essential for patients undergoing this type of nutritional support to prevent the onset of hiponatremia.</data>
      <data key="d10">2206bb4d5efe2dcf644ee48468ea112c,94df5002f2221058a9bb77f456a50e61</data>
      <data key="d11">717f600fec2e4ace87c95657164d2308</data>
      <data key="d12">4821</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="DIETOTERAPIA">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Dietoterapia is often applied in conjunction with parenteral nutrition to ensure patients receive adequate nutrients.</data>
      <data key="d10">2206bb4d5efe2dcf644ee48468ea112c</data>
      <data key="d11">adcfbf8ab80946e9bbe47b12f72d939f</data>
      <data key="d12">4822</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="V&#211;MITOS INCOERCIBLES">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La nutrici&#243;n parenteral puede ser considerada en pacientes con v&#243;mitos incoercibles si la nutrici&#243;n enteral no es viable.</data>
      <data key="d10">b1464c57df2eaa651a10c1522ab7db68</data>
      <data key="d11">2f55d397f6644af2aecae2384242ab8f</data>
      <data key="d12">4823</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="COMPLICACIONES INFECCIOSAS SEVERAS">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La nutrici&#243;n parenteral se relaciona con un aumento de complicaciones infecciosas debido a la v&#237;a de acceso utilizada.</data>
      <data key="d10">b1464c57df2eaa651a10c1522ab7db68</data>
      <data key="d11">a13c410e5363450eb8ad91940a3a054f</data>
      <data key="d12">4824</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="CUIDADOS">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Los cuidados requeridos para la nutrici&#243;n parenteral son m&#225;s complejos que los de la nutrici&#243;n enteral, lo que afecta la elecci&#243;n del m&#233;todo de nutrici&#243;n.</data>
      <data key="d10">7b13bde26d33b4316c3183dd027ed909</data>
      <data key="d11">6ddd393402404af0af22a483fd985ace</data>
      <data key="d12">4825</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="COSTE-EFECTIVIDAD">
      <data key="d8">5.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La coste-efectividad es un factor clave en la decisi&#243;n de utilizar nutrici&#243;n parenteral, dado su mayor costo en comparaci&#243;n con la nutrici&#243;n enteral.</data>
      <data key="d10">7b13bde26d33b4316c3183dd027ed909</data>
      <data key="d11">3d179897a37f4501b9a604ea67b1a45e</data>
      <data key="d12">4826</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="HOSPITAL CL&#205;NICO UNIVERSITARIO DE VALLADOLID">
      <data key="d8">15.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The Hospital Cl&#237;nico Universitario de Valladolid is actively engaged in the research and application of parenteral nutrition. This specialized form of nutrition is crucial for patients who are unable to utilize their digestive systems. The hospital not only conducts research in this field but also provides essential services related to parenteral nutrition, ensuring that patients receive the necessary care and support for their nutritional needs.</data>
      <data key="d10">41dee7570059d609c99074f155d4f927,488affd4bfc1b1b4b9f5b6a054c97d80</data>
      <data key="d11">2cf24d92be0642dc9d53a3add0887bf4</data>
      <data key="d12">4827</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="INSTITUTO DE INVESTIGACI&#211;N DE ENDOCRINOLOG&#205;A Y NUTRICI&#211;N">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The Instituto de Investigaci&#243;n de Endocrinolog&#237;a y Nutrici&#243;n conducts research related to parenteral nutrition</data>
      <data key="d10">41dee7570059d609c99074f155d4f927</data>
      <data key="d11">eced20d313074393a4e747c8bf3fe32f</data>
      <data key="d12">4828</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="FACULTAD DE MEDICINA, UNIVERSIDAD DE VALLADOLID">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The Facultad de Medicina at the Universidad de Valladolid educates medical professionals on topics including parenteral nutrition</data>
      <data key="d10">41dee7570059d609c99074f155d4f927</data>
      <data key="d11">9f31d31cf0934fd396fc885893f0c868</data>
      <data key="d12">4829</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL TOTAL">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La nutrici&#243;n parenteral total es un tipo espec&#237;fico de nutrici&#243;n parenteral que proporciona todos los nutrientes necesarios.</data>
      <data key="d10">dbd97c366d747303c58ef40ebfd44ea5</data>
      <data key="d11">720731a139064efb9f8b92e939855c22</data>
      <data key="d12">4830</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL SUPLEMENTARIA">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La nutrici&#243;n parenteral suplementaria se utiliza para complementar la nutrici&#243;n parenteral en pacientes que requieren apoyo adicional.</data>
      <data key="d10">dbd97c366d747303c58ef40ebfd44ea5</data>
      <data key="d11">d03bce0ea9194d03bc5a237f87800d56</data>
      <data key="d12">4831</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL HOSPITALARIA">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La nutrici&#243;n parenteral hospitalaria es un entorno donde se administra nutrici&#243;n parenteral a pacientes que no pueden alimentarse adecuadamente.</data>
      <data key="d10">dbd97c366d747303c58ef40ebfd44ea5</data>
      <data key="d11">922e778f5eb940b680cba212dc5041d4</data>
      <data key="d12">4832</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="SERVICIOS DE FARMACIA HOSPITALARIA">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Los Servicios de Farmacia Hospitalaria son responsables de la administraci&#243;n de nutrici&#243;n parenteral individualizada para pacientes cr&#237;ticos.</data>
      <data key="d10">7b34ed1eb4b09b2e0762c7e917f8a516</data>
      <data key="d11">fc47da6bfa3846729e6d7f6a741e1b82</data>
      <data key="d12">4833</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="FORMULACI&#211;N 2 EN 1">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La formulaci&#243;n 2 en 1 es una t&#233;cnica utilizada dentro de la nutrici&#243;n parenteral para proporcionar nutrientes de manera efectiva.</data>
      <data key="d10">7b34ed1eb4b09b2e0762c7e917f8a516</data>
      <data key="d11">e7f425e16adc4333bf6150e562e79326</data>
      <data key="d12">4834</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="FORMULACI&#211;N 3 EN 1">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La formulaci&#243;n 3 en 1 es otra t&#233;cnica utilizada en nutrici&#243;n parenteral que combina varios nutrientes en una sola bolsa.</data>
      <data key="d10">7b34ed1eb4b09b2e0762c7e917f8a516</data>
      <data key="d11">bea46808c2a949a78714976750207126</data>
      <data key="d12">4835</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="D-GLUCOSA">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">D-Glucose is a key component of parenteral nutrition, providing energy and influencing metabolic processes.</data>
      <data key="d10">c70d301baddcdcdefbba9b024ad4f3c5</data>
      <data key="d11">25c9fe7949ca4cbaa4aa6ee141940ca3</data>
      <data key="d12">4836</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="PACIENTES POSTQUIR&#218;RGICOS">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Pacientes postquir&#250;rgicos often require parenteral nutrition to ensure adequate nutrient intake during recovery.</data>
      <data key="d10">c70d301baddcdcdefbba9b024ad4f3c5</data>
      <data key="d11">c322de5d99d6484e85e968ac2f228bdf</data>
      <data key="d12">4837</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="GRANDES QUEMADOS">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Grandes quemados require specialized parenteral nutrition to support their increased energy and protein needs.</data>
      <data key="d10">c70d301baddcdcdefbba9b024ad4f3c5</data>
      <data key="d11">b7f8e0c1893741c49cd366a31fce6ddd</data>
      <data key="d12">4838</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="PACIENTE ESTABLE">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Parenteral nutrition is also used for stable patients who require nutritional support</data>
      <data key="d10">2bd5549759c6a0d8393bb93fdccb747b</data>
      <data key="d11">6ad8af477dc14cf58ec81facb5006886</data>
      <data key="d12">4839</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="TABLA 3">
      <data key="d8">13.0</data>
      <data key="d9">NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL is supported by TABLA 3, which offers essential information regarding nitrogen and glucose solutions utilized in parenteral nutrition. Additionally, TABLA 3 outlines guidelines for monitoring clinical parameters in patients who are receiving parenteral nutrition, ensuring that healthcare providers can effectively manage and assess the nutritional needs and health status of these patients.</data>
      <data key="d10">2bd5549759c6a0d8393bb93fdccb747b,45628dcc866de3617e83105d66f901ad</data>
      <data key="d11">65321b57e40b45abb8ed83afce125f0f</data>
      <data key="d12">4840</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="TABLA 4">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL is detailed in TABLA 4, which outlines various preparations for parenteral nutrition. Additionally, TABLA 4 provides guidelines for monitoring analytical parameters in patients receiving parenteral nutrition, ensuring that healthcare providers can effectively manage and assess the nutritional needs of these patients.</data>
      <data key="d10">2bd5549759c6a0d8393bb93fdccb747b,45628dcc866de3617e83105d66f901ad</data>
      <data key="d11">b05c0990d1a84d568b2ed991017f7222</data>
      <data key="d12">4841</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="SELECION DE OLIGOELEMENTOS">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The selection of trace elements is a key component of parenteral nutrition to ensure patient safety and recovery</data>
      <data key="d10">2bd5549759c6a0d8393bb93fdccb747b</data>
      <data key="d11">aa73307eb0694082a6a41b36156e62aa</data>
      <data key="d12">4842</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="COPPER">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Copper levels should be reduced in parenteral nutrition to avoid toxicity</data>
      <data key="d10">2bd5549759c6a0d8393bb93fdccb747b</data>
      <data key="d11">b8e13df9523146ec833abe6bcd56c4d8</data>
      <data key="d12">4843</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="MANGANESE">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Manganese should be minimized in parenteral nutrition due to potential toxicity</data>
      <data key="d10">2bd5549759c6a0d8393bb93fdccb747b</data>
      <data key="d11">7ae619efbeab4013b61d6a3cf5bb5ef1</data>
      <data key="d12">4844</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="CR&#211;MO">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Chromium is a contaminant that should be limited in parenteral nutrition</data>
      <data key="d10">2bd5549759c6a0d8393bb93fdccb747b</data>
      <data key="d11">9ff029d00942436089798a6659f3c5ac</data>
      <data key="d12">4845</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="GLUCEMIA CAPILAR">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Capillary blood glucose monitoring is a critical aspect of managing patients on parenteral nutrition</data>
      <data key="d10">2bd5549759c6a0d8393bb93fdccb747b</data>
      <data key="d11">0718477983ed46b98c787d712efcff18</data>
      <data key="d12">4846</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="BALANCE HIDROELECTROL&#205;TICO">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
