    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="FISH OIL-BASED LIPID EMULSIONS">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Fish oil-based lipid emulsions are a critical component in parenteral nutrition to prevent liver disease.</data>
