    <edge source="PARLAMENTO EUROPEO" target="COMISI&#211;N EUROPEA">
      <data key="d8">14.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The Comisi&#243;n Europea, also known as the European Commission, presented a report to the Parlamento Europeo, or European Parliament, focusing on athlete-targeted foods. This collaboration highlights the ongoing efforts between the European Commission and the European Parliament to update and enforce food labeling regulations, ensuring that consumers, including athletes, receive accurate and relevant information about food products.</data>
      <data key="d10">54a47e2936e787ab5943e2d75afc03f1,b003f8a156374bb4430475f4ffe8e074</data>
      <data key="d11">bab7e348e3724f6d88580b4bdb990a5d</data>
