      <data key="d12">5161</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="UNI&#211;N EUROPEA" target="OMS">
      <data key="d8">18.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The World Health Organization (WHO) and the European Union (EU) collaborate closely in the development of public health regulations and dietary guidelines. Both entities are committed to establishing health and nutrition standards that promote the well-being of populations. Their joint efforts focus on creating comprehensive recommendations aimed at improving public health and nutrition across member states.</data>
      <data key="d10">4198768cfbdf9c226ffba9074adf628f,91131751d701592a597bae807e00c1dc,a4b56b993221a7065a59bca622c02953</data>
