      <data key="d9">The Food and Agriculture Organization (FAO) and the World Health Organization (WHO) collaborate closely on initiatives related to global nutrition and food security. Their partnership focuses on developing international guidelines and recommendations that address these critical areas. Together, the FAO and WHO work to establish global nutrition guidelines and food safety standards, ensuring that their efforts contribute to improved health and well-being worldwide.</data>
      <data key="d10">767d564db2dbf0182707caaf1b0a52d2,8778654a17a48b8ea7b1cec378d52346,9303a85464d02f1cc012aaca21edf9bb</data>
