    <edge source="C&#211;DIGO DE DIETAS" target="UNIDAD DE NUTRICI&#211;N">
      <data key="d8">15.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The "C&#211;DIGO DE DIETAS" and the "UNIDAD DE NUTRICI&#211;N" are closely related entities within the healthcare system. The Unidad de Nutrici&#243;n is tasked with the responsibility of creating, managing, and maintaining the C&#243;digo de Dietas, which is essential for patient care in hospitals. This unit ensures that the dietary guidelines are regularly updated to meet the nutritional needs of patients effectively.</data>
