    <edge source="DIETA" target="HIDRATOS DE CARBONO">
      <data key="d8">13.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The entity "DIETA" is associated with the management of liver diseases, where carbohydrates play a significant role. It is noted that carbohydrates are a crucial component of the diet recommended for patients with liver conditions. However, there is a contrasting recommendation that suggests a low-carbohydrate diet to ensure accurate results in medical tests. To reconcile these descriptions, it can be concluded that while carbohydrates are generally important in dietary considerations for liver disease, specific circumstances or medical guidelines may advocate for a reduced intake of carbohydrates to achieve precise testing outcomes. Thus, the dietary approach for patients with liver diseases may vary based on individual needs and medical advice.</data>
      <data key="d10">20491afa9a4770e93e6cff9034f8b0f0,e82ce4aa73097ca70936be74cdafc12b</data>
