    </edge>
    <edge source="DIETA" target="PROTE&#205;NAS">
      <data key="d8">12.0</data>
      <data key="d9">DIETA and PROTE&#205;NAS are closely related concepts in the context of nutrition and health. Proteins are a necessary part of the diet, playing a crucial role in overall health and nutrition. They are also considered an essential component of dietary recommendations specifically for patients with liver diseases, highlighting their importance in specialized dietary needs.</data>
      <data key="d10">20491afa9a4770e93e6cff9034f8b0f0,ae2bf939fd143e4d8d998722ad86ba66</data>
