      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The Women's Health Initiative studies the health of older women, which is relevant to the research published in the Journal of the American Geriatrics Society</data>
      <data key="d10">3be9d646c354d76527755d79a77c916b</data>
      <data key="d11">0648e9e15b8342a58fb819f90cebd8e7</data>
      <data key="d12">5469</data>
