      <data key="d9">SUPLEMENTOS ORALES are often utilized by PACIENTE ONCOL&#211;GICO to address their nutritional requirements, particularly when traditional food intake is inadequate. Cancer patients who are unable to meet their energy needs or achieve their nutritional goals may require these oral supplements to ensure they receive the necessary nutrients for their health and recovery.</data>
