      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRITIONAL RISK SCREENING" target="DESPISTAJE DE DESNUTRICI&#211;N">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Both processes aim to identify individuals at risk of malnutrition and guide nutritional interventions.</data>
      <data key="d10">ef8194ca70c613876b927087bf7554f5</data>
      <data key="d11">9b034b31ac9746f0a73a66771163c620</data>
      <data key="d12">5554</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRITIONAL RISK SCREENING" target="ANCIANOS FR&#193;GILES">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Nutritional risk screening is particularly important for frail elderly individuals to prevent malnutrition.</data>
      <data key="d10">ef8194ca70c613876b927087bf7554f5</data>
      <data key="d11">7bca6af6f69d4b03b9d79e8c140108f0</data>
      <data key="d12">5555</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRITIONAL RISK SCREENING" target="DENT E">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Dent E has conducted systematic reviews on nutritional screening tools, including the nutritional risk screening tool.</data>
      <data key="d10">d80f1e55925e0ce0cd958e35ad2e49ff</data>
      <data key="d11">16ee8aa1133541d6b8c9d57e584cb4a5</data>
      <data key="d12">5556</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRITIONAL RISK SCREENING" target="NUTRIC SCORE">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The NUTRIC Score is a tool used in conjunction with the Nutritional Risk Screening to assess nutritional risk</data>
      <data key="d10">25192e60a2c23bd74095f4602efeac4c</data>
      <data key="d11">b626d3803bfd4db9ab63b93ab15ef501</data>
      <data key="d12">5557</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="GASTROSTOM&#205;A" target="S&#205;NDROME DE DUMPING">
      <data key="d8">5.0</data>
      <data key="d9">El s&#237;ndrome de dumping puede ser un efecto secundario de la alimentaci&#243;n a trav&#233;s de una gastrostom&#237;a si no se maneja adecuadamente.</data>
      <data key="d10">e4019011dbf10f2c4b73d33215d7631d</data>
      <data key="d11">996d14dd4067436fbf1b37ae3a20fbe8</data>
      <data key="d12">5558</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="GASTROSTOM&#205;A" target="DIETOTERAPIA">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Gastrostomy is a method used in dietotherapy for patients requiring nutritional support</data>
      <data key="d10">76bdd5f53571ff68dd1e439219572347</data>
      <data key="d11">d302ff9964c3498390f51a2bc45652c5</data>
      <data key="d12">5559</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="GASTROSTOM&#205;A" target="HERNIAS HIATALES">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Hiatal hernias can complicate the placement of gastrostomy tubes</data>
      <data key="d10">76bdd5f53571ff68dd1e439219572347</data>
      <data key="d11">dbdf4416a9af4f0696aa02ca04430b00</data>
      <data key="d12">5560</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="GASTROSTOM&#205;A" target="V&#211;LVULO G&#193;STRICO">
      <data key="d8">11.0</data>
      <data key="d9">GASTROSTOM&#205;A and V&#211;LVULO G&#193;STRICO are related medical concepts. Gastric volvulus, known as v&#243;lvulo g&#225;strico, is a condition that presents a significant contraindication for the placement of gastrostomy tubes. This means that when a patient is diagnosed with gastric volvulus, the procedure to insert a gastrostomy tube should not be performed due to the potential complications associated with the condition.</data>
      <data key="d10">0b3eea4ed6da979f796aeba1ff2ee8d9,76bdd5f53571ff68dd1e439219572347</data>
      <data key="d11">11e3d9ba56684d97831b06fa6755d926</data>
      <data key="d12">5561</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="GASTROSTOM&#205;A" target="CIRROSIS HEP&#193;TICA">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Liver cirrhosis can complicate the placement of gastrostomy tubes due to bleeding risks</data>
      <data key="d10">76bdd5f53571ff68dd1e439219572347</data>
      <data key="d11">a59609caac534e4f9cb5a35ec638a2d6</data>
      <data key="d12">5562</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="GASTROSTOM&#205;A" target="HIPERTENSI&#211;N PORTAL">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Portal hypertension can complicate the placement of gastrostomy tubes due to bleeding risks</data>
      <data key="d10">76bdd5f53571ff68dd1e439219572347</data>
      <data key="d11">ed419b872811499aae84cbe7d17cd821</data>
      <data key="d12">5563</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="GASTROSTOM&#205;A" target="NE">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La gastrostom&#237;a se realiza para facilitar la nutrici&#243;n enteral en pacientes que no pueden alimentarse por v&#237;a oral.</data>
      <data key="d10">7469cc60475806b519e91abe2796aead</data>
      <data key="d11">5b321cb60f9245ce83df5674c68b5e9a</data>
      <data key="d12">5564</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="GASTROSTOM&#205;A" target="FIBROSIS QU&#205;STICA">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Gastrostomy is often employed for long-term nutritional support in patients with fibrosis qu&#237;stica</data>
      <data key="d10">95ef1473677a26ea6ad77c7db0c55e5e</data>
      <data key="d11">c6b90420feb44896b17e4d90416eea65</data>
      <data key="d12">5565</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="GASTROSTOM&#205;A" target="NUTRICI&#211;N EN ONCOLOG&#205;A">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Gastrostom&#237;a is a method of enteral nutrition discussed in the context of post-surgical care for oncology patients</data>
      <data key="d10">7c43869fff0960219e47d176597b35b8</data>
      <data key="d11">cdd3106b45d24536a41823d6c7f64cf1</data>
      <data key="d12">5566</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="GASTROSTOM&#205;A" target="PACIENTE ONCOL&#211;GICO">
      <data key="d8">12.0</data>
      <data key="d9">GASTROSTOM&#205;A is a medical procedure that may be necessary for PACIENTE ONCOL&#211;GICO, or cancer patients, who require long-term enteral nutrition support. This procedure provides a means for these patients to receive adequate nutrition when they are unable to do so through normal oral intake.</data>
      <data key="d10">395385fad73fd5b7ed9eda114b482624,40dcfaa6144c6424068ba46fdf288dd2</data>
      <data key="d11">8b2586e2c17a4aa18d7f8bf9b0f730eb</data>
      <data key="d12">5567</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="GASTROSTOM&#205;A" target="PONSKEY">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Ponskey is recognized for his role in developing the endoscopic gastrostomy technique, which is now a preferred method for feeding patients</data>
      <data key="d10">4dffad2ae717727b21f2294ac520f2be</data>
      <data key="d11">9d64eecc7c0c44d5af92cb8ba838503b</data>
      <data key="d12">5568</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="GASTROSTOM&#205;A" target="GAUDEREZ">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Gauderez collaborated with Ponskey in the development of the endoscopic gastrostomy technique, improving patient outcomes</data>
      <data key="d10">4dffad2ae717727b21f2294ac520f2be</data>
      <data key="d11">051eac4c8f3e476283333855bcc85e0a</data>
      <data key="d12">5569</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="GASTROSTOM&#205;A" target="YEYUNOSTOM&#205;A">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Both are surgical procedures used for long-term nutritional support in patients unable to eat normally</data>
      <data key="d10">4dffad2ae717727b21f2294ac520f2be</data>
      <data key="d11">ff8e4644f6234105a881a7ed90d64dc0</data>
      <data key="d12">5570</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="GASTROSTOM&#205;A" target="SONDAS">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Sondas are used in the procedure of gastrostom&#237;a for feeding patients.</data>
      <data key="d10">0f7dbd2afca6dc5582d55fb39b0f55b7</data>
      <data key="d11">631da40d28f44048975e62eb67c13183</data>
      <data key="d12">5571</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="GASTROSTOM&#205;A" target="NUTRICI&#211;N ARTIFICIAL">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Gastrostomy is a method used to provide artificial nutrition to patients who cannot eat orally</data>
      <data key="d10">0b3eea4ed6da979f796aeba1ff2ee8d9</data>
      <data key="d11">bd76ca7cd336477fa1c66811f5397861</data>
      <data key="d12">5572</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="GASTROSTOM&#205;A" target="RADIOLOG&#205;A INTERVENCIONISTA">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Radiologists are often required to perform gastrostomy procedures</data>
      <data key="d10">0b3eea4ed6da979f796aeba1ff2ee8d9</data>
      <data key="d11">c9f483830d5e4747910a7e8aa101c23f</data>
      <data key="d12">5573</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="GASTROSTOM&#205;A" target="SNG">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">SNG is used to locate the stomach before performing a gastrostomy</data>
      <data key="d10">0b3eea4ed6da979f796aeba1ff2ee8d9</data>
      <data key="d11">21da7c30450d44f79d11f503752a34ab</data>
      <data key="d12">5574</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="GASTROSTOM&#205;A" target="HERNIA HIATAL">
      <data key="d8">5.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Hernia hiatal is a contraindication for performing gastrostomy</data>
      <data key="d10">0b3eea4ed6da979f796aeba1ff2ee8d9</data>
      <data key="d11">6ce317ecfc254e12ad6a03a103d487f7</data>
      <data key="d12">5575</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="GASTROSTOM&#205;A" target="GLUCAG&#211;N">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Glucag&#243;n is used during the sedation process for gastrostomy procedures</data>
      <data key="d10">0b3eea4ed6da979f796aeba1ff2ee8d9</data>
      <data key="d11">403bdf8fb1c04a32b9a716423215e7ce</data>
      <data key="d12">5576</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="GASTROSTOM&#205;A" target="ATROPINA">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Atropina is administered to reduce secretions during gastrostomy procedures</data>
      <data key="d10">0b3eea4ed6da979f796aeba1ff2ee8d9</data>
      <data key="d11">2642287a75ee4128aca1e82383ba5e38</data>
      <data key="d12">5577</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="GASTROSTOM&#205;A" target="T&#201;CNICA ENDOSC&#211;PICA">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Endoscopic techniques are often employed in performing gastrostomy</data>
