    </edge>
    <edge source="ALZHEIMER" target="MCI">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Mild Cognitive Impairment (MCI) is often seen as a precursor to Alzheimer's disease, indicating a high risk of progression to Alzheimer's</data>
      <data key="d10">53e49c7e4c8bca9063d743acb9997132</data>
      <data key="d11">677a270b8e844dc88598e58f32238257</data>
      <data key="d12">5598</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ALZHEIMER" target="CVD">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Cardiovascular disease (CVD) has been shown to increase the risk of developing Alzheimer's disease</data>
      <data key="d10">53e49c7e4c8bca9063d743acb9997132</data>
