    <edge source="DIABETES" target="LIRAGLUTIDA">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Liraglutida is a medication specifically designed for the management of type 2 diabetes. It not only aids in controlling blood sugar levels but also offers cardiovascular protection, enhancing overall health outcomes for diabetic patients. Through its dual benefits, Liraglutida plays a significant role in improving the well-being of individuals living with diabetes.</data>
