    </edge>
    <edge source="DIABETES" target="MORTALIDAD">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Diabetes is a leading cause of mortality, particularly due to its association with cardiovascular diseases</data>
      <data key="d10">ac8c5a07bd415723c0410ec34b9d7c5e</data>
      <data key="d11">bc6bf93a3e89430ca30fe6047f6df3e7</data>
      <data key="d12">5721</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DIABETES" target="SISTEMAS DE SALUD">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Health systems are crucial in managing diabetes care and prevention efforts</data>
      <data key="d10">ac8c5a07bd415723c0410ec34b9d7c5e</data>
      <data key="d11">2d097d6a4a474de5a8ac48c10929686d</data>
      <data key="d12">5722</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DIABETES" target="ENFERMEDADES CARDIOVASCULARES">
      <data key="d8">15.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Diabetes and cardiovascular diseases are both chronic conditions that are interconnected and can be significantly influenced by dietary choices. Individuals with diabetes face an increased risk of developing cardiovascular diseases, which are a major contributor to higher mortality rates among this population. The relationship between these two health issues underscores the importance of managing diet and lifestyle to mitigate risks associated with both diabetes and cardiovascular diseases.</data>
      <data key="d10">ac8c5a07bd415723c0410ec34b9d7c5e,ea5b0e748b16db9640ab70c394ca1a4c</data>
      <data key="d11">4c096d6353f3471598c3dd901814f61f</data>
      <data key="d12">5723</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DIABETES" target="PROVINCIA">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Different provinces in Spain have varying rates of diabetes prevalence and mortality</data>
      <data key="d10">ac8c5a07bd415723c0410ec34b9d7c5e</data>
      <data key="d11">8b71d5a96019459f825c6ac85e709650</data>
      <data key="d12">5724</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DIABETES" target="COMUNIDAD VALENCIANA">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
