    <edge source="DIABETES" target="F&#211;RMULAS ESPEC&#205;FICAS">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Diabetes is a condition that requires careful management of nutritional intake, and specific formulas play a crucial role in this regard. Formulas for diabetics are a type of specific formula used in enteral nutrition, designed to meet the unique dietary needs of individuals with diabetes. These specific formulas are particularly beneficial for managing the nutritional requirements of diabetic patients, especially those who also suffer from pancreatitis. By providing tailored nutritional support, these formulas help in maintaining optimal health and managing the complexities associated with diabetes.</data>
      <data key="d10">178140d0d29364593546d7d21393f2c6,d028f23d86d7ed32eebe35c5d90765f2</data>
      <data key="d11">19f6dd4f608046ae80499cae6f6e3042</data>
      <data key="d12">5737</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DIABETES" target="HIPERGLUCEMIA">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La hiperglucemia es una complicaci&#243;n com&#250;n en pacientes diab&#233;ticos que requiere atenci&#243;n m&#233;dica y nutricional.</data>
      <data key="d10">7469cc60475806b519e91abe2796aead</data>
      <data key="d11">1c2a3dda8a324dcd8095a7b6c364ddef</data>
      <data key="d12">5738</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DIABETES" target="DIFICULTAD EN EL CONTROL GLUC&#201;MICO">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La dificultad en el control gluc&#233;mico es un desaf&#237;o com&#250;n para los pacientes diab&#233;ticos que necesitan un manejo adecuado.</data>
      <data key="d10">7469cc60475806b519e91abe2796aead</data>
      <data key="d11">6b9c3afde83d4311b1b3e4a80ee3397d</data>
      <data key="d12">5739</data>
