    </edge>
    <edge source="DIABETES" target="FIBROSIS QU&#205;STICA">
      <data key="d8">13.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Diabetes is a common complication in patients with fibrosis qu&#237;stica (cystic fibrosis), establishing a significant link between the two conditions. The patient in question is affected by both cystic fibrosis and diabetes, highlighting the interrelated nature of these diseases and their combined impact on health.</data>
      <data key="d10">84e91b50850bfa0ad0122cdebf477a1d,d22c91140c11f7344e9aeebb21454cee</data>
      <data key="d11">11302e5be8f443c08564ab8a6765b822</data>
