      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Ignacio Hern&#225;ndez Medrano developed the Savana program, which is designed to extract clinical data using artificial intelligence.</data>
      <data key="d10">b7034350b98abd27ed6af7560149691d</data>
