      <data key="d11">15fcb1c9c6a545d192212a617b171283</data>
      <data key="d12">5930</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="OMS" target="RECOMENDACIONES DE INGESTA">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La OMS emite recomendaciones de ingesta para asegurar una nutrici&#243;n adecuada en la poblaci&#243;n</data>
      <data key="d10">91131751d701592a597bae807e00c1dc</data>
      <data key="d11">2146c502cb1646388a57eca4a1c721ed</data>
      <data key="d12">5931</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="OMS" target="GINEBRA">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Ginebra es la sede de la OMS, donde se desarrollan pol&#237;ticas y recomendaciones de salud global</data>
      <data key="d10">135d72a9407315b8bbf5b1ac13d72abf</data>
      <data key="d11">d29e689e65e34ddd9d441ac4f7691baa</data>
      <data key="d12">5932</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="OMS" target="MA KOMINIAREK">
      <data key="d8">5.0</data>
      <data key="d9">MA Kominiarek ha escrito sobre recomendaciones que son relevantes para la OMS en el contexto de la salud materna</data>
      <data key="d10">135d72a9407315b8bbf5b1ac13d72abf</data>
      <data key="d11">74bc60fa540941c781f94a65e4718367</data>
      <data key="d12">5933</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="OMS" target="M">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">M ha investigado sobre la nutrici&#243;n en el embarazo, un tema de inter&#233;s para la OMS</data>
      <data key="d10">135d72a9407315b8bbf5b1ac13d72abf</data>
      <data key="d11">6a63319fcd9e4483bc233e707dfca90c</data>
      <data key="d12">5934</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="OMS" target="CIE-11">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The OMS (World Health Organization) utilizes the CIE-11 (International Classification of Diseases, 11th Revision) to classify nutritional status based on anthropometric parameters. The CIE-11 was developed by the OMS to provide a standardized framework for international health classification.</data>
      <data key="d10">21634801ee74e0828836551dbeb8b1ed,3779506e9a987b6bdf5da381df675430</data>
      <data key="d11">8961de34c5444e8b8f91c05a4c9e021b</data>
      <data key="d12">5935</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="OMS" target="TNE PANCRE&#193;TICOS">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La OMS ha establecido clasificaciones para los tumores neuroendocrinos pancre&#225;ticos, incluyendo el TNE G3.</data>
      <data key="d10">eb8099d0ade1b1539ca9f357d155574b</data>
      <data key="d11">f83c4d0e80574bbfb90e8b3bb7f66bbc</data>
      <data key="d12">5936</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="OMS" target="HARRIS-BENEDICT">
      <data key="d8">12.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The OMS (World Health Organization) references the Harris-Benedict formula as one of the methods for estimating energy needs in individuals. Both the Harris-Benedict formula and the WHO formulas are utilized to estimate energy expenditure, highlighting their importance in nutritional assessments and health-related calculations.</data>
      <data key="d10">148443357888793655b663333268775a,d10d3648e8642657567d9a619f210ca6</data>
      <data key="d11">2db261ea34d84a2f9f1bf8c8870937e2</data>
      <data key="d12">5937</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="OMS" target="MIFFLIN-ST. JEOR">
      <data key="d8">5.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Mifflin-St. Jeor is another method recommended by the OMS for estimating energy requirements</data>
      <data key="d10">d10d3648e8642657567d9a619f210ca6</data>
      <data key="d11">488d0c96ea254165b6cd63b5169c916e</data>
      <data key="d12">5938</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="OMS" target="UPTODATE">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La OMS proporciona informaci&#243;n que es referenciada en UpToDate sobre el gasto energ&#233;tico y la salud</data>
      <data key="d10">89b0bde0358432506a0e03d4691dd2ab</data>
      <data key="d11">b8386f39ee834f2baf9f8f48fa338f79</data>
      <data key="d12">5939</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="OMS" target="TRASTORNO DEL COMPORTAMIENTO ALIMENTARIO">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The World Health Organization offers guidelines for the classification of diseases, including eating disorders, which are critical for global health understanding</data>
      <data key="d10">bbb0b98043e40738bce354afe3de265c</data>
      <data key="d11">3ad27991a78149d3bf605f373d5f85ea</data>
      <data key="d12">5940</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="OMS" target="POBLACI&#211;N GENERAL">
