    <edge source="SOCIEDAD ESPA&#209;OLA DE ENDOCRINOLOG&#205;A Y NUTRICI&#211;N" target="MANUAL DE ENDOCRINOLOG&#205;A Y NUTRICI&#211;N">
      <data key="d8">56.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The Sociedad Espa&#241;ola de Endocrinolog&#237;a y Nutrici&#243;n (Spanish Society of Endocrinology and Nutrition) is responsible for publishing the Manual de Endocrinolog&#237;a y Nutrici&#243;n (Manual of Endocrinology and Nutrition). This manual serves as a comprehensive resource that provides guidelines on nutrition practices and includes valuable information on various endocrine disorders, such as hypopituitarism. Through this publication, the society aims to enhance the understanding and management of endocrinological and nutritional issues within the medical community.</data>
      <data key="d10">2729f43dc666433fb3fabad498b99f91,593ae586183f02d2611966f8a1603e5d,6083387b51909347a13ed5aa1c92bb26,746fad557197bebe72763efd23a9e0e2,9312fdfba5d3f79b95c5e6af38ced009,9d100ca2bc5b797561fe3b3a4bb61586,9fda43c414d32c5a8a3bb7354bfb1704,e55f521d442f8ba50012b67d7051d39f</data>
