      <data key="d9">Nutrici&#243;n Interactiva is developed under the auspices of the Society of Spanish Endocrinology and Nutrition</data>
      <data key="d10">dea64d5eb807430bc52e8bed6e30c393</data>
      <data key="d11">ac69a486607b4ed286062c2315bc276c</data>
      <data key="d12">6223</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="SOCIEDAD ESPA&#209;OLA DE ENDOCRINOLOG&#205;A Y NUTRICI&#211;N" target="ALIANZA M&#193;SNUTRIDOS">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The Sociedad Espa&#241;ola de Endocrinolog&#237;a y Nutrici&#243;n supports the Alianza m&#225;snutridos in its initiatives aimed at raising awareness about malnutrition. Additionally, the Sociedad Espa&#241;ola de Endocrinolog&#237;a y Nutrici&#243;n collaborates with Alianza m&#225;snutridos to tackle nutritional issues that are associated with endocrine disorders. This partnership highlights their commitment to addressing both malnutrition and the nutritional challenges faced by individuals with endocrine conditions.</data>
      <data key="d10">969bdfc6cc15b9089e96000addd87561,ba214f6f228224af19c5ca2dcc9c6772</data>
      <data key="d11">0564bca2ef264c52a28857e251747f31</data>
      <data key="d12">6224</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="GAMIFICACI&#211;N" target="FORMACI&#211;N BIOM&#201;DICA">
      <data key="d8">4.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Gamification can be applied in biomedical training to enhance learning experiences and engagement among healthcare professionals.</data>
      <data key="d10">6d174de24d62997808908333da591120</data>
      <data key="d11">68b1c472ce0143b1a2a1d8a39d28cdd3</data>
      <data key="d12">6225</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="TIC" target="POSVERDAD">
      <data key="d8">5.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The phenomenon of post-truth is exacerbated by the use of information and communication technologies (TIC) in manipulating beliefs</data>
      <data key="d10">6d628d186db6cb708d96ec523f3e35c8</data>
      <data key="d11">9cccbb4ec3b04541a1f6dfe32cd6b400</data>
      <data key="d12">6226</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="TIC" target="DIOGENES INFORM&#193;TICO">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The concept of Digital Diogenes highlights the challenges posed by the vast amounts of data generated by information and communication technologies (TIC)</data>
      <data key="d10">6d628d186db6cb708d96ec523f3e35c8</data>
      <data key="d11">16d71d4487ce44e4b94e650ffdcf9be0</data>
      <data key="d12">6227</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="TABACO" target="ENFERMEDAD DE GRAVES">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">El tabaquismo se ha asociado con un mayor riesgo de desarrollar la enfermedad de Graves.</data>
      <data key="d10">1263bbcd20f6e54800e1c9361466bc63</data>
      <data key="d11">0a7f1ee194ca4e64877fa0e68935a946</data>
      <data key="d12">6228</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="TABACO" target="CALCIO">
      <data key="d8">10.0</data>
      <data key="d9">TABACO and CALCIO are interconnected in the context of bone health. Avoiding tobacco is crucial for minimizing the risk of osteoporosis in patients who require calcium supplementation. The consumption of tobacco negatively impacts bone health and the absorption of calcium, highlighting the importance of steering clear of tobacco to support overall skeletal integrity and ensure effective calcium utilization.</data>
      <data key="d10">7925a5f252f3bfc107f8199401edf824,94afd4bf40b661992e66cf7963ef236c</data>
      <data key="d11">1a749ab3251d42d0b42ed275685ba323</data>
      <data key="d12">6229</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="CRISTINA TEJERA" target="TWITTER">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Cristina Tejera has a significant presence on Twitter, where she shares information related to her specialty in health</data>
      <data key="d10">1fd926c88c75ff7b965baddbfb8bc0a6</data>
      <data key="d11">c158d1d1a73243dbbdd186f39be086e4</data>
      <data key="d12">6230</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="TWITTER" target="FACEBOOK">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Both Twitter and Facebook are major social media platforms used for sharing health-related information and connecting professionals and patients</data>
      <data key="d10">1fd926c88c75ff7b965baddbfb8bc0a6</data>
      <data key="d11">898133da10c04510a1ae96439e81085e</data>
      <data key="d12">6231</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="TWITTER" target="INSTAGRAM">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Twitter and Instagram are both utilized in the health sector for sharing information, though they focus on different formats (text vs. images)</data>
      <data key="d10">1fd926c88c75ff7b965baddbfb8bc0a6</data>
      <data key="d11">e4854efb468b4e509b1b4764e7cc3b4c</data>
      <data key="d12">6232</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="TWITTER" target="LINKEDIN">
      <data key="d8">5.0</data>
      <data key="d9">LinkedIn and Twitter are both platforms that professionals use to share content and connect with others in their fields</data>
      <data key="d10">1fd926c88c75ff7b965baddbfb8bc0a6</data>
      <data key="d11">ecfc9d05e6994585be56d54fa27298db</data>
      <data key="d12">6233</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="FACEBOOK" target="INSTAGRAM">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
