    <edge source="CANCER" target="CANCER CACHEXIA">
      <data key="d8">18.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Cancer cachexia is a prevalent condition among cancer patients, characterized by significant weight loss and muscle wasting. This syndrome severely impacts the health of individuals diagnosed with cancer, making specialized nutritional interventions essential for managing the condition. Cancer often leads to the development of cachexia, highlighting the interconnectedness of these two entities and the importance of addressing nutritional needs in cancer care.</data>
      <data key="d10">bb209dcfffac9c89dae0ad4ed2908d85,fb7b0d121f195e2a472f3d47e28ccff9</data>
      <data key="d11">058198a139f44377b93659082a57f0ae</data>
      <data key="d12">6365</data>
