    <edge source="SAL" target="CROQUETAS EN SALSA DE PIMIENTO DE PIQUILLO">
      <data key="d8">5.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Salt is used to season the croquettes and sauce</data>
      <data key="d10">fa95290726c6f8f7c5947019c98a3e1d</data>
      <data key="d11">0ea59b5923064162b1910944bb57e1ec</data>
      <data key="d12">6541</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="SAL" target="ENFERMEDADES CARDIOVASCULARES">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">SAL and ENFERMEDADES CARDIOVASCULARES are closely related, as high salt consumption is significantly linked to an increased risk of cardiovascular diseases. The relationship between salt intake and the incidence of these diseases becomes particularly pronounced at elevated levels of salt consumption.</data>
      <data key="d10">a0ef28095dacaada520d8e6fbaf518f1,dcb29ef57f2b65cd420e728a3e29102d</data>
      <data key="d11">7919d22f07c14453a602e77555226310</data>
      <data key="d12">6542</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="SAL" target="MORTALIDAD CARDIOVASCULAR">
      <data key="d8">15.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The entity "SAL" is linked to "MORTALIDAD CARDIOVASCULAR" through a significant association. Elevated salt consumption has been correlated with an increase in cardiovascular mortality rates. This relationship indicates that higher intake of salt may directly contribute to a rise in the risk of death from cardiovascular-related issues.</data>
      <data key="d10">a0ef28095dacaada520d8e6fbaf518f1,dcb29ef57f2b65cd420e728a3e29102d</data>
      <data key="d11">b0b83ec8a54c43a094942bebe9ab1471</data>
      <data key="d12">6543</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="SAL" target="C&#193;NCER">
      <data key="d8">5.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Increased salt consumption has been proposed as a risk factor for the development of gastric and renal cancer.</data>
      <data key="d10">a0ef28095dacaada520d8e6fbaf518f1</data>
      <data key="d11">0cf27d1bf27b4c36b2281a211947f893</data>
      <data key="d12">6544</data>
