    </edge>
    <edge source="ALERGENOS" target="ALIMENTACION ADAPTADA TRADICIONAL">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The control of allergens is crucial in the preparation of traditional adapted food for patients with dysphagia.</data>
      <data key="d10">3a7dac32347984360ee9e87767129272</data>
      <data key="d11">00113d2389024c3494c31ffd60f89503</data>
      <data key="d12">6653</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ALERGENOS" target="ALIMENTACION ADAPTADA COMERCIAL">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Allergen control is necessary in commercially prepared food for individuals with dysphagia to ensure safety.</data>
      <data key="d10">3a7dac32347984360ee9e87767129272</data>
      <data key="d11">ee363b2f39a94ca8af3fc8f45873f776</data>
      <data key="d12">6654</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ALERGENOS" target="GALLETA MARIA">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Alergenos must be disclosed for Galleta Maria to inform consumers about potential food allergies</data>
