    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ARTIFICIAL" target="C&#193;NCER">
      <data key="d8">14.0</data>
      <data key="d9">NUTRICI&#211;N ARTIFICIAL is a treatment indicated for cancer patients who are unable to adequately nourish themselves due to the effects of their condition or its treatment. Cancer patients often require nutritional support to manage the side effects of their treatment, making artificial nutrition an essential component of their care. This approach helps ensure that patients receive the necessary nutrients to support their health and recovery during a challenging time.</data>
      <data key="d10">f0a97cbd966f5a930d9355f589d05613,f7871bbaa57d50bb5f5675cd580cb0af</data>
      <data key="d11">62172660a02a4e9a8d56b104ab839f81</data>
      <data key="d12">6760</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
