    </edge>
    <edge source="FIBROSIS QU&#205;STICA" target="CYSTIC FIBROSIS FOUNDATION">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The Cystic Fibrosis Foundation provides guidelines for managing fibrosis qu&#237;stica, focusing on dietary needs and supplementation</data>
      <data key="d10">c2211f0deb7328a77cb632140690da03</data>
      <data key="d11">10ef4d52de934551be29e365ffae3646</data>
      <data key="d12">7099</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="FIBROSIS QU&#205;STICA" target="KREON 10000">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Kreon 10000 is recommended for use in patients with cystic fibrosis to aid in digestion due to pancreatic insufficiency.</data>
      <data key="d10">028c43c3f0f3d1f8085eed8518636f97</data>
      <data key="d11">18f74ff5268c493b944761e4be8737f9</data>
      <data key="d12">7100</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="FIBROSIS QU&#205;STICA" target="KREON 25000">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Kreon 25000 is recommended for use in patients with cystic fibrosis to aid in digestion due to pancreatic insufficiency.</data>
      <data key="d10">028c43c3f0f3d1f8085eed8518636f97</data>
      <data key="d11">0590a33b3d064e53807711f37a20be3e</data>
      <data key="d12">7101</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="FIBROSIS QU&#205;STICA" target="KREON 5000 GRANULADO">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Kreon 5000 granulado is recommended for use in patients with cystic fibrosis to aid in digestion due to pancreatic insufficiency.</data>
      <data key="d10">028c43c3f0f3d1f8085eed8518636f97</data>
      <data key="d11">b71207b32d5c45b684ed411ebc32dc33</data>
      <data key="d12">7102</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="FIBROSIS QU&#205;STICA" target="ENZIMAS PANCRE&#193;TICAS">
      <data key="d8">26.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Fibrosis qu&#237;stica, also known as cystic fibrosis, is a genetic disorder that significantly impacts the digestive system, particularly due to pancreatic insufficiency. In patients with fibrosis qu&#237;stica, pancreatic enzymes play a crucial role in the management of the condition. These enzymes are essential for digestion, particularly in aiding the breakdown of fats, which is vital for proper nutrient absorption. Therefore, the administration of pancreatic enzymes is a key component in the treatment and management of patients suffering from fibrosis qu&#237;stica, ensuring they can effectively digest food and maintain their health.</data>
      <data key="d10">028c43c3f0f3d1f8085eed8518636f97,95ef1473677a26ea6ad77c7db0c55e5e,c926a8237fba5d5bc497ac2165bbb039</data>
      <data key="d11">a4b7cf87c3bc41b7ba1d3bd308148ffc</data>
      <data key="d12">7103</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="FIBROSIS QU&#205;STICA" target="LIPASA">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Lipase is a key enzyme in pancreatic enzyme preparations used for patients with cystic fibrosis to aid in fat digestion.</data>
      <data key="d10">028c43c3f0f3d1f8085eed8518636f97</data>
      <data key="d11">a9d007957a09459b851860cd2ec9e3cb</data>
      <data key="d12">7104</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="FIBROSIS QU&#205;STICA" target="AMILASA (ALFA)">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Alpha-amylase is included in pancreatic enzyme preparations for patients with cystic fibrosis to assist in carbohydrate digestion.</data>
      <data key="d10">028c43c3f0f3d1f8085eed8518636f97</data>
      <data key="d11">c784bc5e30cb42b1a5d6deaebce351dc</data>
      <data key="d12">7105</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="FIBROSIS QU&#205;STICA" target="PROTEASA">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Protease is included in pancreatic enzyme preparations for patients with cystic fibrosis to assist in protein digestion.</data>
      <data key="d10">028c43c3f0f3d1f8085eed8518636f97</data>
      <data key="d11">de2323e6aaf44b00a477de50b5a37a80</data>
      <data key="d12">7106</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="FIBROSIS QU&#205;STICA" target="PACIENTES CON PANCREATITIS CR&#211;NICA">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Patients with chronic pancreatitis may also experience similar digestive issues as those with cystic fibrosis, requiring enzyme supplementation.</data>
      <data key="d10">028c43c3f0f3d1f8085eed8518636f97</data>
      <data key="d11">7ac138cc6efc4ecdbf33599e94970308</data>
      <data key="d12">7107</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="FIBROSIS QU&#205;STICA" target="OLIVEIRA G">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Olveira G conducted research related to nutritional support in patients with cystic fibrosis</data>
      <data key="d10">c926a8237fba5d5bc497ac2165bbb039</data>
      <data key="d11">d52f67b108984e6680154d935bb40313</data>
      <data key="d12">7108</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="FIBROSIS QU&#205;STICA" target="COLPAT&#205;A FIBROSANTE">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Excessive use of pancreatic enzymes in cystic fibrosis can lead to fibrosing colonopathy</data>
      <data key="d10">c926a8237fba5d5bc497ac2165bbb039</data>
      <data key="d11">ac843fea21514568a92b2067a88b9f53</data>
      <data key="d12">7109</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="FIBROSIS QU&#205;STICA" target="DISTRIBUCI&#211;N">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Proper distribution of pancreatic enzymes is critical for effective treatment in cystic fibrosis</data>
      <data key="d10">c926a8237fba5d5bc497ac2165bbb039</data>
      <data key="d11">6ca864d0d15d43aa9ec8413468fed67b</data>
      <data key="d12">7110</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="FIBROSIS QU&#205;STICA" target="ADMINISTRACI&#211;N">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The administration of pancreatic enzymes is a key part of managing cystic fibrosis</data>
      <data key="d10">c926a8237fba5d5bc497ac2165bbb039</data>
      <data key="d11">9b00c92d14a64e2a998236c3c0573ee4</data>
      <data key="d12">7111</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
