    </edge>
    <edge source="ANEXO 3" target="EVALUACI&#211;N GLOBAL SUBJETIVA GLOBAL (VSG)">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Anexo 3 contains the Global Subjective Assessment (VSG) which is a method for evaluating nutritional status</data>
      <data key="d10">0bc48d0666e895b990c211acf7cbcf23</data>
      <data key="d11">5173996440da4c228838e85ff7a3863d</data>
      <data key="d12">7245</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MALNUTRICI&#211;N" target="&#205;NDICE DE MASA CORPORAL (IMC)">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Body Mass Index (BMI) is used to assess malnutrition and is a critical measure in nutritional evaluations</data>
      <data key="d10">0bc48d0666e895b990c211acf7cbcf23</data>
      <data key="d11">bee755a5d1354344a9ae0867a258ff61</data>
      <data key="d12">7246</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MALNUTRICI&#211;N" target="CAPACIDAD FUNCIONAL">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Functional capacity can be affected by malnutrition, making it an important factor in nutritional assessments</data>
      <data key="d10">0bc48d0666e895b990c211acf7cbcf23</data>
      <data key="d11">76504edd6762484e8fd7cb5a0e0068d8</data>
      <data key="d12">7247</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MALNUTRICI&#211;N" target="S&#205;NTOMAS GASTROINTESTINALES">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Gastrointestinal symptoms can hinder nutrient absorption and contribute to malnutrition</data>
      <data key="d10">0bc48d0666e895b990c211acf7cbcf23</data>
      <data key="d11">c3b8f2dc415d429b85bd0eecb8c5bd4c</data>
      <data key="d12">7248</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MALNUTRICI&#211;N" target="CAMBIOS EN LA INGESTA DIET&#201;TICA">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Changes in dietary intake can lead to malnutrition if not properly managed</data>
      <data key="d10">0bc48d0666e895b990c211acf7cbcf23</data>
      <data key="d11">5225daa7e2884d59903f1026c7d9ca41</data>
      <data key="d12">7249</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MALNUTRICI&#211;N" target="ESTR&#201;S PSICOL&#211;GICO">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Psychological stress can negatively impact a patient's nutritional intake and contribute to malnutrition</data>
      <data key="d10">0bc48d0666e895b990c211acf7cbcf23</data>
      <data key="d11">72a1e92b78e345b7826958d65e0412d0</data>
      <data key="d12">7250</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MALNUTRICI&#211;N" target="PROTE&#205;NAS">
      <data key="d8">15.0</data>
      <data key="d9">MALNUTRICI&#211;N and PROTE&#205;NAS are closely interconnected, particularly in the context of patients with renal insufficiency. Malnutrition in these patients is frequently associated with inadequate protein consumption, which can significantly impact their overall health. Furthermore, malnutrition influences protein metabolism, and this relationship is evaluated through nitrogen balance, a measure that reflects both protein intake and excretion. This highlights the critical role of adequate protein levels in maintaining health and managing malnutrition in individuals with renal issues.</data>
      <data key="d10">2c60ced31055ac58d76da9c1e90c8e9d,30d5c2ac31f39f8177bec50f6b5e631b</data>
      <data key="d11">acceed2b6bba4a33a39b1b56bfa89f52</data>
      <data key="d12">7251</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MALNUTRICI&#211;N" target="ANAMNESIS">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Anamnesis is used in nutritional assessment to identify signs of malnutrition through various dietary and health-related questions.</data>
      <data key="d10">30d5c2ac31f39f8177bec50f6b5e631b</data>
      <data key="d11">94ada3d87bde4bd1a2ce50e9d1194aa7</data>
      <data key="d12">7252</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MALNUTRICI&#211;N" target="FUNCIONES INMUNITARIAS">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Malnutrition can lead to a decrease in immune functions, making it an important factor in nutritional assessments.</data>
      <data key="d10">30d5c2ac31f39f8177bec50f6b5e631b</data>
      <data key="d11">82bd6dfd442d4649920fed07fff6d35f</data>
      <data key="d12">7253</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MALNUTRICI&#211;N" target="SUPLEMENTOS CAL&#211;RICOS">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Los suplementos cal&#243;ricos son recomendados para tratar la malnutrici&#243;n en pacientes con enfermedad inflamatoria intestinal</data>
      <data key="d10">d66daca6ec5ffce0fc73bce55a3c0ff0</data>
      <data key="d11">de305b7012464dcda50f1c260952f2fc</data>
      <data key="d12">7254</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MALNUTRICI&#211;N" target="MALNUTRICI&#211;N EN C&#193;NCER">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Malnutrition is a significant concern in cancer patients, necessitating specific nutritional strategies to address it</data>
      <data key="d10">bf234f719a608fc6858d9a1749463539</data>
      <data key="d11">ce246ae5e61b4423b177d46d7602a5b9</data>
      <data key="d12">7255</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MALNUTRICI&#211;N" target="ANCIANO">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Elderly individuals are at risk of malnutrition due to various physiological and social factors.</data>
      <data key="d10">b6180d67d6fdf45ff73aa2a63a8e3f74</data>
      <data key="d11">53bfe278e02644119da6ca6c6c1e94e8</data>
      <data key="d12">7256</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MALNUTRICI&#211;N" target="PLURIPATOLOG&#205;A">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Pluripatolog&#237;a influences the nutrition of the elderly, especially chronic and psychiatric diseases.</data>
      <data key="d10">b6180d67d6fdf45ff73aa2a63a8e3f74</data>
      <data key="d11">1a0b913cd8cd4fdf81cf93875ba92548</data>
      <data key="d12">7257</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MALNUTRICI&#211;N" target="POLIFARMACIA">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Polifarmacia can alter the absorption and metabolism of nutrients, leading to malnutrition in the elderly.</data>
      <data key="d10">b6180d67d6fdf45ff73aa2a63a8e3f74</data>
      <data key="d11">f3e5f9df3e064dbfa77e8a7b04aec992</data>
      <data key="d12">7258</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MALNUTRICI&#211;N" target="POBREZA">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Poverty is a contributing factor to nutritional deficits in the elderly, leading to malnutrition.</data>
      <data key="d10">b6180d67d6fdf45ff73aa2a63a8e3f74</data>
      <data key="d11">c87e4bd3408b4e0e80e0efbc49a18164</data>
      <data key="d12">7259</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MALNUTRICI&#211;N" target="ENFERMO">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Sick individuals, particularly the elderly, are at a higher risk of malnutrition due to various health factors.</data>
      <data key="d10">b6180d67d6fdf45ff73aa2a63a8e3f74</data>
      <data key="d11">3353c0b5f4384e7a9fa511af767148ef</data>
      <data key="d12">7260</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MALNUTRICI&#211;N" target="S&#205;NDROMES GERI&#193;TRICOS">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Geriatric syndromes are often interrelated with malnutrition, affecting the health of the elderly.</data>
      <data key="d10">b6180d67d6fdf45ff73aa2a63a8e3f74</data>
      <data key="d11">72902643fa15461d8e698fd7945bb1aa</data>
      <data key="d12">7261</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MALNUTRICI&#211;N" target="DETERIORO COGNITIVO">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Cognitive decline can be exacerbated by malnutrition, affecting the elderly's overall health.</data>
      <data key="d10">b6180d67d6fdf45ff73aa2a63a8e3f74</data>
      <data key="d11">e568ff3a54844625b2f4a936693a149c</data>
      <data key="d12">7262</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MALNUTRICI&#211;N" target="HIPOTENSI&#211;N POSTURAL">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Postural hypotension can be a risk factor for elderly individuals suffering from malnutrition.</data>
      <data key="d10">b6180d67d6fdf45ff73aa2a63a8e3f74</data>
      <data key="d11">22b839409e1f431eab30e23309581c96</data>
      <data key="d12">7263</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MALNUTRICI&#211;N" target="INFECCIONES">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Infections are more likely to occur in elderly individuals who are malnourished, impacting their health outcomes.</data>
      <data key="d10">b6180d67d6fdf45ff73aa2a63a8e3f74</data>
      <data key="d11">4bc43058c2cc4dafa1f40215234f43c7</data>
      <data key="d12">7264</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MALNUTRICI&#211;N" target="PACIENCIA">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Malnutrition is a significant concern for patients in palliative care, affecting their overall health and treatment outcomes.</data>
      <data key="d10">d3f53b7b7352e8ba2fd9dc8be977648c</data>
      <data key="d11">97803d4e1a4749d2912c9f3e24b8d481</data>
      <data key="d12">7265</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MALNUTRICI&#211;N" target="EUROPEAN COUNTRIES">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The study involving elderly patients and diabetes was conducted across multiple European countries, indicating a broader context for malnutrition research</data>
      <data key="d10">1ba0aa1d1330351a62eb6319ffdd30db</data>
      <data key="d11">4312f8c6b41846f388964ab08e92258b</data>
      <data key="d12">7266</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MALNUTRICI&#211;N" target="DANIEL A. DE LUIS ROM&#193;N">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Dr. Daniel A. de Luis Rom&#225;n addresses issues of malnutrition in diabetic patients</data>
      <data key="d10">7949b821c1ca2e4adc524e7775626396</data>
      <data key="d11">476b3d0ee07545c9af8f8a4af0ed07a1</data>
      <data key="d12">7267</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MALNUTRICI&#211;N" target="DIABETES MELLITUS TIPO 2">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Malnutrition is prevalent among patients with Diabetes Mellitus Tipo 2, impacting their health outcomes</data>
      <data key="d10">7949b821c1ca2e4adc524e7775626396</data>
      <data key="d11">7dee0797ee0540fba77b1043790c45cd</data>
      <data key="d12">7268</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MALNUTRICI&#211;N" target="PANCREATIC CANCER">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Malnutrition is a significant risk factor for patients with pancreatic cancer, affecting their treatment outcomes</data>
      <data key="d10">bd3162e408d0d1ddd770ea833aad5ff3</data>
      <data key="d11">3dd08c8de85142869bc3a9c6f45c900a</data>
      <data key="d12">7269</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MALNUTRICI&#211;N" target="ANOREXIA NERVIOSA">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Malnutrition is a significant factor contributing to the development and complications of Anorexia Nerviosa</data>
      <data key="d10">1f9d0f4850dde2dbd335969b016fc359</data>
      <data key="d11">a88c58267ee248b4be4d22d2dca6ac24</data>
      <data key="d12">7270</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MALNUTRICI&#211;N" target="MALABSORCI&#211;N DE GLUCOSA-GALACTOSA">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Malnutrition is a long-term consequence of untreated glucose-galactose malabsorption</data>
      <data key="d10">e329b5d4c64709889680df357bd1cc09</data>
      <data key="d11">b940dd730bb145cbb1fc35fb293972c5</data>
      <data key="d12">7271</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MALNUTRICI&#211;N" target="INSUFICIENCIA RENAL CR&#211;NICA">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La insuficiencia renal cr&#243;nica a menudo se asocia con malnutrici&#243;n cal&#243;rico-proteica, lo que puede aumentar la mortalidad y el riesgo de hospitalizaci&#243;n.</data>
      <data key="d10">2c60ced31055ac58d76da9c1e90c8e9d</data>
      <data key="d11">b226597fec0942b4a145f49328a5f9e4</data>
      <data key="d12">7272</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MALNUTRICI&#211;N" target="S&#205;NDROME NEFR&#211;TICO">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">El s&#237;ndrome nefr&#243;tico puede llevar a la malnutrici&#243;n debido a la p&#233;rdida de prote&#237;nas en la orina, afectando el estado nutricional del paciente.</data>
      <data key="d10">2c60ced31055ac58d76da9c1e90c8e9d</data>
      <data key="d11">184a1f8070b149e1a00c3c8348cdc89a</data>
      <data key="d12">7273</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MALNUTRICI&#211;N" target="CALOR&#205;AS">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La malnutrici&#243;n puede resultar de una ingesta insuficiente de calor&#237;as, lo que es cr&#237;tico en pacientes con insuficiencia renal para mantener su estado nutricional.</data>
      <data key="d10">2c60ced31055ac58d76da9c1e90c8e9d</data>
      <data key="d11">1e21f44d8e114094be754c73aa8e3fc2</data>
      <data key="d12">7274</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MALNUTRICI&#211;N" target="MICRONUTRIENTES">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La malnutrici&#243;n puede llevar a deficiencias en micronutrientes, afectando la salud y el bienestar de los pacientes con insuficiencia renal.</data>
      <data key="d10">2c60ced31055ac58d76da9c1e90c8e9d</data>
      <data key="d11">ce5eaffef9c54ab38e7a313f50b127cf</data>
      <data key="d12">7275</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MALNUTRICI&#211;N" target="CAQUEXIA">
      <data key="d8">20.0</data>
      <data key="d9">MALNUTRICI&#211;N y CAQUEXIA est&#225;n interrelacionadas, ya que la malnutrici&#243;n puede contribuir significativamente al desarrollo de caquexia en pacientes que padecen enfermedades cr&#243;nicas. En particular, en el contexto del c&#225;ncer, la malnutrici&#243;n puede llevar a la caquexia, lo que afecta negativamente la salud general del paciente. La caquexia se caracteriza por una combinaci&#243;n de p&#233;rdida de masa muscular y grasa, lo que resalta la importancia de una adecuada nutrici&#243;n para prevenir esta condici&#243;n debilitante.</data>
      <data key="d10">61564a330848cb173088bd08e1a9a181,6c8b41c09b1ada129f0908d6e5d18185,b4b789f8b1484fea88d0b5c58dfde854</data>
      <data key="d11">15360f940b05428d96549d89470ee0bb</data>
      <data key="d12">7276</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MALNUTRICI&#211;N" target="CIRCUNFERENCIA MUSCULAR DEL BRAZO">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La disminuci&#243;n de la circunferencia muscular del brazo es un indicador de malnutrici&#243;n</data>
      <data key="d10">61564a330848cb173088bd08e1a9a181</data>
      <data key="d11">5fd4b60182fc43928cf70e7cdf61635c</data>
      <data key="d12">7277</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MALNUTRICI&#211;N" target="HEMODI&#193;LISIS">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Patients undergoing hemodi&#225;lisis are at risk of malnutrici&#243;n due to dietary restrictions and nutrient loss</data>
      <data key="d10">541c13a95526e4d68903f0901042f292</data>
      <data key="d11">2f1d52423e9e40e481d1e40d54f6487d</data>
      <data key="d12">7278</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MALNUTRICI&#211;N" target="DI&#193;LISIS PERITONEAL">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Di&#225;lisis peritoneal can also lead to malnutrici&#243;n if nutritional needs are not adequately met</data>
      <data key="d10">541c13a95526e4d68903f0901042f292</data>
      <data key="d11">8f8f257795d04d73a517e6f100e5e730</data>
      <data key="d12">7279</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MALNUTRICI&#211;N" target="GASTROPARESIA">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Gastroparesis can lead to malnutrition due to impaired digestion and absorption</data>
      <data key="d10">9da930839072b524410f2345ab1df8b1</data>
      <data key="d11">b5342101153042a38439bf9b8134ff0f</data>
      <data key="d12">7280</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MALNUTRICI&#211;N" target="ENFERMEDAD HEP&#193;TICA CR&#211;NICA">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Malnutrition is a significant concern in patients suffering from chronic liver disease, impacting their treatment and recovery.</data>
      <data key="d10">9426220ccd162a5796b1bb2cb373e29f</data>
      <data key="d11">b0052daf9c3247f9951c360364165010</data>
      <data key="d12">7281</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MALNUTRICI&#211;N" target="CIRROSIS">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La cirrosis est&#225; asociada con la malnutrici&#243;n, que es una de sus complicaciones m&#225;s frecuentes</data>
      <data key="d10">b4b789f8b1484fea88d0b5c58dfde854</data>
      <data key="d11">2d99d21af18042b1bba14a1e0032c457</data>
      <data key="d12">7282</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MALNUTRICI&#211;N" target="DEFICIT DE ZINC">
      <data key="d8">5.0</data>
      <data key="d9">El d&#233;ficit de zinc es un factor que puede contribuir a la malnutrici&#243;n en pacientes con enfermedad hep&#225;tica cr&#243;nica</data>
      <data key="d10">b4b789f8b1484fea88d0b5c58dfde854</data>
      <data key="d11">8bde9dc8ebe24921a3d75f074406bfb3</data>
      <data key="d12">7283</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MALNUTRICI&#211;N" target="CITOQUINAS">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Las citoquinas proinflamatorias pueden estar elevadas en pacientes con enfermedad hep&#225;tica cr&#243;nica, afectando la ingesta y contribuyendo a la malnutrici&#243;n</data>
      <data key="d10">b4b789f8b1484fea88d0b5c58dfde854</data>
      <data key="d11">9f7f885819184542a957609829444d0c</data>
      <data key="d12">7284</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MALNUTRICI&#211;N" target="EHC">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Patients with EHC are at a higher risk of malnutrition, which can lead to severe complications</data>
      <data key="d10">2b9c137acf3599eaa41c3514aba67a8a</data>
      <data key="d11">e736715cf70b4eb9ada4a731c43951c3</data>
      <data key="d12">7285</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MALNUTRICI&#211;N" target="ENFERMEDAD CELIACA">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La enfermedad cel&#237;aca puede resultar en malnutrici&#243;n si no se maneja adecuadamente</data>
      <data key="d10">4335489f570bb14684484e76cd6c196f</data>
      <data key="d11">7918606b3f194f5b991daf8f4bc25f94</data>
      <data key="d12">7286</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MALNUTRICI&#211;N" target="HIPOMAGNESEMIA">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La malnutrici&#243;n puede causar hipomagnesemia al limitar la ingesta de nutrientes esenciales.</data>
      <data key="d10">ed9dfe1b1e334597565187840983df05</data>
      <data key="d11">4dfa5d31005d4aa0b680dbf9e20880c8</data>
      <data key="d12">7287</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MALNUTRICI&#211;N" target="FIEBRE">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La fiebre puede aumentar los requerimientos nutricionales, contribuyendo a la malnutrici&#243;n si no se satisfacen</data>
      <data key="d10">417548e99612a123d61f9fd10807ce34</data>
      <data key="d11">c700416bad60458992b40666f04988d6</data>
      <data key="d12">7288</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MALNUTRICI&#211;N" target="CRECIMIENTO">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">El crecimiento en ni&#241;os y adolescentes puede verse afectado por la malnutrici&#243;n si no se proporciona suficiente nutrici&#243;n</data>
      <data key="d10">417548e99612a123d61f9fd10807ce34</data>
      <data key="d11">ed6b9f577cd64e37be47d188ffe9f441</data>
      <data key="d12">7289</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MALNUTRICI&#211;N" target="MALABSORCI&#211;N">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La malabsorci&#243;n puede causar malnutrici&#243;n al impedir que el cuerpo absorba los nutrientes necesarios</data>
      <data key="d10">417548e99612a123d61f9fd10807ce34</data>
      <data key="d11">f483c4e756c14f40bc5a4c4ccbb16f3a</data>
      <data key="d12">7290</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MALNUTRICI&#211;N" target="F&#205;STULAS">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Las f&#237;stulas pueden causar p&#233;rdidas de nutrientes, contribuyendo a la malnutrici&#243;n</data>
      <data key="d10">417548e99612a123d61f9fd10807ce34</data>
      <data key="d11">4c6891bd862945a1bdbac25dada20a75</data>
      <data key="d12">7291</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MALNUTRICI&#211;N" target="OSTOM&#205;AS">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Las ostom&#237;as pueden afectar la absorci&#243;n de nutrientes y contribuir a la malnutrici&#243;n</data>
      <data key="d10">417548e99612a123d61f9fd10807ce34</data>
      <data key="d11">c4988dadd1144877800e013117fe71ff</data>
      <data key="d12">7292</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MALNUTRICI&#211;N" target="EJERCICIO F&#205;SICO">
      <data key="d8">5.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Malnutrition in the elderly necessitates the consideration of physical exercise to improve overall health and muscle function</data>
      <data key="d10">a25b0f84bc321cad942a2e33f681a5e4</data>
      <data key="d11">d98464f6fc0b478c8d9a9e1551e866b0</data>
      <data key="d12">7293</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MALNUTRICI&#211;N" target="TUMORES DE CABEZA Y CUELLO">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Head and neck tumors can result in malnutrition due to challenges in food intake</data>
      <data key="d10">58af2bdd20eeb5647ecc8088732833d8</data>
      <data key="d11">2476a2748d304513b34579e3f2070e3c</data>
      <data key="d12">7294</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MALNUTRICI&#211;N" target="C&#193;NCER G&#193;STRICO">
      <data key="d8">16.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Gastric cancer patients are at high risk of malnutrition, which is prevalent among this group and significantly impacts their health and recovery. As a result, nutritional interventions are necessary to address the malnutrition experienced by individuals diagnosed with gastric cancer.</data>
      <data key="d10">5e934738b2a8cb03468f4ebf4eec0cd2,f75d1340b39e345875bf878dba07ab8c</data>
      <data key="d11">b4de014fa9044ca1b095cfbe366c8fc6</data>
      <data key="d12">7295</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MALNUTRICI&#211;N" target="C&#193;NCER DE ES&#211;FAGO">
      <data key="d8">16.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Esophageal cancer patients are at high risk of malnutrition, which necessitates nutritional interventions to address this critical issue. Weight loss and malnutrition are significant symptoms observed in individuals diagnosed with esophageal cancer, highlighting the importance of monitoring and managing nutritional status in this patient population.</data>
      <data key="d10">5e934738b2a8cb03468f4ebf4eec0cd2,7c0d1f274b31d130e4feb8e46fbeb764</data>
      <data key="d11">1424de4ca1a94de78358ecee1a8bd046</data>
      <data key="d12">7296</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MALNUTRICI&#211;N" target="C&#193;NCER DE P&#193;NCREAS">
      <data key="d8">24.0</data>
      <data key="d9">MALNUTRICI&#211;N and C&#193;NCER DE P&#193;NCREAS are closely interconnected, as pancreatic cancer can significantly lead to malnutrition in patients. This condition adversely affects their overall health and recovery process. It is a common issue among individuals diagnosed with pancreatic cancer, impacting their general well-being and complicating treatment efforts. Due to the high risk of malnutrition in these patients, nutritional interventions are often necessary to support their health and improve treatment outcomes.</data>
      <data key="d10">2754a719b063eed550046e5b405be3d5,5e934738b2a8cb03468f4ebf4eec0cd2,7c0d1f274b31d130e4feb8e46fbeb764</data>
      <data key="d11">34b192cdf6c541a2b8713e7bb2bc52df</data>
      <data key="d12">7297</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MALNUTRICI&#211;N" target="NEOPLASIAS GASTROINTESTINALES">
      <data key="d8">2.0</data>
      <data key="d9">MALNUTRICI&#211;N and NEOPLASIAS GASTROINTESTINALES are closely interconnected, as gastrointestinal neoplasms are a significant cause of cancer-related malnutrition. These neoplasms can lead to malnutrition, which adversely affects patient survival and quality of life. The relationship between these two entities highlights the critical impact that gastrointestinal cancers have on nutritional status, emphasizing the need for comprehensive care that addresses both cancer treatment and nutritional support.</data>
      <data key="d10">5e934738b2a8cb03468f4ebf4eec0cd2,639ebafae8a95bb03a09e111172b9a4e</data>
      <data key="d11">f3e8df93cdca4d7897f88cf53a8a66e9</data>
      <data key="d12">7298</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MALNUTRICI&#211;N" target="GASTRECTOM&#205;A">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Malnutrition is a significant concern for patients undergoing gastrectomy, affecting their recovery and outcomes</data>
      <data key="d10">f75d1340b39e345875bf878dba07ab8c</data>
      <data key="d11">172168695e974c46967d184e5c686cac</data>
      <data key="d12">7299</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MALNUTRICI&#211;N" target="COMPLICACIONES">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La malnutrici&#243;n puede aumentar la incidencia de complicaciones en pacientes que se someten a cirug&#237;a.</data>
      <data key="d10">a7baff5fb024c516ea6ae8c236dc945d</data>
      <data key="d11">ed7eb34c90a14d0486d5538c4123a289</data>
      <data key="d12">7300</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MALNUTRICI&#211;N" target="ESTANCIA HOSPITALARIA">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La malnutrici&#243;n puede llevar a una mayor estancia hospitalaria en pacientes con c&#225;ncer.</data>
      <data key="d10">a7baff5fb024c516ea6ae8c236dc945d</data>
      <data key="d11">799b54780cc14331b2ed4772ca8b9566</data>
      <data key="d12">7301</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MALNUTRICI&#211;N" target="DUODENOPANCREATECTOM&#205;A CEF&#193;LICA">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La duodenopancreatectom&#237;a cef&#225;lica puede llevar a complicaciones nutricionales, incluyendo malnutrici&#243;n</data>
      <data key="d10">7c0d1f274b31d130e4feb8e46fbeb764</data>
      <data key="d11">f2b36ea02ba9453fa071c499695626d5</data>
      <data key="d12">7302</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MALNUTRICI&#211;N" target="CRIBADO MUST">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">El cribado MUST se utiliza para evaluar la malnutrici&#243;n y su relaci&#243;n con la morbilidad postoperatoria</data>
      <data key="d10">2754a719b063eed550046e5b405be3d5</data>
      <data key="d11">42fdb63c74184f849aaf7dd25fbbaa73</data>
      <data key="d12">7303</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MALNUTRICI&#211;N" target="&#205;NDICE DE RIESGO NUTRICIONAL">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">El &#205;ndice de Riesgo Nutricional se utiliza para evaluar la malnutrici&#243;n en pacientes y su impacto en la morbilidad</data>
      <data key="d10">2754a719b063eed550046e5b405be3d5</data>
      <data key="d11">888d01843c7a4a53a0283447109089ea</data>
      <data key="d12">7304</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MALNUTRICI&#211;N" target="C&#193;NCER GASTROINTESTINAL">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Cancer patients often experience malnutrition, which complicates their treatment and recovery</data>
      <data key="d10">639ebafae8a95bb03a09e111172b9a4e</data>
      <data key="d11">dda862bb368942b884a23de1bd92fc4a</data>
      <data key="d12">7305</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MALNUTRICI&#211;N" target="QUIMIO Y/O RADIOTERAPIA">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Chemotherapy and/or radiotherapy can lead to malnutrition in patients with gastrointestinal cancers</data>
      <data key="d10">639ebafae8a95bb03a09e111172b9a4e</data>
      <data key="d11">ce2d75623ff04c75b4a73347f910b038</data>
      <data key="d12">7306</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MALNUTRICI&#211;N" target="INMUNOTERAPIA">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La inmunoterapia puede causar efectos que contribuyen a la malnutrici&#243;n en pacientes con c&#225;ncer.</data>
      <data key="d10">9c3716c3860855ce045a1e5d9d30b9d1</data>
      <data key="d11">94ecbb00fd7e49f7a32a4a45de3cddc1</data>
      <data key="d12">7307</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MALNUTRICI&#211;N" target="PACIENTE NEOPL&#193;SICO">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">El paciente neopl&#225;sico puede sufrir de malnutrici&#243;n debido a la enfermedad y sus tratamientos.</data>
      <data key="d10">9c3716c3860855ce045a1e5d9d30b9d1</data>
      <data key="d11">b4fd0e9f032b49f59a404f1bdb89f3c3</data>
      <data key="d12">7308</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MALNUTRICI&#211;N" target="MALNUTRICI&#211;N EN PACIENTES CON C&#193;NCER">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La malnutrici&#243;n es un problema com&#250;n en pacientes con c&#225;ncer, afectando su salud y tratamiento.</data>
      <data key="d10">9c3716c3860855ce045a1e5d9d30b9d1</data>
      <data key="d11">1c98d3f5095c4c458aa02c09b0f54225</data>
      <data key="d12">7309</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MALNUTRICI&#211;N" target="INTERVENCI&#211;N NUTRICIONAL">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La intervenci&#243;n nutricional se implementa para tratar y prevenir la malnutrici&#243;n en pacientes oncol&#243;gicos</data>
      <data key="d10">a96b8f4fe52b5b963b28242c3352aa7c</data>
      <data key="d11">cbb420f057e9440bbb75e1a02ee4509e</data>
      <data key="d12">7310</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MALNUTRICI&#211;N" target="PACIENTE ONCOL&#211;GICO">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Cancer patients are at risk of malnutrition due to their condition and treatment.</data>
      <data key="d10">395385fad73fd5b7ed9eda114b482624</data>
      <data key="d11">a9032192a474462cae5b7ac5c0fffa7e</data>
      <data key="d12">7311</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MALNUTRICI&#211;N" target="ANEMIA CARENCIAL">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Malnutrition often leads to deficiency anemia due to inadequate nutrient intake</data>
      <data key="d10">a6ed8551aad722adcaf8fced4ac8685b</data>
      <data key="d11">85de7715985148c8a4bb2b497d138263</data>
      <data key="d12">7312</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MALNUTRICI&#211;N" target="DESNUTRICI&#211;N AGUDA MODERADA">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Moderate acute malnutrition is a direct consequence of malnutrition</data>
      <data key="d10">a6ed8551aad722adcaf8fced4ac8685b</data>
      <data key="d11">890ba38e68cf4896914808c614fb4c8f</data>
      <data key="d12">7313</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MALNUTRICI&#211;N" target="DESNUTRICI&#211;N AGUDA GRAVE">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Severe acute malnutrition is a critical condition resulting from prolonged malnutrition</data>
      <data key="d10">a6ed8551aad722adcaf8fced4ac8685b</data>
      <data key="d11">48c8794d8f5649f3874f488efa31228a</data>
      <data key="d12">7314</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MALNUTRICI&#211;N" target="DESNUTRICI&#211;N CR&#211;NICA MODERADA">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Moderate chronic malnutrition is a long-term effect of inadequate nutrition</data>
      <data key="d10">a6ed8551aad722adcaf8fced4ac8685b</data>
      <data key="d11">a9c2637db0d4412084cfa80d8b44e09a</data>
      <data key="d12">7315</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MALNUTRICI&#211;N" target="DESNUTRICI&#211;N CR&#211;NICA GRAVE">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Severe chronic malnutrition indicates a severe lack of nutritional intake over time</data>
      <data key="d10">a6ed8551aad722adcaf8fced4ac8685b</data>
      <data key="d11">b2ac19e7db8841f5bdd73e8ddd57b681</data>
      <data key="d12">7316</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MALNUTRICI&#211;N" target="NED">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">NED aims to address malnutrici&#243;n by providing nutritional support to affected patients</data>
      <data key="d10">0d083c309fb6f4d0d16c0e2b23ea5c8b</data>
      <data key="d11">05912b0ae41f458a8612b7500d8c58d5</data>
      <data key="d12">7317</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MALNUTRICI&#211;N" target="ESTUDIO ESPA&#209;OL DE 2007">
      <data key="d8">5.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The study from 2007 provides insights into the costs and implications of malnutrici&#243;n in elderly patients</data>
      <data key="d10">0d083c309fb6f4d0d16c0e2b23ea5c8b</data>
      <data key="d11">1ad4165c3ad94106a3cf3eda9f599b70</data>
      <data key="d12">7318</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&#205;NDICE DE MASA CORPORAL (IMC)" target="SOCIEDAD ESPA&#209;OLA PARA EL ESTUDIO DE LA OBESIDAD">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The Sociedad Espa&#241;ola para el Estudio de la Obesidad provides criteria for classifying obesity based on the IMC.</data>
      <data key="d10">30d5c2ac31f39f8177bec50f6b5e631b</data>
      <data key="d11">83ff340e6ff348d490a7d3efe74ab84d</data>
      <data key="d12">7319</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&#205;NDICE DE MASA CORPORAL (IMC)" target="TABLAS DE PERCENTILES">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The IMC is classified using percentile tables that provide benchmarks for different age groups and weight categories.</data>
      <data key="d10">30d5c2ac31f39f8177bec50f6b5e631b</data>
      <data key="d11">876a6a95237147059738914044936e5e</data>
      <data key="d12">7320</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="S&#205;NTOMAS GASTROINTESTINALES" target="ENFERMEDAD CELIACA">
      <data key="d8">10.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Celiac disease, known as "ENFERMEDAD CELIACA," is characterized by a range of gastrointestinal symptoms, which are a hallmark of the condition. These symptoms are frequently observed in patients and often play a crucial role in leading to the diagnosis of celiac disease. In summary, "S&#205;NTOMAS GASTROINTESTINALES" are common manifestations in individuals suffering from celiac disease, highlighting the importance of recognizing these symptoms for proper identification and management of the disease.</data>
      <data key="d10">281c46dd2bcde6e6fbb1505ed667b0e9,9d5e76e37794965024f4b16e7e163d30</data>
      <data key="d11">aade9597cdd942cc863e4900cb1f6a03</data>
      <data key="d12">7321</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="S&#205;NTOMAS GASTROINTESTINALES" target="INTOLERANCIAS ALIMENTARIAS">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Las intolerancias alimentarias pueden causar s&#237;ntomas gastrointestinales, que son una manifestaci&#243;n com&#250;n de estas condiciones.</data>
      <data key="d10">9d1d9a50a4a29ae7660c32b749e46dbd</data>
      <data key="d11">419fd7e3235f4f1eb059dc2fe8399db0</data>
      <data key="d12">7322</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ALIMENTACI&#211;N RESPECTO HACE 1 MES" target="DIFICULTADES PARA ALIMENTARSE">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Las dificultades para alimentarse pueden influir en los cambios en la alimentaci&#243;n del paciente en el &#250;ltimo mes</data>
      <data key="d10">3f379d10d8c57694a1c646c072f7ed84</data>
      <data key="d11">6f5d5d589c284ff79bcb4ff9d0ecb95b</data>
      <data key="d12">7323</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
