      <data key="d9">The entities "MUJERES" and "NI&#209;OS/AS" are interconnected, as children (Ni&#241;os/as) encompass female children (Mujeres) across various age groups. This relationship highlights that within the broader category of children, female children are specifically included and categorized under the age group.</data>
