    <edge source="MUJERES" target="EMBARAZO">
      <data key="d8">16.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The entities "MUJERES" (women) and "EMBARAZO" (pregnancy) are closely interconnected within demographic statistics. The assessment specifically includes women who are pregnant, highlighting a direct relationship between the group of women and the event of pregnancy. Furthermore, it is noted that women can experience pregnancy at specific age groups, indicating that age plays a significant role in the context of pregnancy among females.</data>
