      <data key="d9">FIBER plays a crucial role in the formulation of NUTRITIONAL PRODUCTS, as its selection significantly impacts the viscosity and overall functionality of these products. Additionally, the inclusion of fiber in nutritional products is essential for promoting digestive health, highlighting its importance in maintaining a balanced diet.</data>
