    <edge source="GASTO ENERG&#201;TICO TOTAL" target="REQUERIMIENTOS ENERG&#201;TICOS">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Energy requirements are directly related to total energy expenditure, as they determine the energy intake needed to maintain balance</data>
      <data key="d10">c2a8dd9d28d1992a73de2834131b69c9</data>
      <data key="d11">7b776f6b801b4a6d9296dead6ff24e91</data>
      <data key="d12">7630</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="GASTO ENERG&#201;TICO TOTAL" target="GASTO ENERG&#201;TICO BASAL">
      <data key="d8">17.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The entities "GASTO ENERG&#201;TICO TOTAL" and "GASTO ENERG&#201;TICO BASAL" are closely related concepts in the field of energy expenditure. "GASTO ENERG&#201;TICO BASAL" refers to the basal energy expenditure, which is a crucial component of total energy expenditure. It significantly contributes to an individual's daily energy needs. On the other hand, "GASTO ENERG&#201;TICO TOTAL" encompasses the overall energy expenditure, which includes not only the basal energy expenditure but also other factors such as physical activity and thermogenesis. Thus, the total energy expenditure is the sum of basal energy expenditure and additional energy used during various activities and metabolic processes.</data>
      <data key="d10">79dc467f42c611bc9f285c95a6c6ff62,c2a8dd9d28d1992a73de2834131b69c9</data>
      <data key="d11">9d89137753ea4554a39a05289af3d9b2</data>
      <data key="d12">7631</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="GASTO ENERG&#201;TICO TOTAL" target="EFECTO TERMOG&#201;NICO DE LOS ALIMENTOS">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The thermic effect of food contributes to total energy expenditure by increasing metabolic rate after meals</data>
      <data key="d10">c2a8dd9d28d1992a73de2834131b69c9</data>
      <data key="d11">e9715ab9c22a4128a85d5ef0ab4f2e4f</data>
      <data key="d12">7632</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="GASTO ENERG&#201;TICO TOTAL" target="PACIENTE ONCOL&#211;GICO">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
