      <data key="d12">7648</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HIDRATOS DE CARBONO" target="DEXTROSA-EQUIVALENTE">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Dextrose equivalent is a measure that helps determine the carbohydrate composition in formulas</data>
      <data key="d10">7796f48230d374753b744d8e5fb1e8ae</data>
      <data key="d11">c3ba5483e6e84dd9ba7091c82fd6941a</data>
      <data key="d12">7649</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HIDRATOS DE CARBONO" target="CALORIC COMPONENTS">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Hidratos de carbono are a type of caloric component that contributes to the overall energy intake</data>
      <data key="d10">622b4827c8894dba02debfade4a9f817</data>
      <data key="d11">c08a49f40c454fea87e9ec4f8f527c59</data>
      <data key="d12">7650</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HIDRATOS DE CARBONO" target="PRETERM INFANTS">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Carbohydrates are a crucial part of the nutritional requirements for preterm infants</data>
      <data key="d10">d0f40e5a802daab3992f9e1746a82467</data>
      <data key="d11">3e0f2ace68384771aae3c3b062bce3ab</data>
      <data key="d12">7651</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HIDRATOS DE CARBONO" target="DIETA IDEAL PARA LOS MAYORES">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The Ideal Diet for Seniors emphasizes the importance of balancing carbohydrates, particularly complex carbohydrates, for better health outcomes in older adults.</data>
      <data key="d10">c7af1c950a6caab8be5d180a2889a25a</data>
      <data key="d11">d0f66bde84094c6ab0669b1e7b308597</data>
      <data key="d12">7652</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HIDRATOS DE CARBONO" target="FIBRA">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Carbohydrates, especially complex ones, are linked to fiber intake, which is crucial for digestive health and overall well-being.</data>
      <data key="d10">c7af1c950a6caab8be5d180a2889a25a</data>
      <data key="d11">bab0192d139f458f9c1cf25268b9090d</data>
      <data key="d12">7653</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HIDRATOS DE CARBONO" target="ACEITES VEGETALES">
      <data key="d8">4.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Vegetable oils are often discussed in the context of balanced diets that include carbohydrates, highlighting their role in overall nutrition.</data>
      <data key="d10">c7af1c950a6caab8be5d180a2889a25a</data>
      <data key="d11">762802532a6a4588819c0a612a75315e</data>
      <data key="d12">7654</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HIDRATOS DE CARBONO" target="S&#205;NDROME DE DUMPING">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Los hidratos de carbono de r&#225;pida absorci&#243;n pueden desencadenar s&#237;ntomas del s&#237;ndrome de dumping.</data>
      <data key="d10">65e3dfcb7a0c5a2a09a98342c597c020</data>
      <data key="d11">0f1ecf79126640fba79c351c05bb3493</data>
      <data key="d12">7655</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HIDRATOS DE CARBONO" target="HIPERTRIGLICERIDEMIA">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Hidratos de carbono with a high glycemic index should be restricted in cases of hipertrigliceridemia</data>
      <data key="d10">c78125c02ea4d5afdf5cb5ac4baeeb27</data>
      <data key="d11">c1667d6b791e48fa87bab8d705c8013e</data>
      <data key="d12">7656</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HIDRATOS DE CARBONO" target="DIABETES TIPO 2">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La presencia de hidratos de carbono de absorci&#243;n r&#225;pida en bebidas azucaradas se ha relacionado con un mayor riesgo de diabetes tipo 2.</data>
      <data key="d10">dcb29ef57f2b65cd420e728a3e29102d</data>
      <data key="d11">cb4f326a2eb24455bb0452be214e775e</data>
      <data key="d12">7657</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HIDRATOS DE CARBONO" target="WHO">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The WHO provides recommendations on the necessary intake of carbohydrates to prevent health issues</data>
      <data key="d10">1ad5b4d7f49ca2d3d44adc99227f07d8</data>
      <data key="d11">0c5dc4c43ea64f5fb60c14e819a74b25</data>
      <data key="d12">7658</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HIDRATOS DE CARBONO" target="TABLA 1">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Hidratos de carbono are included in the mandatory nutritional information as per Tabla 1.</data>
      <data key="d10">b68bac9cb298a49d19de8db2a2b640a1</data>
      <data key="d11">7444b42c6cb2471484a90482663fd148</data>
      <data key="d12">7659</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HIDRATOS DE CARBONO" target="TABLA 5">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Carbohydrates are included in Table 5 as part of the nutritional information</data>
      <data key="d10">3dbf07634cee8d4d443f59ed50f98b54</data>
      <data key="d11">727eeeef53844367b9dbfd0f2a213e8d</data>
      <data key="d12">7660</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HIDRATOS DE CARBONO" target="DIETOTERAPIA">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Hidratos de carbono are a key component managed in dietoterapia for patients, especially those with diabetes</data>
      <data key="d10">9df63e54761edd6ad6c4ad6fb83ae123</data>
      <data key="d11">4e4c9ddee27944ebb267b53c32f0c58d</data>
      <data key="d12">7661</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HIDRATOS DE CARBONO" target="DIETAS BAJAS EN HIDRATOS DE CARBONO">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Low-carbohydrate diets specifically reduce the intake of carbohydrates to achieve certain health benefits</data>
      <data key="d10">880102f905a34cd6b5e2638ce7bad162</data>
      <data key="d11">3be7dee81788463198f13097e4f2d471</data>
      <data key="d12">7662</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HIDRATOS DE CARBONO" target="INSULINA">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Hidratos de Carbono, or carbohydrates, play a crucial role in the regulation of insulin, a hormone essential for managing glucose levels in the body. The intake of carbohydrates stimulates the release of insulin, which is particularly important for surgical patients who need to maintain stable glucose levels during and after procedures. Additionally, the amount of Hidratos de Carbono consumed directly influences the dosage of Insulina required for effective blood glucose control. Therefore, understanding the relationship between carbohydrate intake and insulin management is vital for ensuring optimal health outcomes, especially in clinical settings.</data>
      <data key="d10">abf638322cfb1c522bfbee1852e28a19,d42b833940d845abc98aa8e8ea05d6ae</data>
      <data key="d11">ce817ff645ea4530a5d711055b40efee</data>
      <data key="d12">7663</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HIDRATOS DE CARBONO" target="DIABETES MELLITUS TYPE 1">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Carbohydrate intake must be carefully managed for individuals with Diabetes Mellitus Type 1 to maintain stable blood glucose levels during exercise.</data>
      <data key="d10">043ed163c427b880fe39884076cae7ea</data>
      <data key="d11">6144099a493d4c439245ab021bfe83e4</data>
      <data key="d12">7664</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HIDRATOS DE CARBONO" target="DIABETES MELLITUS TYPE 2">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Carbohydrate management is important for individuals with Diabetes Mellitus Type 2 to control blood sugar levels during physical activity.</data>
      <data key="d10">043ed163c427b880fe39884076cae7ea</data>
      <data key="d11">af62d9b04b0645dd8e0fb3cc0b65e425</data>
      <data key="d12">7665</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HIDRATOS DE CARBONO" target="EJERCICIO F&#205;SICO">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Hidratos de carbono, or carbohydrates, are essential nutrients that play a crucial role in providing energy during physical exercise, particularly in high-intensity activities. They are necessary for maintaining energy levels during ejercicio f&#237;sico, especially for individuals with diabetes, who may require careful management of their carbohydrate intake to support their physical activity while maintaining stable blood sugar levels.</data>
      <data key="d10">21339c051dc2f47471026673b3ac6436,39da0855b83941d97766254aa36ed2fd</data>
      <data key="d11">9c660ba51f134fac8332cca515456838</data>
      <data key="d12">7666</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HIDRATOS DE CARBONO" target="F&#211;RMULAS RICAS EN GRASA">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The modification of carbohydrates in fat-rich formulas is aimed at improving metabolic control in diabetic patients</data>
      <data key="d10">8d1eb00b23450a2f2cb1243ea32aa36f</data>
      <data key="d11">d15fb605d2cb49c792f6d9cdee19f08a</data>
      <data key="d12">7667</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HIDRATOS DE CARBONO" target="MICROFLORA COL&#211;NICA">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Microflora col&#243;nica ferments undigested carbohydrates, leading to the production of gases and short-chain fatty acids</data>
      <data key="d10">8c87213151750706e4e87956bfc9cb88</data>
      <data key="d11">9b346f9413894e18ae9a8ce027d9497d</data>
      <data key="d12">7668</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HIDRATOS DE CARBONO" target="TEST DEL ALIENTO">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Test del aliento is used to diagnose malabsorption of carbohydrates by measuring hydrogen and methane levels</data>
      <data key="d10">8c87213151750706e4e87956bfc9cb88</data>
      <data key="d11">266834faef6c4bf29e4c8ac1e09608a8</data>
      <data key="d12">7669</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HIDRATOS DE CARBONO" target="NUTRICIONAL RECOMMENDATIONS">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Carbohydrates are included in dietary recommendations for balanced nutrition.</data>
      <data key="d10">f41688eecb31d8e55fc70e993e99c3e9</data>
      <data key="d11">4c9f0b154987404e84e7f5f8e6d2ae16</data>
      <data key="d12">7670</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HIDRATOS DE CARBONO" target="LITIASIS RENAL">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Carbohydrates in sports drinks do not affect urinary calcium excretion, which is relevant to kidney stone formation.</data>
      <data key="d10">451bbcaee8b1a025277b84488ea7db61</data>
      <data key="d11">baa8e0b7c3f143b0a3c3124c25969b7f</data>
      <data key="d12">7671</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HIDRATOS DE CARBONO" target="CIRUG&#205;A">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Carbohydrates are recommended to be consumed before surgery to mitigate insulin resistance and improve recovery</data>
      <data key="d10">d42b833940d845abc98aa8e8ea05d6ae</data>
      <data key="d11">f3353ba960014ee4b29b81c6f8c1e04e</data>
      <data key="d12">7672</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HIDRATOS DE CARBONO" target="MALTODEXTRINAS">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Maltodextrinas are a form of HIDRATOS DE CARBONO used in commercial preparations</data>
      <data key="d10">a089d87928ddde83e1945eece488d3f5</data>
      <data key="d11">8172f7812a884654b9e59d789c5f3ebb</data>
      <data key="d12">7673</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HIDRATOS DE CARBONO" target="DEPORTISTAS">
      <data key="d8">17.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Hidratos de carbono, commonly known as carbohydrates, play a crucial role for deportistas, or athletes, as they are essential for replenishing glycogen stores and enhancing overall performance. Athletes require the consumption of carbohydrates to improve their performance and maintain adequate glycogen levels, which are vital for sustaining energy during physical activities.</data>
      <data key="d10">3e8ab018917854d76a0137102e0392bd,490f5e3c6dbf3754eee50c52154da09a</data>
      <data key="d11">442ae8dc738c4cc5bb34b176185860f5</data>
      <data key="d12">7674</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HIDRATOS DE CARBONO" target="DIETA DEL DEPORTISTA">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La dieta del deportista debe incluir una alta proporci&#243;n de hidratos de carbono para asegurar un rendimiento &#243;ptimo</data>
      <data key="d10">490f5e3c6dbf3754eee50c52154da09a</data>
      <data key="d11">e16eeb52c218437ea3dff1fa5dea302e</data>
      <data key="d12">7675</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HIDRATOS DE CARBONO" target="DIETAS EN SITUACIONES ESPECIALES">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The section on special situations emphasizes the importance of carbohydrate intake for athletes</data>
      <data key="d10">470e6bb2e8b8ca543addb0f07464f38c</data>
      <data key="d11">12f8f68a7bcb4aa39dbbed4f6b875129</data>
      <data key="d12">7676</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HIDRATOS DE CARBONO" target="DEPORTISTA">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Athletes require a sufficient intake of carbohydrates to maintain optimal glycogen storage for energy during exercise.</data>
      <data key="d10">39da0855b83941d97766254aa36ed2fd</data>
      <data key="d11">c3c7f7ce8f5645119ee62a2c196afe3c</data>
      <data key="d12">7677</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HIDRATOS DE CARBONO" target="BEBIDAS DEPORTIVAS">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Carbohydrates are a fundamental component of sports drinks, providing energy and aiding in hydration.</data>
      <data key="d10">cfe1de28f01fa6428be1486b6af8f0a2</data>
      <data key="d11">f19f147f7e774ea08130d0952a24f4cc</data>
      <data key="d12">7678</data>
