    <edge source="HIDRATOS DE CARBONO" target="NUTRICI&#211;N PEDI&#193;TRICA">
      <data key="d8">15.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Hidratos de carbono, or carbohydrates, are a crucial component of pediatric nutrition, providing necessary energy for children's growth and development. NUTRICI&#211;N PEDI&#193;TRICA encompasses guidelines for the intake of hidratos de carbono, ensuring that children receive adequate energy levels to support their health and well-being. These guidelines emphasize the importance of incorporating appropriate amounts of carbohydrates into children's diets to meet their nutritional needs.</data>
      <data key="d10">507eeea555c496a467930836fc4c1a39,df73c75d84a055e0a67bc7f14d35e9d5</data>
      <data key="d11">dac0a73280c54e558f166aecb1fc584b</data>
      <data key="d12">7680</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
