    <edge source="CAQUEXIA" target="INSUFICIENCIA RENAL CR&#211;NICA">
      <data key="d8">13.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Chronic kidney disease (insuficiencia renal cr&#243;nica) can lead to the development of cachexia (caquexia), a condition characterized by significant weight loss and muscle wasting. This relationship is primarily attributed to the inflammation associated with chronic kidney disease, which contributes to the loss of muscle mass. As a result, careful nutritional management is essential for individuals suffering from chronic kidney disease to mitigate the risk of cachexia and support overall health.</data>
      <data key="d10">00467cf9f31ccb0046bfd36ff48c4448,61564a330848cb173088bd08e1a9a181</data>
      <data key="d11">f46d215bc0df4ab09b82c6ceedfa1c28</data>
      <data key="d12">7705</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="CAQUEXIA" target="PACIENCIA">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Cachexia is a syndrome that significantly affects patients in palliative care, leading to muscle loss and decreased quality of life.</data>
      <data key="d10">d3f53b7b7352e8ba2fd9dc8be977648c</data>
      <data key="d11">b2dcb897e82347ffa8e5346224e196e8</data>
      <data key="d12">7706</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="CAQUEXIA" target="FRAGILIDAD">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La fragilidad est&#225; relacionada con el concepto de caquexia, que implica p&#233;rdida de m&#250;sculo y grasa asociada a enfermedades</data>
      <data key="d10">00a918807f0c6568ea1d9f0c41f1ad49</data>
      <data key="d11">0f0b41e2db73471bbf9be637bf3827e5</data>
      <data key="d12">7707</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="CAQUEXIA" target="DIETA IDEAL PARA LOS MAYORES">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The ideal diet for older adults should address the risk of cachexia by ensuring sufficient caloric and protein intake.</data>
      <data key="d10">368804d3e1f8a58c4e6c3a8210f08a35</data>
      <data key="d11">7cab8d06bd814d739001e12de7d2c213</data>
      <data key="d12">7708</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="CAQUEXIA" target="MNGIE">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Cachexia is a consequence of the severe digestive symptoms experienced by MNGIE patients</data>
      <data key="d10">cb3d17a78ad2d9342ebe0fd2aac8e9d1</data>
      <data key="d11">05f371ec69694dd0aefcefbbf049d3ae</data>
      <data key="d12">7709</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="CAQUEXIA" target="ADENOCARCINOMA DE P&#193;NCREAS DUCTAL">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Adenocarcinoma de p&#225;ncreas ductal is frequently associated with cachexia, affecting the patient's survival and quality of life</data>
      <data key="d10">da58ef987e74d508eb95395230f21cdc</data>
      <data key="d11">d1784ad8b4624975b41eb5f8f1e54f98</data>
      <data key="d12">7710</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="CAQUEXIA" target="NE NORMOCAL&#211;RICA Y NORMOPROTEICA">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Cachexia led to the need for normocaloric and normoproteic nutritional support to help the patient maintain weight</data>
      <data key="d10">da58ef987e74d508eb95395230f21cdc</data>
      <data key="d11">7492244716df4793b51eb71a87ba3d55</data>
      <data key="d12">7711</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="CAQUEXIA" target="ACETATO DE MEDROXIPROGESTERONA">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Medroxyprogesterone acetate was used to combat the effects of cachexia by improving appetite and reducing weight loss</data>
      <data key="d10">da58ef987e74d508eb95395230f21cdc</data>
      <data key="d11">3ddca9743f3845d19ad3b7b62b389738</data>
      <data key="d12">7712</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="CAQUEXIA" target="VITAMINA D">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Vitamin D supplementation is recommended to help maintain quality of life in patients suffering from cachexia</data>
      <data key="d10">da58ef987e74d508eb95395230f21cdc</data>
      <data key="d11">a71f4a5a18b44fb88fe984c79b08a2e4</data>
      <data key="d12">7713</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="CAQUEXIA" target="ADENOCARCINOMA DE P&#193;NCREAS">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La caquexia es una complicaci&#243;n com&#250;n en pacientes con adenocarcinoma de p&#225;ncreas</data>
      <data key="d10">5f4610a3d5efde69d7f34ec14c4bed0b</data>
      <data key="d11">37cb1b607e874d54b164d518b8282f47</data>
      <data key="d12">7714</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="CAQUEXIA" target="CITOQUINAS PROINFLAMATORIAS">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Las citoquinas proinflamatorias est&#225;n elevadas en pacientes con caquexia, contribuyendo a la p&#233;rdida de peso y masa muscular</data>
      <data key="d10">61564a330848cb173088bd08e1a9a181</data>
      <data key="d11">dae5d9ebb2e048cab9218adbb1b83ff9</data>
      <data key="d12">7715</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="CAQUEXIA" target="CIRROSIS">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La cirrosis puede resultar en caquexia, que es un estado de malnutrici&#243;n severa</data>
      <data key="d10">b4b789f8b1484fea88d0b5c58dfde854</data>
      <data key="d11">a8fe6b00498c4b579822527e7e8b1b83</data>
      <data key="d12">7716</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="CAQUEXIA" target="EPOC">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">EPOC is often associated with cachexia, which is a common complication in patients with chronic lung diseases</data>
      <data key="d10">ddd48beea3c882bf1a651cb25283ba91</data>
      <data key="d11">47457515d09e4dada14d10f7f3c5421a</data>
      <data key="d12">7717</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="CAQUEXIA" target="TERAPIA NEOADYUVANTE">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La terapia neoadyuvante puede contribuir a la caquexia en pacientes con c&#225;ncer de es&#243;fago debido a la p&#233;rdida de peso y el estado nutricional deteriorado</data>
      <data key="d10">f0d279ccc92a98dc953edafb1080630b</data>
      <data key="d11">f7c14d63f13f46fc8c79eec2b348e569</data>
      <data key="d12">7718</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="CAQUEXIA" target="LEPTINA">
      <data key="d8">4.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Los niveles bajos de leptina se asocian con la caquexia en pacientes con c&#225;ncer de es&#243;fago</data>
      <data key="d10">f0d279ccc92a98dc953edafb1080630b</data>
      <data key="d11">c35ce20c2c9d47fe8d664028de336cd1</data>
      <data key="d12">7719</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="CAQUEXIA" target="INFLAMACI&#211;N SIST&#201;MICA">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La inflamaci&#243;n sist&#233;mica contribuye al desarrollo de la caquexia en pacientes con c&#225;ncer, afectando su estado nutricional</data>
      <data key="d10">f0d279ccc92a98dc953edafb1080630b</data>
      <data key="d11">97a40c01655b444fa2e007d45dea8bff</data>
      <data key="d12">7720</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="CAQUEXIA" target="PACIENTES CON C&#193;NCER">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Los pacientes con c&#225;ncer a menudo experimentan caquexia, lo que afecta su estado nutricional y recuperaci&#243;n.</data>
      <data key="d10">27b65be3bda292c9c26dfd7a87e74752</data>
      <data key="d11">ecc4988372a247e2af578f7d70aadf7c</data>
      <data key="d12">7721</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="S&#205;NDROMES DE MALABSORCI&#211;N" target="VITAMINA E">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Malabsorption syndromes can lead to deficiencies in vitamin E, impacting overall health.</data>
      <data key="d10">c879b2e3799c9353091ac931a92a99e8</data>
      <data key="d11">0147dfa1571e40bc8fd99f0cff1b6ba6</data>
      <data key="d12">7722</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="SONDAS NASOENTERALES" target="DIETA ENTERAL">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Las sondas nasoenterales se utilizan para la administraci&#243;n de dieta enteral en pacientes con problemas gastrointestinales.</data>
      <data key="d10">aa99de2530170165c9ac9333021210e3</data>
      <data key="d11">411cbcca79eb4862a9c24a320293ea48</data>
      <data key="d12">7723</data>
