    <edge source="OBESITY" target="BARIATRIC SURGERY">
      <data key="d8">34.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Bariatric surgery is a treatment method specifically designed for individuals suffering from obesity. It is directly linked to obesity and is often performed to promote significant weight loss and improve overall health outcomes. This surgical intervention is particularly important as obesity is a major contributing factor to various health issues, including Type 2 diabetes. By addressing obesity through bariatric surgery, patients can achieve better health and potentially reduce the risk of obesity-related complications.</data>
      <data key="d10">6517add809ee588bede013f59f20b0ef,8ad412c188e4086d686c217c6c5c5324,a3e3a651e24883d279405241439b58bc,b0a60df651e774a77b1969babdf3b21a</data>
      <data key="d11">e93364e14bbf420f99101f76563a8d5d</data>
      <data key="d12">8075</data>
