    <edge source="CALCIO" target="ALCOHOL">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">CALCIO and ALCOHOL are interconnected in terms of health and nutrition. Excessive alcohol consumption can interfere with the absorption of calcium and other essential nutrients, which is crucial for maintaining bone health. Therefore, minimizing alcohol intake is advised to reduce the risk of osteoporosis, particularly in patients who require adequate calcium levels for their health.</data>
      <data key="d10">7925a5f252f3bfc107f8199401edf824,94afd4bf40b661992e66cf7963ef236c</data>
      <data key="d11">7d95b9db3e7341708bdd8055313421ab</data>
