    </edge>
    <edge source="CALCIO" target="LACTANCIA">
      <data key="d8">15.0</data>
      <data key="d9">CALCIO (calcium) and LACTANCIA (lactation) are interconnected in terms of dietary recommendations. Calcium has specific recommended intake levels for infants during lactation, highlighting the importance of adequate calcium consumption for this age group. Additionally, lactation provides dietary reference intake guidelines for calcium, which are tailored for different age groups, ensuring that individuals receive appropriate nutritional guidance throughout various stages of development. Together, these insights emphasize the critical role of calcium during the lactation period and the necessity of adhering to established dietary guidelines.</data>
      <data key="d10">74a9c62d0f932e27419151241f7db445,acf7f978dbec397c60ed463f4eb2fcf6</data>
