    <edge source="ZINC" target="SELENIO">
      <data key="d8">11.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Zinc and Selenio are both types of mineral supplements that provide essential nutrients for health. They are important oligoelements that contribute significantly to overall well-being and are frequently discussed in dietary recommendations. As trace minerals, Zinc and Selenio play crucial roles in immune function, highlighting their importance in maintaining a healthy body.</data>
      <data key="d10">3bd46addca98ca875c66aab3827bbf5f,9200477669cf2a6e6f67f912c729ddc6,b1d4c144806ac7875725e152251868f3</data>
