    <edge source="SODIO" target="HIPERTENSI&#211;N ARTERIAL">
      <data key="d8">16.0</data>
      <data key="d9">SODIO, or sodium, is a dietary component that has a significant association with the increase in blood pressure and the risk of developing hipertensi&#243;n arterial, or high blood pressure. The intake of sodium is directly related to the management of hipertensi&#243;n arterial, highlighting the importance of dietary control in regulating blood pressure levels. Reducing sodium consumption can be a crucial strategy in preventing and managing hypertension.</data>
