    <edge source="SODIO" target="NUTRICI&#211;N PEDI&#193;TRICA">
      <data key="d8">14.0</data>
      <data key="d9">SODIO and NUTRICI&#211;N PEDI&#193;TRICA are closely related in the context of children's health and nutrition. NUTRICI&#211;N PEDI&#193;TRICA addresses the significant impact of excessive sodium intake on children's health, highlighting the potential risks associated with high sodium consumption. At the same time, sodium is recognized as a critical component within the nutritional guidelines established in NUTRICI&#211;N PEDI&#193;TRICA, which emphasizes the importance of maintaining electrolyte balance in children. This dual perspective underscores the necessity of managing sodium intake to promote overall health while acknowledging its essential role in nutrition.</data>
