    </edge>
    <edge source="HIERRO" target="PACIENTE ANCIANO">
      <data key="d8">5.0</data>
      <data key="d9">El Hierro es un micronutriente que debe ser administrado a pacientes ancianos solo en casos de d&#233;ficit.</data>
      <data key="d10">2f548ddee569586dbe82ca124f2695e9</data>
      <data key="d11">ae20e339e67445469938994224511bef</data>
      <data key="d12">8646</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HIERRO" target="PRETERM INFANTS">
      <data key="d8">15.0</data>
      <data key="d9">HIERRO, or iron, is essential for the health of preterm infants. It is provided to these infants in specific dosages to prevent iron deficiency, which is crucial for their development. Adequate iron intake is vital for preventing anemia in preterm infants, ensuring they receive the necessary nutrients to support their growth and overall well-being.</data>
      <data key="d10">d0f40e5a802daab3992f9e1746a82467,fa356397bc52582bdbbd1868639feec9</data>
      <data key="d11">4515fa5baa4d49eeae7e5324c53cc477</data>
      <data key="d12">8647</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
