      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HIERRO" target="SUPLEMENTOS DE HIERRO">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Iron supplements are a direct source of iron intended to address deficiencies in individuals</data>
      <data key="d10">868defec6ca59b677cc97ac9a6b777bd</data>
      <data key="d11">5a4ebd2ccbd04143be0b11b29c2d1662</data>
      <data key="d12">8657</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HIERRO" target="HEMOCROMATOSIS">
      <data key="d8">17.0</data>
      <data key="d9">HIERRO and HEMOCROMATOSIS are closely related, as hemochromatosis is a condition characterized by excessive iron accumulation in the body. This excessive absorption and accumulation of iron can lead to various health complications, making it a significant medical concern. The primary issue in hemochromatosis is the body's inability to regulate iron levels, resulting in detrimental effects on health.</data>
      <data key="d10">2eeab2238556165bbea897f24c5b1c7a,45921035725d6b94d451399b0dac4079</data>
      <data key="d11">c4a8ebeff8924ca48eab0db5264d5630</data>
      <data key="d12">8658</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HIERRO" target="MINERALES Y OLIGOELEMENTOS">
