      <data key="d9">Hipo-glucemia, or hypoglycemia, is a primary symptom observed in patients with Glycogen Storage Disease Type III (GSDIII). Individuals affected by GSDIII often experience hypoglycemia as a significant complication of the disorder, highlighting the importance of monitoring blood sugar levels in these patients.</data>
