      <data key="d11">67a1b0e6b055461faadd93e7a6194d46</data>
      <data key="d12">8842</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HOSPITAL UNIVERSITARI I POLIT&#200;CNIC LA FE" target="F. MINGOL NAVARRO">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">F. Mingol Navarro works at Hospital Universitari i Polit&#232;cnic La Fe, contributing to nutritional support practices</data>
      <data key="d10">1f2182c320403c424563ba1a084c00d5</data>
      <data key="d11">d2fb4c86cc91467bac0028aae612eb8b</data>
      <data key="d12">8843</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HOSPITAL UNIVERSITARI I POLIT&#200;CNIC LA FE" target="M. SAUR&#205; ORTIZ">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">M. Saur&#237; Ortiz works at Hospital Universitari i Polit&#232;cnic La Fe, contributing to nutritional support practices</data>
      <data key="d10">1f2182c320403c424563ba1a084c00d5</data>
      <data key="d11">eee839b390944b7a8a28274a89b38eb9</data>
      <data key="d12">8844</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HIPERTRIGLICERIDEMIA" target="CARDIOVASCULAR SALUD">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Hipertrigliceridemia is a condition that negatively affects cardiovascular health</data>
      <data key="d10">c78125c02ea4d5afdf5cb5ac4baeeb27</data>
      <data key="d11">b7916fa90d78471a94f010c9474d0043</data>
      <data key="d12">8845</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HIPERTRIGLICERIDEMIA" target="QUILOMICRONES">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La hipertrigliceridemia se caracteriza por niveles elevados de quilomicrones en la sangre, que son responsables del transporte de triglic&#233;ridos.</data>
      <data key="d10">a9ee55a5371c88622e278b2543fa7317</data>
      <data key="d11">2c31e3ad82be4b4d898a9643e6ece2b4</data>
      <data key="d12">8846</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HIPERTRIGLICERIDEMIA" target="XANTOMAS">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La hipertrigliceridemia puede causar la formaci&#243;n de xantomas en la piel como resultado de la acumulaci&#243;n de l&#237;pidos.</data>
      <data key="d10">a9ee55a5371c88622e278b2543fa7317</data>
      <data key="d11">822735d39fd2499e87bf2e361062138f</data>
      <data key="d12">8847</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HIPERTRIGLICERIDEMIA" target="LIPIDEMIA RETINALIS">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La lipidemia retinalis es una manifestaci&#243;n ocular asociada a la hiperquilomicronemia, que se presenta en pacientes con hipertrigliceridemia.</data>
      <data key="d10">a9ee55a5371c88622e278b2543fa7317</data>
      <data key="d11">1aa7fb8dd9db401ca6445b101f1a911a</data>
      <data key="d12">8848</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HIPERTRIGLICERIDEMIA" target="PANCREATITIS LIP&#201;MICA">
      <data key="d8">17.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Hypertriglyceridemia is a condition characterized by elevated triglyceride levels in the blood, which can lead to serious health complications if not properly managed. One such complication is pancreatitis lip&#233;mica, a form of pancreatitis that arises from the accumulation of chylomicrons in the pancreas due to uncontrolled triglyceride levels. This relationship highlights the importance of controlling triglyceride levels to prevent the onset of lipid pancreatitis, which can result from the effects of hypertriglyceridemia.</data>
      <data key="d10">3f46d79bcfab2143f045659e11be171b,a9ee55a5371c88622e278b2543fa7317</data>
      <data key="d11">c809acac044343e7bdba3ce9f32b9531</data>
      <data key="d12">8849</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HIPERTRIGLICERIDEMIA" target="DEFICIT FAMILIAR DE LIPOPROTE&#205;NA LIPASA">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">El d&#233;ficit familiar de lipoprote&#237;na lipasa es una causa gen&#233;tica de hipertrigliceridemia debido a la acumulaci&#243;n de quilomicrones.</data>
      <data key="d10">a9ee55a5371c88622e278b2543fa7317</data>
      <data key="d11">483dffecc36c405a860bf3ed51d8e734</data>
      <data key="d12">8850</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HIPERTRIGLICERIDEMIA" target="DEFICIT DE APO C-II">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">El d&#233;ficit de apo C-II causa un d&#233;ficit funcional de lipoprote&#237;na lipasa, contribuyendo a la hipertrigliceridemia.</data>
      <data key="d10">a9ee55a5371c88622e278b2543fa7317</data>
      <data key="d11">d7622c707f8d466996fc295166c4f16e</data>
      <data key="d12">8851</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HIPERTRIGLICERIDEMIA" target="DEFICIT DE LIPASA HEP&#193;TICA">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">El d&#233;ficit de lipasa hep&#225;tica interfiere con el metabolismo de las lipoprote&#237;nas, lo que puede resultar en hipertrigliceridemia.</data>
      <data key="d10">a9ee55a5371c88622e278b2543fa7317</data>
      <data key="d11">c00689e5ee2d468bb7cf636161c26ebe</data>
      <data key="d12">8852</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HIPERTRIGLICERIDEMIA" target="DEFICIT DE APO-V">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">El d&#233;ficit de apo-V afecta la uni&#243;n de lipoprote&#237;nas a la lipoprote&#237;na lipasa, contribuyendo a la hipertrigliceridemia.</data>
      <data key="d10">a9ee55a5371c88622e278b2543fa7317</data>
      <data key="d11">a5755b86da594a18b1a8785136c29d31</data>
      <data key="d12">8853</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HIPERTRIGLICERIDEMIA" target="HIPERTRIGLICERIDEMIA FAMILIAR">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La hipertrigliceridemia familiar es una forma hereditaria de hipertrigliceridemia, donde los niveles de triglic&#233;ridos son elevados debido a factores gen&#233;ticos.</data>
      <data key="d10">a9ee55a5371c88622e278b2543fa7317</data>
      <data key="d11">df205b33a0ab47278c3f6d86db2f8ace</data>
      <data key="d12">8854</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HIPERTRIGLICERIDEMIA" target="D&#201;FICIT FAMILIAR DE LIPOPROTE&#205;NA LIPASA">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">El d&#233;ficit familiar de lipoprote&#237;na lipasa es una causa de hipertrigliceridemia debido a la acumulaci&#243;n de quilomicrones en el plasma.</data>
      <data key="d10">a9ee55a5371c88622e278b2543fa7317</data>
      <data key="d11">4abd37062211474f8c234d22e93b317d</data>
      <data key="d12">8855</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HIPERTRIGLICERIDEMIA" target="D&#201;FICIT DE APO C-II">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">El d&#233;ficit de apo C-II contribuye a la hipertrigliceridemia al afectar la funci&#243;n de la lipoprote&#237;na lipasa.</data>
      <data key="d10">a9ee55a5371c88622e278b2543fa7317</data>
      <data key="d11">5a7170677b404820bbad690a4dacc806</data>
      <data key="d12">8856</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HIPERTRIGLICERIDEMIA" target="D&#201;FICIT DE LIPASA HEP&#193;TICA">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">El d&#233;ficit de lipasa hep&#225;tica interfiere con el metabolismo de las lipoprote&#237;nas, lo que puede resultar en hipertrigliceridemia.</data>
      <data key="d10">a9ee55a5371c88622e278b2543fa7317</data>
      <data key="d11">f7036e4ac03e45ef907c7983dcf25319</data>
      <data key="d12">8857</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HIPERTRIGLICERIDEMIA" target="D&#201;FICIT DE APO-V">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">El d&#233;ficit de apo-V afecta la uni&#243;n de lipoprote&#237;nas a la lipoprote&#237;na lipasa, contribuyendo a la hipertrigliceridemia.</data>
      <data key="d10">a9ee55a5371c88622e278b2543fa7317</data>
      <data key="d11">9d1c998887294eba9e18f0c0d4402810</data>
      <data key="d12">8858</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HIPERTRIGLICERIDEMIA" target="LOMITAPIDA">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Lomitapide is prescribed for severe cases of hypertriglyceridemia</data>
      <data key="d10">3f46d79bcfab2143f045659e11be171b</data>
      <data key="d11">1d5b2249a82d49189abc6b089f0aa126</data>
      <data key="d12">8859</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HIPERTRIGLICERIDEMIA" target="TRIGLIC&#201;RIDOS">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">High levels of triglycerides are a defining characteristic of hypertriglyceridemia</data>
      <data key="d10">3f46d79bcfab2143f045659e11be171b</data>
      <data key="d11">a0069cc8c5184f4291e9ab06626bc2f5</data>
      <data key="d12">8860</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HIPERTRIGLICERIDEMIA" target="H&#193;BITOS DE VIDA">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Lifestyle habits play a crucial role in managing hypertriglyceridemia</data>
      <data key="d10">3f46d79bcfab2143f045659e11be171b</data>
      <data key="d11">2d45ab913a3c457aa668ebc885be1c7e</data>
      <data key="d12">8861</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HIPERTRIGLICERIDEMIA" target="QUILOMICRONEMIAS">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Chylomicronemia can lead to hypertriglyceridemia due to excessive chylomicron levels</data>
      <data key="d10">3f46d79bcfab2143f045659e11be171b</data>
      <data key="d11">0c2d26b6ae06489685c63626283e9091</data>
      <data key="d12">8862</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HIPERTRIGLICERIDEMIA" target="PACIENTE PEDI&#193;TRICO">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Pediatric patients on parenteral nutrition may experience hypertriglyceridemia due to excessive lipid intake</data>
      <data key="d10">c06e5bcd7933ed338cd1257d11c709cf</data>
      <data key="d11">19589344493e4b9281cf575e2ebd961c</data>
      <data key="d12">8863</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HEPATOPAT&#205;A" target="CIRROSIS">
      <data key="d8">16.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Hepatopathy refers to any disease of the liver, and cirrhosis is a severe consequence of this condition. Specifically, cirrhosis represents an advanced stage of hepatopathy, characterized by significant liver dysfunction and a range of complications. As such, cirrhosis is considered a severe form of hepatopathy, highlighting the critical nature of liver health and the potential for serious outcomes when hepatopathy progresses.</data>
      <data key="d10">1911ce26c118381473eccb438875b29c,ecc0b96af9066f424f1c114102063682</data>
      <data key="d11">06cb0d3f92184b2680395d3c2fedb06c</data>
      <data key="d12">8864</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HEPATOPAT&#205;A" target="TEDUGLUTIDE">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">TEDUGLUTIDE is a potential treatment for patients with hepatopathy associated with intestinal failure</data>
      <data key="d10">7ad48347b2499729451a184bae719445</data>
      <data key="d11">9c8b5bbd847e4719aa14faa53c603b90</data>
      <data key="d12">8865</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HEPATOPAT&#205;A" target="&#193;CIDOS GRASOS &#937;-3">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Omega-3 fatty acids are recommended for patients with liver disease who cannot use fibrates</data>
      <data key="d10">75a4b2d504de480eaef247aa682bfd05</data>
      <data key="d11">57087872989f4ba6a81ce4a4edee8e22</data>
      <data key="d12">8866</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HEPATOPAT&#205;A" target="DIETA 40 G/60 G PROTE&#205;NAS">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Patients with liver disease may need to follow a diet with controlled protein intake to manage their condition</data>
      <data key="d10">c6406ac5c0c7b03d4ee61ca311fd783f</data>
      <data key="d11">7406b5e652174c488f93556b29a79de5</data>
      <data key="d12">8867</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HEPATOPAT&#205;A" target="BUPROPION">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Hepatopathy is a contraindication for the use of bupropion, indicating potential risks</data>
      <data key="d10">488970234520652b063db88e8346031c</data>
      <data key="d11">c72eedb3ce72421b8c2319375899abae</data>
      <data key="d12">8868</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HEPATOPAT&#205;A" target="HEPATITIS">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Hepatitis is a form of hepatopathy that can lead to liver dysfunction</data>
      <data key="d10">1911ce26c118381473eccb438875b29c</data>
      <data key="d11">8fbab74ef2ad4935bf5eba59dd31be9c</data>
      <data key="d12">8869</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HEPATOPAT&#205;A" target="TRASTORNOS METAB&#211;LICOS">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La hepatopat&#237;a puede ser un s&#237;ntoma asociado a trastornos metab&#243;licos, incluyendo aquellos que afectan la &#946;-oxidaci&#243;n</data>
      <data key="d10">2f96bbc5eafd39b659620da7282a2079</data>
      <data key="d11">e968ad5be77f4c0ebf525dcfadb041d4</data>
      <data key="d12">8870</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HEPATOPAT&#205;A" target="ADRENOLEUKODYSTROPHY">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Adrenoleukodystrophy can be associated with hepatopathy as a complication</data>
      <data key="d10">c4abdcd9f1628aa02ca6ed662b795fd6</data>
      <data key="d11">1975f5a3a6b5422688d50c93afd5aca2</data>
      <data key="d12">8871</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HEPATOPAT&#205;A" target="DIETA CETOG&#201;NICA">
      <data key="d8">3.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La hepatopat&#237;a puede ser una condici&#243;n que se eval&#250;a en pacientes que siguen la dieta cetog&#233;nica</data>
      <data key="d10">0a9b42ff082f2d0bb036ec3365d9a6e9</data>
      <data key="d11">0b323e8ea9224cbabc1f16ceb3772bc0</data>
      <data key="d12">8872</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HEPATOPAT&#205;A" target="ENFERMEDAD DE WILSON">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La hepatopat&#237;a es un s&#237;ntoma com&#250;n en pacientes con enfermedad de Wilson, que afecta la funci&#243;n hep&#225;tica</data>
      <data key="d10">ea816809115cc37c571bd36191042123</data>
      <data key="d11">f28a0348645c41f2bf518106152a58fa</data>
      <data key="d12">8873</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ENFERMEDAD METAB&#211;LICA &#211;SEA" target="PACIENTE PEDI&#193;TRICO">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Pediatric patients on long-term parenteral nutrition are at risk for metabolic bone disease</data>
      <data key="d10">c06e5bcd7933ed338cd1257d11c709cf</data>
      <data key="d11">d87abe59b3c34f2794e0b025371c8f4f</data>
      <data key="d12">8874</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="SURGICAL PATIENT" target="POSTOPERATIVE NUTRITION">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Postoperative nutrition is crucial for surgical patients to ensure proper recovery</data>
      <data key="d10">d23c564df025cf16e37f2ef2be83ec34</data>
      <data key="d11">16c20f70a233474bb1c9bb23b1622090</data>
      <data key="d12">8875</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="SURGICAL PATIENT" target="HARRIS AND BENEDICT FORMULA">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The Harris and Benedict formula is used to determine the energy needs of surgical patients</data>
      <data key="d10">d23c564df025cf16e37f2ef2be83ec34</data>
      <data key="d11">7640b0ce714e4caaa8538d1469f6437b</data>
      <data key="d12">8876</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="SURGICAL PATIENT" target="NUTRITIONAL SUPPLEMENTATION">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Nutritional supplementation is provided to surgical patients to address their nutritional deficiencies</data>
      <data key="d10">d23c564df025cf16e37f2ef2be83ec34</data>
      <data key="d11">5fe30c8ae5e54ca08b992fbdfa3c9768</data>
      <data key="d12">8877</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="SURGICAL PATIENT" target="NUTRITIONAL SUPPORT PREOPERATIVE">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Preoperative nutritional support is aimed at surgical patients to improve their nutritional status</data>
      <data key="d10">d23c564df025cf16e37f2ef2be83ec34</data>
      <data key="d11">642dc5295d294b8cafbf7b42ad2c205f</data>
      <data key="d12">8878</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="SURGICAL PATIENT" target="NUTRITIONAL SUPPORT POSTOPERATIVE">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Postoperative nutritional support is provided to surgical patients to aid in their recovery</data>
      <data key="d10">d23c564df025cf16e37f2ef2be83ec34</data>
      <data key="d11">0781af3452444f2aba7f5df8e3da6eef</data>
      <data key="d12">8879</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="SURGICAL PATIENT" target="MORBIMORTALIDAD PERIOPERATORIA">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Morbimortalidad perioperatoria is a significant concern for surgical patients, influenced by their nutritional status</data>
      <data key="d10">d23c564df025cf16e37f2ef2be83ec34</data>
      <data key="d11">c3c51727d0464c30bae31acba11521da</data>
      <data key="d12">8880</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRITIONAL SUPPLEMENTATION" target="POSTOPERATIVE NUTRITION">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Postoperative nutrition may include nutritional supplementation if oral intake is insufficient</data>
      <data key="d10">d23c564df025cf16e37f2ef2be83ec34</data>
      <data key="d11">f9d39363bf3a4c32b109ed1d0ddd8931</data>
      <data key="d12">8881</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRITIONAL SUPPLEMENTATION" target="MICRONUTRIENTS">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Nutritional supplementation often includes micronutrients that are essential for cognitive health</data>
      <data key="d10">65143afbc494705be9ccc4e48bee296b</data>
      <data key="d11">32377793ee8d459a89ea7c37cafeb29b</data>
      <data key="d12">8882</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRITIONAL SUPPLEMENTATION" target="HEALTH ABC STUDY">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The Health ABC Study investigates the effects of nutritional supplementation on health outcomes in older adults</data>
      <data key="d10">3ec3efbe130c20d623681e00e3d784f7</data>
      <data key="d11">f04e22c77a2c422c8e8a16bddb280196</data>
      <data key="d12">8883</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRITIONAL SUPPLEMENTATION" target="PROTEIN SUPPLEMENTATION">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Nutritional supplementation often includes protein supplementation to improve health outcomes in older adults</data>
      <data key="d10">3ec3efbe130c20d623681e00e3d784f7</data>
      <data key="d11">0b9dc55036a74cefa30d17991d212386</data>
      <data key="d12">8884</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRITIONAL SUPPLEMENTATION" target="DEMENTIA">
      <data key="d8">5.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Nutritional supplementation is often discussed in the context of dementia, with varying evidence regarding its effectiveness</data>
      <data key="d10">b3f35283251afbd3276cf40d7be382c0</data>
