    </edge>
    <edge source="PACIENTE S&#201;PTICO" target="HIPERMETABOLISMO">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">El hipermetabolismo es una respuesta com&#250;n en pacientes s&#233;pticos que moviliza sustratos energ&#233;ticos para mejorar la funci&#243;n inmune</data>
      <data key="d10">422dbd193843eb5098307e57ba002ced</data>
      <data key="d11">4cbfb7d4cb3a48599d96af84ea9549ec</data>
      <data key="d12">8958</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PACIENTE S&#201;PTICO" target="HIPERCATABOLISMO">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">El hipercatabolismo afecta a pacientes s&#233;pticos al utilizar prote&#237;nas como sustrato energ&#233;tico, lo que puede ser perjudicial</data>
      <data key="d10">422dbd193843eb5098307e57ba002ced</data>
      <data key="d11">4b865472cb594616be66ebbe5e2aa031</data>
      <data key="d12">8959</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="LIPIDOS" target="PROTEINAS">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">L&#237;pidos and Proteins are both essential components of nutritional support, contributing to energy and metabolic processes.</data>
      <data key="d10">33815f13a51d2a716356eaca97176390</data>
      <data key="d11">dd30cee45eed48df98d3a8cba4429dc6</data>
      <data key="d12">8960</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="LIPIDOS" target="ACIDOS GRASOS ESENCIALES">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">LIPIDOS, or lipids, are crucial components of nutrition that provide essential fatty acids. These essential fatty acids are necessary for proper nutrition and play a vital role in growth and development, particularly in infants. Thus, lipids serve as a source of these essential fatty acids, highlighting their importance in a balanced diet.</data>
      <data key="d10">33815f13a51d2a716356eaca97176390,e41a9b2827462263a11ef60ce74c160b</data>
      <data key="d11">dc1b7b75c1d346aca408aefd999887cf</data>
      <data key="d12">8961</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="LIPIDOS" target="ACIDO LINOLEICO">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Linoleic acid is a type of essential fatty acid that is part of lipid intake.</data>
      <data key="d10">33815f13a51d2a716356eaca97176390</data>
      <data key="d11">0b0290142eb04a43b59f60945baa096b</data>
      <data key="d12">8962</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="LIPIDOS" target="ACIDO ALFA-LINOLENICO">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Alpha-linolenic acid is another essential fatty acid that contributes to lipid intake.</data>
      <data key="d10">33815f13a51d2a716356eaca97176390</data>
      <data key="d11">3b7ee6a8a29d4170964da521a387e6e7</data>
      <data key="d12">8963</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="LIPIDOS" target="RN PRET&#201;RMINO">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">RN Pret&#233;rmino infants need lipids to provide essential fatty acids and energy, which are crucial for their growth and development.</data>
      <data key="d10">e41a9b2827462263a11ef60ce74c160b</data>
      <data key="d11">94c43c62aaf44a2ca2311806b73425e1</data>
      <data key="d12">8964</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="LIPIDOS" target="CASOS CLINICOS">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">L&#237;pidos are often analyzed in clinical cases to understand their role in health conditions, particularly in relation to obesity and metabolic disorders.</data>
      <data key="d10">7c6e51fbc38204b42b4d619b271037c3</data>
      <data key="d11">eec9a685e1444779a91177d113703c95</data>
      <data key="d12">8965</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="LIPIDOS" target="M&#211;DULO 8">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">M&#243;dulo 8 addresses lipids in the context of obesity and related health disorders, emphasizing their importance in medical discussions.</data>
      <data key="d10">7c6e51fbc38204b42b4d619b271037c3</data>
      <data key="d11">84e9426ba3a345be93b84b622811e8f0</data>
      <data key="d12">8966</data>
