    <edge source="MICRONUTRIENTS" target="ALZHEIMER'S DISEASE">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Micronutrients are essential nutrients that may play a significant role in preventing Alzheimer's disease. They are believed to contribute to the reduction of oxidative stress, which is a factor associated with the development and progression of this neurodegenerative condition. By supporting overall brain health, micronutrients are crucial in both preventing the onset and slowing the progression of Alzheimer's disease.</data>
      <data key="d10">680ff2c9e67ec29c5952df66bd83c984,75457662a196b78b5738344c4dbd89a8</data>
      <data key="d11">dd30e9aca6434057a4129ebbab62c1b4</data>
