    <edge source="AMERICAN SOCIETY FOR PARENTERAL AND ENTERAL NUTRITION" target="SOCIETY OF CRITICAL CARE MEDICINE">
      <data key="d8">21.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The American Society for Parenteral and Enteral Nutrition and the Society of Critical Care Medicine are two organizations dedicated to enhancing nutritional support practices for critically ill patients. Both societies provide guidelines and support for nutrition therapy, aiming to improve the overall care and outcomes for individuals in critical conditions. Their collaborative efforts emphasize the importance of effective nutritional management in the treatment of critically ill patients.</data>
      <data key="d10">29cd22ec41c1cb5160d9987958d6ae16,4ce6342fdfe4419826c1ab2f84c56247,d26aec24f3f8c930c1c4b1d464bacd6b</data>
