    <edge source="FIBRA" target="ENVEJECIMIENTO Y NUTRICI&#211;N">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Fiber is a critical component of nutrition that can significantly impact health as individuals age, making it relevant to the discussion of aging and nutrition.</data>
