    </edge>
    <edge source="FIBRA" target="C&#193;NCER DE COLON">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Fiber intake is linked to a reduced risk of colon cancer, making it a significant focus in dietary recommendations aimed at preventing this disease.</data>
      <data key="d10">c7af1c950a6caab8be5d180a2889a25a</data>
      <data key="d11">0362329ab2b240d08ac71ec280302b50</data>
      <data key="d12">9394</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="FIBRA" target="ENFERMEDADES CARDIOVASCULARES">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">A diet high in fiber is known to help reduce the risk of cardiovascular diseases, emphasizing the importance of fiber in heart health.</data>
