    <edge source="ENFERMEDAD INJERTO CONTRA HU&#201;SPED" target="TRASPLANTE ALOG&#201;NICO">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The entity "ENFERMEDAD INJERTO CONTRA HU&#201;SPED" is a complication that can arise in the context of "TRASPLANTE ALOG&#201;NICO." Specifically, the process of allogeneic transplantation carries a significant risk of developing this condition. Therefore, it is important to recognize that the disease manifests as a potential complication following allogeneic transplants, highlighting the need for careful monitoring and management in patients undergoing such procedures.</data>
      <data key="d10">b2b9da64e886eb0b5a8b332d2ba9c7fb</data>
      <data key="d11">7707c881cee6439680b8dfc8b79ab3cf</data>
