      <data key="d12">9609</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HLA" target="DR3-DQ2">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">DR3-DQ2 is a haplotype that is part of the HLA system, which is crucial in determining susceptibility to autoimmune diseases like Type 1 Diabetes.</data>
      <data key="d10">ed9fbb82a9162d601f8370ef97810e54</data>
      <data key="d11">7bd6613b316246878c70b60a46821c34</data>
      <data key="d12">9610</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HLA" target="DR4-DQ8">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">DR4-DQ8 is a haplotype that is part of the HLA system, which is crucial in determining susceptibility to autoimmune diseases like Type 1 Diabetes.</data>
      <data key="d10">ed9fbb82a9162d601f8370ef97810e54</data>
      <data key="d11">fd5d59c9adbc4811bec9c4ec121c1f90</data>
      <data key="d12">9611</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HLA" target="CYP21A2">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">El gen CYP21A2 se encuentra en la regi&#243;n del sistema HLA en el cromosoma 6, lo que afecta la frecuencia de mutaciones</data>
      <data key="d10">095d265c06452e52ccbfbc871a19a899</data>
      <data key="d11">801d9dfb194846ef8a39f2546b1e545d</data>
      <data key="d12">9612</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HLA" target="ALOG&#201;NICO">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">El HLA es crucial para determinar la compatibilidad en trasplantes alog&#233;nicos.</data>
