      <data key="d9">Valoraci&#243;n nutricional is essential for planning an effective intervenci&#243;n nutricional</data>
      <data key="d10">56da8c0bffe9c7811cc9790d767f4972</data>
      <data key="d11">1a63b497f51b40888f3b09e715842b00</data>
      <data key="d12">9627</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HISTORIA DIET&#201;TICA" target="ENCUESTAS NUTRICIONALES">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Historia diet&#233;tica is a method that can be included in nutritional surveys to gather comprehensive dietary information</data>
