    <edge source="MCT" target="PANCREATITIS CR&#211;NICA">
      <data key="d8">13.0</data>
      <data key="d9">MCT, or medium-chain triglycerides, are recommended in the diet of patients with pancreatitis cr&#243;nica (chronic pancreatitis) to assist with fat absorption. They are considered a beneficial nutritional option for these patients due to their advantages over long-chain triglycerides (LCTs). MCTs provide a more easily digestible source of fat, which is particularly important for individuals suffering from chronic pancreatitis, as their ability to absorb fats is often compromised.</data>
      <data key="d10">67106be274787fd7f400ce3023c33a3d,803363886f385b089938bf122246dfa2</data>
