    </edge>
    <edge source="ACTIVIDAD F&#205;SICA" target="S&#205;NDROME DE FRAGILIDAD">
      <data key="d8">24.0</data>
      <data key="d9">ACTIVIDAD F&#205;SICA plays a crucial role in the management and prevention of S&#205;NDROME DE FRAGILIDAD. It is recognized as a key intervention that significantly improves functionality in individuals affected by this syndrome. Engaging in physical activity is essential for both the treatment and prevention of frailty, highlighting its importance in enhancing the overall well-being of those at risk or suffering from this condition.</data>
      <data key="d10">1052683f23a0c9825af9c5c1d39ceb2c,4913cc391a44397e2e1ea12979e1fd58,6656dd3bdc79720504c3e4245f935d32</data>
      <data key="d11">97c10dd6a0844b229ccda302e5668a09</data>
      <data key="d12">9915</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ACTIVIDAD F&#205;SICA" target="FRAGILIDAD">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La actividad f&#237;sica es un factor que puede ayudar a reducir la fragilidad en ancianos.</data>
      <data key="d10">bdb8258b310cb9ed8a0e4354fac5a33c</data>
      <data key="d11">99a2d30cfe644e0daeaef4a414a946b8</data>
      <data key="d12">9916</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ACTIVIDAD F&#205;SICA" target="COCHRANE">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Cochrane ha evaluado la efectividad de la actividad f&#237;sica en la mejora de la funcionalidad en ancianos.</data>
      <data key="d10">4913cc391a44397e2e1ea12979e1fd58</data>
      <data key="d11">35b0c4331da345f4811c1503d4610dc2</data>
      <data key="d12">9917</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ACTIVIDAD F&#205;SICA" target="SUPLEMENTOS DE HIDRATOS DE CARBONO">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Carbohydrate supplements are often needed during physical activity to prevent hypoglycemia in individuals with diabetes</data>
      <data key="d10">ac2955cad85e541f3b61de2f4df0a3a9</data>
      <data key="d11">68297b8b0ce947c894537f7b4812a7cf</data>
      <data key="d12">9918</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ACTIVIDAD F&#205;SICA" target="CARBOHIDRATOS DE ABSORCI&#211;N LENTA">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Slow-absorbing carbohydrates are recommended before physical activity to maintain stable blood sugar levels</data>
      <data key="d10">ac2955cad85e541f3b61de2f4df0a3a9</data>
      <data key="d11">0d9ea5eeb64f46b4a3b867b427b783f4</data>
      <data key="d12">9919</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
