    <edge source="SALGADO ALBA A" target="TENA D&#193;VILA MC">
      <data key="d8">5.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Both are contributors to the Manual de geriatr&#237;a, discussing aspects of geriatric care.</data>
      <data key="d10">54f3b76c0240696aa63ae60ad52b82b6</data>
