      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ASTENIA" target="PACIENCIA">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Astenia is a common symptom experienced by patients in palliative care, impacting their quality of life.</data>
      <data key="d10">d3f53b7b7352e8ba2fd9dc8be977648c</data>
      <data key="d11">c060d8a148e74f76a61dac609ce2626f</data>
      <data key="d12">9936</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PALIATIVOS" target="PACIENCIA">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Patients are the primary recipients of palliative care services, which aim to improve their quality of life.</data>
      <data key="d10">d3f53b7b7352e8ba2fd9dc8be977648c</data>
      <data key="d11">b0c28e18aa0349c5a2fc0c9d786da917</data>
      <data key="d12">9937</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PACIENCIA" target="INTERVENCI&#211;N NUTRICIONAL">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Nutritional intervention is essential for patients to address deficiencies and improve their overall well-being.</data>
      <data key="d10">d3f53b7b7352e8ba2fd9dc8be977648c</data>
      <data key="d11">8a50e24c8fd442639b3eea274c262b0e</data>
      <data key="d12">9938</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PACIENCIA" target="CONSEJO DIET&#201;TICO">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Dietary advice is provided to patients to help them manage their nutritional intake effectively.</data>
      <data key="d10">d3f53b7b7352e8ba2fd9dc8be977648c</data>
      <data key="d11">0a6df6d4c560487c905c656066bc93e6</data>
      <data key="d12">9939</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PACIENCIA" target="CONTROL FARMACOL&#211;GICO">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Pharmacological control is implemented to help patients manage symptoms that contribute to malnutrition.</data>
      <data key="d10">d3f53b7b7352e8ba2fd9dc8be977648c</data>
      <data key="d11">1a549d02ea024055b1b6169b85149b08</data>
      <data key="d12">9940</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PACIENCIA" target="COTICOSTEROIDES">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Corticosteroids are prescribed to patients to stimulate appetite and improve nutritional status.</data>
      <data key="d10">d3f53b7b7352e8ba2fd9dc8be977648c</data>
      <data key="d11">39a863d9b9a3411981e2fa688cc0fee7</data>
      <data key="d12">9941</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PACIENCIA" target="PSICOESTIMULANTES">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Psychostimulants are used in patients to enhance appetite, although they may have side effects.</data>
      <data key="d10">d3f53b7b7352e8ba2fd9dc8be977648c</data>
      <data key="d11">321ed7da219144418d297551d178e51f</data>
      <data key="d12">9942</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PACIENCIA" target="PROGEST&#193;GENOS">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Progestogens are administered to patients to help increase appetite and weight gain.</data>
      <data key="d10">d3f53b7b7352e8ba2fd9dc8be977648c</data>
      <data key="d11">ed29d29d0b824d4a9143a5c83b342e8e</data>
      <data key="d12">9943</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PACIENCIA" target="CIPROHEPTADINA">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Ciproheptadine is given to patients to slightly increase appetite, aiding in nutritional management.</data>
      <data key="d10">d3f53b7b7352e8ba2fd9dc8be977648c</data>
      <data key="d11">7b6bd04ca21d4e568fb0615a7c7d3abe</data>
      <data key="d12">9944</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PACIENCIA" target="SULFATO DE HIDRACINA">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Hydrazine sulfate is used in patients to stimulate appetite, particularly in cancer care.</data>
      <data key="d10">d3f53b7b7352e8ba2fd9dc8be977648c</data>
      <data key="d11">4cc2ba1f514a45208ce426b3fd03f0a4</data>
      <data key="d12">9945</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="INTERVENCI&#211;N NUTRICIONAL" target="HOMBRE">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">El paciente var&#243;n de 66 a&#241;os requiere intervenci&#243;n nutricional debido a su estado de salud</data>
      <data key="d10">e474ebdcd3e5392e4b2bed8434293849</data>
      <data key="d11">c2c45912ad144e5990e0ddf1fe8ae6ec</data>
      <data key="d12">9946</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="INTERVENCI&#211;N NUTRICIONAL" target="HYPERTENSION">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Nutritional interventions, such as the DASH diet, are effective in preventing and managing hypertension</data>
      <data key="d10">3fab4e796fd2145b2d0f62ffa60775aa</data>
      <data key="d11">06a14bb4b1c64eb980192d2d0d0968e9</data>
      <data key="d12">9947</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PROGEST&#193;GENOS" target="HIPERANDROGENISMO">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Progestogens can affect androgen levels, potentially leading to hyperandrogenism and its symptoms.</data>
      <data key="d10">b30c94def1763c77fe1fc302cc896d6c</data>
      <data key="d11">3029e0dd551e432e89e5a32a1eed0dc6</data>
      <data key="d12">9948</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PROGEST&#193;GENOS" target="SHBG">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Progest&#225;genos can influence SHBG levels and hormonal dynamics</data>
      <data key="d10">4beab004731d7baff10fd2796a523b55</data>
      <data key="d11">c1a14047293046aa8b28051c7ca7ecc4</data>
      <data key="d12">9949</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="CIPROHEPTADINA" target="SULFATO DE HIDRACINA">
      <data key="d8">4.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Both are medications used to manage symptoms related to appetite and metabolism in patients</data>
      <data key="d10">79a751fb45e4b69c946d088100f43654</data>
      <data key="d11">183f1954e73447f8a225906ae68f4f05</data>
      <data key="d12">9950</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="CIPROHEPTADINA" target="NUTRICI&#211;N EN ONCOLOG&#205;A">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Ciproheptadina is included in nutritional management for cancer patients to stimulate appetite</data>
      <data key="d10">42e8a4a4bff905ef121f1101d65c959f</data>
      <data key="d11">9e66539ea614418b9b22510851591298</data>
      <data key="d12">9951</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NAUSEAS" target="DEPORTISTA">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Las n&#225;useas pueden ser un s&#237;ntoma que experimenta un deportista cuando est&#225; deshidratado o sobreesforzado.</data>
      <data key="d10">364aa13581a973c2e55c25191bad27cc</data>
      <data key="d11">30d3a2aff5d14780a0103cfb4d1254b2</data>
      <data key="d12">9952</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="INFECCI&#211;N F&#218;NGICA" target="XEROSTOM&#205;A">
      <data key="d8">5.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Xerostom&#237;a can be secondary to fungal infections, which may require treatment with antifungal medications</data>
      <data key="d10">79a751fb45e4b69c946d088100f43654</data>
      <data key="d11">80cfcab689fe4c4e80b8ac57fb9b9d56</data>
      <data key="d12">9953</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="INFECCIONES VIRALES" target="XEROSTOM&#205;A">
      <data key="d8">5.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Xerostom&#237;a can be caused by viral infections, leading to discomfort and other symptoms</data>
      <data key="d10">79a751fb45e4b69c946d088100f43654</data>
      <data key="d11">362bf67895f347698503572d058b248f</data>
      <data key="d12">9954</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="XEROSTOM&#205;A" target="NUTRICI&#211;N EN ONCOLOG&#205;A">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
