    </edge>
    <edge source="REAL DECRETO 1205/2010" target="REGLAMENTO (UE) N&#186; 1924/2006">
      <data key="d8">5.0</data>
      <data key="d9">El Real Decreto 1205/2010 se basa en las normativas de la UE, incluyendo el Reglamento (UE) N&#186; 1924/2006 para la inclusi&#243;n de alimentos diet&#233;ticos en el Sistema Nacional de Salud.</data>
      <data key="d10">5bda98c244ed300cfc07192e54c7eb88</data>
      <data key="d11">f4d8f9bff82745b1b418273754e7c0ea</data>
      <data key="d12">9969</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="REAL DECRETO 1205/2010" target="REGLAMENTO (UE) N&#186; 609/2013">
      <data key="d8">5.0</data>
      <data key="d9">El Reglamento (UE) N&#186; 609/2013 regula los alimentos para usos m&#233;dicos especiales, que son incluidos en el Real Decreto 1205/2010.</data>
      <data key="d10">5bda98c244ed300cfc07192e54c7eb88</data>
      <data key="d11">44bf118a6cf94bb1b3823efc9760e4d2</data>
      <data key="d12">9970</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="REAL DECRETO 1205/2010" target="REGLAMENTO DELEGADO (UE) N&#186; 2016/128">
      <data key="d8">5.0</data>
      <data key="d9">El Reglamento delegado (UE) N&#186; 2016/128 establece requisitos espec&#237;ficos que son aplicables a los alimentos m&#233;dicos especiales mencionados en el Real Decreto 1205/2010.</data>
      <data key="d10">5bda98c244ed300cfc07192e54c7eb88</data>
      <data key="d11">00705774949b482bb686518ffd3573cd</data>
      <data key="d12">9971</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="L-AMINO&#193;CIDOS" target="F&#211;RMULAS PEDI&#193;TRICAS">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">L-amino acids are used in pediatric formulas to provide essential nutrients for growth</data>
      <data key="d10">7796f48230d374753b744d8e5fb1e8ae</data>
      <data key="d11">14f46b1c3acd41a7b629ee2eed1252b4</data>
      <data key="d12">9972</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="F&#211;RMULAS PEDI&#193;TRICAS" target="NI&#209;OS">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Pediatric formulas are specifically designed for children to meet their nutritional needs</data>
      <data key="d10">7796f48230d374753b744d8e5fb1e8ae</data>
      <data key="d11">19c829d8acaa48b9a4b204f2a9efcaab</data>
      <data key="d12">9973</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="F&#211;RMULAS PEDI&#193;TRICAS" target="LACTANTES">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Pediatric formulas are also formulated to cater to the nutritional requirements of infants</data>
      <data key="d10">7796f48230d374753b744d8e5fb1e8ae</data>
      <data key="d11">7ee0d5fb782e4de983046e6eb980e1e8</data>
      <data key="d12">9974</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="F&#211;RMULAS PEDI&#193;TRICAS" target="TRIGLIC&#201;RIDOS">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Triglycerides are included in pediatric formulas to supply necessary energy</data>
      <data key="d10">7796f48230d374753b744d8e5fb1e8ae</data>
      <data key="d11">03b94dc7b0e0428c9251ae1dbb4d2d20</data>
      <data key="d12">9975</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="F&#211;RMULAS PEDI&#193;TRICAS" target="F&#211;RMULAS POLIM&#201;RICAS">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Polymeric formulas are a type of pediatric formula designed for children who can digest whole proteins</data>
      <data key="d10">7796f48230d374753b744d8e5fb1e8ae</data>
      <data key="d11">be8ecdc50a464941bd4f752f9b425483</data>
      <data key="d12">9976</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="F&#211;RMULAS PEDI&#193;TRICAS" target="F&#211;RMULAS OLIGOM&#201;RICAS">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Oligomeric formulas are designed for children with specific digestive needs and are a subset of pediatric formulas</data>
      <data key="d10">7796f48230d374753b744d8e5fb1e8ae</data>
      <data key="d11">3acfeea89c3449609bbae2c5b606c839</data>
      <data key="d12">9977</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="F&#211;RMULAS PEDI&#193;TRICAS" target="F&#211;RMULAS ELEMENTALES">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Elemental formulas are used in pediatric nutrition for children with severe allergies</data>
      <data key="d10">7796f48230d374753b744d8e5fb1e8ae</data>
      <data key="d11">3b5ce3a474b84010b5815b12df10955c</data>
      <data key="d12">9978</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="F&#211;RMULAS PEDI&#193;TRICAS" target="F&#211;RMULAS HIPERPROTEICAS">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Hyperproteic formulas are a specialized type of pediatric formula for children with increased protein needs</data>
      <data key="d10">7796f48230d374753b744d8e5fb1e8ae</data>
      <data key="d11">ddeb6407e37942ab9069dd466052a159</data>
      <data key="d12">9979</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="F&#211;RMULAS PEDI&#193;TRICAS" target="DENSIDAD CAL&#211;RICA">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Caloric density is a critical factor in formulating pediatric nutrition to ensure adequate energy intake</data>
      <data key="d10">7796f48230d374753b744d8e5fb1e8ae</data>
      <data key="d11">5fc6ff9ae9b8472c8a9fcbc3022bfe3a</data>
      <data key="d12">9980</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NI&#209;OS" target="HIPOPITUITARISMO">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Children can suffer from hormonal deficiencies such as growth hormone deficiency due to hypopituitarism.</data>
      <data key="d10">9ea2863d43f4c93ae3681a0faf1a0a3d</data>
      <data key="d11">6ebbfd0174d9433398c77d02f2a0e738</data>
      <data key="d12">9981</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NI&#209;OS" target="NAS">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The NAS provides specific formulas for calculating energy requirements for children aged 9-18 years</data>
      <data key="d10">bd31c6face847551241359e37e4baa2e</data>
      <data key="d11">733d1b7c5c9b49188621af735ed34075</data>
      <data key="d12">9982</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NI&#209;OS" target="D&#201;FICIT CONG&#201;NITO">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Children with congenital deficit must avoid sucrose to prevent symptoms, highlighting the relationship between the condition and dietary restrictions.</data>
      <data key="d10">a079902e52676a05df746098c930a0e7</data>
      <data key="d11">7081e30e2e1b4b278b20b33011c93320</data>
      <data key="d12">9983</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NI&#209;OS" target="DIETA CETOG&#201;NICA">
      <data key="d8">16.0</data>
      <data key="d9">NI&#209;OS, en el contexto de la DIETA CETOG&#201;NICA, se benefician de esta dieta principalmente para la reducci&#243;n de las crisis epil&#233;pticas. Se han llevado a cabo estudios que demuestran la eficacia de la dieta cetog&#233;nica en este grupo etario, y se ha observado que los ni&#241;os pueden seguir este tipo de dieta como un m&#233;todo para controlar sus crisis epil&#233;pticas.</data>
      <data key="d10">0a9b42ff082f2d0bb036ec3365d9a6e9,1592143354d1ef792f8618ec03a32a16,2d07762e6db07c2587caceac3427a1c7</data>
      <data key="d11">2fe34fbb33594fcab3ef1f30ecbb12d0</data>
      <data key="d12">9984</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NI&#209;OS" target="DIETA ATKINS MODIFICADA">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Los ni&#241;os han sido objeto de estudios sobre la eficacia de la dieta Atkins modificada</data>
      <data key="d10">2d07762e6db07c2587caceac3427a1c7</data>
      <data key="d11">40d136b82688454d8f1b82db27bacb97</data>
      <data key="d12">9985</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NI&#209;OS" target="DC">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Ni&#241;os are the subjects of studies regarding the effects of dietary treatment on health</data>
      <data key="d10">214cb2b8ddec52ff69849d87feb8e141</data>
      <data key="d11">71258da6464046528b4e7174c41bfdb0</data>
      <data key="d12">9986</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NI&#209;OS" target="INSTITUTO DE MEDICINA">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">El Instituto de Medicina establece recomendaciones de ingesta de cobre espec&#237;ficas para ni&#241;os.</data>
      <data key="d10">d6bd9fbceb166872651dd2deade92849</data>
      <data key="d11">29c1cc58ac5d4bbb9bac165af4c5e8f6</data>
      <data key="d12">9987</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NI&#209;OS" target="ALERGIAS">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Los ni&#241;os son la poblaci&#243;n m&#225;s afectada por alergias alimentarias, lo que indica una relaci&#243;n directa entre la edad y la prevalencia de estas.</data>
      <data key="d10">39a7166ca777be46a1613c54a746e2b8</data>
      <data key="d11">f785fa135c17455291e30d6dab1cd7c4</data>
      <data key="d12">9988</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NI&#209;OS" target="ALERGIA A LAS PROTE&#205;NAS DE LA LECHE DE VACA">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Los ni&#241;os son los m&#225;s afectados por la alergia a las prote&#237;nas de la leche de vaca, con una alta prevalencia en esta poblaci&#243;n</data>
      <data key="d10">ac74fa24a5f29d72ff023c010162fea5</data>
      <data key="d11">2fde734d371a47008df009bdddde8582</data>
      <data key="d12">9989</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NI&#209;OS" target="INTERACCI&#211;N FARMACO-NUTRIENTE">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Los ni&#241;os son un grupo vulnerable a las interacciones entre f&#225;rmacos y nutrientes debido a su desarrollo incompleto de sistemas de detoxificaci&#243;n.</data>
      <data key="d10">ac274a54f27601e9d60118e72fc2ba94</data>
      <data key="d11">d13fc9f0063b4c578dcc5420b90e9128</data>
      <data key="d12">9990</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NI&#209;OS" target="NUTRICI&#211;N PEDI&#193;TRICA">
      <data key="d8">17.0</data>
      <data key="d9">NI&#209;OS are a specific group whose nutritional needs are addressed in the NUTRICI&#211;N PEDI&#193;TRICA guidelines. NUTRICI&#211;N PEDI&#193;TRICA focuses on the nutritional needs and health of children, ensuring that their dietary requirements are met for optimal growth and development.</data>
      <data key="d10">d0fb942f9036630b4cf0727dea808fd2,f96dd2fbe3cd9aa6516522de8ed33145</data>
      <data key="d11">98b5a7a75cfe4e0ebb4e6cfcceba9cff</data>
      <data key="d12">9991</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NI&#209;OS" target="LACANTES">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Lactantes are a subset of ni&#241;os, specifically referring to infants</data>
