      <data key="d9">CVCs are commonly used in Intensive Care Units for long-term intravenous access</data>
      <data key="d10">fe3ebcedac0857680bcc85bb58dcb3e1</data>
      <data key="d11">f6417f761f6b4cd0a7d9b990de73191f</data>
