      <data key="d11">bf1204dbb2854d71b3cd2e24753f5910</data>
      <data key="d12">10395</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DHA" target="EPA">
      <data key="d8">22.0</data>
      <data key="d9">DHA and EPA are both omega-3 fatty acids that play crucial roles in supporting brain health and cognitive function. They are frequently discussed in dietary recommendations due to their significant contributions to enhancing immune response and reducing inflammation. Together, DHA and EPA work synergistically to promote overall health and well-being.</data>
      <data key="d10">680ff2c9e67ec29c5952df66bd83c984,d2f16314e7098030a6780411d2e03023,dea64d5eb807430bc52e8bed6e30c393</data>
      <data key="d11">d1405f283a1948589048b6c9cf0a9cef</data>
      <data key="d12">10396</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DHA" target="MEDITERRANEAN DIET">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The Mediterranean diet is known to be rich in DHA, which contributes to its neuroprotective effects</data>
      <data key="d10">680ff2c9e67ec29c5952df66bd83c984</data>
      <data key="d11">f0cc7c4d744e49b8b866c73c46b30c7f</data>
      <data key="d12">10397</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DHA" target="COGNITIVE DECLINE">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">DHA is associated with reducing cognitive decline and improving brain health</data>
      <data key="d10">680ff2c9e67ec29c5952df66bd83c984</data>
      <data key="d11">36936aadb1614210ba9b0887235ecd6b</data>
      <data key="d12">10398</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DHA" target="ALZHEIMER'S DISEASE">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">DHA may contribute to preventing the development of Alzheimer's disease by counteracting beta-amyloid formation</data>
      <data key="d10">dd8c7ee9ef48992cebb11e84fbb0fe34</data>
      <data key="d11">0fdd1755b44c416cbffc99746f5e2dd0</data>
      <data key="d12">10399</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DHA" target="CVD">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">DHA is associated with cardiovascular health benefits, including lowering triglycerides and LDL cholesterol</data>
      <data key="d10">dd8c7ee9ef48992cebb11e84fbb0fe34</data>
      <data key="d11">53082a4dc401433db86f54a78ff11980</data>
      <data key="d12">10400</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DHA" target="AMERICAN HEART ASSOCIATION">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The American Heart Association published a study recommending omega-6 intake and discussing the importance of omega-3 fatty acids like DHA</data>
      <data key="d10">bfe7b32b596449644b274ed7486a507a</data>
      <data key="d11">3157b8674d144c24a42155f27e81ba72</data>
      <data key="d12">10401</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DHA" target="ASOCIACI&#211;N INTERNACIONAL PARA EL ESTUDIO DE LOS &#193;CIDOS GRASOS Y L&#205;PIDOS">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The ISSFAL advises on the intake of DHA as part of healthy dietary practices</data>
      <data key="d10">bfe7b32b596449644b274ed7486a507a</data>
      <data key="d11">4a5530fb25704458964d6dcdd9c0dd53</data>
      <data key="d12">10402</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DHA" target="AGENCIA FRANCESA PARA LA SEGURIDAD SANITARIA DE LOS ALIMENTOS">
      <data key="d8">5.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The AFSSA establishes dietary recommendations that include DHA</data>
      <data key="d10">bfe7b32b596449644b274ed7486a507a</data>
      <data key="d11">c235e5d512d24ae2b880de870cc1f5a6</data>
      <data key="d12">10403</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DHA" target="FUNDACI&#211;N BRIT&#193;NICA PARA LA NUTRICI&#211;N">
      <data key="d8">5.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The BNF provides guidance on the intake of DHA as part of a balanced diet</data>
      <data key="d10">bfe7b32b596449644b274ed7486a507a</data>
      <data key="d11">731987ada8794cc4b14687ae6deb0329</data>
      <data key="d12">10404</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DHA" target="CARDIOVASCULAR RISK">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">DHA is an omega-3 fatty acid that has been shown to reduce cardiovascular risk</data>
      <data key="d10">e1766b4a9f6cff776650a29195cee9fc</data>
      <data key="d11">c365c9a141d541f6a91ac915a809c1e8</data>
      <data key="d12">10405</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DHA" target="CYSTIC FIBROSIS FOUNDATION">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The Cystic Fibrosis Foundation suggests DHA supplementation as a way to improve inflammatory responses in cystic fibrosis patients</data>
      <data key="d10">c2211f0deb7328a77cb632140690da03</data>
      <data key="d11">845f259ca0874b169e46a9585f45e80b</data>
      <data key="d12">10406</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DHA" target="F&#211;RMULAS EST&#193;NDAR">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Las f&#243;rmulas est&#225;ndar deben incluir DHA para cumplir con la nueva legislaci&#243;n europea.</data>
      <data key="d10">056e169253fe046c2922537bb79ba187</data>
      <data key="d11">7a28dfaf1d854b8ba2a7aa59d17bb985</data>
      <data key="d12">10407</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="RNPT" target="NUTRITIONAL MANAGEMENT">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Nutritional management is essential for the growth and development of RNPT.</data>
      <data key="d10">52bb736eec60ff1b81771029cc43f715</data>
      <data key="d11">f981ae8cdcc641bf8d4036b3089911f4</data>
      <data key="d12">10408</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="RNPT" target="RNMBPN">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">RNMBPN are a subset of RNPT who require additional nutritional support due to their very low birth weight.</data>
      <data key="d10">52bb736eec60ff1b81771029cc43f715</data>
      <data key="d11">47f385bcbf194f11a73dfd745893f682</data>
      <data key="d12">10409</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="RNPT" target="EBPN">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">EBPN are a more critical subset of RNPT, facing even greater challenges in growth and development.</data>
      <data key="d10">52bb736eec60ff1b81771029cc43f715</data>
      <data key="d11">3252236f97e34d51825d52cd29c7ed17</data>
      <data key="d12">10410</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="RNPT" target="RNT">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">RNT and RNPT are both categories of newborns receiving parenteral nutrition, with different nutritional needs based on their gestational age</data>
      <data key="d10">a0b6196d53d4eb1c8ca5b1a3a78e8fc7</data>
      <data key="d11">fd050a4aefca40e293a3467c3b80499d</data>
      <data key="d12">10411</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="RNPT" target="ACIDOSIS METABOLICA">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">RNPT may experience metabolic acidosis due to the composition of parenteral nutrition</data>
      <data key="d10">a0b6196d53d4eb1c8ca5b1a3a78e8fc7</data>
      <data key="d11">1b8f2a49c8ad4b17b05fd41719796d65</data>
      <data key="d12">10412</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="RNPT" target="NUTRICI&#211;N PEDI&#193;TRICA">
      <data key="d8">17.0</data>
      <data key="d9">NUTRICI&#211;N PEDI&#193;TRICA is dedicated to addressing the nutritional needs of RNPT (Reci&#233;n Nacidos Prematuros y de Bajo Peso al Nacer), a specific group of patients within pediatric nutrition. This field ensures that RNPT receive adequate nutrition essential for their growth and development, recognizing that they require tailored nutritional support to meet their unique health challenges.</data>
      <data key="d10">507eeea555c496a467930836fc4c1a39,e5b3805730df59cb36030c92aa33c194</data>
      <data key="d11">e3a8e54921e44bbb8e90eb93444492bd</data>
      <data key="d12">10413</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="RNPT" target="PACIENTES CR&#205;TICOS">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">RNPT patients are often considered pacientes cr&#237;ticos due to their vulnerable health status requiring specialized care</data>
      <data key="d10">df73c75d84a055e0a67bc7f14d35e9d5</data>
      <data key="d11">7e5535e88f7242baa26e83550c459bbf</data>
      <data key="d12">10414</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="RNPT" target="PEDIATRIC NUTRITION">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Premature newborns (RNPT) are a critical focus within pediatric nutrition due to their unique nutritional needs.</data>
      <data key="d10">f5175f0c433eb4e10840a41d8052c8e0</data>
      <data key="d11">df16941466494850aef1afb6c5dcf3d1</data>
      <data key="d12">10415</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="FORTIFICACI&#211;N DE LA LECHE MATERNA" target="ECN">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
