    </edge>
    <edge source="CALCIUM" target="ANOREXIA NERVOSA">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Calcium supplementation is recommended for patients with Anorexia Nervosa to support bone density recovery</data>
      <data key="d10">bb6a2caec3fa27e00fc1044b17147ccb</data>
      <data key="d11">8e827afd155c4cdca4dc36e1c6275714</data>
      <data key="d12">10489</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="CALCIUM" target="IRON">
      <data key="d8">5.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Calcium and iron are both essential nutrients that play a crucial role in children's diets and overall health. It is important to monitor the intake of these nutrients to ensure that children receive adequate amounts for their growth and development. Additionally, calcium supplementation is recommended alongside iron to help meet the dietary needs of patients, highlighting the interrelated importance of these two minerals in maintaining proper nutrition.</data>
      <data key="d10">9303a85464d02f1cc012aaca21edf9bb,9a0227d0ea548fa46814e6403be885ce</data>
      <data key="d11">265e9c47cf194dee9ad6752b188fd711</data>
