    <edge source="ENVEJECIMIENTO Y NUTRICI&#211;N" target="S&#205;NDROME DE FRAGILIDAD">
      <data key="d8">14.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The entity "ENVEJECIMIENTO Y NUTRICI&#211;N" focuses on the treatment of "S&#205;NDROME DE FRAGILIDAD" in elderly individuals through targeted nutritional and physical interventions. This area of study emphasizes the importance of managing frailty syndrome among the elderly, providing guidelines and strategies to enhance their overall health and well-being.</data>
      <data key="d10">4913cc391a44397e2e1ea12979e1fd58,6656dd3bdc79720504c3e4245f935d32</data>
      <data key="d11">ffd209aac447432b84621eb31e9e2589</data>
      <data key="d12">10831</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ENVEJECIMIENTO Y NUTRICI&#211;N" target="D. MIGUEL DE CERVANTES SAAVEDRA">
      <data key="d8">5.0</data>
      <data key="d9">D. Miguel de Cervantes Saavedra's quote is referenced in the context of healthy aging and nutrition</data>
      <data key="d10">d6c8f8036af0c4f0b6f7938c4bab491f</data>
      <data key="d11">eac1e302491447be957757a29a45c70e</data>
      <data key="d12">10832</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ENVEJECIMIENTO Y NUTRICI&#211;N" target="VECENAT">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Vegenat sponsors the series "Envejecimiento y Nutrici&#243;n," supporting the nutritional needs of older adults</data>
      <data key="d10">d6c8f8036af0c4f0b6f7938c4bab491f</data>
      <data key="d11">f95b18e9e6ad445eaa7cdd0c16ddc99b</data>
      <data key="d12">10833</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ENVEJECIMIENTO Y NUTRICI&#211;N" target="EUROPEAN COUNTRIES">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">European countries are implementing programs related to healthy aging, which is the focus of the "Envejecimiento y Nutrici&#243;n" series</data>
      <data key="d10">d6c8f8036af0c4f0b6f7938c4bab491f</data>
      <data key="d11">c55e5d44a3354a9a893bc570359d3851</data>
      <data key="d12">10834</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ENVEJECIMIENTO Y NUTRICI&#211;N" target="DIETA IDEAL PARA LOS MAYORES">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The study of aging and nutrition directly informs the ideal diet for older adults to address their specific health needs.</data>
      <data key="d10">368804d3e1f8a58c4e6c3a8210f08a35</data>
      <data key="d11">aafa7f30264e4fca8b7b88c93ba3966b</data>
      <data key="d12">10835</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ESTUDIO FRADEA" target="VAUPEL">
