      <data key="d12">10839</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="FRAILTY" target="DISABILITY">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Frail elderly individuals often experience disabilities that affect their daily living and overall health</data>
      <data key="d10">72bafac70ee8322d8f303cf94612b461</data>
      <data key="d11">3f9d7070ad8346bc8f470b756d1ebd67</data>
      <data key="d12">10840</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="FRAILTY" target="AGING">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Aging is a primary factor contributing to the development of frailty in elderly individuals</data>
      <data key="d10">72bafac70ee8322d8f303cf94612b461</data>
      <data key="d11">c82d5fb649fe4928896573009ff35e83</data>
      <data key="d12">10841</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="FRAILTY" target="ABIZANDA SOLER P.">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Abizanda Soler P. has conducted research and published findings related to the clinical syndrome of frailty in the elderly</data>
      <data key="d10">1052683f23a0c9825af9c5c1d39ceb2c</data>
      <data key="d11">5168912f13ab4979ab2e42ef4daccc1d</data>
      <data key="d12">10842</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="FRAILTY" target="EJERCICIOS DE RESISTENCIA">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Resistance exercises are recommended as a treatment to reduce the risk of frailty</data>
      <data key="d10">1052683f23a0c9825af9c5c1d39ceb2c</data>
      <data key="d11">063033af3f32473c8931ced2257deee5</data>
      <data key="d12">10843</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="FRAILTY" target="NUTRITIONAL INTERVENTION GUIDELINES">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Nutritional intervention guidelines are designed to address the needs of frail elderly patients</data>
      <data key="d10">87e62f930efe0b81911357297ccd271c</data>
      <data key="d11">7a7a6c9de89d450b91110ec636ce18df</data>
      <data key="d12">10844</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="FRAILTY" target="WOMEN'S HEALTH AND AGING STUDIES">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The Women's Health and Aging Studies investigate the association between nutrition and frailty in older women</data>
      <data key="d10">6d6fc66abf6c858e5c5e9e47eb1ff6d2</data>
      <data key="d11">62f579f0fe194c5d91240878014f4fea</data>
      <data key="d12">10845</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="FRAILTY" target="HEALTH, AGING AND BODY COMPOSITION STUDY">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The Health ABC study examines the relationship between dietary intake and the incidence of frailty in older adults</data>
      <data key="d10">6d6fc66abf6c858e5c5e9e47eb1ff6d2</data>
      <data key="d11">7d8b906b954044ccbf92dcaa17fdf10b</data>
      <data key="d12">10846</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="FRAILTY" target="WOMEN'S HEALTH INITIATIVE OBSERVATIONAL STUDY">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The WHI-OS investigates the impact of dietary protein intake on the incidence of frailty among older women</data>
      <data key="d10">6d6fc66abf6c858e5c5e9e47eb1ff6d2</data>
      <data key="d11">1322d6c4e015421a80ad19410a5045a0</data>
      <data key="d12">10847</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="FRAILTY" target="CAROTENOIDS">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Low levels of carotenoids have been associated with an increased risk of frailty</data>
      <data key="d10">6d6fc66abf6c858e5c5e9e47eb1ff6d2</data>
      <data key="d11">c24114024d2f41a6a799228166845eba</data>
      <data key="d12">10848</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="FRAILTY" target="ITALIAN INCHIANTI STUDY">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The inCHIANTI study examines the relationship between nutritional intake and frailty in older adults</data>
      <data key="d10">6d6fc66abf6c858e5c5e9e47eb1ff6d2</data>
      <data key="d11">db6cb4dd750d41dea6daeb2f6fc61018</data>
      <data key="d12">10849</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="FRAILTY" target="INFLAMMATION SYSTEM">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Frailty is often associated with the activation of the inflammation system, indicating a relationship between the two</data>
      <data key="d10">0903b40c7774225e89c5e798f9feef9b</data>
      <data key="d11">384a356d04964bf3bb433b3baadcda67</data>
      <data key="d12">10850</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="FRAILTY" target="COAGULATION SYSTEM">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Frailty can influence the coagulation system, affecting the body's ability to respond to stressors</data>
      <data key="d10">0903b40c7774225e89c5e798f9feef9b</data>
      <data key="d11">096ac18e01134742a7913cc7670c621d</data>
      <data key="d12">10851</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="FRAILTY" target="VITAMIN D DEFICIENCY">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Vitamin D deficiency is linked to increased frailty in older adults</data>
      <data key="d10">0903b40c7774225e89c5e798f9feef9b</data>
      <data key="d11">5a9f205ae35e45438e87b1243122ae39</data>
      <data key="d12">10852</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="FRAILTY" target="SARCOPEMIC OBESITY">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Sarcopenic obesity is a condition that can exacerbate frailty in older adults</data>
      <data key="d10">0903b40c7774225e89c5e798f9feef9b</data>
      <data key="d11">e26c4fa83d184970bc7707d0dc059180</data>
      <data key="d12">10853</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="FRAILTY" target="LONGITUDINAL ENGLISH STUDY">
      <data key="d8">5.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The Longitudinal English Study provides data on the prevalence of frailty among older adults</data>
      <data key="d10">a830f202c73ba48c11fb8863e0e4a642</data>
      <data key="d11">75cb9342889446139a877cd57000d16c</data>
      <data key="d12">10854</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="FRAILTY" target="IL-6">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La IL-6 est&#225; asociada con un estado proinflamatorio que contribuye a la fragilidad en los ancianos.</data>
      <data key="d10">4b3664b368fad59fd55189a65e19b000</data>
      <data key="d11">ae9cfd02f9974f429ab12ff520a82d9e</data>
      <data key="d12">10855</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="FRAILTY" target="IL-1">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La IL-1 se relaciona con la inflamaci&#243;n que puede exacerbar la fragilidad en la poblaci&#243;n anciana.</data>
      <data key="d10">4b3664b368fad59fd55189a65e19b000</data>
      <data key="d11">5f85fb85daf34f9e913f86f8216fe0e6</data>
      <data key="d12">10856</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="FRAILTY" target="FNT-&#913;">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">El FNT-&#945; est&#225; involucrado en la respuesta inflamatoria que se asocia con la fragilidad en los ancianos.</data>
      <data key="d10">4b3664b368fad59fd55189a65e19b000</data>
      <data key="d11">fe7f1e6142ae4747972a206eb3e0d0c1</data>
      <data key="d12">10857</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="FRAILTY" target="SISTEMA INMUNE">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">El sistema inmune alterado contribuye al estado proinflamatorio que se asocia con la fragilidad en los ancianos.</data>
      <data key="d10">4b3664b368fad59fd55189a65e19b000</data>
      <data key="d11">974ab5483c9745228a2f8d64858a616a</data>
      <data key="d12">10858</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="FRAILTY" target="SISTEMA NEUROENDOCRINO">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Los cambios en el sistema neuroendocrino, como la disminuci&#243;n de hormonas anab&#243;licas, est&#225;n relacionados con la fragilidad en el envejecimiento.</data>
      <data key="d10">4b3664b368fad59fd55189a65e19b000</data>
      <data key="d11">6453477becb14a0d9d178969a4a66c44</data>
      <data key="d12">10859</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="FRAILTY" target="EXERCISE">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Exercise is a key intervention to reduce the effects of frailty and improve physical function in elderly individuals</data>
      <data key="d10">5898660be8944e9248ba187ffd7553b1</data>
      <data key="d11">3b80a47502374a71aa126e8b55ffe288</data>
      <data key="d12">10860</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="FRAILTY" target="EUROPEAN WORKING GROUP ON SARCOPENIA IN OLDER PEOPLE">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The European Working Group on Sarcopenia in Older People also addresses frailty in their guidelines and definitions</data>
      <data key="d10">8205166235be6abd77947eb2f7c5ab27</data>
      <data key="d11">48a2681d2ff84325b53e23f294073f0d</data>
      <data key="d12">10861</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="FRAILTY" target="MEDITERRANEAN DIET">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The Mediterranean diet has been linked to a decrease in the incidence of frailty among older adults</data>
      <data key="d10">8205166235be6abd77947eb2f7c5ab27</data>
      <data key="d11">81b31f4ec040462ebcd7cb4515f9ad55</data>
      <data key="d12">10862</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ESTUDIO DE ENVEJECIMIENTO SALUDABLE EN TOLEDO" target="ONON">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Onon&#8217;s article in 1968 linked aging and fragility, influencing studies like the Healthy Aging Study in Toledo</data>
      <data key="d10">e09463a0b899f9cd54a1daefc265ca39</data>
      <data key="d11">a501fde474b545d8bca0de0e8794c199</data>
      <data key="d12">10863</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ESTUDIO DE ENVEJECIMIENTO SALUDABLE EN TOLEDO" target="WINOGRAD">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Winograd's classification of elderly patients informs the research conducted in the Toledo study</data>
      <data key="d10">e09463a0b899f9cd54a1daefc265ca39</data>
      <data key="d11">56e760a55dd1436681e3758002de9164</data>
      <data key="d12">10864</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="SPIRDUSO" target="BORTZ">
      <data key="d8">5.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Spirduso's relation of fragility to the human condition complements Bortz's characterization of fragility</data>
      <data key="d10">e09463a0b899f9cd54a1daefc265ca39</data>
      <data key="d11">d051343a11624be18f46b0fbc9cb725b</data>
      <data key="d12">10865</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="BUCHNER" target="WAGNER">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Buchner's review of fragility as a precursor to disability aligns with Wagner's definitions</data>
      <data key="d10">e09463a0b899f9cd54a1daefc265ca39</data>
      <data key="d11">8c22296b5a3b45a28f971bf7b4726d66</data>
      <data key="d12">10866</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="BROCKLEHURST" target="BROWN">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Brocklehurst's dynamic model of fragility includes elements that Brown suggests are essential for identifying fragility</data>
      <data key="d10">e09463a0b899f9cd54a1daefc265ca39</data>
      <data key="d11">425516e490be46048541adf491c1fe6b</data>
      <data key="d12">10867</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="BROWN" target="TRASPLANTE DE C&#201;LULAS HEMATOL&#211;GICAS">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Brown realiz&#243; un estudio sobre la administraci&#243;n de glutamina en adultos sometidos a trasplante de c&#233;lulas hematol&#243;gicas.</data>
      <data key="d10">3e6ae05671fed21e332ee155332df21e</data>
      <data key="d11">f55401b2e1c042d3a8805c6196fe90a8</data>
      <data key="d12">10868</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="FRAGILIDAD" target="MODELO DE D&#201;FICITS ACUMULATIVOS">
      <data key="d8">5.0</data>
      <data key="d9">El modelo de d&#233;ficits acumulativos es uno de los modelos utilizados para evaluar la fragilidad</data>
