    <edge source="ABIZANDA SOLER P" target="REV ESP GERIATR GERONTOL">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Abizanda Soler P has published articles in the Revista Espa&#241;ola de Geriatr&#237;a y Gerontolog&#237;a, contributing to the field of geriatrics and the study of frailty.</data>
      <data key="d10">caab2e12a2bce3c947d663cf8b71cb67</data>
      <data key="d11">e0a7e040ff634a68b6aee2b7db84f1f4</data>
