    </edge>
    <edge source="ABIZANDA SOLER P" target="SARCOPEMIA">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Abizanda Soler P's research focuses on frailty and sarcopenia, highlighting the importance of understanding these conditions in the elderly.</data>
      <data key="d10">caab2e12a2bce3c947d663cf8b71cb67</data>
      <data key="d11">f92cc92ac6404787b371e54bbf21a5bf</data>
      <data key="d12">11045</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ABIZANDA SOLER P" target="FRAGILIDAD Y DEPENDENCIA">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Abizanda Soler P's research on frailty is directly related to the themes of frailty and dependency</data>
      <data key="d10">72bafac70ee8322d8f303cf94612b461</data>
      <data key="d11">65dd75bac0b04df5b0cd49d63cdd7ff7</data>
      <data key="d12">11046</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="SARCOPEMIA" target="IL-6">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Elevated levels of IL-6 are associated with the development of sarcopenia, indicating a link between inflammation and muscle loss in the elderly.</data>
      <data key="d10">caab2e12a2bce3c947d663cf8b71cb67</data>
      <data key="d11">f9f9493d46834c78b0bc2c37dda17a27</data>
