      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="SARCOPEMIA" target="IL-1">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">IL-1 is involved in inflammatory processes that can contribute to the development of sarcopenia in older adults.</data>
      <data key="d10">caab2e12a2bce3c947d663cf8b71cb67</data>
      <data key="d11">ef64b90af60b4b42afee369a1d9bc209</data>
      <data key="d12">11048</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="SARCOPEMIA" target="PROTE&#205;NA C REACTIVA">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Increased levels of C-reactive protein are often found in frail elderly individuals, indicating a relationship with sarcopenia.</data>
      <data key="d10">caab2e12a2bce3c947d663cf8b71cb67</data>
      <data key="d11">2add202d12df470a95a9b6291863c848</data>
