    <edge source="MEDITERRANEAN DIET" target="FRUITS">
      <data key="d8">17.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The Mediterranean diet emphasizes the importance of fruits as a crucial element, promoting their daily consumption. Fruits are not only a staple in this dietary pattern but also play a significant role in supporting cognitive health. This highlights the integral part that fruits serve in the Mediterranean diet, contributing to overall well-being and mental function.</data>
      <data key="d10">52bc63fdc8f15b328d9033bca7021363,c4f12f866dc714cdbb2323a920f524c2</data>
      <data key="d11">98b5d16e8e9f4fa7920174effd83eb43</data>
