    <edge source="OMEGA-3 FATTY ACIDS" target="FISH CONSUMPTION">
      <data key="d8">16.0</data>
      <data key="d9">OMEGA-3 FATTY ACIDS are essential nutrients primarily obtained through FISH CONSUMPTION. Fish consumption is recognized as a significant source of omega-3 fatty acids, which are known for their numerous health benefits, particularly in promoting heart health. Additionally, these fatty acids have been the subject of research regarding their potential effects on cancer risk. Overall, increased fish consumption correlates with a higher intake of omega-3 fatty acids, contributing positively to overall health.</data>
      <data key="d10">97c27548ceb554d425303875efc5f9b4,bb2e69a0ff4c25a21149882162922c8d,e271766bdc88e84209e5cdac4adc0724</data>
