    </edge>
    <edge source="OMEGA-3 FATTY ACIDS" target="CARDIOVASCULAR DISEASE">
      <data key="d8">23.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Omega-3 fatty acids are recognized for their protective effects against cardiovascular disease. Research indicates that these essential fatty acids are linked to a reduced risk of developing cardiovascular conditions. Additionally, omega-3 fatty acids have been associated with a lower likelihood of cardiovascular disease, highlighting their potential role in promoting heart health.</data>
      <data key="d10">6a95bf35e698b03ca552f2c75d5d60ef,bb2e69a0ff4c25a21149882162922c8d,e271766bdc88e84209e5cdac4adc0724</data>
