    </edge>
    <edge source="PERSONAS MAYORES" target="EURRECA">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">EURRECA is focused on developing micronutrient recommendations that are particularly relevant for older adults who are at risk of deficiencies.</data>
      <data key="d10">aa44a32ccc29ae80ddbbc4a77b33a297</data>
      <data key="d11">a9c5b0db395e436b826a0796254a57da</data>
      <data key="d12">11471</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PERSONAS MAYORES" target="ESTUDIO DE 1992">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The 1992 study focused on older adults and demonstrated the benefits of mineral and vitamin supplementation in reducing infections.</data>
      <data key="d10">aa44a32ccc29ae80ddbbc4a77b33a297</data>
      <data key="d11">6e846ee1861b49fa849b12b7505613d8</data>
      <data key="d12">11472</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PERSONAS MAYORES" target="ESTUDIO DE 1993">
      <data key="d8">5.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The 1993 study evaluated older adults and found no benefits from vitamin and mineral supplementation, highlighting the need for further research in this demographic.</data>
      <data key="d10">aa44a32ccc29ae80ddbbc4a77b33a297</data>
      <data key="d11">3cd44a624ec44cad97213bd813ab73b0</data>
      <data key="d12">11473</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PERSONAS MAYORES" target="ESTUDIO DE 1997">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The 1997 study assessed older adults and showed that specific antioxidant micronutrient supplementation could reduce infections, indicating its importance for this group.</data>
      <data key="d10">aa44a32ccc29ae80ddbbc4a77b33a297</data>
      <data key="d11">19d59720f0074c4098156a0b7896d01e</data>
      <data key="d12">11474</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PERSONAS MAYORES" target="ENSAYO CL&#205;NICO 2003">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The 2003 clinical trial evaluated older adults and found that supplementation had the best results in diabetic patients, emphasizing the need for tailored approaches.</data>
      <data key="d10">aa44a32ccc29ae80ddbbc4a77b33a297</data>
      <data key="d11">31c7bc18b7a442f19110ef4ffbc9c432</data>
      <data key="d12">11475</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PERSONAS MAYORES" target="ESTUDIO DE 2005">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The 2005 study involved older adults and found no significant benefits from supplementation, suggesting that not all older adults may benefit equally from micronutrient intake.</data>
      <data key="d10">aa44a32ccc29ae80ddbbc4a77b33a297</data>
      <data key="d11">d1a6d73c6f064ee1ba8312a8ac2416bd</data>
      <data key="d12">11476</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PERSONAS MAYORES" target="MINERALES">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Older adults are at risk of mineral deficiencies, making mineral supplementation important for their health.</data>
      <data key="d10">aa44a32ccc29ae80ddbbc4a77b33a297</data>
      <data key="d11">1557b8775f954f07b0beb9c0acabfb18</data>
      <data key="d12">11477</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PERSONAS MAYORES" target="DEFICITS DE MICRONUTRIENTES">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Older adults are particularly vulnerable to micronutrient deficiencies, which can lead to various health issues.</data>
      <data key="d10">aa44a32ccc29ae80ddbbc4a77b33a297</data>
      <data key="d11">9b10cd2a468a41bfac433502f7130393</data>
      <data key="d12">11478</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PERSONAS MAYORES" target="ESTR&#211;GENOS">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The reduction of estrogen levels in older adults significantly impacts their bone health and increases the risk of osteoporosis.</data>
      <data key="d10">aa44a32ccc29ae80ddbbc4a77b33a297</data>
      <data key="d11">1b807de1605445f38ef92525d351296d</data>
      <data key="d12">11479</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PERSONAS MAYORES" target="DEFICIENCIA DE ZINC">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
