      <data key="d9">The J AM MED DIR ASSOC and ARCH INTERN MED are two journals that concentrate on medical research pertinent to older adults. They both emphasize studies related to frailty and nutrition, highlighting their shared commitment to exploring the implications of frailty on health. This connection underscores their role in advancing knowledge and understanding of issues affecting the aging population.</data>
