      <data key="d9">Milaneschi asoci&#243; la dieta mediterr&#225;nea a un menor declinar de la movilidad en ancianos</data>
      <data key="d10">7e1b90e2c8714b39e283be229f6d5de3</data>
      <data key="d11">222ea2df22544bc79a36e064823d33b9</data>
      <data key="d12">11508</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DIETA MEDITERR&#193;NEA" target="TALEGAWKAR">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Talegawkar demostr&#243; que la adherencia a la dieta mediterr&#225;nea se asocia a menos probabilidad de desarrollar fragilidad</data>
      <data key="d10">7e1b90e2c8714b39e283be229f6d5de3</data>
      <data key="d11">e33662aee5f144849b8de0710dd11478</data>
      <data key="d12">11509</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DIETA MEDITERR&#193;NEA" target="DISLIPIDEMIA">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The Mediterranean diet is recommended for managing dyslipidemia by optimizing lipid profiles</data>
      <data key="d10">5f7420a865ebf111326e5fc746c66c10</data>
      <data key="d11">f32ffbf4c8f7429187f4de9443aaf73a</data>
      <data key="d12">11510</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DIETA MEDITERR&#193;NEA" target="CARDIOVASCULAR SALUD">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La dieta mediterr&#225;nea is known for its positive effects on cardiovascular health</data>
      <data key="d10">c78125c02ea4d5afdf5cb5ac4baeeb27</data>
      <data key="d11">41994a2ae5944a8cb7ad99f628317254</data>
      <data key="d12">11511</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DIETA MEDITERR&#193;NEA" target="DIETOTERAPIA">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Dieta Mediterr&#225;nea is a significant topic within Dietoterapia, promoting healthy eating habits</data>
      <data key="d10">7852af9e2886d0d889fbc056d0a75f21</data>
      <data key="d11">2615c07a11a546bca2d722bd1bc5dcc2</data>
      <data key="d12">11512</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DIETA MEDITERR&#193;NEA" target="UNESCO">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La dieta mediterr&#225;nea fue inscrita por la UNESCO como Patrimonio Cultural Inmaterial de la Humanidad en 2010</data>
      <data key="d10">05ad4e8782ea0fc2d2347d73a0b5c704</data>
      <data key="d11">b0fd879787af48cf8e1da9b2edf7cea9</data>
      <data key="d12">11513</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DIETA MEDITERR&#193;NEA" target="FUNDACI&#211;N DIETA MEDITERR&#193;NEA">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Fundaci&#243;n Dieta Mediterr&#225;nea promotes the Mediterranean diet as a means to improve health outcomes, particularly cardiovascular health.</data>
      <data key="d10">c0b1584b66f6fc74e457e1281d64cd49</data>
      <data key="d11">ec33084257e843d788491e84e0dc21df</data>
      <data key="d12">11514</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DIETA MEDITERR&#193;NEA" target="ESTUDIO PREDIMED">
      <data key="d8">25.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The "DIETA MEDITERR&#193;NEA" is a dietary pattern that has been extensively studied for its health benefits, particularly in relation to cardiovascular health. The "ESTUDIO PREDIMED" (Prevenci&#243;n con Dieta Mediterr&#225;nea) specifically analyzed the effects of the Mediterranean diet on health and adiposity. This study demonstrated significant positive effects of the Mediterranean diet on cardiovascular health, including a reduction in cardiovascular events. Furthermore, the ESTUDIO PREDIMED provided scientific evidence supporting the benefits of the Mediterranean diet in preventing cardiovascular complications. Overall, the findings from the ESTUDIO PREDIMED highlight the Mediterranean diet as a beneficial dietary approach for improving health outcomes, particularly in relation to cardiovascular disease.</data>
      <data key="d10">01302d2656a8cbb49cb7505b3182cc63,4e6568999eba5abd852eedecc5fc580f,c0b1584b66f6fc74e457e1281d64cd49</data>
      <data key="d11">648a00060f0f4e12bac346b6473f5237</data>
      <data key="d12">11515</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DIETA MEDITERR&#193;NEA" target="EXCESO DE PESO">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The Mediterranean diet is recommended to help manage excess weight and reduce cardiovascular risk.</data>
      <data key="d10">c0b1584b66f6fc74e457e1281d64cd49</data>
      <data key="d11">bd2e6fa8fc864c8691a48787b52196cb</data>
      <data key="d12">11516</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DIETA MEDITERR&#193;NEA" target="PREDIMED DIABETES">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The PREDIMED Diabetes study highlights the effectiveness of the Mediterranean diet in reducing the risk of type 2 diabetes.</data>
      <data key="d10">72d0be9d03c79097f867a8af2e3e89e4</data>
      <data key="d11">3e910d34dcb54046a4237d3b8828f48c</data>
      <data key="d12">11517</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DIETA MEDITERR&#193;NEA" target="DIABETES TIPO 2">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The Mediterranean diet is associated with a significant reduction in the risk of developing type 2 diabetes.</data>
      <data key="d10">72d0be9d03c79097f867a8af2e3e89e4</data>
      <data key="d11">58cbffcfc8f64fa5a16fa05f010a976f</data>
      <data key="d12">11518</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DIETA MEDITERR&#193;NEA" target="SOCIETADES AMERICANAS DE DIABETES Y CARDIOLOG&#205;A">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The American Diabetes and Cardiology Societies endorse the Mediterranean diet for improving glycemic control and cardiometabolic risk factors.</data>
      <data key="d10">72d0be9d03c79097f867a8af2e3e89e4</data>
      <data key="d11">c557d2bbaae0428b8d2a00901a41511a</data>
      <data key="d12">11519</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DIETA MEDITERR&#193;NEA" target="S&#205;NDROME METAB&#211;LICO">
      <data key="d8">14.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The Mediterranean diet is associated with a significant reduction in the prevalence and progression of metabolic syndrome. This dietary pattern plays a crucial role in the prevention of metabolic syndrome, highlighting its importance in promoting overall health and well-being.</data>
      <data key="d10">035d53a7f46fdb72c0a939265667044b,72d0be9d03c79097f867a8af2e3e89e4</data>
      <data key="d11">c8a1d12385d74ef6bc38f45d4e326a62</data>
      <data key="d12">11520</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DIETA MEDITERR&#193;NEA" target="NUTRIENTES ANTIINFLAMATORIOS">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The Mediterranean diet increases the intake of anti-inflammatory nutrients, contributing to its health benefits.</data>
      <data key="d10">72d0be9d03c79097f867a8af2e3e89e4</data>
      <data key="d11">3163ddb5419449c1abeed2a9799ec60f</data>
      <data key="d12">11521</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DIETA MEDITERR&#193;NEA" target="NUTRIENTES PROINFLAMATORIOS">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The Mediterranean diet reduces the intake of pro-inflammatory nutrients, which is beneficial for health.</data>
      <data key="d10">72d0be9d03c79097f867a8af2e3e89e4</data>
      <data key="d11">c110c58a3f5c48138cf56ad263faacbe</data>
      <data key="d12">11522</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DIETA MEDITERR&#193;NEA" target="ACEITE DE OLIVA VIRGEN EXTRA">
      <data key="d8">18.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The Mediterranean diet is characterized by its emphasis on healthy eating patterns, with extra virgin olive oil being a key component. This oil is renowned for its numerous health benefits, making it an essential part of the Mediterranean dietary framework. Both descriptions highlight the importance of extra virgin olive oil in promoting health within the context of the Mediterranean diet.</data>
      <data key="d10">4e6568999eba5abd852eedecc5fc580f,72d0be9d03c79097f867a8af2e3e89e4</data>
      <data key="d11">368f4e1c2e0040419990d4dca78686b6</data>
      <data key="d12">11523</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DIETA MEDITERR&#193;NEA" target="HEMOGLOBINA GLICOSILADA">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The Mediterranean diet has been shown to reduce glycated hemoglobin levels in patients with type 2 diabetes.</data>
      <data key="d10">72d0be9d03c79097f867a8af2e3e89e4</data>
      <data key="d11">1502d4db1f9740c58dbc23920d4e0b96</data>
      <data key="d12">11524</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DIETA MEDITERR&#193;NEA" target="CIRCUNFERENCIA DE LA CINTURA">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Adherence to the Mediterranean diet is linked to a reduction in waist circumference, indicating improved health outcomes.</data>
      <data key="d10">72d0be9d03c79097f867a8af2e3e89e4</data>
      <data key="d11">815610f3603f46568fe1bba24b43b814</data>
      <data key="d12">11525</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DIETA MEDITERR&#193;NEA" target="ESTUDIO PREDIMED PLUS">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">El estudio PREDIMED PLUS evaluar&#225; el efecto de la dieta mediterr&#225;nea en la salud a largo plazo</data>
      <data key="d10">01302d2656a8cbb49cb7505b3182cc63</data>
      <data key="d11">550f53324b014f47b9f9569488665f98</data>
      <data key="d12">11526</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DIETA MEDITERR&#193;NEA" target="MINERALES">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La dieta mediterr&#225;nea promueve un mayor consumo de minerales, esenciales para la salud</data>
      <data key="d10">01302d2656a8cbb49cb7505b3182cc63</data>
      <data key="d11">e3c82929ce2c47838dcbed54433675bd</data>
      <data key="d12">11527</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DIETA MEDITERR&#193;NEA" target="POLIFENOLES">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La dieta mediterr&#225;nea es rica en polifenoles, que ayudan a combatir la inflamaci&#243;n</data>
      <data key="d10">01302d2656a8cbb49cb7505b3182cc63</data>
      <data key="d11">7bfb77cabaff468aaf624cb2f57e72b8</data>
      <data key="d12">11528</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DIETA MEDITERR&#193;NEA" target="AZ&#218;CARES REFINADOS">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La adherencia a la dieta mediterr&#225;nea reduce el consumo de az&#250;cares refinados, que son proinflamatorios</data>
      <data key="d10">01302d2656a8cbb49cb7505b3182cc63</data>
      <data key="d11">ea61916981784186b29409f066a8a9f7</data>
      <data key="d12">11529</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DIETA MEDITERR&#193;NEA" target="GRASAS TRANS">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La dieta mediterr&#225;nea evita las grasas trans, que son perjudiciales para la salud</data>
      <data key="d10">01302d2656a8cbb49cb7505b3182cc63</data>
      <data key="d11">f5b8c1fb7a9045e58a56353f9f4b3197</data>
      <data key="d12">11530</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DIETA MEDITERR&#193;NEA" target="ALIMENTOS DE ALTA DENSIDAD CAL&#211;RICA">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La dieta mediterr&#225;nea limita los alimentos de alta densidad cal&#243;rica para prevenir el aumento de peso</data>
      <data key="d10">01302d2656a8cbb49cb7505b3182cc63</data>
      <data key="d11">686fe22d664745c2aa05d4d90d1e82b1</data>
      <data key="d12">11531</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DIETA MEDITERR&#193;NEA" target="DIABETES MELLITUS TIPO 2">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The Mediterranean diet is associated with a reduced risk of developing type 2 diabetes mellitus, particularly in high-risk populations. Research indicates that adherence to this dietary pattern not only lowers the likelihood of onset but also demonstrates a preventive effect against the development of type 2 diabetes mellitus.</data>
      <data key="d10">035d53a7f46fdb72c0a939265667044b,4e6568999eba5abd852eedecc5fc580f</data>
      <data key="d11">4982dfb1d75c479f9f0094f2dbfff989</data>
      <data key="d12">11532</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DIETA MEDITERR&#193;NEA" target="SALUD P&#218;BLICA">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Las estrategias de Salud P&#250;blica deben promover la dieta mediterr&#225;nea para mejorar la salud de la poblaci&#243;n.</data>
      <data key="d10">035d53a7f46fdb72c0a939265667044b</data>
      <data key="d11">262b7a90a4024a52a20521853414e8cd</data>
      <data key="d12">11533</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DIETA MEDITERR&#193;NEA" target="ENFERMEDAD CARDIOMETAB&#211;LICA">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La dieta mediterr&#225;nea puede ayudar a reducir el riesgo de enfermedad cardiometab&#243;lica a trav&#233;s de una alimentaci&#243;n rica en nutrientes.</data>
      <data key="d10">035d53a7f46fdb72c0a939265667044b</data>
      <data key="d11">14650a42cae149a8acbae9f648a35b7c</data>
      <data key="d12">11534</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DIETA MEDITERR&#193;NEA" target="PREDIMED">
      <data key="d8">17.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The Mediterranean diet is a central focus of the PREDIMED study, which evaluates its effects on cardiovascular health and its protective benefits against chronic diseases. The study aims to assess how adherence to the Mediterranean diet can influence overall health outcomes, particularly in relation to cardiovascular conditions.</data>
      <data key="d10">1ad5b4d7f49ca2d3d44adc99227f07d8,633a3a90a82e02d05096b361ddba3ad7</data>
      <data key="d11">b2274aae40f04ffeaf843d5a7e32b190</data>
      <data key="d12">11535</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DIETA MEDITERR&#193;NEA" target="DIETA HIPERPROTEICA">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La dieta hiperproteica y la dieta mediterr&#225;nea son enfoques diet&#233;ticos diferentes que se utilizan para la p&#233;rdida de peso y la salud general, pero tienen principios nutricionales distintos.</data>
      <data key="d10">0fba67c4e6cffbde6f31d895bedc4bf7</data>
      <data key="d11">a6bec06f10894f188c9820e5f297099a</data>
      <data key="d12">11536</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DIETA MEDITERR&#193;NEA" target="CEREALES INTEGRALES">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Los cereales integrales son un componente fundamental de la dieta mediterr&#225;nea, contribuyendo a su perfil saludable.</data>
      <data key="d10">4e6568999eba5abd852eedecc5fc580f</data>
      <data key="d11">f2c87e81387e4cd2ba3dabef7e72a2c0</data>
      <data key="d12">11537</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DIETA MEDITERR&#193;NEA" target="VERDURAS">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Las verduras son una parte integral de la dieta mediterr&#225;nea, aportando nutrientes y fibra.</data>
      <data key="d10">4e6568999eba5abd852eedecc5fc580f</data>
      <data key="d11">b91493cc7aaf4efcb95a847960ceb190</data>
      <data key="d12">11538</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DIETA MEDITERR&#193;NEA" target="CARNES BLANCAS">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La dieta mediterr&#225;nea favorece el consumo de carnes blancas sobre las rojas, lo que contribuye a una alimentaci&#243;n m&#225;s saludable.</data>
      <data key="d10">4e6568999eba5abd852eedecc5fc580f</data>
      <data key="d11">0018a97221014853b392d265872400d9</data>
      <data key="d12">11539</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DIETA MEDITERR&#193;NEA" target="CARNES ROJAS">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La dieta mediterr&#225;nea limita el consumo de carnes rojas, lo que se asocia con beneficios para la salud.</data>
      <data key="d10">4e6568999eba5abd852eedecc5fc580f</data>
      <data key="d11">cbaccef3af4b46f1a19f73ee41c107a8</data>
      <data key="d12">11540</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DIETA MEDITERR&#193;NEA" target="L&#193;CTEOS">
      <data key="d8">5.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La dieta mediterr&#225;nea se caracteriza por un bajo consumo de l&#225;cteos, lo que puede contribuir a la salud general.</data>
      <data key="d10">4e6568999eba5abd852eedecc5fc580f</data>
      <data key="d11">0be1e40a768d4b1d9bcf73d1145d807a</data>
      <data key="d12">11541</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DIETA MEDITERR&#193;NEA" target="AZ&#218;CARES A&#209;ADIDOS">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La dieta mediterr&#225;nea se distingue por su bajo consumo de az&#250;cares a&#241;adidos, lo que ayuda a prevenir enfermedades.</data>
      <data key="d10">4e6568999eba5abd852eedecc5fc580f</data>
      <data key="d11">121d4fc8d4ec4103a232048e39d41cc9</data>
      <data key="d12">11542</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DIETA MEDITERR&#193;NEA" target="AGENCIA ESPA&#209;OLA DE SEGURIDAD ALIMENTARIA Y NUTRICI&#211;N">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">AESAN provides guidelines and information regarding the Mediterranean diet and its health benefits</data>
      <data key="d10">64347a9be918a67f786cbdf9f9db9c8a</data>
      <data key="d11">60cd37a8481f4ee8baf09ff0d362035f</data>
      <data key="d12">11543</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DIETA MEDITERR&#193;NEA" target="DIETAS MILAGRO">
      <data key="d8">5.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Miracle diets are often compared to the Mediterranean diet, which is considered healthier and more sustainable</data>
      <data key="d10">64347a9be918a67f786cbdf9f9db9c8a</data>
      <data key="d11">97d473a2dba040579eaa7b9891e03ea7</data>
      <data key="d12">11544</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DIETA MEDITERR&#193;NEA" target="AHA/ACC">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The AHA/ACC acknowledges the Mediterranean diet in their guidelines, despite its lower evidence rating for cardiovascular risk.</data>
      <data key="d10">633a3a90a82e02d05096b361ddba3ad7</data>
      <data key="d11">e75f987b89204e3086dcf92bffa16d39</data>
      <data key="d12">11545</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DIETA MEDITERR&#193;NEA" target="EPOC">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The Mediterranean diet is recommended for patients with EPOC due to its potential benefits on lung function and overall health</data>
      <data key="d10">cbadd445efd24c3f7ab682a373e416cf</data>
      <data key="d11">07da268d51124365a3f45847ba948bce</data>
      <data key="d12">11546</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="CREATINA" target="MIOSTATINA">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Myostatin blockers and creatine are both being researched for their potential to enhance muscle growth</data>
      <data key="d10">3f21321c62f3e5ee31c822e90ca6b89e</data>
      <data key="d11">d95208c1aa00454483610ddc8a544ba9</data>
      <data key="d12">11547</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="CREATINA" target="DEPORTISTAS">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Athletes use creatine to enhance their physical performance</data>
      <data key="d10">3e8ab018917854d76a0137102e0392bd</data>
      <data key="d11">c7bd10e947ea40f2a742667e041997ed</data>
      <data key="d12">11548</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="CREATINA" target="CAFE&#205;NA">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Ambas sustancias son ergog&#233;nicas y se utilizan para mejorar el rendimiento deportivo en diferentes tipos de actividades f&#237;sicas.</data>
      <data key="d10">fae6538f87888794da1ff0aaf0d842fe</data>
      <data key="d11">db40293e5ae14e5c892a9e66b7083620</data>
      <data key="d12">11549</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
