    <edge source="EJERCICIO F&#205;SICO" target="DEPORTISTA">
      <data key="d8">28.0</data>
      <data key="d9">EJERCICIO F&#205;SICO and DEPORTISTA are closely interconnected concepts, as the athlete (deportista) engages in physical exercise (ejercicio f&#237;sico) to enhance their fitness and performance levels. The practice of physical exercise is essential for athletes, as it not only aims to improve their physical condition but also necessitates proper nutrition and recovery strategies to support their training and overall well-being. Thus, the relationship between EJERCICIO F&#205;SICO and DEPORTISTA highlights the importance of structured physical activity in achieving optimal athletic performance.</data>
      <data key="d10">39da0855b83941d97766254aa36ed2fd,638446780cdd61df83a06944c4e15c15,ab9a942f3aa9ca3eb88bcd26fcd60ddb</data>
