    <edge source="MUJER" target="GASTO ENERG&#201;TICO BASAL">
      <data key="d8">11.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The basal energy expenditure (GASTO ENERG&#201;TICO BASAL) is calculated differently for men and women (MUJER), reflecting their distinct energy needs. The formula used to determine this expenditure is specifically tailored for women, acknowledging the variations in metabolic requirements between genders.</data>
      <data key="d10">148443357888793655b663333268775a,24e49b0b93b2307e2c4e7ac34f4d7f4b</data>
