      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="C&#193;NCER DE P&#193;NCREAS" target="INMUNONUTRICI&#211;N">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La inmunonutrici&#243;n se aplica en pacientes con c&#225;ncer de p&#225;ncreas para mejorar su recuperaci&#243;n postoperatoria</data>
      <data key="d10">2754a719b063eed550046e5b405be3d5</data>
      <data key="d11">66c04386d03f48a4b6c2845c1c47e49e</data>
      <data key="d12">11659</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="C&#193;NCER DE P&#193;NCREAS" target="QUIMIO O QUIMIORRADIOTERAPIA">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La quimio o quimiorradioterapia se utiliza en pacientes con c&#225;ncer de p&#225;ncreas antes de la cirug&#237;a</data>
      <data key="d10">2754a719b063eed550046e5b405be3d5</data>
      <data key="d11">44d09d1f454a495e89de05354b3f2e0e</data>
      <data key="d12">11660</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="C&#193;NCER DE P&#193;NCREAS" target="LUCAS ET AL">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Lucas et al's study specifically investigates the relationship between diet and the risk of developing c&#225;ncer de p&#225;ncreas.</data>
      <data key="d10">a13a13b249ba729ec581f7a16ec5eae5</data>
      <data key="d11">40d0e26b95864526b4862f1c80ab0193</data>
      <data key="d12">11661</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="AMINO&#193;CIDOS ESENCIALES" target="LEUCINA">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Leucine is a key essential amino acid that is particularly emphasized in the context of aging and muscle health.</data>
