      <data key="d11">7e41b7630ede457c92dc2d2825de65dc</data>
      <data key="d12">11684</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="CALCITRIOL" target="ERGOCALCIFEROL">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Calcitriol and ergocalciferol are both forms of vitamin D used in the treatment of deficiencies, with calcitriol being the active form</data>
      <data key="d10">313611d83ceda2a812387fbcffbedad6</data>
      <data key="d11">767479cd650f4875a4b5749eb79255d4</data>
