    </edge>
    <edge source="OSTEOPENIA" target="GSDIII">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Osteopenia can be a long-term complication in patients with Glycogen Storage Disease Type III (GSDIII).</data>
      <data key="d10">a3fd8bf0a5229c36813682803cd15e35,b5e899a3def3da339630eb0d2bfe4af8</data>
