    <edge source="LARSEN PR" target="WILLIAMS TEXTBOOK OF ENDOCRINOLOGY">
      <data key="d8">15.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Larsen PR is an editor of the "Williams Textbook of Endocrinology," a comprehensive resource that emphasizes hormonal regulation and disorders. The textbook also includes detailed information on specific conditions such as pheochromocytoma, highlighting its relevance in the field of endocrinology.</data>
      <data key="d10">05edb31ec01c621a00d71bd5868784e0,973f9100fbfeb9ef31038f51312620a9</data>
      <data key="d11">756549a2237249cba72aea03289a759d</data>
