    <edge source="KRONENBERG HM" target="WILLIAMS TEXTBOOK OF ENDOCRINOLOGY">
      <data key="d8">39.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Kronenberg HM is a prominent co-author and editor of the "Williams Textbook of Endocrinology," a comprehensive resource in the field of endocrinology. He has made significant contributions to the textbook's content, particularly in areas such as osteoporosis and hypercalcemia treatment. Additionally, the textbook includes detailed information on pheochromocytoma, reflecting Kronenberg's involvement in both endocrine research and education. His work in the textbook underscores his expertise and commitment to advancing knowledge in endocrinology.</data>
      <data key="d10">05edb31ec01c621a00d71bd5868784e0,08bc93c6dcf6df5ebf660f30b1f1ef2d,85df619f6d535bbe5c0485f540242903,973f9100fbfeb9ef31038f51312620a9,de7d109afad1dbd144cb8e76c49ed638</data>
