    <edge source="UPTODATE INC." target="WILLIAMS TEXTBOOK OF ENDOCRINOLOGY">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">UpToDate Inc. is a prominent resource in the field of medical information, particularly known for its comprehensive coverage of various health topics, including endocrine disorders. The Williams Textbook of Endocrinology serves as a valuable complement to the information provided by UpToDate Inc., enhancing the understanding of endocrine disorders. Additionally, the Williams Textbook is specifically referenced in UpToDate for its thorough exploration of vitamin D and its clinical implications, highlighting its significance as a trusted source in the field of endocrinology. Together, these entities contribute to a deeper understanding of endocrine health and related clinical practices.</data>
      <data key="d10">313611d83ceda2a812387fbcffbedad6,7f3df1437755b60344fdffd2ef3b8a9e</data>
