      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="UPTODATE INC." target="YOUNG WF, JR.">
      <data key="d8">15.0</data>
      <data key="d9">UpToDate Inc. is a reputable source of medical information, and Young WF, Jr. is a notable contributor to its content. He has authored articles that focus on the clinical presentation and treatment of pheochromocytoma, as well as contributing to the literature and guidelines concerning primary aldosteronism. Through his work, Young WF, Jr. has played a significant role in enhancing the understanding and management of these endocrine disorders within the medical community.</data>
