    <edge source="LHX3" target="DISPLASIA SEPT&#211;PTICA">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Mutations in LHX3 can lead to neurological anomalies, which are part of the symptoms of septo-optic dysplasia.</data>
