      <data key="d9">Nieman LK has made significant contributions to the medical literature on UpToDate, particularly focusing on Cushing's syndrome and hypercortisolism. This includes authoring literature reviews that provide comprehensive insights into these conditions, enhancing the resource's value for medical professionals seeking up-to-date information on the subject.</data>
