    <edge source="UPTODATE" target="HARRISON PRINCIPIOS DE MEDICINA INTERNA">
      <data key="d8">10.0</data>
      <data key="d9">UpToDate and Harrison Principios de Medicina Interna are both reputable sources of medical information that cover topics related to endocrinology. UpToDate offers current clinical information that often references or builds upon the foundational knowledge presented in Harrison's textbook, making them complementary resources for healthcare professionals seeking comprehensive insights into medical practices and principles.</data>
