    <edge source="UPTODATE" target="EUROPEAN SOCIETY OF ENDOCRINOLOGY">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">UpToDate and the European Society of Endocrinology are two organizations that play a significant role in providing clinical guidelines and resources for healthcare professionals, particularly concerning adrenal disorders. UpToDate offers current literature and guidelines that are likely to align with the recommendations set forth by the European Society of Endocrinology, ensuring that healthcare providers have access to the most relevant and up-to-date information in the field. Together, these organizations contribute to the advancement of knowledge and best practices in the management of adrenal disorders.</data>
      <data key="d10">1bfdc8a3b2272265ee6fd132fcf3a8ce,6ebb5385c8eda09a187e6d0595812bbf</data>
