    <edge source="CUSHING'S SYNDROME" target="METOPIRONA">
      <data key="d8">16.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Cushing's syndrome is a condition characterized by excessive cortisol production in the body. Metopirona, also known as Metopirone, is a medication utilized in the treatment of Cushing's syndrome. It functions by inhibiting the production of cortisol, thereby helping to manage the symptoms associated with this condition.</data>
