    </edge>
    <edge source="HORMONAS" target="HORMONA ESTIMULANTE DEL FOL&#205;CULO">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Follicle-stimulating hormone is another critical hormone involved in the regulation of reproductive processes.</data>
