      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">El s&#237;ndrome de ovario poliqu&#237;stico puede causar hiperprolactinemia debido a alteraciones hormonales.</data>
      <data key="d10">2b6e6d589cd4e83086e44c77205b3740</data>
      <data key="d11">d70023c451a0477a9e9fac382f3fde80</data>
      <data key="d12">12702</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HIPERPROLACTINEMIA" target="VENLAFAXINA">
      <data key="d8">5.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Venlafaxine may cause an increase in prolactin levels in some patients, contributing to hyperprolactinemia</data>
      <data key="d10">b344a34a623d4ade6b3ed6e1adae0016</data>
      <data key="d11">f78a15a1d64549c7b7c99c9ea925474f</data>
      <data key="d12">12703</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HIPERPROLACTINEMIA" target="BUPROPION">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Bupropion does not affect prolactin levels, thus it is not a cause of hyperprolactinemia</data>
