    <edge source="S&#205;NDROME DE OVARIO POLIQU&#205;STICO" target="DIABETES MELLITUS TYPE 2">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Polycystic Ovary Syndrome (PCOS) increases the risk of developing Diabetes Mellitus Type 2, particularly in women.</data>
      <data key="d10">34d62296f09da1a452febcc9ab8c18ad</data>
      <data key="d11">a336bd3041d8484192d220ec5883854b</data>
      <data key="d12">12714</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="S&#205;NDROME DE OVARIO POLIQU&#205;STICO" target="AMENORREA PRIMARIA">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Polycystic ovary syndrome is often associated with irregular menstruation and can contribute to primary amenorrhea</data>
      <data key="d10">31ce1e681d5daab6e4f4071ed09a0266</data>
      <data key="d11">0ec307b77eef4e248ba7633afd62ed91</data>
      <data key="d12">12715</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="S&#205;NDROME DE OVARIO POLIQU&#205;STICO" target="RETARDO PUBERAL">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">El s&#237;ndrome de ovario poliqu&#237;stico puede llevar a irregularidades menstruales y retraso puberal</data>
      <data key="d10">b972e75c5d62cc5cd76d9fc308265621</data>
      <data key="d11">49dfbf092c9342639b0d9c67c5442406</data>
      <data key="d12">12716</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="S&#205;NDROME DE OVARIO POLIQU&#205;STICO" target="DHEA">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">El s&#237;ndrome de ovario poliqu&#237;stico puede estar asociado con la producci&#243;n de DHEA, que contribuye al hiperandrogenismo.</data>
      <data key="d10">401a6af689562ae0b9d7fe627eb56d0f</data>
      <data key="d11">4270890e4bd3435eae39f03e6a1f3d89</data>
      <data key="d12">12717</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="S&#205;NDROME DE OVARIO POLIQU&#205;STICO" target="DHT">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La DHT, derivada de la testosterona, es clave en el desarrollo del hirsutismo en mujeres con s&#237;ndrome de ovario poliqu&#237;stico.</data>
      <data key="d10">401a6af689562ae0b9d7fe627eb56d0f</data>
      <data key="d11">feed535fef1048199e9fa33e1ed80c4c</data>
      <data key="d12">12718</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="S&#205;NDROME DE OVARIO POLIQU&#205;STICO" target="TUMORES DE C&#201;LULAS DE SERTOLI-LEYDIG">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Los tumores de c&#233;lulas de Sertoli-Leydig pueden ser una causa alternativa de hiperandrogenismo, similar al s&#237;ndrome de ovario poliqu&#237;stico.</data>
      <data key="d10">401a6af689562ae0b9d7fe627eb56d0f</data>
      <data key="d11">dccefa3ee83c4dab8cbf8e9c362df86d</data>
      <data key="d12">12719</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="S&#205;NDROME DE OVARIO POLIQU&#205;STICO" target="ANOVULACI&#211;N">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">El s&#237;ndrome de ovario poliqu&#237;stico es la causa principal de anovulaci&#243;n cr&#243;nica en mujeres en edad f&#233;rtil.</data>
      <data key="d10">401a6af689562ae0b9d7fe627eb56d0f</data>
      <data key="d11">53a6fc7c7d66440b8567ca8c7bdd0232</data>
      <data key="d12">12720</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="S&#205;NDROME DE OVARIO POLIQU&#205;STICO" target="GL&#193;NDULAS SUPRARRENALES">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Las gl&#225;ndulas suprarrenales contribuyen a la producci&#243;n de andr&#243;genos en mujeres con s&#237;ndrome de ovario poliqu&#237;stico.</data>
      <data key="d10">401a6af689562ae0b9d7fe627eb56d0f</data>
      <data key="d11">da95bc4f752945d3a047f200a0ad96cb</data>
      <data key="d12">12721</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="S&#205;NDROME DE OVARIO POLIQU&#205;STICO" target="28-YEAR-OLD PATIENT">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The 28-year-old patient is suspected to have Syndrome de Ovario Poliqu&#237;stico based on her symptoms of hirsutism and irregular menstrual cycles.</data>
      <data key="d10">70bc9625e649f5e478fdef15e27dda58</data>
      <data key="d11">dac19444dda74fc69331ab3ddefd5cbf</data>
      <data key="d12">12722</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="S&#205;NDROME DE OVARIO POLIQU&#205;STICO" target="FERRIMAN-GALLWEY">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The Ferriman-Gallwey scale is used to assess hirsutism, which is a common symptom of Syndrome de Ovario Poliqu&#237;stico.</data>
      <data key="d10">70bc9625e649f5e478fdef15e27dda58</data>
      <data key="d11">0aff50a100bb42388f870c3ce6c7930f</data>
      <data key="d12">12723</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="S&#205;NDROME DE OVARIO POLIQU&#205;STICO" target="HYPERANDROGENISM">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Hyperandrogenism is a key feature in the diagnosis of Syndrome de Ovario Poliqu&#237;stico, as it often leads to symptoms like hirsutism.</data>
      <data key="d10">70bc9625e649f5e478fdef15e27dda58</data>
      <data key="d11">146648bdb039427181bbf795cacddba3</data>
      <data key="d12">12724</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="S&#205;NDROME DE OVARIO POLIQU&#205;STICO" target="GSDIII">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Polycystic ovary syndrome can occur in female patients with GSDIII.</data>
      <data key="d10">a3fd8bf0a5229c36813682803cd15e35</data>
      <data key="d11">e795167e279b4f59b40e9aff590fabc6</data>
      <data key="d12">12725</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
