    <edge source="TYPE 1 DIABETES GENETICS CONSORTIUM" target="FOXP3 GENE">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The FOXP3 gene is also a focus of research by the Type 1 Diabetes Genetics Consortium due to its implications in autoimmune conditions</data>
