      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DIABETES TIPO 2" target="PREVALENCIA DE DIABETES">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The prevalence of diabetes includes a significant number of cases of type 2 diabetes, especially in older adults</data>
      <data key="d10">201f8e6a0d6c49396cf9c81f5da4520f</data>
      <data key="d11">a3b96fd5ed6d4113bc80fb18478eadd7</data>
      <data key="d12">13162</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DIABETES TIPO 2" target="MUJER DE 48 A&#209;OS">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La mujer ha sido diagnosticada con diabetes tipo 2 durante 12 a&#241;os, lo que afecta su salud y tratamiento</data>
      <data key="d10">39ea441f219d949e8bc3c6f430970689</data>
      <data key="d11">e65fc2cf771742178bfc6e82f945de39</data>
      <data key="d12">13163</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DIABETES TIPO 2" target="CIRUG&#205;A BARI&#193;TRICA">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La cirug&#237;a bari&#225;trica se realiz&#243; en parte para mejorar el control de la diabetes tipo 2 de la paciente</data>
      <data key="d10">39ea441f219d949e8bc3c6f430970689</data>
      <data key="d11">b2d14356b8794006a2d4881928357830</data>
      <data key="d12">13164</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DIABETES TIPO 2" target="CEREALES INTEGRALES">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The relationship between type 2 diabetes and whole grains is significant, as consumption of whole grains is associated with a lower risk of developing this condition. Whole grains may provide protective benefits against insulin resistance and the onset of type 2 diabetes, demonstrating an inverse relationship with the risk of this disease. This suggests that incorporating whole grains into the diet could be a beneficial strategy for reducing the likelihood of type 2 diabetes.</data>
      <data key="d10">7ba4c7b49d445c147394ac626d055ef3,8f4f0fffa52482a1b5a520849d10c692</data>
      <data key="d11">3edbbccf030a4773b20f63c186fae702</data>
      <data key="d12">13165</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DIABETES TIPO 2" target="FIBRA DIET&#201;TICA">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La ingesta de fibra diet&#233;tica se asocia inversamente con el desarrollo de diabetes tipo 2, donde un mayor consumo puede reducir el riesgo de esta enfermedad.</data>
      <data key="d10">8f4f0fffa52482a1b5a520849d10c692</data>
      <data key="d11">cdc437b7d1da4126921fc4af3bf7cb50</data>
      <data key="d12">13166</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DIABETES TIPO 2" target="BEBIDAS AZUCARADAS">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">El consumo de bebidas azucaradas se ha relacionado con un mayor riesgo de diabetes tipo 2 debido a su contenido de az&#250;cares de absorci&#243;n r&#225;pida.</data>
      <data key="d10">dcb29ef57f2b65cd420e728a3e29102d</data>
      <data key="d11">df41973745f042ba8104cfb29340aef0</data>
      <data key="d12">13167</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DIABETES TIPO 2" target="GRASAS TRANS">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">El consumo de grasas trans se ha relacionado con un riesgo aumentado de diabetes tipo 2 en mujeres obesas y sedentarias.</data>
      <data key="d10">dcb29ef57f2b65cd420e728a3e29102d</data>
      <data key="d11">c8733b8ec0ce4b9188796edd00627af5</data>
      <data key="d12">13168</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DIABETES TIPO 2" target="S&#205;NDROME METAB&#211;LICO">
      <data key="d8">13.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Diabetes tipo 2 and s&#237;ndrome metab&#243;lico are interrelated conditions, with diabetes tipo 2 often being a component of s&#237;ndrome metab&#243;lico. The relationship between these two conditions is significant, as both are influenced by various factors, including vitamin D. This connection highlights the importance of understanding how diabetes tipo 2 and s&#237;ndrome metab&#243;lico interact and affect overall health.</data>
      <data key="d10">a29197a0d36ee2c688c9c959435e999f,a45daf363c832c36bc8ece57f5887f53</data>
      <data key="d11">02e0e6d8a099419dad7d609734982ccd</data>
      <data key="d12">13169</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
