    <edge source="ACIDOSIS METAB&#211;LICA" target="MAR&#205;A">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Mar&#237;a's symptoms and lab results indicate the possibility of metabolic acidosis, which can occur in diabetic patients</data>
