    <edge source="CETOACIDOSIS" target="ENFERMEDAD DE ORINA DE JARABE DE ARCE">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Ketoacidosis is a potential complication in adults with Maple Syrup Urine Disease, often associated with metabolic crises.</data>
