    <edge source="ACIDOSIS L&#193;CTICA" target="MELAS">
      <data key="d8">15.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Acidosis l&#225;ctica is a common metabolic issue observed in patients with MELAS (Mitochondrial Encephalomyopathy, Lactic Acidosis, and Stroke-like episodes). This condition signifies a serious health concern and is considered a key diagnostic criterion for MELAS. The presence of acidosis l&#225;ctica in these patients highlights the metabolic challenges associated with this mitochondrial disorder.</data>
