    <edge source="AMERICAN THYROID ASSOCIATION" target="GU&#205;A ATA 2015">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The 2015 guidelines were published by the American Thyroid Association to guide the management of thyroid conditions</data>
      <data key="d10">cb3b93a50040c892ecf439582ebb6ac0</data>
      <data key="d11">fd6e3900decd4f46885ef38141125889</data>
      <data key="d12">13778</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="AMERICAN THYROID ASSOCIATION" target="NATIONAL COMPREHENSIVE CANCER NETWORK">
      <data key="d8">14.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The American Thyroid Association and the National Comprehensive Cancer Network are both prominent organizations dedicated to improving the management of thyroid-related conditions. They collaborate in developing clinical practice guidelines that address various aspects of thyroid health, including the management of thyroid carcinoma. Through their guidelines and recommendations, these organizations aim to enhance the quality of care for patients with thyroid disorders and ensure that healthcare providers have access to the most current and evidence-based practices in the field.</data>
      <data key="d10">a4e97817eb89c3941a890d94f5359369,e2091cc12f3e5cfae8cc2c1358cddc65</data>
      <data key="d11">895768ca1b1149ad8f7392cee2406f56</data>
      <data key="d12">13779</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="AMERICAN THYROID ASSOCIATION" target="KOREAN SOCIETY OF THYROID RADIOLOGY">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Both organizations provide recommendations for the diagnosis and management of thyroid nodules</data>
      <data key="d10">e2091cc12f3e5cfae8cc2c1358cddc65</data>
      <data key="d11">883306e2f2c64c09a62404a59a780a92</data>
      <data key="d12">13780</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="AMERICAN THYROID ASSOCIATION" target="PERROS P">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Perros P has contributed to the guidelines for thyroid cancer management, which aligns with the focus of the American Thyroid Association</data>
      <data key="d10">e2091cc12f3e5cfae8cc2c1358cddc65</data>
      <data key="d11">28b7ea2eb73e443db3b55f47c55c7322</data>
      <data key="d12">13781</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="AMERICAN THYROID ASSOCIATION" target="HAUGEN BR">
      <data key="d8">31.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Haugen BR is a significant contributor to the American Thyroid Association, having played a key role in the development of the Association's Management Guidelines for Adult Patients with Thyroid Nodules and Differentiated Thyroid Cancer. As an author of these guidelines, Haugen BR has been involved in shaping the recommendations published by the American Thyroid Association regarding thyroid management and cancer management. This involvement underscores Haugen BR's expertise and commitment to advancing the standards of care in the field of thyroid health.</data>
      <data key="d10">02db15b9ad7bc5655e1907ad3fa4e8ad,17db9c3996d806c3332ba2796ab7736f,a4e97817eb89c3941a890d94f5359369,bbe700b5b290ea119e511c94a6f0c67f,e775708e66a97968834f7476479a21b2</data>
      <data key="d11">65faf619794740e686a4c8a1a8d73fed</data>
      <data key="d12">13782</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="AMERICAN THYROID ASSOCIATION" target="BIBLE KC">
      <data key="d8">14.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The American Thyroid Association (ATA) has published management guidelines for adult patients with thyroid nodules and differentiated thyroid cancer, to which Bible KC has made significant contributions. Bible KC is recognized as an author of these guidelines, highlighting their involvement and expertise in the development of these important clinical recommendations.</data>
      <data key="d10">17db9c3996d806c3332ba2796ab7736f,a4e97817eb89c3941a890d94f5359369</data>
      <data key="d11">af030cd2c2514df798988cd7283b7322</data>
      <data key="d12">13783</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="AMERICAN THYROID ASSOCIATION" target="DOHERTY GM">
      <data key="d8">14.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Doherty GM is recognized for their significant contributions to the American Thyroid Association, particularly in the development of the Management Guidelines for Adult Patients with Thyroid Nodules and Differentiated Thyroid Cancer. As an author of these guidelines, Doherty GM played a crucial role in shaping the recommendations and protocols that assist healthcare professionals in managing these conditions effectively.</data>
      <data key="d10">17db9c3996d806c3332ba2796ab7736f,a4e97817eb89c3941a890d94f5359369</data>
      <data key="d11">75029c7ffae242f6979e5e4b9cec212b</data>
      <data key="d12">13784</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="AMERICAN THYROID ASSOCIATION" target="NIKIFOROV YE">
      <data key="d8">14.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Nikiforov YE is a notable contributor to the American Thyroid Association, having played a significant role in the development of the Management Guidelines for Adult Patients with Thyroid Nodules and Differentiated Thyroid Cancer. As an author of these guidelines, Nikiforov YE has helped shape the standards and recommendations that inform clinical practice in the management of thyroid conditions.</data>
      <data key="d10">17db9c3996d806c3332ba2796ab7736f,a4e97817eb89c3941a890d94f5359369</data>
      <data key="d11">815c64d5b05f462f87f082458d0fdd81</data>
