      <data key="d9">Wells SA is an author and contributor to the guidelines published by the American Thyroid Association concerning the management of medullary thyroid carcinoma. This involvement highlights Wells SA's role in the development of these important clinical guidelines, which aim to provide comprehensive recommendations for the diagnosis and treatment of this specific type of thyroid cancer.</data>
