    </edge>
    <edge source="OBESIDAD M&#211;RBIDA" target="CIRUG&#205;A BARI&#193;TRICA">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Bariatric surgery is often performed to treat morbid obesity and its associated health complications, including diabetes.</data>
