    <edge source="INSTITUTE OF MEDICINE" target="DIETARY REFERENCE INTAKES">
      <data key="d8">17.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The Institute of Medicine is responsible for establishing the Dietary Reference Intakes (DRIs) for various nutrients. These guidelines serve as a framework for assessing and planning dietary intake to ensure adequate nutrition and health.</data>
