      <data key="d9">Gastroesophageal varices are a complication of portal hypertension</data>
      <data key="d10">1911ce26c118381473eccb438875b29c</data>
      <data key="d11">30f177d73e274398a20c6b814a2b0ea2</data>
      <data key="d12">14200</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HIPERTENSI&#211;N PORTAL" target="CIRROSIS BILIAR FOCAL">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Portal hypertension can be a consequence of cirrhosis, which may occur in cystic fibrosis patients</data>
      <data key="d10">ad6c1f4ea2a6b80d32100cf5c2808cdc</data>
      <data key="d11">b99b2707c4974722872ab0e232417877</data>
      <data key="d12">14201</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="SYSTEM NATIONAL DE SALUD" target="MINISTERIO DE SANIDAD">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The Sistema Nacional de Salud operates under the regulations and guidelines set forth by the Ministerio de Sanidad</data>
      <data key="d10">f7b4cba3bbdeec64513c036fd4166835</data>
      <data key="d11">fd4870f12c2842d3a26690688c83a929</data>
      <data key="d12">14202</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MINISTERIO DE SANIDAD" target="HOSPITALES">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The Ministry of Health finances and oversees the operations of hospitals within the healthcare system</data>
      <data key="d10">26765fd0d663c8708d7bd6a545de3e2c</data>
      <data key="d11">c83f88c1be414a78a9dfa93d2533da34</data>
      <data key="d12">14203</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="SONDA DE GASTROSTOM&#205;A" target="TUMORES DE CABEZA Y CUELLO">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Head and neck tumors may necessitate the use of a gastrostomy tube for feeding</data>
      <data key="d10">f7b4cba3bbdeec64513c036fd4166835</data>
      <data key="d11">7a97531396614b889c63d0a861053e4d</data>
      <data key="d12">14204</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="SONDA DE GASTROSTOM&#205;A" target="GASTROSTOM&#205;A ENDOSC&#211;PICA">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La sonda de gastrostom&#237;a es el dispositivo utilizado en el procedimiento de gastrostom&#237;a endosc&#243;pica para la alimentaci&#243;n enteral</data>
      <data key="d10">4041e05fe2f79ca70bbf0522cc31be8f</data>
      <data key="d11">841ba7b72b894bf3b478f8bf48302bd4</data>
      <data key="d12">14205</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="SONDA DE GASTROSTOM&#205;A" target="BOT&#211;N DE GASTROSTOM&#205;A">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La sonda de gastrostom&#237;a puede ser sustituida por un bot&#243;n tras la formaci&#243;n de una f&#237;stula gastrocut&#225;nea.</data>
      <data key="d10">e569eda9506ef1e77080a8120e388963</data>
      <data key="d11">297a598e30214712bd06e74913ec81dc</data>
      <data key="d12">14206</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="TUMORES DE CABEZA Y CUELLO" target="NUTRICI&#211;N EN ONCOLOG&#205;A">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">TUMORES DE CABEZA Y CUELLO, or head and neck tumors, are a significant concern in oncology, particularly regarding the nutritional needs of affected patients. NUTRICI&#211;N EN ONCOLOG&#205;A, or nutrition in oncology, plays a crucial role in addressing these specific needs. Nutritional assessment and support are essential for patients with head and neck tumors, as they often face unique challenges that can impact their dietary intake and overall health. Therefore, a comprehensive approach to nutrition is vital for the effective management and treatment of individuals suffering from these types of tumors.</data>
      <data key="d10">38c7f97d650c77986c2dc9132aa20fdb,eae8ddef005974a2ffe71cf7c61b0634</data>
      <data key="d11">cd6d604e0b3b433ca8a8dc5f87ff304a</data>
      <data key="d12">14207</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="F&#211;RMULAS MONOM&#201;RICAS" target="OSMOLALIDAD">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La osmolalidad de las f&#243;rmulas monom&#233;ricas puede ser m&#225;s alta debido a su composici&#243;n</data>
      <data key="d10">0a844e2dc679c0578ba4bdeda742c2eb</data>
      <data key="d11">2df5a23f37e143a99b786af72d7b2e47</data>
      <data key="d12">14208</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="F&#211;RMULAS PEPT&#205;DICAS" target="OSMOLALIDAD">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La osmolalidad de las f&#243;rmulas pept&#237;dicas var&#237;a seg&#250;n la complejidad de los ingredientes</data>
      <data key="d10">0a844e2dc679c0578ba4bdeda742c2eb</data>
      <data key="d11">f67bd8a5b85a44dc8a39088512744b7a</data>
      <data key="d12">14209</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
