    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ARTIFICIAL DOMICILIARIA" target="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL DOMICILIARIA">
      <data key="d8">15.0</data>
      <data key="d9">NUTRICI&#211;N ARTIFICIAL DOMICILIARIA and NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL DOMICILIARIA refer to nutritional therapies provided in a home setting. Home artificial nutrition encompasses various methods, including enteral nutrition, which is a specific delivery method for providing essential nutrients directly to the gastrointestinal tract. This approach ensures that individuals receive the necessary nutritional support while remaining in the comfort of their own homes.</data>
