    <edge source="HARRISON PRINCIPIOS DE MEDICINA INTERNA" target="EUROPEAN SOCIETY OF ENDOCRINOLOGY">
      <data key="d8">14.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Harrison Principios de Medicina Interna and the European Society of Endocrinology both play significant roles in providing guidelines and information on the management of adrenal conditions, including incidentalomas. The European Society of Endocrinology may reference the guidelines and information found in Harrison's textbook within their clinical practice guidelines, ensuring that their recommendations are informed by established medical literature. This collaboration highlights the importance of integrating comprehensive resources in the field of endocrinology to enhance clinical practice and patient care.</data>
      <data key="d10">1bfdc8a3b2272265ee6fd132fcf3a8ce,6ebb5385c8eda09a187e6d0595812bbf,8fe4d0101ea7a6ddaefd71c963d9ecc7,b7b162b783ea688c5fe9b7f531b46aaf</data>
