    </edge>
    <edge source="PSA" target="TESTOSTERONE THERAPY">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">PSA levels are monitored before and during testosterone therapy to assess prostate health</data>
      <data key="d10">f979a07da5d7c814ccf957629ab91cc5</data>
      <data key="d11">fddb3bb53b9040259b3b02c61b026bc3</data>
      <data key="d12">14942</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ENFERMEDAD DE ADDISON" target="S&#205;NDROME POLIGLANDULAR AUTOINMUNE TIPO 1">
      <data key="d8">16.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The "S&#237;ndrome Poliglandular Autoinmune Tipo 1" (Type 1 Autoimmune Polyglandular Syndrome) is a condition that encompasses several autoimmune disorders, with "Enfermedad de Addison" (Addison's Disease) being one of its primary characteristics. This syndrome is marked by the presence of multiple endocrine gland failures due to autoimmune destruction, and Addison's disease, which affects the adrenal glands and leads to insufficient production of hormones, is a significant component of this syndrome.</data>
      <data key="d10">71a67838e4fbd705b0fb3b14b20664ee,806e7b517eea737f1b254b699db60046</data>
      <data key="d11">3a2311a710f94ba4b7ee68646e0958e2</data>
      <data key="d12">14943</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ENFERMEDAD DE ADDISON" target="S&#205;NDROME POLIGLANDULAR AUTOINMUNE TIPO 2">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">El s&#237;ndrome poliglandular autoinmune tipo 2 se caracteriza por la presencia de enfermedad de Addison entre otros trastornos autoinmunes.</data>
      <data key="d10">71a67838e4fbd705b0fb3b14b20664ee</data>
      <data key="d11">5e9f0cc4318342358359f1d970cb85f1</data>
      <data key="d12">14944</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ENFERMEDAD DE ADDISON" target="AUTOANTICUERPOS">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Autoantibodies can precede the clinical manifestation of Addison's disease in patients</data>
      <data key="d10">806e7b517eea737f1b254b699db60046</data>
      <data key="d11">eb0a04d81a5645dd8e6368536f41b2ed</data>
      <data key="d12">14945</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ENFERMEDAD DE ADDISON" target="ANTICUERPOS ANTIADRENALES">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The presence of anti-adrenal antibodies can indicate a risk for developing Addison's disease</data>
      <data key="d10">806e7b517eea737f1b254b699db60046</data>
      <data key="d11">ea4adabc84324b94a56e764e364b8ebe</data>
      <data key="d12">14946</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ENFERMEDAD DE ADDISON" target="ANTICUERPOS ANTI-21 HIDROXILASA">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Anti-21 hydroxylase antibodies are often present in patients who may develop Addison's disease</data>
      <data key="d10">806e7b517eea737f1b254b699db60046</data>
      <data key="d11">6c9ff7b1e4ec4e50a3fa837910fae630</data>
      <data key="d12">14947</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ENFERMEDAD DE ADDISON" target="DIETA HIPOS&#211;DICA">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Los pacientes con enfermedad de Addison pueden necesitar ajustes en su ingesta de sodio, lo que afecta la dieta hipos&#243;dica</data>
      <data key="d10">9de04e5aa72249acf96899ca74c17e0b</data>
      <data key="d11">c4d4447059ab4bdc8c269da010987c4c</data>
      <data key="d12">14948</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
