    </edge>
    <edge source="LITIASIS RENAL" target="MODIFICACIONES DIET&#201;TICAS">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Las modificaciones diet&#233;ticas son recomendadas para prevenir la formaci&#243;n de c&#225;lculos renales</data>
      <data key="d10">b703f173982cf68d36653cc0d9cc1fcb</data>
      <data key="d11">1dd42fec05e949aabbf8a82280bd39dd</data>
      <data key="d12">15208</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="LITIASIS RENAL" target="C&#193;LCULO RENAL">
      <data key="d8">19.0</data>
      <data key="d9">LITIASIS RENAL, also known as CALCULO RENAL, refers to the condition commonly recognized as kidney stones. The term "c&#225;lculo renal" is synonymous with kidney stones, indicating a direct relationship between the two terms. Furthermore, kidney stones are a manifestation of litiasis renal, which describes the process of formation of these stones. Thus, both terms are interconnected, with litiasis renal encompassing the broader process of stone formation and c&#225;lculo renal specifically denoting the stones themselves.</data>
      <data key="d10">12c1878563254283012703d4f20ff4a9,9ea70909c43b9b7923a0fa217c0e7290</data>
      <data key="d11">4de6281fed104e77bca7ea95ee05212c</data>
      <data key="d12">15209</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="LITIASIS RENAL" target="HIPERCALCIURIA">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La hipercalciuria puede contribuir a la litiasis renal al aumentar la concentraci&#243;n de sales en la orina.</data>
      <data key="d10">12c1878563254283012703d4f20ff4a9</data>
      <data key="d11">1ebf92f461494e19a25281fec28d70c2</data>
      <data key="d12">15210</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="LITIASIS RENAL" target="OXALATO C&#193;LCICO MONOHIDRATO">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Oxalato c&#225;lcico monohidratado is a type of stone that can form in the kidneys, contributing to renal lithiasis.</data>
      <data key="d10">634b74df7b9403e4c578f3fc84fe3335</data>
      <data key="d11">face9f8397ec4a3da93840f38ffbdd65</data>
      <data key="d12">15211</data>
