      <data key="d12">15310</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="WORLD CANCER RESEARCH FUND" target="CANCER SOCIETY">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The World Cancer Research Fund and the American Cancer Society both focus on cancer prevention through dietary research</data>
      <data key="d10">e33729f8eea62e59507c132b7c2437df</data>
      <data key="d11">7670fe557b32438c8ef76c783c1b7d3c</data>
      <data key="d12">15311</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ATRIAL FIBRILLATION" target="SWEDISH OBESE SUBJECTS">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The study of Swedish obese subjects focuses on the risk of new-onset atrial fibrillation</data>
      <data key="d10">ea79efb65695c260a301f5c42237e2cb</data>
      <data key="d11">615bf2dcd3314584afa73d30284ce157</data>
      <data key="d12">15312</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="C&#193;NCER COLORRECTAL" target="DIETA RICA EN FRUTAS Y VERDURAS">
      <data key="d8">5.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Una dieta rica en frutas y verduras puede tener un efecto protector contra el c&#225;ncer colorrectal</data>
      <data key="d10">240ded3c69bd7ae82bed4089517ffb6b</data>
      <data key="d11">7f954706531b433a8498d8abb5d66b5f</data>
      <data key="d12">15313</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="C&#193;NCER COLORRECTAL" target="CEREALES INTEGRALES">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">C&#193;NCER COLORRECTAL and CEREALES INTEGRALES are interconnected through research indicating that the consumption of whole grains is associated with a reduced risk of colorectal cancer. Various mechanisms have been proposed to explain this relationship, particularly highlighting that an increase in fiber intake from whole grains may contribute to a lower risk of developing this type of cancer. Overall, the evidence suggests that incorporating whole grains into the diet can be beneficial in mitigating the risk of colorectal cancer.</data>
      <data key="d10">8f4f0fffa52482a1b5a520849d10c692,a6ba6423064bccccefee095de7435164</data>
      <data key="d11">e8c61105ea644867aecbdfd22e900569</data>
      <data key="d12">15314</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="C&#193;NCER COLORRECTAL" target="PESCADO">
      <data key="d8">4.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Studies have explored the relationship between fish intake and colorectal cancer risk</data>
      <data key="d10">11c3cb37b1a2c111ceb227aefa8d9e1a</data>
      <data key="d11">f1411f955f9d4630a0248a52824acaac</data>
      <data key="d12">15315</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="C&#193;NCER COLORRECTAL" target="PACIENTE ONCOL&#211;GICO">
      <data key="d8">5.0</data>
      <data key="d9">El gasto energ&#233;tico en reposo es normal en pacientes con c&#225;ncer colorrectal</data>
      <data key="d10">d667e6abc204bbfa6aba210705db6d56</data>
      <data key="d11">b5bbf2ee861c490a9591aa361e9a5d0c</data>
      <data key="d12">15316</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="BUPROPION-NALTREXONE" target="BILLIES SK">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Billes SK authored research on the effectiveness of bupropion-naltrexone for obesity treatment</data>
      <data key="d10">7eea8ed505de441028811dbb848d0fa0</data>
      <data key="d11">9cc273f9a2a246218ac5009f5ad05cfa</data>
      <data key="d12">15317</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="BUPROPION-NALTREXONE" target="NALTREXONE">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Naltrexone is a key component of the bupropion-naltrexone combination used for weight loss</data>
      <data key="d10">7eea8ed505de441028811dbb848d0fa0</data>
      <data key="d11">d4ca450346744acf8cf516b2d4384386</data>
      <data key="d12">15318</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="BUPROPION-NALTREXONE" target="HORMONA ESTIMULANTE DE MELANOCITOS">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Bupropion-naltrexone may influence the levels of hormones like &#945;-MSH that regulate appetite</data>
      <data key="d10">7eea8ed505de441028811dbb848d0fa0</data>
      <data key="d11">b144536754ec4fb7b8317a086617e537</data>
      <data key="d12">15319</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="BUPROPION-NALTREXONE" target="PROOPIOMELANOCORTINA">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Bupropion-naltrexone may affect the pathways involving POMC, which is related to appetite control</data>
      <data key="d10">7eea8ed505de441028811dbb848d0fa0</data>
      <data key="d11">8b960fe7b93b4da99883009697ee44bd</data>
      <data key="d12">15320</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="BUPROPION-NALTREXONE" target="CRISIS COMICIALES">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Bupropion-naltrexone is contraindicated in patients with a history of seizure disorders</data>
      <data key="d10">7eea8ed505de441028811dbb848d0fa0</data>
      <data key="d11">8f2fb76a5805422c88f06fe233053272</data>
      <data key="d12">15321</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="GASTRECTOMY VERTICAL" target="BYPASS G&#193;STRICO">
      <data key="d8">5.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Both gastrectomy vertical and bypass g&#225;strico are surgical techniques used for weight loss</data>
      <data key="d10">7eea8ed505de441028811dbb848d0fa0</data>
      <data key="d11">267a20413242486c8ff46085e9110d7c</data>
      <data key="d12">15322</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="BYPASS G&#193;STRICO" target="CRUCE DUODENAL">
      <data key="d8">5.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Cruce duodenal and bypass g&#225;strico are both surgical procedures aimed at reducing weight through different methods</data>
      <data key="d10">7eea8ed505de441028811dbb848d0fa0</data>
      <data key="d11">4c56f3e57eae4237b826c15f79cd4079</data>
      <data key="d12">15323</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="BYPASS G&#193;STRICO" target="GASTRECTOM&#205;A VERTICAL">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Both gastrectom&#237;a vertical and bypass g&#225;strico are surgical options for weight loss</data>
      <data key="d10">8d2d57471630a504ffa4a39c259d9b18</data>
      <data key="d11">e0e9f92759d8445e92ec98df1c7d72eb</data>
      <data key="d12">15324</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="BYPASS G&#193;STRICO" target="DERIVACI&#211;N BILIOPANCRE&#193;TICA">
      <data key="d8">14.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Bypass g&#225;strico and derivaci&#243;n biliopancre&#225;tica are both surgical techniques designed to treat severe obesity by altering the digestive process. These methods focus on modifying how the body processes food, ultimately aiding in weight loss and improving overall health.</data>
      <data key="d10">8d2d57471630a504ffa4a39c259d9b18,b980df2798effe4d56b74a254734403c</data>
      <data key="d11">4d83373d536c4cbf80eb5668bee41ca0</data>
      <data key="d12">15325</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="BYPASS G&#193;STRICO" target="DEHISCENCIA DE SUTURA">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Suture dehiscence is a potential complication that can occur after gastric bypass surgery</data>
      <data key="d10">e70fa2e099766154321f13c0112d436a</data>
      <data key="d11">436081c6ce2040fd80fd3445598efff9</data>
      <data key="d12">15326</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="BYPASS G&#193;STRICO" target="PROTEIN MALNUTRITION">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Gastric bypass can also result in protein malnutrition, similar to biliopancreatic diversion</data>
      <data key="d10">bd26f1257d0d7f3e1de6624b3b4a3cc2</data>
      <data key="d11">9063128b1dce4444a43a97b1f371e52f</data>
      <data key="d12">15327</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="BYPASS G&#193;STRICO" target="MICRONUTRIENT DEFICIENCY">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Gastric bypass can lead to similar micronutrient deficiencies as biliopancreatic diversion</data>
      <data key="d10">bd26f1257d0d7f3e1de6624b3b4a3cc2</data>
      <data key="d11">3d22f182604b483084ee6672464fa9ed</data>
      <data key="d12">15328</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="CRISIS COMICIALES" target="ALD">
      <data key="d8">4.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Crisis comiciales are a common symptom in patients with ALD</data>
      <data key="d10">0745ce31d3922cbba1497dbe1d2845de</data>
      <data key="d11">d420021ef28248d5b98b5bde95f25b74</data>
      <data key="d12">15329</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NALTREXONE" target="COR-DIABETES">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Naltrexone is a medication studied in the COR-Diabetes trial for its effects on body weight and glycemic parameters</data>
