    </edge>
    <edge source="BARIATRIC SURGERY" target="RUBINO F">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Rubino F has published studies on the impact of metabolic surgery on Type 2 diabetes management.</data>
      <data key="d10">a3e3a651e24883d279405241439b58bc</data>
      <data key="d11">fef4339862034b6faebc7d3187882374</data>
      <data key="d12">15338</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="BARIATRIC SURGERY" target="RAMOS-LEVI AM">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Ramos-Levi AM has worked on statistical models to predict outcomes of bariatric surgery in relation to Type 2 diabetes remission.</data>
