    <edge source="BARIATRIC SURGERY" target="HOSPITAL DIET">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The hospital diet is specifically designed for patients undergoing bariatric surgery</data>
      <data key="d10">5236affa95aaf73b0f2d08e839e4db54</data>
      <data key="d11">35b71ba3b9224671b04897da3821a289</data>
      <data key="d12">15351</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="BARIATRIC SURGERY" target="LIQUID DIET">
      <data key="d8">23.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Bariatric surgery is a significant medical procedure aimed at aiding weight loss and improving health outcomes for individuals struggling with obesity. Following this surgery, patients typically enter a critical initial phase that involves a liquid diet. This liquid diet serves as the first step in the dietary plan and is essential for recovery, helping to ensure that patients can heal properly while gradually transitioning to more solid foods. Overall, the liquid diet plays a vital role in the post-operative process of bariatric surgery, supporting patients as they embark on their journey towards improved health.</data>
      <data key="d10">5236affa95aaf73b0f2d08e839e4db54,8ad412c188e4086d686c217c6c5c5324,ae99604da4e0a7da3a6e99e197205ab5</data>
      <data key="d11">1ea530633676409583117b25fb47c387</data>
      <data key="d12">15352</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="BARIATRIC SURGERY" target="SOLID DIET">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The solid diet is the final phase of dietary reintroduction after bariatric surgery</data>
      <data key="d10">5236affa95aaf73b0f2d08e839e4db54</data>
      <data key="d11">5e026f318c2a4dc38fe8a9190477aa19</data>
      <data key="d12">15353</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
