      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The infant's symptoms may suggest a diagnosis of diabetic ketoacidosis due to the presence of acidosis and dehydration</data>
      <data key="d10">a1b16c80a55fd88d0b1efb78addf3853</data>
      <data key="d11">cd7252cc25464e54a9df05f0f6ca727d</data>
