    <edge source="CYSTIC FIBROSIS" target="CYSTIC FIBROSIS FOUNDATION">
      <data key="d8">18.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Cystic fibrosis is a genetic disorder that affects the lungs and digestive system, leading to severe respiratory and nutritional challenges. The Cystic Fibrosis Foundation is an organization committed to improving the lives of individuals affected by this condition. It focuses on advancing research to find effective treatments and ultimately a cure for cystic fibrosis. Additionally, the foundation provides essential resources and support for patients and their families, ensuring they have access to the necessary tools and information to manage the disease effectively. Through its efforts, the Cystic Fibrosis Foundation plays a crucial role in enhancing the quality of life for those living with cystic fibrosis.</data>
