    <edge source="FOOD AND NUTRITION BOARD" target="DIETARY REFERENCE INTAKES">
      <data key="d8">15.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The Food and Nutrition Board is responsible for establishing the Dietary Reference Intakes (DRIs), which serve as guidelines for nutrient intake. The DRIs provide a comprehensive framework to help individuals understand the recommended levels of various nutrients necessary for maintaining health and preventing deficiencies.</data>
