    </edge>
    <edge source="REQUERIMIENTOS ENERG&#201;TICOS" target="NUTRICI&#211;N PEDI&#193;TRICA">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Requerimientos energ&#233;ticos are a key aspect of nutrici&#243;n pedi&#225;trica, outlining the caloric needs for children</data>
