      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="GEB" target="GET">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">GET is calculated based on GEB and physical activity levels</data>
      <data key="d10">dea64d5eb807430bc52e8bed6e30c393</data>
      <data key="d11">609491136f834653a50b959ce693069c</data>
      <data key="d12">16759</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="GEB" target="AGRICULTURA NO MECANIZADA">
      <data key="d8">5.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Agriculture activities contribute significantly to energy expenditure, which is part of the GEB calculations</data>
      <data key="d10">bd31c6face847551241359e37e4baa2e</data>
      <data key="d11">7dc7b19c7cbe48c28b16287afcaf992e</data>
      <data key="d12">16760</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="GEB" target="TAREAS DOM&#201;STICAS NO MECANIZADAS">
      <data key="d8">5.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Domestic tasks contribute to energy expenditure, which is part of the GEB calculations</data>
      <data key="d10">bd31c6face847551241359e37e4baa2e</data>
      <data key="d11">52a7c333c9a640d0b7a0f66604e10527</data>
      <data key="d12">16761</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="GEB" target="ACTIVIDADES L&#218;DICAS">
      <data key="d8">3.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Leisure activities have a lower energy expenditure, which is considered in GEB calculations</data>
      <data key="d10">bd31c6face847551241359e37e4baa2e</data>
      <data key="d11">75dddeee2f184f569ffac9c79f0e2fad</data>
      <data key="d12">16762</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="GEB" target="DORMIR">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Sleeping is a fundamental part of energy conservation and is included in GEB calculations</data>
      <data key="d10">bd31c6face847551241359e37e4baa2e</data>
      <data key="d11">ff1c926af5d54ad5a586a52b805347da</data>
      <data key="d12">16763</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="GEB" target="ASEO PERSONAL">
      <data key="d8">4.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Personal hygiene activities contribute to daily energy expenditure, which is part of GEB calculations</data>
      <data key="d10">bd31c6face847551241359e37e4baa2e</data>
      <data key="d11">d2ea26abcee349638012979263d67a1f</data>
      <data key="d12">16764</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="GEB" target="COMER">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Eating is a necessary activity that affects energy intake and is considered in GEB calculations</data>
      <data key="d10">bd31c6face847551241359e37e4baa2e</data>
      <data key="d11">f653cb16bae04f8e8638ee12e1b31c2d</data>
      <data key="d12">16765</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="GEB" target="COCINAR">
      <data key="d8">5.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Cooking involves physical activity and contributes to energy expenditure, which is part of GEB calculations</data>
      <data key="d10">bd31c6face847551241359e37e4baa2e</data>
      <data key="d11">4e861654e0b74f3fa18578e40691e900</data>
      <data key="d12">16766</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="GEB" target="RECOGER AGUA O MADERA">
      <data key="d8">5.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Collecting water or firewood involves physical effort and contributes to energy expenditure, which is part of GEB calculations</data>
      <data key="d10">bd31c6face847551241359e37e4baa2e</data>
      <data key="d11">e0b84eb4c9094339bfed57d3ca5f2c67</data>
      <data key="d12">16767</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="GEB" target="CAMINAR">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Walking contributes to daily energy expenditure, which is part of GEB calculations</data>
      <data key="d10">bd31c6face847551241359e37e4baa2e</data>
      <data key="d11">59d81982731545ae91e20abfcd920e90</data>
      <data key="d12">16768</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="GEB" target="GASTO METAB&#211;LICO BASAL">
