      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="CITOQUINAS" target="NEFROPAT&#205;A">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Cytokines are inflammatory mediators that can exacerbate nephropathy, and dietary management aims to reduce their levels</data>
