    <edge source="ALIANZA M&#193;SNUTRIDOS" target="SOCIEDAD ESPA&#209;OLA DE NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL Y PARENTERAL">
      <data key="d8">12.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Alianza m&#225;snutridos is an initiative that is supported by the Sociedad Espa&#241;ola de Nutrici&#243;n Enteral y Parenteral. This collaboration is part of a multidisciplinary approach aimed at combating malnutrition. The Sociedad Espa&#241;ola de Nutrici&#243;n Enteral y Parenteral works alongside Alianza m&#225;snutridos to enhance hospital nutrition, emphasizing the importance of effective nutritional strategies in healthcare settings. Together, these entities focus on improving nutritional care and addressing the challenges associated with malnutrition.</data>
