      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ALIANZA M&#193;SNUTRIDOS" target="CONSEJO DE EUROPA">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The recommendations from the Consejo de Europa have influenced the initiatives taken by Alianza m&#225;snutridos in addressing hospital malnutrition.</data>
