    </edge>
    <edge source="YOGUR" target="DBIG">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Yogur is an example of a food with a moderate glycemic index, which is relevant to the principles of DBIG</data>
      <data key="d10">5116416429465894c102d9fb93d6a8fc</data>
      <data key="d11">064e3c309e5a474aa191a101a2ba7080</data>
      <data key="d12">17061</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="YOGUR" target="LACTOSA">
      <data key="d8">14.0</data>
      <data key="d9">YOGUR is a dairy product that contains beneficial bacteria which ferment lactosa, thereby reducing its overall content. This fermentation process not only diminishes the amount of lactosa present in the yogurt but also enhances the tolerance of individuals who may have difficulty digesting this sugar. As a result, yogurt is often well-tolerated by lactose-intolerant individuals, making it a suitable dairy option for those suffering from conditions such as EII (Inflammatory Bowel Disease).</data>
      <data key="d10">527c3c962d22018377b32c52e984d4e1,94afd4bf40b661992e66cf7963ef236c</data>
      <data key="d11">f498c38da4ab4599a7bef0b3f874763b</data>
      <data key="d12">17062</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="YOGUR" target="NUTRICI&#211;N PEDI&#193;TRICA">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Yogur is recommended as a source of iron in pediatric nutrition</data>
      <data key="d10">e742c891694171ad455b038f416b7728</data>
      <data key="d11">184976fe4c8249c1b5562487369420bb</data>
      <data key="d12">17063</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DIETA SEMIL&#205;QUIDA" target="DIETA SEMIBLANDA">
      <data key="d8">15.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The "DIETA SEMIL&#205;QUIDA" and "DIETA SEMIBLANDA" are two dietary stages that are part of a progressive eating plan. The "DIETA SEMIL&#205;QUIDA" serves as an initial phase, which typically lasts for 24 to 72 hours. Following this stage, individuals transition to the "DIETA SEMIBLANDA." This second phase introduces soft solid foods after the consumption of liquid and semi-liquid diets, allowing for a gradual reintroduction of more substantial food textures. Thus, the "DIETA SEMIBLANDA" follows the "DIETA SEMIL&#205;QUIDA" in the dietary progression, facilitating a smooth transition towards a more varied diet.</data>
      <data key="d10">4b19145e0977ee48b7132c9915d8c284,4d74cee5793710b781c0b83db2f27209</data>
      <data key="d11">2f992f7e2d894ff7bea8d6fcc9c7f3e8</data>
      <data key="d12">17064</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DIETA SEMIL&#205;QUIDA" target="DIETA BLANDA">
      <data key="d8">5.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La dieta blanda es una etapa posterior a la dieta semil&#237;quida, que busca mejorar la digesti&#243;n con alimentos m&#225;s s&#243;lidos.</data>
      <data key="d10">4d74cee5793710b781c0b83db2f27209</data>
      <data key="d11">c240688e3a5d43c1867f6f380ce56b8e</data>
      <data key="d12">17065</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DIETA SEMIL&#205;QUIDA" target="PUR&#201; DE VERDURA">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">El pur&#233; de verdura es un componente de la dieta semil&#237;quida, proporcionando nutrientes en una forma f&#225;cil de digerir.</data>
      <data key="d10">4d74cee5793710b781c0b83db2f27209</data>
      <data key="d11">cca989ca37354613b0f4a0670aef9682</data>
      <data key="d12">17066</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DIETA SEMIBLANDA" target="DIETA BLANDA">
      <data key="d8">15.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The "DIETA SEMIBLANDA" serves as a preliminary dietary stage that transitions into the "DIETA BLANDA." The "DIETA BLANDA" is characterized by a progression from the semibland diet, incorporating a variety of solid-textured foods aimed at enhancing digestion. This progression reflects an evolution in dietary texture and complexity, allowing for improved digestive function as individuals advance from the semibland to the bland diet.</data>
      <data key="d10">4b19145e0977ee48b7132c9915d8c284,4d74cee5793710b781c0b83db2f27209</data>
      <data key="d11">e349289828fe464488baafb6b80ece25</data>
      <data key="d12">17067</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DIETA SEMIBLANDA" target="DIETA DE TRANSICI&#211;N">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La dieta de transici&#243;n sigue a la dieta semiblanda, completando la progresi&#243;n hacia una dieta m&#225;s variada y equilibrada.</data>
      <data key="d10">4d74cee5793710b781c0b83db2f27209</data>
      <data key="d11">359965935f1e46c78f875a55c6d7de77</data>
      <data key="d12">17068</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DIETA SEMIBLANDA" target="DIETA DE F&#193;CIL MASTICACI&#211;N">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La dieta de f&#225;cil masticaci&#243;n es similar a la dieta semiblanda, ya que ambas est&#225;n dise&#241;adas para facilitar la ingesta de alimentos a personas con dificultades de masticaci&#243;n.</data>
      <data key="d10">4d74cee5793710b781c0b83db2f27209</data>
      <data key="d11">510f26060524418da5f3885ff953794c</data>
      <data key="d12">17069</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DIETA SEMIBLANDA" target="PESCADO AL HORNO">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">El pescado al horno es un alimento que se incluye en la dieta semiblanda, aportando prote&#237;nas magras y f&#225;cil de masticar.</data>
      <data key="d10">4d74cee5793710b781c0b83db2f27209</data>
      <data key="d11">6f7caf9c1f48425784c738a973fdeb31</data>
      <data key="d12">17070</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DIETA BLANDA" target="DIETA DE TRANSICI&#211;N">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La dieta de transici&#243;n es el siguiente paso despu&#233;s de la dieta blanda, que incluye todos los grupos de alimentos y es m&#225;s variada.</data>
      <data key="d10">4d74cee5793710b781c0b83db2f27209</data>
      <data key="d11">fba422374bf946c9b9356d22ac0c7283</data>
      <data key="d12">17071</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DIETA BLANDA" target="FRUTA EN ALM&#205;BAR">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La fruta en alm&#237;bar es un postre que se puede incluir en la dieta blanda, ofreciendo un sabor dulce y nutrientes.</data>
      <data key="d10">4d74cee5793710b781c0b83db2f27209</data>
      <data key="d11">2a3ae278fa894c1f91f208744294f72c</data>
      <data key="d12">17072</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="GALLETAS" target="MERENDA">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Galletas are typically consumed during merienda as a snack</data>
      <data key="d10">4b19145e0977ee48b7132c9915d8c284</data>
      <data key="d11">befbc2aa5de74dcbab27c72576b3966d</data>
      <data key="d12">17073</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="GALLETAS" target="ENFERMEDAD CELIACA">
      <data key="d8">10.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Las galletas contienen gluten y son inapropiadas para personas con enfermedad celiaca.</data>
      <data key="d10">7d2050a2481adc105bdebbcf2af1a173</data>
      <data key="d11">102e469afb384c739633918e89c894ae</data>
      <data key="d12">17074</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="GALLETAS" target="NUTRICI&#211;N PEDI&#193;TRICA">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Galletas are recommended as a source of iron in pediatric nutrition</data>
      <data key="d10">e742c891694171ad455b038f416b7728</data>
      <data key="d11">abcd3c7da330433b903c91b8cd7fd5ee</data>
      <data key="d12">17075</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DESAYUNO" target="NUTRICI&#211;N PEDI&#193;TRICA">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Desayuno is a critical meal outlined in the NUTRICI&#211;N PEDI&#193;TRICA guidelines for children's nutrition</data>
      <data key="d10">f96dd2fbe3cd9aa6516522de8ed33145</data>
      <data key="d11">a1dc62d468b6421e89fba5aa705bead3</data>
      <data key="d12">17076</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="DIETAS CON MODIFICACI&#211;N DE TEXTURA" target="DIETA ODONTOLOGICA">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
