    <edge source="DIETARY RECOMMENDATIONS" target="NUTRITIONAL OBJECTIVES">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The entities "DIETARY RECOMMENDATIONS" and "NUTRITIONAL OBJECTIVES" are closely related, as nutritional objectives serve to guide dietary recommendations. These objectives focus on managing the intake of specific substances, including fructose, sorbitol, and lactose. By establishing clear nutritional goals, they help individuals make informed dietary choices that promote better health outcomes.</data>
