      <data key="d12">17106</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="CELIAQU&#205;A" target="DIETA SIN GLUTEN">
      <data key="d8">18.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Celiac disease, known as "CELIAQU&#205;A," requires individuals to adhere to a gluten-free diet, referred to as "DIETA SIN GLUTEN," in order to manage symptoms and prevent associated health issues. The gluten-free diet is the primary treatment for celiac disease, emphasizing the importance of avoiding gluten-containing foods to maintain health and well-being.</data>
      <data key="d10">8a7b2d5e0440750e36603c8d3f93a68a,8eef8cced3d7433de267e8e624813566</data>
      <data key="d11">d20bbc3422304c659c7126b34a1c0f19</data>
      <data key="d12">17107</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="CELIAQU&#205;A" target="PACIENTES CEL&#205;ACOS">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Patients with celiac disease are those who are affected by the condition and require dietary management.</data>
      <data key="d10">8a7b2d5e0440750e36603c8d3f93a68a</data>
      <data key="d11">6fdb454b31e749288fb81a92bc8ba9c9</data>
      <data key="d12">17108</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="CELIAQU&#205;A" target="CEBADA">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La cebada contiene gluten y es perjudicial para los pacientes con celiaqu&#237;a</data>
      <data key="d10">8eef8cced3d7433de267e8e624813566</data>
      <data key="d11">11f93f7f4e864f3fb24762fdc93e3e52</data>
      <data key="d12">17109</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="CELIAQU&#205;A" target="CENTENO">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">El centeno contiene gluten y debe ser evitado por los pacientes con celiaqu&#237;a</data>
      <data key="d10">8eef8cced3d7433de267e8e624813566</data>
      <data key="d11">8a3ab6660ede4efcb1d1595cfe6c7a06</data>
      <data key="d12">17110</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
