      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="EEUU" target="NPD">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">NPD funding in the United States comes from government programs and insurers</data>
      <data key="d10">f84386a9907d954b9cf46475d0d45243</data>
      <data key="d11">ff8c0b0dbd46497bba90c2236c9a40fb</data>
      <data key="d12">17281</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="EEUU" target="NED">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">NED coverage in the United States is managed by Medicare and Medicaid</data>
      <data key="d10">f84386a9907d954b9cf46475d0d45243</data>
      <data key="d11">cfd80250c73e47b6b8e2a859a5c2ff17</data>
      <data key="d12">17282</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="BANDA G&#193;STRICA" target="T&#201;CNICAS QUIR&#218;RGICAS">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Banda g&#225;strica is one of the t&#233;cnicas quir&#250;rgicas used for weight loss treatment.</data>
      <data key="d10">b980df2798effe4d56b74a254734403c</data>
      <data key="d11">ef0fc6924fc74b2d8e0544d631e3488f</data>
      <data key="d12">17283</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HTA" target="DASH">
      <data key="d8">15.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The DASH (Dietary Approaches to Stop Hypertension) diet is specifically designed to help reduce hypertension levels in individuals. Research from the DASH study indicates that dietary changes can positively affect the management of hypertension. This diet emphasizes the consumption of fruits, vegetables, whole grains, and lean proteins, aiming to improve overall cardiovascular health and lower blood pressure effectively.</data>
      <data key="d10">66b7c4d336056f832579dc20ffb92992,b5db5210dfb726bf3f6d3fae82598596</data>
      <data key="d11">2998d27d99e44d0385570341188db610</data>
      <data key="d12">17284</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HTA" target="ESTUDIO DASH-SODIO">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The DASH-sodium study aimed to observe the effects of sodium reduction on hypertension levels</data>
      <data key="d10">b5db5210dfb726bf3f6d3fae82598596</data>
      <data key="d11">05f67173caab48d7882da8ca8d48a6c7</data>
      <data key="d12">17285</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HTA" target="STAMLER">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Stamler's research highlighted the low prevalence of hypertension in primitive societies, contributing to the understanding of the condition</data>
      <data key="d10">b5db5210dfb726bf3f6d3fae82598596</data>
      <data key="d11">94fd57e3df99451eb625ba2259b3312f</data>
      <data key="d12">17286</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HTA" target="INTERSALT">
      <data key="d8">15.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The INTERSALT study provided compelling evidence supporting the relationship between sodium intake and hypertension. This research highlighted the significant impact that sodium consumption can have on blood pressure levels, reinforcing the understanding of dietary factors in the management of hypertension.</data>
      <data key="d10">66b7c4d336056f832579dc20ffb92992,b5db5210dfb726bf3f6d3fae82598596</data>
      <data key="d11">36a12c09c267480e8f89db2c68227ce0</data>
      <data key="d12">17287</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HTA" target="JOINT NATIONAL COMMITTEE">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The Joint National Committee offers guidelines that address the management of hypertension, including dietary recommendations.</data>
      <data key="d10">66b7c4d336056f832579dc20ffb92992</data>
      <data key="d11">6373b865cb5b4ef9a0cb7f69696df909</data>
      <data key="d12">17288</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HTA" target="HTA RESISTENTE A LA SAL">
      <data key="d8">4.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La HTA resistente a la sal se refiere a un grupo de personas con hipertensi&#243;n que no responden al consumo de sal.</data>
      <data key="d10">66b7c4d336056f832579dc20ffb92992</data>
      <data key="d11">0482029307f44cf6baf7733cb819835c</data>
      <data key="d12">17289</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HTA" target="MORTALIDAD CORONARIA">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La mortalidad coronaria puede verse afectada por la hipertensi&#243;n, que est&#225; relacionada con la ingesta de sodio.</data>
      <data key="d10">66b7c4d336056f832579dc20ffb92992</data>
      <data key="d11">e51624f0251c471a929542da2cea91cf</data>
      <data key="d12">17290</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HTA" target="MORTALIDAD POR ICTUS">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La mortalidad por ictus puede estar influenciada por la hipertensi&#243;n, que a su vez est&#225; relacionada con la ingesta de sodio.</data>
      <data key="d10">66b7c4d336056f832579dc20ffb92992</data>
      <data key="d11">0117a36ad4524fb5b9e94b50f3b58993</data>
      <data key="d12">17291</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HTA" target="DIETA VEGETARIANA">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">A vegetarian diet is linked to lower blood pressure levels due to its composition of fats and nutrients.</data>
      <data key="d10">29b354fe9b007cadb55ce27555391d5a</data>
      <data key="d11">1da699a4d3f94d92aa2e24258e338c06</data>
      <data key="d12">17292</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HTA" target="ACEITES INSATURADOS">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Unsaturated oils are associated with lower blood pressure levels and are recommended in dietary guidelines.</data>
      <data key="d10">29b354fe9b007cadb55ce27555391d5a</data>
      <data key="d11">e8363fb1547d49ceb6e1c6cd5263109e</data>
      <data key="d12">17293</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="CLINICAL TEAM" target="PRIMARY CARE TEAMS">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The clinical team works in conjunction with primary care teams to provide holistic care for the patient</data>
      <data key="d10">8ad412c188e4086d686c217c6c5c5324</data>
      <data key="d11">6c37d9824d6241f08bcd331b709f260a</data>
      <data key="d12">17294</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="CLINICAL TEAM" target="PRIMARY CARE">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The clinical team coordinates with primary care for the follow-up of patients after bariatric surgery</data>
      <data key="d10">db39b776f49b9fad2deb1dec7a0d3288</data>
      <data key="d11">47e8a6c8b6df4390970ca698aff95a00</data>
      <data key="d12">17295</data>
