    <edge source="INFECCIONES BACTERIANAS" target="SISTEMA INMUNE">
      <data key="d8">5.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Bacterial infections can impact the immune system, which may be influenced by antibiotic use</data>
      <data key="d10">15ac197b57d904b3bf72905c4d946c0d</data>
      <data key="d11">44c188fcb72048d2b97433c2a5db4b6a</data>
      <data key="d12">17408</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ALERGIAS" target="SISTEMA INMUNE">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Allergies are closely related to the immune system, which plays a crucial role in the body's response to allergens. The development of the immune system in children is a key factor influencing their susceptibility to food allergies. Additionally, changes in microbiota due to antibiotic use can impact the immune system, further affecting the likelihood of developing allergies.</data>
      <data key="d10">15ac197b57d904b3bf72905c4d946c0d,39a7166ca777be46a1613c54a746e2b8</data>
      <data key="d11">abbf5dd446a349778cb60afff73c4d02</data>
      <data key="d12">17409</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ALERGIAS" target="INTOLERANCIAS ALIMENTARIAS">
      <data key="d8">14.0</data>
      <data key="d9">ALERGIAS and INTOLERANCIAS ALIMENTARIAS are both types of adverse reactions to food. However, they differ significantly in their underlying mechanisms. Alergias are mediated by the immune system, which means they involve an immune response to certain food proteins. In contrast, intolerancias alimentarias do not involve the immune system; instead, they typically result from the body's inability to properly digest or metabolize certain foods. Additionally, the symptoms associated with these two conditions can vary, reflecting their distinct mechanisms.</data>
      <data key="d10">39a7166ca777be46a1613c54a746e2b8,9d1d9a50a4a29ae7660c32b749e46dbd</data>
      <data key="d11">8e59f165077d4ef58bf89c85fd7be3aa</data>
      <data key="d12">17410</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ALERGIAS" target="MEDIO AMBIENTE">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">El medio ambiente puede afectar la prevalencia y severidad de las alergias alimentarias.</data>
      <data key="d10">39a7166ca777be46a1613c54a746e2b8</data>
      <data key="d11">9a0c64e8a5f9486180cc0abbd486d8cf</data>
      <data key="d12">17411</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ALERGIAS" target="POLIMORFISMOS">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Los polimorfismos en el ADN pueden influir en la predisposici&#243;n a desarrollar alergias alimentarias.</data>
      <data key="d10">39a7166ca777be46a1613c54a746e2b8</data>
      <data key="d11">f666f0012b734916ac0c73d011eb3dc5</data>
      <data key="d12">17412</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ALERGIAS" target="SENSIBILIZACI&#211;N">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La sensibilizaci&#243;n es un proceso que puede llevar a la aparici&#243;n de alergias alimentarias, especialmente en los primeros a&#241;os de vida.</data>
      <data key="d10">9d1d9a50a4a29ae7660c32b749e46dbd</data>
      <data key="d11">0c0bc1713b8f47b698c2bbcb13fda737</data>
      <data key="d12">17413</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ALERGIAS" target="ALERGENO">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Los al&#233;rgenos son las sustancias que provocan reacciones al&#233;rgicas, siendo un componente clave en el estudio de las alergias alimentarias.</data>
      <data key="d10">9d1d9a50a4a29ae7660c32b749e46dbd</data>
      <data key="d11">3f023ecff3a549a4a40d2566437eef2f</data>
      <data key="d12">17414</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ALERGIAS" target="PROBLEMAS DERMATOL&#211;GICOS">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Los problemas dermatol&#243;gicos pueden ser una manifestaci&#243;n de alergias alimentarias, mostrando la conexi&#243;n entre la piel y la dieta.</data>
      <data key="d10">9d1d9a50a4a29ae7660c32b749e46dbd</data>
      <data key="d11">2966b394f18a41a19ac4f68d491e3ca2</data>
      <data key="d12">17415</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ALERGIAS" target="SOCIETADES CIENT&#205;FICAS DE ALERGOLOG&#205;A">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Las sociedades cient&#237;ficas de alergolog&#237;a investigan y proporcionan informaci&#243;n sobre las alergias alimentarias y su manejo.</data>
      <data key="d10">9d1d9a50a4a29ae7660c32b749e46dbd</data>
      <data key="d11">f7c8da2ffe534fa6bf99b602412bcfbc</data>
