    <edge source="G6PC" target="GSDIB">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Mutations in the G6PC gene are responsible for Glycogen Storage Disease Type Ib, leading to various metabolic complications.</data>
      <data key="d10">a81765e6d24ccef0c86801f71673de98</data>
