      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="GALACTOSE" target="GALE">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">GALE is involved in the metabolism of galactose, converting UDP-Gal and Glu-1-P into Gal-1-P and UDP-Glu.</data>
