    <edge source="SII" target="FODMAP">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">SII, or Irritable Bowel Syndrome, is a condition that is often associated with various digestive symptoms. Many individuals suffering from SII report experiencing issues related to FODMAPs, which are a group of carbohydrates that can trigger these symptoms. As a result, FODMAPs are frequently restricted in the diets of those with SII to help alleviate their digestive discomfort.</data>
      <data key="d10">6c98e1347f14c72617198a910cf8c246,79168ac744819ae83bdd5ad50140fead</data>
      <data key="d11">7851ff42fcef49f591b484e34050fb2b</data>
      <data key="d12">17959</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="SII" target="SENSIBILIDAD VISCERAL">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
