    <edge source="LYON HEART STUDY" target="AGP &#937;-3">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The Lyon Heart Study involved the use of ALA, which is a type of AGP &#969;-3, showing its benefits in reducing mortality</data>
