    <edge source="AGP &#937;-3" target="GISSI-PREVENZIONE TRIAL">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The GISSI-Prevenzione Trial demonstrated the benefits of EPA and DHA, which are types of AGP &#969;-3, in reducing coronary mortality</data>
      <data key="d10">0a43b350a248173236a96a64e266b744</data>
      <data key="d11">09b200dfc85b48958354b5ccc105e02b</data>
