    <edge source="ACEITE DE LORENZO" target="GTO">
      <data key="d8">15.0</data>
      <data key="d9">ACEITE DE LORENZO is a treatment for Adrenoleukodystrophy (ALD), and GTO is a key component of this treatment. It is noted that GTO can continue to be administered even if the Oil of Lorenzo is suspended due to side effects. This indicates that GTO plays a significant role in the overall management of ALD, providing an alternative or supplementary option in the treatment regimen.</data>
      <data key="d10">015189b6c6e12a45665ac4c614da79c9,9aa00ebb9b33b958c9956b7859eb11d8</data>
      <data key="d11">28bba0f899c5495e9878acb538b04a88</data>
      <data key="d12">18540</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ACEITE DE LORENZO" target="GTE">
      <data key="d8">15.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The Oil of Lorenzo treatment for Adrenoleukodystrophy (ALD) involves the use of GTE, which is combined with GTO. However, it is important to note that GTE may be suspended if thrombocytopenia occurs in patients using the Oil of Lorenzo.</data>
      <data key="d10">015189b6c6e12a45665ac4c614da79c9,9aa00ebb9b33b958c9956b7859eb11d8</data>
      <data key="d11">d88914bbad8540589991c9e5b3e0c077</data>
      <data key="d12">18541</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ACEITE DE LORENZO" target="C26:0">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The Oil of Lorenzo aims to normalize the levels of C26:0 in ALD patients</data>
      <data key="d10">015189b6c6e12a45665ac4c614da79c9</data>
      <data key="d11">0f55c2b2bbef4e9bbd7d2909fde8ba0b</data>
      <data key="d12">18542</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
