      <data key="d8">5.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Idiopathic hypoxaluria is a specific type of hypoxaluria with no known cause, affecting oxalate levels in the urine.</data>
      <data key="d10">634b74df7b9403e4c578f3fc84fe3335</data>
