      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">E. Cabr&#233; Gelada is associated with the Complejo Hospitalario Universitario Albacete, contributing to research on nutrition</data>
      <data key="d10">f7d56bac9cc29e47690669e812094c99</data>
