      <data key="d9">The Harris-Benedict formula is used to estimate energy needs, which is a component considered in the NUTRIC score</data>
      <data key="d10">fb0c6cd346ca91e15f8ff1cc07570d9d</data>
      <data key="d11">06fec2af329b480aa182bf18bf85701e</data>
      <data key="d12">19264</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRIC SCORE" target="ESPEN 2013">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The ESPEN 2013 guidelines include the NUTRIC score as a tool for assessing nutritional needs in critically ill patients</data>
      <data key="d10">fb0c6cd346ca91e15f8ff1cc07570d9d</data>
      <data key="d11">5eb5df12213442e682455ee0d0b54bc5</data>
      <data key="d12">19265</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRIC SCORE" target="BURNED PATIENT">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The NUTRIC score is specifically designed to assess the nutritional needs of burned patients</data>
      <data key="d10">fb0c6cd346ca91e15f8ff1cc07570d9d</data>
      <data key="d11">240a1baffc4d4ff3a164350610006262</data>
      <data key="d12">19266</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PACIENTE CR&#205;TICO" target="GASTO CAL&#211;RICO">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Caloric expenditure must be evaluated to optimize nutritional strategies for critically ill patients</data>
      <data key="d10">195affa22ecd2f7b1cdce3d72fc1cba4</data>
      <data key="d11">817367100cf248c6aa99f22b4676f073</data>
      <data key="d12">19267</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PACIENTES CR&#205;TICOS" target="SEPSIS SEVERA">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">PACIENTES CR&#205;TICOS are individuals who are in a critical state of health, often requiring intensive medical care. Among this group, SEPSIS SEVERA, or severe sepsis, is a significant condition that affects these patients. Severe sepsis necessitates intensive monitoring and treatment due to its serious nature and the potential for rapid deterioration in the patient's condition. It is a critical condition that specifically impacts a subset of PACIENTES CR&#205;TICOS, highlighting the need for specialized medical attention and resources to manage the complexities associated with it.</data>
      <data key="d10">4ce0bfcd129ba597d70d90d2120c1996,9e4c5851293c18ef6b304ff6293b0be5</data>
      <data key="d11">c454cc4e37044f5e8185d54a9f77f840</data>
      <data key="d12">19268</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PACIENTES CR&#205;TICOS" target="F&#211;RMULA DE NE">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The formula of enteral nutrition is specifically designed to meet the nutritional needs of critical patients</data>
      <data key="d10">4ce0bfcd129ba597d70d90d2120c1996</data>
      <data key="d11">deff584fa2fc445cb1916a592852257b</data>
      <data key="d12">19269</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PACIENTES CR&#205;TICOS" target="ALCOH&#211;LICOS">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Alcoholics are identified as a specific group of critically ill patients needing thiamine supplementation</data>
      <data key="d10">a687eee1e8bfd2d98ce40a14628dd855</data>
      <data key="d11">893273fa7de547cf8c58935c9c388a11</data>
      <data key="d12">19270</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PACIENTES CR&#205;TICOS" target="MALNUTRIDOS">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Malnourished patients are a significant concern in critical care nutrition</data>
      <data key="d10">a687eee1e8bfd2d98ce40a14628dd855</data>
      <data key="d11">274652e9187a44d19178c988cf80d7b6</data>
      <data key="d12">19271</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PACIENTES CR&#205;TICOS" target="AMINO&#193;CIDOS RAMIFICADOS">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Branched-chain amino acids are used in critically ill patients to improve recovery outcomes.</data>
      <data key="d10">01704aec4089b2f0f24dd0f0841b5ecf</data>
      <data key="d11">329ead518f3b4cda80277fc336342448</data>
      <data key="d12">19272</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PACIENTES CR&#205;TICOS" target="INFECCIONES NOSOCOMIALES">
      <data key="d8">12.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The entity "PACIENTES CR&#205;TICOS" refers to critically ill patients who are often monitored for various health complications, including the incidence of hospital-acquired infections, also known as "INFECCIONES NOSOCOMIALES." Nutritional interventions are implemented with the specific aim of reducing the occurrence of these nosocomial infections in this vulnerable patient population. Thus, the relationship between critically ill patients and nosocomial infections is significant, as effective nutritional strategies may play a crucial role in improving patient outcomes by minimizing infection rates.</data>
      <data key="d10">01704aec4089b2f0f24dd0f0841b5ecf,9e4c5851293c18ef6b304ff6293b0be5</data>
      <data key="d11">cfddda5adb9149e0b61ede0e9e0cd974</data>
      <data key="d12">19273</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PACIENTES CR&#205;TICOS" target="AA RAMIFICADOS">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Los amino&#225;cidos ramificados son utilizados en la nutrici&#243;n parenteral de pacientes cr&#237;ticos para mejorar su estado nutricional.</data>
      <data key="d10">7b34ed1eb4b09b2e0762c7e917f8a516</data>
      <data key="d11">87348933c1ae4a8e919be1a89212354c</data>
      <data key="d12">19274</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PACIENTES CR&#205;TICOS" target="ENFERMEDAD DE BASE">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La enfermedad de base de un paciente cr&#237;tico influye en su tratamiento y en la formulaci&#243;n de su nutrici&#243;n parenteral.</data>
      <data key="d10">7b34ed1eb4b09b2e0762c7e917f8a516</data>
      <data key="d11">1fabdafa200c4f0e8066becc3501590b</data>
      <data key="d12">19275</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PACIENTES CR&#205;TICOS" target="SEPSIS NO SEVERA">
