    </edge>
    <edge source="BQ" target="IVACAFTOR">
      <data key="d8">4.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Ivacaftor's role in improving lung function may also be relevant for patients with bronchiectasis, although it is not its primary indication.</data>
      <data key="d10">f1f6ad756644e84b6caa8e4e3adb94da</data>
