      <data key="d9">Minerals and trace elements are often supplemented in patients with IPE to address deficiencies</data>
      <data key="d10">a4886f74d848ccd61cefcaab3103f233</data>
      <data key="d11">74fe773da50a495ca37fb99ec5329b3c</data>
