    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL DOMICILIARIA" target="GRUPO NADYA-SENPE">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL DOMICILIARIA is a key focus of the GRUPO NADYA-SENPE, which is dedicated to providing comprehensive support in this area. The group is involved in the management of home enteral nutrition, offering essential records and guidelines to ensure effective practices. Through its efforts, GRUPO NADYA-SENPE aims to enhance the quality of care for individuals requiring enteral nutrition in a home setting.</data>
