    <edge source="HEMATOPOIETIC CELL TRANSPLANTATION" target="AUTLOGOUS BONE MARROW TRANSPLANTATION">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Autologous bone marrow transplantation is a type of hematopoietic cell transplantation where the patient's own cells are used.</data>
