    <edge source="ALERGIAS ALIMENTARIAS" target="INTOLERANCIAS ALIMENTARIAS">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Alergias alimentarias and intolerancias alimentarias are both types of adverse food reactions, but they differ in their underlying mechanisms. Alergias alimentarias, or food allergies, involve an immune system response to certain proteins in food, which can lead to severe reactions. In contrast, intolerancias alimentarias, or food intolerances, do not involve the immune system and are typically related to the digestive system's inability to properly process certain foods. While both conditions result in adverse reactions to food, they require different approaches for treatment and management.</data>
      <data key="d10">7d6ee23789bfcf1d419eafb56a6d064f,9d84c9c66c832dd17e7247a6966c2ea1</data>
      <data key="d11">9aef2020ed604c43baef97701b38bd14</data>
      <data key="d12">19716</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ALERGIAS ALIMENTARIAS" target="URTICARIA">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Urticaria is a common symptom associated with allergies, including food allergies</data>
      <data key="d10">9d84c9c66c832dd17e7247a6966c2ea1</data>
      <data key="d11">61a22a6c66864b10a96ced4006d1f23d</data>
      <data key="d12">19717</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ALERGIAS ALIMENTARIAS" target="ANAFLAXIA AL&#201;RGICA ORAL">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Anafilaxia al&#233;rgica oral is a severe reaction that can occur as a result of food allergies</data>
      <data key="d10">9d84c9c66c832dd17e7247a6966c2ea1</data>
      <data key="d11">e44340d381a4406b9e167f9c0af0a350</data>
      <data key="d12">19718</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ALERGIAS ALIMENTARIAS" target="BRONCOESPASMO">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Broncoespasmo can be triggered by food allergies, leading to respiratory issues</data>
      <data key="d10">9d84c9c66c832dd17e7247a6966c2ea1</data>
      <data key="d11">2885eaf978d54805875f46b76abfac95</data>
      <data key="d12">19719</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ALERGIAS ALIMENTARIAS" target="RINITIS">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Rinitis can be a symptom of food allergies, causing nasal inflammation</data>
      <data key="d10">9d84c9c66c832dd17e7247a6966c2ea1</data>
      <data key="d11">e9fe0419f8a447248a7cdf40e42a95e1</data>
      <data key="d12">19720</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ALERGIAS ALIMENTARIAS" target="ANGIOEDEMA">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Angioedema is often associated with allergic reactions, including those triggered by food</data>
      <data key="d10">9d84c9c66c832dd17e7247a6966c2ea1</data>
      <data key="d11">9430d07aba9d46938d80008c818f9457</data>
      <data key="d12">19721</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ALERGIAS ALIMENTARIAS" target="ENTEROCOLITIS INDUCIDA POR PROTE&#205;NAS DE LA DIETA">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Enterocolitis inducida por prote&#237;nas de la dieta is a condition that can arise from food allergies</data>
      <data key="d10">9d84c9c66c832dd17e7247a6966c2ea1</data>
      <data key="d11">60a68b0e9c004a95aaff6bddce70d136</data>
      <data key="d12">19722</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ALERGIAS ALIMENTARIAS" target="TOXINAS BACTERIANAS">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Toxinas bacterianas can cause adverse reactions similar to those seen in food allergies</data>
      <data key="d10">9d84c9c66c832dd17e7247a6966c2ea1</data>
      <data key="d11">cc2d06b7878d4fb8b3b8abaed20e3a9b</data>
      <data key="d12">19723</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ALERGIAS ALIMENTARIAS" target="IG&#201;">
      <data key="d8">8.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Las alergias alimentarias son mediadas por la producci&#243;n de IgE en respuesta a al&#233;rgenos espec&#237;ficos</data>
      <data key="d10">d10e6c00bbb982bda449b9cb815691a3</data>
      <data key="d11">2bf36c0f2fc148fa9c59c3b015942e27</data>
      <data key="d12">19724</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ALERGIAS ALIMENTARIAS" target="CELULAS DE LANGERHANS">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Las c&#233;lulas de Langerhans captan al&#233;rgenos a trav&#233;s de la piel y son cruciales en la sensibilizaci&#243;n para las alergias alimentarias</data>
      <data key="d10">d10e6c00bbb982bda449b9cb815691a3</data>
      <data key="d11">78be457ba6c14f9292203a8d6c3ce9f1</data>
      <data key="d12">19725</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ALERGIAS ALIMENTARIAS" target="LINFOCITOS TH2">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Los linfocitos TH2 son responsables de la producci&#243;n de IgE, lo que est&#225; directamente relacionado con las alergias alimentarias</data>
      <data key="d10">d10e6c00bbb982bda449b9cb815691a3</data>
      <data key="d11">3ad406e8679f4f81ad48bb9a14739a24</data>
      <data key="d12">19726</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ALERGIAS ALIMENTARIAS" target="LINFOCITOS TH1">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Los linfocitos TH1 est&#225;n involucrados en la tolerancia a al&#233;rgenos cuando se ingieren, lo que afecta la respuesta al&#233;rgica</data>
      <data key="d10">d10e6c00bbb982bda449b9cb815691a3</data>
      <data key="d11">3e353ef2a782489d8803a6807878dae4</data>
