    <edge source="1-3 A&#209;OS" target="NI&#209;OS/AS">
      <data key="d8">18.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The entity "1-3 A&#209;OS" refers to a specific age range within the broader category of "NI&#209;OS/AS," which encompasses all children. Children aged 1-3 years are included in this category, highlighting their classification as part of the larger group of children. Thus, "1-3 A&#209;OS" specifically identifies a subset of "NI&#209;OS/AS," focusing on the developmental stage of early childhood.</data>
      <data key="d10">4fe098dece0637a1082d6a439757620a,565aef05382a327b4bdefb2ab3d3b4be,6c65beaf6ed5575b0945052270630136</data>
