    <edge source="HUELGA DE HAMBRE" target="GRAPO">
      <data key="d8">17.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The HUELGA DE HAMBRE, associated with the GRAPO collective, involves members of GRAPO who are participating in a hunger strike. This protest is aimed at demanding better treatment and improved conditions for the members. The GRAPO organization is recognized for its history of organizing such hunger strikes as a form of activism.</data>
      <data key="d10">87ab96c9e47970751fc97c244c4b4534,f8440456e04065bd27e87482b8d2db89</data>
      <data key="d11">2cbb4642ffcf4041a295721a57ecca0d</data>
