    <edge source="CULTURA MEDITERR&#193;NEA" target="CULTURA ANGLOSAXONA">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The Mediterranean culture contrasts with the Anglo-Saxon culture in their approaches to care and decision-making at the end of life</data>
