    <edge source="DIEGO GRACIA" target="COMIT&#201; DE &#201;TICA DE LOS SERVICIOS SOCIALES DE CATALU&#209;A">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Diego Gracia's school promotes deliberative processes that may influence the work of the Ethics Committee of Social Services in Catalonia.</data>
      <data key="d10">3775bd9e3567a81cf7b7acf1e2741f6f</data>
