    </edge>
    <edge source="MINISTERIO FISCAL" target="JUZGADO DE VIGILANCIA PENITENCIARIA N&#186; 2 DE MADRID">
      <data key="d8">7.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The Ministerio Fiscal filed an appeal against the decision of the Juzgado de Vigilancia Penitenciaria regarding the treatment of hunger strikers</data>
